and field recordings to make works that create a space for deep listening and reflection whilst attempting to translate and subtly amplify the quieter moments of everyday life.\\n\\n**This event is part of Silent Film with New Sound season at Theatreship.**\\n\\n**Programme supported by Film Hub London, managed by Film London. Proud to be a partner of the BFI Film Audience Network, funded by the National Lottery.**\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 15+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-26T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-22T22:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-26T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-22T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-22T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Joe Harvey-Whyte - Flatland\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/flatland/1586102408?i=1586102409&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Joe Harvey-Whyte\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/55/48/f5/5548f5a4-b118-4000-b566-5a04a266d7e8/mzaf_534292032434442397.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Flatland\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Joe Harvey-Whyte - Plainsong\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/50g0Y8sQd54uJMfh9wmPTJ\",\"artist\":\"Joe Harvey-Whyte\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/fde9874353fee05871d404967cf28583de6cd7eb?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Plainsong\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Sun 22 Feb\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"