eaf-7439-4100-9f71-cee5fb123bbb.jpg?rect=651%2C0%2C586%2C1065\"},\"id\":\"695270078ef9560001108961\",\"name\":\"WE ARE MAKING A FILM ABOUT MARK FISHER\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"We Are Making A Film About Mark Fisher — a 65-minute cinematic experiment exploring the continuing relevance of the late theorist’s ideas on capitalism, culture, and the future.\\n\\nBlending documentary, performance, and hauntological fiction, the film follows Parkins — a time-slipped character — through ghostly landscapes and digital spaces, tracing Fisher’s thought from the 1990s to our algorithmic present.\\n\\nCreated collaboratively by over 70 artists through Instagram (@markfisherfilm), the film embodies Fisher’s call for collective imagination beyond capitalist realism.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-28T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T14:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-28T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-28T14:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T15:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Film Screening\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2020-09-15/0b8ef9ab-63ad-41fd-bec4-98e25f9bca16.jpg?rect=67%2C0%2C798%2C798\"},\"artist_id\":\"11393\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Deeper Into Movies.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"film\",\"value\":\"culture:film\",\"title\":\"Film\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\