s Parkins — a time-slipped character — through ghostly landscapes and digital spaces, tracing Fisher’s thought from the 1990s to our algorithmic present.\\n\\nCreated collaboratively by over 70 artists through Instagram (@markfisherfilm), the film embodies Fisher’s call for collective imagination beyond capitalist realism.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-06T14:45:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-15T13:45:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-06T14:45:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-15T14:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-15T15:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Film Screening\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2020-09-15/0b8ef9ab-63ad-41fd-bec4-98e25f9bca16.jpg?rect=67%2C0%2C798%2C798\"},\"artist_id\":\"11393\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Deeper Into Movies.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"film\",\"value\":\"culture:film\",\"title\":\"Film\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"2338\",\"name\":\"The Haggerston\",\"address\":\"438 Kingsland Rd, London E8 4AA, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5423183,\"lng\":-0.0758063000000675},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-haggerston-29wp\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":nu