e\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Fairytale-teller extraordinaire Ben Haggarty returns to Folklore with a story of boys becoming men, of the darkest arts, of forbidden knowledge, and of inescapable destinies. At its heart is a baby sister who should not exist—at least not in the way she does.\\n\\nThis is the first wondertale Haggarty ever told, sharpened over years of retelling until it has become like a spell: tough, beautiful, and dangerous. It lifts you as high as you can go… then takes you just as far down… making room for something stranger and harder than happily ever after.\\n\\nDark. Elemental. Unforgettable.\\n\\n***'A fresh dose of magic that you need in your life'* \\\\*\\\\*\\\\*\\\\*\\\\* EVERYTHING THEATRE**\\n\\n***‘Mesmerizing. The crick crack club weaves a web of enchantment’* \\\\*\\\\*\\\\*\\\\* REMOTE GOAT**\\n\\n***‘The Crick Crack Club is something special!’* \\\\*\\\\*\\\\*\\\\* A YOUNGER THEATRE**\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Folklore Hoxton & The Crick Crack Club.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"29d7bae4e57e800a:28\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z60837908b81?dice_id=Z60837908b81\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Fb6045f42941?dice_id=Fb6045f42941\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T0a5b15578c1?dice_id=T0a5b15578c1\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/hb665ac2f612?dice_id=hb665ac2f612\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Jc209bda0ee3?dice_id=Jc209bda0ee3\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E5d1201f045b?dice_id=E5d1201f045b\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date