'Burlesque Queen' (What's on Stage) Miss Tempest Rose and the stars of The House of Burlesque…\\n\\nSee Burlesque dancing divas, tantalising tassel-twirlers, and cabaret glitterati with everything in between in an uplifting fabulous live show performed in the round. This special early show is the perfect prelude to dinner and a night on the town if you are heading out after, or all guests are welcome to stay on after the show to dance the night away at the venue. Arrive early doors to enjoy special Happy Hour, DJ afterparty till late.\\n\\n\\\\*Please note all tickets are non-refundable\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by House of Burlesque.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"29d7bae4e57e800a:32\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/wfbfdfb13516?dice_id=wfbfdfb13516\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m9548a723bab?dice_id=m9548a723bab\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/vd26251f57c4?dice_id=vd26251f57c4\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v2b43950878c?dice_id=v2b43950878c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ecf12024a7b8?dice_id=Ecf12024a7b8\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o0664dcf86e9?dice_id=o0664dcf86e9\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-05T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-21T15:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-06T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-21T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-21T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":2035},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2924\",\"name\":\"House of Burlesque\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"house-of-burlesque-6pd8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"698482b058a17600012f0ad7\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"House of Burlesque Speakeasy \",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"g5mwnb-house-of-burlesque-speakeasy-21st-mar-qt-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1774116000,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Sat 21 Mar\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"5661\",\"name\":\"The Obie Theatre - The BRIT School\",\"address\":\"60 The Crescent, Croydon CR0 2HN, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.3900037,\"lng\":-0.0914101},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-obie-theatre---the-brit-school-r5kr\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-23T18:45:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":73013,\"title\":\"How to get here?\",\"body\":\"If travelling by car, please use SE25 5PL for Sat Nav, as our shared car parking entrance is in Dagnall Park. You will need to enter your registration plate at Reception to avoid a parking charge.\\n\\nThe Crescent is part of Croydon's Healthy Schools Scheme. This means that you can no longer drive a vehicle into The Crescent from 08.00am – 9.30am and 2.00pm – 4.00pm.\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":73014,\"title\":\"What is a Concession\",\"body\":\"A Student or Child Concession is available for children and students at any school, college or university.\\n\\nAn Adult Concession is available for those in receipt of Universal Credit, Working Tax Credit, Child Tax Credit, Pension Credit, Employment and Support Allowance, Income Support or Jobseeker’s Allowance.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":73015,\"title\":\"How do I book an access ticket?\",\"body\":\"Please contact tickets@brit.school before making your booking\",\"order\":2}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-29/46859c52-2301-494e-8ab0-7fc5b423cf2e.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C3366%2C3366\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-29/46859c52-2301-494e-8ab0-7fc5b423cf2e.jpg?rect=0%2C673%2C3366%2C2020\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-29/46859c52-2301-494e-8ab0-7fc5b423cf2e.jpg?rect=758%2C0%2C1851%2C3366\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"'Come From Away' Company - Come From Away - \\\"Welcome to the Rock\\\"  Apple TV+\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/music-video/come-from-away-welcome-to-the-rock-apple-tv/1585220108?uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"'Come From Away' Company - Come From Away - \\\"Welcome to the Rock\\\"  Apple TV+\",\"preview_url\":\"\",\"track_name\":\"'Come From Away' Company - Come From Away - \\\"Welcome to the Rock\\\"  Apple TV+\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1769677200,\"max_tickets\":8,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Supported by The Alburys Charitable Foundation\\\"\\n\\nCome From Away begins our Musical Theatre Season of 2026. Our other shows will be Hadestown (8th-10th April) & Six (22nd-24th April).\\n\\nCome From Away is based on the true story of the time when the isolated community of Gander, Newfoundland, played host to the world. What started as an average day in a small town turned into an international sleepover, when 38 planes, carrying thousands of people from around the globe, were diverted to Gander’s airstrip on September 11, 2001. Undaunted by culture clashes and language barriers, the people of Gander cheered the stranded travelers with music, an open bar and the recognition that we’re all part of a global family.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a PG event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The BRIT School Limited.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"29d7bae4e57e800a:33\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/d6401e273e55?dice_id=d6401e273e55\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ncf0e483a1e2?dice_id=ncf0e483a1e2\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/t4753dc1cae0?dice_id=t4753dc1cae0\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P1bb3721917c?dice_id=P1bb3721917c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q602d7e84352?dice_id=Q602d7e84352\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R08724537366?dice_id=R08724537366\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-29T09:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-23T19:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-02T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-23T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-23T20:45:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":824},\"propert