jpg?rect=0%2C700%2C3500%2C2100\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-17/26a47198-a3c2-46a4-81bd-deacc4744b32.jpg?rect=788%2C0%2C1925%2C3500\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1763337600,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**HotHaus Drag Presents: HotHaus: HotShots 2026**\\n\\nIt’s season 4 of our annual newcomers, one-night-only pageant. We are again opening our stage to newcomers and upcoming performers who want to make their mark on the UK drag scene.\\n\\nThe winner will receive a cash prize, crown, sash and the opportunity to become a member of the HotHaus family.\\n\\nHoused at a venue which celebrates diversity and has a supportive, fun and non-judgemental atmosphere. Please grab your tickets and show your love and support for our stars of tomorrow.\\n\\nDoors open 7pm – show starts 8pm\\n\\nHotHaus is a safe space for EVERYONE and EVERYONE is welcome.\\n\\nHosted by and Head Judge Kenzie Blackheart\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Hot Box Live Community Interest\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"29d7bae4e57e800a:37\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m17fe274aed2?dice_id=m17fe274aed2\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m90f2ec03483?dice_id=m90f2ec03483\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/U644ed4128c9?dice_id=U644ed4128c9\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/zed4ee6e1ee1?dice_id=zed4ee6e1ee1\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/sef7232fb0bd?dice_id=sef7232fb0bd\",\"post_