United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"qt-8ea25\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-11T18:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-07-19/042cc3b1-9ac8-4947-8f09-722659ba176a.jpg?rect=0%2C250%2C1001%2C1001\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-07-19/042cc3b1-9ac8-4947-8f09-722659ba176a.jpg?rect=0%2C450%2C1001%2C601\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-07-19/042cc3b1-9ac8-4947-8f09-722659ba176a.jpg?rect=88%2C0%2C825%2C1500\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770310800,\"max_tickets\":100,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Under the streets of the world famous London's West End lurks a world of stockings, feathers and fabulousness. The UK's TOP Burlesque production house's weekly Saturday night residency, started at the legendary Madame Jojo's, is here and is the perfect start to the party! Venture under the streets of London to spend some time with 'Burlesque Queen' (What's on Stage) Miss Tempest Rose and the stars of The House of Burlesque…\\n\\nSee Burlesque dancing divas, tantalising tassel-twirlers, and cabaret glitterati with everything in between in an uplifting fabulous live show performed in the round. This special early show is the perfect prelude to dinner and a night on the town if you are heading out after, or all guests are welcome to stay on after the show to dance the night away at the venue. Arrive early doors to enjoy special Happy Hour, DJ afterparty till late.\\n\\n\\\\*Please note all tickets are non-refundable\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by House of Burlesque.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"29d7bae4e57e800a:54\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/l4a5759fd35d?dice_id=l4a5759fd35d\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T611c935e1e9?dice_id=T611c935e1e9\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/C9a3e02eb44d?dice_id=C9a3e02eb44d\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y4e4c23d8dbd?dice_id=y4e4c23d8dbd\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b1b7bb04cbbc?dice_id=b1b7bb04cbbc\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J9da4dbfc43f?dice_id=J9da4dbfc43f\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-05T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-11T15:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-06T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-11T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-11T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":2035},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2924\",\"name\":\"House of Burlesque\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"house-of-burlesque-6pd8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"698482b094f8500001be3e48\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"House of Burlesque Speakeasy \",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"nv92gl-house-of-burlesque-speakeasy-11th-apr-qt-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1775926800,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":false,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1061\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"address\":\"The Clapham Grand, 21-25 St John's Hill, London SW11 1TT, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4629923,\"lng\":-0.169368800000029},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-06-05/35fd37f7-73c6-4d16-a3a1-47ab54898234.jpg?rect=359%2C0%2C1334%2C1334\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-clapham-grand-ry8v\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://claphamgrand.com/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-11T18:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":4},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":46896,\"title\":\"Timings\",\"body\":\"Doors Open 18:30\\n\\nShow starts 19:30\\n\\nShow ends 22:30\\n\\nAfterparty 23:00-01.00\\n\\nTickets to this show grant all attendees free entry to our afterparty until 01:00\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":46897,\"title\":\"AfterParty\",\"body\":\"Tickets to this show grant all attendees free entry to our afterparty until 01:00\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":46898,\"title\":\"Tickets\",\"body\":\"For any ticketing enquiries, please contact DICE via their Help Desk. For any information about the show, accessibility or timings, please contact Team Grand on info@claphamgrand.com detailing your enquiry and the show/date in question\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":46899,\"title\":\"Further FAQs\",\"body\":\"Check out all FAQs for attending shows on our website, here: https://claphamgrand.com/faqs/\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":46900,\"title\":\"Accessibility\",\"body\":\"Venue ccessibility Information can be found here https://claphamgrand.com/faq-type/access-questions/\\n\\nQueue jumping for disabled guests and earplugs are available at the venue. For queue jumping please email access@claphamgrand.com\",\"order\":4}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-23/d57d7a00-c4a4-4d37-b348-927a537d4c65.jpg?rect=716%2C0%2C2863%2C2863\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-23/d57d7a00-c4a4-4d37-b348-927a537d4c65.jpg?rect=0%2C144%2C4294%2C2576\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-23/d57d7a00-c4a4-4d37-b348-927a537d4c65.jpg?rect=1360%2C0%2C1575%2C2863\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1759132800,\"max_tickets\":10,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":12,\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://claphamgrand.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1705644923004016\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-5134978-1\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"*Doors 6.30PM / Show 7.30- 11.00PM / Afterparty Until 01.00AM*\\n\\n**Blackstage Presents: Reclamation**\\n\\nFor three years, our shows ‘Blackstage’, ‘Rebellion’, ‘Community’, ‘Audacity’, and ‘0121’ have blown minds and amplified pole dancers of colour, turning the stage into a weapon of rebellion and a home for community and audacious self-expression. This year we rise with Reclamation. Our lands, our people, our art have been stolen. We’ve been displaced, erased, and forced to conform. Sex workers and Trans\\\\* lives are under relentless attack. Enough. We reclaim our bodies, our art, our spaces. What is ours has always been ours and it **WILL** be reclaimed.\\n\\nAn ensemble of extraordinary pole artists showcase their unique voices through movement, each performance a fresh creation. Be ready to immerse yourself in a whirlwind of artistry, intrigue, and wonder.\\n\\nSince 2020, Blackstage Pole has existed to disrupt an industry that erases, excludes, and discriminates against marginalised polers. We platform the brilliance of BIPOC dancers, especially those who are LGBTQIA+, disabled, plus-sized, or sex workers, and we do it on our terms. No one else elevates pole dance through theatre at this scale, with this excellence, and this unapologetic commitment to justice.\\n\\nFollow our work:  \\nInstagram @blxckstage / Website www.blackstagepole.com\\n\\nThis show is directed and produced by Leila Davis (Credits include: Vogue, Nike, Burberry, Snoop Dogg, James Blake, Burna Boy, Shygirl and Cupcakkke)\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Clapham Grand.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"29d7bae4e57e800a:55\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F41fff0c1980?dice_id=F41fff0c1980\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y78262bf4d0d?dice_id=Y78262bf4d0d\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z922f7903dac?dice_id=z922f7903dac\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ye7637abee76?dice_id=ye7637abee76\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m986a151efce?dice_id=m986a151efce\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/L7e289ffb404?dice_id=L7e289ffb404\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-09-29T09:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"