0\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-17/99ed3944-1380-4a93-bbbd-6f7630a7557e.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C3500%2C3500\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-17/99ed3944-1380-4a93-bbbd-6f7630a7557e.jpg?rect=0%2C700%2C3500%2C2100\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-17/99ed3944-1380-4a93-bbbd-6f7630a7557e.jpg?rect=788%2C0%2C1925%2C3500\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1763337600,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**HotHaus Drag & Tassels 360 Presents: When Two Worlds Collide - A Drag / Burlesque Fusion Show**\\n\\nFor the first time ever, we are co-hosting a fusion show between ourselves and Tassels 360. They are an Essex based Burlesque company, with the full cast line up being half from HotHaus Drag, and half from Tassels 360 Burlesque.\\n\\nGet ready for a night of drag and burlesque excellence as our two worlds will merge to make one EXTRAORDINARY show. It will be a night like no other.\\n\\nMake sure you’re there to witness this one off, very special show.\\n\\nDoors open 7pm – show starts 8pm\\n\\nHotHaus is a safe space for EVERYONE and EVERYONE is welcome.\\n\\nHosted by Kenzie Blackheart\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Hot Box Live Community Interest\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"29d7bae4e