_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"15810\",\"name\":\"QT\",\"address\":\"66 Great Queen Street, Camden, London, WC2B 5BX, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.51584,\"lng\":-0.12026},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"qt-8ea25\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-18T18:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-07-19/042cc3b1-9ac8-4947-8f09-722659ba176a.jpg?rect=0%2C250%2C1001%2C1001\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-07-19/042cc3b1-9ac8-4947-8f09-722659ba176a.jpg?rect=0%2C450%2C1001%2C601\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-07-19/042cc3b1-9ac8-4947-8f09-722659ba176a.jpg?rect=88%2C0%2C825%2C1500\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770310800,\"max_tickets\":100,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Under the streets of the world famous London's West End lurks a world of stockings, feathers and fabulousness. The UK's TOP Burlesque production house's weekly Saturday night residency, started at the legendary Madame Jojo's, is here and is the perfect start to the party! Venture under the streets of London to spend some time with 'Burlesque Queen' (What's on Stage) Miss Tempest Rose and the stars of The House of Burlesque…\\n\\nSee Burlesque dancing divas, tantalising tassel-twirlers, and cabaret glitterati with everything in between in an uplifting fabulous live show performed in the round. This special early show is the perfect prelude to dinner and a night on the town if you are heading out after, or all guests are welcome to stay on after the show to dance the night away at the venue. Arrive early doors to enjoy special Happy Hour, DJ afterparty till late.\\n\\n\\\\*Please note all tickets are non-refundable\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by House of Burlesque.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"29d7bae4e57e800a:57\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ld2b5d9024b6?dice_id=ld2b5d9024b6\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/M4ceef89d023?dice_id=M4ceef89d023\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Gf38d444cbc4?dice_id=Gf38d444cbc4\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q86ca6d445b5?dice_id=q86ca6d445b5\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A3e9240d2767?dice_id=A3e9240d2767\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F21317d5e1bc?dice_id=F21317d5e1bc\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-05T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-18T15:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-06T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-18T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-18T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":2035},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2924\",\"name\":\"House of Burlesque\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"house-of-burlesque-6pd8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"698482b06b46d100013ca340\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"House of Burlesque Speakeasy \",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"py9mqy-house-of-burlesque-speakeasy-18th-apr-qt-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1776531600,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Sat 18 Apr\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1238\",\"name\":\"Folklore Hoxton\",\"address\":\"186 Hackney Rd, London E2 7QL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5306515,\"lng\":-0.07228429999997843},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"folklore-hoxton-2or7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-22T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":3},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-13/76654610-9e3a-4116-bffe-b58527b99b38.jpg?rect=602%2C0%2C1533%2C1533\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-13/76654610-9e3a-4116-bffe-b58527b99b38.jpg?rect=91%2C0%2C2555%2C1533\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-13/76654610-9e3a-4116-bffe-b58527b99b38.jpg?rect=947%2C0%2C843%2C1533\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1769904000,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**The Crick Crack Club presents**\\n\\n**UNCANNY**\\n\\n**Performance storytelling by Nell Phoenix**\\n\\n**‘I heard a whining voice but saw no body in the room’**\\n\\n**‘We saw her and we saw right through her’**\\n\\n**‘I blinked just once and he had changed his shape’**\\n\\n**Nell paces a path from dusty Mesopotamia, to Ancient Egypt, through London’s Bloomsbury, along a dingy road in Guatemala at dawn, and back to her own kitchen table – gathering up disturbing, unsettling, baffling, bewildering, sinister, UNCANNY stories.**\\n\\n**These are not literary tales crafted to scare you. These are not folktales, bloody fairytales, or urban myths. These are spine-tingling tales told as true by one of the UK’s most popular and dynamic storytellers.**\\n\\n**Who are these witnesses of these other-worldly acts? Why did they tell their stories? And do we believe in ghosts?**\\n\\n**‘She picks through her tale like a mountain goat skipping up a cliff face’ London City Nights**\\n\\n**‘A mercurial and captivating performer’ Dave Farnogli**\\n\\n**RUNNING TIME: Approx. 75 minutes without interval**\\n\\n**SUITABLE FOR adults 14+**\\n\\n**CONTENT This performance contains references to the supernatural, threat, death and dying, contextualised within a paradigm of mythic narrative, archetype and metaphor**\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Folklore Hoxton.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"29d7bae4e57e800a:58\",\"s