ody\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":17869,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":17870,\"title\":\"A show is listed as sold out. How can I get tickets?\",\"body\":\"If a show is listed as sold out on this website then our venue is full to capacity. We recommend you download the DICE app and join the Waiting List for return tickets.\\n\\nYou are welcome to visit the box office when doors open for the event to see if there are any door tickets. We cannot guarantee door tickets will be available in advance. Sorry.\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":17871,\"title\":\"I have mobility issues. How can you help?\",\"body\":\"If you need a seat for medical reasons or need help moving around our venue, or if you’d like to bring a companion along to help you with mobility, you will need to arrange it with us in advance. We suggest you read our accessibility guide and then contact our box office.\",\"order\":4},{\"id\":17872,\"title\":\"Do I need ID? What type of ID is accepted?\",\"body\":\"Bring ID if you look 25 years of age or younger. We accept the following forms of photo ID.\\n\\n\\\\- Passport\\n\\n\\\\- Driving licence card\\n\\n\\\\- PASS card. You can apply for a PASS card at www.pass-scheme.org.uk\",\"order\":5},{\"id\":17873,\"title\":\"Can I bring food?\",\"body\":\"We do not allow you to bring food or drink into the venue. Chewing gum is also not permitted inside the venue.\",\"order\":6},{\"id\":17874,\"title\":\"Is there a cloakroom?\",\"body\":\"Yes, we have a cloakroom in the Foyer Bar space. As you walk up the entrance stairs and straight ahead towards the Foyer Bar the cloakroom is on the left. Each item is charged at £3.\",\"order\":7}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-31/7d1de88c-1cf6-4fc1-9c49-cddc0c719a9a.jpg?rect=79%2C0%2C770%2C770\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-31/7d1de88c-1cf6-4fc1-9c49-cddc0c719a9a.jpg?rect=0%2C107%2C927%2C556\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-31/7d1de88c-1cf6-4fc1-9c49-cddc0c719a9a.jpg?rect=252%2C0%2C424%2C770\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1767219900,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":13,\"name\":\"Scala\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://scala.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"LONDON'S NEWEST PARTY SHOW IS BACK FOR 2026!\\n\\nA nonstop LIVE celebration featuring the hit songs of your favourite Divas.\\n\\nDiana Ross And The Supremes, Whitney Houston, Aretha Franklin, Donna Summer, Diana Ross, Madonna, Beyonce, Dusty Springfield, Tina Turner, Cher, Celine Dion, Dolly Parton, Amy Winehouse, and MANY more!\\n\\nFeaturing ALL your favourite Divas classics.\\n\\nHot Stuff, Think, A Natural Women, Single Ladies, If I Could Turn Back Time, Holding Out For A Hero, Venus Back To Black, Flashdance, Chain Reaction, River Deep Mountain, High, Baby Love, Material Girl, Total Eclipse Of The Heart and lots more!\\n\\nA two-hour live show featuring a top west end cast and fabulous drag compere!\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event (ID required)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Entertainment Providers.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"29d7bae4e57e800a:77\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R09564fe0df9?dice_id=R09564fe0df9\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/L339254853ae?dice_id=L339254853ae\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Rd7f43d586bd?dice_id=Rd7f43d586bd\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/I42a90da829c?dice_id=I42a90da829c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H01259a07cf1?dice_id=H01259a07cf1\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Qf73260715d4?dice_id=Qf73260715d4\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-31T22:25:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-09-19T15:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-31T22:25:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-09-19T16:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-09-19T19:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":4230},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2066\",\"name\":\"Scala\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"scala-9b69\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"697a1cc535a6650001cb1c19\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Divas The Party\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"bb39om-divas-the-party-19th-sep-scala-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1789830000,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Sat 19 Sep\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3785\",\"name\":\"Hot Box\",\"address\":\"28 Viaduct Rd, Chelmsford CM1 1TS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.7359952,\"lng\":0.4672127},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-06-29/9ff0c867-708b-4d5c-834d-a927e4e4ae83.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"5eb9799ae1727402966007e1\",\"name\":\"Chelmsford\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.736717,\"lng\":0.466083,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-r7wq\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.hotboxlive.co.uk/accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-10-30T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-17/7619e152-ab71-4555-a473-8b4310d4b4ae.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C3500%2C3500\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-17/7619e152-ab71-4555-a473-8b4310d4b4ae.jpg?rect=0%2C700%2C3500%2C2100\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-17/7619e152-ab71-4555-a473-8b4310d4b4ae.jpg?rect=788%2C0%2C1925%2C3500\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1763337600,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**HotHaus Drag Presents: Freakilicious – A Halloween Circus/Freak Show**\\n\\nROLL UP, ROLL UP for the freakiest Halloween show you’ve ever seen! We have some extra special guests joining us along with the HotHaus family you already know and love for a night of surreal circus/freak show vibes. They’ll all be bringing out their dark inner demons for a night that will fright and thrill in equal measure.\\n\\nNever fear, you’ll be safe in our dark but loving care. So, step inside the circus tent of the macabre for a night you’ll NEVER forget and will go down in HotHaus history.\\n\\nDoors open 7pm – show starts 8pm\\n\\nHotHaus is a safe space for EVERYONE and EVERYONE is welcome.\\n\\nHosted by Kenzie Blackheart\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Hot Box Live Community Interest\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"29d7bae4e57e80