//dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-13/555c5cda-88ee-4c78-98ca-b178fb771e4c.jpg?rect=0%2C300%2C1500%2C900\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-13/555c5cda-88ee-4c78-98ca-b178fb771e4c.jpg?rect=338%2C0%2C825%2C1500\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1759226400,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":99,\"name\":\"Night Tales\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5e2aabd2b0d5c87010fb3d64/t/5e3f17972c3202581310afa8/1581193111803/BACKGROUND+CLUBS+LIMITED+PRIVACY+AND+COOKIES+STATEMENT.pdf\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"219310887034475\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":1827,\"name\":\"Night Tales Loft\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://static1.squarespace.com/static/62502cbe020d59057d88d958/t/62bb7163377da00692cca3bd/1656451427778/BACKGROUND%2BCLUBS%2BLIMITED%2BPRIVACY%2BAND%2BCOOKIES%2BSTATEMENT.pdf\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1020185540161660\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Presented by Johnnie Walker Black Label × NT’s Loft**\\n\\nPlayback is a candlelit listening experience designed to slow time. Over 200 candles illuminate NT’s Loft, transforming the space into a warm, intimate sanctuary where music is felt as much as it is heard.\\n\\nOn Tuesday, 17th February 2026, we celebrate the timeless elegance and emotional depth of Sade. This curated playback journeys through her most iconic works, from the smooth sensuality of Diamond Life and Promise, to the quiet power of Love Deluxe and beyond. A night dedicated to soul, romance, restraint, and the unmistakable voice that defined sophistication for generations.\\n\\nExperience every note through the richness of Funktion-One sound, in a setting made for deep listening, reflection, and feeling every lyric.\\n\\nJohnnie Walker Black Label returns to elevate the evening with signature serves available throughout the night. **Guests arriving before 8pm will receive a complimentary drink to begin the evening in style (Limited to First 50 Customers).**\\n\\n**Please note: This is a listening session only. Sade will not perform live.**\\n\\n—\\n\\nTickets\\n\\nReserved seating ticket holders must arrive by 8:00 PM. **Seating is first come, first served.**\\n\\n—\\n\\nSchedule\\n\\n7:00 PM – Doors & Playlist\\n\\n8:15 PM – Listening Session Begins (90 mins)\\n\\nLimited capacity. Arrive early, stay late.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event. Bring your ID card with you. ID Scanner in place. \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by NT's Loft.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"7edfaa6f16d85d00:8\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A3230d7952e4?dice_id=A3230d7952e4\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/yc2ff1cd6c1f?dice_id=yc2ff1cd6c1f\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k98919ab9767?dice_id=k98919ab9767\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p87cf21b9a2c?dice_id=p87cf21b9a2c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/He4461ecaa62?dice_id=He4461ecaa62\",\"post_waitingli