 who face a variety of barriers that might prevent them from making the most of their creativity and talent. Every donation helps keep Studio 36 open and accessible, so that more young people can find their voice, develop their talents and feel supported as they take their next steps.\\n\\nA percentage of your donation goes towards a payment processing fee (DICE keeps none of this fee). For a £10 donation, the charity gets £9.75.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-28/af5fb538-b9c7-4f41-bf11-48d1d9d6d45a.jpeg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"variants\":[{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":100,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTA4MTMyNywidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NDk5MDE1LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1NzowMC4wNTU4NTVaIiwicHJpY2UiOjEwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MjQwOSwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MzAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":300,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTA4MTMyNywidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NDk5MDE1LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1NzowMC4wNTU4ODhaIiwicHJpY2UiOjMwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MjQxMCwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6NTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":500,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTA4MTMyNywidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NDk5MDE1LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1NzowMC4wNTU5MDNaIiwicHJpY2UiOjUwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MjQxMSwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwMCwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsfQ==\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1000,\"sales_tax\"