4627602133720867257.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Not yet\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1747670400,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/legal-information/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"679202632593023\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-980124-39\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Originating from Chicago before studying guitar and songwriting at the Thornton School of Music, and now based in Los Angeles, NoSo’s music deals with the alienation that comes at the intersection of his different identities. The stage name of NoSo itself comes from a question he’d get growing up in a largely white neighborhood (“North or South Korean?”) While he became known in LA for his talent with guitar, he ultimately decided to pursue writing his own deeply personal music. This is as personal as anything else he’s made.  \\n  \\nPlease see approximate stage times below (subject to change):  \\n  \\n7pm Doors  \\n7.45pm Gigi Wilde  \\n9pm NoSo  \\n11pm Music curfew\\n\\n*By purchasing a ticket to this event you are agreeing to adhere to Islington Assembly Hall's terms and conditions: https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/customer-terms-conditions-2022/*\\n\\n*All tickets to shows at Islington Assembly Hall are subject to a Venue Levy of £1.50 + VAT. As a Grade II listed building, this levy will be reinvested into Islington Assembly Hall and its services, meaning the customer experience can continue to be enhanced.*\\n\\nThis is a 16+ event – you may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Festival Republic.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"7edfaa6f16d85d00:15\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y7c5785c05f8?dice_id=Y7c5785c05f8\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k28c3b70c49f?dice_id=k28c3b70c49f\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Se650473762f?dice_id=Se650473762f\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J9f2023ba5d3?dice_id=J9f2023ba5d3\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ad46a4429108?dice_id=ad46a4429108\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Fb63949e58b3?dice_id=Fb63949e58b3\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-05-19T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-17T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-05-21T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-17T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":2086},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1607\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-78g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"682b525cc28ca4000184842e\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"NoSo\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"perm_name\":\"mxaagk-noso-17th-feb-islington-assembly-hall-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1771354800,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":tr