s and textured rhythms inspired by Peshay, Nookie, and Machinedrum, paired with the atmospheric chords of Yaeji and Lone.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Columbo Music.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"7edfaa6f16d85d00:72\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n6f5925984d4?dice_id=n6f5925984d4\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/G35b0995ab6c?dice_id=G35b0995ab6c\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a19f3976850c?dice_id=a19f3976850c\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/za931193d262?dice_id=za931193d262\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c43790974d29?dice_id=c43790974d29\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y24fc0e6c113?dice_id=Y24fc0e6c113\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-25T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-02T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1965,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"14\",\"name\":\"Columbo Music\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"columbo-music-427z\",\"profile_active\":true},\"id\":\"69244a2ae5ae220001923c03\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Mysie\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"avel6d-mysie-19th-feb-the-lower-third-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1771527600,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_disabled\"},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"650\",\"name\":\"O2 Academy Brixton\",\"address\":\"211 Stockwell Road, London SW9 9SL\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4653454,\"lng\":-0.115164400000026},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"o2-academy-brixton-bbav\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.academymusicgroup.com/o2academybrixton/access\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Amelia Moore\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb087307aa7b61dd04806c3a91\"},\"artist_id\":\"49993\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Ashnikko\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-12/e5469fbb-a7b9-4c40-909a-8a3389b39aa1.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"8735\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":23938,\"title\":\"What's the bag policy?\",\"body\":\"Security – Bag Policy\\n\\nLarge bags – including rucksacks are not allowed.\\n\\nOnly one small bag per person is permitted and it must not be bigger than A4 size.\\n\\nHeight: 28.7cm\\n\\nWidth: 21cm\\n\\nDepth: 15cm\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":76527,\"title\":\"How do tickets work for O2 Academy Brixton? \",\"body\":\"Tickets will be in the O2 Academy Venues app as they’re handling ticket scanning for this event. We will email you when your tickets are available in the app.\\n\\nHow to use your tickets:\\n\\n1\\\\. Get the O2 Academy Venues app: https://www.academymusicgroup.com/o2academybrixton/o2-academy-venues-app\\n\\n2\\\\. Sign up using the email you used to purchase your tickets on DICE\\n\\n3\\\\. At the door, show your tickets on the O2 Academy Venues app (not DICE)\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":76528,\"title\":\"How do I download the O2 Academy Venues app?\",\"body\":\"The O2 Academy Venues app is available to download for iOS and Android: https://www.academymusicgroup.com/o2academybrixton/o2-academy-venues-app\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":76529,\"title\":\"How do I find my ticket?\",\"body\":\"Your ticket is stored on the “Tickets” section of the O2 Academy Venues app. Simply select where you booked your tickets and log in using the email address you purchased your tickets with.\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":76530,\"title\":\"Can I change my seat?\",\"body\":\"Seats can’t be changed after booking, so please review your selection carefully before checkout.\",\"order\":4},{\"id\":76531,\"title\":\"Do I need to transfer tickets to the rest of my group?\",\"body\":\"Yes, access to the venue requires all members of your group to have their own ticket, so make sure you transfer these in the O2 Academy Venues app before arriving at the venue. Ticket transfer will not be available for this event on DICE.\",\"order\":5},{\"id\":76532,\"title\":\"I can’t make it anymore, can I sell my ticket? \",\"body\":\"DICE Wait list returns are not available for this venue. You must use the O2 Academy Venues app to securely resell your tickets to another fan.\",\"order\":6},{\"id\":76533,\"title\":\"How to book accessible tickets for O2 Academy Brixton\",\"body\":\"More info on accessibility here: https://www.academymusicgroup.com/o2academybrixton/accessibility\",\"order\":7},{\"id\":76534,\"title\":\"How do I travel to the venue?\",\"body\":\"The venue is easily accessible by public transport. There are no parking facilities. Check all local transport routes for the latest information, services and timetables.\\n\\nLocation information and all accessible travel options can be found here: https://www.academymusicgroup.com/o2academybrixton/getting-here\\n\\nPlan ahead and always know how you're going to get home.\",\"order\":8}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-12/3d9dcb9e-525e-45b5-a73d-e709c7388e14.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C768%2C768\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-12/3d9dcb9e-525e-45b5-a73d-e709c7388e14.jpg?rect=0%2C154%2C768%2C461\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-12/3d9dcb9e-525e-45b5-a73d-e709c7388e14.jpg?rect=173%2C0%2C422%2C768\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Ashnikko - Blow\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/15tYNBfPUKQ7oxTr9TidZr\",\"artist\":\"Ashnikko\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/f2065e59b5722eca2646edf3c1ea8225b56ffba8?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Blow\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":\"176c36bf-8cc0-47b8-b9e4-fe9983743810\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1770976380,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1707,\"name\":\"Live Nation UK\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.livenation.co.uk/privacy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"4f3c2a85-4bb4-4b30-9a29-0e3a7501c57c\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"176c36bf-8cc0-47b8-b9e4-fe9983743810\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Live Nation presents\\n\\nAshnikko\\n\\n\\\\+ Amelia Moore\\n\\nNo U8’s, U14’s must be seated in the circle and accompanied by an adult 18+. Stalls standing strictly 14+ only.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Live Nation.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"7edfaa6f16d85d00:73\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/iffbec998ee6?dice_id=iffbec998ee6\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u42df02cb2cb?dice_id=u42df02cb2cb\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N70b5714d7b2?dice_id=N70b5714d7b2\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T55fc0916610?dice_id=T55fc0916610\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y337dd7f450b?dice_id=y337dd7f450b\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Yb8fc1644c18?dice_id=Yb8fc1644c18\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-13T09:53:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-13T09:55:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":4127,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[\"selling_fast\"],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"24\",\"name\":\"Live Nation\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"live-nation-z6d3\",\"profile_active\":true},\"id\":\"698e099e19fa050001ae8576\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"4f3c2a85-4bb4-4b30-9a29-0e3a7501c57c\",\"name\":\"Ashnikko: Smoochies Tour\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"v39r67-ashnikko-smoochies-tour-19th-feb-o2-academy-brixton-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1771527600,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"4877\",\"name\":\"The Engine Rooms\",\"address\":\"Unit 30, Bow Triangle Business Centre, Eleanor St, London E3, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5260621,\"lng\":-0.0230738},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-21/4b217afc-7433-4486-a17a-80ee360b3d14.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C192%2C192\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-engine-rooms-gyrp\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-02-19T23:00:00+00:00\"},{\"id\":\"1976\",\"name\":\"Engine Rooms Rehearsal Studio\",\"address\":\"Unit 30, Bow Triangle Business Centre, Eleanor Street, London E3 4UR, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5242217,\"lng\":-0.022967999999991662},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"engine-rooms-rehearsal-studio-kweq\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-02-19T23:00:00+00:00\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":4},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-05/6f16ce7e-2a3f-4890-bfc5-e67c9c1694ff.jpg?rect=0%2C155%2C1290%2C1290\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-05/6f16ce7e-2a3f-4890-bfc5-e67c9c1694ff.jpg?rect=0%2C413%2C1290%2C774\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-05/6f16ce7e-2a3f-4890-bfc5-e67c9c1694ff.jpg?rect=205%2C0%2C880%2C1600\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770300000,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Engine Rooms Presents: Just Another Thursday Night**\\n\\nA heavy night of live metal at **Engine Rooms** in **Bow**, **East** **London**, bringing together four bands delivering volume, weight and atmosphere in a room built for it.\\n\\n**Syndicate** follow with a more direct, modern metal approach. Driven by tight riffs and relentless rhythm, their set keeps momentum high while staying rooted in raw energy and precision.\\n\\n**Bullmaera** push things further with crushing guitars and dynamic shifts that hit hard and stay heavy. Expect urgency, grit and a set designed to fill the Engine Rooms floor with noise and movement.\\n\\n**Anserine** continue the evening with dark, oppressive metal that leans into tension and slow-burning intensity. Their sound sets a brooding tone early, pulling the room into deeper, heavier territory from the first note.\\n\\n*Just another heavy gig on a Thursday night in Bow.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by LVLS London & The Engine Rooms.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"7edfaa6f16d85d00:74\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ef6b453bbb88?dice_id=Ef6b453bbb88\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/He007afc29a6?dice_id=He007afc29a6\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w37d779494cc?dice_id=w37d779494cc\",\"post_purchase_referr