 see the accessibility information button/link below*\\n\\nRochelle Jordan is stepping into a luminous new chapter, one that promises to define an era. To those in the know, the Los Angeles based British Canadian singer and songwriter has long been an underground force coaxing together the mutually flirtatious scenes of daring alt R&B and heart pumping electronic music. With her longtime creative director/producer KLSH, she’s cultivated a singular marriage of sound mixing soulful sensuality, house bump, DnB wildness, hip-hop swagger, and pure experimentalism that’s spread not only through certain circles, but also to the mainstream.\\n\\nThis is a 14+ (under 16s to be accompanied by an adult) event - physical photo ID required\",\"highlights\":[]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by BOTW.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"7edfaa6f16d85d00:79\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Bbe06f9bbe67?dice_id=Bbe06f9bbe67\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/rd808eb19a0c?dice_id=rd808eb19a0c\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z52066d3bc7e?dice_id=z52066d3bc7e\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b6c6c1d124fe?dice_id=b6c6c1d124fe\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k5f84e2ce0cb?dice_id=k5f84e2ce0cb\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x34c7df5bbf0?dice_id=x34c7df5bbf0\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-22T15:59:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-23T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":2561},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8466\",\"name\":\"Outernet Venue Ltd\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"outernet-venue-ltd-96a7\",\"profile_active\":true},\"id\":\"696f802cdcc71700015d773e\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Rochelle Jordan\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"oeggn5-rochelle-jordan-19th-feb-here-at-outernet-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1771527600,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"202\",\"name\":\"Rough Trade East London\",\"address\":\"The Old Truman Brewery, 150 Brick Lane, London E1 6QL\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5217064,\"lng\":-0.0722892999999658},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-04-22/07d0d459-3704-44e0-b9e6-2a2920355fb6.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"rough-trade-east-london-4bwm\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://dice.fm/help/article?id=29038379509137\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Lots of Hands\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb85533b05dd2d0971b9da4929\"},\"artist_id\":\"71446\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Truthpaste\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebe5c5a9eef3e0c46634bf1563\"},\"artist_id\":\"94288\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Tulpa\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-06-03/40ea515d-5008-4337-8bc8-8bc578dd0bc3.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"102585\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":17764,\"title\":\"How do I arrange a carer/PA ticket?\",\"body\":\"Free PA and Carer tickets can be added onto an existing ticket by reaching out to dice.fm/contact. If possible please request these as soon as possible after purchase of your original ticket to ensure availability. These spots are limited for sold out events.\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":36018,\"title\":\"Can I upgrade my CD to an LP or the other way around on the night?\",\"body\":\"Sometimes this is possible, sometimes not. It all depends on if we have extra stock on the night!\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":36019,\"title\":\"If there is a signing at the event, can I have a photo with the artist?\",\"body\":\"We want everyone to enjoy their moment at these special intimate events. Although this is solely at the discretion of the artist or their management, there may be some cases where they don’t want photos.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":17763,\"title\":\"Do you have accessible seating?\",\"body\":\"Accessible seating can be requested prior to the event through dice.fm/contact or by contacting us directly. Please note that we only have a very limited number of seats available for sold out events.\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":36015,\"title\":\"Is Rough Trade East London wheelchair accessible?\",\"body\":\"Rough Trade East London is wheelchair acccessible via ramp, and has an accessible toilet.\",\"order\":4},{\"id\":36020,\"title\":\"If there is a signing at the event, can I bring other stuff to get signed?\",\"body\":\"This is purely at the discretion of the artist and management.\",\"order\":5},{\"id\":36021,\"title\":\"Where do I pick up my album?\",\"body\":\"When you arrive, a member of staff will scan your ticket and give you your pre-order upon entry. In some cases the album will be shipped and there will be a print to be signed instead. You won’t be able to collect the album on the way out after the event.\",\"order\":6},{\"id\":17765,\"title\":\"How long is the show and is there a support act?\",\"body\":\"Unless stated, there is just one set with no support, these are usually shorter than your average headline set. They’re between 30-50 minutes, playing songs from the new release or a Q&A. There is an hour between the door time and the stage time.\",\"order\":7},{\"id\":36033,\"title\":\"How do I know when it starts?\",\"body\":\"The doors and set times are listed on your DICE ticket and on the DICE event. This differs from store to store.\",\"order\":8},{\"id\":36017,\"title\":\"I don’t have a CD/Record player, can I just buy a ticket for the gig?\",\"body\":\"Unfortunately no, if general entry/free entry tickets aren’t listed there is no way to buy a ticket without an album.\",\"order\":9}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-16/7b0d63c9-e001-478e-a98c-ff4cedda0473.jpg?rect=399%2C0%2C2245%2C2245\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-16/7b0d63c9-e001-478e-a98c-ff4cedda0473.jpg?rect=0%2C210%2C3042%2C1825\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-16/7b0d63c9-e001-478e-a98c-ff4cedda0473.jpg?rect=904%2C0%2C1235%2C2245\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"lots of hands - mistake\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6wjznpOUm54iCCCT6Rgt6R\",\"artist\":\"lots of hands\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/8f8c32e712f336f2439dc4ec26a709db77669b1a?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"mistake\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"lots of hands - Mistake\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/mistake/1756141849?i=1756141863&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"lots of hands\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/37/0e/a8/370ea831-9e9e-bec9-60c9-5babdade40d6/mzaf_17013281871644664482.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Mistake\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1768582800,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":88,\"name\":\"Rough Trade\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.roughtrade.com/gb/privacy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"140305603371460\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-1783149-3\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Rough Trade Recommends presents: lots of hands + Truthpaste + Tulpa**\\n\\nRough Trade's monthly new music showcase returns with some of the best up-and-coming acts in the alternative scene.\\n\\n**lots of hands  \\n**into a pretty room—lots of hands’ debut on Fire Talk Records — exists in the tear-stained early mornings of adolescence, just as the sun makes its first appearance over the horizon and thoughts of the night before begin to subside.\\n\\nA collage of reworked demos, freewheeling session standouts, and swatches of instrumental electronics, into a pretty room emerges as lots of hands’ most thoughtful work to date.\\n\\nSolemn yet hopeful, into a pretty room occupies the space between moments of tragedy and triumph, offering a touching rumination on grief and loss, growing up and letting go  \\n\\n**Truthpaste  \\n**Truthpaste are a band of five multi-instrumentalists and a trusty computer drum, blending pop, acoustic folk, and electronic music.  \\n\\n**Tulpa  \\n**Tulpa are a very new indie rock band from Leeds. Their sound contrasts detuned and lo-fi guitar textures with hyper-melodic vocals, creating songs with emotional warmth and sonic intrigue. The group consists of Josie Kirk, Daniel Hyndman, Myles Kirks and Mike Ainsley. They supported Throwing Muses, Pale Blue Eyes and Bug Club, recorded a live session for Marc Riley and Gideon Coe on BBC6 Music, and released their debut album ‘Monster Of The Week’ on Skep Wax Records in November 2025.\\n\\nA Tulpa is a mythical being manifested into existence through the act of concentrated thought, like an imaginary friend brought to life - but (sometimes) scarier.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Rough Trade.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"7edfaa6f16d85d00:80\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p43abe56d993?dice_id=p43abe56d993\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A22d771762e0?dice_id=A22d771762e0\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x430f6ffe1a5?dice_id=x430f6ffe1a5\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p9f77a7d795b?dice_id=p9f77a7d795b\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o522f1c5d170?dice_id=o522f1c5d170\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Vfd156baef8f?dice_id=Vfd156baef8f\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-16T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-20T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":900,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"236\",\"name\":\"Rough Trade\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-04-22/9fc79b92-f049-4139-9903-f93a90a88363.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"rough-trade-jqgp\",\"profile_active\":true},\"id\":\"696e39e149dc100001f25184\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Rough Trade Recommends: lots of hands + Truthpaste + Tulpa\",\"offers_extras\":true,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"l8bg9x-rough-trade-recommends-lots-of-hands-truthpaste-tulpa-19th-feb-rough-trade-east-london-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1771527600,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[{\"ticket_type_id\":1169947,\"extra_ids\":[\"1176288\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1169948,\"extra_ids\":[\"1176288\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1169949,\"extra_ids\":[\"1176288\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1194355,\"extra_ids\":[\"1176288\"]}],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"14088\",\"name\":\"Theatreship\",\"address\":\"South Quay Plaza 2, London, England E14 9SH, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.500574,\"lng\":-0.01734},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-16/325a798f-118c-4bd1-ad3e-4bfdd4f477dc.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"theatreship-yo272\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Body Orchestra\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-31/954d9cf3-08d4-4100-b3b3-7c27da194217.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"81775\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Josh Curtis\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"64995\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Avice Caro\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-09-14/5cff7998-d155-493e-905c-8f0f8fbdb434.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"22600\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":69424,\"title\":\"Theatreship Accessibility Policy\",\"body\":\"Theatreship is committed to broadening access to the arts - we know that ticket price is a huge barrier for some. If the regular ticket price is beyond what you feel able to afford for whatever reason, please don't hesitate to email us at tickets@theatreship.co.uk and we will send a ticket at whatever price works for you, no questions asked.\\n\\nDue to the historic nature of the ship, we’re sorry to say there is not currently step-free access into the theatre space. We have dedicated staff on hand to help with stairs, and an onsite wheelchair once you’re inside the venue. If you have any access needs, please do e-mail us at access@theatreship.co.uk, we're always happy to hear from you, and we'll do whatever we can to help!\",\"order\":0}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-14/d012cf59-86a3-4ee9-81d9-49331fe07653.jpg?rect=256%2C0%2C768%2C768\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-14/d012cf59-86a3-4ee9-81d9-49331fe07653.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1280%2C768\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-14/d012cf59-86a3-4ee9-81d9-49331fe07653.jpg?rect=429%2C0%2C422%2C768\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Robin\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/17bPDBj3Jw7JO9K3fuCkej\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/f14a8a42b3d55ddcb9a61c10bfe282d992bdefe7?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Robin\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1768401000,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Rather than bucolic depictions of the countryside, the London-based Avice Caro (Maria Dearest) makes folk music that draws on fairytales and the strange folklore of the British Isles. Think stories of seagulls with mischievous smiles and 17th-century tales of lost love, sung in melodies that twist like creeping vines.Rather than bucolic depictions of the countryside, the London-based Avice Caro (Maria Dearest) makes folk music that draws on fairytales and the strange folklore of the British Isles. Think stories of seagulls with mischievous smiles and 17th-century tales of lost love, sung in melodies that twist like creeping vines.\\n\\nBody Orchestra is the brainchild of Vincent Curson Smith (Insecure men, Pet Deaths, Denh Izen). Body Orchestra regularly appears as a four piece ensemble featuring composer/singer Vincent C Smith , drummer Seb Bloom, double bassist Sam Hollis, and violinist Beth Elliott . After meeting when studying at Trinity Laban Conservatoire - Smith, Elliott and Bloom discovered a shared love of improvisation and avant garde music, and brought in Hollis to form Body Orchestra.\\n\\nBDRCHSTR explores improvisation, and recomposition, developing on folk or classical themes and exploring with sonic experimentation.\\n\\nVincent will be appearing solo\\n\\nJosh Curtis is a London based multi-instrumentalist and composer whose genre-crossing music brings together classical and electronic music, underpinning introspective songwriting and spoken word.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Theatreship.\",\"streaming_op