Voices — **Tokomololo** is the alias of Anglesey-based producer, Meilir Tee Evans. Born from joy and jubilation, and tipped by CLASH as Wales’ answer to Bonobo, Tokomololo crafts sonic soundscapes that pulse between the organic and the synthetic. He will be joined on the night by rising artists **Angharad** and **SHINOBii**.\\n\\nThis event celebrates the release of Klust Magazine Issue 04, out now.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Klust.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"7edfaa6f16d85d00:83\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A1ecec0deaa1?dice_id=A1ecec0deaa1\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c9e673364614?dice_id=c9e673364614\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y74da3107735?dice_id=Y74da3107735\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Gff0528c143a?dice_id=Gff0528c143a\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q791056b4782?dice_id=q791056b4782\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/l5b59b9b43a0?dice_id=l5b59b9b43a0\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-16T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-16T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1000,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"14629\",\"name\":\"Klust\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"klust-g5526\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"6968a2c4aeaf970001c701a0\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Tokomololo, Angharad + SHI