ts onto the stage to perform with the improv band**\\n\\n(it's not a competition just a way of bringing poets and singers together 🫂)\\n\\n\\\\----------------------------\\n\\n**line up**\\n\\ntia-zakura\\n\\nrio sterling\\n\\n\\\\+ guests & open mic\\n\\n(sign up for open mic 7-7:45pm, names will be picked out a hat (roughly 1 in 4 chance of being picked)\\n\\ninsta / tiktok - @spitnights\\n\\n\\\\----------------------------\\n\\n- event starts 7:45pm\\n- bar open from 5pm\\n- DJs 7-8pm and 10:30-late\\n- standing event\\n- step free access (speak to venue staff and they can assist)\\n\\n\\\\----------------------------\\n\\n*LOW INCOME TICKETS*\\n\\n*we don't want anyone to be priced out of coming to our night so if money is tight use code COMMUNITY to unlock £5 tickets (DICE adds a fee for waitlist tickets)*\\n\\n*thank you to everyone who buys a PAY IT FORWARD ticket to help us offer cheaper tickets to those who need <3*\\n\\n\\\\----------------------------\\n\\n1st fridays of the month = pure poetry night\\n\\n3rd thursdays of the month = poets vs singers\\n\\nlast thursday of the month = poetry x improv jazz show\\n\\n\\\\----------------------------\\n\\nYou can find info regarding our safety policy here: https://linktr.ee/spitnights\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by spit nights.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"7edfaa6f16d85d00:84\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Yf0bc5f7452f?dice_id=Yf0bc5f7452f\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ya3999d62510?dice_id=ya3999d62510\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k6fa08fd1856?dice_id=k6fa08fd1856\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Kd5789c76b09?dice_id=Kd5789c76b09\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"