 play full-band sets for you as part of one excellent night and we cannot wait for you to hear the music of Maya Lakhani and Alexandra Leaving. If its your first time, you're in for a treat. For those who know, get yourself a ticket now.\\n\\nSeasons Change; welcome to Season Two, February 2026\\n\\nPick up your Season Ticket now at https://link.dice.fm/theseason\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Season.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"7edfaa6f16d85d00:86\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w2594185d0ee?dice_id=w2594185d0ee\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Zdcfe2340273?dice_id=Zdcfe2340273\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R7f7f9085bbb?dice_id=R7f7f9085bbb\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Me97e12138ab?dice_id=Me97e12138ab\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T75493e5d6a2?dice_id=T75493e5d6a2\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/nf84a5c5c1ef?dice_id=nf84a5c5c1ef\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-20T14:15:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-20T14:15:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":750},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1634\",\"name\":\"InFireworks\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"infireworks-8vqv\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"6946ae2574bdc4000158adb8\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"The Season: Maya Lakhani,  Alexandra Leaving, Watching Alice\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"v3glqv-the-season-maya-lakhani-alexandra-leaving-watching-alice-19th-feb-notting-hill-arts-club-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1771527600,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"415\",\"name\":\"The Jazz Cafe\",\"address\":\"5 Parkway, London NW1 7PG\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5387845,\"lng\":-0.143146300000012},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-jazz-cafe-4m7k\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://thejazzcafelondon.com/faqs/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"System Olympia\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebf1b2b37ba7fbe59591a8962f\"},\"artist_id\":\"32111\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Ruby Francis\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-03-11/828bbd41-9b10-481e-a970-d1edec6831e5.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"5184\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"ROSEYE\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"124129\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":65493,\"title\":\"The Jazz Cafe FAQ's\",\"body\":\"Please follow this link for all Jazz Cafe FAQ's: https://thejazzcafe.com/faqs/?\",\"order\":0}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-18/f84a36a7-010a-4040-9cf1-2802c9747a98.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-18/f84a36a7-010a-4040-9cf1-2802c9747a98.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-18/f84a36a7-010a-4040-9cf1-2802c9747a98.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1766138400,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":380,\"name\":\"Columbo Music\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://thecolumbogroup.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"298700384025189\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Bradley Zero and London’s hottest label return to our stage for the first Rhythm Section takeover of the year — a highly anticipated night of RnB, hip-hop and genre-blending sounds.**\\n\\nLeading the charge is **System Olympia**, whose Italo-disco-laced synths and nocturnal pop romance soundtrack the dancefloor’s more intimate, after-dark moments.\\n\\nShe’s followed by **Ruby Francis**, an artist redefining modern soul, weaving ’00s RnB and neo-soul into beautifully crafted songs that feel intimate and effortlessly cool.\\n\\n Rounding things off, Amsterdam’s **ROSEYE** push the energy further, colliding soul, jazz, rock and electronics into an electrifying, free-flowing live show driven by improvisation, community and raw emotion.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Jazz Cafe.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"7edfaa6f16d85d00:87\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h9eb1a4080f4?dice_id=h9eb1a4080f4\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ma17568a1f26?dice_id=ma17568a1f26\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c388935b1b65?dice_id=c388935b1b65\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b5b3a7e24bf7?dice_id=b5b3a7e24bf7\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z3aa25a7766b?dice_id=z3aa25a7766b\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q77126fe543b?dice_id=Q77126fe543b\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-19T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-19T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1800,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"43\",\"name\":\"The Jazz Cafe\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-jazz-cafe-43ox\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"69443986dc2886000197c77e\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Rhythm Section Live: System Olympia, Ruby Francis \",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"dka7no-rhythm-section-live-system-olympia-ruby-francis-19th-feb-the-jazz-cafe-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1771527600,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"16894\",\"name\":\"Vespers Club Peckham\",\"address\":\"133A Rye Lane, London, SE15 4BQ, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.469813,\"lng\":-0.068368},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"vespers-club-peckham-v3wml\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Spanish Horses\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-01-23/e20927cd-3eb1-45e8-8861-9c37b7c6e23c.jpg?rect=0%2C51%2C539%2C539\"},\"artist_id\":\"113696\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"House Arrest\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebb47852f0e0fd6f9ab87bbd76\"},\"artist_id\":\"27958\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Border Widow\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"109031\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-18/fe38b43e-47dd-468f-a1ff-f39db988bb2b.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C3000%2C3000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-18/fe38b43e-47dd-468f-a1ff-f39db988bb2b.jpg?rect=0%2C600%2C3000%2C1800\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-18/fe38b43e-47dd-468f-a1ff-f39db988bb2b.jpg?rect=675%2C0%2C1650%2C3000\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Spanish Horses - Sisters\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/7k4XI1jNeV9m3QjFubnNLw\",\"artist\":\"Spanish Horses\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/fe399aa3cfaf10e64ba40535983fb63a4d2b30ff?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Sisters\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Spanish Horses - Sisters\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/sisters/1784085610?i=1784085613&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Spanish Horses\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/ce/97/83/ce978337-7d1d-309a-9350-2757af9fdf0d/mzaf_10802919570906391500.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Sisters\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1766102400,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"HENGE Live & Underground® present\\n\\n**Rare Doings**\\n\\nA monthly new artist showcase by Dash The Henge and Underground® at Vespers Club Peckham\\n\\n**SPANISH HORSES**\\n\\nSpanish Horses, a five-piece rock band formed in Paris in 2023, began in a cold storage studio and quickly built a loyal following. Their 2024 EP As She Rides By earned critical praise, with “Sisters” becoming a live staple. Relocating to London in 2025, they toured the UK and Ireland, supporting Public Image Ltd., and continue crafting heartfelt, ambitious music\\n\\n**HOUSE ARREST**\\n\\nUnified by desperation to create and collaborate despite the physical separation, House Arrest is a 5 piece Alternative Post- Punk band who celebrate individuality and freedom of expression. Fuelled only by a desire to bring people together and dance the pain away, they are prepared to unload whatever you need when you need it\\n\\n**BORDER WIDOW**\\n\\nBorder Widow is the new project from Chardine Taylor-Stone (Big Joanie) and Hatty Carmen (Thigh High, Princess Republic). Our music is a gothic journey into the dark feminine realms of sound. Characterised by haunting darkwave pop melodies and atmospheric soundscapes, we create an immersive experience that is both eerie and beautiful\\n\\nDJ: **Matt Priory** (Dash The Henge)\\n\\nwww.dashthehengestore.com  \\nInstagram: @dashthehengestore\\n\\nhttps://underground-england.com/  \\nInstagram: @undergroundengland.since1981\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by HENGE Live.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"7edfaa6f16d85d00:88\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F14a821bb083?dice_id=F14a821bb083\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z11d42efc123?dice_id=z11d42efc123\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D6d2ead51865?dice_id=D6d2ead51865\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/V5f2cf3d2395?dice_id=V5f2cf3d2395\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z3b86c3ddc7f?dice_id=Z3b86c3ddc7f\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/wfbb161c80d5?dice_id=wfbb161c80d5\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-19T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-19T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-20T00:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1247},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"138900\",\"name\":\"HENGE Live\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"henge-live-6rdeb\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"69440d84a1b6e20001ca703a\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Rare Doings #001: Spanish Horses + House Arrest\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"oeq95a-rare-doings-001-spanish-horses-house-arrest-19th-feb-vespers-club-peckham-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1771527600,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1238\",\"name\":\"Folklore Hoxton\",\"address\":\"186 Hackney Rd, London E2 7QL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5306515,\"lng\":-0.07228429999997843},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"folklore-hoxton-2or7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Dan Millson\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebb67b4e9b44a10399cacbf179\"},\"artist_id\":\"48270\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Official Shannon\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-01-29/0ed39110-ac02-4187-8873-f48d28dc5167.jpg?rect=0%2C1%2C639%2C639\"},\"artist_id\":\"68386\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-17/3f53afdd-90a5-4217-ae11-af34d3fcfdb5.jpg?rect=0%2C270%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-17/3f53afdd-90a5-4217-ae11-af34d3fcfdb5.jpg?rect=0%2C486%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-17/3f53afdd-90a5-4217-ae11-af34d3fcfdb5.jpg?rect=95%2C0%2C891%2C1620\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Amity - Bite Me!\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1wI680HpFceTwO95q0yNW1\",\"artist\":\"Amity\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/bf8c7552c39849dd39322fa0f58da715dde9713d?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Bite Me!\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Amity - Bite Me!\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/bite-me/1791767537?i=1791767538&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Amity\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/8e/8f/96/8e8f9699-f321-eca2-3273-3fc10977dbf3/mzaf_15204543006078079872.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Bite Me!\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1765969200,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Writing hard-hitting songs for right now, **Amity**’s an outspoken South London artist with a \\\"gut punch voice, razor sharp pen game & a lot to say\\\". For fans of Sofia Isella, Paris Paloma, and REN, as much as Fiona Apple, Billie Eilish, and Adele, this multi-award-winner’s piano-led “powerhouse” performances serve up distinctive vivid lyricism in profound, visceral songs that resonate deeply, leaving audiences not knowing whether to cry or dance - they usually do both!\\n\\nSince dropping his debut track in February 25, the critically acclaimed 18-yr-old has gone on to achieve viral momentum, 11x’ing his fanbase in under a year, selling out The Royal Albert Hall’s Elgar Room with the release concert for his debut EP and bagging his first chart success plus two more award nominations with his latest release.\\n\\nThe current “Breakthrough Artist 2025” nominee, Amity’s been creating a buzz since he was 15, when his live debut was lauded in The Guardian. Dubbed “an artist for our time” (ASBO Magazine), The Royal Albert Hall’s Official “Future Maker” artist & “the voice & music of 2025” (Phoenix FM), Amity’s powerfully moving art takes aim at an unjust world, speaking up for anyone who's faced adversity.\\n\\n*With support from Official Shannon, Dan Millson*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Success Express.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"7edfaa6f16d85d00:89\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e7303ee974c5?dice_id=e7303ee974c5\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K86530e0b925?dice_id=K86530e0b925\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ia195b580d7f?dice_id=ia195b580d7f\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W128db2c30e6?dice_id=W128db2c30e6\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y70d42ba2fc2?dice_id=Y70d42ba2fc2\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J4a3914b1058?dice_id=J4a3914b1058\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-17T11:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-17T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":\"rescheduled\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1350,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"5755\",\"name\":\"Success Express\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"success-express-7a9b\",\"profile_active\":true},\"id\":\"69428ea991de1700015264c1\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Amity + Official Shannon, Dan Millson\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"oeqdmg-amity-official-shannon-dan-millson-19th-feb-folklore-hoxton-london-tickets\",\"d