=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"DEAFDEAFDEAF\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview124/v4/c0/90/bd/c090bd4f-6cc3-4aaa-a2bb-8152db253861/mzaf_9735835766467924769.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Nothingness\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1765152000,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**DEAFDEAFDEAF**\\n\\nIndependent Band from Greater Manchester, UK.\\n\\n‘Disarming shoegaze, raucous, feedback-laced post-punk that rings out with the echoes of **DEAFDEAFDEAF**’s Mancunian forebears.’\\n\\n‘A mile away from the average indie b\\\\*llocks and a marker for the Next Next Wave. **DEAFDEAFDEAF** cement their place in the rich vaults of Manc music with their own twist of subnormal soundscapes.’\\n\\n*Louder Than War.*\\n\\n‘The Band perfectly executes a range of dynamic levels, knowing just when to throw an abundant amount of harsh noise at you resulting in an all more powerful feeling of intensity.’\\n\\n*SPEW.*\\n\\n‘Touching on all of the unsettling emotions typically found in the melancholy genre, DEAFDEAFDEAF refuse to shy away from the truth.’\\n\\n*Gigwise.*\\n\\n‘Comparative to the records, the live set exhibits chaos and intensity that has to be experienced firsthand to truly appreciate the immense talents of DEAFDEAFDEAF’\\n\\n*VOICE*\\n\\n‘DEAFDEAFDEAF have carved for themselves. Undefinable by genre, yet akin to influence, the boys have really pulled together an impressive roster of tracks – especially this early on in their career. Notably building a name for themselves in the live music industry as one to watch, they have a certain grace in creating atmosphere and forging chaos in even the most unconventional of spaces.’\\n\\n*YUCK*\\n\\n***Details***\\n\\n*Instrumental rock from the estuary.*\\n\\n*Beddow, Dawson, Green, Wallman*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Hot Box Live Community Interest\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"7edfaa6f16d85d00:91\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Wa34dbbc7e18?dice_id=Wa34dbbc7e18\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/bcb885104547?dice_id=bcb885104547\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F00dea18755d?dice_id=F00dea18755d\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T1cee5fdba24?dice_id=T1cee5fdba24\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T881fa70a80a?dice_id=T881fa70a80a\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e86f558f92af?dice_id=e86f558f92af\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-08T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-08T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1000,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"4307\",\"name\":\"Hot Box Live Community Interest \",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-live-community-interest-7v77\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"693753b3f5977700013c1570\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"DEAFDEAFDEAF / Details\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"nvwk79-deafdeafdeaf-details-19th-feb-hot-box-chelmsford-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1771527600,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"coolin