nderstanding of their musical inheritance. The trio have performed across Ireland, France and the UK in venues such as The National Concert Hall, Paris Centre Culturel Irlandais and Sidmouth Folk Festival.\\n\\nAfter a sold out performance at Feakle Festival alongside Martin Hayes and extensive UK and Ireland tours 'The Weaving' look forward to releasing their debut album drawn from the rich musical wellspring of the West Kerry Gaeltacht.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Hackney Folk Club\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"7edfaa6f16d85d00:93\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v6a028179d11?dice_id=v6a028179d11\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/l198e6c38a34?dice_id=l198e6c38a34\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/B05fa8ffe5b4?dice_id=B05fa8ffe5b4\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E71d0a8a4583?dice_id=E71d0a8a4583\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ic71c5cab550?dice_id=Ic71c5cab550\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P0bd707fc59e?dice_id=P0bd707fc59e\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-30T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-01T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1429},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8999\",\"name\":\"Fire in the Mountain Festival\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"fire-in-the-mountain-festival-ltd-lbop\",\"prof