,\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-05-21/2954b5b4-727f-448f-9dc4-57aeaa40c928.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"113449\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"For a number of years, Nina Lim has been at the centre of London’s alternative music scene. Having studied at Guildhall School of Music and Drama she established working relationships as a violinist with Black Country, New Road, Jockstrap, Geordie Greep and M.T Hadley. More broadly she has performed for more alternative pop musicians JADE and Little Simz and arranged strings for Holly Humberstone, and Anne Marie.\\n\\nThrough years of collaboration, touring, and session work, Nina has developed her craft right on the boundaries between pop and alternative. On her debut EP The Flowers I See You In, Ninush offers something emotionally resonant, rich in character and playfully kaleidscopic.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1765533600,\"faqs\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1696,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Ninush - I Don't Mind\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6wL3cuhOPz17kioLBs2Ger\",\"artist\":\"Ninush\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/8ac4187999d5353241a292c7798e0ac72f274dd5?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"I Don't Mind\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Ninush - I Don't Mind\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/i-dont-mind/1850169626?i=1850169627&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Ninush\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/55/04/c0/5504c05a-fb3a-9af8-0b46-28d0dcad88bb/mzaf_15726569283001122923.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"I Don't Mind\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-03T14:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-03T14:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-19T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Substance.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m2d5967587f1?dice_id=m2d5967587f1\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/wabfec489b67?dice_id=wabfec489b67\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A8235fb54b49?dice_id=A8235fb54b49\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J1d9c91574f8?dice_id=J1d9c91574f8\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ra3cab533c75?dice_id=Ra3cab533c75\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/C2705cecd3fc?dice_id=C2705cecd3fc\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Temporal Comet**\\n\\nTemporal Comet returns to 2025, weaving sonic warnings from a fractured world. Think Bowie and Radiohead in a Blade Runner dystopia.\\n\\nOn stage, Temporal Comet is a three-piece Temporal Comet comprising vocals w harmonies, guitar, electric upright bass and drums.\\n\\nThis floaty, slightly electronic music is often compared to David Bowie, Radiohead, Pink Floyd, and the sound of black holes forming. We like to call it'spacepop'.\\n\\nWe have a set of 30-50 minutes, mainly playing our original songs, with a cover or two thrown in - and all set to a live video projection which explores the best of sci fi and sci fact.\\n\\nhttps://linktr.ee/temporalcometepk\\n\\n**Teiger**\\n\\nFast-moving London trio Teiger have been described as enigmatic musical shapeshifters channelling psychedelic rock, textured folk, and soft, progressive metal to create collagist, atmospheric sounds that truly defy description.\\n\\nWith an arresting blend of power and intimacy, the band has gathered an impressive number of accolades despite only launching in 2022 - plays from BBC6’s Stu Maconie and BBC Introducing, a sold out vinyl release via Rough Trade, nominations for HRH Best New Band, Radio Wigwam’s Best Indie Rock award, as well as strong support from the press with features in Fireworks, Powerplay, PROG, Classic Rock and more....\\n\\nThe band has quickly become known on the UK festival circuit with appearances at\\n\\nCambridge Rock, Portals, Nene Valley, HRH, Soundle and Winter’s End\\n\\nTeiger is led by the siren-like vocals and unorthodox guitar playing of Talie Rose Eigeland, whose unusual approach is often likened to that of Beth Gibbons, Jeff Buckley or Grace Slick. Against these are juxtaposed the sometimes intricate,\\n\\n**Lugnut**\\n\\nCriminal moves, cosmic grooves....\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/lugnutband/\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":220,\"name\":\"Paper Dress Vintage\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1196387937118330\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":false,\"show_opt_in_form\":false,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":1771529400,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"373\",\"name\":\"Paper Dress Vintage\",\"address\":\"352a Mare Street, London, E8 1HR, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.54733,\"lng\":-0.05467},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-03-29/