0:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-18T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-22T02:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-19T21:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-19T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Royal Albert Hall.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[\"selling_fast\"],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_disabled\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Nfb58a53fff6?dice_id=Nfb58a53fff6\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/g95ae37c1529?dice_id=g95ae37c1529\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a7178f29bf57?dice_id=a7178f29bf57\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Rfb2611cff37?dice_id=Rfb2611cff37\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ff6d7a9fe2b1?dice_id=Ff6d7a9fe2b1\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H1e8d81c96d1?dice_id=H1e8d81c96d1\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"An evening of future-facing jazz and genre-bending fusion is coming to the Elgar Room as ORII COMMUNITY takes over Late Night Jazz with the sounds of some of London’s most innovative musicians.\\n\\nCelebrating boundary-pushers and cross-cultural sound-makers, this special edition brings together an exciting lineup of ORII residents, Christopher Chikwanah, Demba.io, Big Dreco, NuAloe, Sunshine the Afrooist, Grifton Forbes-Amos, Neue Grafik, and Tjoe Man Cheung.\\n\\nThe show will feature a special guest set from South London singer-songwriter, Hillarynx. Playful and multi-tonal, Hillarynx draws inspiration from Betty Carter, Nina Simone and the Soulquarians. Her work is rooted in Black Feminism(s) and she credits London's jazz jam scene for shaping her signature sound. Her contralto voice grounds the audience to face these times.\\n\\nOur intimate Late Night Jazz series presents sensational music in the Elgar Room, celebrating the freshest sounds on the London scene alongside the finest in jazz standards.\\n\\nWe have a laid-back attitude at Late Night Jazz at the Royal Albert Hall. Customers are welcome to dance, move around, sing along, and enjoy themselves in whatever way feels most comfortable!\\n\\nAll customers aged 14 years or below must be accompanied by an adult aged 18 years or over\",\"highlights\":[]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1771536600,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"8368\",\"name\":\"Elgar Room at Royal Albert Hall\",\"address\":\"Elgar Room at Royal Albert Hall\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.501267,\"lng\":-0.17754},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"elgar-room-at-royal-albert-hall-da6q\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-19T21:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"80cf0d405ef65b94:23\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2558\",\"name\":\"Royal Albert Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"royal-albert-hall-8m2r\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"694970e11d72490001e923c9\",\"name\":\"ORII COMMUNITY and Hillarynx\",\"perm_name\":\"nvwr69-orii-community-and-hillarynx-19th-feb-elgar-room-at-royal-albert-hall-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-22/a4a