re VERY limited, so make sure you grab yours before they run out!\\n\\nEach ticket gains you entry to the show and free drinks.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1771614000,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1081\",\"name\":\"Clock Tower, St. Pancras Station\",\"address\":\"King's Cross, Euston Rd, Kings Cross, London N1 9AL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.531703,\"lng\":-0.124310499999979},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"clock-tower-st-pancras-station-pywy\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-20T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":10,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"80cf0d405ef65b94:33\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"13797\",\"name\":\"Scott Quinn\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"scott-quinn-a8kx\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"69879b8a4ea2100001d016f6\",\"name\":\"Live From The Clock Tower\",\"perm_name\":\"v398lv-live-from-the-clock-tower-20th-feb-clock-tower-st-pancras-station-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-01-16/c1b322c5-c8e4-4c3c-a3e1-ad3d70d18332.jpg?rect=0%2C2153%2C5304%2C5304\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-01-16/c1b322c5-c8e4-4c3c-a3e1-ad3d70d18332.jpg?rect=0%2C2385%2C5304%2C3182\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-01-16/c1b322c5-c8e4-4c3c-a3e1-ad3d70d18332.jpg?rect=465%2C0%2C4374%2C7952\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Morgan Harper-Jones\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb4b7b960b7c6d40ebdc13755e\"},\"artist_id\":\"37183\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Peder Elias\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb7f476e93f2e9976c9fd65c1e\"},\"artist_id\":\"133756\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Scott Quinn\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb3cac79ac76634fe3537111a4\"},\"artist_id\":\"6014\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770552000,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":75438,\"title\":\"How do I find the venue? \",\"body\":\"Detailed instructions on how to find the venue will be sent via email on the day of the event. If you haven't received the email by 11am on the day of the show (check your junk!) please contact us via the instagram page @livefromtheclocktower .\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":75439,\"title\":\"What time should I arrive? \",\"body\":\"In order to really soak up the magic of this intimate show, make sure to arrive at 7 p.m. (but please no earlier!). This allows you to enjoy the special atmosphere and settle in with a drink before the first act performs at 7:30 p.m.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":75440,\"title\":\"Is this a seated event? \",\"body\":\"There are many seats in the tower but they do get taken up quite quickly, so make sure to arrive on time in order to grab one for yourself :)\",\"order\":2}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2090,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Scott Quinn - Loving You Is Easy\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/58KeGsuLVCSQ0Q72HFQENb\",\"artist\":\"Scott Quinn\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/6890e4e219a2c6366465e78e215aa9f09f25ded0?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Loving You Is Easy\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Scott Quinn - Loving You Is Easy\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/loving-you-is-easy/1828135813?i=1828135817&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Scott Quinn\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/e5/75/86/e5758685-069d-bfe6-b132-0bf3f14230e5/mzaf_9720049693681315723.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Loving You Is Easy\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-06T17:45:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-20T20:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-07T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-20T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-20T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Cav Presents.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P384c91ad87a?dice_id=P384c91ad87a\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ze1a5defe1a0?dice_id=Ze1a5defe1a0\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/wfd067305422?dice_id=wfd067305422\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ec1df57ec107?dice_id=Ec1df57ec107\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Df3fcb8d57a9?dice_id=Df3fcb8d57a9\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/M18edcce20a3?dice_id=M18edcce20a3\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Jamws** is an indie artist from London. Inspired by Jason Molina and The War on Drugs, he combines intimate songwriting with mesmeric arrangements.\\n\\nFeatured on Radio 1 and described as \\\"dazzling psych pop\\\" (Clash), he has over 10 million streams on Spotify. *https://youtu.be/j5yLj_ofHhY?si=oyBylaub381J9dir*\\n\\n**Jonny Simon** is back for a full band show. with a soft intensity, winding strings, earnest lyrics and burning warmth, Simon writes powerful folk, softpop tracks, like 'I Miss My Friends' available here: *https://linktr.ee/jonnysimon.wav*\\n\\n**Wren Stone** is the moniker of songwriter Henry Arrowsmith, who writes sparse, expressive and lyrical songs on piano and acoustic guitar. His sometimes delicate songs are influenced by folk, chamber-pop and Americana. *https://linktr.ee/wren.stone*\\n\\n**Oscar James** is an artist with a warming voice and a guitar virtuosity and style not dissimilar to Julian Lage, with complex harmonies and touching themes, James produced one of The Cav's favourite EPs back in '24 'Granville Park' *https://open.spotify.com/album/0nt70Z8Gvxc7q8HgVcgiQ8?si=xstNSkB9ScaRhzhbO9sd_Q*\\n\\n*💙 The Cavendish Arms is an accessible and inclusive venue with step free access and gender neutral toilets.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1771614000,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"2706\",\"name\":\"The Cavendish Arms\",\"address\":\"128 Hartington Rd, London SW8 2HJ, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4764913,\"lng\":-0.1277182000000039},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-cavendish-arms-59rl\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.thecav.uk/about-us\"}