ve transcended the gender binary. For a night of queer expression, imagination, and feral jubilation.\\n\\nWhere: Folklore, Hoxton\\n\\nWhen: Doors open 7pm // Cabaret 8.30-10pm // Party 10pm-late\\n\\nWhy: Raising money for Eat Your Art Out (a queer camp at Nowhere, the Spanish burn)\\n\\nWhat to wear?: Something you feel good in.\\n\\nMC: @\\\\_yarnballs\\n\\nPerformers:\\n\\n@fag\\\\_packet\\n\\n@vyomesingh\\n\\n@samisraar\\n\\n@chryshellemae\\n\\n@ziggyfroufou\\n\\n@mister\\\\_llaneous\\n\\n@finn\\\\_happened\\n\\n@chadgpt.drag\\n\\n@laurenapeters\\\\_\\n\\n@xtechnymphx\\n\\nDJs:\\n\\n@oysther\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\n\\n@laurenapeters\\\\_\\n\\n@dom.j.ryder\\n\\n@xtechnymphx\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1771614000,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1238\",\"name\":\"Folklore Hoxton\",\"address\":\"186 Hackney Rd, London E2 7QL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5306515,\"lng\":-0.07228429999997843},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"folklore-hoxton-2or7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-20T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"80cf0d405ef65b94:45\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2755\",\"name\":\"Folklore Hoxton\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"folklore-hoxton-7ogb\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\