20T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-20T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Acid Box\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e90b2e65168d?dice_id=e90b2e65168d\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Zff4ab7e43e5?dice_id=Zff4ab7e43e5\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Yfa56b09b39f?dice_id=Yfa56b09b39f\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x4b3b6070bed?dice_id=x4b3b6070bed\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y45d4b2ba15e?dice_id=Y45d4b2ba15e\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R71a6f743be4?dice_id=R71a6f743be4\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Gilles Peterson-endorsed cinematic maestro SHOLTO returns with his third album in three years. Following the epic, sprawling odyssey of 2024’s double album ‘Letting Go of Forever’, his new project ‘The Sirens’ builds upon the groove-rooted, string-soaked dreamscapes and ethereal textures upon which he’s built his name, this time inverting the beauty into a haunting fever dream. Releasing on Friday 21st November via DeepMatter Records, the record is emotionally unflinching, exploring themes of duality, temptation, and emotional dislocation, in SHOLTO’s words “blurring grief with groove, seduction and surrender”.\\n\\n*For accessibility information please see the accessibility information button/link below.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":819,\"name\":\"The Lower Third\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https:/