_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"The Season\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p01d9a7fbd1a?dice_id=p01d9a7fbd1a\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N18d5608e683?dice_id=N18d5608e683\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K054d26b527a?dice_id=K054d26b527a\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x8d0aa60da6c?dice_id=x8d0aa60da6c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H49871aa5912?dice_id=H49871aa5912\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a91a0c963567?dice_id=a91a0c963567\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Proudly presenting as part of **The Season:** **Hutch**, **Wakey Wakey Rise** a**nd Shine** plus **Moon Balloon**\\n\\nThis is a psych / indie show at Paper Dress Vintage, a truly excellent grassroots music venue / vintage clothes store in Hackney.\\n\\n**Hutch** are whimsical, psychedelic twang-pop enthusiasts with a penchant for poppy hooks, emerging from Brighton’s vibrant music scene.\\n\\nThey're joined by energetic, post-punk/indie-pop band from Bristol, UK; **Wakey Wakey, Rise & Shine**. Known for their catchy, danceable tunes with ironic, relatable lyrics about everyday struggles, blending psychedelic synths with gritty guitars for a sound that's both fun and smart.\\n\\n**Moon Balloon** sit somewhere between Gorky's Zygotic Mynci, Wire and Whitney. Moon Balloon congeal within the songwriting stew pot of South East London's music scene.\\n\\nWe defy you not to leave this show with a smile on your face.\\n\\nSeasons Change; welcome to Season Two, February 2026\\n\\nPick up your Season Ticket now at https://link.dice.fm/theseason\",\"h