":{\"description\":\"This is a night that flows through nostalgia, energy, and soul — bringing people together through the music we’ve grown up with and still return to.\\n\\n✨ Bollywood Retro — performed by Pradeep\\n\\nAt the heart of SoulJam is singing together and this set is exactly that.\\n\\nFamiliar retro melodies that invite everyone to join in, breathe together, and slow down. When we sing collectively, something shifts: the nervous system calms, the mood lifts, the breath deepens, and stress melts away. Focus improves, connection feels effortless, and joy shows up naturally.\\n\\n✨ Bollywood Rock — performed by Tushar\\n\\nTurning up the energy with bold, rock-infused Bollywood anthems. Powerful vocals, big emotions, and songs that hit hard — the kind you feel in your chest and sing at full volume.\\n\\n✨ Sufi Set — performed by Suboor Khan\\n\\nTo close the night, we move inward. Soulful, Sufi-inspired music that’s reflective, calming, and deeply emotional — a gentle landing after the highs, leaving you centered and full\\n\\n📅 21st February 2026\\n\\n💺 Seating: Limited Seated Tickets sold . The rest is standing to rock with the bands ...\\n\\n🚷 Re-Entry: No re-admission after exit.\\n\\n🎟️ 18+ Event | Limited Capacity – Book Early!\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":294,\"name\":\"229 The Venue\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://229.london/dataprotection/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":1771696800,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"399\",\"name\":\"229\",\"address\":\"229 Great Portland St, London W1W 