ersary-special-addition/1625903453?i=1625903461&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Buster Shuffle\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview112/v4/24/a7/49/24a7496b-2667-6d46-05ed-aa9fa2408f04/mzaf_9971189794800892128.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Our Night Out (10Th Anniversary Special Addition)\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Buster Shuffle\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb4df305a22cc3f4adac0beafa\"},\"artist_id\":\"48448\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"East London four-piece Buster Shuffle have blended ska punk with classic rock since their 2007 formation. Fronted by vocalist and pianist Jet Baker, the band take a tongue-in-cheek approach to songwriting, with Baker often singing in a thick cockney accent against a backdrop of bouncy guitar riffs, reggae drumlines, and unexpected instrumentation from mandolins and tubas.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3785\",\"name\":\"Hot Box\",\"address\":\"28 Viaduct Rd, Chelmsford CM1 1TS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.7359952,\"lng\":0.4672127},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-06-29/9ff0c867-708b-4d5c-834d-a927e4e4ae83.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"5eb9799ae1727402966007e1\",\"name\":\"Chelmsford\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.736717,\"lng\":0.466083,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-r7wq\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.hotboxlive.co.uk/accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-21T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-05-13/ce1fc830-57bc-4c4a-9d18-33fe629e5719.jpg?rect=257%2C0%2C1240%2C1240\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-05-13/ce1fc830-57bc-4c4a-9d18-33fe629e5719.jpg?rect=0%2C94%2C1754%2C1052\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-05-13/ce1fc830-57bc-4c4a-9d18-33fe629e5719.jpg?rect=536%2C0%2C682%2C1240\"},\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y45a5b47de6e?dice_id=Y45a5b47de6e\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s19650e6da11?dice_id=s19650e6da11\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D2093de50a4c?dice_id=D2093de50a4c\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o9ce9a895597?dice_id=o9ce9a895597\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/xbb4fdf0c26e?dice_id=xbb4fdf0c26e\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Mc1270e67461?dice_id=Mc1270e67461\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"db136d3610fd9326:10\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Hot Box Live Community Interest\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1747090800,\"id\":\"6823584a8fb5940001b5d6f9\",\"name\":\"Buster Shuffle\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Music is supposed to be about having fun and it’s practically impossible not to have a good time when listening to Buster Shuffle.\\n\\nFormed in 2007 by Jet Baker, Buster Shuffle quickly built up a formidable reputation on the London pub/club circuit, effortlessly fusing cockney Ska Punk with authentic Rock and Roll influences.\\n\\nBuster Shuffle teamed up with Art Brut’s Ian Catskilkin to produce 2010 debut album ‘Our Night Out’, which esteemed British music magazine, Uncut, gave four out of five stars. It went on to win a number of high-profile fans in the process, including BBC radio giant, Steve Lamacq and Pixies legend Frank Black. The band went on the road around the UK and supports with Madness, The Blockheads, The Selecter, The Wombats and The Beat along with sold out in-store Fred Perry subculture gigs enhanced the band’s burgeoning reputation.\\n\\nIn November 2017 Buster Shuffle released their 4th studio album titled “I’ll take what I want’. This latest offering is heavier, punkier and is a massive statement of intent from a band that is bigger and stronger than ever. Their debut single “I don’t trust a word you say” was premiered by the worlds most read newspaper, London’s “Metro” with readership of over 1 million per day. Having made their first forays into the USA, Canada and Mexico, Buster Shuffle have their sights firmly set on world domination.\\n\\n2025 sees Buster already confirmed for many Punk Rock and Ska Festivals worldwide. Shuffle on Shuffle on…\\n\\n\\\"Take my word for it, they're rocking.\\\"\\n\\n***THE SUN***\\n\\n\\\"Inspired arrangements and effective songs, one to watch.\\\"\\n\\n***UNCUT***\\n\\n\\\"You'll enjoy this knees-up bar-room stomp.\\\"\\n\\n***THE GUARDIAN***\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"4307\",\"name\":\"Hot Box Live Community Interest \",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-live-community-interest-7v77\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1771700400,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":0,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02