3481c6ed9.jpg?rect=151%2C0%2C1426%2C2592\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r198317d4fd6?dice_id=r198317d4fd6\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N30400057f74?dice_id=N30400057f74\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z029a238e308?dice_id=z029a238e308\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s2e675ee883c?dice_id=s2e675ee883c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ia32d1c0e89c?dice_id=Ia32d1c0e89c\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q2713a53cf4e?dice_id=Q2713a53cf4e\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"db136d3610fd9326:37\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Grow, Hackney.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1732665600,\"id\":\"69398b7c3bf9990001bc9a95\",\"name\":\"Canalside Sessions // Free // Every Sunday\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Experience live global music with master conga player Williams Cumberbache and special guests on Grow’s canalside terrace in Hackney Wick. Set against the River Lea, enjoy world-class performances from the pontoon stage as boats drift by.\\n\\nRelax in our hidden garden, surrounded by greenery, and enjoy homemade dishes from the Brunch or All Day menu. Ease into the weekend with a spritz in hand and sun on your face. Our new Spritz Happy Hour is the perfect way to toast your brunch plans – two for £15, or go alcohol-free with two Crodinos for £10.\\n\\nWith over 30 years in the UK music scene, including collaborations with Goldie and Björk, Williams curates each session with a vibrant mix of jazz fusion, Latin, Brazilian, and African rhythms. Expect solo sets or surprise guest artists.\\n\\nWhether you're a jazz head, a brunch lover, or just after feel-good energy, these sessions offer high-quality music, warm vibes, and a family-friendly space that welcomes dancing.\\n\\nPractical Info\\n\\n- Venue: Grow is a converted warehouse with canalside and indoor seating.\\n- Booking: Tables for up to 8 via OpenTable. Larger groups via enquiry form. Walk-ins welcome.\\n- Weather: Performances are outdoors but may move inside during extreme conditions.\\n- Time: Performances run between 1–4 PM; artists and set times may vary.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"10561\",\"name\":\"Grow, Hackney\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"grow-hackney-rdpy\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1771765200,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":2390},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-19T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-22T13:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-19T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-22T15:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-22T21:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"mx8o2w-wendy-mays-locomotion-40th-anniversary-22nd-feb-229-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Sometimes Love Aint Enough\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1u5MKc4jHulxqVWWU1sKHr\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/72fc2255c2d75cbb510b97cd4f5179d701c7ae04?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Sometimes Love Aint Enough\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":58739,\"title\":\"Venue Restoration Levy\",\"body\":\"The restoration levy is £1.20 for 229.\",\"order\":0}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"WENDY MAY'S LOCOMOTION\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab67616d0000b27381edfe696b2b305f68e0e0b7\"},\"artist_id\":\"14657\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Phill Jupitus\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"130440\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"399\",\"name\":\"229\",\"address\":\"229 Great Portland St, London W1W 5PN, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.523568,\"lng\":-0.144821},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-04-28/84389ecd-ecb4-45bc-a846-5cf9964535ff.jpg?rect=180%2C0%2C838%2C838\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"229-zl9b\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://229.london/access/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-22T15:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-19/938407dc-5224-497d-af40-4d5985ba7bd3.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-19/938407dc-5224-497d-af40-4d5985ba7bd3.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-19/938407dc-5224-497d-af40-4d5985ba7bd3.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h98e8e9508fe?dice_id=h98e8e9508fe\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/sf9f2142cdb7?dice_id=sf9f2142cdb7\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q24412685184?dice_id=Q24412685184\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/L0d26b95a9ba?dice_id=L0d26b95a9ba\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n8742251114d?dice_id=n8742251114d\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/M005d72407d8?dice_id=M005d72407d8\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":294,\"name\":\"229 The Venue\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://229.london/dataprotection/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"db136d3610fd9326:38\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by 229.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1763510400,\"id\":\"691df811163bcb00016a7ad8\",\"name\":\"Wendy May's Locomotion 40th Anniversary \",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"WENDY MAY'S LOCOMOTION featuring DJ'S: **WENDY MAY, PHILL JUPITUS, ANDY LEWIS, JANE WILKES**\\n\\nWendy May's Locomotion returns to London to celebrate it's 40th anniversary.\\n\\nA special one off at 229 with the original DJ line up from the legendary club session.\\n\\nAfter the demise of the Boothill Foot-Tappers, Wendy May started a regular Friday night club session at the Town & Country Club in London's Kentish Town (now know as the o2 Kentish Town Forum). Named 'Wendy May's Locomotion', the club ran for over 5 years pulling in more than 2,000 customers each week who danced to a mixture of vintage soul, funk, blues, mod jazz, ska and more.\\n\\nBeloved by a generation of club-goers, we are thrilled to bring Wendy May's Locomotion back to central London for a very special one-off 40th anniversary all day session.\\n\\n18+\\n\\nDoors at 3pm\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"6234\",\"name\":\"229\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"229-82l5\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1771772400,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[{\"ticket_type_id\":1179848,\"extra_ids\":[\"1186384\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1179849,\"extra_ids\":[\"1186384\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1179878,\"extra_ids\":[\"1186384\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1194357,\"extra_ids\":[\"1186384\"]}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1565},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-28T11:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-22T15:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-29T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-22T15:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-22T17:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"6dnob7-big-sleep-stripped-back-signing-22nd-feb-rough-trade-denmark-street-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Big Sleep - Old Friend\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4Upa4Devu3DADgTvonkPkL\",\"artist\":\"Big Sleep\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/b94929a663878d6a1a9e6d4a4f4d8350eaf38ddc?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Old Friend\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Big Sleep - Old Friend\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/old-friend/1864556400?i=1864556403&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Big Sleep\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/f5/ac/bc/f5acbcfd-747f-79db-dab0-f903903f29d8/mzaf_8345294376991021448.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Old Friend\"}],\"donation\":{\"description\":\"Help save a life. Someone in the UK dies by suicide every 90 minutes. Artists, musicians, and entertainers have an increased risk of suicide. Rough Trade is proud to partner with Campaign Against Living Miserably (CALM) in support of their incredible work challenging the stigma surrounding suicide and mental health.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-28/af5fb538-b9c7-4f41-bf11-48d1d9d6d45a.jpeg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"variants\":[{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":100,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE4NjM4NSwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTUxNTI0LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1OToxOS4wNzQwNjNaIiwicHJpY2UiOjEwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MzU4OSwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MzAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":300,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE4NjM4NSwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTUxNTI0LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1OToxOS4wNzQwOTNaIiwicHJpY2UiOjMwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MzU5MCwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6OTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":900,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE4NjM4NSwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTUxNTI0LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1OToxOS4wNzQxMDRaIiwicHJpY2UiOjkwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MzU5MSwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTIwMCwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsfQ==\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1200,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE4NjM4NSwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTUxNTI0LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1OToxOS4wNzQxMTRaIiwicHJpY2UiOjEyMDAsInZhcmlhbnRfaWQiOjM1OTIsInByb21vdGlvbl9pZCI6bnVsbCwicHJvZHVjdF9ncm91cF90eXBlIjoiZG9uYXRpb25zIn0=\"}],\"charity_name\":\"Campaign Against Living Miserably\",\"charity_registration_number\":\"1110621\"},\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":72764,\"title\":\"Can I bring a camera?\",\"body\":\"Please note no professional cameras are allowed. Small cameras are fine but anything too big or with a detachable lense will be turned away as we are a small space.\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":72765,\"title\":\"How do I arrange a carer/PA ticket?\",\"body\":\"Free PA and Carer tickets can be added onto an existing ticket by reaching out to dice.fm/contact. If possible please request these as soon as possible after purchase of your original ticket to ensure availability. These spots are limited for sold out events.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":72766,\"title\":\"Can I upgrade my CD to an LP or the other way around on the night?\",\"body\":\"Sometimes this is possible, sometimes not. It all depends on if we have extra stock on the night!\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":72767,\"title\":\"How long is the show and is there a support act?\",\"body\":\"Unless stated, there is just one set with no support, these are usually shorter than your average headline set. They’re between 15-30 minutes, playing songs from the new release or a Q&A. Please note there is only 15min between the door time and the stage time.\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":72768,\"title\":\"If there is a signing at the event, can I have a photo with the artist?\",\"body\":\"We want everyone to enjoy their moment at these special intimate events. Although this is solely at the discretion of the artist or their management, there may be some cases where they don’t want photos.\",\"order\":4},{\"id\":72769,\"title\":\"If there is a signing at the event, can I bring other stuff to get signed?\",\"body\":\"This is purely at the discretion of the artist and management.\",\"order\":5},{\"id\":72770,\"title\":\"Where do I pick up my album?\",\"body\":\"When you arrive, a member of staff will scan your ticket and give you your pre-order upon entry. In some cases the album will be shipped and there will be a print to be signed instead. You won’t be able to collect the album on the way out after the event.\",\"order\":6},{\"id\":72771,\"title\":\"How do I know when it starts?\",\"body\":\"The doors and set times are listed on your DICE ticket and on the DICE event. This differs from store to store.\",\"order\":7},{\"id\":72772,\"title\":\"I don’t have a CD/Record player, can I just buy a ticket for the gig?\",\"body\":\"Unfortunately no, if general entry/free entry tickets aren’t listed there is no way to buy a ticket without an album.\",\"order\":8}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Big Sleep\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-04-17/3a378e75-2538-4436-afcd-d8c572ee76fa.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"49606\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":true,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"14095\",\"name\":\"Rough Trade Denmark Street\",\"address\":\"24 Denmark Street, Camden, London, WC2H 8NJ, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.51547,\"lng\":-0.12933},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"rou