nces with his signature layered lyricism and top-tier flow.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"43\",\"name\":\"The Jazz Cafe\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-jazz-cafe-43ox\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1771779600,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":718},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-12T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-22T15:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-12T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-22T17:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-22T20:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"7dqygv-duo-concertante-heather-tuach-pre-concert-recital-22nd-feb-conway-hall-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":4},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3223\",\"name\":\"Conway Hall\",\"address\":\"25 Red Lion Square Holborn, London WC1R 4RL UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.51948760000001,\"lng\":-0.1168424},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"conway-hall-obq5\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.conwayhall.org.uk/about-us/faqs/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-22T17:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-22/ed675339-8f33-4d63-a3cb-1ad365d3a8e7.jpg?rect=128%2C0%2C1024%2C1024\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-22/ed675339-8f33-4d63-a3cb-1ad365d3a8e7.jpg?rect=0%2C128%2C1280%2C768\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-22/ed675339-8f33-4d63-a3cb-1ad365d3a8e7.jpg?rect=359%2C0%2C563%2C1024\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e8421d7e8bd4?dice_id=e8421d7e8bd4\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q88a3af8887f?dice_id=Q88a3af8887f\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y2181d81a477?dice_id=Y2181d81a477\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ef6a796fdbd6?dice_id=ef6a796fdbd6\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J1fec324977a?dice_id=J1fec324977a\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/I8c7b8703492?dice_id=I8c7b8703492\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"db136d3610fd9326:45\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Conway Hall.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1765497600,\"id\":\"6925ba91532e2f0001db220c\",\"name\":\"Duo Concertante & Heather Tuach + Pre-Concert Recital\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"For twenty-four years through live performances and acclaimed recordings, Canadian violinist **Nancy Dahn** and pianist **Timothy Steeves** have built an international career as Duo Concertante. Their name comes from the inscription over Beethoven’s “Kreutzer” Sonata, “in stilo molto concertante,” which implies the two performers are equal, dynamic voices. Cellist **Heather Tuach** will be known to Conway Hall concert-goers as a member of the Greenwich Trio. We are pleased to welcome this ensemble of Canadian musicians in a programme of Beethoven, Dvořák and the UK premiere of London-based composer Marcus Barcham Stevens' first piano trio.\\n\\n**Beethoven** | Violin Sonata in A minor Op.23\\n\\n**Marcus Barcham Stevens** | Trio No.1 (UK premiere)\\n\\n**Dvořák** | Trio in E minor 'Dumky' Op.90\\n\\nNancy Dahn • *violin*\\n\\nTimothy Steeves • *piano*\\n\\nHeather Tuach • *cello*\\n\\n**Pre-Concert Recital with Calliope Duo**\\n\\nThe three composers in this programme (Kurtág, Schubert and Bach). Despite their differences, all three composers share a gift for translating the subtle complexities of human nature and emotion into their purest musical form, making for a diverse and intimate listening experience.\\n\\n**A programme to celebrate the centenary of György Kurtág.**\\n\\nJosh Luxon-Robinson • *piano*\\n\\nIeuan Davies • *piano*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an all ages event. Under 16's must be accompanied by an adult.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"5578\",\"name\":\"Conway Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"conway-hall-5nry\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1771781400,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":700},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-07T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-22T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-08T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-22T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-22T21:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"3owo9l-metal-on-a-sunday-22nd-feb-the-engine-rooms-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":4},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"4877\",\"name\":\"The Engine Rooms\",\"address\":\"Unit 30, Bow Triangle Business Centre, Eleanor St, London E3, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5260621,\"lng\":-0.0230738},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-21/4b217afc-7433-4486-a17a-80ee360b3d14.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C192%2C192\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-engine-rooms-gyrp\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-22T18:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-13/f043a3b9-f4bb-4919-98c7-1a1f2dfb1772.jpg?rect=0%2C185%2C1590%2C1590\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-13/f043a3b9-f4bb-4919-98c7-1a1f2dfb1772.jpg?rect=0%2C503%2C1590%2C954\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-13/f043a3b9-f4bb-4919-98c7-1a1f2dfb1772.jpg?rect=256%2C0%2C1078%2C1960\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ff1d8342e170?dice_id=ff1d8342e170\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u8f6239ae5c5?dice_id=u8f6239ae5c5\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/cce62367043d?dice_id=cce62367043d\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r67a9271e5f8?dice_id=r67a9271e5f8\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/S78bf4534f14?dice_id=S78bf4534f14\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E63395f5c4ea?dice_id=E63395f5c4ea\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"db136d3610fd9326:46\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by LVLS London & The Engine Rooms.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1770465600,\"id\":\"6981db4e79917b0001b8a4d9\",\"name\":\"Metal on a Sunday\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Engine Rooms in Bow, East London hosts a Sunday night built for heavy music fans, bringing together four bands spanning modern metal, alternative and post-hardcore in one uncompromising bill.\\n\\nOpening the night, **The Custard Screams** kick things off with raw, high-energy punk attitude. Fast, loud and confrontational, their set is designed to shake the room awake and set the pace early.\\n\\n**Ending Everything** follow with a sound shaped by years of experience across genres. Blending EDM textures, metalcore weight and pop sensibility, their music moves between intensity and melody with confidence. This marks the beginning of a new chapter, with a set that signals change and ambition.\\n\\nMain support comes from **Doctor Black**, led by multi-instrumentalist and vocalist Rob Rees. Drawing influence from Slipknot, Parkway Drive and A Day To Remember, Doctor Black deliver an aggressive yet accessible mix of metal, punk and post-hardcore. With debut album Tales from the Void set for release on 12th September 2025, this is a chance to catch the band as momentum builds.\\n\\nHeadlining the night, **Transient Spirits** bring a hypnotic and genre-fluid approach to alternative rock and metal. Blending metal, glam, post-punk, grunge, goth and indie influences with infectious melodies and trance-like grooves, their sound explores the human condition and the ethereal, closing the night with weight, atmosphere and intent.\\n\\nGet your tickets now to send yourself off into the week with a smile.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"14743\",\"name\":\"LVLS London & The Engine Rooms\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"lvls-london--the-engine-rooms-3oonv\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1771783200,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":499,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-04-24T00:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-22T20:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-04-24T00:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-22T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-22T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"wwrl5n-jazz-on-the-lane-ft-gordon-li-22nd-feb-ninety-one-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":2,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3396\",\"name\":\"Ninety One \",\"address\":\"91 Brick Ln, Spitalfields, London E1 6QL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5214425,\"lng\":-0.07235059999999999},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"Lo