ng)\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Talib Kweli returns with the sharp and insightful lyrics that established him as one of hip-hop’s greats.**\\n\\nThe Brooklyn-based MC earned his stripes as one of the most lyrically-gifted, socially aware, and politically insightful rappers to emerge in the last 20 years, continuing to set the standard for conscious hip-hop.\\n\\nA legend in the game, his resume includes work with Black Star and Reflection Eternal, alongside a critically acclaimed solo career.\\n\\nKweli never fails to enthral audiences with his signature layered lyricism and top-tier flow.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"43\",\"name\":\"The Jazz Cafe\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-jazz-cafe-43ox\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1771790400,\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Sun 22 Feb\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":770,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-16T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-23T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-16T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-23T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-23T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"oegwaa-kalyani-23rd-feb-new-cross-inn-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":