rimental twists, weaving hypnotic rhythms and melodies that feel alive with every note. From intricate fingerpicking to vibrant groove-driven bursts, his music moves effortlessly between tradition and invention.\\n\\nRooted in Afro-Samba, choro and folkloric sounds, Fabiano’s compositions are both intimate and expansive, carrying the listener from sun-soaked Brazilian streets to the bustling energy of Tokyo.\\n\\nExpect hypnotic grooves, melodic ingenuity and a celebration of Brazil’s rich musical heritage.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"43\",\"name\":\"The Jazz Cafe\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-jazz-cafe-43ox\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1771873200,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":0,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-16T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-23T22:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-16T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-23T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-23T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"v397w6-palestine-fundraiser-noct-pigeon-dog-piracy-is-theft-23rd-feb-sebright-arms-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"NOCT - Everything is Ripe\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/everything-is-ripe/1735299971?i=1735299973&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"NOCT\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/e2/dd/42/e2dd423a-4a5e-a5a3-9fd8-10aa79365d2a/mzaf_16223255116501580330.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Everything is Ripe\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"