"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":false,\"show_opt_in_form\":false,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"db136d3610fd9326:79\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Orii Community.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1769601600,\"id\":\"6978f32f0ce9fa0001012b79\",\"name\":\"ORII JAM #oriieast | Töpia's Homies\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":true,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**ORII JAM | TÖPIA'S HOMIES**\\n\\nTÖPIA’S HOMIES ⭐️ is a collaborative, community-led music night centered on connection, creativity, and live expression. In this special edition, The Homies join forces with Töpia to host and facilitate the evening.\\n\\nThe night follows the same structure as Töpia’s regular sessions: an open jam led by live musicians, followed by an open mic where artists, poets, and performers are invited to share their work in a supportive space. Whether you’re stepping up to perform or just coming to soak in the energy, this is about building together, celebrating new voices, and creating something in the moment.\\n\\n*Come for the music, stay for the community :)  \\n  \\n***\\\\----**\\n\\n**Orii is a platform for artists and creatives, to perform, enagage, and inhabit their true Orii.**\\n\\n**1st half** | *for beginners to come on stage supported by our house band and hosts*\\n\\n**2nd half** | *for seasoned musicians, instrumentalists and vocalists to perform*\\n\\n\\\\----\\n\\n*Our weekly jam sessions occur every Monday in east, and every Tuesday in south*\\n\\n*Enabling the best musicians and artists in town to connect in a carefully curated sonic space, in the heart of Hackney Wick.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"T