a42e7b0e8cee?dice_id=a42e7b0e8cee\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/O0c4104b6361?dice_id=O0c4104b6361\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y5044e74a823?dice_id=y5044e74a823\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/d499d5217786?dice_id=d499d5217786\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"db136d3610fd9326:85\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Fox & Firkin.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1771200000,\"id\":\"69932cfec152b2000100752e\",\"name\":\"The Folks South Side Jazz Jam Takeover\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**On Tuesday February 24 The Folks Music will be featured at the South Side Jazz Jam!**\\n\\nThe Folks Music is a Nigerian band known for blending traditional African sounds with contemporary musical influences. They are recognized for their rich, soulful music that incorporates elements of Afrobeat, highlife, folk, jazz and contemporary Nigerian genres. Their sound is often described as a fusion of traditional Nigerian rhythms and modern instrumentation, creating a unique and engaging musical experience. The band’s music often explores themes of culture, love, social issues, and personal introspection, which resonates deeply with their audience. They are part of a broader movement in Nigerian music where artists seek to preserve and celebrate African traditions while also embracing global influences.\\n\\nAfter the Folks perform Tjoe Man Cheung will be leading our monthly jam. Anyone who has been, knows what they’re in for, anyone who hasn’t, come through!\\n\\n£5 + booking fees in advance\\n\\n£7 on the door\\n\\nPerforming musicians- Free\\n\\nDiscounted in-house beer of the night for all jam go-ers.\\n\\nEvery other Tuesday.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":nu