fy genre and categorisation !\\n\\nwww.instagram.com/improvsgreatesthits\\n\\nGROUP C\\n\\n—————\\n\\nSet time 8.30pm\\n\\nRuby Kyriakides ( Goat Girl / Marsey ) - keys\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/rubykyri\\n\\nNathan Greywater ( Skronk ) - bass\\n\\nhttps://skronkimprov.bandcamp.com\\n\\nHarry Furniss ( Improv’s Greatest Hits\\n\\nMinor Conflict / Bingo Fury etc ) - cornet\\n\\nhttps://fictionfriction.substack.com/p/we-want-to-create-music-that-hasnt\\n\\nEmilio Alvarez Manilla ( Recogniser ) - guitar\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/recogniserband\\n\\nGROUP B\\n\\n—————-\\n\\nSet time 9.15pm\\n\\nLaura Tenschert ( Holy Mountain ) - saw\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/lauratenschert\\n\\nLaura Hussey ( 1000 Rabbits ) - harmonium\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/1000rabbitsband\\n\\nMiles Lavelle Golding - keys\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/1000rabbitsband\\n\\nFlora Brown ( Herman’s Military\\n\\nAntiques ) - clarinet\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/hermansmilitaryantiques\\n\\nGROUP A\\n\\n—————-\\n\\nSet time 10pm\\n\\nAsher Fynn ( Jasmine 4.t etc ) - keys / vocals\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/asherfynn\\n\\nAidan Surgey ( Ex Agent / Broadsheets ) - drums\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/exagentband\\n\\nCarys Mai - sound collage\\n\\nRosa Brook ( Pozi / Squid ) - violin / vocals\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/rocarabro\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/poziband\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2755\",\"name\":\"Folklore Hoxton\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"folklore-hoxton-7ogb\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1771959600,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":880,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-30T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_da