s-24th-feb-the-shacklewell-arms-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"LNZRT\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://lanzaroteworks.com/Privacy-Policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":225,\"name\":\"Bad Vibrations\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"http://www.badvibrations.co.uk/privacy-policy-mojave\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"744309937658318\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":954,\"name\":\"MOTH\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"2922216871345119\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":false,\"show_opt_in_form\":false,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":2440,\"name\":\"The Shacklewell Arms\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://lanzaroteworks.com/Privacy-Policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"551066515482061\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1771961400,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"4699078e3c3acde4:4\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":0,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-20/937e6e04-a4db-433e-bb5d-a64d95188d8d.jpg?rect=0%2C521%2C2048%2C2048\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-20/937e6e04-a4db-433e-bb5d-a64d95188d8d.jpg?rect=0%2C931%2C2048%2C1229\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-20/937e6e04-a4db-433e-bb5d-a64d95188d8d.jpg?rect=174%2C0%2C1700%2C3090\"},\"id\":\"696f10a4a719200001e869d1\",\"name\":\"Birds Flying Backwards + Of Iyrn + Henry Webb-Jenkins\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**BIRDS FLYING BACKWARDS**\\n\\nBirds Flying Backwards are a London-based six-piece formed by friends and family of principal songwriter JR Sanders. Their sound is eclectic, shifting from alt-folk to droning psychedelia and left-field spiritual jazz. Following the release of Surrender to The Void, 2025 saw them exploring a more folk-oriented direction, all while further solidifying their reputation as the ‘purveyors of nostalgic, yet timeless rock reverie’ (Atwood Magazine). Their first full-length album, Lovebirds, is slated for release on 11th March 2026.\\n\\n**OF IYRN**\\n\\nOf Iyrn are a London-based band rooted in the Black Country, an industrial heartland named after the minerals once mined beneath it: coal and \\\\[iyrn\\\\]. Their warm, alternative-indie sound is influenced by “home”: a concept that transcends borders for the band as they bridge Brazilian music with English and move fluidly between languages.\\n\\n**HENRY WEBB-JENKINS**\\n\\nHenry Webb-Jenkins is a songwriter and multi-instrumentalist (pedal steel, banjo, guitar) from North London. Drawing influence from the cosmic country of the Flying Burrito Brothers to the good old rock ‘n’ roll of the Rolling Stones, HWJ and his band - Jonah Winslet (Sunken, Highschool) on drums, Adrian Woodward on guitar and Clem Appleby (Naima Bock, Sunken) - blend heartfelt lyricism with lush instrumentation and rich Americana-tinged textures, paying homage to the country genre without being confined by it.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"18+ only (photo ID required)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-19T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-24T22:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-19T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-24T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-24T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"People Person\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"131582\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Dad's Mood is Bad.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":66882,\"title\":\"Entry Requirements\",\"body\":\"Always bring ID.\",\"order\":0}],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"14448\",\"name\":\"The Elephants Head\",\"address\":\"224 Camden High Street, Camden, London, NW1 8QR, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.54071,\"lng\":-0.14392},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-elephants-head-6dd93\