722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"ica-institute-of-contemporary-arts-jvrv\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.ica.art/visit/access\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-24T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"3153\",\"name\":\"Institute of Contemporary Arts\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"institute-of-contemporary-arts-gpr2\",\"profile_active\":true},\"announcement_date_unix\":1765188000,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Raa5788aa610?dice_id=Raa5788aa610\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Xc2b3432302d?dice_id=Xc2b3432302d\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Qc82539bcc00?dice_id=Qc82539bcc00\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/De05a7b5f598?dice_id=De05a7b5f598\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/obd63e390332?dice_id=obd63e390332\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/gea32c623f46?dice_id=gea32c623f46\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"pyrrmk-in-the-round-flur-gal-go-24th-feb-ica-institute-of-contemporary-arts-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":861,\"name\":\"Institute of Contemporary Arts\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://ica.art/privacy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1771961400,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"4699078e3c3acde4:6\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1950,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-05/793e83e4-1900-4c2e-8acc-9cd00a433ad4.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1000%2C1000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-05/793e83e4-1900-4c2e-8acc-9cd00a433ad4.jpg?rect=0%2C200%2C1000%2C600\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-05/793e83e4-1900-4c2e-8acc-9cd00a433ad4.jpg?rect=225%2C0%2C550%2C1000\"},\"id\":\"6932e969ec268500011bd220\",\"name\":\"In the Round: Flur + GAL GO\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"As part of the ICA's 'In the Round' series, we present a double header featuring 2 of London's most exciting artists, Flur + GAL GO. Both will harness the venue's 360° spatial soundsystem, d&b Soundscape.\\n\\nExperimental jazz trio Flur are comprised of harpist Miriam Adefris, saxophonist Isaac Robertson, and percussionist Dillon Harrison. The trio have played in various formations over the past few years and collaborated with acclaimed artists such as Ganavya, Floating Points and Shabaka Hutchings. Their debut album Plunge was released on Paris-based label Latency earlier this year.\\n\\nGAL GO is the project of multi-instrumentalist Ignacio Salvadores, born in Buenos Aires and based in London since 2016. Described as a “burst of passion that’s mysterious and striking” \\\\[Pitchfork\\\\], Gal Go's sound is full of complexities. A key collaborator of Archy Marshall in King Krule, his effortless embrace of jazz, rock, and experimentation placed his music in a universe of its own. Singing mostly in Spanish, his native language, he seeks to connect his two worlds in a way that’s both brooding and exhilarating. Impossible to put in a box. His poetic sensibilities atop his infinite instrumentation invite you to stay a while.\\n\\nSupported by d&b audiotechnik.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-08T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-24T19:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-09T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-24T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-24T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Alessandro Asso Stefana\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"74063\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Mirror TV.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":12,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"181\",\"name\":\"SJQ\",\"address\":\"10A Bradbury Street, London N16 8JN\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.548677,\"lng\":-0.0767180999999937},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-01-14/8d708e25-8424-478d-bba7-b394578460a7.jpg?rect=899%2C0%2C3744%2C3744\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"sjq-4pqp\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://servantjazzquarters.com/#contact\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-24T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"136165\",\"name\":\"Mirror TV\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"mirror-tv-xlylk\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1764072000,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/f433dfb0c15e?dice_id=f433dfb0c15e\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r7e20624e182?dice_id=r7e20624e182\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/va4bc4e369d2?dice_id=va4bc4e369d2\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q84c68a94950?dice_id=q84c68a94950\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N2544eecf5b8?dice_id=N2544eecf5b8\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v3ee221e4fbe?dice_id=v3ee221e4fbe\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"eobvoo-alessandro-asso-stefana-24th-feb-sjq-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1771961400,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"4699078e3c3acde4:7\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1500,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-24/b75f9b1f-0d63-4054-8cb8-d9303fb715c7.jpg?rect=0%2C159%2C1191%2C1191\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-24/b75f9b1f-0d63-4054-8cb8-d9303fb715c7.jpg?rect=0%2C397%2C1191%2C715\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-24/b75f9b1f-0d63-4054-8cb8-d9303fb715c7.jpg?rect=181%2C0%2C830%2C1509\"},\"id\":\"69256fc177f3b0000190005a\",\"name\":\"Alessandro 'Asso' Stefana\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"MIRROR TV IS HAPPY TO PRESENT:\\n\\nAlessandro \\\"Asso\\\" Stefana is an Italian musician, renowned for being a brilliant guitarist, multi-instrumentalist, composer, and producer.\\n\\nDrawing inspiration from different musical genres from folk music and primitive blues to soundtracks, psychedelia, desert ballads and electronic ambient music Stefana crafted a unique blend of sounds, making his musical signature absolutely distinguishable\\n\\nThroughout his career he has been involved in numerous musical endeavors, both as a solo artist and as a collaborator. He has released several albums showcasing his skills as a guitarist and composer, earning critical acclaim for his innovative approach to music-making.\\n\\nAlessandro has collaborated with a diverse array of artists and bands, from the recording sessions with PJ HARVEY on “The Hope Six Demolition Project” (2016) and following her on the World’s tour to MIKE PATTON “Mondo cane” (2010), CALEXICO “El Mirador” (2022), MICAH P. HINSON “I lie to You” (2022), PENGUIN CAFÉ “Rain before Seven…” (2023) and many others, contributing with his signature guitar to a wide range of projects.\\n\\nWith his band GUANO PADANO, Alessandro \\\"Asso\\\" Stefana has released several applauded records featuring prominent guests such as ALESSANDRO ALESSANDRONI (the famous whistle in Ennio Morricone's soundtracks), MARC RIBOT, BILL FRISELL, and MIKE PATTON.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-25T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-24T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-29T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-24T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-24T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Georgian\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media