hments/2025-10-28/f61b35c5-d516-4ef2-a2e0-8a9d2c02e70e.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-28/f61b35c5-d516-4ef2-a2e0-8a9d2c02e70e.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"id\":\"6900ca8b6388ee000114e1c9\",\"name\":\"Wet Market + special guests\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"When members of Algiers (and ex-Bloc Party), GHUM, Hilang Child and Helen Ganya joined forces through ESEA Music, the result was Wet Market — a new left-field British-Asian rock collective blending sharp humour, defiance and thunderous sound.\\n\\nBorn from an ESEA Music writing camp and spanning roots across Thailand, Malaysia and Indonesia, Wet Market is a shapeshifting project reclaiming narratives and rewriting expectations. Their debut single ‘Red Lantern’ tackles the exoticising gaze with ferocity and wit.\\n\\nJoin Wet Market and friends from the ESEA Music community for a night of bold new sounds, solo sets and shared energy at Paper Dress Vintage. Come discover the UK’s most exciting new collective in motion.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-28T13:15:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-24T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-10-28T13:15:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-24T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-24T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Fright Years\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-02-25/3166d107-56d0-4358-9079-08800a64791f.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"115813\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true},{\"name\":\"XL Poncho\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"131270\",