t=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-13/a7ea4050-0a6b-4f5f-85f5-79cc423eef3f.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-13/a7ea4050-0a6b-4f5f-85f5-79cc423eef3f.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"id\":\"6915e666d41d1f0001fba481\",\"name\":\"Soho Calling 2026\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**ILMC Presents:**\\n\\n**SOHO CALLING**\\n\\nThe fourth edition of Soho Calling will take place on the 25th February 2026 in Soho, the beating heart of London’s music culture, and a district which has nurtured legendary artists and hosted groundbreaking performances that have shaped the global music landscape.\\n\\nHonouring this legendary district by bringing 30 exciting emerging artists to Soho's iconic stages,\\n\\nSoho Calling will take place across multiple venues incl. The 100 Club, 21Soho, Phoenix Arts Club, The Social, B.R.A.T, Anotherland, Third Man Records and beyond.\\n\\nPrevious years have seen performances from the likes of Monster Florence, The New Eves, Tom Aspaul, The Molotovs, Nxdia, Hamish Hawk, Giift - and 2026 promises to bring more incredible new music to Soho Calling's stages than ever before. sohocalling.com\\n\\nSoho Calling is returning to London Soho for its fourth edition on Wednesday 25th February 2026, bringing emerging artists to different stages across central London:\\n\\n**The full line-up for Soho Calling 2026:**\\n\\n**21 Soho - BBC Introducing**\\n\\nNight Tapes + Ashaine White + Tough Cookie + Two Man Lift\\n\\n**The Social:**\\n\\nThumper + Hunny Buzz + Yangbans + Joe Butler\\n\\n**Phoenix Arts Club:**\\n\\nRhumba Club + Baobei + Morgana\\n\\n**B.R.A.T.:**\\n\\nKURT. + Teethin + Bugbear + The Clumps\\n\\n**Anotherland:**\\n\\nBrian Nasty + AlexAbril + Claudia Isaki + Arno Sacco\\n\\n**The Blue Basement:**\\n\\nEllur + Panam + Becky Sikasa\\n\\n**The 100 Club (presented by Music Venue Trust)**\\n\\nSoapbox + Arxx + Ellis.D + Melanie Baker\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-14T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-25T14:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-14T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-25T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-25T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"drifting\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2YuySJd7C2aoBarBP8OvzR\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/50d53796fdb479b1bda16f11acd1ac4951898eb8?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"drifting\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Kikuo\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-07-10/0dc0970e-7828-4162-bbbe-1a5447ac45d5.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"91536\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Communion ONE.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":53051,\"title\":\"What's the bag policy?\",\"body\":\"Security – Bag Policy\\n\\nLarge bags – including rucksacks are not allowed.\\n\\nThere are no facilities to leave large bags or luggage.\\n\\nIf you really have to bring a bag – and it’s preferable you don’t – please make sure it’s small.\\n\\nOnly one small bag per person is permitted and it must not be bigger than A4 size.\\n\\nHeight: 28.7cm\\n\\nWidth: 21cm\\n\\nDepth 15cm\",\"order\":0}],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"934\",\"name\":\"O2 Forum Kentish Town