-4e76-9ab0-5baf3b6bdad3.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-12/d8750fac-bfa5-4e76-9ab0-5baf3b6bdad3.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"id\":\"698d8f4161f7b100016167de\",\"name\":\"HIPJOINT Jazz: The George Mooney Trio\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"We’re plunging back into our Peckham jazz speakeasy for a night of sweet sax!\\n\\nYou should know the deal by now - £4 pints, free jazz, vinyl Djs, award winning pizza and plenty of shmoozing and boozing!\\n\\nIf you caught our August instalment, you’ll remember legendary saxophonist George Mooney! This time flanked by drummer Sacha Harlan and bassist Kobe Heath Ngugi, Mr Mooney will be making his second appearance at our Jazz series and his fifth outing with HIPJOINT in total, previously joining us with vinyl DJ outfit Onde Anda… bit of George Mooney lore for ya there folks!\\n\\nDon’t go dragging, grab your free ticket now!\\n\\nSee ya there jazzniks x\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-12T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-25T22:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-12T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-25T20:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-25T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Blues Kitchen Camden.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1779\",\"name\":\"The B