\":\"Santiago Motorizado is the singer and leader of El mató a un policía motorizado, the legendary Argentine band that spearheaded the new Latin American alternative rock movement of the new century. After years of touring the world, with a discography released in several countries across America and Europe, and having performed at some of the most important international festivals such as Vive Latino, Primavera Sound, and Lollapalooza, Santiago now presents his first solo album, “El retorno”.\\n\\nNew songs for new adventures.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"Para mayores de 18 años (necesario traer DNI).\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-27T18:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-25T19:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-10-27T18:30:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-25T20:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-26T00:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Blues Kitchen Brixton.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"670\",\"name\":\"The Blues Kitchen Brixton\",\"address\":\"40 Acre Ln, London SW2 5SP\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4606163,\"lng\":-0.119256500000006},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-01-10/acde8e01-529b-4b1e-a86a-5496e18af1df.jpg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\