00\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/09401949-afa3-49da-8b8d-ac7112c27d09.jpg?rect=1900%2C0%2C2200%2C4000\"},\"id\":\"690a591043748b0001c3f2e2\",\"name\":\"PVA\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Eat Your Own Ears presents PVA at Colour Factory.\\n\\nWith their highly anticipated second album – No More Like This – out now, PVA enter an ambitious new era. Where their debut Blush was marked by frenetic electro-chaos, the follow-up is intimate, experimental, sensory and emotionally charged. It’s PVA at their most uncompromising – turning raw sensation into sonic alchemy.\\n\\nSupport from Silver Gore\\n\\nAge limit 18+\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-05T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-26T17:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-07T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-26T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-26T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Bad Dad\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/12tzUisHWGTVrz5g2Hudz9\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/309f3dcf05558779da8d273eb940c6057675c4e0?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Bad Dad\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Lexi Berg \",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-09-06/2714243f-9e22-441f-b592-da5401cf0b14.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"32333\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Satre\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-02-10/96d6318d-3b6d-48ec-878c-d112b0f35ea1.jpg?rect=0%2C53%2C534%2C534\"},\"artist_id\":\"582