n Small Pipes or Celtic Harp.\\n\\nWe aim to uphold the traditions of this community by welcoming all to come and enjoy the spirit of these tunes. If you fancy, bring a fiddle!\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-22T09:45:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-26T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-22T11:30:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-26T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-26T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"The Rizz  \",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-01-13/3067883c-4514-4926-8455-89a0bfe669a5.jpg?rect=0%2C54%2C532%2C532\"},\"artist_id\":\"59302\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Sweet Unrest\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-02-29/2ebdc134-fd24-45c6-adb1-b123f0bde475.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"80307\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by What Does Not.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":71079,\"title\":\"T&Cs\",\"body\":\"By booking tickets to this event you agree to our Terms and Conditions as outline here: https://whatdoesnot.com/wdn-events-terms-and-conditions/\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":71695,\"title\":\"Is the venue wheelchair accessible?\",\"body\":\"Yes, the space where the event is happening is wheelchair accessible. If you have any other accessibility questions, please get in touch.\",\"order\":1}],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\"