sonal assistant tickets have been assigned. We will not be able to accommodate any more requests. We apologise for any inconvenience this may cause.\\n\\nhttps://support.dice.fm/article/179-accessibilty-tickets-for-islington-assembly-hall\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":31976,\"title\":\"Stage Times \",\"body\":\"Stage times are posted at 11am on the day of the show on our venue website.\",\"order\":1}],\"max_tickets\":8,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"34\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"address\":\"Upper Street, London N1 2UD\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5395894,\"lng\":-0.102482699999996},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-02-10/05562e9c-c684-4beb-b818-4e908bbfb14d.jpg?rect=712%2C0%2C2832%2C2832\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-z8e2\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/about/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-26T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1607\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-78g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1758099600,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/d4be2211a3a7?dice_id=d4be2211a3a7\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F69abf6ffc36?dice_id=F69abf6ffc36\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Jba48c9cccb8?dice_id=Jba48c9cccb8\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/t71b8e05f415?dice_id=t71b8e05f415\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/l324e9c15f0b?dice_id=l324e9c15f0b\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Od080f292ae5?dice_id=Od080f292ae5\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"eoaq7o-courtney-marie-andrews-26th-feb-islington-assembly-hall-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":false,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/legal-information/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"679202632593023\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-980124-39\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":338,\"name\":\"FORM Presents\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://formpresents.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"502219323814680\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1772132400,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"impression_id\":\"4699078e3c3acde4:84\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3066},\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-17/8ea5d9f0-752b-4152-99f8-519e4cdc5701.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C800%2C800\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-17/8ea5d9f0-752b-4152-99f8-519e4cdc5701.jpg?rect=0%2C160%2C800%2C480\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-17/8ea5d9f0-752b-4152-99f8-519e4cdc5701.jpg?rect=180%2C0%2C440%2C800\"},\"id\":\"68c280c6d51c7a0001a5ebfa\",\"name\":\"Courtney Marie Andrews\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Andrews is, and has always been, unafraid to say the thing. Her songs are challenging but compassionate, they welcome us in but push us to venture out. From her very first recordings, to her 2016’s breakthrough Honest Life, to 2020’s Grammy- nominated Old Flowers and her most recent Loose Future, Andrews has been celebrated as an artist who challenges herself, and who finds new interplays of Folk and Americana. “As a songwriter you can make the same record over and over again,” Andrews says, “and I’m not interested in that. I make records to stand alone and stand apart from each other.”\\n\\n*By purchasing a ticket to this event you are agreeing to adhere to Islington Assembly Hall's terms and conditions: https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/customer-terms-conditions-2022/*\\n\\n*All tickets to shows at Islington Assembly Hall are subject to a Venue Levy of £1.50 + VAT. As a Grade II listed building, this levy will be reinvested into Islington Assembly Hall and its services, meaning the customer experience can continue to be enhanced.*\\n\\nThis is a 16+ event – you may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-09-17T10:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-26T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-09-19T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-26T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-26T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"If I Told\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2Ckv1DTVTt5UPdnWutOO7h\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/84834ff9a66a3d99cff6dd104717b2ace014c7b8?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"If I Told\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Courtney Marie Andrews - Old Flowers\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/gb/album/old-flowers/1497576634?i=1497576809&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Courtney Marie Andrews\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview114/v4/43/82/1e/43821e21-aa10-8c3a-e12b-06885bb9a434/mzaf_9945120533681098264.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Old Flowers\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Sorry\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-09-26/14c8ccbc-a707-4240-b543-02927dfde9b0.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"6012\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Sorry is two best friends from north London with a wildly eclectic but aligned taste in music. They began making their own music in their teens, trying their hands at guitar work and beatmaking in tandem. Their hybridised sound made them a fixture in London’s club scene, while also satiating those with an appetite for trip-hop, indie, alt-rock and trap. Sorry’s mercurial sound caught the attention of Domino Records who paired them with Gorrilaz producer James Dring for 2020 debut, 925, which encapsulated their essence perfectly – a coherent catasrophe of myriad genres and colours.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Metropolis Music.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"6559\",\"name\":\"HERE at Outernet\",\"addr