s to you 🎶\\n\\nPlus, it's free entry! No registration is required just come along and enjoy.\\n\\n📅 Friday 27 February\\n\\n📍 Metric, Imperial College Union\\n\\n🕕 7pm - 11pm\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-09T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-27T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-09T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-27T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-27T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"6992f3757e78bc00012d46e8\",\"name\":\"Live Music: Indie Night\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-16/ba2a8b93-a9e9-4373-b7c6-1d923d51d5ab.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1600%2C1600\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-16/ba2a8b93-a9e9-4373-b7c6-1d923d51d5ab.jpg?rect=0%2C320%2C1600%2C960\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-16/ba2a8b93-a9e9-4373-b7c6-1d923d51d5ab.jpg?rect=360%2C0%2C880%2C1600\"},\"marketeers\":[],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1770638400,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T87bb1d42b52?dice_id=T87bb1d42b52\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K62b761b26de?dice_id=K62b761b26de\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Fb7a9ada12f6?dice_id=Fb7a9ada12f6\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h413bf078709?dice_id=h413bf078709\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T9026e752069?dice_id=T9026e752069\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k62569c0ff72?dice_id=k62569c0ff72\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1200,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Morocco Bound.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"faqs\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"14196\",\"name\":\"Morocco Bound\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"morocco-bound-6d3nb\",\"profile_active\":false},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"5376gy-lex-vervain-cat-factory-luce-rushton-27th-feb-morocco-bound-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1772218800,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"049f414030f6e5e4:30\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"13583\",\"name\":\"Morocco Bound\",\"address\":\"1a Morocco Street, Southwark, London, SE1 3HB, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.50033,\"lng\":-0.082},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"morocco-bound-wnln\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-27T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Lex Vervain\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebbecf9a2082d6e60d7f0d876d\"},\"artist_id\":\"125610\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Lex Vervain**\\n\\nLex Vervain, new-town troubadour, singer, songwriter and guitarist operates out of SE London. His music is in tune with the Elliott Smith/Bedouine/Alex G alt camp, sharp words and serious tunes, songs that come from a small world caught up in the metropolis. Loves and fallouts, anger and shame, coffee cups and busted records, stories that are Townes tender and troubled.\\n\\nLex moved up to London from Crawley new town some seven years ago and has been making music in the city ever since. He currently plays keys in Ellie Bleach’s band and previously did the same in Tenderhost. Active in the bustling South London indie scene he often backs Luce Rushton at her shows and has also featured in Alice Western’s Glass Eel collective.\\n\\n**Cat Factory**\\n\\n  \\nCat Factory are a four-piece making evocative indie rock. Their sound is grounded in the slacker, power-pop eras of early indie, but kept freshly absurd with the influence of modern London scenes like crankwave and the jangle pop resurgence.\\n\\nThe songs are a blend of DIY, earnest songwriting with a frenetic, restless urgency that leaves no two tunes sounding alike.\\n\\n**Luce Rushton**\\n\\nLuce Rushton's country edged fingerstyle guitar accompanies raw journalistic and figurative songwriting. Following acclaim from the debut EP 'Slinky', Luce Rushton brings brand new tracks from an upcoming EP.\\n\\nClash Magazine - \\\"These songs have a revelatory quality, with personal truths being finely tuned across some keening melodies.\\\"\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-26T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-27T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-26T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-27T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-27T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"697776c0020ddf00014b71ff\",\"name\":\"Lex Vervain, Cat Factory, Luce Rushton\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/3dcfe491-a7f7-4362-8de3-1d8301426303.jpg?rect=274%2C0%2C1072%2C1072\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/3dcfe491-a7f7-4362-8de3-1d8301426303.jpg?rect=0%2C50%2C1620%2C972\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/3dcfe491-a7f7-4362-8de3-1d8301426303.jpg?rect=515%2C0%2C590%2C1072\"},\"marketeers\":[],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1769385600,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/I7c7e10a9c96?dice_id=I7c7e10a9c96\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W7da1afd1632?dice_id=W7da1afd1632\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/G0ebdf95a625?dice_id=G0ebdf95a625\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T07950a6b236?dice_id=T07950a6b236\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Tafa60decec0?dice_id=Tafa60decec0\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/iadfd8ea1d66?dice_id=iadfd8ea1d66\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1100,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by VOYA\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"faqs\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"6690\",\"name\":\"A Love Parasite LLP\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"a-love-parasite-llp-9p67\",\"profile_active\":true},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"92wd76-st-davids-day-with-voya-twst-live-27th-feb-the-waiting-room-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1772218800,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"049f414030f6e5e4:31\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"41\",\"name\":\"The Waiting Room\",\"address\":\"175 Stoke Newington High Street, London N16 0LH\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5620818,\"lng\":-0.0738883999999871},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-waiting-room-jxea\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-27T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"VOYA\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-06-26/77e84421-0b50-47a7-b0c8-cd5751df8fc3.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"123412\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Dydd Gŵyl Dewi gyda VOYA / St David’s Day with VOYA\\n\\nCelebrate Wales and its rich musical heritage this St David’s Day at The Waiting Room on Friday 27 February. Join us for an evening showcasing the best of contemporary Welsh music, featuring a live performance from VOYA, alongside another exciting emerging artists from Wales. The night will be beautifully hosted by Welsh darling Molly Palmer, bringing everything together in true Dydd Gŵyl Dewi passion.\\n\\nVOYA are a Cardiff based duo, Linford Hydes and Eddie Al-Shakarchi, blending the emotive songwriting and rich production of early 80s British synth pop with a dark, modern electronic edge. Their sound merges stylish new wave energy with cinematic depth, creating performances that are both powerful and immersive.\\n\\nCymorth I’w Gyhoeddi / Support TBA…\\n\\nThis evening’s performances are hosted by the effervescent Welsh DJ, TV personality, and BBC Radio Wales presenter: Molly Palmer. A regular DJ at Cardiff’s Clwb Ifor Bach, she will round off the night with an energetic DJ set featuring 80s, New Wave, Indie, Disco classics.\\n\\nSupport from twst\\n\\nBorn in Barry, Wales, twst (she/they) spent their early years working in their dad’s chicken factory. At 14, they left home and school, relocating to a studio in the South Wales Valleys. There, they immersed themselves in internet culture and taught themselves production, laying the foundation for their sound.\\n\\nThousands of bedroom producers mimic the sounds of mainstream pop, but few actually pull off its heart-stopping sense of scale. twst is one of them - Laura Snapes, The Guardian\\n\\nCymru am Byth / Wales forever\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-14T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-27T18:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-14T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-27T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-27T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"69662eb0ba3b420001c1eca0\",\"name\":\"St David’s Day with VOYA + twst (live)\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-13/5891217b-4aa4-4ddf-9b0a-a0802f3d05e2.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-13/5891217b-4aa4-4ddf-9b0a-a0802f3d05e2.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-13/5891217b-4aa4-4ddf-9b0a-a0802f3d05e2.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"marketeers\":[],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1768384800,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y0c790783c80?dice_id=y0c790783c80\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/jc2d735270b7?dice_id=jc2d735270b7\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ia3d5bf8aefe?dice_id=ia3d5bf8aefe\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/l342d34a584e?dice_id=l342d34a584e\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/eebf5f608a7d?dice_id=eebf5f608a7d\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x63480fdb987?dice_id=x63480fdb987\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1250,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Success Express Music\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"faqs\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"5755\",\"name\":\"Success Express\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"success-express-7a9b\",\"profile_active\":true},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"k6a3g8-unspun-sessions-ft-izzy-pinchen-lilla-shy-27th-feb-piano-smithfield-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1772218800,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"049f414030f6e5e4:32\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"5071\",\"name\":\"Piano Smithfield\",\"address\":\"14 Long Ln, Barbican, London EC1A 9PN, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5197837,\"lng\":-0.0989723},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"piano-smithfield-oxa5\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-27T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Lilla Shy\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-04-11/3498b364-eefe-4d17-9ea3-3437f2506d8f.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"119125\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Riley Marsh\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-12/6b6bbd8a-9d3e-481a-a79a-15920eeb9b6f.jpg?rect=0%2C53%2C534%2C534\"},\"artist_id\":\"132293\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Emilia Anastazja\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb7db4e525256b7499cbc87b4e\"},\"artist_id\":\"64836\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Join us for ***Unspun Sessions*** - our monthly discovery showcase with FIVE fabulous artists, three brand new to us.\\n\\nBrighton-born singer-songwriter **Izzy Pinchen**'s whose music sits at the intersection of soulful storytelling and bold, modern pop. Drawing inspiration from icons like Madonna, Charlie XCX, Rihanna for her emotional intensity, and Eminem for his sharp flow and delivery, Izzy crafts songs that cut through with both vulnerability and power.\\n\\nKnown for her rich, emotive voice and genre-blending sound, **Emilia Anastazja** creates music that feels timeless and real, drawing inspiration from Sade, Joni Mitchell, Cleo Sol, Erykah Badu and more. Her newest EP Everything I Want was praised by EARMILK and named Jazz FM’s Song of the Week.\\n\\nDerby based teenage artist **Riley Marsh** delivers everything from 90s Alt Rock, to Grunge and Folk. His live performances are passionate, energetic and raw.\\n\\n“I was quite shocked at just how good he was” - Rock News Magazine\\n\\n**Lilla Shy** is a London based singer, songwriter and producer. Her self-produced debut album “Layers” gained support from John Kennedy at Radio X, BBC Introducing and and BBC5Live, plus multiple Spotify and Apple editorial playlists.London-based singer-songwriter\\n\\n**Cosima Suzanne** is already making waves with her soulful, acoustic sound, bending pop, RnB and soul,. With a stripped-back intimacy, her music is both emotionally charged and effortlessly expressive.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-06T14:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-27T18:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-06T14:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-27T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-27T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"69650faab3cedd0001372a76\",\"name\":\"Unspun Sessions ft Izzy Pinchen, Lilla Shy\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-12/3ec1ff9d-69b6-4b47-a3c0-2e609b94909e.jpg?rect=1000%2C0%2C4000%2C4000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-12/3ec1ff9d-69b6-4b47-a3c0-2e609b94909e.jpg?rect=0%2C200%2C6000%2C3600\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-12/3ec1ff9d-69b6-4b47-a3c0-2e609b94909e.jpg?rect=1900%2C0%2C2200%2C4000\"},\"marketeers\":[],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1767708000,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/vd5b1deccf6e?dice_id=vd5b1deccf6e\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dic