age, delivering razor-sharp bars and a live energy that has defined UK hip hop for decades.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-13T11:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-27T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-13T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-27T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-27T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"6915b105b7d1cf0001300288\",\"name\":\"Verb T\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-13/7a4adbeb-80aa-4978-9c04-c93f3f483813.jpg?rect=126%2C456%2C2388%2C2389\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-13/7a4adbeb-80aa-4978-9c04-c93f3f483813.jpg?rect=0%2C1020%2C2695%2C1617\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-13/7a4adbeb-80aa-4978-9c04-c93f3f483813.jpg?rect=342%2C0%2C2011%2C3656\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":380,\"name\":\"Columbo Music\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://thecolumbogroup.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"298700384025189\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1763031600,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Rd0ec69e68e4?dice_id=Rd0ec69e68e4\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Lb57265cb073?dice_id=Lb57265cb073\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dic