ojockey-dates-for-an-honest-mind-27th-feb-the-cavendish-arms-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1772220600,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"049f414030f6e5e4:48\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"2706\",\"name\":\"The Cavendish Arms\",\"address\":\"128 Hartington Rd, London SW8 2HJ, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4764913,\"lng\":-0.1277182000000039},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-cavendish-arms-59rl\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.thecav.uk/about-us\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-27T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Dates for an Honest Mind\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"132626\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Bojockey \",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-06-07/19364a7c-d433-41a8-8ac7-68457e37c10b.jpg?rect=528%2C0%2C2400%2C2400\"},\"artist_id\":\"59121\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Natalie Evans\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb7467401fd306c2bfbbd1587b\"},\"artist_id\":\"9657\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Bojockey \",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-06-07/19364a7c-d433-41a8-8ac7-68457e37c10b.jpg?rect=528%2C0%2C2400%2C2400\"},\"artist_id\":\"59121\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":4,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"*The Cav Presents Natalie Evans, Bojockey and Dates For An Honest Mind*\\n\\n**NATALIE EVANS** is a singer-songwriter from London, with a fairy-like sound encompassing alt-folk, pop and jazz, and songs written on harp, piano and guitar. https://linktr.ee/nataliehevans @nataliehevans\\n\\n**BOJOCKEY** are the perfect accompaniment to darkening nights. They started as a band in 2022, and the five piece indie folk outfit have already gained recognitions from Matt Wilkinson (Apple Music), Loud and Quiet and The Independent.\\n\\nWith the released their self titled debut album (via Tiny Pocket) in October 2023, the group have immediately developed a special sound; distinctly homely and ambient, high and low - Giles Bidder (101 Part-time jobs)\\n\\n*listen here https://linktr.ee/Bojockey*\\n\\n**Dates For An Honest Mind** is the new dreamfolk project of Courtney McMahon (also of Ruby Doomsday, We Lost Alice). 'Serenades for dream boats and terrible people'. Listen to their first demo 'Divas' here *https://linktr.ee/dates4anhonestmind*\\n\\n*💙 The Cavendish Arms is an accessible and inclusive venue with step free access and gender neutral toilets.*\\n\\nno one turned away for lack of funds\\n\\n\\\\*MAYSHE-MAYSHE unfortunately had to pull out of this line up, please contact music@thecav.uk for any queries.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-20T18:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-27T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-20T18:30:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-27T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-27T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"696fc809688ab00001d5e0b3\",\"name\":\"Natalie Evans/ Bojockey/ Dates for an Honest Mind\",\"