-07/94ee93c8-9fa3-48b9-ae67-0215c3e3b070.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"real-vxyd\",\"profile_active\":true},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"2we967-black-bordello-single-launch-show-27th-feb-the-100-club-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1772220600,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"049f414030f6e5e4:52\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"66\",\"name\":\"The 100 Club\",\"address\":\"100 Oxford St, Fitzrovia, London W1D 1LL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5161551,\"lng\":-0.1353063999999904},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/35e8f238-d827-4132-8534-bc474249d988.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C500%2C500\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-100-club-z997\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.the100club.co.uk/access-info/#:~:text=The%20100%20Club%20is%20an,disabled%20customers%20to%20the%20venue.&text=There%20is%20level%20access%20from,or%20a%20lift%20on%20site.\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-27T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Export Import\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-07-29/d49c8851-842d-4beb-8f68-bc8491b7c6a7.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"125004\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Swallowtail\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-26/fb8f8256-53ea-4d8d-be25-8f608e79eaab.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2721%2C2721\"},\"artist_id\":\"101346\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Black Bordello\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-03/c4d6196f-4bf3-4284-bee4-f6315401379d.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C500%2C500\"},\"artist_id\":\"16840\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"***Black Bordello -*** Black Bordello are an art-rock band from London, fronted by Sienna Bordello, whose emotive soprano and macabre vocals and lyricism have been likened to Kate Bush/ Siousxie, with their theatrical and genre-defying live proposition akin to The Last Dinner Party meets PJ Harvey. Their metamorphic brand of alternative rock is also enchanted with vaudeville, post-punk, psychedelia and gothic rock.\\n\\n**Swallowtail** - Brighton-based four-piece, fusing trip-hop intricacies with industrial noise-rock. Infallibly immersive live performances drive this further, supporting the likes of Miki Bereyni (Lush), bdrmm and Bloodworm, playing standout festivals and a string of highly anticipated shows across the country.\\n\\n**Export Import** - Export Import, a 10-piece ensemble from Canning Town, has carved out a peculiar niche in London’s underground music scene. Known for hosting “Life Passage Ceremonies” such as weddings, funerals, baptisms, and exorcisms, the group performs at venues like Venue MOT, Colour Factory, and The Windmill, as well as unannounced appearances on London’s streets.\\n\\n***Artists:*** We are always interested in hearing from talented artists. If you’d like to play at our future events, please get in touch.\\n\\n***Note: 18+ ID required.*** These events frequently sell out so we recommend buying tickets in advance.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-20T10:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"