url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-27T21:45:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Demae\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb260c2e8950569256b8483d2e\"},\"artist_id\":\"26003\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Goya Gumbani\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-04-15/7d87d785-966a-456c-910e-49288d93039b.jpg?rect=0%2C10%2C620%2C620\"},\"artist_id\":\"29608\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Parismatiq\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"133674\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Social Records Society \",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"133675\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":4,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"After Midnight\\n\\nLate Night Luxury for the musically curious\\n\\nAfter Midnight returns on the 27th February with a typically luscious line-up of DJs and late night live music for folks that want to embrace something a little different.\\n\\nAs usual the music policy is eclectic but always curated and played with love and purpose. Goya Gumbani is your host and he will be performing new music live on stage. Ri Mistry & Soph from Social Records Society will be bringing their vinyl heat fresh from the streets of Salvadore Carnival. We are very lucky to welcome sultry songstress Demae playing her new EP Deep Dive live and Parismatiq is here to bring his immaculate house party vibes.\\n\\nLock Warehouse (ex Oval Space) is a spacious loft nestled in the back streets of Hackney which will be lovingly set designed by the Mam Sham team. Thanks to Asahi Super Dry 0.0% for all the support and delicious beers.\\n\\nAll proceeds go towards Praxis a uk charity supporting migrants with legal aid.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":n