ndary La Folie Douce to bring the ultimate Après Ski Party to the London skyline on Saturday 28th February.\\n\\nWe’re welcoming some of La Folie Douce’s iconic performers to bring their renowned energy to the London skyline. Think alpine glamour means skyline soiree... With no ski pass required.\\n\\nWe have partnered with Grey Goose Vodka to celebrate the occasion, so expect ice cold martinis and an epic line-up of day to night entertainment.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-10T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T13:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-11T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-28T15:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T23:45:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"698cc83f1715d700011f1ee7\",\"name\":\"La Folie Douce \",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/279927be-df02-47b0-9254-8e91e6f2fc88.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C768%2C768\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/279927be-df02-47b0-9254-8e91e6f2fc88.jpg?rect=0%2C154%2C768%2C461\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/279927be-df02-47b0-9254-8e91e6f2fc88.jpg?rect=173%2C0%2C422%2C768\"},\"marketeers\":[],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1770750000,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/kfd47356001d?dice_id=kfd47356001d\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/me1c7253d9ce?dice_id=me1c7253d9ce\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/mfa99138cd5f?dice_id=mfa99138cd5f\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K2d63d48f37c?dice_id=