s\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"London we return to Boxpark Wembley in February 2026 after our sell out November show! Get ready for a massive 90s & 00s R&B Festival coming February 2026! We have an INSANE event planned with lots of glitter, glam & confetti join us as we debut at one of the most famous venues in the city - Box Park Wembley\\n\\nMUSIC\\n\\nExpect to hear music from:\\n\\nDESTINY'S CHILD / ASHANTI / JA RULE / USHER / LUDACRIS / MS LAURYN HILL / TLC / CIARA / NELLY / NE-Y0 / TREY SONGZ / GINUWINE / BRANDY / MONICA / EVE / SEAN PAUL / MISSY ELLIOT / FAT JOE / CASSIE / TWISTA / MASE / MYA / NEXT / 112 / MARIO / DONNELL JONES / AMERIE / KELIS / MARIAH CAREY / YING YANG TWINS / PRETTY RICKY / JOE / DRU HILL / JODECI / TWEET / LLOYD / JON B / KEVIN LYTTLE\\n\\nEXPECT 👇\\n\\n\\\\- 6 hours of Old School 90s & 00's RnB Anthems\\n\\n\\\\- Live Performers & Hosts\\n\\n\\\\- Venue Decor\\n\\n\\\\- Festival Production\\n\\n\\\\- Confetti Showers\\n\\n\\\\- Glitter Stations\\n\\n\\\\- Massive Giveaways\\n\\n\\\\- State of the art sound system\\n\\n\\\\- VIP Area\\n\\n⚠️ This event will SELL OUT! ⚠️\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-09-04T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-09-04T17:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-28T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"6925d2ac76549400010f1f35\",\"name\":\"R&B Lovers - Saturday 28th February - Boxpark \",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-25/e98ee530-4b92-4cd5-b553-072d613268bd.jpg?rect=0%2C120%2C960%2C960\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-25/e