12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"electric-ballroom-j78v\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://electricballroom.co.uk/disabled-access/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-28T18:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Slippery People Presents\\n\\nSTOP MAKING SENSE LIVE\\n\\nOn 19th October 1984 Talking Heads and Jonathan Demme released the greatest concert movie of all time.\\n\\nOn Friday 10th April 2026 Slippery People will recreate ‘Stop Making Sense’ live on stage at Albert Hall in the city of Manchester.\\n\\nThis follows on from their incredible debut at Gorilla that sold out in a matter of weeks – expect pulsating basslines, big suits, wild synths and some extra special surprises.\\n\\nThe band of 10 members will play all of the Talking Heads songs featured in the film. From ‘Psycho Killer’ to ‘Burning Down The House’ to ‘Once In A Lietime’ and everything in between.\\n\\nThey have a tape they’d like to play for you. And everyone is getting involved.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ (Under 16s must be accompanied by an adult 18+).\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-08-06T10:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-27T16:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-08-08T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-28T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"68909a057279770001e6869a\",\"name\":\"STOP MAKING SENSE LIVE \",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-08/b5b0518a