n-again-concerts-pv68\",\"profile_active\":true},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"g5d6db-cryptic-shift-28th-feb-downstairs-at-the-dome-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1772305200,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"049f414030f6e5e4:80\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"24\",\"name\":\"Downstairs at the Dome\",\"address\":\"178 Junction Rd, London N19 5QQ\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.558121,\"lng\":-0.138236099999972},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"downstairs-at-the-dome-z6d3\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://domelondon.co.uk/faq\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-28T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-02-28T23:00:00+00:00\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Desolator\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"80572\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Unburier\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"98212\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Mithras\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebd2967dc89858705eca8bcd10\"},\"artist_id\":\"64205\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Cryptic Shift\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab67616d0000b27381402b3b94fa2afcd767cc3a\"},\"artist_id\":\"53207\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":4,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Whilst not commonly known as an extraterrestrial hotspot, Leeds faced an encounter of another kind, as 2015 saw Xander Bradley and Ryan Sheperson set out to accomplish a project embodying their joint passion for the art of science fiction and heavy metal music. With CRYPTIC SHIFT taking form as a crossover between the worlds of Technical Thrash / Death Metal and all things Sci-Fi, the two set out to spread their influence across the UK, and soon venturing across the globe. After steady lineup refinement, the pair finally found themselves other like-minded musicians within the UK scene.\\n\\n'Overspace & Supertime' sets out to blast away Extreme Metal fans with a new standard of Technical Thrash/Death Metal showmanship, including returning influences of progressive writing, harmonised with their fantastical storytelling. \\\"The concept of Overspace & Supertime plays as an alternative reality to the happenings of Visitations from Enceladus, taking our character into new dimensions filled with both greater adventures and more bizarre encounters\\\" states drummer Ryan Sheperson, \\\"whilst the concept themes of our sci-fi tale has grown, so have our efforts in synthesising it with the ultimate Astrodeath soundscape. The record sets out to achieve a new standard of musicianship across the band and takes the listener on a deeper journey through the fusion of our influences in the Thrash/Death Metal style.\\n\\nOverspace & Supertime', coming to Earth on February 27th 2026 via Metal Blade Records.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 14+ Event Under 18s to be accompanied by an adult\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-16T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-16T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-28T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null