e\":\"Jowee Omicil\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"116101\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Musical polyglot, Jowee Omicil aka Mr. BasH! is heading to Brixton🛬🎷\\n\\nDrawing from spiritual traditions, urban music, and popular culture, Jowee developed a boundary-defying approach to music that is alive, raw, and deeply authentic. He channels music through his whole being, wielding saxophones, clarinets, trumpets, Rhodes, piano, flutes, and whatever the moment demands.\\n\\nJowee moves fluently across instruments, ideas, and cultures — a vision that continues to define his work today.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-15T15:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T21:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-15T15:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-28T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"6968ec9f2971ef000117a71e\",\"name\":\"Jowee Omicil\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-15/17184b42-000c-4292-b9fa-1a45b6c41699.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-15/17184b42-000c-4292-b9fa-1a45b6c41699.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-15/17184b42-000c-4292-b9fa-1a45b6c41699.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":495,\"name\":\"Hootananny Brixton\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://hootanannybrixton.co.uk/terms-conditions/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"284708469113050\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":\"CALJTQBC77UCMC06OO60\",\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixe