ons like Janis Joplin, Tina Turner and Aretha Franklin while standing alongside contemporaries such as Brittany Howard, Michael Kiwanuka and Celeste, Jackaman bridges timeless soul with a modern twist. In February 2026, she embarks on a UK headline tour, igniting the stage with the full fire of her band.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ (under 16s to be accompanied by an adult)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-09-24T12:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-27T15:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-09-26T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-28T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"68d3d37949c3a80001f2dcc9\",\"name\":\"Lynne Jackaman\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-24/d098d0d9-f0f1-4035-9fdd-87ff0dfabc5d.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1024%2C1024\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-24/d098d0d9-f0f1-4035-9fdd-87ff0dfabc5d.jpg?rect=0%2C205%2C1024%2C614\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-24/d098d0d9-f0f1-4035-9fdd-87ff0dfabc5d.jpg?rect=231%2C0%2C563%2C1024\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1201,\"name\":\"DHP Family\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.dhpfamily.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1758711600,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"eve