.466083,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-r7wq\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.hotboxlive.co.uk/accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-28T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Carpark\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-03-31/8b31a5ee-770b-4ab4-b795-9cd81f3976ea.jpg?rect=0%2C135%2C1080%2C1080\"},\"artist_id\":\"46691\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"The Howlers\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-30/3523e3cc-3752-4e94-9f0d-79fd60a436f3.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C3000%2C3000\"},\"artist_id\":\"15924\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"“The Howlers take you on a hellish ride both emotional and catchy” - ***Rolling Stone***\\n\\n“How can we not foresee a bright future taking flight with their debut album” - ***Classic Rock 8/10\\\\****\\n\\n“Ambition, brutal honesty and ferocity the word’s out, The Howlers are ones to watch” - ***The Line of Best Fit***\\n\\n“A Desert Rock Tinged Gem well on their way to creating their own niche” - ***Daily Express 4/5\\\\****\\n\\nFollowing the independent success of their debut album in 2024 which saw the band claim a Top 15 Official Chart Position and a subsequent sold out 17 date UK Tour, The Howlers return on the eve of their debut European tour with bold new single ‘Night Crawling’ and the announcement of their biggest UK shows at Scala in London & Gorilla in Manchester, Working alongside longtime collaborators Black Honey, Night Crawling is a bold, sultry and seductive step forward for a band not afraid of new beginnings.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\"