:\"https://link.dice.fm/a19a3cddc99a?dice_id=a19a3cddc99a\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/f35644c16421?dice_id=f35644c16421\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"e044e34315b96a4b:3\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Too Bright to See. \",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1769598000,\"id\":\"6979f7972991e50001fc56be\",\"name\":\"2b2c: Tommy Barlow / TV / maiden + otta & Doberman\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Too Bright to See Presents:\\n\\n\\\\- **Tommy Barlow** grew up in a very musical household in Cambridge on a steady diet of traditional folk artists such as Flook and Michael McGoldrick. He subsequently moved to London to attend Guildhall where he studied Electronic Music . His music uses field recordings, guitars, strings, samples, his unique voice and sometimes bagpipes. His influences range from Bon Iver and Steve Reich to Mount Kimbie and James Blake.\\n\\nHis self-released mixtape from 2024 Mustard Seeds offered a window into his process and lead to Tommy being a regular at London venues such as The George Tavern, Shacklewell Arms and Spanners. He has played with bands such as Chanel Beads, RIP Magic, Ebbb and Quade (AD93).\\n\\n(https://www.instagram.com/t.barlo/)\\n\\n\\\\- **TV** is a 3 piece band from London. The songs are intimate and heavy, with samples and synths infused with guitars.\\n\\n(https://www.instagram.com/tv__2021/)\\n\\n\\\\- **Maiden** are a London based 4 piece, their work delicately balances searching reflection and forward-thinking experimentation. Elements of avant-pop, dream-pop are abstracted through gothy atmospheres and reimagined through unsettled cityscapes.\\n\\n(https://www.instagram.com/_maiden____/)\\n\\n\\\\- **otta** (*late set*): warped pop experiments\\n\\n(https://www.instagram.com/otta.ottr/)\\n\\n\\\\- **Doberman** (*late set*): electronic rave-punk\\n\\n\\\\+ **benvolio** djs\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2617\",\"name\":\"The George Tavern\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-george-tavern-xwke\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772307000,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1200,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-27T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-27T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-28T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T23:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"rynd5q-resonance-fundraiser-signature-dish-28th-feb-iklectik-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"the plum\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1jsyhWUR1QlU2i3h3sVXRP\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/91653ff919d152260ae2cc727f478ec116b3e81c?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"the plum\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Weaving In Purgatory\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"104318\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Angela wai Nok Hui\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb81855af8d82e6f3918f3f14a\"},\"artist_id\":\"88974\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Kate Carr\",\"