"name\":\"Live bands + DJs 'til late\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":true,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Every Saturday, the world-famous Blues Kitchen house band hit the stage for three blistering live sets with DJs playing soulful bangers from 9pm until 3am.\\n\\n£6 tickets are limited and come off sale 24 hours before the event. £10 tickets will be available all night, or you can pay the same amount on the door. We advise purchasing your tickets in advance to avoid queues.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1995\",\"name\":\"The Blues Kitchen Shoreditch\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-blues-kitchen-shoreditch-oyry\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772308800,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1100,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-03T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T22:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-03T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-28T20:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-01T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":true,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"k6novo-las-forasteritas-28th-feb-the-jago-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Las Forasteritas - Soy Peregrina\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0iBjLQz6EEgZfEv6XvVFGU\",\"artist\":\"Las Forasteritas\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/1b488064b83ddd13941598fe2567eedcab4cc6ad?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Soy Peregrina\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Las Forasteritas - Soy Peregrina\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/soy-peregrina/1773188997?i=1773188998&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Las Forasteritas\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/44/d5/04/44d5042b-4dc4-c904-8236-8f91c36cd6a4/mzaf_15938456662341772061.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Soy Peregrina\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"457\",\"name\":\"The Jago\",\"address\":\"440 Kingsland Road, Hackney, London, E8 4AA, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.541884,\"lng\":-0.076346},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-jago-4pby\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.thejagodalston.com/access/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-28T20:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-03/c0d2f285-ced5-46d0-bfe3-8717d2c6eda4.jpg?rect=588%2C0%2C3648%2C3648\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-03/c0d2f285-ced5-46d0-bfe3-8717d2c6eda4.jpg?rect=0%2C377%2C4823%2C2894\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-03/c0d2f285-ced5-46d0-bfe3-8717d2c6eda4.jpg?rect=1409%2C0%2C2006%2C3648\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ud97f9ce6fca?dice_id=Ud97f9ce6fca\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/nad7c64986d4?dice_id=nad7c64986d4\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/sf15f02d36c2?dice_id=sf15f02d36c2\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m66a6ce03789?dice_id=m66a6ce03789\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h3a0f2a0e416?dice_id=h3a0f2a0e416\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n666e2e8f56a?dice_id=n666e2e8f56a\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"e044e34315b96a4b:11\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Movimientos.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1764781200,\"id\":\"69306b88d3e57e00010c1883\",\"name\":\"Las Forasteritas\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Migration, music and collective joy are crossing borders once again. Las Forasteritas, a diverse and migrant Andean music ensemble, arrive in the United Kingdom for the very first time to light up the iconic The Jago. Blending huayno, festive Andean rhythms and a contemporary urban edge, Las Forasteritas have carved out a space where celebration becomes resistance. Their live set brings together vocals, zapateo footwork and migrant storytelling to push boundaries and open doors for new diasporic voices across Europe.\\n\\nHere, resistance is danced. Memory is sung.\\n\\nFormed in Barcelona, the band has performed in renowned venues across Spain and toured in countries such as France and Austria, carrying with them a vibrant aesthetic, explosive energy and a message rooted in the lived experience of Andean diasporas: Andean music is alive, evolving, and reimagined from afar.\\n\\nAfter releasing their debut EP Huaynos Migrantes, Las Forasteritas are now entering a new creative cycle with fresh material and an expanded live show featuring visuals, choreography and a colourful stage presence that bridges ancestral sounds with modern influences.\\n\\nTheir performance at The Jago marks their UK debut and the opening of a new chapter for the band. Expect a night of Andean rhythms, migrant storytelling and unapologetic celebration — a journey from the highlands to the heart of London’s multicultural East End.\\n\\nGet ready to dance, stomp and celebrate.\\n\\nLas Forasteritas are coming to the UK.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2296\",\"name\":\"Movimientos\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"movimientos-6ey2\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772308800,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":4774},\"unicorn\":false,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"0e32b7ea-c423-4c42-ae12-31abd14bec96\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"19f74e3d-efaf-4a71-9476-13370248a171\",\"seat_selection\":\"disabled\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-11T14:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-27T16:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-11T14:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-28T20:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T22:15:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"dk87r6-andrew-bird-and-britten-sinfonia-28th-feb-barbican-hall-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"0e32b7ea-c423-4c42-ae12-31abd14bec96\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Andrew Bird - Pulaski at Night\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/4uSftVc3FPWe6RJuMZNEe9\",\"artist\":\"Andrew Bird\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/9790adad316ad5866c91f42065e6da51abe8c990\",\"track_name\":\"Pulaski at Night\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_of