fm/a249978af145?dice_id=a249978af145\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1980,\"name\":\"The 100 Club\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://the100club.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"e044e34315b96a4b:13\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by 100 Club.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1762826400,\"id\":\"69137ebca9f8c30001aaf6f7\",\"name\":\"The Stompin Riffraffs\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"ROVR proudly presents: Stompin Riffraffs LIVE\\n\\nA night of rock ‘n’ roll, from rockabilly to garage rock, punk, freakbeat, psyche and everything in between!\\n\\nLINEUP:\\n\\nStompin Riff Raffs (LIVE!)\\n\\nReturning to London for the first time in a decade, Tokyo’s high-voltage act brings a wild fusion of garage rock, surf, and rockabilly, known for their explosive live shows.\\n\\nKeb Darge\\n\\nThe legendary DJ and defining figure in underground music culture, renowned for his deep knowledge of rare funk, soul, and garage punk.\\n\\nBoz Boorer\\n\\nMorrissey's long-time guitarist and musical director, Boz is also a lifelong vinyl obsessive with 40+ years of curation and a one-of-a-kind collection.\\n\\nDJ Little Carl\\n\\nA stalwart of the UK rockabilly scene and Rockabilly Rave regular, renowned for his high-energy sets of rock 'n' roll, hillbilly, and western swing.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"7103\",\"n