onal driving license, or a photo card featuring the PASS hologram. Please note that photocopies, digital images, or screenshots of IDs will not be accepted under any circumstances.\\n\\nThank you for your cooperation in ensuring a safe and smooth entry process.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"304\",\"name\":\"EGG\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"egg-zko9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772316000,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":4365},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-19T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-01T05:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-19T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-28T22:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-01T05:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"xe78vm-koko-electronic-mrak-28th-feb-koko-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":65702,\"title\":\"KOKO Accessibility Information\",\"body\":\"The KOKO venue has limited space for accessibility. Accessibility tickets are only purchasable through the KOKO website and once these tickets have been sold, we cannot accept any further accessibility requests. If you require Accessibility tickets and these are no longer available, please do not purchase a GA ticket and expect to be accommodated as these will be refused. This is a strict policy to make sure the venue is safe for all customers.\\n\\nFor further information please see https://www.koko.co.uk/faqs and if you have any questions regarding accessibility contact ACCESS@koko.uk.com\",\"order\":0}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Mrak\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"25504\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"90\",\"name\":\"KOKO\",\"address\":\"1A Camden High St, London NW1 7JE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5347507,\"lng\":-0.138054300000022},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/5f06821a-da0b-4985-9a41-f48ae4872759.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C400%2C400\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"koko-z9b7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.koko.co.uk/access-and-facilities\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-28T22:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-19/c1d699af-b175-466d-8102-929a738128c4.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1520%2C1520\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-19/c1d699af-b175-466d-8102-929a738128c4.jpg?rect=0%2C304%2C1520%2C912\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-19/c1d699af-b175-466d-8102-929a738128c4.jpg?rect=342%2C0%2C836%2C1520\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Nc7916b88498?dice_id=Nc7916b88498\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k54637b62f62?dice_id=k54637b62f62\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/f4e4784d3e80?dice_id=f4e4784d3e80\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/tb2c515d9552?dice_id=tb2c515d9552\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/kd4fac0fb2ed?dice_id=kd4fac0fb2ed\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Qeeee900f046?dice_id=Qeeee900f046\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":918,\"name\":\"KOKO\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.koko.co.uk/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"421051646826847\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":2075,\"name\":\"KOKO 2\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.koko.co.uk/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"2512980718968598\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"e044e34315b96a4b:19\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by KOKO.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1766102400,\"id\":\"6945764bab100d0001ea6999\",\"name\":\"KOKO Electronic: MRAK\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Carmine Conte, known as MRAK, is a visionary electronic musician and co-founder of Tale Of Us and Afterlife. With MRAK, he explores a more personal and experimental side of his artistry, blending techno, ambient, and cinematic sounds to create deep, immersive experiences.\\n\\n**IMPORTANT INFORMATION:**\\n\\nNeed a pres? Head to our official pre-party from 7pm-12am: Don KOKO, for pizzas & cocktails curated by What Willy Cook, SG Lewis, DJ Tennis, Natasha Diggs, Carlita & many more – check your emails for a 20% discount link. Or head to @donkokofc for reservations & offers.\\n\\nFor VIP & areas please email: bookings@KOKO.co.uk (available on selected nights only).\\n\\nPlease arrive according to the time on your ticket for a smooth and guaranteed entry.\\n\\nWe have a zero tolerance policy towards harassment and prejudice. If you are made to feel uncomfortable in any way, please do not hesitate to speak to any member of staff and we will help immediately.\\n\\nAny unattended drinks will be discarded.\\n\\nPlease do not purchase tickets through social media, we are unable to help with anyone who has been scammed.\\n\\nWe operate a zero tolerance drug policy.\\n\\nKOKO is 19+. No physical ID, no entry.\\n\\nPlease bring a valid form of photographic ID with you to the event/\\n\\nLast entry 3am. No readmission.\\n\\n**TO PREVENT RESELLING AND UNAUTHORISED USE OF TICKETS**\\n\\nTickets cannot be resold or transferred to another person through third party platforms such as Ticketswap..\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 19+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8108\",\"name\":\"KOKO\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"koko-nwv5\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772316000,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":0},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-28T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-28T22:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-28T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-28T23:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-01T05:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"bb398m-viva-baile-28th-feb-li