T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/627f2a79-e59a-4c66-95f7-fbf8a6826d31.jpg?rect=0%2C688%2C4160%2C4160\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/627f2a79-e59a-4c66-95f7-fbf8a6826d31.jpg?rect=0%2C1520%2C4160%2C2496\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/627f2a79-e59a-4c66-95f7-fbf8a6826d31.jpg?rect=558%2C0%2C3045%2C5536\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y9d3702448cd?dice_id=Y9d3702448cd\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ta807bb2c765?dice_id=Ta807bb2c765\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P55e37002348?dice_id=P55e37002348\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/vb7b7cebf7ad?dice_id=vb7b7cebf7ad\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D74c80ec3f61?dice_id=D74c80ec3f61\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/V3764097df0c?dice_id=V3764097df0c\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"e044e34315b96a4b:58\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Next Door Records.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1769385600,\"id\":\"69776734f4fd36000137db18\",\"name\":\"Max Mcleish Trio @ Next Door Records\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Hailing from North Yorkshire, Max is an engaging trombonist, multi-instrumentalist and composer emerging on the London scene. A graduate of the Royal Academy of Music, Max is also a Universal Music endorsed artist. Max is a regular member of Kasper Reitkerk’s Edison Award winning sextet KRSIX and regularly acts as sideman on other projects including the Emma Rawitz Big Band and the Massive Chops Big Band. An experienced band-leader, Max is musical director of jazz-gospel collective Rev21, who released their debut album ‘Let Them Hear’ in 2024, performing recently on BBC1. Max formed his trio in 2025 to bring a fresh approach to the well-loved organ trio sound.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"7075\",\"name\":\"Next Door Records\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"next-door-records-lnvx\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772564400,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2514,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-07T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-03T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-07T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-03T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-03T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"wwrqnr-xasthur-3rd-mar-the-black-heart-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Xasthur\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"128130\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"98\",\"name\":\"The Black Heart\",\"address\":\"2-3 Greenland Pl, London NW1 0AP\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5387812,\"lng\":-0.141761200000019},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-11-28/687dc696-b005-45e0-a194-c89d23ee7bed.jpg?rect=1%2C0%2C2716%2C2716\"},\"cit