00%2C400\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"electric-ballroom-j78v\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://electricballroom.co.uk/disabled-access/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-04T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-06/eaafd96b-7e85-493d-a5db-fdae236cb666.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-06/eaafd96b-7e85-493d-a5db-fdae236cb666.jpg?rect=0%2C240%2C1200%2C720\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-06/eaafd96b-7e85-493d-a5db-fdae236cb666.jpg?rect=270%2C0%2C660%2C1200\"},\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z6bb91a74e7a?dice_id=z6bb91a74e7a\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/t2b4c8a43971?dice_id=t2b4c8a43971\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/B2f5c811cee0?dice_id=B2f5c811cee0\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/He6ffa7d02ec?dice_id=He6ffa7d02ec\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Dcc2876e90cc?dice_id=Dcc2876e90cc\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a2bc1914c11e?dice_id=a2bc1914c11e\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/legal-information/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"679202632593023\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-980124-39\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"e044e34315b96a4b:76\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by C2C.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1751364000,\"id\":\"685cf7895f47e60001163976\",\"name\":\"Willow Avalon\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Originally from Georgia and now based in Nashville, Willow Avalon's musical journey began with her first word, ‘Elvis.’ Raised by her mother and grandmother in a small Southern town, she grew up playing piano in church and taught herself guitar at age 12, using songwriting as both an escape and a means of self-expression. After independently releasing her debut single ‘Drivin'’ in 2021, she quickly caught the industry's attention, leading to a deal with Atlantic Records/Assemble Sound in 2023 and her EP 'Stranger' in 2024.\\n\\nHer debut album, ‘Southern Belle Raisin’ Hell’ (January 2025), cemented her as one of country music's most compelling new voices, blending classic country, Americana, and rock influences. With a sharp wit and rebellious spirit, she has shared stages with legends and rising stars alike, including Zach Bryan (July 2025), Bob Dylan (June 2025), Cage the Elephant, Paul Cauthen, and Charles Wesley Godwin. Solidified by sold out headline tours in both the US and the UK, as well as hundreds of millions of views across social content, Willow Avalon is redefining what it means to be a modern Southern storyteller.\\n\\n*By purchasing a ticket to this event you are agreeing to adhere to Islington Assembly Hall's terms and conditions: https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/customer-terms-conditions-2022/*\\n\\n*All tickets to shows at Islington Assembly Hall are subject to a Venue Levy of £1.50 + VAT. As a Grade II listed building, this levy will be reinvested into Islington Assembly Hall and its services, meaning the customer experience can continue to be enhanced.*\\n\\nThis event is 14 and over. 14s to 16s must be accompanied by an adult.  Any ticket holder unable to present valid identification indicating that they are at least 14 years of age will not be admitted to this event and will not be eligible for a refund.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1607\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-78g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772650800,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1350,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-06T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-04T21:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-06T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-04T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-04T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"53r9ek-ronniee-lightlines-daisy-peacock-4th-mar-piano-smithfield-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"RONNIEE - I Want It That Way\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4sQDBa4YvCJKjuEtwNRXMH\",\"artist\":\"RONNIEE\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/dad8966649adde2de781e3d14eafc3572af066be?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"I Want It That Way\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"RONNIEE - I Want It That Way\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/i-want-it-that-way/1818416696?i=1818416702&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"RONNIEE\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/c2/2b/63/c22b63b8-d768-7b7d-1ff9-62524553a520/mzaf_16765169924938499981.plu