,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x67580382f3f?dice_id=x67580382f3f\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F43b6abb5486?dice_id=F43b6abb5486\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R6768cf6bfd5?dice_id=R6768cf6bfd5\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c7720df4211d?dice_id=c7720df4211d\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o026bece8961?dice_id=o026bece8961\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/rf9a5f7bd509?dice_id=rf9a5f7bd509\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":294,\"name\":\"229 The Venue\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://229.london/dataprotection/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"e044e34315b96a4b:82\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Somewhere Show.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1765843200,\"id\":\"6941999d72d76a00012fae57\",\"name\":\"Nogu Svelo!\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"NOGU SVELO! THEY ARE RETURNING TO EUROPE IN THE SPRING OF 2026!\\n\\nNogu Svelo!, a legendary punk rock band well known to Russian-speaking listeners for its unique style and bold citizenship, announces a new European tour, which will take place in March 2026. Now the band lives and works entirely in the USA, continuing to perform all over the world and uniting the audience with its energy, irony and open anti-war message.\\n\\nThis concert program was created especially for Russian—speaking fans of the band and includes both favorite hits from different years — \\\"Haru Mamburu\\\", \\\"Our young funny voices\\\", \\\"From Alma Ata\\\",\\n\\nas well as new protest compositions from the anti—war album \\\"Amputation\\\": \\\"Ukraine\\\", \\\"Generation Z\\\", \\\"With New Year, son!\\\", \\\"The Anthem of the Doomed\\\".\\n\\nOver the past two years, Nogu Svelo! they have become one of the loudest musical voices against the war. The band conducted a large-scale world tour and raised $ 100,000 to help Ukraine by supporting humanitarian and medical projects in various countries.\\n\\nThe spring concerts in Europe promise to be powerful, emotional and honest — a mixture of nostalgia, protest and lively energy, for which listeners love Nogu Svelo!\\n\\nTickets are flying fast — grab your early bird spots while they last!\\n\\nWant to be in the front rows? Don’t wait.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"6234\",\"name\":\"229\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"229-82l5\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772650800,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2627,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-18T14:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-04T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-18T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-04T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-04T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"2w7576-sofaygo-sold-out-4th-mar-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"SoFaygo - Knock Knock\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6aHoPULNO7pSL2ZfUY0bU8\",\"artist\":\"SoFaygo\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/95175480f6e4aad95b4f39642e12567247cba89f?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Knock Knock\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"SoFaygo - Blitz V2\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/blitz-v2/1653491681?i=1653491748&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"SoFaygo\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/8a/c4/05/8ac405ea-03cf-80d7-8a7c-5d7e9a98c4f4/mzaf_2420475895638921496.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Blitz V2\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":64722,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":64723,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":64724,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"SoFaygo\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-05-15/401ec741-b008-4750-8f1b-5f7179fcc1f7.jpg?rect=0%2C27%2C266%2C266\"},\"artist_id\":\"101599\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-04T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-03-04T23:00:00+00:00\"}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-17/26737591-cac9-4d7c-b099-fa07219f9c40.jpg?rect=0%2C424%2C1536%2C1536\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-17/26737591-cac9-4d7c-b099-fa07219f9c40.jpg?rect=0%2C563%2C1536%2C922\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-17/26737591-cac9-4d7c-b099-fa07219f9c40.jpg?rect=205%2C0%2C1126%2C2048\"},\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D3e597073612?dice_id=D3e597073612\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ff28933bcf3b?dice_id=ff28933bcf3b\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Fb4e4630ecf0?dice_id=Fb4e4630ecf0\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/V8b8daf60aa8?dice_id=V8b8daf60aa8\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b6cdc4700b46?dice_id=b6cdc4700b46\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e577c4efd2a6?dice_id=e577c4efd2a6\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"e044e34315b96a4b:83\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Live Nation\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1766066400,\"id\":\"6941672c0f6d21000137a1af\",\"name\":\"SOFAYGO | SOLD OUT\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"This show has now SOLD OUT! Join the waiting list to be informed of any returns.\\n\\nSoFaygo recorded his first song in the 4th grade. He spent every afternoon since the 9th grade teaching himself to record, mix, and master music in GarageBand. Now, just a year after graduating from High School, the 19-year-old, Cobb County, Georgia rapper is accelerating toward a career-launching breakthrough after two mixtapes, both released in 2020, elevated him from Soundcloud obscurity to more than 900,000 monthly listeners on Spotify. Angelic 7, produced entirely by multi-platinum teen idol Lil Tecca, was the first. “Knock Knock,” their debut record together, is SoFaygo’s biggest single to date with 7 million plays on Spotify and rising. After Me, the project that came next, features eight songs that showcase the ear candy flows and charismatic cadences he’s been developing since his senior year. “Off The Map,” a single that has 1.5 million plays on both Soundcloud and Spotify, and more than 800,000 YouTube views on the music video. All without a major label. Born in 2001, SoFaygo cites Chief Keef, Rich Homie Quan, Young Thug, Chris Brown, Usher, and Drake as the melodic artists who inspired him to create a versatile style of music-making he describes as “wavy.” Able to make waves in any genre, from Rap to Rock or R&B. With a loyal fanbase and famed rappers Lil Yachty, Trippie Redd, and Travis Scott all paying attention now, SoFaygo feels like he’s knocking on the door to stardom, but instead of waiting for someone to answer, he’s ready to, “Kick that bitch down.”\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"