"https://link.dice.fm/Y972cc1e4c01?dice_id=Y972cc1e4c01\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Hedbee5a9c1d?dice_id=Hedbee5a9c1d\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/rd8a845ef28e?dice_id=rd8a845ef28e\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/M48ebd0a8ab9?dice_id=M48ebd0a8ab9\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/i91969c615a9?dice_id=i91969c615a9\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W74a5366aecb?dice_id=W74a5366aecb\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1000},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by False Locust.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"faqs\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"140550\",\"name\":\"False Locust\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"false-locust-bmelk\",\"profile_active\":false},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"l89vbp-lope-amias-hanley-ivn-muela-henry-prince-4th-mar-the-horse-hospital-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1772652600,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"96caedaf310297b1:2\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1505\",\"name\":\"The Horse Hospital\",\"address\":\"The Horse Hospital, 30 Colonnade, Bloomsbury, London WC1N 1JD, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5230123,\"lng\":-0.12402510000003986},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-horse-hospital-g7ka\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-04T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Amias Hanley\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"128626\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Iván Muela\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"66231\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Henry Prince\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-01-24/88420968-daea-4568-8930-5cbea4a9b0ce.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"113715\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Delighted to welcome three artists working in the fields of ambient, drone, and experimental composition.\\n\\nIván Muela is a composer and sound artist based in London. His work often blends traditional instrumentation with electronic live processing, creating soundscapes that resemble ever-evolving sonic paintings. He has been releasing music under his name for the last 10 years in the ambient, experimental and neo-classical scene. He has performed his music in a variety of settings, ranging from intimate piano concerts, to drone festivals or performances with classical ensembles.\\n\\nHenry Prince is a composer and improviser from Nice and based in London. He composes for solo and guitar ensembles using ebows, as well as brass and wind players, occasionally using live sound processing and playing with pure / impure harmony. He is currently interested in the power of extreme quiet and stillness in performance contexts. He released \\\"Against The Earth\\\" in 2025, featuring two pieces for 12 acoustic guitars and ebows.\\n\\nAmias Hanley is an artist working at the intersection of sound, technology, and ecology. While their broader practice is grounded in auditory-led research through composition, installation, and sound sculpture, their performances embrace sound as an experimental and listenable medium. Often drawing on site, atmospherics, electromagnetics, found objects, and field recordings, their performances sometimes explore thresholds, aimlessness, and the possibilities of sound.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-11T13:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-04T20:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-11T13:30:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-04T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-04T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"698d8e2177cf6600014d6195\",\"name\":\"Lope: Amias Hanley, Iván Muela, Henry Prince\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/4102c65a-b812-49e1-a67e-66bf35be82f0.jpg?rect=0%2C240%2C1035%2C1034\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/4102c65a-b812-49e1-a67e-66bf35be82f0.jpg?rect=0%2C351%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/4102c65a-b812-49e1-a67e-66bf35be82f0.jpg?rect=169%2C0%2C743%2C1350\"},\"marketeers\":[],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1770816600,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Gbfedc9b3168?dice_id=Gbfedc9b3168\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e0f9c8299bed?dice_id=e0f9c8299bed\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a5b928af14a1?dice_id=a5b928af14a1\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ue898b90ae0b?dice_id=Ue898b90ae0b\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y9e92c62bf73?dice_id=Y9e92c62bf73\",\"post