":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"paper-dress-vintage-ja37\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://paperdressvintage.co.uk/faqs\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-04T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Avice Caro\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-09-14/5cff7998-d155-493e-905c-8f0f8fbdb434.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"22600\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Camille Jansen\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"41575\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Camille Jansen is an independent French-British artist that resides between Paris, London and LA. From an early age, Jansen recalls household artists Bob Dylan and Leonard Cohen being the soundtrack to most road trips. When curiosity got the better of her, Camille’s passion for storytelling grew stronger and with that came her unrivaled talent for songwriting.\\n\\nEarning support from the likes of Grazia and Earmilk, Camille's debut EP \\\"Louise\\\" has since amassed millions of streams across multiple platforms. More recently, Camille has\\n\\ngained praise from BBC 6music, Radio X, Clash Magazine, Crack Magazine, and Far Out Magazine, for her debut album ‘The Loose Screws’, whilst also supporting Babe Rainbow for their US, Aussie and NZ tour.\\n\\n2026 brings plenty of new music from Camille, with \\\"Bird's Nest & Fear of Flying\\\" recently released - whimsical musing of life experiences led by Camille herself, and others she's come by.\\n\\nCamille's headline show at Paper Dress Vintage will be the first of many, as she moves to share her stories and a slice of life. For this show she'll be joined by friends Avice Caro and LoverGirl.\",\"highlights\":[