ied by a responsible adult (1:1 ratio). Customers may be requested to provide valid physical photo ID upon entry, this is to ensure customer safety and ensure our legal age requirements are met. For this reason, we request that all customers bring valid ID. Digital or photocopied ID will not be accepted. For further information see Age and ID in FAQ’s. Right of admission reserved.\",\"order\":0}],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"11556\",\"name\":\"Village Underground\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"village-underground-n5v8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"7dllmb-monster-florence-4th-mar-village-underground-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1772652600,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"96caedaf310297b1:11\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"835\",\"name\":\"Village Underground\",\"address\":\"54 Holywell Lane, London EC2A 3PQ, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5234726,\"lng\":-0.07799529999999777},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-02-02/5b7b8372-c6a3-4dfa-ad59-4bfaabe94ddc.jpg?rect=317%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"village-underground-wwop\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://bit.ly/3EhSLgF\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-04T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Monster Florence\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-02-06/be6f8da6-84e0-479c-b192-dfae36e57d7e.jpg?rect=0%2C51%2C538%2C538\"},\"artist_id\":\"3929\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Monster Florence have always operated on the edge of genre, blending hip-hop, punk, and anything that fits the moment into something uniquely their own. Their last album, Master System, earned critical acclaim for its barbed lyricism and dark, cinematic atmosphere, capturing the anxieties of the digital age. Since then, the six-piece from Colchester has taken their explosive live show across two UK tours and their first European tour. Now, with their new EP, Petty Cash, they push their sound even further. A currency for the careless, Petty Cash captures the thrill of fleeting pleasures. The EP moves through the highs and lows of excess and aftermath. It’s the sound of nights that blur together, moments that slip through your fingers, and the echoes they leave behind. With Petty Cash marking another evolution, Monster Florence step into the year ahead, ready to defy expectations all over again.\\n\\nIf you have any queries or would like more information about access at Village Underground, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/3EhSLgF, or contact access@villageunderground.co.uk.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-06T10:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-04T19:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-10-09T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-04T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-04T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"68d681eeffdf8300015aa420\",\"name\":\"Monster Florence\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.im