ttps://link.dice.fm/M00d8d5ee6a9?dice_id=M00d8d5ee6a9\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/f41c5f20c627?dice_id=f41c5f20c627\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b0156af49458?dice_id=b0156af49458\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u62eadf0a2b4?dice_id=u62eadf0a2b4\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/i75f79cbeb5f?dice_id=i75f79cbeb5f\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":807,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Notting Hill Arts Club.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"faqs\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1523\",\"name\":\"Notting Hill Arts Club\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"notting-hill-arts-club-okgr\",\"profile_active\":false},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"q27pqx-the-room-the-rhythms-of-our-melanin-5th-mar-notting-hill-arts-club-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1772735400,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"96caedaf310297b1:23\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"80\",\"name\":\"Notting Hill Arts Club\",\"address\":\"21 Notting Hill Gate, London W11 3JQ\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.509239,\"lng\":-0.194435099999964},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"notting-hill-arts-club-4n2q\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-05T18:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Join us for Tooth Gems, Grillz, live music, panel talks, live Jams and more.\\n\\nDoors open at 6:30 pm — please bring physical ID\\n\\n.Black people have played a pivotal role in music for a very long time. We are responsible for creating genres, diversifying them, and constantly upgrading the culture. Yet so much of our music still doesn’t get the recognition it deserves.\\n\\nLondon can be close-minded, and there needs to be a breakthrough — a way to open the door to a whole world of new ideas, sounds, genres and opportunities.\\n\\nThat’s why I (Yishaq) am here.\\n\\nThis is about creating a space for Black and Brown people to come together and support one another: to grow businesses, network, collaborate on projects, and build something meaningful together. To become something more in this big but small city.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-27T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-05T18:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-27T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-05T18:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-06T00:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"6978e0c04cc1ef0001dfb376\",\"name\":\"THE ROOM (The Rhythms Of Our Melanin)\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-27/150ddc21-8bbf-4cd5-a203-2e78a64cef4e.jpg?rect=0%2C383%2C1490%2C1489\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-27/150ddc21-8bbf-4cd5-a203-2e78a64cef4e.jpg?rect=0%2C489%2C1490%2C894\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-27/150ddc21-8bbf-4cd5-a203-2e78a64cef4e.jpg?rect=230%2C0%2C1030%2C1872\"},\"marketeers\":[],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1769536800,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m32056848b36?dice_id=m32056848b36\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/j71d9a1531dd?dice_id=j71d9a1531dd\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y29063b57cb1?dice_id=y29063b57cb1\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ja0c891d1b19?dice_id=Ja0c891d1b19\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y0b8c195c74c?dice_id=y0b8c195c74c\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F117fb84ab19?dice_id=F117fb84ab19\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":0},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Global Soul.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"faqs\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"934\",\"name\":\"Global Soul\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-02-20/2ae7b816-a68d-419a-94d1-4a861ca1cfdb.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"global-soul-8er7\",\"profile_active\":true},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"k6nqrl-sofiia-giorgia-may-geo-baddoo-tammie-gracie-convert-5th-mar-soul-mama-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1772735400,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":2,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"96caedaf310297b1:24\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"14889\",\"name\":\"Soul Mama\",\"address\":\"Ground Floor, 40 Celebration Ave, East Village, London E20 1DB\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.54641,\"lng\":-0.00784},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"68348e77ff502a30257b8e25\",\"name\":\"Stratford\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.545532,\"lng\":-0.007741,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"soul-mama-xeeyl\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-05T18:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Giorgia-May\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb4025e41d1016b53fb359a397\"},\"artist_id\":\"18893\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Tammie\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"29388\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Gracie Convert\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"65438\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Geo Baddoo\\n\\nSomerset-raised, London-based R&B/Soul artist recognised for her soft, expressive vocals, introspective songwriting. Blending classic soul, folk-rooted storytelling, African & Caribbean musical lineages.\\n\\nSupport by BBC 1Xtra (Track of the Week), Kiss Xtra, COLORS, VIBE, Notion & BBC Radio London (Artist of the Week).\\n\\n**Giorgia-May**\\n\\nFrom Brighton, She has been pursuing a musical career through the means of travel. Now based in Berlin, she combines sensual lyrics, mesmerising tones & exciting arrangements drawing on her personal experiences of love, loss & coming into womanhood. Blending soulful melodies with jazzy chords & hints of RnB.\\n\\n**TAMMIE**\\n\\n25-year-old neo-soul artist & alchemist TheButterflyGrl. Her debut EP ‘METAMORPHOSIS’ released with support from Abbey Road Studios, BBC Radio1, BBC Radio1Xtra, BBC Radio6 (Craig Charles), Jazz FM, Reprezent Radio, Global Soul Radio, Notion etc.\\n\\n**Gracie Convert**\\n\\nBritish–French artist and producer whose music blends R&B, Jazz and Neo-Soul influences in both English & French. She is also a DJ, keeping that side of her practice connected to her broader musical identity.\\n\\n**SOFIIA**\\n\\nBorn in a post-Soviet country, began her career aged five. She rose to international fame as the lead singer of the iconic pop group VIA GRA. In 2022, she reshaped her life, began writing music in English, and relocated to Berlin & London to pursue her dreams. She has over half a million streams & social media following of 775K+\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-26T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-05T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-26T12:15:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-05T18:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-05T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"692789e17fc7f200015268cb\",\"name\":\"SOFIIA, Giorgia-May, Geo Baddoo, TAMMIE, Gracie Convert\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-27/a9ec5137-dddb-4695-a50f-fe05acf24868.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-27/a9ec5137-dddb-4695-a50f-fe05acf24868.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-27/a9ec5137-dddb-4695-a50f-fe05acf24868.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":910,\"name\":\"Global Soul\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://globalsoulradio.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initia