"name\":\"Cracked Lime\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"128442\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Strange Devotion\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"104781\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"DROWSE PLAZA\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/38b09801-dca8-4206-85d2-3b33f34d1b7d.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"133801\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Cracked Lime** was created early 2025. London-based, the duo spent the last year touring the north-eastern venues of the city, refining their live performance, which blends post-punk sharp guitars, with electronic beats and a lingering trip-hop feel. Expect some hypnotic existentialist spoken words, melodic interventions, noisy texture and a sharp dance-y weird rhythm section.\\n\\nhttps://linktr.ee/cracked_lime?\\n\\n**DROWSE PLAZA** is the solo project of London based Italian musician and producer Dario Corsetti, formerly behind the drum kit in various local bands. Having drawn from artists such as Dry Cleaning, Sleaford Mods, The Fall and Baxter Dury, Drowse tracks are a balanced mélange of spoken-word, easy synth-disco and post-punk soundscapes.\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/drowse_gram?igsh=MWduNHNuZnl2azRsOA%3D%3D&utm_source=qr\\n\\n**STRANGE DEVOTION** boy/girl vocals and kraut grooves culminate in a sound evoking the moody sweetness of dream-pop and raw minimalism of early post-punk. After a year on the London gig circuit the 5-piece’s debut cassette ‘A Demonstration Of Devotion’ was released in March 2025, capturing the first songs the group wrote together and exhibiting the group’s knack for well-crafted and experimental songwriting. FFO Wire, Stereolab, Au Pairs, The Stranglers.\\n\\nhttps://strangedevotion.bandcamp.com\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-10T11:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-05T21:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-10T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-05T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-05T22:45:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"698a31780f449000016f1fde\",\"name\":\"DrowsePlaza / Cracked Lime / Strange Devotion\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/ab08435f-db25-4dd6-af83-046ec922b3ef.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1417%2C1417\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/ab08435f-db25-4dd6-af83-046ec922b3ef.jpg?rect=0%2C284%2C1417%2C850\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/ab08435f-db25-4dd6-af83-046ec922b3ef.jpg?rect=319%2C0%2C779%2C1417\"},\"marketeers\":[],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1770723000,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Hb7888142379?dice_id=Hb7888142379\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v8d8ef25f3f8?dice_id=v8d8ef25f3f8\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/l67c3177e3c2?dice_id=l67c3177e3c2\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/mbaf0f80cf0a?dice_id=mbaf0f80cf0a\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q4aa05fada4e?dice_id=q4aa05fada4e\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Je7dc2887f87?dice_id=Je7dc2887f87\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"DROWSE PLAZA - borg\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3Iehjes6FXAhSKe5NmAWf4\",\"artist\":\"DROWSE PLAZA\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/6556ae952ecd603a8d4fa5d69bfb937542721729?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"borg\"}