t\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Max Pope is a South London singer-songwriter making instinctive, emotionally-charged music that blends indie-psych, soul and raw guitar energy. His latest record PRAISE ANIMAL leans into jagged blues, woozy electronics and cinematic textures, exploring vulnerability, faith and self-sabotage. Described by The Independent as “a rarity: a crowd-pleaser… genre-bending, pop-minded soul,” Max plays The Courtyard Theatre on March 5th, performing songs from PRAISE ANIMAL alongside new and old favourites.\\n\\nSupport act TBA\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages (under 14s to be accompanied by an adult) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-30T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-05T14:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-30T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-05T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-05T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"6979f1dab863320001171c29\",\"name\":\"Max Pope \",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-29/4512d7ac-2196-4630-b427-d95aa3bd279c.jpg?rect=390%2C0%2C1536%2C1536\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-29/4512d7ac-2196-4630-b427-d95aa3bd279c.jpg?rect=0%2C73%2C2316%2C1390\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-29/4512d7ac-2196-4630-b427-d95aa3bd279c.jpg?rect=736%2C0%2C845%2C1536\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":25,\"name\":\"The Courtyard Theatre\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"http://www.thecourtyard.org.uk/content/16/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_