 accompanied by a responsible adult (1:1 ratio). Customers may be requested to provide valid physical photo ID upon entry, this is to ensure customer safety and ensure our legal age requirements are met. For this reason, we request that all customers bring valid ID. Digital or photocopied ID will not be accepted. For further information see Age and ID in FAQ’s. Right of admission reserved.\",\"order\":0}],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"11556\",\"name\":\"Village Underground\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"village-underground-n5v8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"l8b2dp-lyny-5th-mar-village-underground-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1772739000,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"96caedaf310297b1:49\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"835\",\"name\":\"Village Underground\",\"address\":\"54 Holywell Lane, London EC2A 3PQ, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5234726,\"lng\":-0.07799529999999777},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-02-02/5b7b8372-c6a3-4dfa-ad59-4bfaabe94ddc.jpg?rect=317%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"village-underground-wwop\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://bit.ly/3EhSLgF\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-05T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"LYNY\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-07-13/f5162518-9166-43b9-baba-fe29dbf3b3fe.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"29096\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true},{\"name\":\"Baitz\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb0a4b5a8e388744fb534606a8\"},\"artist_id\":\"132493\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"24-year-old LYNY, aka Alec Leinhauser’s growth as an artist has been inescapable. He is pushing the boundaries of electronic music by discovering and combining new cutting-edge sounds with melodic compositions. His approach to bass music is heavily influenced by Hip-Hop and trap beats with a splash of R&B. He strives to balance his songs with heart wrenching basslines, arpeggiated melodies, and hard hitting drums.  \\n\\nIf you have any queries or would like more information about access at Village Underground, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/3EhSLgF, or contact access@villageunderground.co.uk.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-26T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-05T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-30T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-05T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-05T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"696a61cf97ee6b00019c5e08\",\"name\":\"LYNY\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/6d119ce7-6977-47a9-b272-e90e4ed4a2ca.jpg?rect=0%2C62%2C1179%2C1179\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/6d119ce7-6977-47a9-b272-e90e4ed4a2ca.jpg?rect=0%2C298%2C1179%2C707\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/6d119ce7-6977-47a9-b27