y_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1772825400,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"96caedaf310297b1:92\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"15510\",\"name\":\"Fox And Firkin\",\"address\":\"316 Lewisham High Street, Lewisham, London, SE13 6JZ, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.45698,\"lng\":-0.01441},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-04/8f120254-16c6-4f38-a599-6dbc7a16c8db.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2363%2C2363\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"fox-and-firkin-8ev7w\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-06T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Osibisa\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb9b84a869f67e4ea36d833bab\"},\"artist_id\":\"9339\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"British-Ghanaian band Osibisa aren’t afraid of venturing into different sounds and genres. From classic highlife to progressive and punk to a fusion of Afrobeat and rock, Osibisa established themselves as a progenitor of new-wave highlife, and have continued to push boundaries since their inception in the ’70s.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"The Godfathers of Afro Rock\\n\\nGhanaian Independence Day Celebration\\n\\nThe Fox & Firkin, Lewisham\\n\\n“Jimi Hendrix watched them rehearse, Stevie Wonder joined them on drums, and Fela Kuti partied with them in Lagos…”\\n\\nThe Guardian\\n\\nThis Ghanaian Independence Day, we celebrate with Osibisa, one of the most important bands in the history of Afro rock.\\n\\nFormed in London in 1969 by four African and three Caribbean musicians, including founding members from Ghana, Osibisa were true pioneers. They became the first Black band to break The Marquee Club in 1971, reached the UK charts in 1976, and helped shape a new global sound by blending African rhythms, Caribbean grooves, funk, jazz, rock, Latin and highlife.\\n\\nSongs like Sunshine Day, Welcome Home and Music for Gong Gong have become lasting anthems, still heard on stages around the world. Their influence runs deep, with artists such as Santana, Stevie Wonder, Al Green, Johnny Nash and Bob Marley all citing Osibisa as an inspiration.\\n\\nAt The Fox & Firkin, the band bring their unmistakable mix of driving percussion, soaring horns and rich arrangements, celebrating Ghana’s independence through music that changed the world.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-27T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-06T21:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-27T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-06T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-06T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"69494a123c5338000179d5fa\",\"name\":\"Ghana Independence Celebration w/ OSIBISA \",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-22/ff76dc6b-5526-4d85-8147-d63b605567e4.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-22/ff76dc6b-5526-4d85-8147-d63b605567e4.jpg?rect=0%2C351%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-22/ff76dc6b-5526-4d85-8147-d63b605567e4.jpg?rect=169%2C0%2C743%2C1350\"},\"marketeers\":[],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1766829600,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/f485286412ed?dice_id=f485286412ed\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Rcda90e5fcbd?dice_id=Rcda90e5fcbd\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m9d606ab5779?dice_id=m9d606ab5779\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N431aa189b1c?dice_id=N431aa189b1c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E4c9269aa26f?dice_id=E4c9269aa26f\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y3efe32ca4db?dice_id=Y3efe32ca4db\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Sunshine Day\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/59VYhrPiXcbmB9SxJ4dj7h\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/f5ea22075f9d4dc7e2e4fa99857a5c2c263fde9c?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Sunshine Day\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Osibisa - Sunshine Day\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/sunshine-day/325246598?i=325246713&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Osibisa\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/73/b6/06/73b606ab-5e95-5992-2bc0-f48c5cab1dcb/mzaf_298076580344565002.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Sunshine Day\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2091,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Rich Mix.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"faqs\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"12032\",\"name\":\"Rich Mix\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"rich-mix-n5pq\",\"profile_active\":false},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"538r6k-les-hommes-live-the-karminsky-experienceinc-all-vinyl-dj-set-6th-mar-rich-mix-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1772825400,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"96caedaf310297b1:93\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"111\",\"name\":\"Rich Mix\",\"address\":\"35-47 Bethnal Green Rd, London E1 6LA\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5243489,\"lng\":-0.0732477000000245},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"rich-mix-4w2r\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.richmix.org.uk/plan-your-visit/accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-06T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Les Hommes\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab67616d0000b2739f0d89f172f29f0c75395016\"},\"artist_id\":\"131242\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"The Karminsky Experience Inc.\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"131243\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"A rare live set from mid-century re-appropriators Les Hommes whose extra dusty Lowrey organ, horns, flute, vibraphone and heavy percussion conjures '60s Rio, cinelounge, eastern modes and esoteric jazz. Their medium-cool presence has been apparent since the late '90s with packed performances in London and abroad with special appearances for events such as the Independent Film Awards and Eurotrash parties. Their live show moves from widescreen mondorama through to intense Brazilian organ-and-percussion workouts to hypnotising exotica. The Les Hommes groove comprises sounds we nearly forgot existed – vaguely graspable jazzified moments lost to dusty celluloid.\\n\\nGlobal lounge kings The Karminsky Experience Inc. bring on the club night DJing with an all-vinyl set of dancefloor-filling filmic moods, European jazzed-out poptasms and orchestral orgies of rhythm and groove. Currently number one for listeners on the Mixcloud soundtrack chart, the duo are revered among collectors and crate diggers with a 100,000+ sales of compilations such as the loungecore classic 'In-Flight Entertainment'. Catch their famous 'champagne set' upon your arrival as they swoon your ears with symphonic gems and mellifluous ear candy.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-15T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-06T21:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-15T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-06T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-06T23:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"693fe83246ea5d00013ea22b\",\"name\":\"Les Hommes (live) + The Karminsky Experience Inc. (all-vinyl DJ set)\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-11/bbf9de12-3501-4f91-91c0-a9aa7b986447.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C4500%2C4500\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-11/bbf9de12-3501-4f91-91c0-a9aa7b986447.jpg?rect=0%2C900%2C4500%2C2700\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-11/bbf9de12-3501-4f91-91c0-a9aa7b986447.jpg?rect=1013%2C0%2C2475%2C4500\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\