00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-04/9943deb1-6395-4a2f-9106-9b1333a09940.jpg?rect=0%2C26%2C1449%2C1449\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-04/9943deb1-6395-4a2f-9106-9b1333a09940.jpg?rect=0%2C590%2C1449%2C869\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-04/9943deb1-6395-4a2f-9106-9b1333a09940.jpg?rect=162%2C0%2C1126%2C2048\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n576adc6f78f?dice_id=n576adc6f78f\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Xb441d70e22e?dice_id=Xb441d70e22e\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e76505c977e6?dice_id=e76505c977e6\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ab112a92c434?dice_id=Ab112a92c434\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p01786400c13?dice_id=p01786400c13\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/S1ae081a8334?dice_id=S1ae081a8334\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1980,\"name\":\"The 100 Club\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://the100club.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"a3ead428a6c1b92b:4\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by 100 Club.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1754262900,\"id\":\"68901a306215a20001c6f369\",\"name\":\"KillerStar\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"KillerStar return to The 100 Club, following their previous acclaimed sold out gigs here in the previous 2 years.\\n\\nThese new shows coincide with the launch of a brand new studio album in 2026.\\n\\nKillerStar musicians on this gig: Rob Fleming, James Sedge, Mike Garson, Mark Plati, Kevin Armstrong, Dom Beken, Ulrika Bergelind, Gail Windrass with guest Simon Bates. Plus special guest Earl Slick.\\n\\nKillerStar’s self-titled debut album weaved modern and classic rock into a new distinct sound that features sophisticated harmonies, catchy hooks and elements of art rock. The band led by Rob Fleming(songwriter, guitar, synths) and James Sedge (Drums) , joined forces with a team of musicians and trusted collaborators from David Bowie’s band : Mike Garson on piano, Earl Slick and Mark Plati on guitar, Gail Ann Dorsey and Tim Lefebvre on bass, Emm Gryner on backing vocals, and Donny McCaslin on saxophone for their first studio album. Collectively, these musicians have contributed to almost every era of Bowie’s vast discography, from the landmark ‘Aladdin Sane’ to the final goodbye of ‘Blackstar’.\\n\\nThe album received rave reviews from the media:\\n\\n(★★★★) Mojo Magazine\\n\\n(★★★★) The Times\\n\\n(★★★★) RNR Magazine\\n\\n”Impeccable musicianship” Music Connection\\n\\n\\\"Uncanny project... evocative debut album\\\" VintageGuitar\\n\\nNamed one of “The 12 most exciting acts in the world” by Q magazine\\n\\nFollowing subsequent live shows in the UK and USA , and a live album, the band return to The 100 Club and will preview songs from their new studio album. The album is due for release in early 2026 and features the likes of Mike Garson, Earl Slick, Mark Plati, Gerry Leonard, The Webb Sisters, Emm Gryner.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"7103\",\"name\":\"100 Club\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"100-club-lnlp\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1772825400,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1122},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-10T14:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-06T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-10T15:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-06T20:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-07T00:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"8e6wnv-nyjo-special-guest-sunshine-afrooist-6th-mar-peckham-levels-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":150,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"2310\",\"name\":\"Peckham Levels\",\"address\":\"F1-F6 Peckham Town Centre Carpark, 95A Rye Ln, London SE15 4ST, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.47077090000001,\"lng\":-0.06738610000002154},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"peckham-levels-8m3w\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://peckhamlevels.org/your-visit\"},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-06T20:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/490195e2-ce52-4068-9ef8-8c2eeab42a58.jpg?rect=0%2C135%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/490195e2-ce52-4068-9ef8-8c2eeab42a58.jpg?rect=0%2C351%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/490195e2-ce52-4068-9ef8-8c2eeab42a58.jpg?rect=169%2C0%2C743%2C1350\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a44863efaeb6?dice_id=a44863efaeb6\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y462030ecd53?dice_id=y462030ecd53\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q387c1371337?dice_id=Q387c1371337\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J7b0eec88a8e?dice_id=J7b0eec88a8e\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Pb6a7a06d336?dice_id=Pb6a7a06d336\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P9a6ff17f7ad?dice_id=P9a6ff17f7ad\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"a3ead428a6c1b92b:5\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by NYJO\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1770732000,\"id\":\"698b3ab955c43c0001dcab07\",\"name\":\"NYJO - Special Guest Sunshine Afrooist\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Experience the future of UK jazz at NYJO’s monthly residency at Peckham Levels.\\n\\nSunshine is a Fine Artist, Performer, Singer-Songwriter and Educator; she has previously worked with NYJO as a vocalist on the Sun Ra Reimagined project and led the deep dive for the James Baldwin, ‘The Fire Next Time’. Sunshine is a core as member of the resident band at Orii Jam that happens every Monday in East London.\\n\\nAs always, this will happen on the first Friday of the month (6th March) and will culminate in a 45-minute set of original, bold music as played by both Sunshine and NYJO Musicians, with the set being followed by an open jam session.\\n\\nJoin us at Peckham Levels on the first Friday of every month for a performance of original compositions by NYJO musicians, featuring a special guest artist, followed by a lively jam session. Started in April 2025 our Levels Residency offers an opportunity for NYJO Emerging Professional musicians to develop their composition and stagecraft under the mentorship of key figures in UK jazz. Previous Levels Residency guest artist successes include Jay Kayser, Levitation Orchestra, Theon Cross, Jasmine Myra and Township Jazz.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"10244\",\"name\":\"IKLECTIK\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"iklectik-dm2o\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1772827200,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":618,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-09T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-06T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-09T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-06T20:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-06T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"v39w36-olivia-lynn-6th-mar-the-castle-luton-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Olivia Lynn - I Saw Red\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/i-saw-red/1660688710?i=1660688960&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Olivia Lynn\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview122/v4/09/17/ec/0917ec1c-d5fe-266a-48ce-5463339098b6/mzaf_17007075767793033870.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"I Saw Red\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Olivia Lynn - I Saw Red\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/7Mw9N2UdheT2LjILWTd8qf\",\"a