ture a selection of guest bands, playing new wave, post punk and dream pop.\\n\\nDiskoteka\\n\\nThe live show will be followed with a Diskoteka including Synth Wave, Disco, 80/90s Pop & House brought to you by Club.The.Mammoth. and residents.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1280\",\"name\":\"CLUB.THE.MAMMOTH\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-03-26/b7c6d4f5-e734-437e-aea8-bf1dbd513d1a.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"clubthemammoth-nyaq\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1772827200,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":0,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-07T10:15:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-06T19:45:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-07T10:30:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-06T20:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-06T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"7dpnp6-traditional-irish-music-6th-mar-jungle-electric-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Terence O'Flaherty - Cailin Beag\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/cailin-beag/320053132?i=320053708&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Terence O'Flaherty\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Music/6f/1b/4b/mzm.ruzbakel.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Cailin Beag\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Terence O'Flaherty - Return To Camden\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4hBztwQGgd4yqgGdBg1KXA\",\"artist\":\"Terence O'Flaherty\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/983235baf1bcb9e89378335ceb1201e4e561de8a?cid=921526b9c2da