in her father’s band on several world tours and has found success as a solo artist in the country/Americana music scene; most notably with her debut single “Remembering” which she wrote for her father and is featured on the Grammy award winning and Oscar nominated album for the documentary Glen Campbell: I’ll Be Me.\\n\\n***Artists:*** We are always interested in hearing from talented artists. If you’d like to play at our future events, please get in touch.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"12522\",\"name\":\"REAL\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-04-07/94ee93c8-9fa3-48b9-ae67-0215c3e3b070.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"real-vxyd\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1772910000,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1925,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-13T00:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-07T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-10-13T00:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-07T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-07T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"2wekp6-opal-ocean-7th-mar-colours-hoxton-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Waves Lapping Rocks on the Pier\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/7G4tS9BJ6Yutc5SqN5Ar7S\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/6728142060d8ebaef59f48c00f69d386e6d1019a?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Waves Lapping Rocks on the Pier\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"ta