1b1e709.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"71927\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Copenhagen’s Barbro will be performing their new album Crossfade live for the first time at a very special release show at The Shacklewell Arms on 7th March. The LP is a raw and intimate body of work that Barbro created in an abandoned art classroom at their former school - a quiet, dust-filled place where personal memory, global turmoil and sonic collages overlap. The result is 10 alternative folk and alt-pop compositions, moving gently between states rather than settling on anything fixed.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"10\",\"name\":\"The Shacklewell Arms\",\"address\":\"71 Shacklewell Lane, London E8 2EB\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5531551,\"lng\":-0.0699228999999377},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-shacklewell-arms-z82z\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.shacklewellarms.com/info\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-07T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-03/bed39ce2-9d3b-4fc8-a32c-8ccbb85472ec.jpg?rect=0%2C1%2C2400%2C2400\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-03/bed39ce2-9d3b-4fc8-a32c-8ccbb85472ec.jpg?rect=0%2C481%2C2400%2C1440\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-03/bed39ce2-9d3b-4fc8-a32c-8ccbb85472ec.jpg?rect=540%2C0%2C1321%2C2402\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W19b