/26962165083409-The-Lower-Third-at-Outernet-Accessibility-FAQs\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":\"The Lower Third (Up)\",\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-07T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-15/66a25f69-ae15-43a6-bbef-0fdab7c0af62.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-15/66a25f69-ae15-43a6-bbef-0fdab7c0af62.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-15/66a25f69-ae15-43a6-bbef-0fdab7c0af62.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/vdc53ab01d1d?dice_id=vdc53ab01d1d\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/S578898e308c?dice_id=S578898e308c\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/i0c2588d7503?dice_id=i0c2588d7503\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/C358f9472f6b?dice_id=C358f9472f6b\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/uc220f7d1a00?dice_id=uc220f7d1a00\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/tee59b38140d?dice_id=tee59b38140d\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":818,\"name\":\"HERE at Outernet\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://hereldn.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1415783946118882\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-QH4NRPEYW3\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":819,\"name\":\"The Lower Third\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://thelowerthird.co.uk/privacy-notice/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"783951717556608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-ZVCKXCPJY8\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":910,\"name\":\"Global Soul\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://globalsoulradio.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"a3ead428a6c1b92b:58\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Global Soul\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1764720000,\"id\":\"693051559455a100018782f5\",\"name\":\"Bethannie Hare, Bekka Blake & Zach Antonio\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Bethannie Hare**\\n\\nRaised in Leeds with jazz classics on repeat, she’s always been drawn to storytelling through song. Her early love of performing saw her putting on shows wherever she could. Now based in London, she brings with her a notebook full of lyrics, a head full of melodies & a deep commitment to making honest, soulful music. Her debut single Minds Under My Skin is a self-written, co-produced track that blends vulnerability with strength, offering a glimpse into the emotional honesty that drives her work.\\n\\n**Bekka Blake**\\n\\nLondon-based Singer Songwriter whose sound moves between R&B, soul, funk & house. Originally from Adelaide, Australia. She blends heartfelt vocals, rich harmonies, and smooth neo-soul rhythms. Currently exploring soulful house in the studio, Bekka is excited to dive deeper into this style.\\n\\n**Zach Antonio**\\n\\nAn Alternative RnB and Soul artist from London. His music blends Neo Soul Melodies, real talk, and a love for the RnB, Soul and Hip Hop scene. From growing up on the likes of Lauryn Hill and D’Angelo to the local sounds of Loyle Carner and Little Simz, his inspiration, honesty and soulfulness is echoed in every note.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8466\",\"name\":\"Outernet Venue Ltd\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"outernet-venue-ltd-96a7\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1772911800,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1130},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-12T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-07T17:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-12T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-07T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-07T21:15:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"2w7267-moria-soria-7th-mar-conway-hall-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3223\",\"name\":\"Conway Hall\",\"address\":\"25 Red Lion Square Holborn, London WC1R 4RL UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.51948760000001,\"lng\":-0.1168424},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"conway-hall-obq5\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.conwayhall.org.uk/about-us/faqs/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-07T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-30/d8fba099-9741-4684-aefc-6a4066f34c39.jpg?rect=0%2C1%2C778%2C778\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-30/d8fba099-9741-4684-aefc-6a4066f34c39.jpg?rect=0%2C156%2C778%2C467\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-30/d8fba099-9741-4684-aefc-6a4066f34c39.jpg?rect=175%2C0%2C428%2C779\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D9d2d40e2d47?dice_id=D9d2d40e2d47\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J08b50d5f1e2?dice_id=J08b50d5f1e2\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/gab51b64269f?dice_id=gab51b64269f\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/vc85ef355a1b?dice_id=vc85ef355a1b\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w76fa612f217?dice_id=w76fa612f217\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e3861f1fe0b6?dice_id=e3861f1fe0b6\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"a3ead428a6c1b92b:59\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Conway Hall.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1765497600,\"id\":\"6925bb4dcaf2b4000129eb53\",\"name\":\"Moria Soria\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Conway Hall presents the world premiere of ***Soria Moria*** – a new Climate Opera by composer and pianist **Stefania Passamonte**, inspired by Nordic mythology and real-world climate science.\\n\\n*Soria Moria* tells the story of Lucia, a young explorer who is drawn by the voice of Fossegrim, the ancient Water Spirit, to the melting Arctic ice. Guided by Zefira, the fierce West Wind, Lucia embarks on a mythical journey toward the legendary home of the Snow Queen, in a quest to restore winter and save the frozen world from irreversible warming.\\n\\nBlending folklore and contemporary environmental themes, the opera unfolds across enchanted forests, Nordic villages and the icy realm of Niflheim. What begins as a fairy tale becomes a powerful reflection on climate responsibility, scientific belief, and collective hope. The production weaves together classical opera, choral writing and immersive sound design. Visual projections and atmospheric lighting transform the stage into a shifting world of ice, water, and wind, blurring the boundary between reality and myth. Through elemental characters and poetic imagery, *Soria Moria* invites audiences to confront climate change not through catastrophe, but through wonder, courage, and imagination.\\n\\nThe opera is performed in English and Nordic languages, with surtitles. The evening will begin with a short introduction by the composer and producer, and will be followed by an opportunity to engage with the immersive set and visual installation.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an all ages event. Under 16's must be accompanied by an adult.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"5578\",\"name\":\"Conway Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"conway-hall-5nry\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772911800,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3163},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11