ny others from the 70s through the 2000s — a lively, high-energy performance that connects strongly with both Brazilian communities abroad and international audiences. The concert runs for about 2 hours, filled with energy, interaction, and a vibrant live atmosphere.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"6234\",\"name\":\"229\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"229-82l5\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772911800,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2470,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":false,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-08-04T00:15:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-07T18:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-08-04T00:15:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-07T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-07T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"wwgbxp-killerstar-7th-mar-the-100-club-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"66\",\"name\":\"The 100 Club\",\"address\":\"100 Oxford St, Fitzrovia, London W1D 1LL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5161551,\"lng\":-0.1353063999999904},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/35e8f238-d827-4132-8534-bc474249d988.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C500%2C500\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-100-club-z997\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.the100club.co.uk/access-info/#:~:text=The%20100%20Club%20is%20an,disabled%20customers%20to%20the%20venue.&text=There%20is%20level%20access%20from,or%20a%20lift%20on%20site.\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-07T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-04/9943deb1-6395-4a2f-9106-9b1333a09940.jpg?rect=0%2C26%2C1449%2C1449\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-04/9943deb1-6395-4a2f-9106-9b1333a09940.jpg?rect=0%2C590%2C1449%2C869\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-04/9943deb1-6395-4a2f-9106-9b1333a09940.jpg?rect=162%2C0%2C1126%2C2048\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n199d30eaf40?dice_id=n199d30eaf40\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ca94f6433443?dice_id=ca94f6433443\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/g35e06b9dfa3?dice_id=g35e06b9dfa3\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/hb434a6bd5b3?dice_id=hb434a6bd5b3\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Nad10b6aa5e2?dice_id=Nad10b6aa5e2\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w868be19d4b9?dice_id=w868be19d4b9\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1980,\"name\":\"The 100 Club\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://the100club.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"a3ead428a6c1b92b:61\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by 100 Club.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1754262900,\"id\":\"68901a9db4ff4a00011ce137\",\"name\":\"KillerStar\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"KillerStar return to The 100 Club, following their previous acclaimed sold out gigs here in the previous 2 years.\\n\\nThese new shows coincide with the launch of a brand new studio album in 2026.\\n\\nKillerStar musicians on this gig: Rob Fleming, James Sedge, Mike Garson, Mark Plati, Kevin Armstrong, Dom Beken, Ulrika Bergelind, Gail Windrass with guest Simon Bates. Plus special guest Earl Slick.\\n\\nKillerStar’s self-titled debut album weaved modern and classic rock into a new distinct sound that features sophisticated harmonies, catchy hooks and elements of art rock. The band led by Rob Fleming(songwriter, guitar, synths) and James Sedge (Drums) , joined forces with a team of musicians and trusted collaborators from David Bowie’s band : Mike Garson on piano, Earl Slick and Mark Plati on guitar, Gail Ann Dorsey and Tim Lefebvre on bass, Emm Gryner on backing vocals, and Donny McCaslin on saxophone for their first studio album. Collectively, these musicians have contributed to almost every era of Bowie’s vast discography, from the landmark ‘Aladdin Sane’ to the final goodbye of ‘Blackstar’.\\n\\nThe album received rave reviews from the media:\\n\\n(★★★★) Mojo Magazine\\n\\n(★★★★) The Times\\n\\n(★★★★) RNR Magazine\\n\\n”Impeccable musicianship” Music Connection\\n\\n\\\"Uncanny project... evocative debut album\\\" VintageGuitar\\n\\nNamed one of “The 12 most exciting acts in the world” by Q magazine\\n\\nFollowing subsequent live shows in the UK and USA , and a live album, the band return to The 100 Club and will preview songs from their new studio album. The album is due for release in early 2026 and features the likes of Mike Garson, Earl Slick, Mark Plati, Gerry Leonard, The Webb Sisters, Emm Gryner.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"7103\",\"name\":\"100 Club\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"100-club-lnlp\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1772911800,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1100},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-30T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-07T20:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-30T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-07T20:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-08T03:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"oeg9d5-ssaliva-organ-tapes-phoning-clich-toupee-7th-mar-the-greyhound-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Condition\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5tLjfsaw835GMDqoVsgXtL\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/2f138d13a655d666d06910a6d04bef3f1c53d03d?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Condition\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"cliché toupée\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab67616d0000b2733b875fd8e5059a0c030e7a3f\"},\"artist_id\":\"133326\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"5676\",\"name\":\"The Greyhound\",\"address\":\"109 Peckham High St, London SE15 5SE, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4741705,\"lng\":-0.06862209999999999},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-greyhound-kvlo\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-07T20:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-29/8afd31d8-6584-4929-b778-a6db57939e06.jpg?rect=0%2C135%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-29/8afd31d8-6584-4929-b778-a6db57939e06.jpg?rect=0%2C351%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-29/8afd31d8-6584-4929-b778-a6db57939e06.jpg?rect=169%2C0%2C743%2C1350\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Wc0550b9d9bd?dice_id=Wc0550b9d9bd\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a8d7476ee744?dice_id=a8d7476ee744\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/jbcfecea150f?dice_id=jbcfecea150f\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v36286077fa1?dice_id=v36286077fa1\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/C18d26a2db77?dice_id=C18d26a2db77\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ua11304572d0?dice_id=Ua11304572d0\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"a3ead428a6c1b92b:62\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by MATED.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1769774400,\"id\":\"697c67b7b79a740001ecb720\",\"name\":\"SSaliva, Organ Tapes, Phoning, Cliché Toupee\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"MATED PRESENTS: **ONE LIGHT 03**\\n\\nSSALIVA, ORGAN TAPES, CLICHÉ TOUPEE AND PHONING\\n\\nLIVE AT THE GREYHOUND\\n\\n**SSaliva** is an audiovisual artist born in Liège, Belgium in 1983. He started producing music by the end of the 90’s/early 2000 and producing his visual work around 2010. In 2011, he started his experimental project « ssaliva ». After working for years as Cupp Cave on alternative hip-hop and dance beats, he developped hypnotic soundscapes based on sparse rythms, lush tones and crystallised textures. His work as ssaliva also consists of documenting equally ethereal and removed places in pictures, two compulsive and lonely processes that have made him accumulate thousands of strange, escapist mental landscapes. Sometimes ghostly, sometimes sacred, an instantly recognizable form of melancholia.\\n\\n**Organ Tapes** is a musician from London and Shanghai. His music is characterised by layered guitar loops, midi instrumentation, field recordings and autotune vocals.\\n\\n**Cliché Toupee** is a London based musician drawn to the glamour of ruin… Glitter rubbed raw, melodies warped by corrosion and collapse. Sound that decays slowly, perfumed with sweetness as it rots I guess.\\n\\n**Phoning** is a sound project by Bojan Kostivic and Robin Sparkes. The work uses the telephone as a microphone and transmission interface within a harmonic approach to electronic composition. Sound is shaped through live electronic processes that treat the phonosphere as a stereophonic field.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"130530\",\"name\":\"MATED\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"mated-5ny8l\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772913600,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1320,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-27T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-07T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-27T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-07T20:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-08T00:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"xe2oym-roots-rhythms-womens-day-special-7th-mar-jamboree-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Let Drum Beat - Forró dos Elementos\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/forr%C3%B3-dos-elementos/1487294044?i=1487294226&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Let Drum Beat\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview113/v4/d9/c9/65/d9c9650d-503c-10c1-20b1-860e1744cd72/mzaf_6280981885079142120.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Forró dos Elementos\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Let Drum Beat - Forró dos Elementos\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/07XJyH58VCRytxk3Y3ESju\",\"artist\":\"Let Drum Beat\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/1bcf5450dead283ef26406bdef665375d2359eb3?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Forró dos Elementos\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"8689\",\"name\":\"Jamboree\",\"address\":\"6 St. Chad's Place, Camden, London, WC1X 9HH, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.530445,\"lng\":-0.119635},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"jamboree-x29e\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-07T20:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/f54980cd-cfa6-4ac5-a65c-4d09f22b5e80.jpg?rect=0%2C58%2C768%2C768\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/f54980cd-cfa6-4ac5-a65c-4d09f22b5e80.jpg?rect=0%2C212%2C768%2C461\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/f54980cd-cfa6-4ac5-a65c-4d09f22b5e80.jpg?rect=141%2C0%2C486%2C884\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/i710a271062e?dice_id=i710a271062e\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Vc2c746149db?dice_id=Vc2c746149db\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z46c56f1a8c0?dice_id=z46c56f1a8c0\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y59d4285fab5?dice_id=Y59d4285fab5\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/I323f76a686b?dice_id=I323f76a686b\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T1c0596742d2?dice_id=T1c0596742d2\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"a3ead428a6c1b92b:63\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by FLAWA & Movimientos.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1769508000,\"id\":\"6977a9ebd1ca040001a9a7e5\",\"name\":\"Roots & Rhythms: Women's Day Special \",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"This International Women’s Day, FLAWA and Movimientos invite you to an evening of live music, poetry and dance where Latin American women gather in a celebration of shared traditions, memory and collective strength.\\n\\nThrough rhythm and storytelling, we open a shared space blurring the lines between performance and audience to elevate our voices, dance our bodies and celebrate human connection.\\n\\nJoining us are Let Drum Beat, Las Witchas, and Palacio de Poetas, making up for a night of art as community and a reminder of the transformative power of coming together through poetry, movement and music.\\n\\n**Let Drum Beat**\\n\\nA London-based band led by female percussionists, Let Drum Beat is heavily influenced by Brazilian & Afro-Brazilian rhythms. Fresh from the latest release ‘Aburá’, Let Drum Beat create a space of collective energy exploring sisterhood through music.\\n\\n**Las Witchas**\\n\\nA London-based music and multidisciplinary arts collective of Latin American women, Las Witchas! fuse Afro-Latin rhythms with poetry, dance and performance to experiment with new sounds, share urgent political and social issues, and honour the cultural keepers of our territories.\\n\\n**Palacio de Poetas**\\n\\nAn artistic platform empowering Spanish and Spanglish-speaking poets through multidisciplinary work including poetry, music, and cinematic storytelling. They create inclusive artistic communities in spaces in London & beyond where artists can connect.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2296\",\"name\":\"Movimientos\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"movimientos-6ey2\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772913600,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\