ties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by VIBE LDN.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1737367200,\"id\":\"6943dedb1cc65f00018ca0fa\",\"name\":\"LOVERS ROCK UK x RnBX\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**LOVERS ROCK UK x RnBX**\\n\\nLondon Club Night Edition\\n\\nDate: Saturday 7th March 2026\\n\\nTime: 10:00 PM – 4:00 AM\\n\\nLast entry strictly 1:00 AM\\n\\nVenue: The Camden, 65 Crowndale Rd, London NW1 1TN\\n\\n**Event Description**\\n\\nGet ready for an unforgettable night in the heart of London as Lovers Rock UK joins forces with RnBX to deliver a smooth, soulful club experience like no other. This special collaboration brings together the very best of Lovers Rock, Reggae classics, and timeless R&B, creating the perfect soundtrack for a grown, stylish crowd who appreciate quality music and good vibes.\\n\\nSet inside the iconic Camden venue, expect an electric yet intimate atmosphere where culture, rhythm, and romance meet on the dancefloor. From slow jams to feel-good anthems, this is a night designed for music lovers who know how to enjoy the finer side of nightlife.\\n\\n**Music Policy**\\n\\nOur DJs will be serving a carefully curated selection of:\\n\\n\\\\- Lovers Rock classics\\n\\n\\\\- Old school & new school Reggae\\n\\n\\\\- R&B slow jams & anthems\\n\\n\\\\- Dancefloor favourites to keep the energy flowing all night\\n\\nA seamless blend of old school nostalgia and fresh selections, guaranteed to keep you moving from start to finish.\\n\\n**Contact**\\n\\n📧 loversrockuk1@gmail.com\\n\\n📞 07939 583 424\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2249\",\"name\":\"VIBE LDN\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"vibe-ldn-a6xq\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772920800,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\"