:\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"egg-ldn-jx7m\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://egglondon.co.uk/faqs/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-07T23:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-18/a9184df5-0d09-4d6f-b8b0-4ebf758a58b7.jpg?rect=0%2C180%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-18/a9184df5-0d09-4d6f-b8b0-4ebf758a58b7.jpg?rect=0%2C396%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-18/a9184df5-0d09-4d6f-b8b0-4ebf758a58b7.jpg?rect=144%2C0%2C792%2C1440\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/sa773b5ecca5?dice_id=sa773b5ecca5\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H823b6d1fadd?dice_id=H823b6d1fadd\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/O456040c32f9?dice_id=O456040c32f9\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N796a6632722?dice_id=N796a6632722\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n2bd82b04ee5?dice_id=n2bd82b04ee5\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s6d54ddf41b1?dice_id=s6d54ddf41b1\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":\"rescheduled\",\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"a3ead428a6c1b92b:74\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by EGG.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1719925200,\"id\":\"68f8f8d09646970001f25a1b\",\"name\":\"Elexsandom / London Debut\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Elexsandom will be making his London debut with us on Saturday, 7th March, at Egg London.**\\n\\nElexsandom, a 26-year-old internationally acclaimed DJ and producer, has made waves in the music industry. Born into a family immersed in music, with a pianist father, his destiny was sealed from a young age. With roots stemming from North Africa and Southern Italy, rhythm courses through his veins, drawing inspiration from the vibrant Afrohouse, Afrotech, and Amapiano cultures. His talent and dedication have garnered him collaborations and international experiences that have elevated his profile in the music world. With a thriving presence on social media, Elexsandom’s music reaches millions worldwide, and his performances at international gigs have solidified his status as a respected figure in the industry.\\n\\nEntry Policy at Egg London\\n\\nEgg London is a strictly 18+ venue. To enhance safety and security, we have installed a Club Scan system at the front door. All guests are required to present a valid physical form of photo ID for scanning upon entry. Acceptable forms of ID include an unexpired passport, driving license, provisional driving license, or a photo card featuring the PASS hologram. Please note that photocopies, digital images, or screenshots of IDs will not be accepted under any circumstances.\\n\\nThank you for your cooperation in ensuring a safe and smooth entry process.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"304\",\"name\":\"EGG\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"egg-zko9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772924400,\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Sat 07 Mar\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":0,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2024-11-27T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-08T14:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-10T13:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-08T13:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-08T16:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"ww56wx-canalside-sessions-free-every-sunday-8th-mar-grow-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"954\",\"name\":\"Grow\",\"address\":\"Grow, 98C Main Yard, Wallis Rd, Hackney Wick, London E9 5LN\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5441605,\"lng\":-0.0236324999999624},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"grow-537l\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.growhackney.co.uk/access-accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-08T13:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-07-03/9bdead43-edcb-4c96-94ed-acf3481c6ed9.jpg?rect=0%2C432%2C1728%2C1728\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-07-03/9bdead43-edcb-4c96-94ed-acf3481c6ed9.jpg?rect=0%2C778%2C1728%2C1037\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-07-03/9bdead43-edcb-4c96-94ed-acf3481c6ed9.jpg?rect=151%2C0%2C1426%2C2592\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Pe49eb434412?dice_id=Pe49eb434412\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/nfbed7463362?dice_id=nfbed7463362\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/uac4a71aaf81?dice_id=uac4a71aaf81\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/sbe672557c4d?dice_id=sbe672557c4d\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/eda324d67dd0?dice_id=eda324d67dd0\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Se7c96630e4f?dice_id=Se7c96630e4f\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"a3ead428a6c1b92b:75\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Grow, Hackney.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1732665600,\"id\":\"69398b7dc323900001999d1b\",\"name\":\"Canalside Sessions // Free // Every Sunday\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Experience live global music with master conga player Williams Cumberbache and special guests on Grow’s canalside terrace in Hackney Wick. Set against the River Lea, enjoy world-class performances from the pontoon stage as boats drift by.\\n\\nRelax in our hidden garden, surrounded by greenery, and enjoy homemade dishes from the Brunch or All Day menu. Ease into the weekend with a spritz in hand and sun on your face. Our new Spritz Happy Hour is the perfect way to toast your brunch plans – two for £15, or go alcohol-free with two Crodinos for £10.\\n\\nWith over 30 years in the UK music scene, including collaborations with Goldie and Björk, Williams curates each session with a vibrant mix of jazz fusion, Latin, Brazilian, and African rhythms. Expect solo sets or surprise guest artists.\\n\\nWhether you're a jazz head, a brunch lover, or just after feel-good energy, these sessions offer high-quality music, warm vibes, and a family-friendly space that welcomes dancing.\\n\\nPractical Info\\n\\n- Venue: Grow is a converted warehouse with canalside and indoor seating.\\n- Booking: Tables for up to 8 via OpenTable. Larger groups via enquiry form. Walk-ins welcome.\\n- Weather: Performances are outdoors but may move inside during extreme conditions.\\n- Time: Performances run between 1–4 PM; artists and set times may vary.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"10561\",\"name\":\"Grow, Hackney\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"grow-hackney-rdpy\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772974800,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1669,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-05T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-08T13:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-05T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-08T14:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-08T16:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"8e6ax2-international-womens-day-sljo-big-band-swing-8th-mar-toulouse-lautrec-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3612\",\"name\":\"Toulouse Lautrec\",\"address\":\"140 Newington Butts, Prince's, London SE11 4RN, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4911278,\"lng\":-0.1033709},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"toulouse-lautrec-qmma\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.toulouselautrec.co.uk/faqs/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-08T13:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-05/6ed89f30-a93e-4e8f-9d68-e2b2b92ef139.jpg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-05/6ed89f30-a93e-4e8f-9d68-e2b2b92ef139.jpg?rect=0%2C68%2C2048%2C1229\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-05/6ed89f30-a93e-4e8f-9d68-e2b2b92ef139.jpg?rect=649%2C0%2C751%2C1365\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R953a9b3999e?dice_id=R953a9b3999e\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/gafb1dda915a?dice_id=gafb1dda915a\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Yeaab46cae9e?dice_id=Yeaab46cae9e\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/i63b3115defc?dice_id=i63b3115defc\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/M8134bfc36eb?dice_id=M8134bfc36eb\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ffd18f0032f3?dice_id=Ffd18f0032f3\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"a3ead428a6c1b92b:76\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Toulouse Lautrec Jazz Club.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1770249600,\"id\":\"6984be6903272e0001593226\",\"name\":\"International Women's Day | SLJO Big Band & Swing\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"International Women’s Day Special: Big Band Jazz & Swing\\n\\nCelebrate International Women’s Day with an electrifying night of big band brilliance as the South London Jazz Orchestra takes over Toulouse Lautrec. This special performance shines a spotlight on the powerful legacy of women in jazz, alongside the great swing traditions that shaped the genre.\\n\\nFrom the golden era of big band jazz to modern favourites, expect fresh, contemporary arrangements inspired by the music of legends such as Glenn Miller and Duke Ellington, with a celebratory nod to the women who helped define and transform the sound of jazz across generations.\\n\\nWith the irresistible drive of a full big band in our intimate setting, dancing in the aisles is not just allowed, it’s encouraged. Or simply raise a glass, sit back, and enjoy a joyful, high-energy celebration of music, rhythm, and women’s creative influence.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"14685\",\"name\":\"Toulouse Lautrec Jazz Club\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"toulouse-lautrec-jazz-club-ryy6r\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772978400,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1965},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-13T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-08T16:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-13T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-08T15:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-08T23:45:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"v39a3v-wayout-arts-sierra-leone-benefit-with-morcheeba-live-more-8th-mar-fox-and-firkin-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Morcheeba - Killed Our Love\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0EfaJilzzpzz4TlO2T