t_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"This International Women’s Day, LVLS opens its doors for a genre-blurring celebration of women in music.\\n\\nOn March 8th, from 5pm, expect a soul-soothing journey.\\n\\nFrom alt-R&B to country pop, indie folk to modern soul. A carefully curated lineup of rising voices and boundary-pushers takes the stage for a night that honours creativity, power and perspective.\\n\\nOpening the evening are indie risers **Denisaa** and **Liv Joel**, two artists quietly making serious waves with emotionally sharp songwriting and magnetic live presence.\\n\\nSupport comes from **Saachisen**, fresh from sharing stages with Tom Odell and crowned Best Emerging Artist at the Eastern Eye ACTAs 2025, alongside **Mabes**, whose heartfelt, country-tinged storytelling has earned support from BBC Radio 1.\\n\\nMain support **Diamond 24** bring a rich, immersive live experience, blending classic soul and funk foundations with sleek, contemporary R&B influences. The band create a sound that feels both nostalgic and refreshingly modern, pulling audiences into every rhythm and vocal run.\\n\\nTopping the bill is **Nazare Twinkle**, bringing a genre-bending set ahead of her upcoming summer album release. With ethereal vocals and a sound that blends alt-R&B textures with soulful pop sensibilities, she closes the night in style.\\n\\nThis isn’t just a gig. It’s a celebration of women shaping the sound of now.\\n\\n*March 8th. Hackney Wick. Be there.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"14743\",\"name\":\"LVLS London & The Engine Rooms\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"lvls-london--the-engine-rooms-3oonv\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1772989200,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1601,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-09T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-08T23:45:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-09T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-08T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-09T00:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"xe6m2a-ladies-love-dankie-house-party-debut-8th-mar-house-party-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Wizkid & Asake - Jogodo\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/jogodo/1867908237?i=1867908454&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Wizkid & Asake\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/82/42/7a/82427aaa-0012-28f2-a1d7-f4dc58b7aa16/mzaf_8312211163811258783.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Jogodo\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"13966\",\"name\":\"House Party\",\"address\":\"61 Poland Street, Westminster, London, W1F 7NU, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.51369,\"lng\":-0.13664},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"house-party-92emn\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-08T17:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/532a75a7-3179-4576-acff-1cd49f155481.jpg?rect=0%2C147%2C1179%2C1179\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/532a75a7-3179-4576-acff-1cd49f155481.jpg?rect=0%2C383%2C1179%2C707\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/532a75a7-3179-4576-acff-1cd49f155481.jpg?rect=185%2C0%2C810%2C1472\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s24fa87f0b13?dice_id=s24fa87f0b13\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k58c9382447c?dice_id=k58c9382447c\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Id931ffac8b4?dice_id=Id931ffac8b4\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/nc6e8870855a?dice_id=nc6e8870855a\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/oe6df7054d94?dice_id=oe6df7054d94\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T22e304522c3?dice_id=T22e304522c3\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"a3ead428a6c1b92b:81\",\"properties\":[\"selling_fast\"],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Dankie Sounds.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1770595200,\"id\":\"698a04cd0ad62f0001083270\",\"name\":\"Ladies Love Dankie · House Party Debut\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"★AN IMMERSIVE SPACE OF ABSOLUTE VIBES\\n\\n★MUSIC BY - NICKY SUMMERS, MIRACLE, SERENITY SOUNDZ, SWEETNY IVY, JACINTA, LIZZIE ROSE, CEE LANI\\n\\n★HOST & INSTRUMENTS - TSUNAMI TANIA AND ONIEL\\n\\nLadies Love Dankie is BACK!! It’s the sounds that’s been very quickly winning the hearts of all music lovers across the world… and we’re bringing it to the city of London! We’ve got some of our favourite female DJ’s in the capital spinning all the biggest tunes from Amapiano to Afrobeats. We have so many diverse elements, you never know what you’re going to be walking into… Afrobeats…. Afro-swing…. either way you just have to be there to experience it! All genders are welcome to attend. NO PHYSICAL PHOTO ID NO ENTRY. We do not accept pictures of ID’s, passports or citizenship cards. Doors Close: 7:00PM SHARP! DO NOT BE LATE! THIS IS NOT A DRILL! THE DOORS WILL BE CLOSED PAST THIS TIME!\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2050\",\"name\":\"Dankie Sounds\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-17/0b19da52-1274-48cb-8a1d-251a7de20934.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"dankie-sounds-banm\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1772989200,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":7859},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-22T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-08T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-22T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-08T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-08T20:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"6dnr97-moon-tang-251-tour-london-8th-mar-earth-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"honest (feat. moon tang)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1sVm0BuqORY7fdazHTCS3K\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/6d4cf12d2244780b26a194db2661226c4cbf5ad9?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"honest (feat. moon tang)\"}],\"donation\":{\"description\":\"At EartH, we want our space to give back to the community. That’s why we teamed up with Progression Sessions to open Studio 36 inside our venue. Studio 36 provides music making facilities and expertise for free to young musicians in London who face a variety of barriers that might prevent them from making the most of their creativity and talent. \\n\\nEvery donation helps keep Studio 36 open and accessible, so that more young people can find their voice, develop their talents and feel supported as they take their next steps.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-28/af5fb538-b9c7-4f41-bf11-48d1d9d6d45a.jpeg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"variants\":[{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":100,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE3MTYxMiwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTQ0OTQ4LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1ODoxMC40MTQyMDVaIiwicHJpY2UiOjEwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MzM0OSwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MzAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":300,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE3MTYxMiwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTQ0OTQ4LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1ODoxMC40MTQyMjlaIiwicHJpY2UiOjMwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MzM1MCwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6NTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":500,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE3MTYxMiwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTQ0OTQ4LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1ODoxMC40MTQyMzlaIiwicHJpY2UiOjUwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MzM1MSwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwMCwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsfQ==\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1000,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE3MTYx