tre\",\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-08T17:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-20/abb69eee-9b36-406f-b2fb-a8b2ba7ca7f9.jpg?rect=502%2C0%2C1975%2C1975\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-20/abb69eee-9b36-406f-b2fb-a8b2ba7ca7f9.jpg?rect=0%2C94%2C2978%2C1787\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-20/abb69eee-9b36-406f-b2fb-a8b2ba7ca7f9.jpg?rect=946%2C0%2C1086%2C1975\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Me2fa0b8dbc7?dice_id=Me2fa0b8dbc7\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k29e282451f2?dice_id=k29e282451f2\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ne20aab43ddd?dice_id=Ne20aab43ddd\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y1bf7fb5fda5?dice_id=y1bf7fb5fda5\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Zc238a2b7e76?dice_id=Zc238a2b7e76\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r95a8588ff6a?dice_id=r95a8588ff6a\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":863,\"name\":\"EartH\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://earthackney.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"498772217287544\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-6QJEY8LKG2\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":\"781332317\",\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":\"nxkPCNyPg5caEN3eyPQC\",\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"a3ead428a6c1b92b:82\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by CHESSMAN UK. \",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1769076000,\"id\":\"696f9ce96b41b90001490edd\",\"name\":\"moon tang \\\"25+1\\\" tour - London\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"This event will take place in EartH Theatre.\\n\\n新生代創作女歌手 moon tang，自2020年首張創作 EP《Dear Moon》嶄露頭角，及後多首作品《趁你旅行時搬走》、《夜闌人靜》等廣受樂迷喜愛，2025 年推出專輯《25》及舉行同名演唱會，以音樂記錄二十五歲成長歷程的點滴與感悟，進一步與聽眾心靈連繫，接續再開展「25+1」系列巡演，先後於台北、廣州、深圳、澀谷、上海及佛山開唱，反應熱烈；2026年3月將首次到訪倫敦，繼續這趟象徵成長與蛻變的音樂旅程。\\n\\nmoon tang, a defining creative voice of the new generation, first came into the spotlight in 2020 with her debut EP “Dear Moon”. Since then, she has captured the hearts of music lovers with a series of well-received works, including “Getaway” and “Moon Night Sonata.”\\n\\nIn 2025, moon tang released her album “25” and staged a concert of the same title, using music to chronicle her reflections and growth at age 25, forging a deeper emotional connection with listeners. She then continued the journey with her “25+1” concert series, performing in cities such as Taipei, Guangzhou, Shenzhen, Shibuya, Shanghai, and Foshan to enthusiastic responses.\\n\\nIn March 2026, moon tang will make her London debut, carrying forward this musical journey that symbolizes growth, transformation, and self-discovery.\\n\\nFor more information on access at EartH, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/44dzl75 or contact us at access@earthackney.co.uk\\n\\nEartH is a social enterprise committed to supporting new musicians, with music studios in the venue that are completely free for young artists to use. When you attend a show in EartH Theatre, head to the back of the space to rent a cushion for just £2. Not only will you get to sit more comfortably, but all proceeds go towards funding Studio 36. Find out more here: https://earthackney.co.uk/about/studio-36/\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ event. (14-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"11564\",\"name\":\"EartH\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"earth-yxox\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_u