iginal ticket to ensure availability. These spots are limited for sold out events.\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":67462,\"title\":\"Can I upgrade my CD to an LP or the other way around on the night?\",\"body\":\"Sometimes this is possible, sometimes not. It all depends on if we have extra stock on the night!\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":67463,\"title\":\"If there is a signing at the event, can I have a photo with the artist?\",\"body\":\"We want everyone to enjoy their moment at these special intimate events. Although this is solely at the discretion of the artist or their management, there may be some cases where they don’t want photos.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":67464,\"title\":\"Do you have accessible seating?\",\"body\":\"Accessible seating can be requested prior to the event through dice.fm/contact or by contacting us directly. Please note that we only have a very limited number of seats available for sold out events.\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":67465,\"title\":\"Is Rough Trade East London wheelchair accessible?\",\"body\":\"Rough Trade East London is wheelchair acccessible via ramp, and has an accessible toilet.\",\"order\":4},{\"id\":67466,\"title\":\"If there is a signing at the event, can I bring other stuff to get signed?\",\"body\":\"This is purely at the discretion of the artist and management.\",\"order\":5},{\"id\":67467,\"title\":\"Where do I pick up my album?\",\"body\":\"When you arrive, a member of staff will scan your ticket and give you your pre-order upon entry. In some cases the album will be shipped and there will be a print to be signed instead. You won’t be able to collect the album on the way out after the event.\",\"order\":6},{\"id\":67468,\"title\":\"How long is the show and is there a support act?\",\"body\":\"Unless stated, there is just one set with no support, these are usually shorter than your average headline set. They’re between 30-50 minutes, playing songs from the new release or a Q&A. There is an hour between the door time and the stage time.\",\"order\":7},{\"id\":67469,\"title\":\"How do I know when it starts?\",\"body\":\"The doors and set times are listed on your DICE ticket and on the DICE event. This differs from store to store.\",\"order\":8},{\"id\":67470,\"title\":\"I don’t have a CD/Record player, can I just buy a ticket for the gig?\",\"body\":\"Unfortunately no, if general entry/free entry tickets aren’t listed there is no way to buy a ticket without an album.\",\"order\":9}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Katherine Priddy\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-10-24/a01789f3-efb1-42aa-9e3b-c701e47c8262.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"41355\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":true,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"202\",\"name\":\"Rough Trade East London\",\"address\":\"The Old Truman Brewery, 150 Brick Lane, London E1 6QL\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5217064,\"lng\":-0.0722892999999658},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-04-22/07d0d459-3704-44e0-b9e6-2a2920355fb6.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"rough-trade-east-london-4bwm\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://dice.fm/help/article?id=29038379509137\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-08T18:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-07/9bbfa9b9-3c26-4f45-a245-2f152688ce86.jpg?rect=1080%2C0%2C4320%2C4320\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-07/9bbfa9b9-3c26-4f45-a245-2f152688ce86.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C6480%2C3888\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-07/9bbfa9b9-3c26-4f45-a245-2f152688ce86.jpg?rect=2052%2C0%2C2376%2C4320\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ida83189ce65?dice_id=ida83189ce65\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/B46818b527b9?dice_id=B46818b527b9\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/G0eb96e5320f?dice_id=G0eb96e5320f\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Xea9458db02e?dice_id=Xea9458db02e\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z7ac2e09649e?dice_id=z7ac2e09649e\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/pf4c58d79001?dice_id=pf4c58d79001\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":88,\"name\":\"Rough Trade\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.roughtrade.com/gb/privacy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"140305603371460\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-1783149-3\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"a3ead428a6c1b92b:86\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Rough Trade.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1767952800,\"id\":\"695e2ee0fba5d10001101893\",\"name\":\"Katherine Priddy: Live + Signing\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Rough Trade East is very excited to present an in-store live performance and signing from Katherine Priddy. This unique event celebrates the release of their new album 'These Frightening Machines' released via Cooking Vinyl.\\n\\nTickets for this event also include a physical copy of the fantastic new album on your format of choice to be collected from Rough Trade East on the day of the show.\\n\\nMore product information can be found HERE >> https://www.roughtrade.com/product/katherine-priddy/these-frightening-machines\\n\\nAccessibility:\\n\\nFor accessible tickets, free PA/Carer tickets and other accessibility requests please go to dice.fm/contact. Rough Trade is wheelchair accessible with step free access.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"236\",\"name\":\"Rough Trade\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-04-22/9fc79b92-f049-4139-9903-f93a90a88363.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"rough-trade-jqgp\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1772992800,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":718},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-12T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-08T16:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-12T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-08T18:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-08T20:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"pyrldk-trio-havisham-8th-mar-conway-hall-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":3},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3223\",\"name\":\"Conway Hall\",\"address\":\"25 Red Lion Square Holborn, London WC1R 4RL UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.51948760000001,\"lng\":-0.1168424},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"conway-hall-obq5\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.conwayhall.org.uk/about-us/faqs/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-08T18:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-22/c56b7b4d-475d-4ae9-ad0a-6539d7f04918.jpg?rect=160%2C0%2C960%2C960\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-22/c56b7b4d-475d-4ae9-ad0a-6539d7f04918.jpg?rect=0%2C96%2C1280%2C768\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-22/c56b7b4d-475d-4ae9-ad0a-6539d7f04918.jpg?rect=376%2C0%2C528%2C960\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ma9f9b37460f?dice_id=Ma9f9b37460f\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x47c2b924440?dice_id=x47c2b924440\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q34ed919a6f3?dice_id=q34ed919a6f3\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q10b2a39ba53?dice_id=Q10b2a39ba53\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/md82fe9da675?dice_id=md82fe9da675\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R53538f9de73?dice_id=R53538f9de73\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"a3ead428a6c1b92b:87\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Conway Hall.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1765497600,\"id\":\"6925bb00badc120001ae2639\",\"name\":\"Trio Havisham\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Trio Havisham** is an award-winning ensemble praised for its flair and balance. Winners of the Musicians’ Company Award at Wigmore Hall (2023), they have also earned prizes at Lyon and CAVATINA competitions. Supported by ChamberStudio and the Hans Keller Forum, they have worked with leading artists including members of the Takács and Doric Quartets. The trio has a special interest in the music of Bohuslav Martinů, recording his *Cinq* pièces brèves in 2023. Formed at the Royal Northern College of Music, where they won the Christopher Rowland Ensemble of the Year Prize, they now continue studies at the Guildhall School and Royal Academy of Music.\\n\\n**Rihm** | Fremde Szene I\\n\\n**Beethoven** | Trio in G Op.1/2\\n\\n**Martinů** | Trio No.3 in C H332\\n\\n**Brahms** | Trio No.3 in C minor Op.101\\n\\nMagdalena Riedl • *violin*\\n\\nSeth Collin • *cello*\\n\\nZany Denyer • *piano*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an all ages event. Under 16's must be accompanied by an adult.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"5578\",\"name\":\"Conway Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"conway-hall-5nry\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1772994600,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1006},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-16T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-08T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-16T18:30:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-08T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-08T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"avpm97-f-the-patriarchy-8th-mar-the-engine-rooms-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\