gix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/179ce49d-6f46-42cb-a116-3048340f1015.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"id\":\"6989db34ccec920001cc8db6\",\"name\":\"Luca Firth\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Metropolis Music Presents\\n\\nLuca Firth\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/fucalirth/?hl=en\\n\\nPlus Special Guests\\n\\nLondon-based singer-songwriter Luca Firth crafts indie-folk that balances intimacy with quiet ambition. Blending organic instrumentation with gentle electronic textures, his music explores self-reflection, human connection and the natural world with warmth and sincerity.\\n\\nFollowing his debut A Year of Grace, recorded in his grandparents’ garage in rural Italy, which drew comparisons to Leif Vollebekk, Ben Howard & Bon Iver, Luca has been developing a new body of work that builds on the foundations he's been developing - expansive, cinematic and deeply human.\\n\\nHaving grown a loyal following across London’s live circuit, with sold-out shows at Folklore & St Pancras Clocktower, Luca performs with his evolving ensemble Luca Firth and The Big Eagle, moving between hushed trio sets and sweeping, full-band arrangements. His performances are immersive, heartfelt, and full of space - a glimpse of what’s to come in the year ahead.\\n\\n\\\\-\\n\\n*🍕 £1 off our pizza with this ticket!*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-10T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-09T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-10T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-09T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-09T23:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Luca Firth - Wings\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5aCK7p3xR3PE0zYzXraK7l\",\"artist\":\