olk and experimental music! This edition features Wildwood Daddy, Louis Gardner, Everett and Panik Deluxe.\\n\\n\\\\-\\n\\n*🍕 £1 off our pizza with this ticket!*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-05T09:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-10T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-05T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-10T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-10T23:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Wildwood Daddy - O (Breathe of the Local Mandolin)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0U328qh6eL5u3y2kmCfSBF\",\"artist\":\"Wildwood Daddy\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/9600b4124c82233dc92b787dc10d1d200cac1744?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"O (Breathe of the Local Mandolin)\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Theatreship.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":69387,\"title\":\"Theatreship Accessibility Policy\",\"body\":\"Theatreship is committed to broadening access to the arts - we know that ticket price is a huge barrier for some. If the regular ticket price is beyond what you feel able to afford for whatever reason, please don't hesitate to email us at tickets@theatreship.co.uk and we will send a ticket at whatever price works for you, no questions asked.\\n\\nDue to the historic nature of the ship, we’re sorry to say there is not currently step-free access into the theatre space. We have dedicated staff on hand to help with stairs, and an onsite wheelchair once you’re inside the venue. If you have any access needs, please do e-mail us at access@theatreship.co.uk, we're always happy to hear from you, and we'll do whatever we can to help!\",\"order\":0}],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"14088\",\"name\":\"Theatreship\",\"address\":\"South Quay Plaza 2, London, England E14 9SH, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.500574,\"lng\":-0.01734},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-16/325a798f-118c-4bd1-ad3e-4bfdd4f477dc.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"theatreship-yo272\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-10T16:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"140292\",\"name\":\"Theatreship\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-16/51664b22-6eb3-4e8a-8a59-f7fb6862942d.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"theatreship-dx586\",\"profile_active\":true},\"announcement_date_unix\":1768608000,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/td7969e1d9e3?dice_id=td7969e1d9e3\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J0d9d0cc706a?dice_id=J0d9d0cc706a\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F27cfa6e601d?dice_id=F27cfa6e601d\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/if5cce4c4a87?dice_id=if5cce4c4a87\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/vc612a82c364?dice_id=vc612a82c364\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W3ad0f56e21b?dice_id=W3ad0f56e21b\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"av3gwx-guest-event-mazaika-django-chutney-10th-mar-theatreship-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1773171000,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"49dcf1c1636e57c2:19\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":927,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-14/1e2c1918-663d-4e7a-82e6-8e15640615cb.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C5108%2C5108\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-14/1e2c1918-663d-4e7a-82e6-8e15640615cb.jpg?rect=0%2C1022%2C5108%2C3065\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-14/1e2c1918-663d-4e7a-82e6-8e15640615cb.jpg?rect=1150%2C0%2C2809%2C5108\"},\"id\":\"697616fdac68d6000186ae1c\",\"name\":\"Guest Event - Mazaika & Django Chutney \",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"A very special night, with 3 scheduled performances. Django Chutney will perform a set of classic gypsy-jazz; Mazaika will perform a set of their unique blend of world-folk. This will be followed by a performance with both acts together, combining virtuosic jazz, violin, accordion and world music.\\n\\nDjango Chutney have been described as a virtuosic gypsy-jazz ‘manouche et trois’, with equal parts due respect for the genre, unruly chaotic energy, and a huge dose of tongue-in-cheek humour.\\n\\nCombining tightly woven three part vocal harmonies reminiscent of 30’s and 40’s American vocal groups the Mill’s Brothers and the Ink Spots; ridiculous guitar show-offery that draws as much from Django Reinhardt as it does from Guthrie Govan; Double bass solo’s that drag Pop’s Fosters slap technique kicking and screaming into the 21st century; and a repertoire that’s seemingly firmly rooted in the 30’s Hot Club era, but will suddenly transport you through decades and styles, from New Orleans jazz, to Chicago blues and Parisian Musette, effortlessly, respectfully, but most importantly: with true joie de vivre!\\n\\nMazaika combine violin, domra, accordions, theatricality, and humour to create a show full of dazzling virtuosity and intoxicating passion!\\n\\nHaving spent the past two decades enchanting audiences from the Cadogan Hall to Glastonbury and far beyond, they will transport you from the fairytale Russian Steppe to a flickering Romany campfire with the slip of a bow.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 12+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-17T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-10T23:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-17T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-10T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-10T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Monstera Black\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"132453\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Markus Nikolaus\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebc37545d56895f4bea4d36620\"},\"artist_id\":\"132452\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Paper Dress Vintage.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"373\",\"name\":\"Paper Dress Vintage\",\"address\":\"352a Mare Street, London, E8 1HR, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.54733,\"lng\":-0.05467},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-03-29/13fc3fd2-f3f2-4ebb-b479-d3d2d7cf5214.jpg?rect=683%2C0%2C2731%2C2731\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"paper-dress-vintage-ja37\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://paperdressvintage.co.uk/faqs\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-10T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2624\",\"name\":\"Paper Dress Vintage\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"paper-dress-vintage-67xq\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1768492800,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/je6674555981?dice_id=je6674555981\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N7b817fce964?dice_id=N7b817fce964\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H4470f29fd6c?dice_id=H4470f29fd6c\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w2065b48d773?dice_id=w2065b48d773\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Jf20915168fa?dice_id=Jf20915168fa\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W7832f0f2438?dice_id=W7832f0f2438\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"xe2n3k-markus-nikolaus-presents-the-acid-kids-10th-mar-paper-dress-vintage-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":220,\"name\":\"Paper Dress Vintage\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1196387937118330\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":false,\"show_opt_in_form\":false,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1773171000,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"impression_id\":\"49dcf1c1636e57c2:20\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1122},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-16/823b5569-b659-4873-8088-07db43bdc5a0.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1600%2C1600\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-16/823b5569-b659-4873-8088-07db43bdc5a0.jpg?rect=0%2C320%2C1600%2C960\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-16/823b5569-b659-4873-8088-07db43bdc5a0.jpg?rect=360%2C0%2C880%2C1600\"},\"id\":\"696a1ac73af4200001a07d7b\",\"name\":\"Markus Nikolaus presents “The Acid Kids”\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"10.03.2026\\n\\nBERLIN TAKEOVER +++\\n\\n“MARKUS & THE ACID KIDS” LIVE + IMISSMYMOM & MONSTERA BLACK are coming to LONDON!\\n\\nOn March 10th, 2026, Hackney’s Paper Dress Vintage turns loud, dark, and deliciously electric.\\n\\nBerlin’s hottest music export **Markus Nikolaus** and his band “The Acid Kids” headline a sweaty London night of post-punk tension, sharp hooks, and raw rock ’n’ roll glamour. Joining them are local heroes **IMISSMYMOM** - the up and coming Hackney outfit that are famous for their crazy energy-fuelled warehouse concerts and **Monstera Black** (XL RECORDS) from Berlin, bringing fractured rhythms, nervy guitars, big vocals and a sexy, no-rules energy to the room.\\n\\nThree acts. Two Berlin-based, One East London based. One big headline show in London.\\n\\nDoors open 7.30pm — expect distortion, desire, and the kind of underground atmosphere that lingers long after the amps go quiet.\\n\\nAfter their infamous live debut in Berghain Kantine - Markus & The Acid Kids will be making this an ecstatic night of pure and passion dripping live music.\\n\\nLINE UP:\\n\\nMarkus & The Acid Kids\\n\\nIMISSMYMOM\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-15T16:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-10T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-15T16:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-10T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-10T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"HARTES PORZELLAN & Markus Nikolaus - All in Your Head\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/all-in-your-head/1719096290?i=1719096292&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"HARTES PORZELLAN & Markus Nikolaus\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview116/v4/0f/25/ec/0f25ecc9-7649-fabf-a876-51bfaaf4b8c6/mzaf_14343688918705562465.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"All in Your Head\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Ella Raphael\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb1fe5cfe3863ee40e70fa6125\"},\"artist_id\":\"102995\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Product85.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":67636,\"title\":\"Entry Requirements\",\"body\":\"Always bring ID.\",\"order\":0}],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"14448\",\"name\":\"The Elephants Head\",\"address\":\"224 Camden High Street, Camden, London, NW1 8QR, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.54071,\"lng\":-0.14392},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-elephants-head-6dd93\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.elephantsheadcamden.com/index\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-10T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"134792\",\"name\":\"Product85\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"product85-d92ge\",\"profile_active\":true},\"announcement_date_unix\":1769684400,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/j7772a125317?dice_id=j7772a125317\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/cf73fffad0d2?dice_id=cf73fffad0d2\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/I40c80253c91?dice_id=I40c80253c91\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s6862ce26492?dice_id=s6862ce26492\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/d6a3d46ea473?dice_id=d6a3d46ea473\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Bb1b4a1eaf0c?dice_id=Bb1b4a1eaf0c\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"nvkg39-ella-raphael-10th-mar-the-elephants-head-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1773171000,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"49dcf1c1636e57c2:21\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":0,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\