"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-01/a12b771c-64b4-40f9-8ea9-80a99779e95b.jpg?rect=1118%2C0%2C4903%2C4903\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-01/a12b771c-64b4-40f9-8ea9-80a99779e95b.jpg?rect=0%2C310%2C7139%2C4283\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-01/a12b771c-64b4-40f9-8ea9-80a99779e95b.jpg?rect=2221%2C0%2C2697%2C4903\"},\"id\":\"6957bff14a6bc60001bdc6b2\",\"name\":\"The Deadlians\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"The Deadlians are an absolutely phenomenal Dublin based band with a cult following who play a heady mix of folk songs and punk rock with a touch of psychedelia tying it all together.\\n\\nWith thumping drums, a humming synth, evocative guitars and bucket loads of inventive vocal ornamentation, The Deadlians really come together in the catchiness of their arrangements.\\n\\nThey are looking to create their own identity in the alternative folk music scene and their sound evokes a faintly darker edge to the new generation of Irish alternative trad/folk groups performing today.\\n\\nLed by Dublin man Sean Fitzgerald, singer, balladeer, songwriter, poet, storyteller and musician, The Deadlians started in 2019 as a four piece and are now a fully-fledged Irish trad-psych-punk rock five-piece.\\n\\nOne of Ireland's best kept secrets and one not to be missed…\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-01T13:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-11T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-01T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-11T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-11T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"The Deadlians - I Don't Want To Ride Your Aul One Anymore\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/370kWqwpgIWeR23yallOwf\",\"artist\":\"The Deadlians\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/b75c17cc22ab4daaf968db31fa602daddfe40eb8?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"I Don't Want To Ride Your Aul One Anymore\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"The Deadlians - The Ultimate Gurrier\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/the-ultimate-gurrier/1609678353?i=1609678354&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"The Deadlians\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview116/v4/73/d6/f1/73d6f10c-8abe-5f25-2f5c-73525fb91a9a/mzaf_15298296757804109966.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"The Ultimate Gurrier\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Hot Box Live Community Interest\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3785\",\"name\":\"Hot Box\",\"address\":\"28 Viaduct Rd, Chelmsford CM1 1TS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.7359952,\"lng\":0.4672127},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-06-29/9ff0c867-708b-4d5c-834d-a927e4e4ae83.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"5eb9799ae1727402966007e1\",\"name\":\"Chelmsford\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.736717,\"lng\":0.466083,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-r7wq\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.hotboxlive.co.uk/accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-11T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"4307\",\"name\":\"Hot Box Live Community Interest \",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-live-community-interest-7v77\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1766188800,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/zd1239a5bd0e?dice_id=zd1239a5bd0e\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m209273547c6?dice_id=m209273547c6\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N6c0b19c47d1?dice_id=N6c0b19c47d1\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/xef31ad6e3ad?dice_id=xef31ad6e3ad\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s2245452152b?dice_id=s2245452152b\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e1fb148001f3?dice_id=e1fb148001f3\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"7dq9a6-radiator-solitude-sometimes-is-11th-mar-hot-box-chelmsford-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1773255600,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"49dcf1c1636e57c2:29\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":800,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-20/d8a7e19f-703b-459d-8b7a-4671a8e62b47.jpg?rect=256%2C0%2C1536%2C1536\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-20/d8a7e19f-703b-459d-8b7a-4671a8e62b47.jpg?rect=0%2C154%2C2048%2C1229\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-20/d8a7e19f-703b-459d-8b7a-4671a8e62b47.jpg?rect=602%2C0%2C845%2C1536\"},\"id\":\"6946d8a8739dc20001a530c7\",\"name\":\"Radiator / Solitude Sometimes Is\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Radiator**\\n\\nLondon's most exciting and vital post-punk band Radiator are undertaking a tour in support of their debut EP, ‘Glass’, which reached the Top 40 of the Official Vinyl Singles Chart in December.\\n\\nThe group deliver a high-octane blast of indie that brings to mind Joy Division at their most frantic, The Ramones at their most combustible, and The Smiths at their most direct.\\n\\nWith plays on BBC6 Music and Radio X, and a host of festival dates booked for 2026, Radiator are set to become flag-bearers for the UK indie scene having already sold out shows across London, Cambridge, and Essex.\\n\\nInstagram: @radiatorbanduk\\n\\n**Solitude Sometimes Is**\\n\\nSolitude Sometimes Is melts poetic pretensions with punk-folk vibes to tackle that nagging question: is modern life rubbish?\\n\\nHis debut album 'Float' was recorded with Elbow drummer Alex Reeves, and balances anthemic, Pyramid Stage-sized tunes with wistful, last-orders-at-the-bar odes to all that has got away.\\n\\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/solitudesometimesis/\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-20T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-11T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-20T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-11T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-11T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Lost Society\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"76245\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true},{\"name\":\"Awake Again\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb1ce08a165e8bb2427e1a93bc\"},\"artist_id\":\"133893\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Underworld.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":63807,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":63808,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":63809,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-11T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-03-11T23:00:00+00:00\"}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1765792800,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F8c4735fa3e9?dice_id=F8c4735fa3e9\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n7ea7934c310?dice_id=n7ea7934c310\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/j2711fa4f0f5?dice_id=j2711fa4f0f5\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/L113b61f5e2b?dice_id=L113b61f5e2b\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c8fde9c272b3?dice_id=c8fde9c272b3\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a4987a1ff27c?dice_id=a4987a1ff27c\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"xe7ake-lost-society-11th-mar-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1773255600,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"49dcf1c1636e57c2:30\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1968,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-11/980178c1-d417-4556-ace9-b025754c000e.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1367%2C1367\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-11/980178c1-d417-4556-ace9-b025754c000e.jpg?rect=0%2C274%2C1367%2C820\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-11/980178c1-d417-4556-ace9-b025754c000e.jpg?rect=308%2C0%2C752%2C1367\"},\"id\":\"693a7abb1679d500018e8778\",\"name\":\"LOST SOCIETY\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"'TOUR IS A STATE OF MIND'\\n\\nRelentless energy returns to the stage — and something new is on the horizon\\n\\nFinland’s fiercest export LOST SOCIETY are thrilled to announce their return to the road with a blistering Spring 2026 UK & Europe Tour.\\n\\nKnown for their explosive live performances and untamed stage presence, the band will once again unleash their signature intensity on audiences across the continent.\\n\\nKicking off in March 2026, the tour will see LOST SOCIETY hit cities throughout the UK, Germany, Netherlands and Switzerland. Fans can expect a high-voltage set packed with fan favourites, ferocious riffs, and the band’s unmistakable adrenaline-charged energy.\\n\\nAnd that’s not all—while details remain under wraps for now, LOST SOCIETY are hinting that new music is already in the works, with a brand-new album on the horizon. The upcoming tour promises to offer the very first taste of what’s next.\\n\\nFrontman Samy Elbanna comments: \\\"LOST SOCIETY will be finally bringing a full headline set full of new music and old favourites to Europe and the UK in early 2026 and we urge you to secure your tickets right away! We can’t wait to be up and close with all of you once again, and show you what the newest chapter of LxSx sounds like.\\\"\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-15T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-11T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-17T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-11T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-11T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Backspace - Lost Society\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/lost-society/1739601725?i=1739601731&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Backspace\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/31/48/11/314811b8-5d26-e24c-4c53-0d9c56dc6d36/mzaf_7391019009449116041.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Lost Society\"},{\"type\