y prize, from drinks vouchers to exclusive merchandise from artists that have previously played the venue. Use the #supportthesupports through socials when you discover a new favourite act at Islington Assembly Hall.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":57461,\"title\":\"Age Restricition\",\"body\":\"This is a 14+ event – 14 and 15 year olds must be accompained by an adult. You may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"order\":3}],\"max_tickets\":8,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"34\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"address\":\"Upper Street, London N1 2UD\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5395894,\"lng\":-0.102482699999996},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-02-10/05562e9c-c684-4beb-b818-4e908bbfb14d.jpg?rect=712%2C0%2C2832%2C2832\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-z8e2\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/about/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-12T18:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1607\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-78g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1764691200,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T4e898cacc56?dice_id=T4e898cacc56\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ua4a9b23aa18?dice_id=ua4a9b23aa18\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P8331e3d6223?dice_id=P8331e3d6223\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ra8482bcc670?dice_id=Ra8482bcc670\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y7710b19d067?dice_id=y7710b19d067\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/zfe914441e60?dice_id=zfe914441e60\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"yonk7v-justb-aqua-halo-eu-2026-12th-mar-islington-assembly-hall-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/legal-information/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"679202632593023\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-980124-39\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"date_unix\":1773340200,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"impression_id\":\"49dcf1c1636e57c2:58\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":4794},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-28/2eef37b6-64f4-4ca9-ad4d-9c6366d88cf1.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-28/2eef37b6-64f4-4ca9-ad4d-9c6366d88cf1.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-28/2eef37b6-64f4-4ca9-ad4d-9c6366d88cf1.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"id\":\"692f0e664c69ef000158ac3c\",\"name\":\"JUSTB: AQUA HALO EU 2026\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Europe, get ready! Justb is coming for their first-ever European tour, bringing explosive energy, flawless choreography, and unforgettable performances. Fans can expect exclusive stage moments, surprises, and a chance to sing and dance along with the boys. This isn’t just a concert—it’s a one-of-a-kind experience you’ll remember forever. Whether you’ve followed them from the start or are joining for the first time, don’t miss your chance to witness history in the making. Tickets are limited—grab yours now and be part of Justb’s European debut!\\n\\n*Islington Assembly Hall has launched 'Support the Supports' a campaign to help introduce more music lovers to the up-and-coming acts that open the show! Show up to the venue prior to 8pm and you are in with a chance to win a mystery prize, from drinks vouchers to exclusive merchandise from artists that have previously played the venue. Use the #supportthesupports through socials when you discover a new favourite act at Islington Assembly Hall.*\\n\\n*By purchasing a ticket to this event you are agreeing to adhere to Islington Assembly Hall's terms and conditions: https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/customer-terms-conditions-2022/*\\n\\n*All tickets to shows at Islington Assembly Hall are subject to a Venue Levy of £1.50 + VAT. As a Grade II listed building, this levy will be reinvested into Islington Assembly Hall and its services, meaning the customer experience can continue to be enhanced.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-02T16:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-12T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-08T16:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-12T18:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-12T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"JUSTB - TRUE HEART\",\"