8\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/e7aec06c-e931-4058-b7c6-9026960dd7ef.jpg?rect=0%2C915%2C2798%2C1679\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/e7aec06c-e931-4058-b7c6-9026960dd7ef.jpg?rect=435%2C0%2C1929%2C3508\"},\"id\":\"696f7a4e0d25f800013e68cb\",\"name\":\"cryer mya\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"cryer mya headlines The Blue Basement to celebrate the release of their debut EP ‘The Matter in the Water’.\\n\\nThe project emerged as South London songwriter Rishi Saluja began capturing songs in his bedroom, drawing together influences such as Nick Drake, King Krule and Andy Shauf to create a lush, dreamy and mellow indie folk blend.\\n\\nThe band are quickly picking up supporters, with Spotify adding their debut single ‘Leylines’ to Fresh Finds, radio play from Jess Iszatt as well as multiple tracks being included in Tom Robinson’s ‘Fresh Faves’. The music is also connecting with new fans as despite a complete DIY/self releasing approach, the music has ticked up over 200k streams.\\n\\nSupport on the night comes from Frozen Fountain and Charlie Franklin.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-21T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-12T18:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-21T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-12T18:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-12T21:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"cryer mya - A Circle Forms\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2OOGE9kZ0hdgy2WFLrCyMi\",\"artist\":\"cryer mya\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/0e3ec09aba3a4375f231c99672a44037f4dd4aaf?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"A Circle Forms\"