s of EPs each with its own mood and identity. The completed series now finds its home on the band’s third album, ‘Orbital Collection’ released on August 22nd. They are an ever evolving group who are constantly creating and rarely staying still.\\n\\n“a glorious display of ambient folk” (Glide Mag).\\n\\nSupport TBA\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-03T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-12T19:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-03T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-12T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-12T23:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"The Rabbitts - Nothing Strange\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4D9APdFOFxHrV34hGEKVbb\",\"artist\":\"The Rabbitts\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/2010ef85c7d04bbbb4d19a3a78494c9d3147f773?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Nothing Strange\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"The Rabbitts - Nothing Strange\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/nothing-strange/1755904209?i=1755904210&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"The Rabbitts\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/f9/24/db/f924dbd6-b20a-0f47-ced8-5ab609e3672a/mzaf_9518160885425127379.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Nothing Strange\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Former Champ\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb34ae749169e69d3f081c7951\"},\"artist_id\":\"131891\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Flypaper\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-12-08/ffb5fe1a-fcbe-4b0d-ac64-c041fa97c9f