Mix. Navigating jazz, neo-classical, and elements of electronica, for this special performance Andrew will be joined on stage by an ensemble, including strings, brass and woodwind to perform songs from his forthcoming new album. The evening will also include music taken from his four Scottish Album Of The Year award nominated albums. Not to be missed!\\n\\n★★★★ - Mojo Magazine\\n\\n★★★★ - The Scotsman”\\n\\n★★★★ - The Skinny”\\n\\n★★★★ - The List\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-12T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-12T21:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-14T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-12T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-12T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Andrew Wasylyk - Last Sunbeams of Childhood\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/71V11K82QEUaTymY20CHGJ\",\"artist\":\"Andrew Wasylyk\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/1b6f4161f93e740e374be78b7bc736d84ef232e2?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Last Sunbeams of Childhood\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Andrew Wasylyk - Last Sunbeams of Childhood\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/last-sunbeams-of-childhood/1518077241?i=1518077243&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Andrew Wasylyk\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/e0/1e/e4/e01ee475-8afe-be6a-5525-606c73d9e7cf/mzaf_10380112361800770986.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Last Sunbeams of Childhood\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Tessa Rose Jackson\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-03-13/efbec5e1-5a3b-411e-8d0