4T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-12T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-12T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Strange World\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/7mzsTVSdNv4ImiZnLjIaH8\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/60fa118b4c1070168699e65980ccaa999e6484ec\",\"track_name\":\"Strange World\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Huarinami\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-05-01/3076b326-9084-41c0-8778-3b3fb66ad186.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"118117\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"big long sun\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-06-06/bc473717-2b95-4f26-9ca3-3a00a977d6e8.jpg?rect=0%2C53%2C534%2C534\"},\"artist_id\":\"122421\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"plantoid\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-01-07/8081b0b4-143a-45fd-9522-67e354a312a5.jpg?rect=0%2C55%2C531%2C531\"},\"artist_id\":\"66922\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"After the runaway success of their debut album Terrapath, Plantoid return with their sophomore release: the enigmatic, arresting, and at times downright catchy Flare. The Brighton based band return to Hackney's Moth Club on 12th March 2026\\n\\nStaying true to the band's math-rock roots, the album is awash in heavy, reverberated guitar licks, tempo changes, and mind-altering chord progressions - all while expanding Plantoid’s signature sound towards new horizons, like wall-of-sound shoegaze and vocal-forward rock-pop. It does what all second albums do best; retain the core DNA that set its predecessor apart from the fray, yet evolve enough to excite old fans and new listeners alike.\\n\\nNot just in terms of progressive rock, but leaning into the urge of always pushing forward, always discovering something new, excavating the layers and layers of stratified sediment between them until only a gleaming, polished stone remains. It’s this dedication to the expansion of their craft that makes them both endlessly fascinating, and one of those most intensely imaginative rock bands in the UK today.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Bad Vibrations\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"43\",\"name\":\"MOTH Club\",\"address\":\"Old Trades Hall, Valette Street, London E9 6NU\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5450825,\"lng\":-0.0546326999999565},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-04-14/0164c968-c9f6-4e55-8329-e0a12ce43b69.jpg?rect=341%2C0%2C1367%2C1367\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"moth-club-43ox\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://mothclub.co.uk/Access\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-12T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"12\",\"name\":\"Bad Vibrations\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-09-15/dfc81b8e-e212-4b13-a954-3348aa9a856e.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"bad-vibrations-jqa4\",\"profile_active\":true},\"announcement_date_unix\":1759222800,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/jf903ba0058b?dice_id=jf903ba0058b\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z5857bbb04ef?dice_