 have guided the band from dive bar misfits to cult legends.\\n\\nNow, after six years away from the road, The Growlers return for their first world tour since 2019, with dates spanning Australia, the UK, Europe, and North America. The comeback arrives alongside two brand-new singles, “Crisis” and “Feel My Funk,” signaling a bold new chapter for the band while staying true to their unmistakable sound and unshakable spirit.  \\n  \\nIf you have any queries or would like more information about access at Village Underground, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/3EhSLgF, or contact access@villageunderground.co.uk.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-04T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-13T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-07T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-13T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-13T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Night Ride\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2O07FF1DMc1oRDlkIo33FC\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/6609adcacce881c531dae4d0f9cf2e02c9081930?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Night Ride\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"The Growlers - Love Test\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/gb/album/love-test/1169349881?i=1169350062&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"The Growlers\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview71/v4/91/92/fd/9192fddd-6ee3-0157-e2dc-2e51b0816b41/mzaf_893288825610056303.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Love Test\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Tres Kings\",\"image\":null,\"arti