s://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb1a836b79e95b33d74331170e\"},\"artist_id\":\"2732\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true},{\"name\":\"DJ Drez\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebe4b8efa5a2ad6fabcc6950fa\"},\"artist_id\":\"54745\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1761645600,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":48772,\"title\":\"What are the age restrictions?\",\"body\":\"This is a 16+ event. All attendees 16-17s must be accompanied by a responsible adult who is 18 or older (1:1 ratio). To verify age, ID may be requested. We advise all customers to bring valid ID. For further information, see Age and ID in FAQs. Right of admission reserved.\",\"order\":0}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3837},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Grown Man Sport\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6dRj771QZr0KOQVwaB6ykM\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/9c604715ed537c89dd85e758222f96d493fe5df3?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Grown Man Sport\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-16T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-13T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-16T00:15:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-13T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-13T23:45:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Backstage Promotions\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E9a12c4d8c7c?dice_id=E9a12c4d8c7c\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k0eee565352d?dice_id=k0eee565352d\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/X2e61bf5551d?dice_id=X2e61bf5551d\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/idadd10f2e91?dice_id=idadd10f2e91\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ee652acf7890?dice_id=ee652acf7890\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/nd6d28e3f801?dice_id=nd6d28e3f801\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Backstage Pass Battle of the Bands Finalists -\\n\\n***Southern heights***\\n\\n***Rene mills***\\n\\n***Sam Milne & the tyrants***\\n\\n***The Enquiries***\\n\\nSam Milne is a 16 year old from Ipswich, who plays original indie rock music with his backing band- the Tyrants. His lyrics touch on the desparation of teenagers, the current state of global politics and confused romance, taking inspiration from stellar acts like Sam Fender and Fontaines D.C.\\n\\nSouthern Heights are an Alt-indie band from south Essex . Using their music to build tension with explosive release. They have loud guitars, honest songs and a raw live energy that hits hard without restraint.\\n\\nThe Enquiries are a three piece band who play fast paced indie rock, they do flips and play loud, and are influenced by bands like the artic monkeys, vaccines and the cure .\\n\\nRene mills are a fusion rock band from Rayleigh blending various influences to create their own distinct sound. Described as “Fleetwood Mac meets Jimi Hendrix” they are known for their raw, electric sound through funky bass lines, intricate thrashing guitar solos, precision drumming and powerful vocals.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1773428400,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3785\",\"name\":\"Hot Box\",\"address\":\"28 Viaduct Rd, Chelmsford CM1 1TS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.7359952,\"lng\":0.4672127},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-06-29/9ff0c867-708b-4d5c-834d-a927e4e4ae83.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"5eb9799ae1727402966007e1\",\"name\":\"Chelmsford\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.736717,\"lng\":0.466083,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-r7wq\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.hotboxlive.co.uk/accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-13T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"a49ac62417ecfc95:6\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"4307\",\"name\":\"Hot Box Live Community Interest \",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-live-community-interest-7v77\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"69930e1c15e6dd00012549eb\",\"name\":\"BOTB Final\",\"perm_name\":\"v3973v-botb-final-13th-mar-hot-box-chelmsford-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-16/396e25b0-ff37-4e31-81c8-87449681cc01.jpg?rect=0%2C330%2C1320%2C1320\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-16/396e25b0-ff37-4e31-81c8-87449681cc01.jpg?rect=0%2C429%2C1320%2C792\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-16/396e25b0-ff37-4e31-81c8-87449681cc01.jpg?rect=206%2C0%2C908%2C1650\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1771200000,\"faqs\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1000,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-11T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-13T18:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-11T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-13T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-13T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Morocco Bound.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q3f71ae2ae15?dice_id=Q3f71ae2ae15\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Rb4cb9dcb5e0?dice_id=Rb4cb9dcb5e0\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W0bf180b9b0c?dice_id=W0bf180b9b0c\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/t09ae7acca4c?dice_id=t09ae7acca4c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/O828e8ce0386?dice_id=O828e8ce0386\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Xb2f0a7d498d?dice_id=Xb2f0a7d498d\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Elle**\\n\\nElle Massimo is a British R&B and soul singer-songwriter distinguished by her warm, expressive vocals and introspective storytelling. Her sound marries live-infused instrumentation with modern R&B production, creating lush, emotional music that resonates with both heart and groove. Elle’s work blends sensual late-night reflections with honest lyricism, marking her as one of the UK’s exciting voices in contemporary R&B as she continues to grow her catalogue and live presence.\\n\\n**Safiyyah**\\n\\nSafiyyah is a London-based singer-songwriter whose music bridges neo-soul, lo-fi R&B and contemporary jazz with rich, soulful vocal delivery. Born and raised in Ladbroke Grove with Portuguese and Moroccan heritage, her sound is deeply personal and atmospheric, shaped by her cultural roots and the community around her. She first emerged with projects like the Motions EP, showcasing reflective storytelling and smooth, immersive production alongside collaborators from London’s vibrant R&B scene.  \\n  \\n  \\n**PORTIA**  \\n  \\nEmerging singer-songwriter and producer, PORTIA, draws on a decade-long love of R&B and electronic sounds to create what she calls “r&b from outer space.” Born and raised in Sydney, her music weaves together eclectic influences she discovered while trawling through YouTube, SoundCloud, and other hidden corners of the internet in her teens.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1773428400,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"13583\",\"name\":\"Morocco Bound\",\"address\":\"1a Morocco Street, Southwark, London, SE1 3HB, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.50033,\"lng\":-0.082},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"morocco-bound-wnln\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-13T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"a49ac62417ecfc95:7\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,