hip‑hop, his career is a masterclass in dancefloor innovation.\\n\\nHe’s inspired generations of electronic producers, leaving a trail of timeless club anthems like ‘Egypt, Egypt’ and ‘Dial-A-Freak’.\\n\\nFor fans of anything from classic electro to 80s hip-hop, offering a journey through a sound that continues to feel futuristic.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":380,\"name\":\"Columbo Music\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://thecolumbogroup.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"298700384025189\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":1773428400,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"415\",\"name\":\"The Jazz Cafe\",\"address\":\"5 Parkway, London NW1 7PG\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5387845,\"lng\":-0.143146300000012},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-jazz-cafe-4m7k\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://thejazzcafelondon.com/faqs/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-13T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":20,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"a49ac62417ecfc95:13\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\