dden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"The star of EastEnders, Extras, Life’s Too Short and more recently a million viral videos, Shaun has taken the music scene by storm, bringing BARRIOKE to thousands of music lovers at venues and festivals across the UK.\\n\\nShaun hosts BARRIOKE with his trademark warm and jovial manner, accompanying and singing with audience and guest participants on stage, creating a riotous, joyous moment that people will never forget.\\n\\nThis is the ultimate Insta moment, something people will talk about and want to be part of.\\n\\nBARRIOKE is in partnership with Singa Karaoke, organisers of the World Karaoke Championships and pioneers of the streamed Karaoke revolution.\\n\\n“Barrioke is BRILLIANT!” – Chris Moyles\\n\\n“Shout out to the one and only Shaun Williamson, What a ROAR!” – Sam Fender\\n\\n“Don’t put the blame on... BARRY!” – Rag ‘N’ Bone Man\\n\\n**https://www.instagram.com/barrioke_official**\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":941,\"name\":\"Bush Hall\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://bushhallmusic.co.uk/pages/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":1773428400,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"150\",\"name\":\"Bush Hall\",\"address\":\"310 Uxbridge Rd, London W12 7LJ\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5065655,\"lng\":-0.231633699999975},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-10-27/5f32c34f-a15a-457c-9953-ae3fe3a46464.jpg?rect=0%2C47%2C226%2C226\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5