rth London space, New River Studios, with their uniquely danceable anthems. Support comes from Coventry band The Genes with their fizzing jazz-tinged energy and DIY alt-rockers Lunar Riot. We can't wait!\\n\\nNew River Studios is an inclusive and accessible venue. There is step-free access and gender neutral toilets (and very tasty pizza!).\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1773430200,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"829\",\"name\":\"New River Studios\",\"address\":\"199 Eade Rd, London N4 1DN, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5749501,\"lng\":-0.0881636000000299},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"new-river-studios-g5e6\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-13T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"a49ac62417ecfc95:23\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2172\",\"name\":\"Get In Her Ears\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"get-in-her-ears-6ekb\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"698ded713c42eb0001b05d49\",\"name\":\"Get In Her Ears w/ WIDGET \",\"perm_name\":\"xe6rxm-get-in-her-ears-w-widget-13th-mar-new-river-studios-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-12/8a6662bb-3e4c-4c68-b295-c56f02e2be7d.jpg?rect=938%2C0%2C3619%2C3619\",\"landscape\":\"https://