transcend language barriers and stir the emotions, with crunchy harmonies and wonky beats woven into timeless tales of love and loss, fighting and celebration.  \\n  \\nThe choir has also released three albums, collaborated with numerous rock, jazz and classical musicians, and guest-starred on the BBC, on Netflix and at the National Theatre.\\\"\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1773432000,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"17660\",\"name\":\"The Crypt - St Martin-in-the-Fields \",\"address\":\"Trafalgar Sq, London WC2N 4JH\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.509174,\"lng\":-0.126747},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-crypt---st-martin-in-the-fields-q2m7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-13T20:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"a49ac62417ecfc95:33\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"7097\",\"name\":\"Varvara Shvetsova\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"varvara-shvetsova-ayoq\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"6981e1feff64700001ebfa82\",\"name\":\"Mitsubishi Suicide + The London Bulgarian Choir\",\"perm_name\":\"ryn9qy-mitsubishi-suicide-the-london-bulgarian-choir-13th-mar-the-crypt-st-martin-in-the-fields-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/dbae24b5-359