ires Of Alba Concerts\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J1d9d8b742a1?dice_id=J1d9d8b742a1\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/jf142fb89efe?dice_id=jf142fb89efe\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q17488dbaec4?dice_id=q17488dbaec4\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/eb4327536cdb?dice_id=eb4327536cdb\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/G3687c2d0170?dice_id=G3687c2d0170\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/neccc981cf3c?dice_id=neccc981cf3c\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Hailing from the enchanting landscapes of Scotland, Saor emerged onto the metal scene in 2013, leaving an indelible mark with their unique and captivating blend of melodic atmospheric black metal intensity and rich Scottish/Celtic folk influences.\\n\\nAt the heart of Saor's sonic journey stands the creative genius of Andy Marshall. As the driving force behind the band, Marshall's visionary approach to composition blends the harsh grandeur of black metal with the tender melodies of Scottish folklore. Drawing inspiration from the majesty of the Highlands, Marshall's music becomes a conduit through which listeners can connect with the raw power of nature and the storied history of his homeland.\\n\\nBeyond the studio, Saor's live performances stand as transcendent experiences, transporting audiences into the very heart of their sonic tales. The stage becomes a canvas upon which the band paints stories of battles, legends, and the timeless allure of the Scottish landscape. These enthralling shows bridge the gap between past and present, inviting listeners to join a communal journey that celebrates Caledonia's heritage and its enduring connection with nature.\\n\\n\\\\-\\n\\nJoin us for the after party from 11pm to 3am at The Underworld's Blackout Club, get your tickets: theunderworldcamden.co.uk\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":1773432900,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-13T18:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-03-13T22:00:00+00:00\"}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"a49ac62417ecfc95:35\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"68f65cc4ac522300018a188b\",\"name\":\"SAOR\",\"perm_name\":\"q28gbx-saor-13th-mar-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-20/04d10d1e-62a2-4d96-971f-f030bdf99f8d.jpg?rect=563%2C0%2C2250%2C2250\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-20/04d10d1e-62a2-4d96-971f-f030bdf99f8d.jpg?rect=0%2C113%2C3375%2C2025\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-20/04d10d1e-62a2-4d96-971f-f030bdf99f8d.jpg?rect=1069%2C0%2C1238%2C2250\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Oakthrone\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"132129\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Cistvaen\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"132121\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Saor\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb4d49083927818a0dce8ebb0e\"},\"artist_id\":\"18160\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1707833700,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":19233,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":19234,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":19235,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2987,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Forgotten Paths\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1mDupi4yX9KQ3Wh6oSYqNP\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/6d56defe1a725d148449e22a265ff17d7ce9632e?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Forgotten Paths\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Saor - Forgotten Paths\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/gb/album/forgotten-paths/1448927048?i=1448927049&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Saor\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview124/v4/a7/b9/3e/a7b93e82-696d-4d8c-7a5e-bd6acb7b01ba/mzaf_159315986117629085.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Forgotten Paths\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-17T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-13T22:15:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-17T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-13T21:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-14T03:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Percolate Live.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s46c7092d1a4?dice_id=s46c7092d1a4\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z53c80ad8516?dice_id=z53c80ad8516\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Lf4b9aee19cb?dice_id=Lf4b9aee19cb\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N7d11980f528?dice_id=N7d11980f528\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P411a73e256e?dice_id=P411a73e256e\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/S36dfc7de4fe?dice_id=S36dfc7de4fe\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Benyayer returns to the live stage for his first London show of 2026 at one of our favourite intimate venus The Waiting Room on Friday March 13th.\\n\\nWe've managed to curate an incredible line up around the show, featuring a live set from Louf, whose tracks speak to a modern, introspective strain of electronic music, balancing emotional weight with meticulous sound design.\\n\\nOn the dj front we have 2 of our favourites from London including Sharnie and Joe Milli, who will be both opening and closing the party\\n\\nAfter releasing music for more than a decade as Dark Sky, Matt Benyayer, the seasoned music producer and DJ is bringing his new project to the forefront and the live stage. His music is an exploration of sounds tailored for club environments, drawing inspiration from his North African, French and Scottish heritage and the inescapable range of musical influences he absorbed as a teenager growing up in South London.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":272,\"name\":\"Percolate Live\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.iubenda.com/privacy-policy/67589163\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"5378450042281086\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":1773435600,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"41\",\"name\":\"The Waiting Room\",\"address\":\"175 Stoke Newington High Street, London N16 0LH\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5620818,\"lng\":-0.0738883999999871},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-waiting-room-jxea\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-13T21:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\