r_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Nf56564c4408?dice_id=Nf56564c4408\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Qe32940a985b?dice_id=Qe32940a985b\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Acclaimed British duo Prospa bring their anthemic, uplifting, rave energy to the theatre this March.\\n\\nProspa have quickly established themselves as a standout force in UK dance music, with club staples like “Love Songs,” “This Rhythm,” and “Don’t Stop,” all built for peak-time dancefloors and festival moments, distinctively combining a feel of rave nostalgia with contemporary sounds.\\n\\nHaving released on the likes of Circoloco Records, and played the world’s biggest stages, they are flying right now and we can’t wait for them to takeover the theatre for a huge Prophecy after party.\\n\\nSign up now for first access to tickets: presale goes live this Friday at 1pm / General sale 2pm (if any left)\\n\\n3x tickets will be available to purchase per customer, to ensure everyone has a fair chance.\\n\\n\\\\---------------------------------------\\n\\n**IMPORTANT INFORMATION:**\\n\\nPlease see website listing for full info regarding this event.\\n\\nFor VIP & areas please email: bookings@KOKO.co.uk (available on selected nights only).\\n\\nPlease arrive according to the time on your ticket for a smooth and guaranteed entry. Late fees will apply.\\n\\nWe have a zero tolerance policy towards harassment and prejudice.\\n\\nPlease do not purchase tickets through social media, we are unable to help with anyone who has been scammed.\\n\\nWe operate a zero tolerance drug policy.\\n\\nKOKO is 19+. No physical ID, no entry.\\n\\nPlease bring a valid form of photographic ID with you to the event.\\n\\nLast entry 3am. No readmission.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 19+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":918,\"name\":\"KOKO\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.koko.co.uk/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"421051646826847\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":2075,\"name\":\"KOKO 2\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.koko.co.uk/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"2512980718968598\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":1773439200,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"90\",\"name\":\"KOKO\",\"address\":\"1A Camden High St, London NW1 7JE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5347507,\"lng\":-0.138054300000022},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/5f06821a-da0b-4985-9a41-f48ae4872759.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C400%2C400\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"koko-z9b7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.koko.co.uk/access-and-facilities\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-13T22:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":1,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"a49ac62417ecfc95:38\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8108\",\"name\":\"KOKO\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"koko-nwv5\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"697b5b3a28a14700016eaead\",\"name\":\"KOKO Electronic: Prospa\",\"perm_name\":\"q27d89-koko-electronic-prospa-13th-mar-koko-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-29/51d84579-3273-4561-b574-c6156d57bf2b.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-29/51d84579-3273-4561-b574-c6156d57bf2b.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-29/51d84579-3273-4561-b574-c6156d57bf2b.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Prospa\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-01-18/f62f24b1-440c-46c3-9b04-84a405960678.jpg?rect=0%2C1055%2C2075%2C2075\"},\"artist_id\":\"15969\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Since the release of their debut single ‘Prayer’, Prospa have embarked on a rapid ascent to consolidate their status as one of the UK’s most exciting electronic acts. Synthesising the true sound of euphoria in all guises, the duo are experts at crafting dancefloor focused sonics as much as they are revelling in more heartfelt, meditative moments, with the outer reaches of this versatility being broadened from release to release. Prospa showcase their sonic tapestry of high octane club sounds, blissful euphoria, and uplifting emotional stadium anthems.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1769691600,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":72988,\"title\":\"KOKO Accessibility Information\",\"body\":\"The KOKO venue has limited space for accessibility. Accessibility tickets are only purchasable through the KOKO website and once these tickets have been sold, we cannot accept any further accessibility requests. If you require Accessibility tickets and these are no longer available, please do not purchase a GA ticket and expect to be accommodated as these will be refused. This is a strict policy to make sure the venue is safe for all customers.\\n\\nFor further information please see https://www.koko.co.uk/faqs and if you have any questions regarding accessibility contact ACCESS@koko.uk.com\",\"order\":0}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":4965},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"I Want Your Soul - Prospa Remix\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2ZPiyBKaaV2UNmA4JIMW6O\",\"artist\":\"I Want Your Soul\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/f7377040c40a2d1cb7cbff50edcaaaf923e5aaff?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Prospa Remix\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Prospa - Heartbeat (Dance The Night Away)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/heartbeat-dance-the-night-away/1701068890?i=1701069143&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Prospa\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview126/v4/6e/52/20/6e52209c-8528-00ed-7616-e589c6bea293/mzaf_10582620480993750812.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Heartbeat (Dance The Night Away)\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-01T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-14T03:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-01T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-13T22:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-14T06:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by E1 London.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\"