160%2C1296\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/4de87528-6791-4a3d-bc96-df4235b977c9.jpg?rect=486%2C0%2C1188%2C2160\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"A Little Sound\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb2b7b4bac05d058df0ef893d4\"},\"artist_id\":\"40120\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770681600,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":75856,\"title\":\"KOKO Accessibility Information\",\"body\":\"The KOKO venue has limited space for accessibility. Accessibility tickets are only purchasable through the KOKO website and once these tickets have been sold, we cannot accept any further accessibility requests. If you require Accessibility tickets and these are no longer available, please do not purchase a GA ticket and expect to be accommodated as these will be refused. This is a strict policy to make sure the venue is safe for all customers.\\n\\nFor further information please see https://www.koko.co.uk/faqs and if you have any questions regarding accessibility contact ACCESS@koko.uk.com\",\"order\":0}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":2040},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Back In Time\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/68IobwPw3ozbnp2tNjuh9j\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/4fd52437c326ddec770a3780031f8a9d80c3bb80?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Back In Time\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-02T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-14T11:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-02T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-14T14:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-14T19:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Echo Bass Records and This is the Music\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z6ba5c1c800c?dice_id=z6ba5c1c800c\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W8d833ebf59d?dice_id=W8d833ebf59d\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/i5a0136b1d41?dice_id=i5a0136b1d41\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ncb231465049?dice_id=ncb231465049\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Lec57fe6009e?dice_id=Lec57fe6009e\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Rd6730afd493?dice_id=Rd6730afd493\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**The Indie Social**\\n\\nA new daytime indie showcase built for guitar fans, big hooks and proper new-band energy.\\n\\n**Happy Neighbours**\\n\\nWith 2025 EP Southbank to Battersea under their belt and a headline set at the iconic 100 Club, they blend jangly riffs, driving rhythm and singalong choruses that nod to ’90s greats while sounding completely of the moment. **FFO: Blur, The Stone Roses, Oasis**\\n\\n*Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/artist/6MK49CZ0w0JXVgS51MWZWp*\\n\\n**Headwired**\\n\\nPunchy indie-rock with bite. Driving drums, dynamic guitar work and a set that stays tight and loud from start to finish. Headwired bring modern attitude to indie hooks you actually remember. **FFO: Oasis. Arctic Monkeys, Kasabian, Verve**\\n\\n*Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/artist/3UOlYv3Pos0b1lSlTc9gZx*\\n\\n**SHINES**\\n\\nSHINES bring heart-on-sleeve indie with atmosphere, emotional grip and melodic urgency. Signed to Echo Bass Records, they deliver jangly guitars and lyrical depth that cuts through. **FFO: The Smiths, The Cure, Joy Division**\\n\\n*Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/artist/7ij45dM0SSoNySILoFpVkD*\\n\\n**Sunset Ruins**\\n\\nKicking off with classic chorus-led guitar indie and timeless melodic DNA, Sunset Ruins bring upbeat energy and early singalong pull that sets the tone for the day. **FFO: The Beatles, The Kooks, early Arctic Monkeys**\\n\\n*Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/artist/6OrnMRAmGMsHbYiiV020IF*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1773496800,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"51\",\"name\":\"The Social (London)\",\"address\":\"5 Little Portland St, London W1W 7JD\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5174313,\"lng\":-0.140671099999963},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-social-london-zlqw\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.thesocial.com/access/\"},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-14T14:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"a49ac62417ecfc95:45\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"142290\",\"name\":\"Echo Bass Records\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"echo-bass-records-9dye7\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"697cc45af3064a00019dd99d\",\"name\":\"The Indie Social \",\"perm_name\":\"yo6q8r-the-indie-social-14th-mar-the-social-london-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-m