s://link.dice.fm/O4131ac30eb3?dice_id=O4131ac30eb3\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Febdeebb5a04?dice_id=Febdeebb5a04\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/V722d6f0c429?dice_id=V722d6f0c429\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J939f04a4864?dice_id=J939f04a4864\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Children of Zeus are a soul/hip-hop group from two of Manchester’s most respected artists, Konny Kon and Tyler Daley.\\n\\nBoth are recognised MCs and beatmakers in their own right, and the music they make is a nod to the music of their childhood influences and their taste for timeless sounds.\\n\\nTyler Daley, previously known as Hoodman, is a producer, soul singer and rapper, while Konny Kon’s skills as a DJ, producer and rapper allow them to provide honest, self-deprecating views of life and love.\\n\\nWorking with the likes of Beat Butcha (known for his work with Jay-Z, Westside Gunn, Beyoncé and SZA) on their latest project, Balance, Children of Zeus have built up a solid fanbase and reputation for a serious live show.\\n\\nSupport comes from Tomorrow’s Warriors, a Southbank Centre Resident Organisation.\\n\\nThe ticket price includes a £2 venue restoration levy.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 14+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":\"1c381828-86dd-4f2b-9d28-ed6f89c79409\",\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":228,\"name\":\"Southbank Centre\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.southbankcentre.co.uk/policies/privacy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1145741552151564\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-86802192-1\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":17735112