50-1e4a-4525-94a0-80ea72d62994.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"FEROCIOUS DOG\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/834c27bbb8e25bb0d34bc063e33150ce3fafff8b\"},\"artist_id\":\"15923\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1763978400,\"faqs\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3088,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Ferocious Dog - Slow Motion Suicide\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4gUL8uvKNdTxvLQm0byyyq\",\"artist\":\"Ferocious Dog\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/6a7ab78c2d21e23fd2553faf26b4c2a6edc9b20c?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Slow Motion Suicide\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-12T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-14T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-12T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-14T18:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-14T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Portals.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w047a28f7e7f?dice_id=w047a28f7e7f\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Oe85e5d4476f?dice_id=Oe85e5d4476f\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ha2b7be8f75b?dice_id=Ha2b7be8f75b\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Da2a764ecb5f?dice_id=Da2a764ecb5f\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/nc50c5ed7c4a?dice_id=nc50c5ed7c4a\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/fb1788087888?dice_id=fb1788087888\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Hailing from Lyon, France, Ni are one of the most exciting experimental bands around at the moment. Taking influence from prog rock, jazz, math-rock, post-hardcore and psych, their music transcends boundaries with it's wild experimentation, complex time signatures and virtuosic musicianship.\\n\\n\\\"Math Rock? Noise? Metal? Jazz? On these 10 new tracks, Ni delights more than ever in blurring the lines and confusing their audience, remaining true to their desire to go further in experimentation.\\\" - It's Psychedelic Baby Magazine\\n\\nFFO: Don Caballero, The Dillinger Escape Plan, King Crimson\\n\\nChaos Reigns - \\\"Maddening, warp-speed hardcore\\\" according to Metal Hammer. Taking influence from the jagged edge of hardcore that emerged in the 90s and early 00s with bands like Converge and Dillinger at the forefront.\\n\\nFFO: Dillinger Escape Plan, Converge, Every Time I Die\\n\\nPocket Lint - A chaotic two piece band from London & Brighton who make and perform \\\"adequate\\\" garage / stoner rock.\\n\\nFFO: Queens of the Stone Age, Clutch\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":96,\"name\":\"JaguarShoes Collective\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"http://www.jaguarshoes.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"429057253484103\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":762,\"name\":\"Portals\",\"privac