:\"The Grace has 12 steps into the venue, with no disabled toilet. There is no accessible area inside the venue. Companion ticket for someone to assist them up the stairs and to the toilet & early access available.\\n\\nDirect contact: accessibility@thegarage.london\",\"order\":0}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1983,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Hot Bath\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6WX0NZW9FU15xlyb1K2WZU\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/8b5af4d8ec94b15350f12d9ee4a89bfb9ff8c00b?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Hot Bath\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-16T16:15:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-14T20:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-16T16:15:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-14T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-14T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Garageland promotions and Positive Deviants.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":null,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/bda4e4d70fb9?dice_id=bda4e4d70fb9\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/xd84b150d27f?dice_id=xd84b150d27f\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/yaf7516ca273?dice_id=yaf7516ca273\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y33fe8df1147?dice_id=y33fe8df1147\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h2bbdc1e4252?dice_id=h2bbdc1e4252\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/sfc0e67d4011?dice_id=sfc0e67d4011\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"A special show by Garageland and Positive Deviants to celebrate the end of Spike’s photography exhibition PICTURE THIS: A PUBLIC IMAGE and the start of The Art Of Anarchy: 50 Years Of Punk at Camden Open Air Gallery (COAG).\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/garageland_promotions/\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/positive_deviants/\\n\\n**Please come early. Bands from 7:30-10:30pm**\\n\\nFREE ENTRY but please reserve via DICE\\n\\n**Electric Cowboy Club (E.C.C.)**\\n\\nhttps://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100086639792571\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/electriccowboyclub__/\\n\\nHigh energy charismatic batshit crazy trashy rock’n’roll punk rock reprobates from Brighton.\\n\\n**Francis Pig**\\n\\nFrancis Pig play anti-passive rock & roll with an avant-garde, poetic edge. Built on repetitive rhythms, throbbing basslines and distorted guitars, their songs explore the undercurrents of desire, pleasure and pain in the rawest form. Their erotically charged live set has turned heads by bringing something exciting to the scene: they’ve shared bills with no wave icon Lydia Lunch, supported L.A. Witch and Automatic on their European tours last year, and headlined several grassroots venues across Brighton.\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/francisxpig/\\n\\n**Lawmen**\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/lawmentheband/\\n\\nInspired by renegades, mavericks and outlaws, Lawmen are a new garage punk band who ride the open trail between punk rock, country, blues and rootsy rock 'n roll.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"LNZRT\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://lanzaroteworks.com/Privacy-Policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_con