roduce more music lovers to the up-and-coming acts that open the show! Show up to the venue prior to 8pm and you are in with a chance to win a mystery prize, from drinks vouchers to exclusive merchandise from artists that have previously played the venue. Use the #supportthesupports through socials when you discover a new favourite act at Islington Assembly Hall.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":57461,\"title\":\"Age Restricition\",\"body\":\"This is a 14+ event – 14 and 15 year olds must be accompained by an adult. You may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"order\":3}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3239,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Goca Dünya\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5QO3UJc1gF1ummP75n2b3R\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/f7ef4521b03d5052f4783e7a07cb91e0c151096d?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Goca Dünya\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-21T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-14T22:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-21T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-14T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-14T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Old Blue Last.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":null,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/pd938682db9d?dice_id=pd938682db9d\",\"post_competition_referral\