y age, ID may be requested. We advise all customers to bring valid ID. For further information, see Age and ID in FAQs. Right of admission reserved.\",\"order\":0}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3384},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Jens Lekman - A Higher Power\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/a-higher-power/447873491?i=447873546&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Jens Lekman\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/23/36/8f/23368f0c-043b-adae-e498-f2b7e241baac/mzaf_12119799789756457424.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"A Higher Power\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Jens Lekman - A Higher Power\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2BKfOJm0hEzvwUzJGUQG9E\",\"artist\":\"Jens Lekman\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/05468eab45dfee481166ff12b229dc8079b2e43f?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"A Higher Power\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-09-05T00:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-14T22:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-09-05T00:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-14T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-14T23:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Fire in the Mountain Festival LTD.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A71461404e74?dice_id=A71461404e74\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Hc1fcdb19675?dice_id=Hc1fcdb19675\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Xfdd43f6ff28?dice_id=Xfdd43f6ff28\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v46b602552fb?dice_id=v46b602552fb\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/g112c46dd4b5?dice_id=g112c46dd4b5\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Gb0c10b12ea0?dice_id=Gb0c10b12ea0\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"It's the day we honour the patron saint of Ireland! We focus on Irish Ceili dances, drink stout, and serve Irish Stew and Champ.\\n\\nAbout The Dancing  \\nAlthough called many things; Ceilidh, Country Dance, Barn Dance, Ceili Dance, Square Dance, Set Dancing - one thing is certain, it's all \\\"traditional\\\" and how people would entertain themselves before TV and raves. We have a live band on stage to provide the music, and a \\\"Dance Caller\\\", who is expert at teaching you all the simple and fun moves. First we learn the dance by walking through it with the caller, then the band strike up, and we dance to the music. You don't need any experience, just willingness to have a go and have fun.\\n\\nCut A Shine Monthly Dances  \\nYour monthly fix of endorphins inducing barn dance fun - dance and be silly like they used to do before electricity, TV and Netflix! We're excited to be hosting dances every month at The Round Chapel...\\n\\nInclusivity and Diversity  \\nOur dances are All Inclusive, regardless of age, gender, ability, ethnicity or sexual orientation. Although based largely on traditional European and American dance forms, we welcome all cultures and peoples to enjoy these dances and culture. We have tailored our dances to be non-heteronormative and involve everyone. We welcome members of the LGBTQ+ community.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 16+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1773516600,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"2453\",\"name\":\"The Round Chapel\",\"address\":\"1D Glenarm Rd, Clapton, London E5 0NP, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.55224260000001,\"lng\":-0.052109599999994316},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-round-chapel-g9np\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-14T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"a49ac62417ecfc95:80\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8999\",\"name\":\"Fire in the Mountain Festival\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"fire-in-the-mountain-festival-ltd-lbop\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"68bad8e449a97d00016cd9e2\",\"name\":\"ST PATRICK'S DAY DANCE\",\"perm_name\":\"k6o3wo-st-patricks-day-dance-14th-mar-the-round-chapel-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-05/1e27b5bc-b4bd-4044-a8c5-1279f0fd3f9e.jpg?rect=0%2C257%2C1240%2C1240\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-05/1e27b5bc-b4bd-4044-a8c5-1279f0fd3f9e.jpg?rect=0%2C505%2C1240%2C744\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-05/1e27b5bc-b4bd-4044-a8c5-1279f0fd3f9e.jpg?rect=138%2C0%2C965%2C1754\"},\"unicorn\":false,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":3},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1757026800,\"faqs\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1300},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-22T15:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-14T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-23T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-14T20:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-15T01:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Big Penny Social\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/V6e3907707f5?dice_id=V6e3907707f5\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Fa9fda254a9c?dice_id=Fa9fda254a9c\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ue4ae9d08929?dice_id=ue4ae9d08929\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h1655b7c8da3?dice_id=h1655b7c8da3\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/od3e09801dcd?dice_id=od3e09801dcd\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y6f8a9e06fe9?dice_id=Y6f8a9e06fe9\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Dust off your dancing shoes and dig out something green, because our legendary St Patrick’s Day party is returning once again. We’re throwing a full-blown Irish knees-up, packed with live music, Irish dancers and plenty of reasons to raise a glass.\\n\\nTaking to the stage is the brilliant **Solas Trio**, serving up Irish tunes and party hits that’ll have you singing and dancing in no time. Adding extra magic to the night, the incredible **Maguire O’Shea dancers** are back with their. That’s not all, we’ll also have a **Big Penny DJ** to keep the party going till 1am.\\n\\nThis is one of our most-loved nights of the year, and tickets always fly, so grab a limited early bird while you can and get ready for a proper St Paddy’s celebration.\\n\\nSláinte! 🍀\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event. \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":676,\"name\":\"Big Penny Social\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://bigpenny.co.uk/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"5746367065411442\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":1773518400,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"7425\",\"name\":\"Big Penny Social\",\"address\":\"1 Priestley Way, London E17 6AL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.59085509999999,\"lng\":-0.04131809999999999},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-09-15/018322b6-65c3-40f9-851e-9d09dfa35252.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1000%2C1000\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"big-penny-social-ayxd\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-14T20:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":10,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"a49ac62417ecfc95:81\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"9555\",\"name\":\"Big Penny Ltd\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"big-penny-ltd-7mq6\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"69724fd87752d600017286b5\",\"name\":\"St Patrick's Day Party\",\"perm_name\":\"3og6gp-st-patricks-day-party-14th-mar-big-penny-social-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-01-06/c32665bf-321c-4cbf-8958-f1aa7bb29a32.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-01-06/c32665bf-321c-4cbf-8958-f1aa7bb29a32.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-01-06/c32665bf-321c-4cbf-8958-f1aa7bb29a32.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1769094000,\"faqs\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":900,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-18T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-15T03:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-18T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-14T20:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-15T06:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by E1 London.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/l6b4b70173c3?dice_id=l6b4b70173c3\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p1954bf045a1?dice_id=p1954bf045a1\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/L999029092f9?dice_id=L999029092f9\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W4774f49d4cb?dice_id=W4774f49d4cb\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b7535d262774?dice_id=b7535d262774\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P56d741c28f2?dice_id=P56d741c28f2\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"On 14 March, we’re opening the doors at 8pm and not stopping until 6am for an extended session of House excellence, starting with an infamously off-kilter live set from Session Victim during the day, before Detroit Legend Omar-S takes us deep into the night on his return to London. A proper marathon the way house music was meant to be played.\\n\\nA defining figure in underground dance music, for over 20 years Omar S has moved entirely on his own terms - releasing raw, soulful, music from Detroit on his FXHE label and letting the records speak for themselves.\\n\\nHailing from Berlin and deep diggers at heart, Session Victim are deeply embedded in vinyl culture with a sound is built from years of crate-digging - sample-laden, warm, and steeped in soul, jazz and early house. Their rare live set brings something there is nothing quite like out there: Session Victim as a two-man house band, rebuilding that deep, dusty sound in real time.\\n\\nThey’re joined by Glenn Underground and Boo Williams.\\n\\nBest friends, spiritual brothers, and quiet torchbearers for Chicago house music, they’ve spent decades shaping the language of house from the inside, setting the standard for timeless house made with intent and soul.\\n\\nFoundations: a 10-hour odyssey from Chicago to Detroit and Beyond\\n\\nHouse music will never die.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1813,\"name\":\"E1 London\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"865291950713044\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\