rs that will keep you moving and grooving all night long! Karol G, Bad Bunny, Myke Towers, Rauw Alejandro, Ryan Castro & more!\\n\\n✨ Room 2: Pop & R&B Heaven ✨ Sing your heart out to all your favourite chart-toppers and classic R&B hits. This room is pure feel-good energy!\\n\\n🇧🇷 Room 3: Baile Funk Explosion 🇧🇷 Experience the vibrant, high-energy sounds of Brazilian Baile Funk. It's an electrifying beat that's perfect for a summer night.\\n\\nsential Info 🚨\\n\\nTime: 11PM - 5AM (last entry at 3AM)\\n\\nAge: 18+ with valid ID (no ID, no entry – sorry!)\\n\\nDress Code: Smart casual, ready to party! No sportswear, caps, or hoodies.\\n\\nFree Entry: Limited free tickets available online until 11:30PM! If you arrive after 11:30PM, a concession price will be charged on the door.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1773529200,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"389\",\"name\":\"Lightbox\",\"address\":\"6A S Lambeth Pl, London SW8 1SP\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.485903,\"lng\":-0.123745999999983},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"lightbox-jx6m\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.lightboxlondon.net/\"},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-14T23:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"a49ac62417ecfc95:91\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"185\",\"name\":\"HVY