"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Remember Sports have always sounded like a band in motion - chasing a feeling, chasing each other, sometimes running from themselves. Over the past decade, they've built a cult following on the strength of bruising live shows, emotionally honest lyrics, and an ever-evolving sound that refuses to be pinned down. With their newest album, The Refrigerator, out February 13, 2026 via Get Better Records, the band captures the messy, cathartic energy of transformation: it’s a record born from uncertainty, grief, growth, and ultimately, love - for the music, for each other, and for the many past selves colliding into the present.\\n\\nThey don’t get to the UK whole bunch, so don’t snooze on the opportunity to catch them at MOTH Club in March - it’ll be one of those nights where you’ll be super happy you showed up.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Pink Mist. \",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:0\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/S7f4e38a40fa?dice_id=S7f4e38a40fa\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T0cba1ec4cc7?dice_id=T0cba1ec4cc7\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b91d976aad53?dice_id=b91d976aad53\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w7a4c1a0bf9d?dice_id=w7a4c1a0bf9d\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r9f606eb1815?dice_id=r9f606eb1815\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v0b6c6032a06?dice_id=v0b6c6032a06\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-05T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-15T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-07T10