15T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Jens Lekman\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebe9bb415c62d141bf0146d23a\"},\"artist_id\":\"3851\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true},{\"name\":\"Family Stereo\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-25/8f0394d7-ef70-423f-b957-6a9a003e0fb8.jpg?rect=0%2C55%2C531%2C531\"},\"artist_id\":\"64462\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":64942,\"title\":\"What are the age restrictions for this event?\",\"body\":\"This is a 16+ event. All attendees 16-17s must be accompanied by a responsible adult who is 18 or older (1:1 ratio). To verify age, ID may be requested. We advise all customers to bring valid ID. For further information, see Age and ID in FAQs. Right of admission reserved.\",\"order\":0}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-11/a97ebdcd-6cbb-4a55-b647-28c9668a0da4.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-11/a97ebdcd-6cbb-4a55-b647-28c9668a0da4.jpg?rect=0%2C240%2C1200%2C720\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-11/a97ebdcd-6cbb-4a55-b647-28c9668a0da4.jpg?rect=270%2C0%2C660%2C1200\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Jens Lekman - A Higher Power\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/a-higher-power/447873491?i=447873546&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Jens Lekman\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/23/36/8f/23368f0c-043b-adae-e498-f2b7e241baac/mzaf_12119799789756457424.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"A Higher Power\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Jens Lekman - A Higher Power\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2BKfOJm0hEzvwUzJGUQG9E\",\"artist\":\"Jens Lekman\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/05468eab45dfee481166ff12b229dc8079b2e43f?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"A Higher Power\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1766052000,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":260,\"name\":\"Bird On The Wire\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.birdonthewire.net/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"168353773761986\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":863,\"name\":\"EartH\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://earthackney.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"498772217287544\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-6QJEY8LKG2\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":\"781332317\",\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":\"nxkPCNyPg5caEN3eyPQC\",\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"This event will take place in EartH Theatre.\\n\\nJens Lekman is an accidental wedding singer. But he’s also a wedding singer for a reason. Ever since his 2004 song “If You Ever Need a Stranger (To Sing at Your Wedding)” he has had a side gig fielding requests from strangers to sing at their weddings. For over twenty years, he’s had a particular vantage point from which to see the role love songs can play in our lives. In 2020, he and novelist David Levithan co-conceived a novel-with-music, Songs from Other People’s Weddings. Originally this album was meant to contain the songs from the weddings in the book, but as the novel came together, Lekman began to imagine what happened between the book’s chapters. The book and the album eventually became intertwined but also found their own paths. The book remained the structure of the story, but the album sometimes snuck behind the scenes. Stories from the songs made their way into the book and vice versa. The result is an exploration of what we sing about when we sing about love -- euphoria, doubt, dislocation, tenderness, conflict, playfulness, gratitude, ingratitude, longing, belonging, questioning, answering. It’s very much about a relationship and how it’s reflected through the relationships and weddings of others, but most of all it’s a lovesong to lovesongs\\n\\nFor more information on access at EartH, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/44dzl75 or contact us at access@earthackney.co.uk\\n\\nEartH is a social enterprise committed to supporting new musicians, with music studios in the venue that are completely free for young artists in Hackney to use. Find out more here (https://earthackney.co.uk/about/studio-36/).\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by BOTW.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:7\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F8d1d38b0405?dice_id=F8d1d38b0405\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/gbf311c74823?dice_id=gbf311c74823\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/mec06b6f43f5?dice_id=mec06b6f43f5\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u25483622ea0?dice_id=u25483622ea0\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R5531fd94071?dice_id=R5531fd94071\",\"pos