sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Indie in Town and Omen Magazine are honoured to welcome back Mood Bored to London! Join us for a free entry show on 15 March 2026 at The Victoria in Dalston.\\n\\nMood Bored is an indie-rock trio based in The Netherlands. With their punchy bass lines, guitar driven melodies and infectious hooks, they construct a sonic landscape that evokes the rush of glittering dance floors, while dreamy vocals and introspective lyrics recall the existentialism of those late-night conversations in the party bathroom. Shifting maniacally between sentiments of near-nihilistic cynicism to earnest hopefulness, Mood Bored articulates what it feels like to be a young adult in a digital era of perpetual chaos. Who said an existential crisis can’t be fun?\\n\\nSupport TBA.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Indie in Town.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:9\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/dc3d4e79a830?dice_id=dc3d4e79a830\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/fbe23ddbbf7d?dice_id=fbe23ddbbf7d\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F052d68b73fd?dice_id=F052d68b73fd\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A29e635c569b?dice_id=A29e635c569b\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Fbe350b686a0?dice_id=Fbe350b686a0\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/i5feb1b029c1?dice_id=i5feb1b029c1\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-06T16:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-15T19:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-06T16:30:00+00:00\"