el_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Presented by Johnnie Walker Black Label × NT’s Loft:**\\n\\nPlayback is a candlelit listening experience where over 200 candles transform NT’s Loft into a glowing sanctuary. Each session is designed to slow the pace, heighten the senses, and invite guests to fully immerse themselves in the music that defines generations.\\n\\nOn Tuesday, 17th March, we turn our focus to Sault, an exploration of one of the most vital and enigmatic collectives in contemporary music. Blending soul, funk, gospel, Afrobeat and raw political expression, Sault’s work moves effortlessly between intimacy and urgency. From the spiritual weight of Untitled (Black Is) and Untitled (Rise) to the groove-driven energy of 5, 7 and Nine, this session celebrates music made to heal, provoke and empower.\\n\\nExperience every rhythm, harmony and moment of emotion through the warmth and precision of Funktion-One sound, all within an intimate, candlelit setting. Johnnie Walker Black Label returns to elevate the evening, with signature serves available throughout the night. **Guests arriving before 8pm will receive a complimentary drink to begin the evening in style** (limited to first 50 customers).\\n\\n—\\n\\nTickets\\n\\nReserved seating ticket holders must arrive by 8:00 PM. **Seating is first come, first served.**\\n\\n—\\n\\nSchedule\\n\\n7:00 PM – Doors & Playlist\\n\\n8:15 PM – Listening Session Begins (90 mins)\\n\\nLimited capacity. Arrive early, stay late.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ ev