8a3/mzaf_11149334950744620525.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Here I Am\"},{\"type\":\"trailer\",\"title\":null,\"redirect_url\":null,\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/8WQsoT3GIB3Ll6UXCaI6Nqeqitt59aNNtiiWm5lBBaU.m3u8\",\"track_name\":\"\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1768564800,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":818,\"name\":\"HERE at Outernet\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://hereldn.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1415783946118882\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-QH4NRPEYW3\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"The Hellp are an American indie-electronic band pushing sonic boundaries with a never-ending evolution and a refusal to be confined to any one genre or audience. Connected through fashion—Dillon as a celebrated photographer and Lucy as a model—they’ve forged their own brand of electroslash chaos. Rising from working-class roots through grit and a shared artistic vision, they’ve become key figures in modern music. Their high-energy shows, genre-blurring productions, and meticulous attention to detail have earned them a cult following. From odd jobs, to fashion’s favorites, to today, on the pages of PAPER, Pitchfork, Complex, The FACE, & more — The Hellp aren’t just setting trends, they’re ushering in the next generation of rockstar.\\n\\n*For accessibility information please see the accessibility information button/link below.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ (U16’s must be accompanied by an adult) - physical photo ID required\",