57600,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":818,\"name\":\"HERE at Outernet\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://hereldn.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1415783946118882\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-QH4NRPEYW3\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":819,\"name\":\"The Lower Third\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://thelowerthird.co.uk/privacy-notice/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"783951717556608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-ZVCKXCPJY8\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Alfreda is a London-based alt-pop artist and performer whose work fuses theatrical pop, spoken-word, and surreal storytelling. Known for her immersive live shows and sharp, self-aware humour, she is building a distinctive artistic world that lives across music, performance, and film.\\n\\nShe holds a quarterly residency at House of Koko with her cabaret series Bedroom Tales - a cult favourite blending music, characters, and confessional performance. Her live reputation includes sold-out headline shows at Servant Jazz Quarters and The Shacklewell Arms, with an expanding audience drawn to her bold concepts and emotionally candid writing.\\n\\nThroughout 2026, Alfreda is rolling out her new project TEASERAMA - a connected universe of singles and visuals depicting the 'greatest show that never existed.' The campaign unfolds over the first half of the year, leading into an album and an ongoing UK and European tour, playfully branded as her “world tour.”\\n\\nAlongside the music, Alfreda is developing a scripted mockumentary following the making of TEASERAMA and her pursuit of pop stardom, blurring reality and performance in a satirical portrait of ambition, artifice, and modern fame.\\n\\nWith one foot in pop and the other in performance art, Alfreda is building not just a catalogue of songs, but an ever evolving visual world for her fans to get lost in.\\n\\n*For accessibility information please see the accessibility information button/link below.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 14+ event (U16's must be accompanied by an adult)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Live Nation\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:26\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e8326a5bcd7d?dice_id=e8326a5bcd7d\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H65c425d8ca0?dice_id=H65c425d8ca0\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c30dd723945c?dice_id=c30dd723945c\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ib521749ddc9?dice_id=Ib521749ddc9\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/V57330c50d0f?dice_id=V57330c50d0f\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q4306e6938f0?dice_id=q4306e6938f0\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-16T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-23T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-17T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1683,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8466\",\"name\":\"Outernet Venue Ltd\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"outernet-venue-ltd-96a7\",\"profile_active\":true},\"id\":\"6966cc3b80209800012a78ec\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Alfreda\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"dk3na6-alfreda-17th-mar-the-lower-third-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1773774000,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1238\",\"name\":\"Folklore Hoxton\",\"address\":\"186 Hackney Rd, London E2 7QL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5306515,\"lng\":-0.07228429999997843},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"folklore-hoxton-2or7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":3},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-11/5ac711a5-f294-4345-937c-4b5cbe369239.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C960%2C960\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-11/5ac711a5-f294-4345-937c-4b5cbe369239.jpg?rect=0%2C192%2C960%2C576\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-11/5ac711a5-f294-4345-937c-4b5cbe369239.jpg?rect=216%2C0%2C528%2C960\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1767744000,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Lydia Laughing return to the stage with a special headline show celebrating the release of their second single, “New Beginnings”, at the intimate Folklore, Hoxton. Make sure to get your ticket now to avoid missing out on an unforgettable evening celebrating London’s alternative folk music scene.\\n\\nLydia Laughing is a London-based alternative folk band comprising of harp, cello, guitar and vocals. Their sound is characterised by the fusion of their musical backgrounds, ranging from classical to dream pop and experimental rock, and is underpinned by the traditional music of their respective countries. The result is a tapestry of sound that feels both new and old.\\n\\nEmmi Maaria - Emmi Maaria is a Finnish singer, violist, and composer based in London, blending contemporary alternative music with classical textures, folk influences, and layers of electronic sound.\\n\\nAdela - Adela's songwriting roams curiously through many sound-worlds, drawing inspiration from the wide range of music that has surrounded her throughout her life. She began writing songs in Paris, where she moved after finishing her degree in classical violin. She eventually brought her songs to London and has since done a songwriting residency at The Royal George, as well as played in venues such as The Finsbury and The Gladstone Arms. Songwriting opened a new door for her to explore her story as well as her instrument.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Folklore Hoxton.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:27\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u688254c0f54?dice_id=u688254c0f54\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/We4d298b8e63?dice_id=We4d298b8e63\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y323bc54707d?dice_id=Y323bc54707d\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q8b61e4691d7?dice_id=Q8b61e4691d7\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a06075474153?dice_id=a06075474153\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ge9e7e6a8a81?dice_id=ge9e7e6a8a81\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-07T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-17T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-19T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-17T23:45:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":800,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2755\",\"name\":\"Folklore Hoxton\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"folklore-hoxton-7ogb\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"695e3d8ac964850001e6dd40\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Lydia Laughing + supports Emmi Maaria + Adela\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"yo6l6p-lydia-laughing-supports-emmi-maaria-adela-17th-mar-folklore-hoxton-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1773774000,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"23\",\"name\":\"The Lexington\",\"address\":\"96-98 Pentonville Rd, London N1 9JB\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5317299,\"lng\":-0.111416400000053},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-lexington-jomz\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.thelexington.co.uk/about.php\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"High Parasite\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb0df739ef0827711138ed02d5\"},\"artist_id\":\"118503\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"The Old Dead Tree\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab67616d0000b273b09d0d88650f27866731124f\"},\"artist_id\":\"51962\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":60223,\"title\":\"Venue Accessibility Information\",\"body\":\"The Lexington is an early Victorian building and as such is not easily accessible for anyone with limited mobility. While the main bar is on the ground floor and accessible without steps the music venue is up a flight of stairs. We’re happy to help with access where possible; for any further information please contact us: info@thelexington.co.uk.\",\"order\":0}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-27/0019808f-d2ff-495e-89d0-0d44ea717514.jpg?rect=200%2C0%2C800%2C800\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-27/0019808f-d2ff-495e-89d0-0d44ea717514.jpg?rect=0%2C40%2C1200%2C720\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-27/0019808f-d2ff-495e-89d0-0d44ea717514.jpg?rect=380%2C0%2C440%2C800\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"High Parasite - Let It Fail\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/23GC99uwEucKiyYX2o9YIe\",\"artist\":\"High Parasite\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/b09a1389d452ec1005c32f2b7ba877e10e3e2ad1?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Let It Fail\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"High Parasite - Let It Fail\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/let-it-fail/1747272271?i=1747272647&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"High Parasite\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/33/4c/b4/334cb4ec-1614-b2a4-be2a-169e744d9916/mzaf_12064893140088372421.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Let It Fail\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1764324000,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1300,\"name\":\"Old Empire \",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"252622951855502\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":false,\"show_opt_in_form\":false,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"“This is not a side project. It’s a new touring and recording band,\\\" declares Aaron Stainthorpe, the long standing frontman with doom metal maestros My Dying Bride, and follows \\\"with our debut studio album, we’re showing our love for all things gothic and grand, along with a collective belief that dark music doesn’t have to be confined to the shadows.\\\"\\n\\nHigh Parasite, driven by Aaron and bassist/vocalist/songwriter Tombs, announces the birth of 'Death Pop' with their debut album 'Forever We Burn', via Candlelight/Spinefarm. Produced by Gregor Mackintosh of Paradise Lost, who also contributes signature guitar lines, the album explores the darker recesses of the human condition and showcases the talents of the band's members, Sam Hill (rhythm guitar), Johnny Hunter (lead guitar), and Dan Brown (drums).\\n\\nFeaturing the singles 'Wasn't Human', 'Grave Intentions', and 'Let It Fail', 'Forever We Burn' is out now!\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Old Empire.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:28\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h0ef594abbc5?dice_id=h0ef594abbc5\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H4f33492cc85?dice_id=H4f33492cc85\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Od78358d9cc8?dice_id=Od78358d9cc8\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/pd3db3b0e39c?dice_id=pd3db3b0e39c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N0572fc286e0?dice_id=N0572fc286e0\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q5d5f5b87c8d?dice_id=q5d5f5b87c8d\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-28T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-17T16:45:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-01T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-17T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1965,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"80\",\"name\":\"Old Empire\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"old-empire-4n2q\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"6929664ebbd68d00011116d1\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"High Parasite\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"8erogw-high-parasite-17th-mar-the-lexington-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1773774000,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"6109\",\"name\":\"Hootananny Brixton\",\"address\":\"95 Effra Rd, London SW2 1DF, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4553934,\"lng\":-0.1132058},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-01-25/a335e145-034f-424c-811e-d996395babfa.jpg?rect=912%2C0%2C3648%2C3648\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"hootananny-brixton-parp\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://hootanannybrixton.co.uk/info/#:~:text=Venue%20Access%20Policy,Phone%20number%20020%2077373%207273.\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Mad Dog Mcrea\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebc7209eeb3fe08861ab866855\"},\"artist_id\":\"3329\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-24/61ad7430-e68c-468a-991f-4897ac982e50.jpg?rect=0%2C29%2C1080%2C1079\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-24/61ad7430-e68c-468a-991f-4897ac982e50.jpg?rect=0%2C351%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-24/61ad7430-e68c-468a-991f-4897ac982e50.jpg?rect=169%2C0%2C743%2C1350\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1764064800,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":495,\"name\":\"Hootananny Brixton\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://hootanannybrixton.co.uk/terms-conditions/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"284708469113050\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":\"CALJTQBC77UCMC06OO60\",\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"St. Patrick's 2026 is going be a BIG one in Brixton... with Mad Dog Mcrea 🇮🇪☘️\\n\\nAfter a big show in 2025, the big DOG returns to Brixton for a night of foot-stomping rhythms, intricate musicianship, and wry, often humorous lyrics that transport audiences on a wild musical journey.\\n\\nHailing from Plymouth & Donegal in Ireland the band has built a reputation for raucous live shows, blending original songs with traditional melodies and a dash of storytelling charm.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Hootananny Brixton.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:29\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Hb02b3ed7b03?dice_id=Hb02b3ed7b03\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K37619401a9b?dice_id=K37619401a9b\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/l567f3f5e1b3?dice_id=l567f3f5e1b3\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u56e1d04b45a?dice_id=u56e1d04b45a\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a3d3df54558e?dice_id=a3d3df54558e\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/C1f5ce7a1449?dice_id=C1f5ce7a1449\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-25T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-17T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-25T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-17T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2337,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8240\",\"name\":\"Hootananny Brixton\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hootananny-brixton-yn9r\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"6924bd32ba26f2000189a1d0\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Mad Dog Mcrea: St Patricks Day and Beyond \",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"pyr7rl-mad-dog-mcrea-st-patricks-day-and-beyond-17th-mar-hootananny-brixton-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1773774000,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"202\",\"name\":\"Rough Trade East London\",\"address\":\"The Old Truman Brewery, 150 Brick Lane, London E1 6QL\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5217064,\"lng\":-0.0722892999999658},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-04-22/07d0d459-3704-44e0-b9e6-2a2920355fb6.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"rough-trade-east-london-4bwm\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://dice.fm/help/article?id=29038379509137\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Olive Jones\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebb269d4b519a626718e8f89e0\"},\"artist_id\":\"43906\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":55945,\"title\":\"How do I arrange a carer/PA ticket?\",\"body\":\"Free PA and Carer tickets can be added onto an existing ticket by reaching out to dice.fm/contact. If possible please request these as soon as possible after purchase of your original ticket to ensure availability. These spots are limited for sold out events.\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":55946,\"title\":\"Can I upgrade my CD to an LP or the other way around on the night?\",\"body\":\"Sometimes this is possible, sometimes not. It all depends on if we have extra stock on the night!\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":55947,\"title\":\"Do you have accessible seating?\",\"body\":\"Accessible seating can be requested prior to the event through dice.fm/contact or by contacting us directly. Please note that we only have a very limited number of seats available for sold out events.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":55948,\"title\":\"Is Rough Trade East London wheelchair accessible?\",\"body\":\"Rough Trade East London is wheelchair acccessible via ramp, and has an accessible toilet.\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":55949,\"title\":\"How long is the show and is there a support act?\",\"body\":\"Unless stated, there is just one set with no support, these are usually shorter than your average headline set. They’re between 30-50 minutes, playing songs from the new release or a Q&A. There is an hour between the door time and the stage time.\",\"order\":4},{\"id\":55950,\"title\":\"If there is a signing at the event, can I have a photo with the artist?\",\"body\":\"We want everyone to enjoy their moment at these special intimate events. Although this is solely at the discretion of the artist or their management, there may be some cases where they don’t want photos.\",\"order\":5},{\"id\":55951,\"title\":\"How do I know when it starts?\",\"body\":\"The doors and set times are listed on your DICE ticket and on the DICE event. This differs from store to store.\",\"order\":6},{\"id\":55952,\"title\":\"If there is a signing at the event, can I bring other stuff to get signed?\",\"body\":\"This is purely at the discretion of the artist and management.\",\"order\":7},{\"id\":55953,\"title\":\"Where do I pick up my album?\",\"body\":\"When you arrive, a member of staff will scan your ticket and give you your pre-order upon entry. In some cases the album will be shipped and there will be a print to be signed instead. You won’t be able to collect the album on the way out after the event.\",\"order\":8},{\"id\":55954,\"title\":\"I don’t have a CD/Record player, can I just buy a ticket for the gig?\",\"body\":\"Unfortunately no, if general entry/free entry tickets aren’t listed there is no way to buy a ticket without an album.\",\"order\":9}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-21/1d4cdcd5-11cc-4980-bb71-2a69324713a0.jpg?rect=0%2C199%2C4672%2C4672\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-21/1d4cdcd5-11cc-4980-bb71-2a69324713a0.jpg?rect=0%2C1711%2C4672%2C2803\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-21/1d4cdcd5-11cc-4980-bb71-2a69324713a0.jpg?rect=625%2C0%2C3423%2C6224\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1764324000,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":88,\"name\":\"Rough Trade\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.roughtrade.com/gb/privacy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"140305603371460\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-1783149-3\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Rough Trade East is very excited to present an acoustic performance, Q&A and signing from Olive Jones. This unique event celebrates the release of their new album 'For Mary'.\\n\\nTickets for this event also include a physical copy of the fantastic new album on your format of choice to be collected from Rough Trade East on the day of the show.\\n\\nMore product information can be found HERE >> https://shop.roughtrade.com/products/for-mary\\n\\nAccessibility:\\n\\nFor accessible tickets, free PA/Carer tickets and other accessibility requests please go to dice.fm/contact. Rough Trade is wheelchair accessible with step free access.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Rough Trade.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:30\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/G13b5cb57549?dice_id=G13b5cb57549\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z53de6646884?dice_id=z53de6646884\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W2658a1f109e?dice_id=W2658a1f109e\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Be56f3bb7cb2?dice_id=Be56f3bb7cb2\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/j45f5d75c20a?dice_id=j45f5d75c20a\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K445b6157a40?dice_id=K445b6157a40\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-28T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-17T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-28T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-17T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2650,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"236\",\"name\":\"Rough Trade\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-04-22/9fc79b92-f049-4139-9903-f93a90a88363.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"rough-trade-jqgp\",\"profile_active\":true},\"id\":\"69203bdb44c0c500018504b6\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Olive Jones: Acoustic/Q&A + Signing\",\"offers_extras\":true,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"g563l2-olive-jones-acousticqa-signing-17th-mar-rough-trade-east-london-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1773774000,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[{\"ticket_type_id\":1114697,\"extra_ids\":[\"1120117\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1114698,\"extra_ids\":[\"1120117\"]}],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":false,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_disabled\"},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"114\",\"name\":\"Roundhouse\",\"address\":\"Roundhouse, Chalk Farm Rd, London NW1 8EH\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5430406,\"lng\":-0.15131180000003},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-24/2fce8c34-cb66-4510-a1d0-f2c07a1f9479.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2889%2C2889\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"roundhouse-4296\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/visit/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Del Water Gap\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb756c9f2be6294d04107ae215\"},\"artist_id\":\"84440\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":52996,\"title\":\"Where are my tickets?\",\"body\":\"**IMPORTANT: Read here about your Roundhouse tickets**\\n\\nPlease note you will need to access your tickets via the Roundhouse Online Wallet at - http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk\\n\\nYour tickets WILL NOT be available in the DICE app. Just follow the below steps below on the day of event to access your ticket to the show:\\n\\nHead to http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk\\n\\nSign in using your DICE account email address - if you already had a Roundhouse account under the same email address, enter the password associated with this email address. If you didn’t have one, Roundhouse will have created one for you and you’ll just need to reset the password before logging in.\\n\\nIf you need to reset your password, you’ll be taken to http://roundhouse.org.uk, but you need to log in again at http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk to access your ticket.\\n\\nThe QR code should appear a couple of hours before the stated time on your ticket\\n\\nIf you want to transfer your tickets to a friend please do so at least 4 hours before the event within the Roundhouse ticket wallet.\\n\\nIf you cannot access your tickets in the Roundhouse online wallet please visit the venue box office when you arrive and one of the team will be happy to assist you.\\n\\nFull information regarding the Roundhouse online wallet can be found at - https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/faqs/digital-tickets/\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":52997,\"title\":\"Security\",\"body\":\"On arrival you will be greeted by our ticket scanners and our security teams. Our security checks include bag searches and a search of individuals using wands. Please be prepared upon arrival to go through this process and help speed up the entry. Our security teams are there for your safety but we recognise that this process can be daunting for some. Please do raise any concerns with staff members when you arrive so that we can support you where needed.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":52998,\"title\":\"Prohibited Items\",\"body\":\"We reserve the right to prohibit specific items from the Roundhouse Premises. A full list of prohibited items can be found in our Admissions Terms & Conditions: https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/terms-policies/admissions-terms/\\n\\nUnfortunately flags and banners are not permitted into the venue as they can obstruct the view for other people in the audience. Please note this list is not exhaustive. The Venue Management has the right to prohibit any other items that are not included in this list but are deemed to cause a risk to the building or people.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":52999,\"title\":\"Accessibility Tickets\",\"body\":\"Accessibility tickets must be booked directly with the venue, not through DICE. Please get in touch with the venue via access@roundhouse.org.uk prior to purchasing.\",\"order\":3}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-24/f4798a1c-1d38-41a6-8a5b-41b42fb7e001.jpg?rect=0%2C797%2C3237%2C3237\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-24/f4798a1c-1d38-41a6-8a5b-41b42fb7e001.jpg?rect=0%2C1444%2C3237%2C1942\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-24/f4798a1c-1d38-41a6-8a5b-41b42fb7e001.jpg?rect=290%2C0%2C2657%2C4830\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":\"668c8537-569b-459b-aa5d-df72d382717b\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1761309900,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1987,\"name\":\"SJM Concerts\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://privacy.sjmconcerts.com/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"d7c5ce90-a8d1-4428-b86c-ddc4f3e88668\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"668c8537-569b-459b-aa5d-df72d382717b\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"about\":{\"description\":\"SJM Concerts Presents\\n\\nDel Water Gap\\n\\nPlus Support\\n\\nThis is an all-ages event (Under 16s accompanied by an adult, Under 14s accompanied and in seats).\",\"highlights\":[]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by SJM Concerts.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:31\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o5836240e6e5?dice_id=o5836240e6e5\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ib99a112c7ee?dice_id=ib99a112c7ee\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A00fdcede704?dice_id=A00fdcede704\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/I504829dbfd4?dice_id=I504829dbfd4\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/pd4b4ae1a75e?dice_id=pd4b4ae1a75e\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Qdf10025547e?dice_id=Qdf10025547e\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-24T13:45:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-16T09:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-10-24T13:45:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-17T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3768,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1141\",\"name\":\"SJM Concerts\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"sjm-concerts-xe8k\",\"profile_active\":true},\"id\":\"68fb793ae022060001181b17\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"d7c5ce90-a8d1-4428-b86c-ddc4f3e88668\",\"name\":\"Del Water Gap\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"perm_name\":\"nv78b9-del-water-gap-17th-mar-roundhouse-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1773774000,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":false,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_disabled\"},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"538\",\"name\":\"O2 Shepherds Bush Empire\",\"address\":\"Shepherd's Bush Green, London W12 8TT\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5032636,\"lng\":-0.22311579999996},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"o2-shepherds-bush-empire-42ap\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.academymusicgroup.com/o2shepherdsbushempire/access\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"dEUS\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-05/d6335c5c-bd71-4994-b663-edc135a9bf88.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"9490\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Upon inking a deal with Island Records in 1993, dEUS became Belgium’s first ever indie act to sign with a major record label. Ever since, the quartet’s unconventional cosy rock offering has dabbled in folk, grunge and jazz styles on albums including 2005’s Pocket Revolution. In 2020, a documentary about the band titled Confessions to dEUS was released to celebrate the 20th anniversary of 1999’s The Ideal Crash.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":43095,\"title\":\"What's the bag policy?\",\"body\":\"Security – Bag Policy\\n\\nLarge bags – including rucksacks are not allowed.\\n\\nThere are no facilities to leave large bags or luggage.\\n\\nIf you really have to bring a bag – and it’s preferable you don’t – please make sure it’s small.\\n\\nOnly one small bag per person is permitted and it must not be bigger than A4 size.\\n\\nHeight: 28.7cm\\n\\nWidth: 21cm\\n\\nDepth 15cm\",\"order\":0}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-05/a2b8c5a3-1d9e-4157-a1c1-12bdff52f50d.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C800%2C800\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-05/a2b8c5a3-1d9e-4157-a1c1-12bdff52f50d.jpg?rect=0%2C160%2C800%2C480\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-05/a2b8c5a3-1d9e-4157-a1c1-12bdff52f50d.jpg?rect=180%2C0%2C440%2C800\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Nothing Really Ends\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1WvInhbItBzIuuVpQIXgPP\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/88157dec17133c4fdad5c5bfc1e352f9c43d227e?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Nothing Really Ends\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":\"a695a669-bcc2-43e4-942c-124cc9914f8a\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1757404800,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1108,\"name\":\"Crosstown Arts\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jQ1s1RZ6Rlwokoii9ruLGF2kLERmrgoThnhAaTxmed0/edit?usp=sharing\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":true},{\"id\":1132,\"name\":\"Storia\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"644901813902966\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-MD3H328PXW\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":false,\"show_opt_in_form\":false,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":1184,\"name\":\"Crosstown Concerts\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.crosstownconcerts.com/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"3d8766b8-dbf8-43cc-9aae-2b4bb1553007\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"a695a669-bcc2-43e4-942c-124cc9914f8a\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Crosstown Concerts Presents...\\n\\ndEUS - Worst Case versus In A Bar\\n\\nNo under 8s. Under 14s must be accompanied by an adult over 18 years old at all times and seated in the balcony.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Crosstown Concerts.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:32\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Of8b1079eab8?dice_id=Of8b1079eab8\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Cd2301598dbc?dice_id=Cd2301598dbc\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/kff92ed318fd?dice_id=kff92ed318fd\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/O0abe7d0d0b2?dice_id=O0abe7d0d0b2\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/B1f115312929?dice_id=B1f115312929\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p9296d1368ef?dice_id=p9296d1368ef\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-09-09T09:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-17T16:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-09-12T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-17T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3591},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"29\",\"name\":\"Crosstown Concerts\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-07-01/f0198251-f9b4-4348-9ac3-5dbcf7739d2b.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"crosstown-concerts-zg5p\",\"profile_active\":true},\"id\":\"68bd726dbc073c0001fff0fe\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"3d8766b8-dbf8-43cc-9aae-2b4bb1553007\",\"name\":\"dEUS: Worst Case versus In A Bar\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"perm_name\":\"bbypam-deus-worst-case-versus-in-a-bar-17th-mar-o2-shepherds-bush-empire-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1773774000,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":false,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-03-17T23:00:00+00:00\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Shanghai Treason\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"26652\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Mr. Irish Bastard\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb54f8b4400a5586814bd7eda0\"},\"artist_id\":\"37337\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":43166,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":43167,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":43168,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-05/852d770d-645b-479c-ae16-5be1e2ab8bad.jpg?rect=1098%2C0%2C4000%2C4000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-05/852d770d-645b-479c-ae16-5be1e2ab8bad.jpg?rect=0%2C200%2C6000%2C3600\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-05/852d770d-645b-479c-ae16-5be1e2ab8bad.jpg?rect=1900%2C0%2C2200%2C4000\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"I Hope They Sell Beer in Hell\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4Mp8P2pDUV7B2PwLSWW1pz\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/117321208b5c61b3458cbe2154308867d9fc2eeb?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"I Hope They Sell Beer in Hell\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Mr. Irish Bastard - Home\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/home/1675701808?i=1675701813&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Mr. Irish Bastard\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview126/v4/83/70/68/8370686b-0324-1499-a639-6e113d6738e3/mzaf_2688502093210893527.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Home\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1757026800,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Mr. Irish Bastard is one of the most formidable and recognised bands amongst the celtic punk genre around the world today. Staying true to the name, the band was formed by purebred Irish Bastard, Chris Lennon in Münster, Germany after a night on the lash with fellow drunkard and deviant, Jan Strecker. Armed with an acoustic guitar and a banjo, the duo quickly recruited a motley crew of likeminded Irish (and German) hooligans and set off to conquer the world, one Irish pub at a time.\\n\\nFour months, roughly three hundred pork pies, ninety packs of cigarettes, fifty seven litres of Jameson, and 3 concussions later, the band emerged from the studio with their first attempt “St. Mary’s School of Drinking”. Seven songs about everything from drinking, to… erm… drinking.\\n\\n… And the rest, is history.\\n\\nHistory they will never remember, unfortunately, because, well… alcohol. Which makes it kinda hard to write a band biography, but according to Google, Mr. Irish Bastard has shared the stage with bands of high ilk, such as The Pogues, Dropkick Murphys, The Levellers and Flogging Molly (to name a few), and performed at some of the most prestigious festivals in Europe.\\n\\nArmed with almost 20 years worth of drunken anthems and nursery rhymes on crack, Mr. Irish Bastard are hurdling towards 2025 with tour plans for everywhere from London to Leipzig in support of “Battle Songs of the Damned”.\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Dead Ferret Productions\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:33\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ef2b209ee09f?dice_id=Ef2b209ee09f\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m839a0e4fe0c?dice_id=m839a0e4fe0c\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/pe0ecb8f3f4b?dice_id=pe0ecb8f3f4b\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K9cccb1cac96?dice_id=K9cccb1cac96\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z9bf1430e895?dice_id=z9bf1430e895\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/g205dc59cfa6?dice_id=g205dc59cfa6\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-09-05T00:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-17T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-09-05T00:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-17T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2987,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"68baffd7fc42e800018c104f\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"ST. PATRICK'S DAY WITH MR IRISH BASTARD\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"perm_name\":\"3oy2vv-st-patricks-day-with-mr-irish-bastard-17th-mar-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1773774000,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"373\",\"name\":\"Paper Dress Vintage\",\"address\":\"352a Mare Street, London, E8 1HR, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.54733,\"lng\":-0.05467},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-03-29/13fc3fd2-f3f2-4ebb-b479-d3d2d7cf5214.jpg?rect=683%2C0%2C2731%2C2731\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"paper-dress-vintage-ja37\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://paperdressvintage.co.uk/faqs\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-17T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Kitty Fitz\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb153e8c15e3c539c3898f3303\"},\"artist_id\":\"28000\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Laura Fell\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebb216aedddb45a5039da1f86d\"},\"artist_id\":\"40549\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-05/5e9c807c-8ba3-41ea-9bed-e5d77d4ec8d4.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-05/5e9c807c-8ba3-41ea-9bed-e5d77d4ec8d4.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-05/5e9c807c-8ba3-41ea-9bed-e5d77d4ec8d4.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Bone of Contention\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0iRoFqaXKiAc7Fih2Hg6yt\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/2efb37f66a1ecfcd0469ee1627c4b0f120f87f7d?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Bone of Contention\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770287400,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":220,\"name\":\"Paper Dress Vintage\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1196387937118330\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":false,\"show_opt_in_form\":false,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Singer-songwriter Laura Fell returns to play her first show in London in over four years. She brings with her a full band to launch her new EP ‘All The Work To Keep At Bay’, recorded with Mercury Prize winning producer Mike Lindsay.\\n\\nFell’s emotional rigour and dedication to the craft of songwriting finds a perfect foil in Mike Lindsay – a collaborator extraordinaire who has produced for Anna B Savage, Guy Garvey, Speech Debelle and Du Blonde, as well as being co-founder of UK acid folk band Tuung and one half of the electronic/alt-psych outfit LUMP with Laura Marling. For Fell, the resulting sonic shift is the next step in a fittingly mindful and self-possessed creative evolution.\\n\\nHaving released her 2020 debut album 'Safe From Me' (Balloon Machine Records) – which saw her noted as an artist of rare promise, gaining high profile press praise and featuring in end-of-year ‘Best Of’ lists – Fell embraced a shift from the bustling energy of London to the coastal haven of East Sussex, and took a short break from making music. Reemerging with renewed momentum, she self-released the 'At Least I Tried’ EP in August 2024, followed by May 2025’s ‘Talk It All Apart’ EP, a five-tracker recorded across a week in Berlin with musician Robert Kretzschmar (Anna Erhard, Albertine Sarges).\\n\\nThis purple patch of inspiration and industry continues with ‘All The Work To Keep At Bay’, with the EPs lead single ‘Earthworm’ already receiving radio play from John Kennedy at X Radio, Deb Grant at BBC 6 Music, and Roddy Hart at BBC Radio Scotland.\\n\\n“Fell’s alto is pure poetry” – Uncut Magazine (Album review - 8/10)\\n\\n“With touches of classic pop and refined, artsy folk, Fell dazzles with effortlessly compelling songwriting” – Paste Magazine\\n\\n“Laura Fell is a force to be reckoned with…” – The Line of Best Fit\\n\\n“The poetry of an unravelled heart” - Gold Flake Paint\\n\\n“Intimate and immersive… packed with personal emotion but edged with mystery.” — Various Small Flames\\n\\n“On latest single Only One Of Me Around Laura Fellonce again shows her mastery of vulnerability, self-awareness and incredible musicianship.” - Popoptica\\n\\nSupport comes from **Kitty Fitz**\\n\\nKitty Fitz, the vibrant alter ego of South East London’s Kitty Drummond, is an artist known for blending introspective lyrics with playful, cinematic soundscapes. Describing her music as “introspective, tongue-in-cheek, and honest,” Kitty crafts songs that are both deeply personal and universally relatable.\\n\\nHer latest EP, The Man in Me, showcases her evolution as an artist, exploring themes of heartbreak, anxiety, and renewal. A classically trained musician and self-taught producer, Kitty takes pride in writing, recording, and producing all her own music, making her a rising star in the alt-pop scene.