ive\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"http://www.jaguarshoes.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"429057253484103\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Short Waves Presents:\\n\\ngumdrop:\\n\\nOriginally formed in Southampton, Bristol-based gumdrop create post-punk and shoegaze inspired sounds their own way. You’ll find an electrifying blend of fuzzy, stargazing guitars, ice cold bass lines and industrial, synthesised melodies, all guided by punching drum beats.\\n\\nConsisting of four members, the band have previously supported the likes of Heavy Lungs, Lumer, HAAL, Spilt, and Alien Chicks, also having played Wanderlust Festival in 2024.\\n\\nThey are bound to be loud, so be sure to bring your earplugs and some comfy (mosh-ready) shoes..\\n\\n\\\\+ guests Common Ideal and more tba\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Short Waves.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:40\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c9effd7f2193?dice_id=c9effd7f2193\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/L311b279ff93?dice_id=L311b279ff93\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z0d57fe9fc86?dice_id=Z0d57fe9fc86\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/G186f1549b4e?dice_id=G186f1549b4e\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https:/