:null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Scarlett Woolfe\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"113918\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Scout Gillett\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-05-27/d10b6a3f-5d1c-4df5-8011-1a6c7556eec7.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"51590\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Gritty glitter cosmic twang. Missouri-born, Brooklyn-bred, and now LA-based, the electric and fearless Scout Gillett is an artist in constant motion - in both sound and spirit.\\n\\nOriginally from rural Missouri, she carved her path through Kansas City’s DIY scene and later in Brooklyn, both as an indie artist and founder of her own booking company, Road Dog Booking, before relocating to Los Angeles in 2024.\\n\\nA relentless performer, she has toured extensively, sharing stages with the likes of Sarah Shook & The Disarmers, Marissa Nadler, Habibi, Lily Seabird, Babehoven, Been Stellar, Water From Your Eyes, Wreckless Eric, and more.\\n\\nFollowing her widely acclaimed debut album No Roof No Floor (Captured Tracks), Scout spent over two years honing her live show on the road - delivering performances brimming with unfiltered intensity and haunting sincerity.\\n\\nAfter completing her first headlining European tour in spring 2024, she returned to the studio with legendary producer Stuart Sikes (Modest Mouse, The White Stripes, Cat Power, Loretta Lynn) to craft her sophomore album. Set for release in 2026, it’s a bold, boundary-pushing work that further cements her dynamic voice.\\n\\nScout’s music strikes a rare balance - raw vulnerability meets fearless energy.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-14/c1d80687-d2ff-4533-a697-a8730cc5e2ad.jpg?rect=15%2C0%2C1970%2C19