 pop institution. With an uncanny resemblance physically and vocally (once the syrup's on) to Bob Smith, author, raconteur and music promoter, Andy Macleod fronts this Faith-ful and fun Cure homage playing hits and deep cuts from The Cure's back catalogue.\\n\\nPOPSCENE - Formed in 2023 by lifelong Blur fans, Popscene recreate the sound, look, and energy of Blur’s legendary 90s shows. With meticulous attention to detail, their gigs that make audiences forget they’re not watching the real thing.\\n\\n'Close your eyes and it's The Cure, open your eyes and it's The Cure' Simon Williams Fierce Panda Records\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by AFM presents.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:67\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Gf13334ffb2b?dice_id=Gf13334ffb2b\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Qb2fe69c604b?dice_id=Qb2fe69c604b\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/U8da6c51404a?dice_id=U8da6c51404a\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v9eb437c2a87?dice_id=v9eb437c2a87\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ra84a8d9f0b3?dice_id=Ra84a8d9f0b3\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h5252d812ccf?dice_id=h5252d812ccf\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-07T00:15:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-18T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-09T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-18T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-18T23:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1669,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"