s\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Thursday night jazz has become somewhat of a staple in the Morocco Bound events calander, and provides the perfect motive for a Thursdsay night. Simply come and listen, or bring a book, drawing or other creative activity of your choice and relax to the soundtrack of live jazz.\\n\\nWe sell a variety of local beverages from the Bermondsey beer mile and beyond to accompany your evening.\\n\\nSee you there!\\n\\nMusic from 8-10:30pm\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Morocco Bound.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:83\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Xe1503e6fb3e?dice_id=Xe1503e6fb3e\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/O27dd42fa736?dice_id=O27dd42fa736\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r25bfc1a87ac?dice_id=r25bfc1a87ac\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H568397803c6?dice_id=H568397803c6\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H5745c5d5c75?dice_id=H5745c5d5c75\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F7c95729692a?dice_id=F7c95729692a\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-22T10:15:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-19T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-22T11:15:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-19T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":650,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"14196\",\"name\":\"Morocco Bound\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"morocco-bound-6d3nb\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"69908584a426db00019020dc\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Bookshop Sessions: Jazz Night\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"g5m2lb-bookshop-sessions-jazz-night-19th-mar-morocco-bound-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1773946800,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":6},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"11\",\"name\":\"The Old Queens Head\",\"address\":\"44 Essex Rd, London N1 8LN\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5372033,\"lng\":-0.100354299999935},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-11-01/ade09552-43d6-4800-bee6-15bc5f9cb322.jpg?rect=341%2C0%2C1367%2C1367\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-old-queens-head-4wgz\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://theoldqueenshead.com/contact/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-03-19T00:00:00+00:00\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":3},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":76166,\"title\":\"T&Cs\",\"body\":\"By booking tickets to this event you agree to our T&Cs as outlined here https://whatdoesnot.com/wdn-events-terms-and-conditions/\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":76167,\"title\":\"Is RAW an open mic night?\",\"body\":\"Nope. It's an uncensored storytelling night where the storytellers are handpicked and curated before the event.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":76168,\"title\":\"Is it cool to come on my own?\",\"body\":\"Absolutely. RAW is a community as well as a unique night out. A lot of people come to RAW solo and meet new people - in fact, we encourage it.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":76280,\"title\":\"Is the venue accessible?\",\"body\":\"Due to the nature of the victorian pub, the venue is only easily wheelchair accessible on the ground floor. The main event will be taking place on the first and second floors, which may not be suitable for those with access needs. If you have any questions, please get in touch with us via WhatsApp: +44 7561 720666\",\"order\":3}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/66e298ea-faed-4ae6-a38f-3a21eaefc459.jpg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/66e298ea-faed-4ae6-a38f-3a21eaefc459.jpg?rect=0%2C68%2C2048%2C1229\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/66e298ea-faed-4ae6-a38f-3a21eaefc459.jpg?rect=649%2C0%2C751%2C1365\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770802200,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1606,\"name\":\"What Does Not\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://whatdoesnot.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Born from one woman’s itch for collecting personal tales and speaking to strangers, RAW is a first-of-its-kind event, and London's OG storytelling night.**\\n\\nIt’s a tasting menu of London’s culture: vibrant, eclectic and diverse, pairing uncensored stories with live music, and art. RAW is a night of immersive storytelling curated around a theme.\\n\\n**IG: @whatdoesnot**\\n\\n**\\\\---------------------------------------**\\n\\n**Described as 'one of the best nights in London', RAWs blend culture, connection and cool in some of the city's hottest venues.**\\n\\n**The theme for March: FEMININITY**\\n\\nAudiences at RAW get to experience short, untold stories, undiscovered talent, and the best underground artists before they break into the mainstream. It’s a night of IYKYK vibes, human connection, and creativity.\\n\\n*NOTE: there's a lineup of 8 storytellers at each RAW, which are curated and selected before the event. This is not an open mic.*\\n\\n**\\\\---------------------------------------**\\n\\n**WHAT TO EXPECT THIS MONTH**\\n\\n- **Live Music**\\n- **DJ Set**\\n- **Activation in the PLAYROOM**\\n- **Uncensored Storytelling**\\n\\n*All components and timings of RAW are subject to change. By booking tickets to RAW you agree to our T&Cs*\\n\\n**FYI no two RAWs have ever been the same.**\\n\\n**\\\\---------------------------------------**\\n\\nCheck out what else we've got going on here: https://linktr.ee/WhatDoesNot\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by What Does Not.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:84\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/B7d8b3bf7a2d?dice_id=B7d8b3bf7a2d\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/tde32c465f24?dice_id=tde32c465f24\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x4b55de9a5dc?dice_id=x4b55de9a5dc\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m706d6e0877c?dice_id=m706d6e0877c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v6866c03d349?dice_id=v6866c03d349\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.f