":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Natalie Jinju is a Korean-American singer-songwriter and multi-instrumentalist based in Los Angeles. Known for her intimate lyricism and genre-blending pop, R&B, and jazz influences, she has rapidly built a dedicated global audience.\\n\\nAt 19 years old, Natalie’s songwriting journey began early. At 17, she wrote and produced her debut project Last September as a high school project — an achievement that helped earn her a scholarship to USC’s highly selective Thornton School of Music Popular Music/Singer-Songwriter program, which accepts only 4–5 students per year.\\n\\nShe is signed to Capitol Records and managed by Palm Tree Management, marking significant industry momentum at a young age. Natalie has also started to translate her growing online support into live success, having sold out her first two shows at Los Angeles’ Moroccan Lounge.\\n\\nNatalie’s reach extends strongly across social platforms, where she engages an enthusiastic fanbase where she has over 172 thousand followers across platforms.\\n\\nHer most recent single, “nobody cares,” released on January 14, 2026, showcases her evolution as an artist — combining poignant storytelling with polished production that encapsulates the emotional honesty at the core of her work.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 14+ event (under 16s to be accompanied by an adult)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by SJM Concerts.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:88\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Hc3929b9c771?dice_id=Hc3929b9c771\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/U1389ca9577a?dice_id=U1389ca9577a\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/