nviting singers and poets onto the stage to perform with the improv band**\\n\\n(it's not a competition just a way of bringing poets and singers together 🫂)\\n\\n\\\\----------------------------\\n\\n**line up**\\n\\ntba\\n\\n\\\\+ guests & open mic\\n\\n(sign up for open mic 7-7:45pm, names will be picked out a hat (roughly 1 in 4 chance of being picked)\\n\\ninsta / tiktok - @spitnights\\n\\n\\\\----------------------------\\n\\n- event starts 7:45pm\\n- bar open from 5pm\\n- DJs 7-8pm and 10:30-late\\n- standing event\\n- step free access (speak to venue staff and they can assist)\\n\\n\\\\----------------------------\\n\\n*LOW INCOME TICKETS*\\n\\n*we don't want anyone to be priced out of coming to our night so if money is tight use code COMMUNITY to unlock £5 tickets (DICE adds a fee for waitlist tickets)*\\n\\n*thank you to everyone who buys a PAY IT FORWARD ticket to help us offer cheaper tickets to those who need <3*\\n\\n\\\\----------------------------\\n\\n1st fridays of the month = pure poetry night\\n\\n3rd thursdays of the month = poets vs singers\\n\\nlast thursday of the month = poetry x improv jazz show\\n\\n\\\\----------------------------\\n\\nhere at spit nights, we are committed to creating a safe and celebratory environment for all of our supporters. By attending spit nights, you agree to adhere to our safety policy. you can find more info regarding our safety policy here: https://linktr.ee/spitnights\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by spit nights.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:90\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K5420ef41afb?dice_id=K5420ef41afb\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/O6c4b8876534?dice_id=O6c4b8876534\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_re