:\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"hootananny-brixton-parp\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://hootanannybrixton.co.uk/info/#:~:text=Venue%20Access%20Policy,Phone%20number%20020%2077373%207273.\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"The Smyths \",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"41511\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Since 2003, The Smyths have been paying homage to one of the ’80s most recognisable bands. Focused on channelling the rough-edged spirit of The Smiths, the quartet have toured the length of the UK, and even played at Glastonbury performing the band’s signature hits.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-02/5151793e-e2d8-436f-a04f-d4027a6aff3a.jpg?rect=0%2C321%2C2480%2C2480\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-02/5151793e-e2d8-436f-a04f-d4027a6aff3a.jpg?rect=0%2C1010%2C2480%2C1488\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-02/5151793e-e2d8-436f-a04f-d4027a6aff3a.jpg?rect=276%2C0%2C1929%2C3508\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1767744900,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":495,\"name\":\"Hootananny Brixton\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://hootanannybrixton.co.uk/terms-conditions/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"284708469113050\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":\"CALJTQBC77UCMC06OO60\",\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"After a HUGE sell out show last year, THE SMYTHS are back in Brixton.. ♫⋆🥀｡♪ ₊˚♬ﾟ.\\n\\nThis time around, the Smyths have planned for a special **40th anniversary performance** of the classic **The Queen Is Dead** album.\\n\\nWidely regarded as the ultimate Smiths tribute, The Smyths bring the album to life in a full, sharp, passionate, and unmistakably authentic way.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Hootananny Brixton.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:91\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Rff99fe33d5b?dice_id=Rff99fe33d5b\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b2fa2029a5fe?dice_id=b2fa2029a5fe\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Pa0e1f66e1be?dice_id=Pa0e1f66e1be\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/nad37cebc9ae?dice_id=nad37cebc9ae\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b449433e9f22?dice_id=b449433e9f22\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b894d59475f9?dice_id=b894d59475f9\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-07T00:15:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-19T22:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-07T00:15:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-19T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2400,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8240\",\"name\":\"Hootananny Brixton\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hootananny-brixton-yn9r\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"695e6e6f19378700018b2f33\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"The Smyths: The Queen is Dead 40th Anniversary \",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"2wkm57-the-smyths-the-queen-is-dead-40th-anniversary-19th-mar-hootananny-brixton-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1773946800,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"15510\",\"name\":\"Fox And Firkin\",\"address\":\"316 Lewisham High Street, Lewisham, London, SE13 6JZ, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.45698,\"lng\":-0.01441},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-04/8f120254-16c6-4f38-a599-6dbc7a16c8db.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2363%2C2363\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"fox-and-firkin-8ev7w\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-02/52b3a60c-ea81-403f-a588-f43998d9f7dd.jpg?rect=0%2C30%2C3343%2C3343\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-02/52b3a60c-ea81-403f-a588-f43998d9f7dd.jpg?rect=0%2C1508%2C3343%2C2006\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-02/52b3a60c-ea81-403f-a588-f43998d9f7dd.jpg?rect=291%2C0%2C2762%2C5021\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Omar - Brighter The Days\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6x58hbctAZ5Z7Ihs4lZyog\",\"artist\":\"Omar\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/35c1da5aa86c456dd39a98f15af5bf6775ae3c95?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Brighter The Days\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"OMAR - Brighter The Days\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/brighter-the-days/1791106781?i=1791107136&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"OMAR\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/73/a6/fb/73a6fb63-1657-e0c3-a2d8-4c519e44ec73/mzaf_14681190104835575057.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Brighter The Days\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1767690000,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"The UK's greatest soul singer, Omar, returns to the Fox & Firkin to celebrate 40 years as an active recording artist as well as his 9th and most recent studio album, 'Brighter the Days'.   Brighter the Days has been lauded to be Omar's most self-assured, well rounded, eclectic, and continues to highlight his trademark vocals & songwriting. His unique, instantly identifiable voice always results in nothing but memorable music.  Often tagged ‘neo soul’ or even ‘acid jazz’ - the truth is Omar is his own one-man genre, as this latest album attests.  With worldwide appeal spanning multiple generations Omar has worked with the likes of Stevie Wonder, Lamont Dozier, the late Angie Stone, Leon Ware, Robert Glasper and Erykah Badu just to name a few.\\n\\nWho better to DJ on the night then Femi Fem?\\n\\nFemi Fem, began his journey in London’s underground music scene during the 80s, co-founding the legendary Family Funktion and Shake & Fingerpop warehouse parties. These pioneering events helped ignite the rare groove and acid jazz movements that reshaped UK club culture. As a DJ, Femi has brought his soulful, eclectic sound to events for Prince, Janet Jackson, Lauryn Hill, Stella McCartney, Jade Jagger, Gucci, with trips to Australia  Japan & Hong Kong. He also founded the iconic, MOBO Award-winning club night Rotation at London’s Subterranea.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Fox & Firkin.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"67e592f56c886db9:92\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s88672eb0a48?dice_id=s88672eb0a48\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/vbc5c83fbc4a?dice_id=vbc5c83fbc4a\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w4a66ac8aab4?dice_id=w4a66ac8aab4\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Rb6f7fc5f45c?dice_id=Rb6f7fc5f45c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/i6af15df79a7?dice_id=i6af15df79a7\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/dbe2a936eec1?dice_id=dbe2a936eec1\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-06T09:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-06T09:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-19T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1802},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"10745\",\"name\":\"The Fox & Firkin\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-fox--firkin-em3y\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"6957dd2f224fbb000150cf97\