accessibilty-tickets-for-islington-assembly-hall\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":31976,\"title\":\"Stage Times \",\"body\":\"Stage times are posted at 11am on the day of the show on our venue website.\",\"order\":1}],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"8ebl75-kate-nash-19th-mar-roundhouse-london-tickets\",\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"83197abe-d135-4493-aa04-892018f5caee\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"668c8537-569b-459b-aa5d-df72d382717b\",\"seat_selection\":\"disabled\"},\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1773946800,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-06-03/6cabb3e7-f8cd-4e77-85af-33c346d3b714.jpg?rect=0%2C1233%2C4936%2C4936\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-06-03/6cabb3e7-f8cd-4e77-85af-33c346d3b714.jpg?rect=0%2C2220%2C4936%2C2962\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-06-03/6cabb3e7-f8cd-4e77-85af-33c346d3b714.jpg?rect=433%2C0%2C4071%2C7401\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E6b84aba8b7d?dice_id=E6b84aba8b7d\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h30053446411?dice_id=h30053446411\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r2a4b0456358?dice_id=r2a4b0456358\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Xe2eb0551539?dice_id=Xe2eb0551539\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k6507640f684?dice_id=k6507640f684\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D48f1f46fba8?dice_id=D48f1f46fba8\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"114\",\"name\":\"Roundhouse\",\"address\":\"Roundhouse, Chalk Farm Rd, London NW1 8EH\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5430406,\"lng\":-0.15131180000003},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-24/2fce8c34-cb66-4510-a1d0-f2c07a1f9479.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2889%2C2889\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"roundhouse-4296\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/visit/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":false,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Eat Your Own Ears presents Kate Nash at Roundhouse.\\n\\nKate Nash makes a triumphant return to the stage with her most ambitious live show yet at Roundhouse. Fresh from her Mighty Hoopla set, this special one-off performance showcases the theatrical world of 9 Sad Symphonies — her 2024 album of sweeping, string-laced pop inspired by old Hollywood musicals — alongside new material including the punchy, punk-tinged single GERM.\\n\\nKnown for her cheeky wit, unfiltered lyrics and ever-evolving sound, Nash first stormed the charts with the platinum-selling Made of Bricks and era-defining single Foundations. Since then, she’s shapeshifted through punk, soul and synth-pop, carving out a singular space in UK music. Now, with a bold new vision, she brings her sharp songwriting into a cinematic new light — a powerful comeback from one of pop’s most playful rule-breakers.\\n\\nThis is an all-ages event (Under 16s accompanied by an adult, Under 14s accompanied and in seats).\",\"highlights\":[]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":\"83197abe-d135-4493-aa04-892018f5caee\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"668c8537-569b-459b-aa5d-df72d382717b\",\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:10\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"10\",\"name\":\"Eat Your Own Ears\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"eat-your-own-ears-z82z\",\"profile_active\":true},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Eat Your Own Ears.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Kate Nash\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb6e0a8c830f279a022c6ed700\"},\"artist_id\":\"3140\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1337,\"name\":\"Eat Your Own Ears\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.eatyourownears.com/privacy-cookies-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"announcement_date_unix\":1749459600,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-06-09T10:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-18T09:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-06-13T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-19T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"68431d323c550000015378ca\",\"name\":\"Kate Nash\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":4072},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Misery\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4cLxUG9hsix8lj6woZ4j3w\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/ccc7b7176dcd254a346d839c075a27503213d2e1?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Misery\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":24413,\"title\":\"IMPORTANT: Read here about your Roundhouse tickets\",\"body\":\"Please note you will need to access your tickets via the Roundhouse Online Wallet at - http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk\\n\\nYour tickets WILL NOT be available in the DICE app. Just follow the below steps below on the day of event to access your ticket to the show:\\n\\nHead to http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk\\n\\nSign in using your DICE account email address - if you already had a Roundhouse account under the same email address, enter the password associated with this email address. If you didn’t have one, Roundhouse will have created one for you and you’ll just need to reset the password before logging in.\\n\\nIf you need to reset your password, you’ll be taken to http://roundhouse.org.uk, but you need to log in again at http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk to access your ticket.\\n\\nThe QR code should appear a couple of hours before the stated time on your ticket\\n\\nIf you want to transfer your tickets to a friend please do so at least 4 hours before the event within the Roundhouse ticket wallet.\\n\\nIf you cannot access your tickets in the Roundhouse online wallet please visit the venue box office when you arrive and one of the team will be happy to assist you.\\n\\nFull information regarding the Roundhouse online wallet can be found at - https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/faqs/digital-tickets/\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":24414,\"title\":\"Accessibility Tickets\",\"body\":\"Accessibility tickets must be booked directly with the venue, not through DICE. Please get in touch with the venue via access@roundhouse.org.uk prior to purchasing.\",\"order\":1}],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"bb8a6o-london-music-ultimate-showcase-pearl-runner-19th-mar-lvls-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1773947700,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-14/95aa8d2b-2f9a-49d9-b0e8-478fb45edb4f.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C768%2C768\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-14/95aa8d2b-2f9a-49d9-b0e8-478fb45edb4f.jpg?rect=0%2C154%2C768%2C461\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-14/95aa8d2b-2f9a-49d9-b0e8-478fb45edb4f.jpg?rect=173%2C0%2C422%2C768\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ndc0f2415489?dice_id=ndc0f2415489\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/pfc321a9b75b?dice_id=pfc321a9b75b\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P6932db16e28?dice_id=P6932db16e28\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Pf17894819b6?dice_id=Pf17894819b6\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/I32a8911c6bb?dice_id=I32a8911c6bb\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q64ca01b230f?dice_id=Q64ca01b230f\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"14077\",\"name\":\"LVLS\",\"address\":\"3 Succession Walk, Tower Hamlets, London, E3 2RX, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.54048,\"lng\":-0.02084},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-21/ad72e6a5-12a2-4237-a9ca-943cef71211f.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C192%2C192\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"lvls-g5oe6\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:15:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"👀 Something is happening…\\n\\nThe best way I can describe it is like one member said to me:\\n\\n‘Tim - It’s like freshers week, every week, but better, with bands and stuff…’\\n\\nand that’s how it’s been over the last 7 years since we created this group. It’s honestly the most fun we’ve had and I’m inviting everyone of you because something’s been happening for a while now and you just don’t know about it…It’s a Showcase of some of the Best London bands playing their music in London - and it’s also a MEETUP group, so you can watch the gig with a mix of regular members and newcomers. Feel free to come on your own or bring your friends and meet new people. Look for the ‘MEETUP SIGN’ or ask the Host on the Door when you arrive. It’s an awesome line-up and at one of the Top Venues in London - Great place for a beer, meet new people and see some amazing unsigned bands! 🔥🔥🚒🍻\\n\\n\\\\*\\n\\n🎶‼️ THE ULTIMATE LONDON GIG MEETUP! 💣‼️\\n\\n💥 London Music Showcase\\n\\nThere aren’t enough emojis for this, so I’ll keep it simple: BE THERE.\\n\\nIf you’ve been to the MEET-UPS over the last 7 years, you’ll know what it’s all about so come down, bring your friends, bring your foes, cancel your wedding, book Granny out of the retirement home. Whatever it takes, she won’t want miss it 😄🍻\\n\\n\\\\*\\n\\nGig Meetups 👀‼️👇\\n\\nhttps://dice.fm/promoters/london-music-showcase-6ko3\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/londonmusicshowcase/\\n\\nhttps://www.meetup.com/London-Music-Showcase-Gigs-Drinks/\\n\\nhttps://www.facebook.com/LondonMusicShowcase\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:11\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"10872\",\"name\":\"London Music Showcase\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"london-music-sho