eration. Graduating with First Class Honours in 2024 from the Royal College of Music in London, under the tutelage of Professor Nigel Clayton, she earned both a Bachelor of Music and a Master of Performance degree. During her studies, she was a recipient of the C. Bechstein Scholarship and the holder of the Help Musicians Postgraduate Awards. She is currently supported by the Talent Unlimited Charity.\\n\\n*Captivated the audience with her distinctly sensitive and energetic temperament.*\\n\\n**Romanian Cultural Institute**\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:18\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"139902\",\"name\":\"World Heart Beat\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"world-heart-beat-bmv9k\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by World Heart Beat.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1769453100,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-26T18:45:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-19T17:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-26T19:15:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-19T21:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"6977925fcc43c900013eb5d5\",\"name\":\"International Piano in the Elms Festival: Cristiana Achim\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1669,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[],\"faqs\":[],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_ava