1-21/3a93c45d-11ee-4970-ad5f-e77c1ea6880c.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/3a93c45d-11ee-4970-ad5f-e77c1ea6880c.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/3a93c45d-11ee-4970-ad5f-e77c1ea6880c.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P26afed232a0?dice_id=P26afed232a0\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z5a1aef1fb44?dice_id=Z5a1aef1fb44\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J754cbf8d697?dice_id=J754cbf8d697\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D34f8aeeecc6?dice_id=D34f8aeeecc6\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/X24ee0e01e45?dice_id=X24ee0e01e45\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u44ad2c921ed?dice_id=u44ad2c921ed\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"373\",\"name\":\"Paper Dress Vintage\",\"address\":\"352a Mare Street, London, E8 1HR, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.54733,\"lng\":-0.05467},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-03-29/13fc3fd2-f3f2-4ebb-b479-d3d2d7cf5214.jpg?rect=683%2C0%2C2731%2C2731\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"paper-dress-vintage-ja37\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://paperdressvintage.co.uk/faqs\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"**One Night In Hackney: The Stylus Method Live!**\\n\\nOn 19th March 2026, The Stylus Method will return to the stage at Hackney’s Paper Dress Vintage.\\n\\nFollowing a hiatus to record their upcoming third album, ‘The Smoke Machine’, the band are ready to be exciting another capital crowd with their unique blend of original poptastic hooks, on-stage swagger and a whole load of velvet.\\n\\nFor a Thursday night that’s anything-but-boring, make sure you’re a face in the crowd.\\n\\nTickets on sale now.\\n\\nDoors: 7:30pm\\n\\n**Support from Roni & The Honey Drips.**\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:20\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2624\",\"name\":\"Paper Dress Vintage\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"paper-dress-vintage-67xq\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by OWW.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":220,\"name\":\"Paper Dress Vintage\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1196387937118330\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":false,\"show_opt_in_form\":false,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"announcement_date_unix\":1768993200,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-21T11:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-21T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-19T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"6970bdda6b08a400019c5753\",\"name\":\"One Night In Hackney: The Stylus Method Live! \",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1347,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[],\"faqs\":[],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"oeq535-mason-hill-19th-mar-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1773948600,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-25/e3c9d48d-979c-4e1c-972a-8e1753443460.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2500%2C2500\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-25/e3c9d48d-979c-4e1c-972a-8e1753443460.jpg?rect=0%2C500%2C2500%2C1500\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-25/e3c9d48d-979c-4e1c-972a-8e1753443460.jpg?rect=563%2C0%2C1375%2C2500\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u28b32c862c0?dice_id=u28b32c862c0\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/aa6b6f4a32c8?dice_id=aa6b6f4a32c8\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a96204c992f7?dice_id=a96204c992f7\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K4f583f35b8f?dice_id=K4f583f35b8f\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/I4d37fde20aa?dice_id=I4d37fde20aa\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y8de3880e320?dice_id=Y8de3880e320\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-03-19T23:00:00+00:00\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Four years after their acclaimed 2021 debut Against The Wall hit the Top 20, Mason Hill are re-entering the fray with renewed intent.\\n\\nWhile the core of the band remains the same; guitarist Marc Montgomery, bassist Matt Ward, drummer Craig McFetridge and lead guitarist James Bird; their upcoming release marks the debut of new singer Tom Ward. His versatile voice brings new dimensions to Mason Hill’s sound, switching from emotive whisper to arena-rattling power in a heartbeat.\\n\\nOver their 10-year journey, Mason Hill have faced false starts, botched deals, and the six-year gap between their 2015 EP and Against The Wall. The departure of their former singer in late 2023 was just the latest hurdle.\\n\\nIt was Gumtree, of all places, that proved their salvation. Tom responded to an ad in spring 2024, emails were exchanged, and demos shared. The rest is history.\\n\\nNew music, co-produced with Dan Weller in North London, will be the first with Tom at the helm.\\n\\n“All the good stuff and the bad stuff, I’m glad it happened,” says James. “Because without it we wouldn’t be here, talking about our new sound. We’re so ready. This is who we are now. This is Mason Hill.\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:21\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by ACTION!\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Defences\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"31909\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Mason Hill\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab67616d0000b27395db0ddf63dcd79644bbb8a3\"},\"artist_id\":\"16883\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"announcement_date_unix\":1764028800,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-25T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-19T18:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-28T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-19T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"6925cc27badc120001f768fa\",\"name\":\"MASON HILL\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2704,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Against the Wall\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0NBkmAGNcdwJpf9qPAQGaP\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/4ea893b240c8a628e6e7916b9d17948381321d08?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Against the Wall\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Mason Hill - Against the Wall\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/against-the-wall/1531392046?i=1531392260&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Mason Hill\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/b2/8a/1f/b28a1fa3-179c-aa66-ef9b-adc0adefe1ed/mzaf_2217424367075192966.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Against the Wall\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":59881,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":59882,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":59883,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"5389yk-armand-hammer-19th-mar-scala-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1773948600,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-20/6fb460db-4cd5-40d7-ab64-398934efb2f5.jpg?rect=682%2C0%2C2679%2C2679\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-20/6fb460db-4cd5-40d7-ab64-398934efb2f5.jpg?rect=0%2C127%2C4042%2C2425\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-20/6fb460db-4cd5-40d7-ab64-398934efb2f5.jpg?rect=1285%2C0%2C1473%2C2679\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/t675e4a1ee5b?dice_id=t675e4a1ee5b\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H4017eb24007?dice_id=H4017eb24007\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b69fdc1f9bbe?dice_id=b69fdc1f9bbe\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J2f3b266c545?dice_id=J2f3b266c545\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z3c3205242b9?dice_id=Z3c3205242b9\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z10c851bdd02?dice_id=z10c851bdd02\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"78\",\"name\":\"Scala\",\"address\":\"Scala, 275 Pentonville Rd, London N1 9NL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5308033,\"lng\":-0.12080590000005031},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-02-10/84c4e891-e02c-45c6-8678-bf48caad44d9.jpg?rect=1000%2C0%2C4000%2C4000\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"scala-j55d\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://scala.co.uk/admission/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-19T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-03-19T23:00:00+00:00\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Today, Armand Hammer — the group comprising rappers ELUCID and billy woods — and producer The Alchemist share \\\"Super Nintendo,\\\" a reflection on bittersweet nostalgia set to a ribbony synthesizer figure and a barely-there percussive pulse. \\\"Super Nintendo\\\" is the first single from Mercy, their new album out November 7 via Backwoodz Studioz with global physical distribution by Rhmesayers Entertainment.\\n\\nArmand Hammer and The Alchemist build worlds. Their first was Haram and it remains locked in orbit, equal parts lush and foreboding. Their new one is called Mercy and it’s made out of blood and empire, children’s laughter, unpaid parking tickets, and unkept secrets. Rappers ELUCID and billy woods are joined on the mic by Earl Sweatshirt, Quelle Chris, Cleo Reed, Pink Siifu, Kapwani, and Silka. The Alchemist did everything else.\\n\\nFor nearly a decade as a duo, and longer still as solo artists, Armand Hammer have left a palpable mark on modern rap and hip-hop. At turns both sharp-witted and soul-crushing, their lyrics unspool threads of socio-political, historical, and philosophical import with a potent blend of incisive critique, gallows humor, and narrative élan.\\n\\nMercy is the first Armand Hammer album since 2023's We Buy Diabetic Test Strips, a project that The Observer (UK) described as \\\"an exceptional record that deserves your time and headphones\\\" and The Line Of Best Fit deemed \\\"their headiest and most impressive work thus far.\\\" On 2021's Haram, their first with The Alchemist, the duo \\\"drag postcolonial wounds onto the examination table\\\" (Pitchfork). Beats Per Minute called it \\\"a tremendous success.\\\"\\n\\nEarlier this year, billy woods released GOLLIWOG, \\\"“a densely poetic, totally masterful tour de force\\\" (Rolling Stone) and \\\"one of 2025's truly essential albums\\\" (The FADER). Meanwhile, ELUCID's \\\"enthralling\\\" (MOJO) 2024 album REVELATOR was described by Pitchfork as \\\"soul food for those who know a better world is possible if we're willing to fight for it.\\\" The New York Times, in naming REVELATOR one of their Best Albums Of 2024, called it \\\"a dense, overdriven, fiercely abrasive album that cranks up the tradition of Public Enemy’s Bomb Squad productions for 21st-century impact.\\\"\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:22\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2066\",\"name\