n 20th March Rap Council returns with our biggest event of the year.\\n\\nPerformances from JayaHadADream, Ceebo, Tay Jordan, Jay Malakhi, Deca OTA, StyllUnknown + friends and further acts still to be announced.\\n\\nThere are 620 tickets available, and we are bringing together the best UK rap talent on one stage.\\n\\nThe night will open with DJ sets and special guest performances, as well as a live cypher featuring 15 of London’s best upcoming artists.\\n\\nThe event takes place at 229 London, minutes from Great Portland Street, Regent’s Park, Warren Street, and Oxford Circus tube stations, with easy access via buses across London.\\n\\nWith limited capacity, we expect it to sell out. Be part of this special night for the UK rap scene.\\n\\n18+. Physical Photo ID required for entry.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:28\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"6234\",\"name\":\"229\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"229-82l5\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Rap Council.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Jayahadadream\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-02-25/de5083cc-9684-43ce-84e0-4adc224a0c36.jpg?rect=0%2C54%2C532%2C532\"},\"artist_id\":\"49465\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Ceebo\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-28/e1efa181-90f8-4947-93eb-b3e4562a109a.jpg?rect=0%2C53%2C535%2C535\"},\"artist_id\":\"133086\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Tay Jordan \",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000