n EC2A 3PQ, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5234726,\"lng\":-0.07799529999999777},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-02-02/5b7b8372-c6a3-4dfa-ad59-4bfaabe94ddc.jpg?rect=317%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"village-underground-wwop\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://bit.ly/3EhSLgF\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-20T18:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":false,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Gotobeat and Academy Events is excited to present Alice Merton at Village Underground.\\n\\nGrowing up around the world, singer/songwriter Alice Merton was as influenced by other cultures as much as transience itself. Born in Germany and raised in Canada and England, Alice Merton's absorption of different styles and sounds helped craft the worldly progressive pop leanings on her debut \\\"No Roots\\\". The last couple of years could fill an entire career: Playing Coachella, 8x Platinum, US-Gold, the release of her album \\\"MINT+4\\\" in January 2019 and follow up album \\\"S.I.D.E.S.\\\" in 2022, \\\"Waste My Life\\\" & \\\"Charlie Brown\\\" (2023). All done independent, everything homemade.\\n\\nIf you have any queries or would like more information about access at Village Underground, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/3EhSLgF, or contact access@villageunderground.co.uk.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"coolin