e from Spain with her magnetic voice writing songs of the 70s and 90’s R&B style. JSCA, the spicy British Latina, does an amazing blend of genres of cumbia and Latin pop. Lisey Tigra from Colombia delivers powerful reggaeton and Latin rhythms rooted in her heritage.\\n\\nThis is more than a gig. It’s a celebration of feminine creativity, Latin identity, and the beauty of songwriting told from the heart.\\n\\nExpect great performances followed by an after party from Club Saoco with Nora and Ana Isabella\\n\\nDJ Steeve Rosè in decks\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:33\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"139610\",\"name\":\"Secret Gem\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"secret-gem-82vbv\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Secret Gem.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Miss Blanche\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-20/fb6a1cdc-bd00-4300-841d-286c2b4e8f2f.jpg?rect=0%2C53%2C535%2C535\"},\"artist_id\":\"131713\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Lisey Tigra\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"122196\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"JSCA\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"51142\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1770307200,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-05T16:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-20T18:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-05T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-20T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"202