e\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"TIDE stands for constant motion, the ebb and flow, which never stand still. Just like the sea, our music is shaped by continuous change: we share a deep passion for unpredictability and a spirit of experimentation. With a playful approach, we create a captivating and intimate evening of collective improvisation – a musical rise and fall that will never repeat itself in the same way. Each performance is like a new wave: unique, vibrant, and carried by the energy of the moment.\\n\\nThe trio was formed in London while Berlin-based drummer Finn Seemann was studying there. During this time, Finn connected with guitarist Toby Evans and tenor saxophonist Zac Taylor-Schindler who had already been working together extensively during their time together at the Royal Academy of Music. Since forming, TIDE have performed sold-out shows at venues across the UK and Germany.\\n\\nLineup:\\n\\nToby Evans – Guitar  \\nZac Taylor Schindler – Tenor Sax  \\nFinn Seemann - Drums\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:36\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"14196\",\"name\":\"Morocco Bound\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"morocco-bound-6d3nb\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Morocco Bound.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1770163200,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-04T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-20T18:45:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-0