"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"This March, we celebrate a whole decade since the release of Frank Ocean’s iconic album Blond.\\n\\nReleased in 2016, Blond reshaped the sound of modern R&B and Hip-Hop, weaving it with ambient sound into something deeply intimate and unmistakably Frank.\\n\\nAn album that became the soundtrack to late nights, heartbreaks and the blur between youth and adulthood, will be performed in full by a live gospel choir. Expect reimagined renditions of classics like 'Pink + White', 'Nikes', 'Ivy' + a selection of his other biggest hits thrown in for good measure.\\n\\n*This event does not feature a performance from Frank Ocean. This event is not in association with Frank Ocean.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event (Photo I.D required).\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:39\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1993\",\"name\":\"The Blues Kitchen Brixton\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-blues-kitchen-brixton-e5po\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Blues Kitchen Brixton.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":380,\"name\":\"Columbo Music\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://thecolumbogroup.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"298700384025189\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_de