The Cavendish Arms\",\"address\":\"128 Hartington Rd, London SW8 2HJ, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4764913,\"lng\":-0.1277182000000039},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-cavendish-arms-59rl\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.thecav.uk/about-us\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-20T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"A CELLARFUL OF NOISE PRESENTS...\\n\\nFRIDAY 20TH MARCH\\n\\nTHE CAVENDISH ARMS, STOCKWELL\\n\\n7.30PM - 11PM\\n\\n£10 ADV / £13 OTD / NOTAFLOF\\\\*\\n\\n\\\\- - - -\\n\\nPERENNIAL is an art punk three-piece from New England. The band’s sound – built from the sharp minimalism of guitar, electric organ, and drums – is a kinetic collage of mod pop, 90s post-hardcore, post-bop jazz and 60s soul. The band’s ferocious live show – quick and electrifying – has already become the stuff of DIY legend, short bursts of manic energy with barely a moment to catch your breath: not to be missed. Perennial’s new album, ‘Art History’ is available everywhere that chic modernist punk is sold.\\n\\nplus support from Oxford's SINEWS and Londoners PITYSPEED\\n\\n\\\\- - - -\\n\\nAccessibility: Venue all ground floor. Small step into pub, double push doors. Venue can be accessed through pub or from outside without a step (small ramp). Accessible toilet in venue.\\n\\n\\\\*No one turned away for lack of funds.\\n\\nMention on the door or email acellarfulofnoise@gmail.com to be added to door-list in advance.\\n\\nFree PA tickets available, please email also.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:57\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8834\",\"name\":\"For The Sake of Tapes\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"for-the-sake-of-tapes-88ov\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by A Cellarful of Noise.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Perennial\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-30/541d8e31-68a7-454e-9502-2bd5a502cad3.jpg?rect=25%2C0%2C1850%2C1850\"},\"artist_id\":\"59856\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1768294800,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-13T09:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-20T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-13T09:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-20T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-20T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"6963e1efbe0eba00011c2f65\",\"name\":\"Perennial\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":700},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Perennial In A Haunted House\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5oPIdwjH9tGfV6KoARICEW\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/af178c07d25b04b6c91325c1cea7e507f24550ed?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Perennial In A Haunted House\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Perennial - Action Painting\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://mu