850\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"strongroom-bar-4bym\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-20T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Gotobeat is excited present an unforgettable night with District 13 supported by Ronja Joel in London. Join us on Friday, March 20, at Strongroom in Shoreditch.\\n\\n**District 13**\\n\\nDistrict 13 is a heavy alternative rock band hailing from London, UK, known for infusing Heavy Metal and Punk to create a unique sound, often described as a cross between Black Sabbath and The Ramones. The band comprises Jon Wild on vocals and guitar, Alessio Barba on bass (who joined in March 2024), and Asen Milushev on drums. They released their debut album, \\\"Soma,\\\" on July 15, 2019, which received positive reviews. Notable tracks include \\\"Soma,\\\" \\\"First Impressions,\\\" and \\\"Wild Flowers,\\\" with \\\"Is This The Way\\\" being featured in the 2020 movie \\\"Yatagan.\\\" District 13 has performed at significant events such as the Hills of Rock festival in Bulgaria in 2018 and 2022, and most recently opened for Judas Priest at the Sofia arena on July 19, 2024. The band also has a history of performing at the Wychwood festival and reaching the Glastonbury Pilton Stage finals.\\n\\nThis is an 18+ event. This venue has a strict No ID, No entry Policy. Physical government photo ID required, we do not accept photos or copies of ID’s.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:58\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"5184\",\"name\":\"Gotobeat\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-07-03/167fd842-233e-4076-a3d3-2059c62ce48f.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"gotobeat-qgxx\",\"profile_active\":true},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Gotobeat.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1693,\"name\":\"Gotobeat\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.gotobeat.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"570786809997969\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"announcement_date_unix\":1767830400,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-08T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-20T23:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-08T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-20T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-20T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"695f7fbba000ad00015c3b9e\",\"name\":\"District 13 - Live in London\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1275,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"District 13 - River Runs Dry\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4P2HBTzVu8vHKwjMM2PXcU\",\"artist\":\"District 13\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/5383aefea872fecec44b9ace5ed5055e61ec3bfd?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"River Runs Dry\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"District 13 - River Runs Dry\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/river-runs-dry/1814784198?i=1814784292&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"District 13\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/2f/ff/41/2fff4184-e032-ab35-2410-05d213c79e4f/mzaf_16154960118122277880.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"River Runs Dry\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"xe2wll-capito-fausto-20th-mar-dingwalls-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1774035000,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-05/0e7be307-5951-43ba-be0f-7a31afb9accd.jpg?rect=0%2C40%2C3677%2C3677\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-05/0e7be307-5951-43ba-be0f-7a31afb9accd.jpg?rect=0%2C775%2C3677%2C2206\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-05/0e7be307-5951-43ba-be0f-7a31afb9accd.jpg?rect=806%2C0%2C2066%2C3756\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x959eaab0f0b?dice_id=x959eaab0f0b\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o50e4ec88ccd?dice_id=o50e4ec88ccd\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A230278890e8?dice_id=A230278890e8\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/pf09d37dbbec?dice_id=pf09d37dbbec\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Occc06d29f45?dice_id=Occc06d29f45\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Db3df8f94217?dice_id=Db3df8f94217\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"101\",\"name\":\"Dingwalls\",\"address\":\"Middle Yard, Camden Lock, London NW1 8AB\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5414979,\"lng\":-0.145865500000014},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"dingwalls-jan2\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://dingwalls.com/info/\"},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-20T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"After a highly successful first European gesture in 2025, Capitão Fausto return to Europe in March 2026 with renewed momentum and bigger ambitions.\\n\\nHailing from Lisbon, Capitão Fausto are one of the most influential bands of their generation in Portugal, widely praised for their originality, songwriting and live energy.\\n\\nTheir first European escape in 2025 marked a turning point for the band internationally, with sold-out shows in cities such as Paris, London and Amsterdam, and strong attendance across Spain. The response confirmed that their music resonates far beyond language or borders.\\n\\nTheir return to European stages comes at a pivotal moment for the band. In January 2026, they will headline MEO Arena in Lisbon, the largest concert venue in Portugal, in their biggest headline show to date. Shortly after, they return to the road in Europe carrying that momentum, confidence and ambition.\\n\\nAlongside their established catalogue, the band is already hinting at new material, with new songs expected to surface during this year, offering audiences a glimpse into the next chapter of Capitão Fausto’s evolution.\\n\\nCo-founders of the influential label and artistic collective Cuca Monga, Capitão Fausto remain a central force in Portugal’s independent music scene, while steadily positioning themselves as a compelling European live act, emotionally direct, musically rich and increasingly impossible to ignore.\\n\\nPlease note: £1 venue levy added to the ticket price\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:59\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"142463\",\"name\":\"Cool For Cats Live\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"cool-for-cats-live-mekkw\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Cool For Cats Live & Fierce Panda\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Capitão Fausto\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-05/f855b16f-520a-4b67-86b9-e24050f43348.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"99630\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1767866400,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-08T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-20T18:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-08T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-20T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-20T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"695bd81cda2895000178874f\",\"name\":\"Capitão Fausto\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2662,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Capitão Fausto - Amanhã Tou Melhor\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3I0w0pdn5s2W44gGmBxsa0\",\"artist\":\"Capitão Fausto\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/20616816500756e1400b0a7e1845851c6b671226?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Amanhã Tou Melhor\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Capitão Fausto - Amanhã Tou Melhor\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/amanh%C3%A3-tou-melhor/1103204693?i=1103205109&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Capitão Fausto\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/50/f3/19/50f31905-264d-9ff3-e53b-77648db33ea8/mzaf_3608398371427996213.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Amanhã Tou Melhor\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"bbx3gg-international-piano-in-the-elms-festival-cyrill-ibrahim-a-journey-of-chopins-heart-20th-mar-world-heart-beat-embassy-gardens-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1774035000,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-09/82ca31ac-a578-4118-915e-8227b83a152e.jpg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-09/82ca31ac-a578-4118-915e-8227b83a152e.jpg?rect=0%2C68%2C2048%2C1229\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-09/82ca31ac-a578-4118-915e-8227b83a152e.jpg?rect=649%2C0%2C751%2C1365\"},\"max_tickets\":1,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ja29684b28ad?dice_id=ja29684b28ad\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e77861b39c7f?dice_id=e77861b39c7f\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/eea1373da42a?dice_id=eea1373da42a\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x655a9d7b61b?dice_id=x655a9d7b61b\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Qc371988b5d4?dice_id=Qc371988b5d4\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h4d472c1c379?dice_id=h4d472c1c379\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"16568\",\"name\":\"World Heart Beat Embassy Gardens\",\"address\":\"3 Ponton Road, Wandsworth, London, SW11 7BA, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.481919,\"lng\":-0.133104},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"world-heart-beat-embassy-gardens-dkv2e\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-20T18:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Chopin’s Heart is an intimate solo piano experience exploring the inner world of Frédéric Chopin — his exile, his loves, and the extraordinary journey of the physical heart he left behind. The programme centres on the Heroic Polonaise, a powerful expression of Chopin’s longing for Poland, and the monumental Third Sonata, one of his most personal and emotionally revealing works. These are interwoven with pieces by other composers that reflect themes of memory, identity, and belonging, creating a musical narrative that follows Chopin’s path across countries and across the fault lines of his own life.\\n\\n**Cyrill Ibrahim**\\n\\nCyrill Ibrahim is a concert pianist known for his poetic interpretations and cross-disciplinary artistic vision. A Royal College of Music graduate, he has performed at major international venues including the Concertgebouw, the Philharmonie Berlin, and for King Charles III at Balmoral. His appearances range from classical stages to performing at Kim Kardashian’s birthday party.\\n\\nFeatured on BBC One, Classic FM, and the cover of Gentleman’s Journal, Cyrill is also seen in Sky Arts’ Mozart: Genius for Hire (released December 2025). His debut album Dialogue received national acclaim, and as Artist in Residence at World Heart Beat, he creates innovative, immersive concert experiences\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:60\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"139902\",\"name\":\"World Heart Beat\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"world-heart-beat-bmv9k\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by World Heart Beat.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1765330200,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-10T01:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-20T19:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-10T02:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-20T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-20T21:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"6938554be17d9a000118183e\",\"name\":\"International Piano in the Elms Festival: Cyrill Ibrahim: A Journey of Chopin's Heart\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2225,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[],\"faqs\":[],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"6dx958-scanner-joseph-branciforte-jozef-dumoulin-20th-mar-rich-mix-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1774035000,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-17/077b21a0-4c21-4496-8c87-faa43052240b.jpg?rect=1224%2C0%2C4912%2C4912\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-17/077b21a0-4c21-4496-8c87-faa43052240b.jpg?rect=0%2C248%2C7360%2C4416\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-17/077b21a0-4c21-4496-8c87-faa43052240b.jpg?rect=2329%2C0%2C2702%2C4912\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/cdee52fb0298?dice_id=cdee52fb0298\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ged1619422c2?dice_id=Ged1619422c2\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/wb83df580033?dice_id=wb83df580033\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q4ec6a8c5475?dice_id=q4ec6a8c5475\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/X3139dd02282?dice_id=X3139dd02282\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z6381ecf0860?dice_id=z6381ecf0860\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"111\",\"name\":\"Rich Mix\",\"address\":\"35-47 Bethnal Green Rd, London E1 6LA\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5243489,\"lng\":-0.0732477000000245},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"rich-mix-4w2r\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.richmix.org.uk/plan-your-visit/accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-20T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Baba Yaga's Hut Presents:\\n\\nScanner + Joseph Branciforte & Jozef Dumoulin at Rich Mix\\n\\nRobin Rimbaud- Scanner is a pioneering British composer and artist celebrated for transforming the hidden frequencies of everyday life into music. Emerging in the early 1990s, Scanner became renowned for his innovative use of intercepted mobile phone conversations and found sounds, weaving them into haunting electronic compositions that explore surveillance, identity, and memory. His prolific output spans albums, sound installations, dance, film, and public art, collaborating with artists from Bryan Ferry to Merce Cunningham, Laurie Anderson and Steve McQueen.\\n\\nJoseph Branciforte is an electronic experimentalist, composer, Grammy-winning producer, and “mastermind behind the scenes” (Pitchfork)—known for his collaborations with Taylor Deupree, Theo Bleckmann, and Ryuichi Sakamoto. His label Greyfade, based in New York, has become a home for process-based composition and minimal electronic music, recognized for its meticulous sound, design ethos, and exploration of new physical formats.\\n\\nJozef Dumoulin is a Belgian keyboardist and composer, widely recognized for pioneering the Fender Rhodes as a 21st-century instrument. Equally active in jazz, contemporary, and electronic music, he has worked with artists including Mark Turner, Ellery Eskelin, and Tony Malaby, and is celebrated for his genre-defying solo and ensemble projects.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:61\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"12032\",\"name\":\"Rich Mix\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"rich-mix-n5pq\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Baba Yaga's Hut\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Scanner\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://d