e7-c934-465c-bb3e-dfef001ee748.jpg?rect=315%2C0%2C770%2C1400\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/U241016b19d9?dice_id=U241016b19d9\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c74fad7d7f4f?dice_id=c74fad7d7f4f\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r0f0953c3916?dice_id=r0f0953c3916\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ib577f96893c?dice_id=Ib577f96893c\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ze20600fb06f?dice_id=ze20600fb06f\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Se3984a2e4ab?dice_id=Se3984a2e4ab\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"8870\",\"name\":\"Club Cheek\",\"address\":\"302-304 Barrington Road, SW9 7JJ\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.463624,\"lng\":-0.107648},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"club-cheek-vqag\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-20T21:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"HENGE Live presents Pagan Sex Magick, a series of electronic music nights at Club Cheek in Brixton by Dash The Henge.\\n\\nLes Animaux Sauvages (LIVE) Les Animaux Sauvages are three louche artistic soulmates who came together in 2014 as one electro/minimalwave/postpunk entity\\n\\nSibylla Seraphim (actress, singer & pianist), Nasso (singer & whirlwind frontman) and Charlie (producer, guitarist & captain) hail from Sofia, BG, but the euphoric danceability and bipolar mood swings of their music were also partly formed in Paris, London and Berlin\\n\\nMadd Rod (DJ) Madd Rod is a Berlin-based artist forged in long nights and extended sets, where patience, risk, and instinct matter more than trends. Shaped by marathon residencies and years of experimentation, his sound cuts across raw electronics, punk energy, and forward-driven club music with total control\\n\\nC.A.R. (DJ) London residing, Franco-Canadian Chloé Raunet has been immersed in the world of post-punk, cold wave and her own brand of off-kilter synth-pop since the days fronting her band Battant. A fan of the weirder edges of electronic music, as well as composing as C.A.R., she also DJs and hosts the monthly 'On The Slip Road' show on NTS Radio\\n\\n33rd December (DJ) South London producers Matt Priory & Miles Davies, working at dusk-tinted tempos with smoked synths and gently obsessive grooves. Their sets lean into slow-motion momentum, hypnotic patterns, bass weight and space, built for heads-down floors that like it woozy and warm\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:68\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"138900\",\"name\":\"HENGE Live\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"henge-live-6rdeb\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by HENGE LIVE.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Les Animaux Sauvages\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"132498\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Madd Rod\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-07-04/86449b98-2a93-4662-835b-b24b64e45426.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1659%2C1659\"},\"artist_id\":\"68189\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"