)\",\"address\":\"233 Shoreditch High Street, Hackney, London, E1 6PJ, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.52214,\"lng\":-0.07841},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-light-bar-shoreditch-8ewew\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-21T15:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Makin' Moves Loft Party\\n\\nSaturday 21st March\\n\\n@ Timber Loft, Light Bar\\n\\nMakin' Moves continue their series of day parties, this time taking over the brand new Timber Loft space situated at the top of the Light Bar in Shoreditch! This space has some serious history in London's dance music scene and now has been revamped for 2026! It really is the perfect space for us with its stunning wooden dance floor and sound system (which has been taken from room 2 in fabric!) to 360 degree views of the city!\\n\\nMatt and Jamesey will be fresh from their set at Faith and Southport Weekender respectfully and will be joined once again by Detroit's Ash Lauryn who played a blinder of a set for us last year in Brixton so much so we immediately invited her back! Ash is one of the main female deep house pace setters always on the road out and now also rightly getting props over here in Europe on a regular basis.\\n\\nOpening things up will be Kojay and P-Lucas who are currently making waves in London's deep house scene with their unique Oonts parties at spaces such as Grow and we welcome them both to Makin' moves! Kojay we've obviously had play for us before but this time we also welcome his partner in crime P-Lucas!\\n\\nDJs\\n\\nAsh Lauren (Detroit, USA)\\n\\nMatt L-S & Jamesey\\n\\nKojay & P-Lucas (Oonts)\\n\\nHouse dance work shop from 3pm\\n\\nLimited £10 early bird tickets available via Dice\\n\\nMakin’ Moves Loft Party\\n\\nSaturday 21st March\\n\\nTimber Loft Light Bar\\n\\n233, Shoreditch High Street London E1 6PJ\\n\\nDoors: 3pm - 2am\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:70\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1558\",\"name\":\"Makin Moves\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"makin-moves-8v67\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Makin Moves.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Ash Lauryn\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-05-17/58212fb5-b442-4f2f-b061-6979101e0612.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"23687\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Although she’s based in Atlanta, Ash Lauryn’s home – both personally and musically – is Detroit. A champion of old-school electronic music and the contributions of Black musicians, in 2017 she launched Underground & Black: a blog, podcast and now monthly NTS show celebrating the Black roots of dance music. While her slick Boiler Room sets prove her finesse as a selector, her own club productions – such as 2021’s Truth or her remixes of Dam Swindle and Sam Ruffillio – showcase her talent for crafting soulful house and techno.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1770310800,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-05T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-22T01:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-05T17:30:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-21T15:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-22T14:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"6985daa47dea6500010c1f92\",\"name\":\"Makin' Moves Loft party with Ash Lauryn (Detroit, USA)\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1669,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Dancin In The D\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4IakwcfKlaDeSqeZB4xko7\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/a3511af3a7ec366f4d644e7167e3c69adf659694?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Dancin In The D\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Jimpster, OVEOUS & Ash Lauryn - Feel Me (House Mix)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/feel-me-house-mix/1840799876?i=1840799880&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Jimpster, OVEOUS & Ash Lauryn\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/26/9a/63/269a63c8-0a28-7ca3-7029-e4bb3aa96ae4/mzaf_2123026388131047266.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Feel Me (House Mix)\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"3oy6pg-cruel-unusual-21st-mar-the-black-heart-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1774105200,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-06/39e0ed99-6371-46d0-a8f9-721546f79499.jpg?rect=0%2C32%2C2000%2C2000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-06/39e0ed99-6371-46d0-a8f9-721546f79499.jpg?rect=0%2C550%2C2000%2C1200\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-06/39e0ed99-6371-46d0-a8f9-721546f79499.jpg?rect=368%2C0%2C1265%2C2300\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ud4d1a33bfeb?dice_id=ud4d1a33bfeb\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/S8982a37b3a5?dice_id=S8982a37b3a5\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Jc3d2940fe46?dice_id=Jc3d2940fe46\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n5320a4f5eb6?dice_id=n5320a4f5eb6\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n4ea14a4596a?dice_id=n4ea14a4596a\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/va8b0e70c9fc?dice_id=va8b0e70c9fc\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"98\",\"name\":\"The Black Heart\",\"address\":\"2-3 Greenland Pl, London NW1 0AP\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5387812,\"lng\":-0.141761200000019},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-11-28/687dc696-b005-45e0-a194-c89d23ee7bed.jpg?rect=1%2C0%2C2716%2C2716\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-black-heart-4bev\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-21T15:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":false,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"hollow.moon.ldn presents...\\n\\n**CRUEL & UNUSUAL**  \\n***Abstract Filth. All Day. North London.***\\n\\n**THE SUN’S JOURNEY THROUGH THE NIGHT**  \\n*Emerging from the shadows to grace our inaugural gathering as headliners, making their reinvigorated full-band return, the enigmatic @thesunsjourneythroughthenight will bring their bleakest, blackest blasts back to Camden Town for the first time in far too long.*\\n\\n**ORYX** - Performing 'Primordial Sky'  \\n*Grand-scale, far-reaching and impossibly heavy sludge/doom from the spiritual home of such noises, Denver CO. Impeccable on record, and unmissable in a live setting. AND they’ll be performing their 2024 opus ‘Primordial Sky’ in full. Truly one of the best records of its kind to come out in the last few years. @thebandoryx*\\n\\n**DEATH GOALS**  \\n*A duo capable of destroying any stage before them (including The Underworld’s supporting @conjureruk last month, and @ourblackheart’s several times) under the sheer weight of their chaotic, emotive, post-everything-core fury. It’s an honour to have one of the best live bands in the country return to Camden to join the festivities. @deathgoalsband*\\n\\n**HOST BODY**  \\n*Nasty, noisy, claustrophobic chaos of the highest order. Bit like listening to early Dillinger and modern day Full Of Hell beat each other to death with live instruments inside a shipping container. They crushed supporting @helplessnoise back in October. Had to get ‘em back. @hostbodynoise*\\n\\n**HEALING WOUND**  \\n*This is a band that seem to get better and better with every set they play. Intense, sludgy, violent noise to lose your mind to. They were immense supporting Gillian Carter at TBH a while back, and even better still supporting HELPLESS for us late last year. With a record on the way and in unbelievable form, we’re incredibly stoked to have ‘em back to join the festivities. @healingwound\\\\_*\\n\\n**PARIAH**  \\n*This lot are serving up of the most unhinged takes on metallic hardcore to come out of the UK in a long while, so it’s a pleasure to unleash them on London for the first time. Dirging grinds, with some genuine deck-the-person-closest-to-you groove switches, all imbued with the kind of misery found only in the northeast of this accursed land. @pariahnoise*\\n\\n**WARREN SCHOENBRIGHT**  \\n*This band played the first note on the first ever hm show for a reason. Schoenbright’s form of desolate audio misery encapsulates everything hm shows should sound like - a soundtrack befitting an apocalypse. @warren\\\\_schoenbright*\\n\\n**SUNSWARM**  \\n*And kicking things off, an entirely new offering whose first single drops tomorrow. No spoilers, but it rips. Cacophonous industrial post-metal nihilism, produced by the master of such things, @bearbiteshorse Check out the track tomorrow and get down early on the day itself. You’ll want to see this lot. @sunswarmband*\\n\\n***\\\\+ 1 more band tba***\\n\\n***+++ Secret midnight post-fest set to be revealed on the day itself +++***\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:71\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"13616\",\"name\":\"The Black Heart\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-black-heart-yq6r\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by hollow.moon.ldn\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"The Suns Journey Through The Night\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebb2f5b0a5b64d3a5605719428\"},\"artist_id\":\"53301\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Death Goals\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/bca25276aa96a13ef9d427be9d3ddfc35fdb6f7c\"},\"artist_id\":\"25244\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Host Body\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"73848\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Warren Schoenbright\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb04aac935db529e6a28749fc6\"},\"artist_id\":\"54771\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"ORYX\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"58348\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":6,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1764237600,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-27T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-21T14:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-27T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-21T15:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-22T00:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"691e229f489dad00012285df\",\"name\":\"Cruel + Unusual\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2500,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[],\"faqs\":[],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"ww56qg-banger-factory-records-showcase-21st-mar-kings-place-hall-one-london-tickets\",\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"c576825d-bd86-4086-8258-553c4b5efd60\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"b6cacc81-15a1-4778-90c1-515c20e0c024\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1774107000,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-07/373e493b-83a1-46cf-9281-82977697008d.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-07/373e493b-83a1-46cf-9281-82977697008d.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-07/373e493b-83a1-46cf-9281-82977697008d.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J48159ecbbb0?dice_id=J48159ecbbb0\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w95d0d36b5f5?dice_id=w95d0d36b5f5\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n4a8e1833c2f?dice_id=n4a8e1833c2f\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/kd15be16f1af?dice_id=kd15be16f1af\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u75fed5905a7?dice_id=u75fed5905a7\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/rb10f231b0e1?dice_id=rb10f231b0e1\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"940\",\"name\":\"Kings Place (Hall One)\",\"address\":\"Kings Place, 90 York Way, Kings Cross, London N1 9AG\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5349694,\"lng\":-0.121675500000038},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"kings-place-hall-one-yo6v\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.kingsplace.co.uk/your-visit/access-information/\"},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-21T15:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"***Banger Factory Records Showcase. A celebration of the London jazz community featuring an all star line up inc. Kinetika Bloco, Christ-Stephane Boizi Sextet, Pete Horsfall & Electric Relaxation, Rachael Cohen Trio, Ruben Fox & Deschanel Gordon duo, as well as Mark Kavuma & The Banger Factory, each telling their story.***  \\n\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\n\\nBanger Factory Records burst onto the scene in 2021 and has rapidly established itself as a label that epitomises the vibrancy, energy, and talent of London’s music scene. Spreading love and good vibes, championing community and ultimately shaping the future of music that transcends genres, genders and borders.\\n\\nThe showcase will be a journey through BFR with music from its latest releases and an all-star line up of young lions, veterans of today’s British Jazz and a spotlight on the new generation of creators.\\n\\nThis unique event offers a fantastic chance for music lovers of all ages and backgrounds, the opportunity to experience the cutting edge of live jazz music, celebrating an incredible musical community in a setting that’s both electrifying and welcoming. With DJs, panel discussions and a vibrant multi-stage showcase.\\n\\n***This event will last for approximately six hours with intervals.***\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":\"c576825d-bd86-4086-8258-553c4b5efd60\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"b6cacc81-15a1-4778-90c1-515c20e0c024\",\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:72\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2362\",\"name\":\"Kings Place\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"kings-place-29op\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Kings Place.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1141,\"name\":\"Kings Place \",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.kingsplace.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"announcement_date_unix\":1767864600,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-08T09:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-21T14:00:00+00:00\",\"sa