rnational fan base with their captivating and visceral live performances. The noise rock 4-piece quickly established a reputation as ‘one of NYC’s hottest guitar wielding prospects’ as mentioned in The NME 100: Essential Emerging Artists for 2022. Following the release of their debut record, The Fat Of A Broken Heart, the group were lauded as a must-see act at the 2022 SXSW music festival, with NME stating that their ‘set was a perfect encapsulation of everything that makes SXSW an experience like no other.’\\n\\nThe release of 2024’s 30 Million Windows only further cemented their legacy as ‘your favorite New York City band’s favorite band,’ as stated in Monster Children’s review of the record.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":3},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"LNZRT\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://lanzaroteworks.com/Privacy-Policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":225,\"name\":\"Bad Vibrations\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"http://www.badvibrations.co.uk/privacy-policy-mojave\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"744309937658318\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":954,\"name\":\"MOTH\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"2922216871345119\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_convers