calist, and guitarist, Mario Bakuna brings his project, Brazilian Landscapes, inspired by the country’s rhythmic and harmonic diversity, to the Ninety One stage.\\n\\nBOOK YOUR TABLE: https://www.opentable.co.uk/r/ninety-one-living-room-london\\n\\nABOUT MARIO BAKUNA\\n\\nMario Bakuna is a Brazilian composer, arranger, vocalist, and guitarist, bringing over 25 years of musical artistry to audiences worldwide, currently based in London, UK. Well known for his deep exploration of traditional Brazilian rhythms, samba, jazz, and bossa nova, Mario captures the spirit of Brazilian swing, blending it with refined jazz colours in both his original compositions and fresh arrangements of works by iconic artists such as Tom Jobim, Dorival Caymmi, Paulo Moura, and João Donato.\\n\\nSince moving to Europe to deepen his artistic research and expand his horizons, Mario has become a prominent figure in the UK’s Brazilian jazz scene — a key reference for the fusion of Brazilian music and contemporary jazz.\\n\\nDoors 6pm with live music from 7pm.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"18+ event. Physical, scannable ID required for entry (all ages)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:76\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"10115\",\"name\":\"Ninety One\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"ninety-one-m75r\",\"profile_active\":true},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Ninety One Living Room.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":675,\"name\":\"Ninety One Living Room\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://91livingroom.com/homepage/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"580346810496200\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"302117538\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"