oors_open_date\":\"2026-03-21T18:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-03-21T22:00:00+00:00\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Grey Daze is the origin story of one of the most recognisable rock voices in a generation. The band are finally finding their feet with a new line-up after the tragic loss of their original singer Chester Bennington in 2017.\\n\\nGrey Daze’s first and only tour of the UK came thirty years too late. In 2024, the group from Phoenix, AZ brought their #ForYouChester tour to these shores for the very first time, raising awareness for men’s mental health and suicide prevention. New singer Cris Hodges solidified the group and sparked a renewed passion not only from the band to get out and play these songs for people, but also from the fans for whom the music means so much.\\n\\nIn 2025, Grey Daze released their first new music since Chester’s death, featuring Hodges’ distinctive lead vocals and growing songwriting contributions on the U.S. rock-radio hits “Fake Little Lies” and “Still Screaming.” Alongside this, the band performed a handful of European shows for the very first time. Drummer and founding member Sean Dowdell said, “We had fans come from as far as Japan, and even a fan who traveled five days from the war-torn border of Ukraine just to see us. It feels like the world has decided we can’t give up on these songs. They still need to be heard, and they mean so much to people. On top of that, it has inspired us creatively.”\\n\\nGrey Daze’s live experience is the perfect combination of honouring an important legacy while celebrating exciting new music from a rock band that has rediscovered its hunger.\\n\\n\\\\-\\n\\nJoin us for the after party from 11pm to 3am at The Underworld's Camden Rocks Club, get your tickets: www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:79\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by DHP\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Grumble Bee\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb91fcb322457e127b5c65ed0c\"},\"artist_id\":\"4960\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"PAVÉ\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab67616d0000b2738d75930f655cdb5e5c4877e4\"},\"artist_id\":\"110003\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Grey Daze\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-03-26/f3996d0f-17db-4787-aadb-1d39bf7727d5.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"98003\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"announcement_date_unix\":1761732000,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-29T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-21T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-10-31T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-21T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-21T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"68fb94c38479c500012027a5\",\"name\":\"GREY DAZE\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2987,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Grey Daze - Anything, Anything\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/anything-anything/1570734621?i=1570734848&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Grey Daze\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/8a/03/56/8a0356f7-4555-5a03-3a79-5914168345a4/mzaf_789713018206540438.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Anything, Anything\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":53025,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":53026,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":53027,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"92ad37-swelt-bones-album-launch-21st-mar-the-horse-hospital-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1774119600,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-17/dd4e5fbe-045d-4906-a5f4-92a38fa0a252.jpg?rect=41%2C0%2C2392%2C2392\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-17/dd4e5fbe-045d-4906-a5f4-92a38fa0a252.jpg?rect=0%2C454%2C2474%2C1484\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-17/dd4e5fbe-045d-4906-a5f4-92a38fa0a252.jpg?rect=579%2C0%2C1316%2C2392\"},\"max_tickets\":150,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E2fb6677c46a?dice_id=E2fb6677c46a\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A6a531a7716a?dice_id=A6a531a7716a\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Wc66d4120535?dice_id=Wc66d4120535\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/f7d6ae70db25?dice_id=f7d6ae70db25\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E7c060e1aef6?dice_id=E7c060e1aef6\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ibf21a063f58?dice_id=ibf21a063f58\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1505\",\"name\":\"The Horse Hospital\",\"address\":\"The Horse Hospital, 30 Colonnade, Bloomsbury, London WC1N 1JD, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5230123,\"lng\":-0.12402510000003986},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-horse-hospital-g7ka\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-21T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Diminishing Returns & Divine Schism invite you to see swelt launch their debut album ‘Bones’ at the Horse Hospital, London on 21st March.\\n\\nFollowing the release of 'Bones' on March 10th, London / Bristol based swelt will embark on a run of UK dates, playing their fractured, slow-burning songs. Rooted in restraint and release, their sound draws from ’70s folk, slowcore and first-wave post-rock.\\n\\nFFO: Sparklehorse, Acetone, Talk Talk, Low\\n\\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\\n\\nAccessibility info here: https://www.thehorsehospital.com/accessibility\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"c