27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"other-space-arts-bbago\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-21T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Riverwolf presents **Dolly Mavies,** an ethereal post-folk artist hailing from Oxford, known for blending folk’s heartfelt storytelling with rock’s driving rhythms and an atmosphere that’s both haunting and electric. The result is a unique sonic tapestry that channels the energy of Fleetwood Mac, the ethereal intensity of Florence and the Machine, and the emotional depth of Daughter. Her music has received national airplay from the likes of BBC Radio 2, Absolute Radio, BBC 6 Music as well as being hailed as 'Oxford’s rising star' by Nightshift Magazine.\\n\\n\\\\+ 3 support acts\\n\\nAll acts performing as full bands!\\n\\n**About Riverwolf Music**\\n\\nWe have a mission to craft a brilliant live music experience that allows the artists to shine and provide the audience with a great atmosphere in which to enjoy the carefully curated line up. With high quality touring acts, and an ear to the ground of the best the local scene has to offer, come along to witness what is fast becoming one of the best original music nights in the area.\\n\\nPlease be advised that there is no wheelchair access or accessible toilet at this venue.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"Under 16s accompanied by an adult\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:82\",\"billing_promoter\"