ent\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:92\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"43\",\"name\":\"The Jazz Cafe\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-jazz-cafe-43ox\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Jazz Cafe.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Nitzer Ebb\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/8d2d765d2795806105ecbf45b11f95d7524123ca\"},\"artist_id\":\"9231\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":380,\"name\":\"Columbo Music\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://thecolumbogroup.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"298700384025189\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"announcement_date_unix\":1763488800,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-18T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-21T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-18T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-21T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-21T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"691cb0e1b3a32f0001889ef7\",\"name\":\"Nitzer Ebb\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3450},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Join the Chant\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5XkWyuHcgIQncQWMdBQ9lP\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/fee23662e0c60c8854f8ce69721900bba4bcc6a4?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Join the Chant\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":58434,\"title\":\"The Jazz Cafe FAQ's\",\"body\":\"Please follow this link for all Jazz Cafe FAQ's: https://thejazzcafe.com/faqs/?\",\"order\":0}],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"8exngv--common-saints-21st-mar-earth-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1774119600,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-03/b28004a6-c96f-4395-9cfa-d5b64ee76245.jpg?rect=0%2C1141%2C4492%2C4492\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-03/b28004a6-c96f-4395-9cfa-d5b64ee76245.jpg?rect=0%2C2040%2C4492%2C2695\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-03/b28004a6-c96f-4395-9cfa-d5b64ee76245.jpg?rect=383%2C0%2C3726%2C6774\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c77b047e0e7a?dice_id=c77b047e0e7a\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/g51c6c338474?dice_id=g51c6c338474\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W61c64b1d2c7?dice_id=W61c64b1d2c7\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/uc593067b904?dice_id=uc593067b904\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/d373c9f3acb6?dice_id=d373c9f3acb6\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/da71cc9e0bc2?dice_id=da71cc9e0bc2\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1955\",\"name\":\"EartH\",\"address\":\"11 Stoke Newington Rd, London N16 8BH, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5509892,\"lng\":-0.07532500000002074},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-02-02/92037b31-0756-4c73-9f1b-11e5c4753296.jpg?rect=683%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"earth-76a7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://bit.ly/44dzl75\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":\"EartH Theatre\",\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-21T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"This event will take place in EartH Theatre.\\n\\nCommon Saints is the brainchild of renowned producer and songwriter Charlie Perry, stepping out from behind the scenes (Jorja Smith, BTS, Olivia Dean) to front a live experience that’s as soulful as it is sonically adventurous. Blending psychedelic grooves, rich harmonies, and cinematic textures, the band brings a warm, expansive energy to the stage. With live instrumentation at its core and a free-flowing, immersive feel, a Common Saints show isn’t about chasing hits — it’s about creating moments.\\n\\nDeeply musical, spiritually charged, and emotionally uplifting, Common Saints invites audiences into a space where feeling is everything and the boundaries of genre dissolve.\\n\\nFor more information on access at EartH, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/44dzl75 or contact us at access@earthackney.co.uk\\n\\nEartH is a social enterprise committed to supporting new musicians, with music studios in the venue that are completely free for young artists to use. When you attend a show in EartH Theatre, head to the back of the space to rent a cushion for just £2. Not only will you get to sit more comfortably, but all proceeds go towards funding Studio 36. Find out more here: https://earthackney.co.uk/about/studio-36/\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"donation\":{\"description\":\"At EartH, we want our space to give back to the community. That’s why we teamed up with Progression Sessions to open Studio 36 inside our venue. Studio 36 provides music making facilities and expertise for free to young musicians in London who face a variety of barriers that might prevent them from making the most of their creativity and talent. \\n\\nEvery donation helps keep Studio 36 open and accessible, so that more young people can find their voice, develop their talents and feel supported as they take their next steps.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-28/af5fb538-b9c7-4f41-bf11-48d1d9d6d45a.jpeg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"variants\":[{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":100,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTEwNjk2NiwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTE4MjM0LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1OToyOC40Njg4NTdaIiwicHJpY2UiOjEwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MjcxNCwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MzAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":300,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTEwNjk2NiwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTE4MjM0LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1OToyOC40Njg4ODNaIiwicHJpY2UiOjMwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MjcxNSwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6NTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":500,\"sales_tax