 We advise all customers to bring valid ID. For further information, see Age and ID in FAQs. Right of admission reserved.\",\"order\":0}],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"92xe67-murcof-live-av-21st-mar-rio-cinema-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1774119600,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-06/afc4dbfd-9372-45c9-b94c-ca4f464b0321.jpg?rect=2234%2C0%2C5740%2C5740\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-06/afc4dbfd-9372-45c9-b94c-ca4f464b0321.jpg?rect=320%2C0%2C9567%2C5740\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-06/afc4dbfd-9372-45c9-b94c-ca4f464b0321.jpg?rect=3525%2C0%2C3157%2C5740\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/f19ef19adaa7?dice_id=f19ef19adaa7\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ad03c0bd594a?dice_id=ad03c0bd594a\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r55908449354?dice_id=r55908449354\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W3fa21427022?dice_id=W3fa21427022\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m6c5c153c358?dice_id=m6c5c153c358\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/aff09a1b7684?dice_id=aff09a1b7684\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"733\",\"name\":\"Rio Cinema\",\"address\":\"107 Kingsland High Street, London E8 2PB\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5493458,\"lng\":-0.0752909999999929},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"rio-cinema-py7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.riocinema.org.uk/your-visit/\"},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-21T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Murcof is performing at the historic Art Deco Rio Cinema in Dalston, making full use of the cinema screen with a live AV performance of Twin Color.\\n\\n**Murcof** - Mexican-born musician Fernando Corona primarily records and performs under the name Murcof, creating ghostly compositions that fuse elements of classical music, minimal techno, ambient drone, and free improvisation, among other genres. His first album, 2002's Martes, blended the holy minimalism of composers like Arvo Part and Henryk Górecki with glitchy, microscopic beats.\\n\\n***toechter -*** toechter (de/dk) drew the attention with the release of their critically acclaimed debut album »Zephyr« in 2022 – dancing at the outer edges of what we would normally expect from music made with violin, viola, cello and voice. The three musicians in toechter – Marie-Claire Schlameus, Lisa Marie Vogel and Katrine Grarup Elbo – all grew up immersed in the conventions of classical music.\\n\\nThis is a seated event on a first come, first served basis. Last entry at 9pm.\\n\\n***Artists:*** We are always interested in hearing from talented artists. If you’d like to play at our future events, please get in touch.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"Under 18s accompanied by an adult.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8245dee419ed43db:94\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"12522\",\"name\":\"REAL\",\"image\":{\"url\":