",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.523568,\"lng\":-0.144821},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-04-28/84389ecd-ecb4-45bc-a846-5cf9964535ff.jpg?rect=180%2C0%2C838%2C838\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"229-zl9b\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://229.london/access/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-21T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":false,\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Join us for a rare and captivating evening with Imarhan, one of the strong faces of Tamanrasset’s musical scene.\\n\\nThree albums with City Slang, more than 500 concerts on five continents, and a clear line: playing a music rooted, without posture or folklore.\\n\\nIn 2026, the band are celebrating their twentieth anniversary by returning with a fourth album, recorded at their studio Aboogie, in the heart of the city. A tense, dry record, crossed with their local scene, the sound is raw, tight, without detours. No storytelling. Just a group that ploughs its furrow, without trying to explain.\\n\\nA mainland European tour in late 2025, with a stop at Africa Express, the travelling music factory of Damon Albarn. And then a world tour in 2026 including these select UK dates. Not to wear a banner. Just to play.\\n\\nPresented by AGMP Concerts\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"do