,\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"It’s been a long time coming, but Yakkie’s first album KILL THE COP INSIDE YOUR HEAD is coming and we want YOU to come and celebrate with us! YAKKIE are very proud of their ten-headed beast of a child and are headed back over to The Victoria to make sure they give it the launch that it deserves.\\n\\nExpect a rawkus live show from DIY punk’s premier riff peddlers and their mates TBC.\\n\\nYakkie is a metal-loving punk supergroup made up of Janey Starling, Maeve Westall, Laura Ankles and Robin Gatt. Between them they’ve been in bands such as Petrol Girls, Dream Nails, Colour Me Wednesday, itoldyouiwouldeatyou and Personal Best. They are the soundtrack to your favourite 90s teen film, best enjoyed through your Walkman en route to the local skate park.\\n\\nFFO: Soundgarden, Smashing Pumpkins, Alanis Morissette\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"45901351f3567a3a:1\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2399\",\"name\":\"The Victoria Dalston\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-victoria-dalston-l3wp\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Short Waves.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":96,\"name\":\"JaguarShoes Collective\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"http://www.jaguarshoes.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"429057253484103\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":n