:true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Noise Factory United are peddlers of apocalypse anxiety through a gnarly trill of guitar & synth.\\n\\nDrawing from the grit of social realist writers of crisis & change, these four compadres are out to make sense of the fractured intensity of modern life.\\n\\nThey don’t do songs about unrequited love or plunge into the self-obsession of minor narcissisms. No wistful romance, no solipsistic spirals, no power ballads. Just infectious, socially-driven, self-deprecating songs about the grey & enigmatic zones of the everyday.\\n\\nFFO: Gang of Four, early Roxy, and early Ultravox.\\n\\nThe Dandelion Chain is a polymorphic band creating bold, genre-blurring music that fuses post-punk energy, gothic edge, and pop sensibilities. Known for their inventive live performances and evocative soundscapes, they combine intricate arrangements with raw emotion.\\n\\nThe Dandelion Chain delivers a brightly dark and unforgettable musical experience.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"45901351f3567a3a:9\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"141989\",\"name\":\"The Bread and Roses\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-bread-and-roses-xpbnm\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Bread and Roses.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":3},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1767627000,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-05T15:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_e