 brings her unmistakable Amapiano and 3 step energy to the UK and unmissable live experience.\\n\\nExpect big moments, real vibes, and an atmosphere that hits different.\\n\\nLondon this one is special.\\n\\nSecure your tickets now..\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"45901351f3567a3a:20\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"141763\",\"name\":\"Piano Republik\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"piano-republik-mem29\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Piano Republik.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"MaWhoo\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebcb3b5db3d3ad776580c74d53\"},\"artist_id\":\"79685\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1766252700,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-20T17:45:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-22T20:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-23T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-22T16:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-22T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"6946dfdbba92450001d9607c\",\"name\":\"Mawhoo Live In London \",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1265},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"MaWhoo - Bengicela (feat. JAZZWRLD)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6xlxghvkH5yDv93NoHlWOx\",\"artist\":\"MaWhoo\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/0da7196c8c3a2