",\"address\":\"Camden Stables Market, 87/88 North Yard, Chalk Farm, NW1 8AH, London, Greater London, England, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.542337,\"lng\":-0.147764},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"67a4f245752bf63d0be1e422\",\"name\":\"Archway\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.564906,\"lng\":-0.142079,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-dark-horse-stables-k63g9\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-22T18:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"London, get ready — a new chapter in Latin music is about to be written.\\n\\nFor the first time ever, Cuban artist Fresto brings his unmistakable voice, raw emotion, and Caribbean soul to London city, marking a historic debut that promises to be nothing short of unforgettable. Known for turning heartbreak into anthems and passion into melody, Fresto arrives with a sound that has already crossed oceans — now ready to echo through one of the world’s most iconic music capitals.\\n\\nFrom the viral power of “Me Hace Daño Verte” to the romantic pulse of his latest work, Fresto’s music blends Cuban roots, modern salsa, and heartfelt storytelling into a live experience that goes far beyond a concert — it’s a connection. This London debut is not just another date on a tour; it’s a moment for fans who have waited to feel his songs come alive on stage.\\n\\nExpect intensity. Expect intimacy. Expect the kind of performance that reminds you why live music still matters.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"45901351f3567a3a:25\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"10601\",\"name\":\"Sambroso Sambroso\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"sambroso-sambroso-ltd-awdq\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Sambroso Sambroso LTD.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"DJ Javier La Maquina De Cuba\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"112624\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Fresto\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"132707\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"DJ Javier La Maquina De Cuba\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"112624\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1769000400,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-21T13:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-22T20:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-21T13:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-22T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-22T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"6971365f4a279a0001bb013d\",\"name\":\"Fresto Live at The Dark Horse Stables \",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3740},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[],\"faqs\":[],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"yo6nbr-deptford-dub-club-22nd-mar-fox-and-firkin-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1774202400,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/0d7e7d5f-7f20-4b9f-82b0-7fd9191c7774.jpg?rect=0%2C483%2C2550%2C2550\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/0d7e7d5f-7f20-4b9f-82b0-7fd9191c7774.jpg?rect=0%2C993%2C2550%2C1530\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/0d7e7d5f-7f20-4b9f-82b0-7fd9191c7774.jpg?rect=309%2C0%2C1933%2C3515\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v2ee6b68b5b2?dice_id=v2ee6b68b5b2\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W70c652b9078?dice_id=W70c652b9078\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s3a5a973b6cb?dice_id=s3a5a973b6cb\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Rd8f78979adb?dice_id=Rd8f78979adb\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/zbd45afec31e?dice_id=zbd45afec31e\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/zec989144a98?dice_id=zec989144a98\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"15510\",\"name\":\"Fox And Firkin\",\"address\":\"316 Lewisham High Street, Lewisham, London, SE13 6JZ, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.45698,\"lng\":-0.01441},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-04/8f120254-16c6-4f38-a599-6dbc7a16c8db.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2363%2C2363\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"fox-and-firkin-8ev7w\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-22T18:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"We are pleased and proud to welcome Duke Neville back to the D.D.C.. The legendary Duke is known as “The Rocksteady Teacher”. The mighty Neville started out selecting on the General Soundsystem in the 70s. He selects to entertain and is also an entertaining raconteur on the mic.. Duke Neville remains a very well respected figure on the London Reggae Revive circuit and has wowed big events, such as the London Ska Festival.\\n\\nThroughout proceedings our resident Sing-jay, the mighty Doc Murdoc will be on hand to nice-up the dance. The inimitable Doctor will need no introduction to many, as he is a pillar of the London Reggae scene. He, and the club’s resident selector, Soft Wax, recently supported Black Uhuru and together they’ve grace many of the capital’s stages and far beyond. For this night they will be joined by the D.D.C.s recently amended live horn section including Club favourite Michael.\\n\\nThe evening will also include a selection from Duppy Sista Sound. We’re delighted to welcome the vibrant Jaz back to select for us, she is a stalwart of the Club; more broadly, she’s a well-established figure on the London Reggae scene. \\n\\nWe’re looking forward to another blinding evening of live mixes from the great Prince Fatty on the desk. An enhanced sound system is a feature of this popular night, held in a convivial boozer. The palatial, discrete garden will have the evening sets piped out to it. Put on your dancing shoes.\\n\\n£3 in adv. £5 o.t.d.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"45901351f3567a3a:26\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"10745\",\"name\":\"The Fox & Firkin\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-fox--firkin-em3y\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Fox & Firkin.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extra