e,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"43\",\"name\":\"MOTH Club\",\"address\":\"Old Trades Hall, Valette Street, London E9 6NU\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5450825,\"lng\":-0.0546326999999565},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-04-14/0164c968-c9f6-4e55-8329-e0a12ce43b69.jpg?rect=341%2C0%2C1367%2C1367\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"moth-club-43ox\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://mothclub.co.uk/Access\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-22T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Speed of Sound are delighted to welcome Sam Blasucci to MOTH Club for a very special London headline show on Sunday, 22nd of March as part of their UK/EU tour.\\n\\nSam Blasucci’s music is made for lovers - a vibrant mix of upbeat vintage boogie & heartfelt soul. Half of the band Mapache, he spent the last 10 years tinkering with his songwriting and touring with the likes of the Allah-Lahs & Babe Rainbow. Since then, Sam has developed his solo project into 3 critically acclaimed albums starting with his debut record “Off My Stars”.\\n\\n“You can feel the sonic sincerity and intense intimacy pouring from the pores of every track as the sun collides with the moon in an epic evocation of the senses.” - Self Portrait Gospel\\n\\nHis latest EP release \\\"ORCHIDS\\\" is the first movement off his double album “Physical Dream” coming this spring.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"