 spotlight with an intimate performance ahead of her upcoming project, set to launch this September. Expect an unforgettable evening of rich storytelling, magnetic vocals, and genre‑blending alt‑Latin pop.\\n\\n*For accessibility information please see the accessibility information button/link below.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"45901351f3567a3a:37\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8466\",\"name\":\"Outernet Venue Ltd\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"outernet-venue-ltd-96a7\",\"profile_active\":true},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Rosa Cecilia.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Rosa Cecilia\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-06-27/2079279a-5882-4f87-afbe-a85e6ab06ce7.jpg?rect=0%2C53%2C535%2C535\"},\"artist_id\":\"53911\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":819,\"name\":\"The Lower Third\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://thelowerthird.co.uk/privacy-notice/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"783951717556608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-ZVCKXCPJY8\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"announcement_date_unix\":1753430400,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-07-25T09:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-22T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-07-25T09:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_dat