https://link.dice.fm/o71ed20eadd4?dice_id=o71ed20eadd4\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/hb6a55949a72?dice_id=hb6a55949a72\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k27fe2bec134?dice_id=k27fe2bec134\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p2005acb57f4?dice_id=p2005acb57f4\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R96d5a2c5852?dice_id=R96d5a2c5852\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"34\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"address\":\"Upper Street, London N1 2UD\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5395894,\"lng\":-0.102482699999996},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-02-10/05562e9c-c684-4beb-b818-4e908bbfb14d.jpg?rect=712%2C0%2C2832%2C2832\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-z8e2\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/about/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-22T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":false,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Gio Evan is a multifaceted artist: writer and poet, philosopher, humorist, performer, singer-songwriter, and street artist. Between 2007 and 2015, he embarked on a bicycle journey that took him across much of the world: India, South America, and Europe. During this time, he studied and lived alongside local masters and shamans. In Argentina, he was given the name “Gio Evan” by a Hopi elder.\\n\\nThe year 2023 marked the beginning of his international breakthrough. Since then, he has performed at the Sziget Festival in Budapest, headlined two major concerts in the United States—one in Miami and one in Los Angeles—and served as the patron of the French festival FIMU in Belfort. He also completed sold-out tours across some of Italy’s most prestigious theatres.\\n\\nLast year, he returned to top Italian venues with his new show, L’AFFINE DEL MONDO. Don’t miss his upcoming performance in London!  \\n*  \\nBy purchasing a ticket to this event you are agreeing to adhere to Islington Assembly Hall's terms and conditions: https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/customer-terms-conditions-2022/*\\n\\n*All tickets to shows at Islington Assembly Hall are subject to a Venue Levy of £1.50 + VAT. As a Grade II listed building, this levy will be reinvested into Islington Assembly Hall and its services, meaning the customer experience can continue to be enhanced.*\\n\\nThis is a 16+ event – you may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"45901351f3567a3a:38\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1607\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-78g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by TIJ Events and Citizen Live.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Gio Evan\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-05-01/ff7bc3ca-4c13-48be-932c-e5bc2671a4f5.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"27213\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1,\"name