 age restrictions?\",\"body\":\"This is a 16+ event. Each under 18 must be accompanied by a responsible adult (1:1 ratio). Customers may be requested to provide valid physical photo ID upon entry, this is to ensure customer safety and ensure our legal age requirements are met. For this reason, we request that all customers bring valid ID. Digital or photocopied ID will not be accepted. For further information see Age and ID in FAQ’s. Right of admission reserved.\",\"order\":0}],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"dka3yq-tony-bontana-wing-thom-dehli-23rd-mar-windmill-brixton-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1774295100,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-09/fb328cbb-2761-4693-8901-77bbcae17349.jpg?rect=0%2C600%2C4800%2C4800\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-09/fb328cbb-2761-4693-8901-77bbcae17349.jpg?rect=0%2C1560%2C4800%2C2880\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-09/fb328cbb-2761-4693-8901-77bbcae17349.jpg?rect=750%2C0%2C3300%2C6000\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w484b28b1d6e?dice_id=w484b28b1d6e\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R90c6ddebc75?dice_id=R90c6ddebc75\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/baea272634e1?dice_id=baea272634e1\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u4f04af7c7cc?dice_id=u4f04af7c7cc\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p0a0d87fc8bd?dice_id=p0a0d87fc8bd\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/V81f5ae1e086?dice_id=V81f5ae1e086\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"441\",\"name\":\"Windmill Brixton\",\"address\":\"22 Blenheim Gardens, London SW2 5BZ\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.454073,\"lng\":-0.122336300000029},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"windmill-brixton-jxdl\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.windmillbrixton.co.uk/visitor-info\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-23T19:45:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"TONY BONTANA - https://linktr.ee/tonybontana\\n\\nBirmingham based rapper, producer, and multi-instrumentalist, Tony Bontana is a trailblazer in the UK’s experimental hip-hop landscape, renowned for his self-coined “Splayed” style—a distinctive blend of degraded, manipulated samples, non-linear rhythms, and deeply introspective lyricism, released through his independent label, Everything is Perfect Records.\\n\\nHis extensive discography fuses abstract hip-hop, post-hardcore, indie rock, punk and soul influences, showcasing his genre-defying versatility.\\n\\nBontana’s production credits include work with prominent underground artists like Novelist, PREM, Lil B, Billy Woods, Jadasea, Goya Gumbani, Mary Sue and Cities Aviv, while his raw, evocative live performances have captivated audiences.\\n\\nHis innovative sound and creative philosophy have earned critical acclaim from publications like Pitchfork, which lauded TUMPIT’s imaginative qualities, The Wire, which explored his “Splayed” ethos in a 2022 interview, as well as Afropunk, Cvltnation , Altpress and BABMAG, solidifying his undeniable growing influence in the global underground music scene.\\n\\nPlus support from\\n\\nWing! - is Bexleyheath born and raised producer Adam Swan with his ghostly instrumental hip hop project combining sample-based beat-making with a live rhythm section. https://www.instagram.com/wingroulette/\\n\\nThom Dehli - https://www.instagram.com/thomdehli\\n\\nand more\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"45901351f3567a3a:51\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"487\",\"name\":\"Windmill Brixton\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"windmill-brixton-4mgk\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Windmill Brixton.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Tony Bontana \",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"35101\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"wing!\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-11/00b10928-fb41-4a2b-b26e-4d41c2b29328.jpg?rect=4%2C0%2C4312%2C4312\"},\"artist_id\":\"113985\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1765238400,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-09T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-23T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-09T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-23T19:45:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-23T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"69383740c62a980001e7be46\",\"name\":\"Tony Bontana, Wing!, Thom Dehli\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":700,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Tony Bontana - Battered Chips\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5dIYfk8r