\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-16/55efcf08-bf92-4133-9898-e02a554721ed.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1500%2C1500\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-16/55efcf08-bf92-4133-9898-e02a554721ed.jpg?rect=0%2C300%2C1500%2C900\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-16/55efcf08-bf92-4133-9898-e02a554721ed.jpg?rect=338%2C0%2C825%2C1500\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ybbca072b0c1?dice_id=Ybbca072b0c1\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/V078e6a43152?dice_id=V078e6a43152\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ef340845d3a8?dice_id=ef340845d3a8\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Nfec7c02763e?dice_id=Nfec7c02763e\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K0810569247b?dice_id=K0810569247b\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T0a91e151794?dice_id=T0a91e151794\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"2691\",\"name\":\"Night Tales Loft\",\"address\":\"207, 1 Westgate St, London E8 3RL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.53753889999999,\"lng\":-0.05786670000000001},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-03-28/9ded5223-ee50-49da-9cc8-dfb16fb11e4e.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1317%2C1317\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"night-tales-loft-39wp\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-24T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Presented by Johnnie Walker Black Label × NT’s Loft**\\n\\nPlayback returns as a candlelit listening experience where over 200 candles transform NT’s Loft into a glowing sanctuary. Designed to slow things down, each session invites guests to disconnect from the noise and fully immerse themselves in the music that shapes culture.\\n\\nOn Tuesday, 24th March, we turn our focus to Kendrick Lamar, a powerful, cinematic journey through one of the most influential catalogues in modern music. From the coming-of-age intensity of good kid, m.A.A.d city and the jazz-infused political weight of To Pimp a Butterfly, to the razor-sharp introspection of DAMN. and the emotional reckoning of Mr. Morale & The Big Steppers, this session explores the storytelling, social commentary, and lyrical mastery that define Kendrick’s legacy.\\n\\nExperience every bar, beat, and breath through the warmth and precision of Funktion-One sound, in an intimate, candlelit setting.\\n\\nJohnnie Walker Black Label returns to elevate the evening, with signature serves available throughout the night. **Guests arriving before 8pm will receive a complimentary drink to begin the evening in style (Limited to First 50 Customers).**\\n\\nTickets\\n\\nReserved seating ticket holders must arrive by 8:00 PM. **Seating is first come, first served.**\\n\\n—\\n\\nSchedule\\n\\n7:00 PM – Doors & Playlist\\n\\n8:15 PM – Listening Session Begins (90 mins)\\n\\nLimited capacity. Arrive early, stay late.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event. Bring your ID card with you. ID Scanner in place. \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"45901351f3567a3a:55\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2368\",\"name\":\"Night Tales Loft\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/att