/ SHOW ENDS APPROX. 10PM**\\n\\n**This is a 14+ event. Under 18s must accompanied by an adult 21+ (max. 2 U18s per adult 21+)**\\n\\n25th March: Clapham, Deptford & Tooting choirs\\n\\nJoin us as we celebrate a decade of Real Voices over three nights at the much-loved Clapham Grand!\\n\\nReal Voices is a community of non-auditioned contemporary choirs across South London. Over 400 singers will grace the stage across the three nights, backed by our brilliant house band. Expect unique choral reimaginings of decade-spanning pop/rock favourites, indie gems and recent chart hits: songs by the likes of Prince, Olivia Dean, The Cranberries, Foo Fighters and Sophie Ellis-Bextor.\\n\\nWe’re thrilled to be back at the Clapham Grand to mark this special milestone: 10 years of music, community and joy. We hope you’ll join us for a feel-good night of great music!\\n\\nThese performances are taking place in a gorgeous listed Victorian theatre. Your ticket includes a £1 restoration levy which will go towards the invaluable upkeep of this iconic London landmark.\\n\\n**If you have any questions please scroll down to the FAQ section below.**\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. Under 18s must accompanied by an adult 21+ (max. 2 U18s per adult 21+)\",\"highlights\":[]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"45901351f3567a3a:70\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"399\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-clapham-grand-zl9b\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Clapham Grand.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":12,\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://claphamgrand.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1705644923004016\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-5134978-1\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"announcement_date_unix\":1768996800,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-21T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-25T18:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-21T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-25T18:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-25T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"696f64ccc491140001a29709\",\"name\":\"Real Voices - March 25th\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":2150},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":48280,\"title\":\"What do I do if I have a question about the venue?\",\"body\":\"Check out all FAQs for attending shows on our website, here: https://claphamgrand.com/faqs/\\n\\nFor any further information about the show, timings, age restrictions or general questions please contact Team Grand on info@claphamgrand.com detailing your enquiry and the show/date in question and we’ll be happy to help\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":48281,\"title\":\"I have questions about access, where can I get the information I need?\",\"body\":\"You can see our venue access info here - https://claphamgrand.com/accessibility/\\n\\nIf you require PA tickets or seat reservations for access reasons please contact us **prior** to purchasing your tickets to ensure we have availability and can meet your requirements. The best way to do this is by calling us on 020 7223 6523 or emailing access@claphamgrand.com & including your phone number in the email. Our office hours are 9am-5.30pm Mon – Sat\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":48284,\"title\":\"What can I expect in terms of flashing lights, loud noises and other similar elements?\",\"body\":\"Please note there may be strobes, flashing lights, loud noises, confetti, the occasional balloon drop and other fun stuff used in the venue. If you have any concerns about this don’t hesitate to contact us if you need any further assistance, we want to make sure you have a safe and enjoyable experience with us\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":48282,\"title\":\"I have already purchased my tickets & have questions about the tickets themselves\",\"body\":\"For any ticketing enquiries - for example where to find your tickets or about the Dice app please contact DICE via their Help Desk. If you still have questions after this, please email info@claphamgrand.com\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":48285,\"title\":\"What is 'unallocated' seating?\",\"body\":\"Most of our seated shows have unallocated seating, meaning seating is on a first come, first served basis in the area you have bought a ticket for (eg stalls/circle). We never sell more tickets than there are seats available - so if you've bought a ticket for a seat, you'll definitely get a seat, you just won't have a specific seat reserved.\",\"order\":4}],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"wwl9wv-mandy-indiana-25th-mar-heaven-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1774463400,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-09/cfabf521-cab7-46c6-8e74-856a131467c3.jpg?rect=0%2C1%2C2832%2C2832\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-09/cfabf521-cab7-46c6-8e74-856a131467c3.jpg?rect=0%2C567%2C2832%2C1699\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-09/cfabf521-cab7-46c6-8e74-856a131467c3.jpg?rect=637%2C0%2C1558%2C2833\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T3bb960f9648?dice_id=T3bb960f9648\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Nd3613b9432a?dice_id=Nd3613b9432a\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u03911d4e53a?dice_id=u03911d4e53a\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Aa08d500fa77?dice_id=Aa08d500fa77\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p8692af7c27e?dice_id=p8692af7c27e\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/C14d93b4e244?dice_id=C14d93b4e244\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"207\",\"name\":\"Heaven\",\"address\":\"11, The Arches, Villiers St, London WC2N 6NG\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5080932,\"lng\":-0.124121400000035},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"heaven-j72p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://g-a-yandheaven.co.uk/about/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-25T18:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Support act: **The Null Club**\\n\\nPlease note, this event will end by 10pm\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ only, u16s w/ adult (ID required for under 25s)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"45901351f3567a3a:71\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"12\",\"name\":\"Bad Vibrations\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-09-15/dfc81b8e-e212-4b13-a954-3348aa9a856e.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"bad-vibrations-jqa4\",\"profile_active\":true},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Bad Vibrations\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"The Null Club\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb3e3dba9013be428327d202ed\"},\"artist_id\":\"114811\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Mandy, Indiana\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb56f233b41f1a40afc06e84a8\"},\"artist_id\":\"25436\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Mandy, Indiana sign to Sacred Bones and announce their new album, URGH, out February 6th, with lead single “Magazine.” On URGH, Mandy, Indiana is a force of uncanny nature, grafting together a record that is as much a call to action as a parlay into oblivion and transcendence. Following their acclaimed 2023 debut, i’ve seen a way, URGH finds the band expanding their far-reaching sound with each member - vocalist Valentine Caulfield, guitarist and producer Scott Fair, synth player Simon Catling, and drummer Alex Macdougall - actively taking part in the songwriting process. Across ten tracks, Mandy, Indiana interpolate their own unconventional language into a mantra for self-determination and resilience, forging a template for a brighter future before it fades to black.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"LNZRT\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://lanzaroteworks.com/Privacy-Policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":225,\"na