ve\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-26T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":false,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Jamie Williams and the Roots Collective exist on an imaginary tightrope stretching between Tom Petty & The Rolling Stones.\\n\\nSettled into the current super-tight line-up after many years and hundreds of shows the band is now on fire, playing their own style of Country Blues, Rock & Americana at festivals, venues, clubs & pubs, their ethos is always to have fun and make sure the crowd does too.\\n\\nThis is not a band that stands onstage staring at their (red) shoes. They’ve shared line-ups with likes of Wilko Johnson, The Blockheads, The Darkness, The Pretty Things, Los Pacaminos, The Quireboys, Dr Feelgood, the Yardbirds, Eddi Reeder & the Animals to name a few.\\n\\nJamie Williams - Lead Vocals; Electric & Acoustic Rhythm Guitars\\n\\nDave Milligan - Electric Lead and Rhythm Guitars; Backing Vocals;\\n\\nJake Milligan - Bass Guitars\\n\\nJames Bacon- Drums\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages under 16's must be accompanied by an adult\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"14e26421af20bb85:2\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"4307\",\"name\":\"Hot Box Live Community Interest \",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-live-community-interest-7v77\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Hot Box Live Community Interest Company.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Jamie Williams and The Roots Collective\",\"image\":