gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Following the success of his Winter Yards Band tour, Steve Knightley is delighted to announce Sanctuary – Songs from Sacred Spaces. Known for his songs of history and location , Steve will create an evening of material beautifully matched to these resonant venues — churches, chapels and ancient buildings chosen for their atmosphere and acoustic warmth. The concerts will also feature Dan Salvatore, who’s haunting handpan soundscapes add a meditative, ambient dimension to the evening. Expect stripped-back arrangements, strong storytelling, and a focus on the relationship between song, space, and listener.\\n\\nwww.steveknightley.com\\n\\nwww.facebook.com/steveknightley\\n\\nwww.instagram.com/steveknightleyofficial\\n\\nwww.x.com/sohsteve\\n\\nwww.youtube.com/@SteveKnightleyOfficial?sub\\\\_confirmation=1\\n\\nhttps://open.spotify.com/artist/7bEdfQZ5D4PoPlqTgeeZv8\\n\\nhttps://music.apple.com/gb/artist/steve-knightley/156045021\\n\\nwww.facebook.com/Daniel.Salvator33\\n\\nwww.facebook.com/Salvatore.Handpans\\n\\nwww.instagram.com/salvatore\\\\_handpans\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"14e26421af20bb85:12\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1768\",\"name\":\"DMP\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"dmp-d5kq\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by DMP.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Steve Knightley\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"90454\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":2237,\"name\":\"DMP\",\"privacy_policy_l