e by Hans Zimmerman for the Pirates of the Caribbean OST, together with the English vocal group The Wellermen and other artist friends, a true viral phenomenon on TikTok and streaming services (third most used sound on TikTok in February 2024, 100M+ global streams).\\n\\nAfter making his solo debut with the single Before We Lose Control, Davide becomes the first and only one European to be selected for the Acappella Academy of Avi Kaplan, Pentatonix’s leader and former member, and to fly to California in July 2023 to immerse himself in an intensive vocal improvement course alongside one of his greatest idols ever. Upon his return, he begins working on new unreleased songs, which see the light in his debut EP Virus (1,5M global streams), and is nominated “Artist of the Week” by TikTok Italia in the summer of 2024, having the chance to participate in their live format Prendi il Microfono.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"14e26421af20bb85:21\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"11372\",\"name\":\"Citizen Live\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-07-04/3986ab94-e1cf-489e-95df-450093b12e1c.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"citizen-live-6al8\",\"profile_active\":true},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Citizen Live.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Davide Dalmonte\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"123886\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1751965200,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-07-08T10:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-26T19:30:00