\"perm_name\":\"6dnar7-earth-presents-voices-from-the-lake-360-immersive-sound-show-27th-mar-earth-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1774638000,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/7f99c321-603e-4af0-9e00-4e93219767a5.jpg?rect=0%2C443%2C1771%2C1771\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/7f99c321-603e-4af0-9e00-4e93219767a5.jpg?rect=0%2C797%2C1771%2C1063\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/7f99c321-603e-4af0-9e00-4e93219767a5.jpg?rect=155%2C0%2C1461%2C2657\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W189fda95879?dice_id=W189fda95879\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s52e0c05203d?dice_id=s52e0c05203d\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/fef970ae9755?dice_id=fef970ae9755\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W58f03575061?dice_id=W58f03575061\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ya665befce84?dice_id=ya665befce84\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/l3f6675df90d?dice_id=l3f6675df90d\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1955\",\"name\":\"EartH\",\"address\":\"11 Stoke Newington Rd, London N16 8BH, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5509892,\"lng\":-0.07532500000002074},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-02-02/92037b31-0756-4c73-9f1b-11e5c4753296.jpg?rect=683%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"earth-76a7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://bit.ly/44dzl75\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":\"EartH Theatre\",\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-27T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"This event will take place in EartH Theatre.\\n\\nThirteen years after their landmark debut, Italian duo Voices From The Lake (Donato Dozzy & Neel) return with their much-anticipated second album, ‘II’ (two) on their own Spazio Disponibile. The record marks a new chapter in one of electronic music’s most revered projects.\\n\\nBorn from a friendship and a singular musical vision, Voices From The Lake first emerged as a one-off live performance in the Japanese Alps, later distilled into their self-titled 2012 album. That record has since become a touchstone in ambient techno, reshaping the global landscape of hypnotic and atmospheric electronic music. In the years since, the duo have performed worldwide, released a handful of EPs, worked on installations, and founded record labels, all while continuing to refine the project’s unique identity. Yet the core of Voices From The Lake has always been its deep, aqueous approach to sound, a sensibility that returns in full force on II.\\n\\n“The project was never meant to become what it did,” the duo reflect. “At one point, we even paused it. Only to later embrace it in all its forms. II is both a continuation and a reinvention.” True to that spirit, Voices From The Lake have explored extremes in recent years, from high-tempo live sets to seated listening concerts, while remaining anchored in the meditative pulse of ambient techno. II extends this lineage, carrying forward the immersive sound design and boundary-pushing vision that has defined their work from the beginning.\\n\\nFor more information on access at EartH, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/44dzl75 or contact us at access@earthackney.co.uk\\n\\nEartH is a social enterprise committed to supporting new musicians, with music studios in the venue that are completely free for young artists to use. When you attend a show in EartH Theatre, head to the back of the space to rent a cushion for just £2. Not only will you get to sit more comfortably, but all proceeds go towards funding Studio 36. Find out more here: https://earthackney.co.uk/about/studio-36/\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"donation\":{\"description\":\"At EartH, we want our space to give back to the community. That’s why we teamed up with Progression Sessions to open Studio 36 inside our venue. Studio 36 provides music making facilities and expertise for free to young musicians in London who face a variety of barriers that might prevent them from making the most of their creativity and talent. \\n\\nEvery donation helps keep Studio 36 open and accessible, so that more young people can find their voice, develop their talents and feel supported as they take their next steps.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-28/af5fb538-b9c7-4f41-bf11-48d1d9d6d45a.jpeg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"variants\":[{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":100,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE4Mzg2MSwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTUwMzI0LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1OTo0OS42Mjk3OTJaIiwicHJpY2UiOjEwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MzU1NywicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MzAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":300,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE4Mzg2MSwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTUwMzI0LCJjcm