pirited heir to Brazilian Tropicalism, Lucas Santtana arrives in London to celebrate 25 years of his groundbreaking career with the release of his tenth album, Brasiliano.**\\n\\nIn a world where, according to UNESCO, a language disappears every 14 days, Santtana has crafted a powerful response. His new opus is a true polyglot manifesto celebrating the vitality of the Brazilian language and its cousin Romance languages.\\n\\nA collective celebration featuring eleven prestigious international collaborators, including Brazilian legends such as Gilberto Gil, Paralamas do Sucesso or Chico César. Brasiliano, sung in eight different languages, transforms language itself into a musical instrument and a political tool.\\n\\nThe Bahian singer-songwriter masterfully blends popular rhythms, contemporary soundscapes, and vibrant melodies.\\n\\nA polyphonic conversation, inviting you to reflect on cultural heritage, identity, and the possibility of a shared language.\\n\\nCome discover one of the most independent and stimulating voices among Brazilian music scene.\\n\\n**This is a standing show**\\n\\n**This event is 14+ all under 18s must be accompanied by a full paying adult**\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This event is 14+ all under 18s must be accompanied by a full paying adult\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"14e26421af20bb85:38\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"6234\",\"name\":\"229\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"229-82l5\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by 229.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Lucas Santtana\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/dd047c3400bb9975dc2c5d7f83c3a02f2ee3