both form from improvisatory moments of expression. ‘Blue Car’ is a collection of songs from her archive of unreleased solo recordings. Similar to ‘Painting Stupid Girls’, these tracks attempt to record the moment, and where she was at emotionally that day, similar to diary entries. The dates she wrote these songs is unknown, they span roughly a ten year period.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":260,\"name\":\"Bird On The Wire\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.birdonthewire.net/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"168353773761986\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"announcement_date_unix\":1760349600,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-13T11:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-27T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-10-14T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-27T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-27T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"68e93a93a98be7000151d0ae\",\"name\":\"Joanne Robertson\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2496,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Joanne Robertson & Oliver Coates - Gown\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/gown/1806107071?i=1806107083&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Joanne Robertson & Oliver Coates\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/be/d9/5f/bed95f68-188b-6339-96c1-ee59840ceb49/mzaf_734128430896032362.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Gown\"}],\"faqs\":[],\