standing apart from the more media-friendly Turkish psych revival scene.\\n\\n**LA NOUVELLE MUSIQUE**\\n\\nThis London-based psych-folk duo weave folk-tinged, cinematic psychedelia with a vocal presence somewhere between Vashti Bunyan and Nico. Their songs unfold like dreamlike landscape with orchestration that often hints at a widescreen.\\n\\nSinger and bass player Joanna Beck is also a composer and performance artist, working across electroacoustic music and sonic art, with scores for theatre and film adding further depth to the duo’s immersive world.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"14e26421af20bb85:54\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"134950\",\"name\":\"Anatolian Grooves\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-05/661adfea-54a5-485a-9c83-c6e8646d6def.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"anatolian-grooves-bdokg\",\"profile_active\":true},\"presented_by\":\"Anatolian Grooves\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"La Nouvelle Musique\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-09-03/2c7b82b2-5bda-4d8d-936d-f3b247795802.jpg?rect=0%2C51%2C539%2C539\"},\"artist_id\":\"107135\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Yasak Helva\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-07-31/6ad04137-5c3a-4012-948f-6f357a581b7f.jpg?rect=1%2C0%2C638%2C638\"},\"artist_id\":\"125141\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":220,\"name\":\"Paper Dress Vintage\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1196387937118330\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_i