 the second series in style at Peckham Levels – the final stop on our city-wide journey through the UK’s most exciting grassroots space for live jazz.\\n\\nMyele Manzanza is a live-wire drummer, producer, and one of the most exciting jazz artists on the global stage. From Electric Wire Hustle to his acclaimed solo work and collaborations with Jordan Rakei, Theo Parrish, Ashley Henry and Mark de Clive-Lowe, Myele’s Crisis & Opportunity series has earned praise from The Guardian to Jazz FM. His quartet has shared stages with Hiatus Kaiyote, The Bad Plus, and Alfa Mist, and now he brings that unstoppable energy to Peckham.\\n\\nClose-up, no-filter, and electrifying – the unmistakable spirit of Ronnie’s, ending our London series with a bang.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"14e26421af20bb85:55\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1321\",\"name\":\"Ronnie Scott's\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"ronnie-scotts-eklo\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Ronnie Scott's.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Myele Manzanza\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb10d795928719878a8a9f7a3b\"},\"artist_id\":\"35158\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Lyle Barton\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"102242\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Rio Kai\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"133360\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":300,\"name\":\"Ronnie Scott's\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.ronniescotts.co.uk/privacy\",\"fb_pixel_i