s://link.dice.fm/x101ffb61698?dice_id=x101ffb61698\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H1b44f714d83?dice_id=H1b44f714d83\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y380c1ed79c3?dice_id=Y380c1ed79c3\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"298\",\"name\":\"Strongroom Bar\",\"address\":\"120-124 Curtain Rd, Shoreditch, London EC2A 3SQ, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5259644,\"lng\":-0.0801498},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-11-09/01c2cab5-15ea-48e0-a0b4-d9ed0465d9db.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C850%2C850\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"strongroom-bar-4bym\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-27T19:45:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":false,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"**THE GLASS KEY:**\\n\\nThe Glass Key was born as an instrumental duo based in London a lustre ago. It initially comprised Andrea Giommi (Sons of Viljems - Edible Woman - Leg Leg - The Emerald Leaves -Laura Loriga - Too Early/Too Late - Shama Rahman) and Nicola Lombardi (Uyuni - Mr Brace). Through studio sessions with the great British drummer Frank Byng (Snorkel, This Is Not This Heat) drums were added to their live set up and the addition of the drumset bled into the compositions.\\n\\nThe Glass Key is now a trio of relentless psychedelic groove. Their songs combine heavy electronic rhythms with layers of guitars and synth riffs. The result is mostly devilish instrumental music that reflects the different approaches and personalities of the musicians involved. Apocalyptic drone funk. The Glass Key New album, titled “Memoria”, will be released in March 2026 by Weird Beard and Echodelick Records.\\n\\n**LINKS:**\\n\\nSoundcloud: https://soundcloud.com/theglasskey_music\\n\\nBandcamp: https://theglasskey1.bandcamp.com/\\n\\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100077506248228\\n\\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/keytheglass/\\n\\n**A'BEAR**\\n\\nA'Bear is a multi continental psychedelic electronic musician, composer and dj making riffy\\n\\ncosmic polyrhythms weaved between melodic dreamy layered loops.\\n\\nsouth african born, australian raised, and london grown- janine a’bear’s music production\\n\\nhas garnered local and international attention.\\n\\n**LINKS:**\\n\\nhttps://linktr.ee/a_bear\\n\\nThis is an 18+ event. This venue has a strict No ID, No entry Policy. Physical government photo ID required, we do not accept photos or copies of ID’s.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"14e26421af20bb85:58\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"5285\",\"name\":\"Other Side Promotions\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-09-09/c8464497-8f12-4558-84bb-ede11bc2ddb5.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"other-side-promotions-r5gv\",\"profile_active\":true},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Other Side Promotions.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1763410500,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-17T20:15:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-27T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-17T20:15:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-27T19:45:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-27T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_d