Paris-based composer, performer, producer. Classically trained, the French artist draws inspiration from a wide range of influences, from neo-classical to punk and electronic music.\\n\\nWith a frontal and minimalist setup, she opens up the sound spectrum to its fullest, becoming the epicentre of an electronic narrative where the power of her lyrical voice and the precise conductor-like gestures, transform her performances into captivating experiences.\\n\\nSharing the stage with notable artists like Anne Clark , Kas Product , John Maus, Xeno&Oaklander, ORLAN…, MADMOIZEL has toured, since 2010, the Underground and Queer stages, European Electronics and Goth festivals, and the realm of contemporary art by collaborating with visual artists and choreographers.\\n\\nTo date, 5 albums have been released on european independent labels, and also a production of collaborative works with many remixes, singles for compilations and featuring.\\n\\nUnclassifiable yet identifiable, MADMOIZEL writes and plays a music of its own.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"14e26421af20bb85:63\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"141271\",\"name\":\"REFORMATION\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"reformation-o6bo5\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by REFORMATION.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Madmoizel\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"84958\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1769983200,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-01T22:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_e