,\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Ibiza Anthems Brunch bring the day party vibes to The Broadcaster Rooftop & Club Room in White City, London.\\n\\nRewinding back to the White Isle's golden era, expect a carefree vibe and hear a timeless Ibiza classics soundtrack from some of the Islands most celebrated DJs & performers! Previous guest DJs include: Brandon Block, Alex P, Lisa Loud, Danny Clockwork, Jonathan Ulysses, Judge Jules, Mark Knight, Smokin Jo, Bongo Ben & many more.\\n\\nBrunch tickets include free flowing luxury canapés on the rooftop + event entry.\\n\\nThe arrival time for brunch ticket holders is 12pm, the canapé service will run from 12pm - 2pm only, so you must arrive by then if you wish to eat. There is plenty of seating which you can take on a first come first served basis on the day, seating will be until 2pm only.\\n\\nEntry only ticket holders can arrive from 2:30pm\\n\\nBottomless drinks are not available at this venue.\\n\\nThe Top Floor features a covered rooftop + service bar areas. The Club Room can be found on the middle floor.\\n\\nPlease advise your server on the day if you have any allergens or specific dietary requirements.\\n\\nDates / timings subject to change.\\n\\nFor VIP table booking enquiries please email: info@ibizaanthemsbrunch.com\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"14e26421af20bb85:66\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8340\",\"name\":\"Resonate Media\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"resonate-media-yn7p\",\"profile_active\":false},