 - All That Remains\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/all-that-remains/1762414341?i=1762414360&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Abaddon UK\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/3e/6c/73/3e6c7315-aaf3-fcc5-4b8f-e4607f88f1b5/mzaf_10949517637840779791.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"All That Remains\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"score\":0,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"perm_name\":\"nvkpx5-earth-to-earth-artists-supporting-gaza-and-sudan-28th-mar-earth-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"date_unix\":1774715400,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/c319e2cf-b164-4d35-94ba-75a1d1d7667b.jpg?rect=0%2C244%2C2190%2C2190\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/c319e2cf-b164-4d35-94ba-75a1d1d7667b.jpg?rect=0%2C1019%2C2190%2C1314\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/c319e2cf-b164-4d35-94ba-75a1d1d7667b.jpg?rect=174%2C0%2C1843%2C3351\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/hb6673ea9d31?dice_id=hb6673ea9d31\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/S7d5c666e932?dice_id=S7d5c666e932\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J8890f36421d?dice_id=J8890f36421d\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E721c43dbd3b?dice_id=E721c43dbd3b\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o280d8e78fc7?dice_id=o280d8e78fc7\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e06750a50f3b?dice_id=e06750a50f3b\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1955\",\"name\":\"EartH\",\"address\":\"11 Stoke Newington Rd, London N16 8BH, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5509892,\"lng\":-0.07532500000002074},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-02-02/92037b31-0756-4c73-9f1b-11e5c4753296.jpg?rect=683%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"earth-76a7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://bit.ly/44dzl75\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":\"EartH Theatre\",\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-28T16:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"This event will take place in EartH Theatre.\\n\\nOn March 28th an esteemed handful of bands and musicians in London unite at EartH Theatre in the name of Gaza and Sudan. Half a dozen of London’s budding musical acts - including Ugly, Mary in The Junkyard, Skydaddy, Aga Ujma and Blue Bendy - will be performing in EartH’s beautiful wooden art deco theatre. Black Country, New Road will also be DJing in EartH Kitchen. Hosted by Bathtime Sounds, all proceeds from the event will be donated to War Childs’s current efforts in Gaza and Sudan, supporting not only children but also their families, helping entire communities heal, rebuild, and create safer futures together.\\n\\nFor more information on access at EartH, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/44dzl75 or contact us at access@earthackney.co.uk\\n\\nEartH is a social enterprise committed to supporting new musicians, with music studios in the venue that are completely free for young artists to use. When you attend a show in EartH Theatre, head to the back of the space to rent a cushion for just £2. Not only will you get to sit more comfortably, but all proceeds go towards funding Studio 36. Find out more here: https://earthackney.co.uk/about/studio-36/\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"donation\":{\"description\":\"At EartH, we want our space to give back to the community. That’s why we teamed up with Progression Sessions to open Studio 36 inside our venue. Studio 36 provides music making facilities and expertise for free to young musicians in London who face a variety of barriers that might prevent them from making the most of their creativity and talent. \\n\\nEvery donation helps keep Studio 36 open and accessible, so that more young people can find their voice, develop their talents and feel supported as they take their next steps.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-28/af5fb538-b9c7-4f41-bf11-48d1d9d6d45a.jpeg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"variants\":[{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":100,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE4NzAzMSwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTUxNzgwLCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1NTo1OS45NDM4NDFaIiwicHJpY2UiOjEwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MzYwMSwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MzAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":300,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE4NzAzMSwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTUxNzgwLCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1NTo1OS45NDM4NzhaIiwicHJpY2UiOjMwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MzYwMiwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6NTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":500,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":