name\":\"avalon-cafe-e2vy\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-28T17:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"L.F.T. (live)\\n\\nBerlin-based DJ, producer, and live act who is rapidly carving out a place in contemporary electronic music. His sound blends new wave and breakbeat-influenced electro, shaped by the distorted drum machines of The Hague and the romantic synth melodies of 1980s San Francisco.\\n\\nTIMOTHY J. FAIRPLAY (live)\\n\\nA long-standing figure in UK underground electronic music, DJing and producing since the 1990s. Blending Detroit techno, minimal wave, Italo, Chicago house, and electro, his sound is hypnotic, synth-driven, and steeped in dystopian atmosphere.\\n\\nHARROWED (live)\\n\\nCrushing Metallic Hardcore fusing the intensity of bands like Integrity and Ringworm with the riffs of 90s Swedish Death metal.\\n\\nMONIKA BADLY (live)\\n\\nBristol’s dealer of industrial pain jazz noise techno. The Avon Terror Corps and Chewing Glass Collective member has spent the last few years refining their sound. In 2025, they released their sophomore full-length album Love Songs on Eggy Tapes.\\n\\nDIE VERLETZT (live)\\n\\nLondon based electronic post punk duo influenced by 80s new wave, 70s punk and Berlin electronica. They set about making music that both makes you want to dance hard and cry harder.\\n\\nD.PHYLLEIA (dj)\\n\\nBeing inspired by all things gritty, distorted, and bass-driven, she draws from the legacy of UK and Detroit’s electro and techno innovators, crafting a raw, industrial sound with a punkish drawl.\\n\\nGERST (live)\\n\\nLondon based noise / sound artist.\\n\\nNEW FLESH + IAMA\\n\\nResident DJs.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"14e26421af20bb85:73\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"12689\",\"name\":\"IMPULSE CONTROL\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"impulse-control-xgva\",\"profile_active\":false},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by IMPULSE CONTROL.\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"L.F.T.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab67616d0000b27306545e1f13c417971bf466f4\"},\"artist_id\":\"34803\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true},{\"name\":\"Timothy J. Fairplay\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"106297\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Harrowed\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebdd2459681b3c24af60568245\"},\"artist_id\":\"39820\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Monika Badly\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"128774\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":4,\"total_free_texts\":5},\"marketeers\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1770019200,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-02T08:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-28T23:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-02T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-28T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-29T02:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"id\":\"6972bb5141a6640001b8713e\",\"name\":\"IMPULSE CONTROL\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1200},\"new\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"L.F.T. - Free Cigarettes\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1PRc7rmQqABBNVZ3S6IQS1\",\"artist\