5348047,\"lng\":-0.105732699999976},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"o2-academy-islington-zler\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://academymusicgroup.com/o2academyislington/access\"},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-28T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"unicorn\":false,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Academy Events and Born Again Concerts proudly present\\n\\nMUTATION PHASE IN EUROPE\\n\\nINFECTED RAIN x BUTCHER BABIES\\n\\n\\\\+ support\\n\\nBLACK SPIKES\\n\\n*IInfected Rain returns to Europe and the UK in 2026 with their most visceral and unpredictable tour yet: The Mutation Phase Tour. Known for their explosive live energy and emotional depth, the band now steps into a rare transitional chapter between albums—capturing Infected Rain mid-mutation, offering fans a raw, unfiltered experience that will not repeat. Expect tracks from across their discography, alongside whispers of new material surfacing.*\\n\\n*Joining them as co-headliners are Butcher Babies, the Las Vegas metal powerhouse whose blend of thrash, groove, and melodic ferocity has set stages ablaze worldwide. Renowned for their aggressive style and high-octane performances, Butcher Babies continue to push boundaries, evolving with every release and proving why they are one of the most dynamic forces in modern metal.*\\n\\n*Support comes from Lithuania’s Black Spikes, who bring their heavier modern metal sound and striking stage presence to the tour. With a reputation for unforgettable live shows, the band’s freshly released EP NIL marks the next chapter in their rise, making them a perfect fit for this intense lineup.*\\n\\n*This is not just another tour—it is a ritual in motion. Infected Rain, Butcher Babies, Black Spikes. 2026. Stronger than ever. Shifting beyond form. Come witness the mutation.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ / Under 16's must be accompanied by an adult\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"impression_id\":\"14e26421af20bb85:90\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2609\",\"name\":\"Born Again Concerts\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"born-again-concerts-pv68\",\"profile_active\":true},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Academy Events and Born Again Concerts\",\"properties\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Black Spikes\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"128416\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Butcher Babies\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"6517\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Infected Rain\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-04-18/3853923b-904f-4615-a15f-ee203ddb99ff.jpg?rect=0%2C53%2C535%2C535\"},\"artist_id\":\"47952\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1457,\"name\":\"Born Again Concerts\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://dicefm.zendesk.com/hc/en-gb/sections/4412933643793-Privacy-Policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":1642,\"name\