ments/2026-01-20/8a311d75-6878-4b50-a7a6-034960418cb4.jpg?rect=169%2C0%2C743%2C1350\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"After a short hiatus, we return to The Glove That Fits for another sonic journey with one of our favourite artists - New York native, Berlin-based, EBM & post-punk don; **Curses** joins for a special appearance in Hackney's finest basement.\\n\\nResidents Tronik Youth & Franklin complete the bill, and the excellent Megan Leo is back after her last appearance supporting Roman Flugel with us.\\n\\nAll set to be one for the books, with tickets starting from a fiver, you'd be a fool to miss it.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"696fcc42b76d3f000121be30\",\"name\":\"Club Hiatus x Nein: Curses\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Surrender - Jennifer Cardini Remix\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1mkh8e1lSCuDmUTTWh3r5W\",\"artist\":\"Surrender\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/e70cb56d7552ff6e18958b11aa7f06505f4ac993?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Jennifer Cardini Remix\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Curses - Gold & Silber (feat. Perel)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/gb/album/gold-silber-feat-perel/1425936872?i=1425937408&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Curses\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview128/v4/d0/b1/1b/d0b11b0a-b97e-f150-1c52-dda43caf723f/mzaf_1622975130616103983.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Gold & Silber (feat. Perel)\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Curses\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-02-26/8415bcff-e755-4687-80c8-c53bcdfd113f.jpg?rect=0%2C52%2C537%2C537\"},\"artist_id\":\"