trec-jazz-club-ryy6r\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"19a35eea7aa005ca:11\",\"date_unix\":1774733400,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3550,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h6c599f99b0c?dice_id=h6c599f99b0c\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x8d8c18c48ed?dice_id=x8d8c18c48ed\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Nfc6e23bb518?dice_id=Nfc6e23bb518\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T1b9cee10847?dice_id=T1b9cee10847\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/gedda44c3c4d?dice_id=gedda44c3c4d\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Na4fb966baad?dice_id=Na4fb966baad\"},\"perm_name\":\"92ayqo-buena-vista-social-club-live-revue-28th-mar-toulouse-lautrec-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-03/00f422d6-96ed-42f9-a3e9-4a543a4437d4.jpg?rect=140%2C0%2C800%2C800\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-03/00f422d6-96ed-42f9-a3e9-4a543a4437d4.jpg?rect=0%2C76%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-03/00f422d6-96ed-42f9-a3e9-4a543a4437d4.jpg?rect=320%2C0%2C440%2C800\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"A Journey Through the Golden Age of Cuban Music.\\n\\nStep into the vibrant world of Havana with the Buena Vista Social Club Live Revue, a dazzling celebration of Cuba’s most iconic musical heritage. This unforgettable tribute brings the timeless sounds of son, bolero, danzón, and cha-cha-cha to life, performed by some of the UK’s finest Cuban musicians.\\n\\nInspired by the legendary 1997 Grammy-winning album produced by Ry Cooder and Juan de Marcos González, this live revue pays homage to the spirit and soul of the original Buena Vista ensemble, a project that united the greatest living masters of pre-revolutionary Cuban music.\\n\\nExpect infectious rhythms, soulful trumpet solos, intricate guitar work, and vocals steeped in love, nostalgia, and joy. It’s a night that will transport you straight to Havana’s smoky clubs and sun-drenched plazas, and you may just find yourself dancing before the night is through.\\n\\nBand Line-Up\\n\\nLuke Rattenbury – tres, guitar, vocals\\n\\nEddie Myer – bass, vocals\\n\\nAdriana Lord – lead vocals\\n\\nMickey Ball – trumpet\\n\\nSatin Singh – congas\\n\\nVancho Manoilovich – timbales, drums\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 16+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"698c77fd8e03fb000133c7a8\",\"name\":\"Buena Vista Social Club Live Revue\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Buena Vista Social Club - Chan Chan\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3bxZhauuIU4ubctdRZwPYW\",\"artist\":\"Buena Vista Social Club\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/74dc6eb8f978e16ef80b0c17df14d13c353a733d?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Chan Chan\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Buena Vista Social Club - Chan Chan\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/chan-chan/1716598034?i=1716598344&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Buena Vista Social Club\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview126/v4/9f/b3/bb/9fb3bb95-dce9-bd65-7d91-4e9c4322dbc0/mzaf_17702336458070202791.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Chan Chan\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Buena Vista Social Club\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"73269\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_t