he-bad-and-the-zugly-29th-mar-new-cross-inn-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-13/3a305b11-8102-47fe-82b6-ead752da0f39.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-13/3a305b11-8102-47fe-82b6-ead752da0f39.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-13/3a305b11-8102-47fe-82b6-ead752da0f39.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"The Good the Bad and the Zugly\\n\\nOnce the bastard child of the 90s Oslo punk scene, young spirits carrying the torch of Turbonegro, Gluecifer and Anal Babes, reminding us of a time when punk rock was a promise of infantile nihilism and pure vicious fun!\\n\\nNow, after five studio albums and a decade of touring their infamous live shows, the once so virile Norwegians have hit the inevitable 18-wheeled semi-truck that is middle-age. But the pitch black satiric humor that has characterized GBZ throughout their career seems only to be fueled further on by the growing bitterness instilled in these five hemorrhoid infested critters.\\n\\nhttps://thegoodthebadandthezugly.bandcamp.com/\\n\\n\\\\+ Support from\\n\\nDog Rotten\\n\\nSE London Punk Rap\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/dogrottenband/\\n\\nBlitz The Khazi\\n\\nHerts Yob Punx\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/blitzthekhazi/\\n\\nHeelplant\\n\\nSouth London noise punk\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/heelplant_band/\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ (under 16s require an adult)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"68ecefc517b531000136b0a8\",\"name\":\"The Good The Bad And The Zugly\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"The Good The Bad and The Zugly - November Boys\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3Ki65zoOr3AlK1mGs2zR1j\",\"artist\":\"The Good The Bad and The Zugly\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/989403fe2b84532b6fbc2d11e0572d1170afcb88?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"November Boys\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"The Good The Bad and the Zugly - Nav or Never\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/nav-or-never/1651445715?i=1651445957&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"The Good The Bad and the Zugly\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview122/v4/8f/dc/94/8fdc94e2-66b9-6469-5485-42b8bc29f0c2/mzaf_15220440441725731700.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Nav or Never\"}],\"unicorn\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Blitz The Khazi\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"125204\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"DOG ROTTEN\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"87778\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"The Good the Bad and the Zugly\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"72787\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-12T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-29T16:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-12T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-29T18:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-29T20:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Conway Hall.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1765497600,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3223\",\"name\":\"Conway Hall\",\"address\":\"25 Red Lion Square Holborn, London WC1R 4RL UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.51948760000001,\"lng\":-0.1168424},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"conway-hall-obq5\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.conwayhall.org.uk/about-us/faqs/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-03-29T18:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"5578\",\"name\":\"Conway Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"conway-hall-5nry\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"19a35eea7aa005ca:20\",\"date_unix\":1774805400,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":718},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/V09f7cc7ba7a?dice_id=V09f7cc7ba7a\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K074e40cc01f?dice_id=K074e40cc01f\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Adcec3d961c6?dice_id=Adcec3d961c6\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q8d295ba143b?dice_id=Q8d295ba143b\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/gbc4e03b4ad4?dice_id=gbc4e03b4ad4\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m0d831ec9f37?dice_id=m0d831ec9f37\"},\"perm_name\":\"q26kva-primrose-piano-quartet-29th-mar-conway-hall-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-22/27c6c661-d8f1-479c-bf49-f5d6bb1db3ca.jpg?rect=166%2C0%2C948%2C948\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-22/27c6c661-d8f1-479c-bf49-f5d6bb1db3ca.jpg?rect=0%2C90%2C1280%2C768\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-22/27c6c661-d8f1-479c-bf49-f5d6bb1db3ca.jpg?rect=380%2C0%2C521%2C948\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Conway Hall regulars, the **Primrose Piano Quartet** close our spring season of concerts with a richly imaginative programme. Mozart’s dramatic *G minor Quartet* opens the concert, followed by a fascinating set of *Variations on an Air* by Robert Burns by four leading British composers, commissioned by the PPQ: John Casken, Sally Beamish, Jacques Cohen and Steve Goss. Purcell’s exquisite *Fantasias* for string trio provide a reflective interlude before Fauré’s passionate *C minor Quartet* brings the evening to a luminous and deeply moving close.\\n\\n**Mozart** | Piano Quartet in G minor K478\\n\\n*Variations on an Air* by **Robert Burns**:\\n\\n**John Casken** | Variation on a Jacobite Air\\n\\n**Sally Beamish** | By Yon Castle Wa\\n\\n**Jacques Cohen** | Castle Lament\\n\\n**Steve Goss** | Scherzo Variation\\n\\n**Saint-Saëns** | Barcarolle in F Op.108\\n\\n**Fauré** | Piano Quartet in C minor Op.15\\n\\nSusanne Stanzeleit • *violin*\\n\\nDorothea Vogel • *viola*\\n\\nAndrew Fuller • *cello*\\n\\nJohn Thwaites • *piano*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an all ages event. Under 16's must be accompanied by an adult.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"6925bb31b3e1e30001bf2219\",\"name\":\"Primrose Piano Quartet\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":3},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-16T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-29T22:00:00+01:00