oth-club-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-14/45c0755a-2cb5-4b8d-afdc-e89e4e664fa8.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C3200%2C3200\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-14/45c0755a-2cb5-4b8d-afdc-e89e4e664fa8.jpg?rect=0%2C1040%2C3200%2C1920\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-14/45c0755a-2cb5-4b8d-afdc-e89e4e664fa8.jpg?rect=500%2C0%2C2200%2C4000\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Ben Watt and Tracey Thorn, best known together as Everything But The Girl, continue their residency at the MOTH Club with 3 more intimate seated shows in March. They will perform as a part-acoustic, part-electronic duo, accompanied by Rex Horan on double bass and Family Stereo's Blake Watt on guitar, drawing on songs from their 40-year careers as both solo artists and a best-selling duo.\\n\\nThe evening will consist of two sets and an interval. Ben and Tracey will be on stage at 8pm. There is no support. The venue will be mostly seated with some additional standing. Seats allocated on first come first served basis. Doors 7pm.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"6967a0d6c5db3100017a66a8\",\"name\":\"Ben Watt and Tracey Thorn\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Everything But the Girl - Mirrorball\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/mirrorball/1629189555?i=1629189563&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Everything But the Girl\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview122/v4/7f/c9/c7/7fc9c78c-8a64-acbc-309c-9b7adcaef8b5/mzaf_9075571956832389781.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Mirrorball\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artist