ca:27\",\"date_unix\":1774807200,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2002,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/da1866290684?dice_id=da1866290684\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T9b5433ae425?dice_id=T9b5433ae425\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a6ca407029c7?dice_id=a6ca407029c7\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/iddd49ca99fb?dice_id=iddd49ca99fb\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h66e0e3b4d97?dice_id=h66e0e3b4d97\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y9a670394a1f?dice_id=y9a670394a1f\"},\"perm_name\":\"mx8lnk-tyler-ramsey-29th-mar-the-social-london-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-11/2aff77cf-aa30-4617-8e30-96cd6ce87471.jpg?rect=0%2C435%2C3480%2C3480\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-11/2aff77cf-aa30-4617-8e30-96cd6ce87471.jpg?rect=0%2C1131%2C3480%2C2088\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-11/2aff77cf-aa30-4617-8e30-96cd6ce87471.jpg?rect=544%2C0%2C2393%2C4350\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Tyler Ramsey is a fingerstyle guitarist and a captivating voice in modern indie folk, based outside of Asheville, North Carolina. Ramsey gained recognition as a key member of Band of Horses contributing to their soaring sound across three studio albums. As a songwriter and guitarist, his intricate playing and introspective lyricism became a defining element of the band's music.\\n\\nWith masterful guitar work and a gift for storytelling, Tyler Ramsey continues to carve out his own space in the world of modern folk and indie rock. He has released a series of critically acclaimed albums, including \\\"For the Morning\\\" (2019), which showcased his signature blend of fingerpicked guitar, pedal steel, and atmospheric rock textures, and \\\"New Lost Ages” (2024), produced by Phil Ek (Fleet Foxes, The Shins), hailed by Americana UK as “a gentle indie-folk gem\\\". The project captured Ramsey’s evolution as both a songwriter and musician, balancing moments of quiet introspection with grand, sweeping arrangements.\\n\\nMost recently, Tyler Ramsey and My Morning Jacket guitarist Carl Broemel have announced their full-length recorded debut with “Celestun\\\" (out 1/15/26). A marvel of interwoven musicianship and testament to the duo’s singular camaraderie, the album encapsulates the two veteran guitarist-songwriters’ mutual admiration and effortless compatibility as they swap and share nine new songs of dazzling dexterity and grace recorded almost entirely on acoustic guitars.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"69393a95b41d48000100cfad\",\"name\":\"Tyler Ramsey \",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"1000 Black Birds\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5xEw0CyEGPvOHV1CH97cOS\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/a10bcc974336839c80f893f5ea34cb6a9624f54c?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"1000 Black Birds\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Tyler Ramsey\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-09/13e1fa00-7569-4432-a42b-41055cac051e.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"11248\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true},{\"name\":\"Ross Leighton\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"133737\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-19T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-29T21:00:00+01:0