ion from Quito, Ecuador’s Sexores, involving voices from Haiti, Brazil, Mexico and Peru for a real taste of South American dreamy gothic chiming.\\n\\nWe are so excited for this debut London show!\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"67ed4247d3475500011f0763\",\"name\":\"Sexores (UK Debut)\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Sexores - Aequorea\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/aequorea/1710248947?i=1710248949&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Sexores\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview126/v4/f0/a7/3a/f0a73aea-0874-32b9-6db9-f8cc3bb2b81a/mzaf_3332322415896283780.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Aequorea\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Sexores - Aequorea\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1BT9w7hFoSWjFzrUKGudXs\",\"artist\":\"Sexores\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/d1de100c230ded47f3dddbcbed878245823c1b94?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Aequorea\"}],\"unicorn\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Sexores\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"77315\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-03-26T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-29T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-03-28T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-29T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-29T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":15600,\"title\":\"Which venue is this in?\",\"body\":\"Venue 1 - entrance through double glass doors.\",\"order