ll be on stage at 8pm. There is no support. The venue will be mostly seated with some additional standing. Seats allocated on first come first served basis. Doors 7pm.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"6967a0c7ed074600016dd75c\",\"name\":\"Ben Watt and Tracey Thorn\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Everything But the Girl - Mirrorball\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/mirrorball/1629189555?i=1629189563&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Everything But the Girl\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview122/v4/7f/c9/c7/7fc9c78c-8a64-acbc-309c-9b7adcaef8b5/mzaf_9075571956832389781.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Mirrorball\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":2,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-09T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-30T07:45:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-09T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-30T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-30T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":30466,\"title\":\"The Jazz Cafe FAQ's\",\"body\":\"Please follow this link for all Jazz Cafe FAQ's: https://thejazzcafe.com/faqs/?\",\"order\":0}],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by AGMP.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1765238400,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"415\",\"name\":\"The Jazz Cafe\",\"address\