t/attachments/2025-12-09/fbc0a779-b7f2-4eae-be53-e7c18a97b980.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-09/fbc0a779-b7f2-4eae-be53-e7c18a97b980.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"\\\"One Helluva a Guitar-Player\\\" Bruce Springsteen\\n\\nDirect from Los Angeles, one of the finest modern blues guitarists, Ana Popovic, flies in to perform an exclusive London concert.\\n\\nAna Popovic blends smoking electric funk and slide guitar, jazzy instrumentals and a tight blues groove with soulful, feminine vocals.\\n\\nNominated for seven Blues Music Awards, Ana Popovic was added as the only female guitar-player to the 2014 -2018 all star Experience Hendrix lineup; a tour celebrating the music and legacy of Jimi Hendrix with Buddy Guy, Eric Johnson, Jonny Lang, & Kenny Wayne Shepherd.\\n\\nAside from that tour Ana Popovic has also shared the stage with B.B. King, Joe Bonamassa, Jeff Beck, & Gary Clark Jr.\\n\\nAn AGMP Concerts presentation.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"69383622acb17d000171aa3d\",\"name\":\"ANA POPOVIC\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Ana Popović\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"64688\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-12T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-30T19:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-12T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-30T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-30T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false