G enters the ring with their anticipated breakup EP, staged in a raw fight-club atmosphere and powered by a bold new sound.\\n\\nFierce yet vulnerable, this EP tour unleashes the artist’s full emotional palette.\\n\\nTurning chaos into catharsis. Expect sonic safe spaces, bruised hearts, hard dicks and wet clits across a run of exclusive European cities.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"6970b6550d25f800019dab7b\",\"name\":\"Lie Ning\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"LIE NING - Bullfight\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3xuUlrilEoyAEihQp601xU\",\"artist\":\"LIE NING\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/b8d7fbe0afc56fc08e7bc373f71aa7628bf0c242?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Bullfight\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"LIE NING - Bullfight\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/bullfight/1862125217?i=1862125219&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"LIE NING\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/6d/e9/fb/6de9fb2e-ff45-bd02-7e8f-848eb2dfc371/mzaf_13099830235565263532.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Bullfight\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-22T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-03-31T22:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-22T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-03-31T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-03-31T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"LNZRT\",\"privacy_p