e-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-20/9e920147-dcd6-4eb8-a945-72241a521204.jpg?rect=1386%2C0%2C1605%2C2918\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Rough Trade Denmark Street is very excited to present an in-store acoustic performance and signing from PET NEEDS. This unique event celebrates the release of their new album 'Elbows Out! This Is Capitalism' released via Xtra Mile Recordings.\\n\\nTickets for this event also include a physical copy of the fantastic new album on your format of choice to be collected from Rough Trade Denmark Street on the day of the show.\\n\\nMore product information can be found HERE >> https://shop.roughtrade.com › products › elbows-out-this-is-capitalism\\n\\nAccessibility:\\n\\nFor accessible tickets, free PA/Carer tickets and other accessibility requests please go to dice.fm/contact. Rough Trade is wheelchair accessible with step free access.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"697b30f5530cb90001c2473d\",\"name\":\"PET NEEDS: Acoustic + Signing\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Sleep When I'm Dead\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3vguS2EmpOYEu5M9xvyYjl\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/d2e5af6754fcb9fc033c37ec445dcb7a5402e510?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Sleep When I'm Dead\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"PET NEEDS\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb26565e70a5cd85ffb406a38c\"},\"artist_id\":\"24136\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-17T15:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\"