af0?dice_id=C103dd0adaf0\"},\"perm_name\":\"92amkn-foule-robinsons-village-1st-apr-paper-dress-vintage-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/847d2572-45fa-436c-9819-79857d122de9.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C3508%2C3508\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/847d2572-45fa-436c-9819-79857d122de9.jpg?rect=0%2C702%2C3508%2C2105\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/847d2572-45fa-436c-9819-79857d122de9.jpg?rect=790%2C0%2C1929%2C3508\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Foule (fka Purple Hat Mob) are a genre-blending, immersive live band who will be bringing their hypnotic post-rock/electronic fusion to London’s Paper Dress Vintage for an April Foule’s special.\\n\\nSupport comes from Robinson’s Village - a project of Nottingham born James Burns, blending reverb-soaked tape loops with layers of warped modular synths. His sound explores the fragile beauty of decay and imperfection. He was recently included in the 'Best Ambient Music on Bandcamp'.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"698a2e330f44900001f5bde1\",\"name\":\"Foule + Robinson’s Village\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"terrarium\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0XPhX8Uaw9sx3HGqB629X1\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/f2052beddd32dfd927ea3c7b000f4ec5d3bbe73b?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"terrarium\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Robinson's Village\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebf67a5a1a863eecb1996e4909\"},\"artist_id\":\"47078\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_