ll,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1607\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-78g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"19a35eea7aa005ca:84\",\"date_unix\":1775152800,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":2489},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Kbbf19339281?dice_id=Kbbf19339281\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a3a6c4826ea0?dice_id=a3a6c4826ea0\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b30cb3df431d?dice_id=b30cb3df431d\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/f1df31bcf7ff?dice_id=f1df31bcf7ff\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Icab06bec72f?dice_id=Icab06bec72f\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n0291aa19094?dice_id=n0291aa19094\"},\"perm_name\":\"yog5rp-avalon-emerson-the-charm-2nd-apr-islington-assembly-hall-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-11/989614a8-3b61-4f94-b17f-b5215c57fb39.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2000%2C2000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-11/989614a8-3b61-4f94-b17f-b5215c57fb39.jpg?rect=0%2C400%2C2000%2C1200\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-11/989614a8-3b61-4f94-b17f-b5215c57fb39.jpg?rect=450%2C0%2C1100%2C2000\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Now one of dance music’s most respected DJs, Avalon Emerson first made a name for herself in the storied warehouse scene of her birthplace, San Francisco, before relocating to Berlin in 2013. Over a decade of performances at the famed Berghain led to appearances at numerous festivals around the world which all cemented Emerson, and her evocative, genre- and decade-spanning sets, as perennially in demand.\\n\\nIn 2020, she released her first full-length collection: a contribution to the longrunning DJ-Kicks series (which Resident Advisor described as “The sound of a well-honed DJ at the top of her game.”), nestled alongside a steady stream of remix releases for the likes of Four Tet, Slowdive, Robyn and more.\\n\\nNext up was 2023’s Avalon Emerson & The Charm, an instant classic which saw Emerson exploring her singing voice and more traditional songwriting outside of the boundaries of her dance music work. Created after a move to New York, the resulting & The Charm album was released to critical acclaim, landing on numerous critics’ best-of-the-year lists.\\n\\n*Islington Assembly Hall has launched 'Support the Supports' a campaign to help introduce more music lovers to the up-and-coming acts that open the show! Show up to the venue prior to 8pm and you are in with a chance to win a mystery prize, from drinks vouchers to exclusive merchandise from artists that have previously played the venue. Use the #supportthesupports through socials when you discover a new favourite act at Islington Assembly Hall.*\\n\\n*By purchasing a ticket to this event you are agreeing to adhere to Islington Assembly Hall's terms and conditions: https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/customer-terms-conditions-2022/*\\n\\n*All tickets to shows at Islington Assembly Hall are subject to a Venue Levy of £1.50 + VAT. As a Grade II listed building, this levy will be reinvested into Islington Assembly Hall and its services, meaning the customer experience can continue to be enhanced.*\\n\\nThis is a 16+ event – you may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"id\":\"69147e8d79aeb80001295904\",\"name\":\"Avalon Emerson & the Charm\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Avalon Emerson - One More Fluorescent Rush\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3sJCADvtbzgKPzEBHhHSLY\",\"artist\":\"Avalon Emerson\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/b50e732678bbf899fcc747475d45386701e9a69f?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"One More Fluorescent Rush\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Avalon Emerson - Sandrail Silhouette\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/sandrail-silhouette/1740919644?i=1740919645&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Avalon Emerson\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/8d/7f/b8/8d7fb8e8-6fdb-c8d6-b63a-c74cce605931/mzaf_2611743367064550489.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Sandrail Silhouette\"},{\"type\":\"trailer\",\"title\":null,\"redirect_url\":null,\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/MrhWSXxsJv9prhbyHRBB9wa7F02oFo00gYy02WwsgpiWcM.m3u8\",\"track_name\":\"\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Avalon Emerson\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-07-15/c7d7b46f-8efe-4792-bc94-e333a9eb8d8b.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"4199\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"San Francisco native Avalon Emerson is a producer, remixer and one of techno’s most technically respected DJs. With a background in software development and a methodological approach to mixing, her 11 hour-long Panorama Bar sets see her shift tempos and genres to create innovative soundscapes of alt-pop and breakbeats. Her debut album, & the Charm (2023), marked a shift from techno to dream pop, with Emerson flexing her soft vocals, nostalgic songwriting, and Japanese city pop influences.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":8,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\