-9b5d-989b94381c8f.jpg?rect=0%2C432%2C2160%2C1296\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-14/af08c5f2-fbdf-4ec6-9b5d-989b94381c8f.jpg?rect=486%2C0%2C1188%2C2160\"},\"id\":\"6991f7cbced2390001255aa9\",\"name\":\"Bad Friday All-Dayer\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Forget the heritage acts and the overpriced stadium lager. Bad Friday returns: Eight bands. One ticket. Food included. An all-dayer built on high-velocity, DIY ethics… and the smell of charcoal.\\n\\nYAANG are Manchester’s premier pop-art provocateurs. They aren't \\\"post-punk\\\"—they’re fully carbonated, caffeinated, and non-genre compliant. Expect motorik synths, drum machines, and chaotic energy that moves from gliding 80s power ballads to airport barfights in a single heartbeat.\\n\\nCOWBOYY: South Coast art-pop architects. Part math-rock, part jazz, entirely confusing to those who like their music predictable.\\n\\nPIGEON DOG: North London grunge. Gritty, filthy, and bursting with spiky riffs that tackle gender dysphoria and dissociation with a sneer.\\n\\nNATIONAL PLAYBOYS: Edinburgh’s post-punk 5-piece. High-impact energy meeting synth-driven hooks.\\n\\nASBESTOS SALESMAN: Southend’s \\\"post-slop\\\" duo. Recorded in a shed, sounding like Squid meeting Blur in a trough of toxic positivity.\\n\\nNAOMI IN BLUE: British-Chilean Americana. A striking blend of folk-soul and heavy-synth power, anchored by a voice that stops rooms.\\n\\nJUST KIDS: An indie-pop duo where Springsteen meets Fugazi. Emotional, relatable, and dripping in second-hand smoke.\\n\\nSASHES: South London’s 17-foot-tall (combined) three-piece. Scuzzy riffs, domestic rebellion, and a live presence that leaves you exhilarated and uneasy.\\n\\nIt’s an adventure in angular pop and beautiful noise. Eat the food. Hear the future. See you at the front.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event. \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-16T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-03T11:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-16T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-03T15:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-04T02:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"YAANG - Speed McQueen\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4jPbxgx7YWRPJudNcDdium\",\"artist\":\"YAANG\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/fd8c8f05b2d64f727466c3da168adba013bff6eb?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Speed McQueen\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"YAANG - Speed McQueen\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/speed-mcqueen/1800504514?i=1800504516&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"YAANG\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/5a/75/42/5a754231-137e-3b11-028f-a8513e72e657/mzaf_15847924949113312154.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Speed McQueen\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Hot Box Live Community Interest\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3785\",\"name\":\"Hot Box\",\"address\":\"28 Viaduct Rd, Chelmsford CM1 1TS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.7359952,\"lng\":0.4672127},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-06-29/9ff0c867-708b-4d5c-834d-a927e4e4ae83.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"5eb9799ae1727402966007e1\",\"name\":\"Chelmsford\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.736717,\"lng\":0.466083,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-r7wq\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.hotboxlive.co.uk/accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-03T18:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"4307\",\"name\":\"Hot Box Live Community Interest \",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-live-community-interest-7v77\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1769684400,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/O5ba0e0e0343?dice_id=O5ba0e0e0343\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Wcc2cb9cee3a?dice_id=Wcc2cb9cee3a\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P20711781a75?dice_id=P20711781a75\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ud81c3c9685d?dice_id=ud81c3c9685d\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R6c1b19c3bc9?dice_id=R6c1b19c3bc9\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c1bc5118d775?dice_id=c1bc5118d775\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"6dngx7-euphoria-complex-3rd-apr-hot-box-chelmsford-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1775235600,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"7a59805d984377b8:17\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":850,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/b868bd31-c30a-4771-aa92-4c79ec58b88c.jpg?rect=0%2C17%2C1179%2C1179\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/b868bd31-c30a-4771-aa92-4c79ec58b88c.jpg?rect=0%2C253%2C1179%2C707\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/b868bd31-c30a-4771-aa92-4c79ec58b88c.jpg?rect=256%2C0%2C667%2C1213\"},\"id\":\"697b4a69530cb90001527dd2\",\"name\":\"Euphoria Complex \",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Euphoria complex comprises 3 Essex based DJ’s, bringing the good vibes to Hotbox in April\\n\\nExperience a fusion of house, techno, garage and more.\\n\\nAfter a phenomenal turn out at our previous events we are presenting our 4th instalment with headliners NEDLAR B2B BRDY (extended set).\\n\\nGet ready for the best local talent, spinning beats that transcend genres.\\n\\nCome down for a boogie and let the music speak for itself! Good music and good vibes only.\\n\\nEC x\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-29T11:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-03T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-30T14:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-03T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-04T00:45:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Snatch\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-07-14/e1a52e03-de43-47fd-a2a3-4cfebb28a60b.jpg?rect=0%2C43%2C554%2C554\"},\"artist_id\":\"124230\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Fantazmaz\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"50970\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"SPLIT DOGS\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-20/3bd8e400-83ee-4098-8aa0-4f2eb1ed2eed.jpg?rect=0%2C54%2C513%2C513\"},\"artist_id\":\"97335\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by DHP.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":59297,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":59298,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":59299,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-03T18:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-04-03T22:00:00+01:00\"}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1764151200,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/t1913814219a?dice_id=t1913814219a\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/g468e6c60fe3?dice_id=g468e6c60fe3\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c3c4f3e440d0?dice_id=c3c4f3e440d0\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/X7369dac81c2?dice_id=X7369dac81c2\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/M1018e579225?dice_id=M1018e579225\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A2d7296b5795?dice_id=A2d7296b5795\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"eobd2w-split-dogs-3rd-apr-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1775235600,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"7a59805d984377b8:18\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1741,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-26/029bb841-0a1a-4fdf-9ba4-03b32d753e23.jpg?rect=0%2C153%2C1512%2C1512\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-26/029bb841-0a1a-4fdf-9ba4-03b32d753e23.jpg?rect=0%2C456%2C1512%2C907\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-26/029bb841-0a1a-4fdf-9ba4-03b32d753e23.jpg?rect=256%2C0%2C1000%2C1818\"},\"id\":\"69256fe1376e7b00015de4c6\",\"name\":\"SPLIT DOGS\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Known for their signature gut-punching, fast-paced sound, British rock n roll outfit Split Dogs have hit the ground running since the release of their debut album in may 2023. Cultivating a loyal and growing fanbase with their raucous stage performances, hard-hitting hooks and infectious lyrics.\\n\\nThey have been invited to support punk legends such as GBH, Subhumans and Murphy's Law, whilst also opening shows for contemporary bands such as Teen Mortgage, C.O.F.F.I.N, Battlesnake, Pigs Pigs Pigs to name a few.\\n\\nAfter an incredible year of shows in 2024 Split Dogs have stomped into 2025 all guns blazin’ with their critically acclaimed new album ‘here to destroy’ on Venn records and a run of sold out headline shows across the U.K. culminating in their first ever European tour.\\n\\nWith a string of festival appearances on the horizon and new music in the works theres no sign of these rockers slowing down any time soon.\\n\\nThis is the rock n roll business and Split dogs are here to destroy\\n\\n\\\\-\\n\\nJoin us for the after party from 11pm to 3am at The Underworld's Blackout Club, get your tickets!\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event (under 16s to be accompanied by an adult)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-26T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-03T16:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-26T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-03T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-03T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"SPLIT DOGS - And What\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/799ZlxUFjnMMQP0weDGxR9\",\"artist\":\"SPLIT DOGS\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/ddc53c996800ceeb83b4be9dbe2147fc91711ee4?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"And What\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"SPLIT DOGS - Precious Stones\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/precious-stones/1811274583?i=1811274771&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"SPLIT DOGS\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/f2/97/20/f2972039-f6d6-7573-f4bb-84970d88d9ff/mzaf_18048632212104570975.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Precious Stones\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Yungblud\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb3b0371642fae86417c8dcda1\"},\"artist_id\":\"8156\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"English singer, songwriter and musician YUNGBLUD blends glam and punk rock with youthful angst and gritty vocals. His projects explore themes of growing up queer, unlearning toxic masculinity and self-destructive tendencies, while his live performances are a display of maximalist heavy sounds and a tongue-in-cheek on-stage persona.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":true,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Rough Trade.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[{\"ticket_type_id\":1120666,\"extra_ids\":[\"1126188\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1122497,\"extra_ids\":[\"1126188\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1122508,\"extra_ids\":[\"1126188\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1124545,\"extra_ids\":[\"1126188\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1124606,\"extra_ids\":[\"1126188\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1124607,\"extra_ids\":[\"1126188\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1124608,\"extra_ids\":[\"1126188\"]}],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"6559\",\"name\":\"HERE at Outernet\",\"address\":\"Denmark St, Charing Cross Rd, London WC2H 8LH, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5152089,\"lng\":-0.1295818},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-09-23/44412f0d-34b8-41b5-8483-6f9558894d40.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C400%2C400\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d