atus\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"The hip-hop DJ based in Shimokitazawa, Tokyo, knows no boundaries - he’s the 45 Wizard representing Japan.\\n\\nDJ Koco aka SHIMOKITA has revolutionised the DJ play of 45s. He began his DJ style only playing 7\\\" records (45s) in 2011. With his honed skills and selections as a vinyl digger as his weapon, his mixing style has been pursued to the ultimate point.\\n\\nHaving performed worldwide alongside legends DJ Scratch, Jazzy Jay and DJ Jazzy Jeff, he has also released numerous funk, soul, and disco mixes as part of the unit Funky Soul Brother with DJ Southpaw Chop.\\n\\nFollowing an incredible sold-out show in our home last year, DJ Koco continues to spread his work and talent with his grand return to London\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-22T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-03T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-22T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-03T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-03T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Lydia May\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-12/3f71a9a7-5ac9-42cc-a5eb-63d31e269c41.jpg?rect=0%2C43%2C413%2C413\"},\"artist_id\":\"114113\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by DHP FAMILY.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1116\",\"name\":\"The Grace\",\"address\":\"Highbury Cres, Highb