586-6a2fc96a12c7.jpg?rect=180%2C0%2C440%2C800\"},\"id\":\"691f1cb4b0fc2b00011a9ffc\",\"name\":\"Ora Cogan\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Baba Yaga's Hut Presents:\\n\\nOra Cogan at Dingwalls\\n\\nOra Cogan’s music is alchemical: part instinct, part ritual, and always conjured from the edges where life feels sharpest. With Hard Hearted Woman, she mixes haunted folk, psych rock, and a shadowy strain of country, building a realm where catharsis feels lush, mysterious and vital. Shaken by the tenor of modern life, Cogan pulled in a circle of kindred musicians and made a record shaped by someone who has looked into the abyss and decided, again and again, to choose curiosity.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-13T09:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-03T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-13T09:30:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-03T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-03T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Ora Cogan - Cowgirl\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0swEmOZxdHEYuKZDsYd7Oa\",\"artist\":\"Ora Cogan\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/95f113a335230963652081dff017f76a7f05ecbe?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Cowgirl\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Ora Cogan - Cowgirl\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/cowgirl/1823779286?i=1823779292&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Ora Cogan\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/13/60/5b/13605b49-6c05-0af3-c21d-c40350a6ebc4/mzaf_2097077205217180330.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Cowgirl\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":nul