olerance policy to harassment, racism, homophobia, transphobia, sexism, ageism and any form of discrimination. We ask our community to help improve our space. If you see behaviour that has no place on the dance floor, please tell us. We will deal with it and remove any offending individuals from our club. We now have free reusable lids available for all our glasses.\\n\\nPlease note \\\"fabricfirst tickets\\\" are our members-only tickets. You must have a valid fabricfirst club membership to be eligible.\\n\\nfabric operates a zero-tolerance policy to drugs. Anyone found with illegal drugs will be banned from the venue and reported to the police.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-09T02:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-03T22:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-09T02:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-03T23:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-04T06:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Boy Better Know - Too Many Man\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/180XcSBai6RDpuElMcKk2v\",\"artist\":\"Boy Better Know\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/32da58c968ac61d0b71688ff7dd05da7b2066b1f\",\"track_name\":\"Too Many Man\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":4},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Sunglasses at Night\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1252\",\"name\":\"The George Tavern\",\"address\":\"373 Commercial Rd, London E1 0LA, UK\",\"location\":{\"