r and more accessible, so he founded the All Day I Dream party in Brooklyn in 2011, which is now globally revered thanks to the exacting curation of its founder.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Studio 338.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"729\",\"name\":\"Studio 338\",\"address\":\"338 Tunnel Avenue, Boord Street, Greenwich, SE10 0PF\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4953231,\"lng\":0.00627359999998589},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-01-06/43f28f5f-93d8-4352-b567-e2849b42c39f.jpg?rect=342%2C0%2C1364%2C1364\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"studio-338-g5n2\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-04T14:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8269\",\"name\":\"Studio 338\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"studio-338-ebqw\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1766144700,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/cc9810ae4d2e?dice_id=cc9810ae4d2e\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/t02d24614a58?dice_id=t02d24614a58\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/t57fd1f797cd?dice_id=t57fd1f797cd\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q9655a977eb8?dice_id=q9655a977eb8\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/G563c47c562e?dice_id=G563c47c562e\",\"pos