025-11-03/fb2c66c2-ede4-4197-9fab-7df2725a9634.jpg?rect=0%2C154%2C768%2C461\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-03/fb2c66c2-ede4-4197-9fab-7df2725a9634.jpg?rect=173%2C0%2C422%2C768\"},\"id\":\"6908ef92a9b11d0001af8ced\",\"name\":\"Light of the World\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**We’re celebrating Britain’s legendary underground funk scene with one of the era’s original pioneering live acts — Light of the World.**\\n\\nWidely acknowledged as giants of Brit Funk, Light of the World’s unique sound is a signature blend of gutsy, soulful vocals, tight jazz horn melodies, and fat, gritty basslines.\\n\\nForty years on, original members Gee Bello, Mel Gaynor, and Nat Augustin return to our home with the full band, performing their most popular hits — ‘London Town’, ‘I Shot the Sheriff’, ‘Swingin’, and ‘Time’ — plus many of the band’s major chart hits.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-04T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-04T19:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-07T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-04T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-04T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"London Town\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/30KHPJLS8Xpq6DpGZxfpwN\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/599e7f88b10ae89f3ca5b830255ed33370649082?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"London Town\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Hellripper\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebe6778af273019ee07d673b0c\"},\"artist_id\":\"29808\",\"about\":n