e-43ox\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1767792600,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/jb66cd76ce44?dice_id=jb66cd76ce44\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A8cbe4c595b7?dice_id=A8cbe4c595b7\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/vb16a65be64f?dice_id=vb16a65be64f\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h05f085d7afc?dice_id=h05f085d7afc\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e2c194428b5e?dice_id=e2c194428b5e\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m012077a7117?dice_id=m012077a7117\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"7dpngv-apache-indian-panjabi-mc-5th-apr-the-jazz-cafe-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":380,\"name\":\"Columbo Music\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://thecolumbogroup.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"298700384025189\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1775412000,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"7a59805d984377b8:77\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3450,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-07/69e5fea6-51df-4bf0-adc0-297143e6f5fe.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-07/69e5fea6-51df-4bf0-adc0-297143e6f5fe.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-07/69e5fea6-51df-4bf0-adc0-297143e6f5fe.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"id\":\"695e5ad5042d05000135ecf0\",\"name\":\"Apache Indian & Panjabi MC\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**A monumental double-bill of British Asian music arrives at Jazz Cafe as two of the culture's pioneers, Apache Indian and Panjabi MC, each take to the stage.**\\n\\nA living legend, **Apache Indian** is the architect of the **bhangra-reggae fusion**. From recording at **Bob Marley’s Tuff Gong Studios** to his mainstream breakthrough with **‘Arranged Marriage’**, he remains a global cultural icon.\\n\\nHe is joined by **Panjabi MC**, the world-renowned producer who popularized traditional Punjabi music through hip-hop and R&B. His seminal anthem **'Mundian To Bach Ke'** became a worldwide phenomenon, later reaching new heights via a legendary collaboration with **JAY-Z**.\\n\\nThis is a celebration of the sounds that defined an era and conquered international charts.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-07T13:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-05T19:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-09T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-05T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-05T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Going To Granny’s\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":64702,\"title\":\"What is it?\",\"body\":\"This is a concert/party hybrid celebrating the anthems that has filled Granny’s house over the years, and every family function since.\\n\\nIn this Easter special, through our signature medleys, stylised arrangements, orchestral power and shell down energy, we’re recharging and weaving together the vibrant threads of Soca, Reggae, Dancehall and a few gospel favourites with our 16 piece live orchestra featuring 4 dynamic vocalists.\\n\\nIt’s our signature show, with some fresh additions and some gospel goodness that only Going To Granny’s could turn into a PARDY…and an AFTER PARTY!\\n\\nThat’s right, after the show (aka Granny’s gone to bed) we’re having our first afterparty to end the night! Expect our DJ cousins to be taking over.\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":64703,\"title\":\"Is it seated / is there accessible seating?\",\"body\":\"This is a fully standing event. The venue is fully accessible, and a very limited number of accessible seating spaces are available. Accessible seating and ticketing are handled directly by HERE at Outernet so please contact DICE for all accessibility requirements.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":64704,\"title\":\"Is it 18+?\",\"body\":\"Yes, this show is 18+ (though nothing crass) and we are working on hosting family shows and also, shows tailored just for the Granny’s!\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":64705,\"title\":\"Can I bring my Granny?\",\"body\":\"You already know, we love a Granny. However, this all standing event is likely to be packed and lively - a cousins takeover for when Granny goes to bed. However, we have family and Granny friendly shows coming very soon!\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":64706,\"title\":\"Can I get a refund if I can’t come?\",\"body\":\"Tickets are non-refundable but you’re welcome to pass them on to a friend or resell them yourself.\",\"order\":4},{\"id\":64707,\"title\":\"What else is good to know?\",\"body\":\"This is a high energy, immersive, concert/party hybrid!\\n\\nSo, expect\\n\\n\\\\-loud music\\n\\n\\\\-strobe lighting\\n\\n\\\\-smoke effects and more!\\n\\nWe’ll also be capturing the vibes throughout the night to share the kind of atmosphere that only happens when you’re Going To Granny’s. By entering, you’re cool with possibly being featured in our highlight videos and photos (Nothing wild. Just moments that Granny would be proud of and the cousins who didn’t get to come, would know not to miss out on next time!)\",\"order\":5}],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"6559\",\"name\":\"HERE at Outernet\",\"address\":\"Denmark St, Charing Cross Rd, London WC2H 8LH, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5152089,\"lng\":-0.1295818},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-09-23/44412f0d-34b8-41b5-8483-6f9558894d40.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C400%2C400\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"here-at-outernet-wgbx\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://dicefm.zendesk.com/hc/en-gb/articles/24679933108753-HERE-at-Outernet-Accessibility-FAQs\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-05T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-04-06T01:00:00+01:00\"}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8466\",\"name\":\"Outernet Venue Ltd\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"outernet-venue-ltd-96a7\",\"profile_active\":true},\"announcement_date_unix\":1766059200,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D3064b031d2f?dice_id=D3064b031d2f\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A86f9e640414?dice_id=A86f9e640414\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Xee27ed9afb1?dice_id=Xee27ed9afb1\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Wf2688a8aa00?dice_id=Wf2688a8aa00\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/xe6f014b0baa?dice_id=xe6f014b0baa\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/d0c9f2263a60?dice_id=d0c9f2263a60\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"l8okrl-going-to-grannys-for-easter-5th-apr-here-at-outernet-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":818,\"name\":\"HERE at Outernet\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://hereldn.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1415783946118882\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-QH4NRPEYW3\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":2142,\"name\":\"Going To Granny's\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.goingtogrannys.com/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1775412000,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"impression_id\":\"7a59805d984377b8:78\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3800},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-16/dd87de0d-8929-474a-957a-b6e5a6d7597d.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C768%2C768\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-16/dd87de0d-8929-474a-957a-b6e5a6d7597d.jpg?rect=0%2C154%2C768%2C461\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-16/dd87de0d-8929-474a-957a-b6e5a6d7597d.jpg?rect=173%2C0%2C422%2C768\"},\"id\":\"69414ce8b0500a0001158b92\",\"name\":\"Going To Granny’s For Easter\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"*\\\\*For accessibility information please see the accessibility information button/link below*\\n\\nGoing To Granny’s Soca, Reggae and Dancehall Live Orchestra party RETURNS. But Going To Granny’s for Easter weekend wouldn’t be the same without a likkle gospel energy!\\n\\nThis is an ode to the anthems that has filled Granny’s house over the years, and every family function since.\\n\\nThrough our signature medleys, stylised arrangements, orchestral power and shell down energy, we’re recharging and weaving together the vibrant threads of Soca, Reggae, Dancehall and a few gospel favourites with our 16 piece live orchestra featuring 4 dynamic vocalists.=\\n\\nIt’s our signature show, with some fresh additions and some gospel goodness that only Going To Granny’s could turn into a PARDY…and an AFTER PARTY!\\n\\nThat’s right, after the show (aka Granny’s gone to bed) we’re having our first afterparty to end the night! Expect our DJ cousins to be taking over.\\n\\nSo… are you Going To Granny’s\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event - physical photo ID required\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-18T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-05T23:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-22T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-05T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-06T01:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Even as We Speak\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"70386\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Dictionary Pudding.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":74352,\"title\":\"Venue Accessibility Information\",\"body\":\"The Lexington is an early Victorian building and as such is not easily accessible for anyone with limited mobility. While the main bar is on the ground floor and accessible without steps the music venue is up a flight of stairs. We’re happy to help with access where possible; for any further information please contact us: info@thelexington.co.uk.\",\"order\":0}],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"23\",\"name\":\"The Lexington\",\"address\":\"96-98 Pentonville Rd, London N1 9JB\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5317299,\"lng\":-0.111416400000053},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-lexington-jomz\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.thelexington.co.uk/about.php\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-05T19:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"178\",\"name\":\"Dictionary Pudding\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"dictionary-pudding-j5vy\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1770368400,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/zf75a3cf34cd?dice_id=zf75a3cf34cd\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P767a5fd0b3d?dice_id=P767a5fd0b3d\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Bf95027ac99e?dice_id=Bf95027ac99e\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"ht