pelling jungle and DnB into the mainstream without losing its edge. Their connection to London club culture runs deep, and nights like this sit firmly in our venue’s history.\\n\\nThis Bank Holiday Sunday, expect an intimate, full-spectrum journey from the Godfathers of Drum & Bass themselves.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-20T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-06T02:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-21T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-05T22:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-06T03:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Fools Gold - Grooverider's Mix\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/65u7hdwGqo3J1kEDOLkOtZ\",\"artist\":\"Fools Gold\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/840adf2dfd06cd94e2399ae6c270b3ac93369c1a?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Grooverider's Mix\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Sun 05 Apr\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Omnigone\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"32835\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Kill Lincoln\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-05/bd4e9692-8f60-443b-b933-dd3db5ed12ce.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"46835\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Be Sharp Promotions\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"n