d band Kadebostany (2016–2020), performing 300+ shows across more than 20 countries and earning a reputation for her magnetic stage presence.\\n\\nAccompanied by a live band, Saint Stacy is set to deliver a powerful and unforgettable live experience.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-03T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-07T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-03T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-07T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-07T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Saint Stacy - Feel Like Myself\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/35F1QrGBAgki7d9yjjYnbT\",\"artist\":\"Saint Stacy\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/8a4683700b2359f3eac1d50a27be52d6381bbbbd?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Feel Like Myself\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Saint Stacy - Feel Like Myself\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/feel-like-myself/1759918401?i=1759918411&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Saint Stacy\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/0c/b1/71/0cb171bf-bf19-7989-8bc1-ebc6f0eccb5f/mzaf_9290276062718503862.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Feel Like Myself\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Luciano\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/2c0e3250-e854-483a-a209-4b49a6f44be8.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"132561\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Jazz Cafe.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_tick