ions from our resident collective, every Wednesday.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1995\",\"name\":\"The Blues Kitchen Shoreditch\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-blues-kitchen-shoreditch-oyry\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1775674800,\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Wed 08 Apr\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2421,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-24T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-09T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-24T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-09T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-09T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"bb3odk-cult-of-dissolution-iii-9th-apr-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Trivax - Azrael\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4LgcgiVK8imUTT03QMQiwq\",\"artist\":\"Trivax\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/0f0e364b138a1726c7e0e6a65b172ecb88f48bf4?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Azrael\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Trivax - Azrael\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/azrael/1697372918?i=1697372919&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Trivax\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview126/v4/d4/e8/6f/d4e86ff1-c9ab-f170-4388-b9f7720e1906/mzaf_14073344413144843663.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Azrael\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":71690,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":71691,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":71692,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Stahlsarg\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"77444\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Sidious\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"125259\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Trivax\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"61174\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-09T18:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-04-09T23:00:00+01:00\"}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-23/c488d6ad-264f-4cfc-8fc9-3589db47e3fe.jpg?rect=0%2C908%2C3634%2C3634\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-23/c488d6ad-264f-4cfc-8fc9-3589db47e3fe.jpg?rect=0%2C1181%2C3634%2C2180\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-23/c488d6ad-264f-4cfc-8fc9-3589db47e3fe.jpg?rect=568%2C0%2C2498%2C4542\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Fcf8f9b80b7d?dice_id=Fcf8f9b80b7d\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n8e57db172b0?dice_id=n8e57db172b0\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r02629eabc32?dice_id=r02629eabc32\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Cf5b35cabbf5?dice_id=Cf5b35cabbf5\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Oeee9c14f27c?dice_id=Oeee9c14f27c\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/obee099f4aed?dice_id=obee099f4aed\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"43dbb1788c9c854f:17\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Black Meadow\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1769274000,\"id\":\"69739b2d7752d600017fb4ab\",\"name\":\"CULT OF DISSOLUTION III\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Cult of Dissolution returns for its third iteration, bringing a hand-curated lineup of black and extreme metal that spans continents, perspectives, and intensities.\\n\\nTrivax began in Iran before relocating to the UK, carrying a perspective and intensity rarely seen in the genre. Their sound draws on black and death metal foundations, fused with Middle Eastern influences and shaped by themes of struggle, transcendence, and defiance. With albums such as Eloah Burns Out and the recent The Great Satan, Trivax continue to expand their reach with commanding live performances across Europe and beyond.\\n\\nSidious return to The Underworld more than a decade after their first appearance in 2014. Known for their precise and punishing sound, they have performed alongside acts such as Belphegor, Anaal Nathrakh, and Bölzer. Their forthcoming album, Malefic Necropolis (30 January), marks a new chapter in their evolution — darker, direct, and built for the stage. The single Bloodlust Command Infinite offers a glimpse of what is to come.\\n\\n\\\\+ Stahlsarg & Läbrys\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1775754000,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2090,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-19T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-09T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-19T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-09T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-09T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"oeq9a5-three-for-silver-9th-apr-new-cross-inn-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Three for Silver - Black Dog\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/black-dog/1457858554?i=1457858555&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Three for Silver\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview113/v4/d4/da/18/d4da187c-e7c7-3a49-52e6-9f24be0124a5/mzaf_1873163589171592437.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Black Dog\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Three for Silver - Black Dog\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6GthvijZusNB4vK7nSBkCe\",\"artist\":\"Three for Silver\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/2755998b5cf14bb747eb7bfdfe64d02de1860615?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Black Dog\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Three for Silver\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"131669\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1641\",\"name\":\"New Cross Inn\",\"address\":\"New Cross Inn, 323 New Cross Rd, London SE14 6AS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4757899,\"lng\":-0.037162699999953475},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/ba29f2fe-617e-4542-80b7-6e2529031d70.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C225%2C225\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"new-cross-inn-x9yl\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.newcrossinn.com/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-09T18:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-19/e152d78c-68aa-404d-b078-24221c1f4cf8.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-19/e152d78c-68aa-404d-b078-24221c1f4cf8.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-19/e152d78c-68aa-404d-b078-24221c1f4cf8.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/me2cab767437?dice_id=me2cab767437\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z39f6a6f4783?dice_id=z39f6a6f4783\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/S3cb701266e8?dice_id=S3cb701266e8\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y16da6e91a63?dice_id=y16da6e91a63\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u711d87db702?dice_id=u711d87db702\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W296ad0706c4?dice_id=W296ad0706c4\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"43dbb1788c9c854f:18\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"New Cross Live presents\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1766102400,\"id\":\"69452e45b8cf07000173de00\",\"name\":\"Three For Silver\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Three For Silver\\n\\nThree For Silver is a tatterdemalion ensemble of rotating musicians led by Lucas Warford, “the acid baby of Tom Waits and Les Claypool,” as NW legend Baby Gramps called him.\\n\\nIt's an aggressively original band that is impervious to easy description. PR people often use phrases like Mythic Americana, Doomfolk, or Apocalypso. Some of those are pretty good, but they still just feel like the desperate necessities of someone forced to fill out a  form labelled \\\"genre\\\".\\n\\n​\\n\\nThree For Silver features one-of-a-kind instruments you've never seen playing styles mixed in ways you've never heard. The band has hit the road since 2013, and their monomaniacal devotion has already led them all over the USA and the world, from Accordion Festivals in Vienna to Modern Music Expos in Russia, and even partnering with the US State Department for ongoing cultural exchange tours to countries thirsty for truly original American music.\\n\\nhttps://www.threeforsilver.com/\\n\\n\\\\+ supports\\n\\nThursday 9th April 2026\\n\\nNew Cross Inn, London\\n\\nDoors 6pm\\n\\nTickets £19 ADV STBF\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ under 16's to be accompanied by an adult\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1888\",\"name\":\"New Cross Live\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"new-cross-live-y8la\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1775754000,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1133,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-13T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-09T18:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-13T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-09T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"92alo9-10a-sessions-with-luxjury-album-launch-9th-apr-sjq-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"LuxJury - Hot Mess\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2xxN9ptj9uk3lOVsvumCxX\",\"artist\":\"LuxJury\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/d6e48607412e0eca66a5c7c4258440f8bab00f68?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Hot Mess\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"LuxJury - Hot Mess\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/hot-mess/1845897481?i=1845897489&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"LuxJury\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/76/ff/c5/76ffc530-cce0-3aef-588c-aab9291da882/mzaf_17495285504804775739.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Hot Mess\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"LuxJury\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-07-26/1e62b54f-8c36-45e1-bf65-f6b001fc0afc.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"105311\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"181\",\"name\":\"SJQ\",\"address\":\"10A Bradbury Street, London N16 8JN\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.548677,\"lng\":-0.0767180999999937},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-01-14/8d708e25-8424-478d-bba7-b394578460a7.jpg?rect=899%2C0%2C3744%2C3744\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"sjq-4pqp\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://servantjazzquarters.com/#contact\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-13/fa7e0bda-c266-465a-a7df-0e16154bd1c8.jpg?rect=0%2C270%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-13/fa7e0bda-c266-465a-a7df-0e16154bd1c8.jpg?rect=0%2C351%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-13/fa7e0bda-c266-465a-a7df-0e16154bd1c8.jpg?rect=169%2C0%2C743%2C1350\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H2fad02ac82c?dice_id=H2fad02ac82c\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o467439ba4cf?dice_id=o467439ba4cf\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ua2a9b7ef3f4?dice_id=ua2a9b7ef3f4\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/i9a1c8301c01?dice_id=i9a1c8301c01\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y75b7cae10e2?dice_id=Y75b7cae10e2\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u4add3434582?dice_id=u4add3434582\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"43dbb1788c9c854f:19\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by SJQ.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1770940800,\"id\":\"698f617168765d00013a4bc6\",\"name\":\"10A Sessions with LuxJury Album launch \",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Fronted by lead singer Nicole Fermie, she is a self-professed latecomer to the queer party but made great cliff notes along the way. The cliff notes were put to music which translated into alternative, extremely positive, autobiographical pop guitar music. Like if Prince went down more of a singer songwriter route than outright sex machine.\\n\\nNaming George Michael, Angel Olsen and the Vampyros Lesbos soundtrack as their main inspirations, LuxJury draws from their combined influences, fusing elements of pop, rock and soul baring lyricism to create their own distinctively captivating sound. Recorded and mixed at Hermitage Works (Goat Girl, Fat White Family, Big Joanie, Plantoid) and produced by Nathan Ridley (Plantoid, Big Joanie), ‘Hot Mess’ explores the complexities of toxic love and addiction, but with an undeniably sexy undertone. LuxJury lure in their listeners by telling stories with expression and relatability, but with an angsty yet playfully roguish honesty at its core.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"124635\",\"name\":\"SJQ\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"sjq-wb3bv\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1775757600,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2077,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-03T15:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-09T10:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-06T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-09T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"v393yv-theo-bleak-9th-apr-the-old-blue-last-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Theo Bleak\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-08-28/c7c9f8cd-9eab-4645-bbb6-d0e8ec3053dd.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"43276\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"The Old Blue Last\",\"address\":\"38 Great Eastern Street, London EC2A 3ES\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5245266,\"lng\":-0.0806281999999783},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\