t=44%2C0%2C1075%2C1075\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-02/e188e474-13fb-4715-8f16-701a70326873.jpg?rect=0%2C189%2C1162%2C697\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-02/e188e474-13fb-4715-8f16-701a70326873.jpg?rect=286%2C0%2C591%2C1075\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Bb00a8f467b3?dice_id=Bb00a8f467b3\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/dec7b0a8bb52?dice_id=dec7b0a8bb52\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Sbaae1b8cd61?dice_id=Sbaae1b8cd61\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/X537ebf9c349?dice_id=X537ebf9c349\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/B54ae76b4a08?dice_id=B54ae76b4a08\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/M2f2572380bf?dice_id=M2f2572380bf\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"43dbb1788c9c854f:24\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Black Frog\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1764633600,\"id\":\"692f1a76c736b00001486485\",\"name\":\"Steve Young\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"British Guitarist & Songwriter from the Isle of Wight (now living in Stevenage). He is also a Music Teacher, Corporate Entertainer and Band Coach.\\n\\nSteve is one of the South East's most popular entertainers notching up an incredible 200+ gigs per year. With a repertoire of over 400 songs from the 1950's to present day he can judge the crowd and play to suit whether its a chilled out restaurant vibe, intimate originals show, rowdy weekend pub or summer MainStage street festival the set list will always be perfect.\\n\\nSince 2014 Steve Young has written and released three albums; Troubadour, A Little North Of Nowhere, Is Anyone Listening. His debut EP 'Little Things' was meant to be a one off but the songs keep coming. He has also released a number of singles including - LONG LONG ROAD (2023) LOOKS LIKE YOU & FEELIN' FINE (2024). In 2024 Steve began work on a brand new album called ‘Famous For A Day’ The album, released on Vinyl in March 2025\\n\\nEarlier in his career Steve performed with Darren Hayes (Savage Garden) 2007-2012 and co-wrote & recorded guitar on his 2012 album 'Secret Codes & Battleships'\\n\\nIn 1996 he signed a record deal with ZTT/Warner with the band 'Rehab' going on to become a TV session guitarist for the likes of Lionel Richie, Peter Andre, Dane Bowers & Delta Goodrem\\n\\nSteve worked with Producer Tom Nichols (Black Coffee, All Saints, Kylie, Hall & Oats) writing 100's songs for artists from around the world. He also co-wrote and performed with Lizzie Pattinson.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"4307\",\"name\":\"Hot Box Live Community Interest \",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-live-community-interest-7v77\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1775757600,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2200,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-26T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-09T16:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-28T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-09T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"6dwvmb-nordic-giants-9th-apr-oslo-hackney-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Together\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2zQ2vKm9VslwOerYEWHtaF\",