ed and unheard material with the high-energy sounds that define his performances. A project long in the making, the live show captures both the emotional depth and rhythmic intensity of his music in a fresh form.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"5547\",\"name\":\"Colour Factory\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"colour-factory-olgy\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1775757600,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1566,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-27T13:45:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-09T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-10-27T13:45:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-09T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"bbnndm-rikas-9th-apr-moth-club-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Rikas - Overthinking\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4tMVjTs8Y9C1bi2AGoO8Gk\",\"artist\":\"Rikas\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/771c19bbe333c21f12a0f711924120e43a4c606b?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Overthinking\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Rikas\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-02-08/7af773bb-d637-451a-b7d8-0bdfbcbf983d.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"36476\",\"about\":null,\"is_head