s Gili Goldberg and his full live band bring the album to life, celebrating its 10th anniversary.\\n\\nPraised for its honesty, expansive sound, and seamless genre fusion, Malibu has grown into a modern classic that continues to inspire artists and audiences alike.\\n\\nAn evening of groove, storytelling, and live energy — Malibu like you’ve never heard it before.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"43\",\"name\":\"The Jazz Cafe\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-jazz-cafe-43ox\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1775842200,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3554},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-08T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-10T21:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-08T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-10T18:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-10T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"537q3y-duda-beat-10th-apr-village-underground-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"DUDA BEAT - Bixinho\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/04RFAnuBZkyITGUNIbZHhb\",\"artist\":\"DUDA BEAT\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/ff4003f32dcdc839d923f9366f3f03a0421363ca?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Bixinho\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":68093,\"title\":\"What are the ages restrictions for this event?\",\"body\