oza, and The Town.\\n\\nWith subsequent releases expanding her lyrical and sonic scope, she continues to evolve as a multidisciplinary artist, combining music, performance, and cultural influence.\\n\\nIf you have any queries or would like more information about access at Village Underground, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/3EhSLgF, or contact access@villageunderground.co.uk.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"11556\",\"name\":\"Village Underground\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"village-underground-n5v8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1775842200,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":4148},\"unicorn\":false,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"e724468f-a037-4105-a65d-f8d6bd0a6278\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"d31cbde6-a999-4e14-8ec1-e975c10adbf1\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-18T09:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-10T22:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-19T09:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-10T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-10T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"926e2o-godspeed-you-black-emperor-10th-apr-troxy-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"e724468f-a037-4105-a65d-f8d6bd0a6278\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Godspeed You! Black Emperor - Fire at Static Valley\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/05qZjkncp85Z4pu4of3w6y\",\"artist\":\"Godspeed You! Black Emperor\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/2ea1c6991058bdae7eafdd6bb26cafd806252ae7?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Fire at Static Valley\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":\"d31cbde6-a999-4e14-8ec1-e975c10adbf1\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":20779,\"title\":\"How can I purchase an accessible ticket?\",\"body\":\"Please email accesstickets@troxy.co.uk with a copy of your proof of eligibility.\\n\\nFor more information about Accessible bookings and example proof of eligibility, visit https://troxy.co.uk/accessibility/.\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":20780,\"title\":\"Can I get a carer ticket if I have a standing or circle ticket?\",\"body\":\"We can offer free companion tickets upon receipt of proof of eligibility and your DICE booking confirmation at accesstickets@troxy.co.uk. Companion ticket availability is limited in the Circle, so please reach out to check availability before purchasing a Circle ticket.\",\"order\":1}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Godspeed You! Black Emperor\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-03-31/e895e2dd-26a3-4376-bca8-04c9ab1fb959.jpg?rect=247%2C0%2C2507%2C2507\"},\"artist_id\":\"15519\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"583\",\"name\":\"Troxy\",\"address\":\"490 Commercial Road, London E1 0HX\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5127267,\"lng\":-0.0440164000000323},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-02-09/061113a1-696d-4a63-976d-388707e1d2c4.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2750%2C2750\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"troxy-ww3x\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://troxy.co.uk/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-10T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-04-10T23:00:00+01:00\"}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-14/57034f8e-a5c3-4de1-a218-5e0f0b4ec7b2.jpg?rect=247%2C0%2C2507%2C2507\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-14/57034f8e-a5c3-4de1-a218-5e0f0b4ec7b2.jpg?rect=0%2C354%2C3000%2C1800\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-14/57034f8e-a5c3-4de1-a218-5e0f0b4ec7b2.jpg?rect=811%2C0%2C1379%2C2507\"},\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/lf018fdc57d2?dice_id=lf018fdc57d2\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r2c71f385308?dice_id=r2c71f385308\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P5f2d3d32cfa?dice_id=P5f2d3d32cfa\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z450bea6c524?dice_id=Z450bea6c524\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E0db36b4bf57?dice_id=E0db36b4bf57\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k01214fe3af6?dice_id=k01214fe3af6\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":14,\"name\":\"Troxy\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://troxy.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"43dbb1788c9c854f:45\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Wax Face.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1763456400,\"id\":\"6915d27d4a67690001f8c256\",\"name\":\"Godspeed You! Black Emperor\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Godspeed You! Black Emperor released a string of albums from 1997-2002 widely recognized as redefining what protest music can be, where longform instrumental chamber rock compositions of immense feeling and power serve as soundtracks to late capitalist alienation and resistance. The band’s first four releases - especially F#A#∞ (1997) and Lift Your Skinny Fists Like Antennas To Heaven (2000) - are variously regarded as classics of the era and genre.\\n\\nGodspeed's legendary live performances, featuring multiple 16mm projectors beaming a collage of overlapping analog film loops and reels - along with the distinctive iconography, imagery and tactility of the band's album artwork and physical LP packages - further defines the sui generis aesthetic substance, ethos and mythos of this group.\\n\\nGY!BE has issued two official band photos in its 25-year existence (the second, left, a 2010 recreation of the first from 1997) and has done a half-dozen collectively-answered written interviews over that same span. The band has never had a website or social media accounts. It has never made a video. Few rock bands in our 21st century have been as steadfast in trying to let the work speak for itself and maintaining simple rules about minimising participation in cultures of personality, exposure, access, commodification or co-optation.\\n\\nFollowing a seven-year hiatus that began in 2003, Godspeed returned to the stage in December 2010 (curating the UK festival All Tomorrow’s Parties) and the band’s post-reunion period has now lasted over a decade, marked by hundreds of sold-out live shows and four additional albums, all of which have been met with high acclaim.\\n\\nBooking fees include a £2.25 venue restoration levy per ticket.\\n\\n**Accessible Bookings:**\\n\\nTickets for Troxy’s step-free seated accessible area are available directly from this listing as Accessible Area tickets. If you’ve purchased Accessible Area tickets for this event and haven’t done so for a previous event at Troxy, please email accesstickets@troxy.co.uk with a copy of your proof of eligibility. We accept PIP letters, Access Cards, Blue Badge, Doctor's notes, etc. Please ensure that this is sent to us within 7 days of your purchase, as failure to do so could result in your ticket being cancelled and refunded. Please direct all other accessibility enquiries to accesstickets@troxy.co.uk.\\n\\nFor more information about Accessible bookings and example proof of eligibility, visit https://troxy.co.uk/accessibility/.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1554\",\"name\":\"Troxy\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"troxy-5wrl\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1775844000,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1200,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-17T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-10T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-17T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-10T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-10T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"q29r59-rhiannon-hope-10th-apr-morocco-bound-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Rhiannon Hope - B.B.\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/40cv1yAnkhu65KjQiu90Gi\",\"artist\":\"Rhiannon Hope\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/3f92f2f4c707177c92f689a2d934f54ada6c7622?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"B.B.\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Rhiannon Hope - B.B.\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/b-b/1832692633?i=1832692635&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Rhiannon Hope\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/de/b0/6e/deb06ebc-aad5-6b6b-31ba-45259c970920/mzaf_2053548542393798305.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"B.B.\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"13583\",\"name\":\"Morocco Bound\",\"address\":\"1a Morocco Street, Southwark, London, SE1 3HB, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.50033,\"lng\":-0.082},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"morocco-bound-wnln\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-10T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-17/ae6b92ed-1116-4271-99d4-15b8f45dac3a.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C3712%2C3712\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-17/ae6b92ed-1116-4271-99d4-15b8f45dac3a.jpg?rect=0%2C186%2C5568%2C3341\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-17/ae6b92ed-1116-4271-99d4-15b8f45dac3a.jpg?rect=1763%2C0%2C2042%2C3712\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/xb841873853e?dice_id=xb841873853e\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D955f1e9cb21?dice_id=D955f1e9cb21\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b40f96e2bdf5?dice_id=b40f96e2bdf5\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Oa83599fe113?dice_id=Oa83599fe113\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/wf5ecbe5b47a?dice_id=wf5ecbe5b47a\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F5fdc0185d2b?dice_id=F5fdc0185d2b\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"43dbb1788c9c854f:46\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Morocco Bound.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1771286400,\"id\":\"699468a7dd0eff00013331a1\",\"name\":\"Rhiannon Hope\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Liverpool-born, Leeds-based folk songwriter Rhiannon Hope is set to release her first EP, All Things, Rising and Returning, on 25th September via Private Regcords. The lead single, ‘B.B.’, is out now.\\n\\nWeaving odes to jazz greats into tales of the working class experience and stitching gentle twangs into accordion hums, All Things, Rising and Returning marks the debut release from Leeds-based folk artist Rhiannon Hope. The EP nurtures a unique blend of traditional folk and contemporary influences, with Rhiannon looking to the likes of Ella Fitzgerald and Aldous Harding for sonic guidance. The resulting sound is at once delicate and deliberate, wistful yet soulful, and, perhaps most of all, timeless.\\n\\nLead single ‘B.B’ arrived earlier this month and proved Hope’s talent for melody and vulnerability in her approach to folk, exploring feelings of imposter syndrome over soft strings. The track earned Hope press coverage from DIY Magazine, Still Listening and Far Out Magazine, the latter comparing the track to a glowing pink sunset, “beautiful and full of catharsis.” Now, the single is being pressed onto wax, alongside three more tracks from Rhiannon’s repertoire, as part of her debut EP.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"14196\",\"name\":\"Morocco Bound\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"morocco-bound-6d3nb\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1775844000,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1100,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-21T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-10T16:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-26T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-10T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-10T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"rynk35-rolla-10th-apr-the-old-blue-last-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Rolla \",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"30962\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"The Old Blue Last\",\"address\":\"38 Great Eastern Street, London EC2A 3ES\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5245266,\"lng\":-0.0806281999999783},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27