 Images - Monumento\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/monumento/1595711355?i=1595711356&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Sunset Images\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview116/v4/85/bf/62/85bf62eb-3f67-8f28-c394-796bcb32bfdd/mzaf_10543326949144394104.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Monumento\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Sunset Images - Monumento\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3WDgMofhX0G5XVzvC5Y1Rj\",\"artist\":\"Sunset Images\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/c5da4b1acdefad482c4b59c1eb5dfca6933e57c7?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Monumento\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Mugstar\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/7e20e91622e468def29d5e2672fc00f2a59b9b80\"},\"artist_id\":\"10111\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Sunset Images\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-30/6ae3f5b6-88dd-4d7f-91eb-a97f8d6a36fa.jpg?rect=0%2C51%2C481%2C481\"},\"artist_id\":\"71640\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"298\",\"name\":\"Strongroom Bar\",\"address\":\"120-124 Curtain Rd, Shoreditch, London EC2A 3SQ, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5259644,\"lng\":-0.0801498},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-11-09/01c2cab5-15ea-48e0-a0b4-d9ed0465d9db.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C850%2C850\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"strongroom-bar-4bym\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-10T19:45:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-10/009d570b-a9be-485f-909a-0e2eed2afbf4.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2160%2C2160\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-10/009d570b-a9be-485f-909a-0e2eed2afbf4.jpg?rect=0%2C432%2C2160%2C1296\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-10/009d570b-a9be-485f-909a-0e2eed2afbf4.jpg?rect=486%2C0%2C1188%2C2160\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E3d8c1d575a3?dice_id=E3d8c1d575a3\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/t1a7c574f4a6?dice_id=t1a7c574f4a6\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m6016c2a5bce?dice_id=m6016c2a5bce\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y58cc3f04625?dice_id=Y58cc3f04625\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N1938646c6f1?dice_id=N1938646c6f1\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/offd85ebf7f0?dice_id=offd85ebf7f0\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"43dbb1788c9c854f:64\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Other Side Promotions.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1765373400,\"id\":\"6939744ef7393d0001b3f0eb\",\"name\":\"OSP Presents: Sunset Images (MX) + Mugstar \",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"𝐒𝐮𝐧𝐬𝐞𝐭 𝐈𝐦𝐚𝐠𝐞𝐬 (𝐌𝐗):\\n\\n“In the depths of Mexico City, a maelstrom of sound has been brewing, Sunset Images, a sonic entity-fueled by the unyielding passion of Samuel Osorio- has transcended the influences of krautrock, shoegaze, & punk into a layered soundscape of dissonance, cathartic release, & emotional depth.\\n\\nWith a growing reputation for their intense live performances, Sunset Images has shared stages with notable bands, toured extensively across multiple continents.\\n\\nThis journey has lead them into their highly anticipated debut with Dedstrange ( out on January 23, 2026), the label founded by the mastermind behind A Place To Bury Strangers & the FX pedal company Death by Audio, Oliver Ackermann, who sought out and brought them into the Dedstrange tribe of sonic outcasts, where Sunset Images has found the perfect home & only label that could match their vision for massively distorted & inextricable sound.\\n\\nhttps://linktr.ee/SunsetImages\\n\\n𝐌𝐮𝐠𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐫:\\n\\nThe Liverpool group have been releasing exceptional music since 2003. Along the way, they have collaborated with Damo Suzuki, & been lauded by Krautrock scholar (and fully qualified space cadet) Julian Cope.\\n\\nMUGSTAR are undeniable masters within the 21st century Psychedelic Rock movement, playing across Europe & the USA, fully deserving to be mentioned in the same breath as Mogwai or Godspeed You! Black Emperor, Hawkwind or CAN.\\n\\nfacebook.com/p/MUGSTAR-100034425406661\\n\\nhttps://mugstar.bandcamp.com/music\\n\\nThis is an 18+ event. This venue has a strict No ID, No entry Policy. Physical government photo ID required, we do not accept photos or copies of ID’s.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"5285\",\"name\":\"Other Side Promotions\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-09-09/c8464497-8f12-4558-84bb-ede11bc2ddb5.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"other-side-promotions-r5gv\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1775846700,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":375},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\