se from The FADER, STEREOGUM, PASTE, and EARMILK—and a growing reputation for standout live shows.\\n\\nDon’t miss one of the UK’s most exciting rising acts.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"128716\",\"name\":\"The Castle\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-castle-yk97v\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1775847600,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":900},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-10T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-10T19:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-10T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-10T21:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-11T01:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"ry97xy-mixtape-the-euro-step-sweet-sensation-10th-apr-prince-of-peckham-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1587\",\"name\":\"Prince of Peckham\",\"address\":\"1 Clayton Rd, Peckham, London SE15 5JA, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.47358029999999,\"lng\":-0.06533349999995153},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5