lking the finest selectors spinning non-stop fire from across the globe.\\n\\nPull up and catch our DJs doing what they do best, setting the vibe from start to finish. If it’s a banger, it’s on their playlist.\\n\\nVisit our website to secure a table at https://princeofpeckham.co.uk .\\n\\nEntry Policy:\\n\\nTickets do not guarantee entry. They provide priority access and queue jump, but entry remains subject to venue capacity and conditions.\\n\\nDress Code: No sportswear, tracksuits, or track shorts. Guests not adhering to the dress code will be refused entry, regardless of ticket purchase. No refunds will be issued.\\n\\nAge Policy: 21+ only. A valid photo ID is required for entry.\\n\\nTicket holders are guaranteed priority entry until 11 PM (subject to capacity). From 11pm entry will be at the discretion of the venue.\\n\\nLast Entry: Doors close at 12:30 AM. Ticket holders arriving after this time will be refused entry with no refund.\\n\\nAll rights of admission are reserved by Prince of Peckham.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 21+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"7843\",\"name\":\"The Arbuthnot Group Ltd\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-arbuthnot-group-ltd-33nx\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1775851200,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":375},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-30T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-11T01:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-30T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-10T21:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-11T03:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"rynex5-camden-got-soul-10th-apr-the-blues-kitchen-camden-lo