id\":854,\"name\":\"Village Underground\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://villageunderground.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"574810874256593\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-TTMX0FS0EH\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":\"781332317\",\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":\"SOfECKivg5caEN3eyPQC\",\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"43dbb1788c9c854f:78\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Focuss events.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1758099600,\"id\":\"68d26d69f9354e00017b986e\",\"name\":\"RSKO in London\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"After an explosive 2024, marked by a sold-out show at La Cigale in just 24 hours, a packed Olympia within weeks, and a triumphant first\\n\\ntour across France, RSKO confirms his status as a heavyweight of the French-speaking music scene.\\n\\nOriginally from the 94, RSKO has established himself as one of the most unique voices in today’s musical landscape, delivering hit after hit with dreamy melodies, heartfelt lyrics, and Afro-Caribbean influences.\\n\\nHis latest project, acclaimed by critics and featuring collaborations with major figures in French rap and R&B, marked a new milestone in his career.\\n\\nRSKO now announces an exceptional 2026 tour, including a date at Village Underground on 11/04/2026, which promises to be unforgettable!\\n\\nRSKO on tour in 2026 — an event not to be missed! 🐍\\n\\nIf you have any queries or would like more information about access at Village Underground, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/3EhSLgF, or contact access@villageunderground.co.uk.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subti