18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-12T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"announcement_date_unix\":1760605200,\"offers_extras\":true,\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2704,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"id\":\"68ee845bef8d54000141d1ed\",\"name\":\"MORNING AGAIN\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Killing Me Softly\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb927cb6d3a924f92e8262b0c2\"},\"artist_id\":\"99616\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Morning Again\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"99249\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"new\":false,\"seating\":null,\"perm_name\":\"8exwv5-morning-again-12th-apr-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-16/f54c0b17-124c-4d4e-8920-bf28c63e6bc7.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C4032%2C4032\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-16/f54c0b17-124c-4d4e-8920-bf28c63e6bc7.jpg?rect=0%2C807%2C4032%2C2419\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-16/f54c0b17-124c-4d4e-8920-bf28c63e6bc7.jpg?rect=907%2C0%2C2218%2C4032\"},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"score\":0,\"about\":{\"description\":\"MORNING AGAIN are an American Metalcore band from Florida. They were known for their metallic sound as well as for their Straight Edge, Vegan, anti-religious and anti-government ideals. The band was a \\\"sister band\\\" to CULTURE, often switching members after one had left the other. Several members went on to play in other bands such as AS FRIENDS RUST and DEAD BLUE SKY. The band were originally from Cooper City, Florida, but moved to Coral Springs in 1998 before breaking up later that year. After playing several reunion shows over the years, the band released an EP in 2018.\\n\\nIn July 2018, it was announced that the group reforming once again and were recording new material (to be issued as an EP through Revelation). The Survival Instinct EP was released on November 9, 2018. In 2022, the band announced a week-long European tour and released another EP, Borrowed Time, on Revelation Records.\\n\\nFrom the band:\\n\\n  \\n\\\"We’re excited to share that Damien Moyal (As Friends Rust, Morning Again, Culture) will be taking on microphone duties for our upcoming EU/UK shows! As you might have heard, Kevin is taking the time to heal after his recent accident and we’re grateful to Damien for stepping up to help in April. We’re looking forward to it, see you in the pit!\\\"\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":65652,\"title\":\"What's the bag policy?\",\"body\":\"Security – Bag Policy\\n\\nLarge bags – including rucksacks are not allowed.\\n\\nThere are no facilities to leave large bags or luggage.\\n\\nIf you really have to bring a bag – and it’s preferable you don’t – please make sure it’s small.\\n\\nOnly one small bag per person is permitted and it must not be bigger than A4 size.\\n\\nHeight: 28.7cm\\n\\nWidth: 21cm\\n\\nDepth 15cm\",\"order\":0}],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Protoje & Chronixx - Who Knows\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/who-knows/1814333348?i=1814333351&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Protoje & Chronixx\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/d8/9c/ae/d89caeaf-5594-3654-f946-be925cde192f/mzaf_4308373085787743971.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Who Knows\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\