LP purchases will be shipped at release from 24/04 via Second Class Mail.\\n\\nTicket transfers will be off to avoid shipping issues, please make sure you either purchase your own ticket or attend the event together.\\n\\nMore product information can be found HERE >> https://www.roughtrade.com/product/metric/romanticize-the-dive\\n\\nAccessibility:\\n\\nFor accessible tickets, free PA/Carer tickets and other accessibility requests please go to dice.fm/contact. Rough Trade is wheelchair accessible with step free access.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":12},\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":260,\"name\":\"Bird On The Wire\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.birdonthewire.net/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"168353773761986\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Eiko Ishibashi & Jim O'Rourke - Par\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/par/1813472438?i=1813472440&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Eiko Ishibashi & Jim O'Rourke\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/44/b8/ce/44b8cee7-6542-9e57-1499-574d5b30003f/mzaf_6092512918448348446.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Par\"}],\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"properties\":[],\"date_unix\":1776103200,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"65\",\"name