 Tall Black Guy** have spent years building a cinematic world where **jazz-inflected keys** meet the **Precision of beat-making**. A masterclass in texture, they have created a sanctuary for artists like **Phonte**, **Omar**, and **Sy Smith** to redefine the global RnB landscape.\\n\\nBlending the warmth of **live instrumentation** with the grit of **electronic percussion**, their sound remains untethered from expectation—a celebration of the melodies that bridge the gap between club culture and soul.\\n\\nRefined, evocative, and deeply soulful, Zo! & Tall Black Guy find their magic as two masters operating in total, rhythmic harmony.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"LNZRT\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://lanzaroteworks.com/Privacy-Policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":954,\"name\":\"MOTH\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"2922216871345119\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":false,\"show_opt_in_form\":false,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":1337,\"name\":\"Eat Your Own Ears\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.eatyourownears.com/privacy-cookies-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tikt