\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-13T21:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"announcement_date_unix\":1770894900,\"offers_extras\":true,\"secondary_status\":\"pre-sale\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3154},\"id\":\"698f0a35d030c40001c9f271\",\"name\":\"1VERSE EUROPE TOUR 2026 - LONDON\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":5},\"new\":false,\"seating\":null,\"perm_name\":\"2w8dq7-1verse-europe-tour-2026-london-13th-apr-the-garage-london-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/53cbc362-5acd-488a-a3be-b46d4d2c824f.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2000%2C2000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/53cbc362-5acd-488a-a3be-b46d4d2c824f.jpg?rect=0%2C400%2C2000%2C1200\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/53cbc362-5acd-488a-a3be-b46d4d2c824f.jpg?rect=450%2C0%2C1100%2C2000\"},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"score\":0,\"about\":{\"description\":\"The OFFICIAL 1VERSE EU Tour lands in London! 5TARZ, join us and be a part of 1VERSE's first-ever concert tour! We can't wait to see you!\\n\\nSale for KOOKY ticket holders opens on Tuesday 17th February at 14:00. To access tickets, click on \\\"got a code\\\" and complete the information.\\n\\nEarly bird sale opens on Friday Feburary 20th at 14:00.\\n\\nGeneral sale opens on Thursday March 19th at 14:00.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages. Under 16 years old must be accompanied by an adult.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":68769,\"title\":\"Where are my tickets?\",\"body\":\"**IMPORTANT: Read here about your Roundhouse tickets**\\n\\nPlease note you will need to access your tickets via the Roundhouse Online Wallet at - http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk\\n\\nYour tickets WILL NOT be available in the DICE app. Just follow the below steps below on the day of event to access your ticket to the show:\\n\\nHead to http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk\\n\\nSign in using your DICE account email address - if you already had a Roundhouse account under the same email address, enter the password associated with this email address. If you didn’t have one, Roundhouse will have created one for you and you’ll just need to reset the password before logging in.\\n\\nIf you need to reset your password, you’ll be taken to http://roundhouse.org.uk, but you need to log in again at http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk to access your ticket.\\n\\nThe QR code should appear a couple of hours before the stated time on your ticket\\n\\nIf you want to transfer your tickets to a friend please do so at least 4 hours before the event within the Roundhouse ticket wallet.\\n\\nIf you cannot access your tickets in the Roundhouse online wallet please visit the venue box office when you arrive and one of the team will be happy to assist you.\\n\\nFull information regarding the Roundhouse online wallet can be found at - https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/faqs/digital-tickets/\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":68770,\"title\":\"Security\",\"body\":\"On arrival you will be greeted by our ticket scanners and our security teams. Our security checks include bag searches and a search of individuals using wands. Please be prepared upon arrival to go through this process and help speed up the entry. Our security teams are there for your safety but we recognise that this process can be daunting for some. Please do raise any concerns with staff members when you arrive so that we can support you where needed.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":68771,\"title\":\"Prohibited Items\",\"body\":\"We reserve the right to prohibit specific items from the Roundhouse Premises. A full list of prohibited items can be found in our Admissions Terms & Conditions: https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/terms-policies/admissions-terms/\\n\\nUnfortunately flags and banners are not permitted into the venue as they can obstruct the view for other people in the audience. Please note this list is not exhaustive. The Venue Management has the right to prohibit any other items that are not included in this list but are deemed to cause a risk to the building or people.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":68772,\"title\":\"Accessibility Tickets\",\"body\":\"Accessibility tickets must be booked directly with the venue, not through DICE. Please get in touch with the venue via access@roundhouse.org.uk prior to purchasing.\",\"order\":3}],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[],\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":\"668c8537-569b-459b-aa5d-df72d382717b\",\"properties\":[],\"date_unix\":1776105000,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"114\",\"name\":\"Roundhouse\",\"address\":\"Roundhouse, Chalk Farm Rd, London NW1 8EH\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5430406,\"lng\":-0.15131180000003},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-24/2fce8c34-cb66-4510-a1d0-f2c07a1f9479.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2889%2C2889\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"roundhouse-4296\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/visit/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-13T19:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"388\",\"name\":\"Roundhouse\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"roundhouse-jyav\",\"profile_active\":false},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p219871c66b3?dice_id=p219871c66b3\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/C12518f64ea4?dice_id=C12518f64ea4\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H4744671b99e?dice_id=H4744671b99e\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q8aac8b5f11a?dice_id=Q8aac8b5f11a\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/B6b1c0998579?dice_id=B6b1c0998579\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n2a0cc86b528?dice_id=n2a0cc86b528\"},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"seats_io_event_id\":\"39eb0763-035b-4bf2-9c41-e98b414dc59a\",\"max_tickets\":6,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Roundhouse Three Sixty Festival.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"86cf2032e1cbfbea:21\",\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-16T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-10T09:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-16T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-13T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-13T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"announcement_date_unix\":1768557600,\"offers_extras\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1040},\"id\":\"696788caed07460001bcd10d\",\"name\":\"Roundhouse Three Sixty: SpitNights\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Harry Baker\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"25978\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Maureen Onwunali\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"132303\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Caitlin O’Ryan\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"132304\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"39eb0763-035b-4bf2-9c41-e98b414dc59a\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"668c8537-569b-459b-aa5d-df72d382717b\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"perm_name\":\"oeg6yy-roundhouse-three-sixty-spitnights-13th-apr-roundhouse-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/31eb16ea-2eea-40c5-bc13-7fa6a48ec83c.jpg?rect=0%2C682%2C2732%2C2732\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/31eb16ea-2eea-40c5-bc13-7fa6a48ec83c.jpg?rect=0%2C1229%2C2732%2C1639\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/31eb16ea-2eea-40c5-bc13-7fa6a48ec83c.jpg?rect=240%2C0%2C2253%2C4096\"},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"score\":0,\"about\":{\"description\":\"SpitNights has become one of the UK’s fastest-growing platforms for emerging artists, combining the most exciting talent on the jazz and poetry circuit.\\n\\nTheir nights are full of explosive interludes, unpredictable collaborations, and poetry designed for anyone who thought they didn’t like it.\\n\\nExpect to see poetry legend Harry Baker, rising star Maureen Onwunali, and poet, author and actor Caitlin O’Ryan (who has amassed over 18 million views online and performed at Glastonbury in 2025).\\n\\nTheir poems will all be backed by a live improvised jazz band, creating a soundtrack for their words.\\n\\nShow starts 7:30pm\\n\\n@spitnights\\n\\n@harrybakerpoet\\n\\n@caitlinoryan\\n\\n@maureenonwunaliRoundhouse Three Sixty festival\\n\\nFeaturing Harry Baker, Maureen Onwunali, Caitlin O’Ryan & special guests\\n\\nThis is an all-ages event (Under 16s accompanied by an adult, Under 14s accompanied and in seats).\",\"highlights\":[]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":20,\"name\":\"Upset The Rhythm\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"http://www.upsettherhythm.co.uk/privacypolicy.html http://www.upsettherhythm.co.uk/privac