_extras\":true,\"score\":0,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Two of New York's most mesmerising lyricists share the stage for a rare double headline performance.**\\n\\nA key figure in modern underground hip-hop, **Rome Streetz** is known for his relentless, complex bars and vivid narratives. Part of the influential Griselda crew, he blends razor sharp wordplay with classic East Coast boom-bap.\\n\\nMoving effortlessly between high-concept storytelling and witty punchlines, Y**our Old Droog** marks his first performance in London since lockdown, bringing the impeccable flow and dedicated artistry that has defined his career.\\n\\nTogether, Streetz and Droog offer a night where technique meets authenticity, showcasing the very best of contemporary New York hip-hop.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":338,\"name\":\"FORM Presents\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://formpresents.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"502219323814680\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":861,\"name\":\"Institute of Contemporary Arts\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://ica.art/privacy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":fa