:null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":31977,\"title\":\"Accessible and carer ticketing information\",\"body\":\"The accessible area for this show is full, and all the free personal assistant tickets have been assigned. We will not be able to accommodate any more requests. We apologise for any inconvenience this may cause.\\n\\nhttps://support.dice.fm/article/179-accessibilty-tickets-for-islington-assembly-hall\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":31976,\"title\":\"Stage Times \",\"body\":\"Stage times are posted at 11am on the day of the show on our venue website.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":47386,\"title\":\"Support the Supports\",\"body\":\"Islington Assembly Hall has launched 'Support the Supports' a campaign to help introduce more music lovers to the up-and-coming acts that open the show! Show up to the venue prior to 8pm and you are in with a chance to win a mystery prize, from drinks vouchers to exclusive merchandise from artists that have previously played the venue. Use the #supportthesupports through socials when you discover a new favourite act at Islington Assembly Hall.\",\"order\":2}],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/legal-information/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"679202632593023\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-980124-39\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[],\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"properties\":[],\"date_unix\":1776276000,\