p with stairs, and an onsite wheelchair once you’re inside the venue. If you have any access needs, please do e-mail us at access@theatreship.co.uk, we're always happy to hear from you, and we'll do whatever we can to help!\",\"order\":0}],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Forever Young\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5NKFUeiNY8Y6TeNdmshSt8\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/a5a3f2c0893ffa928d28fc35a032a510e58fd046?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Forever Young\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Bradley Jago - Girl Problems\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/girl-problems/1726384255?i=1726384261&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Bradley Jago\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview126/v4/b6/0e/8b/b60e8bbb-3518-f9f9-4fa6-a41c738e0414/mzaf_6267440765463264552.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Girl Problems\"}],\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"properties\":[],\"date_unix\":1776362400,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"14088\",\"name\":\"Theatreship\",\"address\":\"South Quay Plaza 2, London, England E14 9SH, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.500574,\"lng\":-0.01734},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-16/325a798f-118c-4bd1-ad3e-4bfdd4f477dc.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"theatreship-yo272\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-16T16:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_cl