?dice_id=o3e23abb832d\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Fbef5dcb762b?dice_id=Fbef5dcb762b\"},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by REAL\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"86cf2032e1cbfbea:61\",\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-18T11:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-16T23:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-22T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-16T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-16T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"announcement_date_unix\":1766055600,\"offers_extras\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1000},\"id\":\"69429ccbcbeb8d00018e3688\",\"name\":\"Dead Horse One\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Dead Horse One\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb404cacf25c82b525528c9ab1\"},\"artist_id\":\"10882\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"new\":false,\"seating\":null,\"perm_name\":\"l8ox5r-dead-horse-one-16th-apr-strongroom-bar-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-15/35c322e4-123a-428a-8601-da47349ba314.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-15/35c322e4-123a-428a-8601-da47349ba314.jpg?rect=0%2C240%2C1200%2C720\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-15/35c322e4-123a-428a-8601-da47349ba314.jpg?rect=270%2C0%2C660%2C1200\"},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"score\":0,\"about\":{\"description\":\"***Dead Horse One -*** French band Dead Horse One combine a heavy three-guitar attack with lush, psych-tinged dreampop shoegaze textures. Following a series of smaller releases, they established themselves across Europe in the mid 2010s, issuing a pair of well-received albums and playing alongside like-minded forebears such as Ride, The Brian Jonestown Massacre, and Nothing. The group’s third LP, The West Is The Best, was released at the end of 2019. After this, their sound became heavier and more intense, especially on 2024’s Seas Of Static.\\n\\n***Velcrow*** - London four-piece Velcrow bring a fresh blend of post-punk, shoegaze and art rock to the capital. Recorded aboard a floating studio in the Docklands, debut singles Collected Mind and Hallowed Ground build cascading guitars into the raw, rhythmic intensity that's earned the band a run of sold-out shows. There's much more to come, with 2026 shaping up to be a standout year for London's newest recruits.\\n\\n***BLANKTALK*** - Hailing out of the south Norfolk countryside, 4 piece alternative rock outfit BLANKTALK elevates reverberated emotion in a mesh of wide guitars and beautiful atmospheric layers.\\n\\n***Artists:*** We are always interested in hearing from talented artists. If you’d like to play at our future events, please get in touch at info@realsounds.uk.\\n\\n***Refunds:*** Tickets are for the full event and not for individual artists. If an artist cancels your tickets are still valid for the event. We cannot offer refunds.\\n\\nThis is an 18+ event. This venue has a strict No ID, No entry Policy. Physical government photo ID required, we do not accept photos or copies of ID’s.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":63603,\"title\":\"Venue Restoration Levy\",\"body\":\"The restoration levy is £1.20 for 229.\",\"order\":0}],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":294,\"name\":\"229 The Venue\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://229.london/dataprotection/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twit