ntage-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-12/672c8f8d-e4da-48d3-869a-12b0dab01af4.jpg?rect=0%2C135%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-12/672c8f8d-e4da-48d3-869a-12b0dab01af4.jpg?rect=0%2C351%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-12/672c8f8d-e4da-48d3-869a-12b0dab01af4.jpg?rect=169%2C0%2C743%2C1350\"},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"score\":0,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Wayne Wayneson and the Whisky Kissers**: A comedy, clown, drag king character Wayne Wayneson - is multi-platinum, Grammy-winning country-rock icon. Once the untouchable symbol of musical masculinity, Wayne became a relic of excess, stumbling through life fueled by cheap whiskey and outdated bravado. But he's got a plan: a comeback.\\n\\nEnter Wayne Wayneson & The Whisky Kissers. A powerhouse band of seasoned musicians (who are all women in drag), embodying the swagger, ego, and grit of classic male country stars. Through electrifying performances and sharp satire, they channel the world of whiskey-soaked honky-tonks, heartbreak anthems, and absurd, over-the-top machismo.\\n\\nWayne Wayneson: Coral Bevan\\n\\nKeys and Harmonica (MD) : Old Rip Van Winkle: Steph Singer\\n\\nGuitarist : Ole Smokey: Fran Barrett\\n\\nBassist : Jimmy Beam: Nina Brostrøm Laumann\\n\\nDrummer : Jonny Jameson: Holly Sayer\\n\\nPedal Steel and Guitar : Jonny Red Stag: Holly Carter\\n\\nViolin and Banjo : Knobby Creek: Evie Hilyer-Ziegler\\n\\nConcept and Character: Coral Bevan\\n\\nDirectors: Ricky Hunt and David Alwyn.\\n\\nWritten by: Coral Bevan, Ricky Hunt and David Alwyn.\\n\\nInstagram: @waynewayneson and @coralbevan for more updates\\n\\nWebsite: www.coralbevan.com\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unic