Morgan Wright. Working with restraint and atmosphere, their music unfolds slowly and deliberately, guided by instinct and emotion. Their debut album Chances was released in 2022 on Melbourne imprint Companion, followed by a self-titled, self-released LP in 2023. Since then, they’ve sold out headline shows across the UK, Europe, and Australia, performed at festivals including Wide Awake (UK), Les Nuits Botanique (BE), and Golden Plains (AUS), and shared the stage with artists such as Bar Italia, Tirzah, and Raisa K. Their third album, Blush Response, is due out in September 2025 via London label Scenic Route.\\n\\nIf you have any queries or would like more information about access at Village Underground, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/3EhSLgF, or contact access@villageunderground.co.uk.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"vgtbl.pl - Krasnoludki\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1VCZhmyclVteb6u2vSSzLC\",\"artist\":\"vgtbl.pl\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/8b204eaaca033c66ce5f7432496eef39861408e4?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Krasnoludki\"}],\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"properties\":[],\"date_unix\":1776364200,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1252\",\"name\":\"The George Tavern\",\"address\":\"373 Commercial Rd, London E1 0LA, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.51433609999999,\"lng\":-0.05291299999998955},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.50