\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-05-19/9a09b0e0-9932-4f7c-adfc-2c2570063a66.jpg?rect=0%2C201%2C1536%2C1536\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-05-19/9a09b0e0-9932-4f7c-adfc-2c2570063a66.jpg?rect=0%2C563%2C1536%2C922\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-05-19/9a09b0e0-9932-4f7c-adfc-2c2570063a66.jpg?rect=205%2C0%2C1126%2C2048\"},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"score\":0,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Originally from Bourouba in Algiers, Flenn is a trailblazing Algerian rapper who has established himself as one of the most distinctive voices in Maghreb rap.\\n\\nHis hybrid style, blending egotrip, cloud rap, and social commentary, combines sharp lyricism, modern soundscapes, and artistic boldness.\\n\\nWith standout tracks like ‘Recyclage’, ‘Mchat Liyem’, and ‘WB III’, Flenn marks the next step in a bold and forward-looking career with his recent critically acclaimed COLORS performance, alongside a new album set to drop this summer.\\n\\nThe rising star in the Algerian hip-hop scene heads to London for a rare live performance at The Lower Third.\\n\\n*For accessibility information please see the accessibility information button/link below*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event - physical photo ID required\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Fri 17 Apr\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null}],\"next_page_cursor\":\"\"}",
