d\":false,\"date_unix\":1776531600,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"ebbfe7c73b45a3bb:17\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1320,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-13/307ce8f9-2385-4d55-872c-0aff39847b1b.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-13/307ce8f9-2385-4d55-872c-0aff39847b1b.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-13/307ce8f9-2385-4d55-872c-0aff39847b1b.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"id\":\"68ecec47a98be700012f30d8\",\"name\":\"The Restarts\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Sat 18th April 2026\\n\\nTHE RESTARTS (long-time London punk)\\n\\nhttps://therestarts.bandcamp.com/\\n\\nŚMIERĆ (Polish language dbeat punk from Stockholm, Sweden)\\n\\nhttps://smierc.bandcamp.com/\\n\\nR.U.B (Naarm (Melbourne, Aus) based DIY anarcha punks with a hardcore bite)\\n\\nhttps://rub-punk.bandcamp.com/\\n\\nHAAVAT (Finnish language hardcore punk from Norwich, featuring members of Deviated Instinct, Viha, Agnosy, Revulsion)\\n\\nhttps://haavat.bandcamp.com/album/demo-1-2019\\n\\n@ the New Cross Inn, 323 New Cross Rd, London SE14 6AS.\\n\\n6pm doors, bands on until 11pm.\\n\\n£12 advance tickets // £14 on the door.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ (under 16s require an adult)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-14T13:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-17T16:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-10-15T13:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-18T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-18T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Frustration\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3T0bptz2pUKPzcp2oIKJ4x\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/b8e5d28077de9c136a3169082c54387632d774f3?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Frustration\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"The Restarts - Better Off Dead\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/gb/album/better-off-dead/298343399?i=298343440&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"The Restarts\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Music/v4/30/9c/f1/309cf1d3-7983-bd45-51ee-ab85f39f9140/mzaf_3459301574006422455.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Better Off Dead\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Clapham Grand.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":48280,\"title\":\"What do I do if I have a question about the venue?\",\"body\":\"Check out all FAQs for attending shows on our website, here: https://claphamgrand.com/faqs/\\n\\nFor any further information about the show, timings, age restrictions or general questions please contact Team Grand on info@claphamgrand.com detailing your enquiry and the show/date in question and we’ll be happy to help\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":48281,\"title\":\"I have questions about access, where can I get the information I need?\",\"body\":\"You can see our venue access info here - https://claphamgrand.com/accessibility/\\n\\nIf you require PA tickets or seat reservations for access reasons please contact us **prior** to purchasing your tickets to ensure we have availability and can meet your requirements. The best way to do this is by calling us on 020 7223 6523 or emailing access@claphamgrand.com & including your phone number in the email. Our office hours are 9am-5.30pm Mon – Sat\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":48284,\"title\":\"What can I expect in terms of flashing lights, loud noises and other similar elements?\",\"body\":\"Please note there may be strobes, flashing lights, loud noises, confetti, the occasional balloon drop and other fun stuff used in the venue. If you have any concerns about this don’t hesitate to contact us if you need any further assistance, we want to make sure you have a safe and enjoyable experience with us\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":48282,\"title\":\"I have already purchased my tickets & have questions about the tickets themselves\",\"body\":\"For any ticketing enquiries - for example where to find your tickets or about the Dice app please contact DICE via their Help Desk. If you still have questions after this, please email info@claphamgrand.com\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":48285,\"title\":\"What is 'unallocated' seating?\",\"body\":\"Most of our seated shows have unallocated seating, meaning seating is on a first come, first served basis in the area you have bought a ticket for (eg stalls/circle). We never sell more tickets than there are seats available - so if you've bought a ticket for a seat, you'll definitely get a seat, you just won't have a specific seat reserved.\",\"order\":4}],\"max_tickets\":18,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1061\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"address\":\"The Clapham Grand, 21-25 St John's Hill, London SW11 1TT, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4629923,\"lng\":-0.169368800000029},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-06-05/35fd37f7-73c6-4d16-a3a1-47ab54898234.jpg?rect=359%2C0%2C1334%2C1334\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-clapham-grand-ry8v\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://claphamgrand.com/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-18T18:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"399\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-clapham-grand-zl9b\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1764950400,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T03110a26dd7?dice_id=T03110a26dd7\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a0669984c2fd?dice_id=a0669984c2fd\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/od8e45c158a1?dice_id=od8e45c158a1\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/cb155a88512c?dice_id=cb155a88512c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/tb50cb84bb06?dice_id=tb50cb84bb06\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R8f963fe7cca?dice_id=R8f963fe7cca\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"xe77vk-the-groove-chorus-18th-apr-the-clapham-grand-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":12,\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://claphamgrand.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1705644923004016\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-5134978-1\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1776533400,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"impression_id\":\"ebbfe7c73b45a3bb:18\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":2450},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-05/a4ccda79-bc56-41fe-8c67-6c1734fc2c6e.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-05/a4ccda79-bc56-41fe-8c67-6c1734fc2c6e.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-05/a4ccda79-bc56-41fe-8c67-6c1734fc2c6e.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"id\":\"6932d3f984365100015caa05\",\"name\":\"The Groove Chorus\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**SARUDAY 18TH APRIL / DOORS & BARS OPEN 6:30PM / SHOW STARTS APPROX. 1 HOUR AFTER DOORS / SHOW END 10:00PM**\\n\\nNot your average choir - The Groove Chorus will be turning up the volume once again at The Clapham Grand! Featuring a choir of 100 and a mega 8-piece live band, they'll be bringing their iconic dance anthems with a disco twist, inspired by queer culture from the 80s to today (drenched in double denim of course). See you there! x\\n\\nFor any ticketing enquiries please contact DICE's Help Centre first, or contact info@claphamgrand.com\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"18+\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-05T16:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-18T18:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-05T16:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-18T18:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-18T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by AGMP.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"66\",\"name\":\"The 100 Club\",\"address\":\"100 Oxford St, Fitzrovia, London W1D 1LL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5161551,\"lng\":-0.1353063999999904},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/35e8f238-d827-4132-8534-bc474249d988.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C500%2C500\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-100-club-z997\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.the100club.co.uk/access-info/#:~:text=The%20100%20Club%20is%20an,disabled%20customers%20to%20the%20venue.&text=There%20is%20level%20access%20from,or%20a%20lift%20on%20site.\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-18T18:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1442\",\"name\":\"AGMP\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"agmp-99g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1763596800,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e8407e7658a2?dice_id=e8407e7658a2\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q70578def8ff?dice_id=q70578def8ff\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Mdd4ed59bb2f?dice_id=Mdd4ed59bb2f\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/L948efd066b0?dice_id=L948efd066b0\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Udfe3fb3b663?dice_id=Udfe3fb3b663\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p2d6c1edea66?dice_id=p2d6c1edea66\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"avenex-remembering-gregory-isaacs-18th-apr-the-100-club-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1980,\"name\":\"The 100 Club\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://the100club.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1776533400,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"ebbfe7c73b45a3bb:19\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2750,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-20/56eafcbc-c3f5-45f4-901e-a0a0613bd248.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-20/56eafcbc-c3f5-45f4-901e-a0a0613bd248.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-20/56eafcbc-c3f5-45f4-901e-a0a0613bd248.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"id\":\"691f21b6a595c60001c0251c\",\"name\":\"Remembering Gregory Isaacs\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"REMEMBERING GREGORY ISAACS\\n\\nAn evening celebrating the music and legacy of the \\\"Cool Ruler\\\" with Terrance Wallen & The Material Men.\\n\\n\\\"Gregory Isaacs is the most exquisite vocalist in reggae\\\" The New York Times\\n\\nGregory Isaacs, known as the \\\"Cool Ruler\\\", was one of Jamaica's most iconic reggae artists, blending smooth vocals with heartfelt lyrics. Born in 1951, Isaacs rose to prominence in the 1970s, pioneering the lovers rock subgenre with hits like Night Nurse, My Only Lover, and Love Is Overdue. His signature crooning style and deep, emotional storytelling made him a global reggae sensation, influencing generations of artists.\\n\\nBeyond love songs, Isaacs also voiced social struggles in tracks like Slave Master and Border, reflecting the hardships of his time. With over 500 albums recorded, his prolific output solidified his legacy as one of reggae's greatest vocalists. The impact of Gregory Isaac's music on reggae is undeniable, with his silky, melancholic voice continuing to inspire new audiences even after his passing in 2010.\\n\\nTerrance Wallen & the Material Men, under the direction of Ciyo 'Guitar' Brown will perform hits and fan favourites from the extensive Gregory Isaacs back catalogue.\\n\\nAn AGMP Concerts presentation.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-20T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-17T00:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-20T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-18T18:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-18T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"ANU\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebf1710e285b5675e019e06db5\"},\"artist_id\":\"132292\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by DHP FAMILY.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3\",\"name\":\"The Garage (London)\",\"address\":\"20-22 Highbury Cres, London N5 1RD\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5467588,\"lng\":-0.103