re completely free for young artists to use. When you attend a show in EartH Theatre, head to the back of the space to rent a cushion for just £2. Not only will you get to sit more comfortably, but all proceeds go towards funding Studio 36. Find out more here: https://earthackney.co.uk/about/studio-36/\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-10T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-18T21:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-13T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-18T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-18T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"I'm A Girl You Can Hold IRL\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4AdqGV9WJmIKybuqZWCzhi\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/53180bfe74909606c67247f80e94eaaceb3f6478?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"I'm A Girl You Can Hold IRL\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"YĪN YĪN\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb79dd59c6c4d3ef58b867a796\"},\"artist_id\":\"19390\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":{\"description\":\"At EartH, we want our space to give back to the community. That’s why we teamed up with Progression Sessions to open Studio 36 inside our venue. Studio 36 provides music making facilities and expertise for free to young musicians in London who face a variety of barriers that might prevent them from making the most of their creativity and talent. Every donation helps keep Studio 36 open and accessible, so that more young people can find their voice, develop their talents and feel supported as they take their next steps.\\n\\nA percentage of your donation goes towards a payment processing fee (DICE keeps none of this fee). For a £10 donation, the charity gets £9.75.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-28/af5fb538-b9c7-4f41-bf11-48d1d9d6d45a.jpeg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"variants\":[{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":100,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTA4MTM1MiwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTA3ODY0LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1ODoxNS41NDg4ODVaIiwicHJpY2UiOjEwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MjQ4NSwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MzAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":300,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTA4MTM1MiwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTA3ODY0LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1ODoxNS41NDg5MTBaIiwicHJpY2UiOjMwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MjQ4NiwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6NTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":500,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTA4MTM1MiwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTA3ODY0LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1ODoxNS41NDg5MjBaIiwicHJpY2UiOjUwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MjQ4NywicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwMCwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsfQ==\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1000,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTA4MTM1MiwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTA3ODY0LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1ODoxNS41NDg5MzBaIiwicHJpY2UiOjEwMDAsInZhcmlhbnRfaWQiOjI0ODgsInByb21