dges the gap between classic house energy and a deep, driving soul, British producer and multi-instrumentalist RULES brings his uncompromising vision to one of London’s most historic dancefloors.\\n\\nIf you have any queries or would like more information about access at Village Underground, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/3EhSLgF, or contact access@villageunderground.co.uk.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is 18+ event. Valid ID required. \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-27T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-18T20:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-30T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-18T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-18T21:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Rules - Could Have Been So Good\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4QOi1ZUOxZzDXvKn7nm0Ro\",\"artist\":\"Rules\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/e7e9b6d335196c530596606b76d7c1b7216e7d53?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Could Have Been So Good\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Sugar horse\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"30097\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Black Heart.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"98\",\"name\":\"The Black Heart\",\"address\":\"2-3 Greenland Pl, London NW1 0AP\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5387812,\"lng\":-0.141761200000019},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-11-28/68