as\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-19/15b42c49-6904-443a-986a-e3ea684e12fb.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2000%2C2000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-19/15b42c49-6904-443a-986a-e3ea684e12fb.jpg?rect=0%2C400%2C2000%2C1200\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-19/15b42c49-6904-443a-986a-e3ea684e12fb.jpg?rect=450%2C0%2C1100%2C2000\"},\"id\":\"691dec95163bcb00013a17de\",\"name\":\"Big Narstie\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"*“He’s the Grime MC, agony-uncle, and online personality that speaks for a generation” – **Crack Magazine***\\n\\nUndoubtedly a fully fledged TV and entertainment star now thanks to his BAFTA, double RTS Award, Edinburgh TV Festival and National Reality TV Award winning ,The Big Narstie Show,(Channel 4).\\n\\nIt is sometimes forgotten that Big Narstie came up during the first wave of Grime and UK Hip Hop in the early 2000s. Chart topping collaborations with Craig David, Ed Sheeran, Donae'O, Papoose and Kurupt FM are the tip of the iceberg.\\n\\n*“Big Narstie is an enigma; a force of nature that cannot be stopped.” – **Manchester Evening News***\\n\\n**WITH SPECIAL GUEST CHE3KZ**\\n\\n**From supporting JLS on a UK-wide arena tour as part of her former group VIDA, to performing alongside Ed Sheeran, Ghettz and Omarion, and working with countless young people across the UK - Che3kz is Manchester's latest export. The Manc MC is making waves across the UK scene right now**\\n\\nSUPPORT FROM\\n\\nCourtney Courtney\\n\\nRue Lansky\\n\\nNaughty North twins\\n\\n**THIS IS A STANDING SHOW**\\n\\n**16+ all U18s must be accompanied by a full paying adult**\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. All U18s must be accompanied by an adult.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"