thers.\\n\\nDo not miss this chance to catch one of the finest musicians of all time as part of the Ace Records 50th Anniversary Concerts Series.\\n\\nAn AGMP Concerts presentation.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-05-07T00:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-18T09:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-05-07T00:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-18T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-18T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"The Bronx\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1ENGe5j5pdmz1YKiW6NhK9\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/e6b0b00ae25143e539a3388c3fbe3753d927b92c?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"The Bronx\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Scruff of the Neck.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"54\",\"name\":\"The Victoria\",\"address\":\"451 Queensbridge Road, London E8 3AS\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5457498,\"lng\":-0.0701916000000438},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-victoria-j5wd\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"202