jamieson-21st-apr-folklore-hoxton-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1776794400,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"ebbfe7c73b45a3bb:66\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1000,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-15/bfe2df26-6228-4803-bb95-e9f52b7e2c99.jpg?rect=0%2C19%2C1240%2C1240\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-15/bfe2df26-6228-4803-bb95-e9f52b7e2c99.jpg?rect=0%2C502%2C1240%2C744\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-15/bfe2df26-6228-4803-bb95-e9f52b7e2c99.jpg?rect=140%2C0%2C961%2C1748\"},\"id\":\"69919e04de45d900011cff54\",\"name\":\"OK DOOMER - SOPHIE JAMIESON \",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"OK Doomer is the alternative project of South London songwriter Lou Doyle. Alt-indie, dark synth-folk and orchestral arrangements converge on forthcoming debut record For My Old Great Satan.\\n\\nokdoomer.bandcamp.com\\n\\nSophie Jamieson doesn’t shy away from discomfort, or life’s ugly truths. The subjects of her songwriting are put to unflinching examination, often revealing aspects of the human character that most would rather turn away from. Need, desperation and anger simmer through her songs, but are balanced by an unsentimental acceptance of life’s painful contradictions. All of this is carried by a deep, raw voice which pivots from wobbling vulnerability to soaring, pent-up longing unleashed.\\n\\nhttps://linktr.ee/sophiejamiesonmusic?utm_source=ig&utm_medium=social&utm_content=link_in_bio&fbclid=PAZXh0bgNhZW0CMTEAc3J0YwZhcHBfaWQMMjU2MjgxMDQwNTU4AAGnnzReDZ-02spfObJouKlyruKSs1dRHcwof5QSC6-QvFFP8Slisfvo9BQU5pM_aem_pt0DyGOw8p8aWlhHyGhVKQ\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-17T12:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-21T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-17T13:30:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-21T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-21T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Sophie Jamieson - Take\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5h1ZpUPjOEZpFgOSxDmmPk\",\"artist\":\"Sophie Jamieson\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/7ac29160572edc7df8cb24acacab6b0313ed8285\",\"track_name\":\"Take\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by NT's Loft.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"2691\",\"name\":\"Night Tales Loft\",\"address\":\"207, 1 Westgate St, London E8 3RL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.53753889999999,\"lng\":-0.05786670000000001},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-03-28/9ded5223-ee50-49da-9cc8-dfb16fb11e4e.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1317%2C1317\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"night-tales-loft-39wp\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-21T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2368\",\"name\":\"Night Tales Loft\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-03-28/6e6ef849-1334-49eb-a7bd-a888e14902a0.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"night-tales-loft-dvlq\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1759226400,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/dab46e40575b?dice_id=dab46e40575b\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Jd72126670cd?dice_id=Jd72126670cd\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Jd39c809285a?dice_id=Jd39c809285a\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/d61c1f27c5d4?dice_id=d61c1f27c5d4\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p178a2a9e8ba?dice_id=p178a2a9e8ba\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e31d3af47648?dice_id=e31d3af47648\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"nv9gol--playback-olivia-dean-candlelit-sessions-21st-apr-night-tales-loft-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1827,\"name\":\"Night Tales Loft\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://static1.squarespace.com/static/62502cbe020d59057d88d958/t/62bb7163377da00692cca3bd/1656451427778/BACKGROUND%2BCLUBS%2BLIMITED%2BPRIVACY%2BAND%2BCOOKIES%2BSTATEMENT.pdf\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1020185540161660\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1776794400,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"ebbfe7c73b45a3bb:67\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1185,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/133a1314-7ee9-41d2-b97f-27044f745d9b.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1500%2C1500\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/133a1314-7ee9-41d2-b97f-27044f745d9b.jpg?rect=0%2C300%2C1500%2C900\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/133a1314-7ee9-41d2-b97f-27044f745d9b.jpg?rect=338%2C0%2C825%2C1500\"},\"id\":\"698c83ac8e03fb0001421340\",\"name\":\" Playback: Olivia Dean [Candlelit Sessions]\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Presented by Johnnie Walker Black Label × NT’s Loft\\n\\nOn Tuesday 21st of April, we turn our focus to Olivia Dean for a soulful, heartfelt journey through one of the UK’s most captivating new voices. From the warmth of Growth, to the breakout brilliance of Messy and the intimate storytelling woven through her most beloved singles, this session explores the vulnerability and emotional clarity that defines her sound. Blending neo-soul, pop and jazz influences, Olivia Dean’s music captures the beauty of becoming: Tender, self-assured and deeply human.\\n\\nPlayback returns as a candlelit listening experience where over 200 candles transform NT’s Loft into a glowing sanctuary. Designed to slow the pace, each session invites guests to disconnect from the noise and fully immerse themselves in the music shaping global culture.\\n\\nExperience every harmony, lyric and subtle groove through the warmth and precision of Funktion-One sound, in an intimate, candlelit setting.\\n\\nJohnnie Walker Black Label returns to elevate the evening, with signature serves available throughout the night. Guests arriving before 8pm will receive a complimentary drink to begin the evening in style (Limited to First 50 Customers).\\n\\nTickets\\n\\nReserved seating ticket holders must arrive by 8:00 PM. Seating is first come, first served.\\n\\n—\\n\\nSchedule\\n\\n7:00 PM – Doors & Playlist\\n\\n8:15 PM – Listening Session Begins (90 mins)\\n\\nLimited capacity. Arrive early, stay late.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event. Bring your ID card with you. ID Scanner in place. \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-09-30T11:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-21T19:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-09-30T11:30:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-21T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-21T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Orlando\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb76868988e747412827d40fb5\"},\"artist_id\":\"18001\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Communion ONE\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"7609\",\"name\":\"The Lower Third\",\"address\":\"26 Denmark St, London WC2H 8NJ, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5154881,\"lng\":-0.1291489},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-02/07187d0d-81c0-4ec9-96b2-d5998bd884b9.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C3600%2C3600\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-lower-third-pply\",\"accessibil