-2026-21st-apr-the-courtyard-theatre-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":25,\"name\":\"The Courtyard Theatre\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"http://www.thecourtyard.org.uk/content/16/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1776801600,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"ebbfe7c73b45a3bb:75\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":4520,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/6b909d4f-2533-42e4-b10a-b3db568524f6.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/6b909d4f-2533-42e4-b10a-b3db568524f6.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/6b909d4f-2533-42e4-b10a-b3db568524f6.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"id\":\"69713700c8724b0001c2265c\",\"name\":\"Cardellino - London - Europe Tour 2026\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**ESPAÑOL**\\n\\nDe Uruguay para el mundo, Cardellino se presenta como una fuerza creativa única: multiinstrumentista, productor y compositor que fusiona R&B urbano, soul y pop latino con una sensibilidad poética que se siente desde la primera nota. Lanzó su proyecto solista en 2018, construyendo un repertorio que va de lo íntimo a lo vibrante, combinando melodías pegadizas con letras que cuentan historias. Con su mixtape homónimo y colaboraciones internacionales, Cardellino se consolida hoy como una promesa que trasciende fronteras — y este concierto es la invitación perfecta para descubrirlo en vivo.\\n\\n**ENGLISH**\\n\\nFrom Uruguay to the world, Cardellino emerges as a unique creative force: a multi-instrumentalist, producer, and songwriter who blends urban R&B, soul, and Latin pop with a poetic sensitivity felt from the very first note. He launched his solo project in 2018, crafting a repertoire that moves from intimate to vibrant, combining catchy melodies with storytelling lyrics. With his self-titled mixtape and international collaborations, Cardellino stands today as a border-crossing promise — and this concert is your invitation to experience him live.\\n\\nEN: This event is 16+. Attendees under 16 must be accompanied by an adult over 21, who must present a valid photo ID. ES:Este evento es 16+. Los menores de 16 años deberán ingresar acompañados por un adulto mayor de 21 años, quien deberá presentar identificación oficial con foto.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-22T11:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-21T21:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-22T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-21T21:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-21T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"CURSI\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6JVkXfcIkaulb6CP2pyYsG\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/48b7de63cde81dceacaf9dca34bc9104d2dddf78?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"CURSI\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Tue 21 Apr\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"ev