reviously played the venue. Use the #supportthesupports through socials when you discover a new favourite act at Islington Assembly Hall.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":57461,\"title\":\"Age Restricition\",\"body\":\"This is a 14+ event – 14 and 15 year olds must be accompained by an adult. You may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"order\":3}],\"max_tickets\":8,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"34\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"address\":\"Upper Street, London N1 2UD\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5395894,\"lng\":-0.102482699999996},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-02-10/05562e9c-c684-4beb-b818-4e908bbfb14d.jpg?rect=712%2C0%2C2832%2C2832\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-z8e2\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/about/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-22T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1607\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-78g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1768298400,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/j46c1129bad5?dice_id=j46c1129bad5\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c2102e4d36d4?dice_id=c2102e4d36d4\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/lbc72a0832c6?dice_id=lbc72a0832c6\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Le80