/f2bcadbc-c6f6-426e-93bb-4cca55811e69.jpg?rect=0%2C792%2C3957%2C2374\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/f2bcadbc-c6f6-426e-93bb-4cca55811e69.jpg?rect=891%2C0%2C2176%2C3957\"},\"id\":\"698dc5ff8bd4eb0001a404c3\",\"name\":\"Orlando\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Orlando’s deeply emotional songs speak straight to the heart. His heartfelt, emotionally astute lyrics cut to the core, while his atmospheric, lo-fi piano playing captures the raw ache of heartbreak. With a rare ability to turn personal moments into universal anthems, Orlando — the piano-playing boy next door — is emerging as a voice for a new generation navigating the highs and lows of love. Intimate, honest and quietly powerful, his music offers comfort, connection and catharsis in equal measure.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-12T15:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-22T19:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-13T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-22T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-22T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Orlando - are you still in love with me?\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2HJPxIJ9OiE0w23CsmDfLr\",\"artist\":\"Orlando\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/7aa784fc657aca04dcc828961b1b9dbabd7ca933?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"are you still in love with me?\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Orlando - are you still in love with me?\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/are-you-still-in-love-with-me/1768448152?i=1768448160&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Orlando\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/30/9b/f4/309bf44a-0967-058d-ec80-533aacb76655/mzaf_8894866628393385500.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"are you still in love with me?\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Zak Abel\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebf30f0f0e7f93877befa196af\"},\"artist_id\":\"1750\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"The raspy voice of London’s Zak Abel has made him one of the most in-demand collaborators among headline electronic producers including Kaytranda, Tom Misch and Kygo. Merging smooth R&B and catchy pop hooks on his 2017 debut Only When We’re Naked, as a songwriter Abel has written love songs for the likes of John Legend and Paloma Faith – the latter of whom he supported on tour in 2022. Live, his soul-stirring vocals have taken centre stage at his shows at KOKO and Electric Brixton.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Communion ONE.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"15328\",\"name\":\"ONE NINETYFOUR\",\"address\":\"194 Piccadilly, London W1J 9LN\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.50882030237029,\"lng\":-0.13754808887345502},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"one-ninetyfour-k6xn9\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-22T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id