n stage, he anchors himself behind the mic, broad-shouldered and wide-eyed whilst telling stories. Song histories, personal anecdotes, or just random thoughts and funny observations are blurted out with erratic but effortless charm. His smile is so sunny and wide it feels permanent, and his laugh is hoarse, warm, and totally infectious. When he speaks his eyes glisten, but when he sings, they close as his head lulls onto his shoulder and tilts back. For Aaron, singing and playing guitar is not a choice, it’s an extension of himself — he has to do it. You can tell as soon as he begins it offers him not only freedom, but focus.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1768903200,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Aaron Rowe\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-05/34329fc9-8d3e-4666-a1cf-29f209e72882.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"125380\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/82118cff-bc25-42c8-986d-fb90a3110054.jpg?rect=0%2C1356%2C6192%2C6192\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/82118cff-bc25-42c8-986d-fb90a3110054.jpg?rect=0%2C2271%2C6192%2C3715\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/82118cff-bc25-42c8-986d-fb90a3110054.jpg?rect=826%2C0%2C4541%2C8256\"},\"offers_extras\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"id\":\"696e70655f4dec00012b4c75\",\"name\":\"Aaron Rowe\",\"new\":false,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-20T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-23T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-23T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-23T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-23T22:30