t, **Nissi Ogulu** has become **a symbol of African excellence**. Her musical journey, highlighted by the acclaimed EP ***Ignite*** and the expansive 2023 project ***Unboxed***, showcases a rich sound defined by thought-provoking storytelling and global appeal.\\n\\nWhether through her soulful vocals or her commitment to cultural transformation, Nissi captures a unique sonic identity that transcends boundaries.\\n\\nThis performance offers a rare opportunity to witness one of Africa’s most compelling and multi-faceted voices in an intimate setting.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1768485600,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Nissi\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebe56d982528a809e9ac6ef188\"},\"artist_id\":\"132351\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-13/d8aed27f-3920-44c7-a1a3-bc8de7767135.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C4160%2C4160\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-13/d8aed27f-3920-44c7-a1a3-bc8de7767135.jpg?rect=0%2C832%2C4160%2C2496\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-13/d8aed27f-3920-44c7-a1a3-bc8de7767135.jpg?rect=936%2C0%2C2288%2C4160\"},\"offers_extras\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"id\":\"6966783bba3b420001147cdb\",\"name\":\"Nissi\",\"new\":false,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-15T14:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-23T19:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-19T14:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-23T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-23T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"perm_name\":\"92wp9n-nissi-23rd-apr-the-jazz-cafe-lond