music.apple.com/us/album/toxic-radio-edit/1690341460?i=1690341609&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"SINN6R\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview116/v4/0d/93/7f/0d937f82-4191-fb1a-712c-152ac812bd37/mzaf_18034594824876528496.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Toxic (Radio Edit)\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":64674,\"title\":\"What are the ages restrictions for this event?\",\"body\":\"This is a 16+ event. All attendees 16-17s must be accompanied by a responsible adult who is 18 or older (1:1 ratio). To verify age, ID may be requested. We advise all customers to bring valid ID. For further information, see Age and ID in FAQs. Right of admission reserved.\",\"order\":0}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Go to beat. \",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"11564\",\"name\":\"EartH\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"earth-yxox\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1776970800,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"unicorn\":true,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1955\",\"name\":\"EartH\",\"address\":\"11 Stoke Newington Rd, London N16 8BH, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5509892,\"lng\":-0.07532500000002074},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-02-02/92037b31-0756-4c73-9f1b-11e5c4753296.jpg?rect=683%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"earth-76a7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://bit.ly/44dzl75\"},\"highlights\":[],\"profile_active\":true,\"space_name\":\"EartH Hall\",\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-23T20:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":863,\"name\":\"EartH\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://earthackney.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"498772217287544\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-6QJEY8LKG2\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":\"781332317\",\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":\"nxkPCNyPg5caEN3eyPQC\",\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"impression_id\":\"ab902a79f4685193:42\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"This event will take place in EartH Hall.\\n\\nFollowing his sold-out show at Village Underground in August and the release of his new project FEDERAL, SINN6R returns to London for a major headline performance at EartH on April 23rd.\\n\\nFor more information on access at EartH, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/44dzl75 or contact us at access@earthackney.co.uk\\n\\nEartH is a social enterprise committed to supporting new musicians, with music studios in the venue that are completely free for young artists in Hackney to use. Find out more here (https://earthackney.co.uk/about/studio-36/).\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1765980000,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":{\"description\":\"At EartH, we want our space to give back to the community. That’s why we teamed up with Progression Sessions to open Studio 36 inside our venue. Studio 36 provides music making facilities and expertise for free to young musicians in London who face a variety of barriers that might prevent them from making the most of their creativity and talent. \\n\\nEvery donation helps keep Studio 36 open and accessible, so that more young people can find their voice, develop their talents and feel supported as they take their next steps.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-28/af5fb538-b9c7-4f41-bf11-48d1d9d6d45a.jpeg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"variants\":[{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":100,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE1Mjc5MSwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTM2NjM5LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1OTo1Mi43NTI3MzRaIiwicHJpY2UiOjEwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MzExMiwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MzAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":300,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE1Mjc5MSwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTM2NjM5LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1OTo1Mi43NTI3NThaIiwicHJpY2UiOjMwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MzExMywicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6NTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":500,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE1Mjc5MSwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTM2NjM5LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1OTo1Mi43NTI3NjhaIiwicHJpY2UiOjUwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MzExNCwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwMCwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsfQ==\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1000,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE1Mjc5MSwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTM2NjM5LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1OTo1Mi43NTI3NzdaIiwicHJpY2UiOjEwMDAsInZhcmlhbnRfaWQiOjMxMTUsInByb21vdGlvbl9pZCI6bnVsbCwicHJvZHVjdF9ncm91cF90eXBlIjoiZG9uYXRpb25zIn0=\"}],\"char