GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"fox-and-firkin-8ev7w\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"highlights\":[],\"profile_active\":true,\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-24T20:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1496,\"name\":\"Como No\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.comono.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1012760396803642\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"secondary_status\":null,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"impression_id\":\"ab902a79f4685193:71\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Mesmerizing and exuberant Argentinian LA YEGROS is back with her new live show, ready to make you dance once again!\\n\\nThe undisputed Queen of Nu Cumbia has not rested on her laurels. Known worldwide for hits like Viene de Mi and Chicha Roja, and for her high-voltage live performances, she blends cumbia, chamamé, and carnavalito with reggae, ska, and cutting-edge electronic sounds — creating a vibrant fusion of contemporary global music.\\n\\nHer new live show, LA YEGROS – Electro Trío, offers a fresh, modern and vibrant reinterpretation of her music, enlivened by the bass of dancehall and the electronic sounds of Buenos Aires club nights. In this powerful trio format — percussion, synth/sampler and lead vocals — she delivers the same explosive energy and contagious joy that have made her live shows famous all over the world, from Buenos Aires to Paris, Berlin, London.\\n\\nTicket includes entrance to the club night right after the show:\\n\\n¡Cumbia, Mi Amor! — Club Night, 10:30pm