t sunshine energy, open-air grooves and plenty of twists along the way.\\n\\nThink deep digging, long blends and an easy, feel-good flow that only thrives when the day stretches out.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1768953600,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"KIROLLUS\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-04-09/98ee6b1d-0ed8-46c2-899f-079384a65dce.jpg?rect=1%2C0%2C299%2C299\"},\"artist_id\":\"66716\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/8046506a-fd50-4b21-8092-3ca9b88d9585.jpg?rect=0%2C342%2C1364%2C1364\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/8046506a-fd50-4b21-8092-3ca9b88d9585.jpg?rect=0%2C615%2C1364%2C818\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/8046506a-fd50-4b21-8092-3ca9b88d9585.jpg?rect=119%2C0%2C1126%2C2048\"},\"offers_extras\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"id\":\"6971186ea59d0f0001e3c10e\",\"name\":\"Club Tales: Kirollus & Friends\",\"new\":false,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-21T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-26T04:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-26T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-25T13:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-26T04:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"perm_name\":\"xe263l-club-tales-kirollus-friends-25th-apr-the-cause-at-60-dock-road-london-tickets\",\"score\":0,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1320,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Fde7e5514d8d?dice_id=Fde7e5514d8d\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z06e2464b578?dice_id=z06e2464b578\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s8aefd37e687?dice_id=s8aefd37e687\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a9e4c78282c9?dice_id=a9e4c78282c9\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A8b422bde283?dice_id=A8b422bde283\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ybcf852ca72c?dice_id=ybcf852ca72c\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Kings & Bears - 2 3 4 5\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/2-3-4-5/1633847442?i=1633847444&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Kings & Bears\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview122/v4/75/73/71/7573712d-2737-24ef-b49f-22891f1dabc5/mzaf_14564837976943686484.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"2 3 4 5\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Kings & Bears - 2 3 4 5\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/7wiOTsNR5caGcld0tDqPLR\",\"artist\":\"Kings & Bears\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/5e7fb2a06fe72a0c1c6997486efaa2bb619ac7b4?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"2 3 4 5\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Black Frog\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"4307\",\"name\":\"Hot Box Live Community Interest \",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-live-community-interest-7v77\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1777118400,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"unicorn\":true,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3785\",\"name\":\"Hot Box\",\"address\":\"28 Viaduct Rd, Chelmsford CM1 1TS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.7359952,\"lng\":0.4672127},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-06-29/9ff0c867-708b-4d5c-834d-a927e4e4ae83.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"5eb9799ae1727402966007e1\",\"name\":\"Chelmsford\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.736717,\"lng\":0.466083,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-r7wq\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.hotboxlive.co.uk/accessibility\"},\"highlights\":[],\"profile_active\":true,\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-25T13:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"impression_id\":\"ab902a79f4685193:77\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Welcome to the vibrant, genre-bending world of Kings & Bears, a groove rock trio tearing down musical boundaries with a bold blend of rock, funk, reggae, and soul. Born from a shared belief in the unifying power of music and love, this powerhouse trio has evolved into a dynamic live force, thrilling audiences with a sound that’s both fiercely fresh and steeped in the spirit of the greats.\\n\\nFuelled by an ever-growing community of passionate fans, many of whom helped crowdfund their debut EP, Kings & Bears have turned grassroots momentum into real movement. Their electrifying live shows are part celebration, part spiritual jam session: euphoric, unrelenting, and deeply human. Every gig is an invitation to let loose, connect, and feel everything.\\n\\nSince their inception, the band has carved out a unique sonic identity, balancing swagger and soul, chaos and control. Their growing discography includes an array of genre-hopping singles and a live album pulsing with raw energy. Endorsed by BBC Introducing and featured on Radio 1, Radio 6, Kerrang! (handpicked by SKINDRED’s Benji Webbe), and Planet Rock, Kings & Bears are no strangers to national airplay – or to sharing stages with heavyweights like Gentleman’s Dub Club, Neville Staple, Dub Pistols, and KOG.\\n\\nKings & Bears aren’t just a band, they’re a collective heartbeat. A groove-laden rallying cry for joy, rebellion, and unity.\\n\\n***Sponsored by Last Piastre Records.***\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1764547200,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-01/0b4572fc-0178-4f59-a064-7edbd72bcc6d.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-01/0b4572fc-0178-4f59-a064-7edbd72bcc6d.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-01/0b4572fc-0178-4f59-a064-7edbd72bcc6d.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"offers_extras\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"id\":\"692dc7204c69ef000192029c\",\"name\":\"Kings & Bears\",\"new\":false,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-01T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-25T14:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-01T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-25T13:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-25T17:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"perm_name\":\"g5kera-kings-bears-25th-apr-hot-box-chelmsford-tickets\",\"score\":0,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":7082,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"max_tickets\":12,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z222a2e164a5?dice_id=Z222a2e164a5\",\"post_co