,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"signature-brew-haggerston-l3yw\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.signaturebrew.co.uk/pages/signature-brews-frequently-asked-questions-faqs\"},\"highlights\":[],\"profile_active\":true,\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-25T18:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"impression_id\":\"ab902a79f4685193:82\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"THE CYNZ, STUPIDITY, YOBS, RAGE DC | Signature Brew Haggerston\\n\\nMega stoked to announce CBGB'S Punk Rock n Roll from THE CYNZ ( U.S.A).\\n\\nFull- throttle band formed around the songwriting talents of Cyndi Dawson and Henry Seiz. Playing tracks that span their career and also the new l.p ' Confess'. Beautifully composed and arranged songs performed with passion and precision. The closest you will get to those heady days of 1970's New York.\\n\\nSTUPIDITY. From Stockholm,Sweden, this band play catchy Garage Rock with added Soul! Expect a fun,lively show.\\n\\nYOBS. Emerging from the rubble of Liverpool bands Weird Sex and Ohmns, they play hard- edged primitive ' Yob Rock ' with fuzze.Anarchic and full - fat tunes and performance guaranteed!\\n\\nRAGE DC.Anthemic Punk Rock that will have you singing along. You won't be able to help it!\\n\\nSaturday 25th April 2026 / Doors 6pm\\n\\nSignature Brew Haggerston\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1771002000,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"The Cynz \",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-07-27/cf1f5985-be97-458f-b3e7-9b5