n_id\":\"ab902a79f4685193:84\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Citizen Live and TIJ Events are thrilled to partner with Dingwalls to present the very first edition of **LONDRA FESTIVAL**, bringing the best of the Italian Alternative Rock scene to London. The festival will feature some of the most exciting and influential artists in the genre.\\n\\nThe festival takes place on **April 25th & 26th, 2026 at Dingwalls**, Camden.\\n\\n**DAY 1 – 25th April**\\n\\nZen Circus\\n\\nDente\\n\\nLamante\\n\\nAftershow with limited availability for Super Fan ticket buyers only\\n\\n**DAY 2 – 26th April**\\n\\nMinistri\\n\\nMeganoidi\\n\\nManagement del dolore post-operatorio\\n\\nAftershow with limited availability for Super Fan ticket buyers only\\n\\nSuperFan ticket holders get exclusive access to the aftershow at Dingwalls 2 (former Canal Bar, entrance next to the main clockroom).\\\\*\\\\*\\\\*\\n\\nGet ready for two unforgettable nights of Italian alternative rock in the heart of London!\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1768482000,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Lamante\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-08-30/3e4f13be-3ebe-4fd3-84fe-9dff64731d55.jpg?rect=0%2C155%2C1667%2C1667\"},\"artist_id\":\"107030\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Dente\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-02-20/b6bd5919-ca2d-4326-b98f-9508a67f7175.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1500%2C1500\"},\"artist_id\":\"21347\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"The Zen Circus\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-01-04/75d224d3-6e32-438c-be5b-e20ee2baadd1.jpg?rect=0%2C135%2C1080%2C1080\"},\"artist_id\":\"26841\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":5},\"images