om on Saturday 25th April 2026, performing their timeless hits and celebrating three decades of nostalgic R&B classics \\\"Steelo, Get it Together, You Don't Know\\\" just to name a few. Come and join them and experience their incredible story of loss and resilience through adversity. Get together with 702 on this exclusive night and one not to be missed!\\n\\nThis one’s for the day-ones, the real R&B heads, and everyone who loves those classic harmonies and unforgettable energy.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1763568000,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"702\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"86521\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-19/49691bd1-0415-4c6c-b7ec-9007086ddec1.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C768%2C768\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-19/49691bd1-0415-4c6c-b7ec-9007086ddec1.jpg?rect=0%2C154%2C768%2C461\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-19/49691bd1-0415-4c6c-b7ec-9007086ddec1.jpg?rect=173%2C0%2C422%2C768\"},\"offers_extras\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"id\":\"691f0bba0e05030001fda8b4\",\"name\":\"702\",\"new\":false,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-19T16:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-25T23:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-21T16:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-25T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-25T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"perm_name\":\"ave6k2-702-25th-apr-acres-london-tickets\",\"score\":0,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"seats_io_event_