n\",\"body\":\"The accessible area for this show is full, and all the free personal assistant tickets have been assigned. We will not be able to accommodate any more requests. We apologise for any inconvenience this may cause.\\n\\nhttps://support.dice.fm/article/179-accessibilty-tickets-for-islington-assembly-hall\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":31976,\"title\":\"Stage Times \",\"body\":\"Stage times are posted at 11am on the day of the show on our venue website.\",\"order\":1}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-29/9ae64b16-166d-4940-86ae-3cfe553293f3.jpg?rect=0%2C38%2C1079%2C1079\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-29/9ae64b16-166d-4940-86ae-3cfe553293f3.jpg?rect=0%2C254%2C1079%2C647\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-29/9ae64b16-166d-4940-86ae-3cfe553293f3.jpg?rect=222%2C0%2C635%2C1154\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1756717200,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/legal-information/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"679202632593023\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-980124-39\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"*Puressence are a band that marry the presence and attitude of the Roses to a darkly haunting and molten guitar rock that last hit the heights during the era of Joy Division and Echo & The Bunnymen. James Mudriczki, Kevin Matthews, Lowell Killen and Anthony Szuminski have had more than their share of diehard fans, especially within Manchester and Greece, where they play to the masses. Among their countless accolades and success of headlines, Puressence have supported the likes of Depeche Mode, Iggy Pop and James throughout accomplished tours.*\\n\\n*The Manchester quintet put emotion at the forefront of all they do, from the fragile to the euphoric. This emotion is echoed through the support and commitment of their unwavering fans, making their live experience an incomparable one.*\\n\\n*35 years on since Puressence formed in North Manchester, they continue to refine, expand and craft their skill.*\\n\\n*By purchasing a ticket to this event you are agreeing to adhere to Islington Assembly Hall's terms and conditions: https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/customer-terms-conditions-2022/*\\n\\n*All tickets to shows at Islington Assembly Hall are subject to a Venue Levy of £1.50 + VAT. As a Grade II listed building, this levy will be reinvested into Islington Assembly Hall and its services, meaning the customer experience can continue to be enhanced.*\\n\\nThis is a 16+ event – you may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by SJM Concerts\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:0\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/B1328215740f?dice_id=B1328215740f\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Bb4a9296b011?dice_id=Bb4a9296b011\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/dfdf884ddfef?dice_id=dfdf884ddfef\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/yf39cf6f080c?dice_id=yf39cf6f080c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q7c3774f557e?dice_id=q7c3774f557e\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/wbaaf7f7314b?dice_id=wbaaf7f7314b\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-09-01T10:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-25T21:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-09-05T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-25T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-25T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":4339},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1607\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-78g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"68b157ba3b5ba40001e4eb43\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Puressence\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"perm_name\":\"wwgnmr-puressence-25th-apr-islington-assembly-hall-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1777140000,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"10\",\"name\":\"The Shacklewell Arms\",\"address\":\"71 Shacklewell Lane, London E8 2EB\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5531551,\"lng\":-0.0699228999999377},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-shacklewell-arms-z82z\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.shacklewellarms.com/info\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-25T19:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Sick Thoughts\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab67616d0000b2730ad9470c506574d11e017659\"},\"artist_id\":\"55422\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Sick Thoughts is the music project of Drew Owen, a multi-instrumentalist who began releasing music under the name as a teenager in Baltimore. From the outset, Sick Thoughts became known for its raw intensity and prolific output, blending feral garage punk energy with a clear reverence for classic KBD-era sounds. All recordings, performed, recorded, and mixed by Owen himself, Now based in New Orleans, Drew has continued to refine Sick Thoughts without sacrificing the chaos and urgency that defined its early years. His songwriting has evolved to embrace sharper melodies and tighter arrangements, all while remaining unfiltered and aggressive. The live band has toured extensively across the U.S. and Europe, known for explosive, high-energy performances that leave no doubt about the project’s staying power.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-16/3a34babd-1fd6-410f-afbd-da49f9c92a71.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-16/3a34babd-1fd6-410f-afbd-da49f9c92a71.jpg?rect=0%2C273%2C1365%2C819\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-16/3a34babd-1fd6-410f-afbd-da49f9c92a71.jpg?rect=307%2C0%2C751%2C1365\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Sick Thoughts - Me And My Guitar\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6f5uiZfiyn2kVs2runFwm3\",\"artist\":\"Sick Thoughts\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/4513e758ec616a4e7311d97b642a880579757420?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Me And My Guitar\"},{\"type