c, be part of a diverse community and enjoy the iconic location of Brick Lane: Village Underground, Rich Mix, Rough Trade East, Ninety One Living Room, Cafe 1001, 93 Feet East, Juju's Bar & Stage, Brick Lane Tap Room + MORE TBA\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Brick Lane Jazz Fest\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:19\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ia989a29174d?dice_id=ia989a29174d\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/sffd79ddcb89?dice_id=sffd79ddcb89\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o1952030b111?dice_id=o1952030b111\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/haab34acc103?dice_id=haab34acc103\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Da57b421c194?dice_id=Da57b421c194\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/M9c39283c2ff?dice_id=M9c39283c2ff\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-07-01T00:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-26T22:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-07-01T00:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-26T15:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-26T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":4771,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"10445\",\"name\":\"Brick Lane Jazz Fest \",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-07-14/6ab3b317-fae4-4b28-a08a-6e089783cc97.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"brick-lane-jazz-fest-em5d\",\"profile_active\":true},\"id\":\"6863ed12ab701d0001953c6b\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Brick Lane Jazz Festival 2026: Sunday Pass\",\"offers_extras\":fal