me\":\"Kings Place \",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.kingsplace.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"***The Shackleton Trio bring their unmistakable blend of fiddle, mandolin, guitar and soaring three-part harmonies to Kings Place Folk Weekend 2026 — breathing new life into the stories and songs of East Anglia.***  \\n\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\n\\nCaptivating songwriting and fiery instrumental tunes come together in **The Shackleton Trio**’s unmistakable sound — weaving mandolin, fiddle, guitar and banjo with powerful three-part harmonies. Their music brings to life the stories of their native East Anglia and beyond, with a warmth and energy that has won them audiences across the UK and internationally.\\n\\nThe trio — **Georgia Shackleton** (fiddle, vocals), **Aaren Bennett** (guitar) and **Nic Zuppardi** (mandolin, banjo) — draw on British, American and Scandinavian folk traditions, while Georgia’s passion for uncovering lesser-known material from East Anglia keeps their work deeply rooted in local heritage.\\n\\n2025 marks the band’s 10-year anniversary, celebrated with a brand new album and an extensive tour. Their decade together has included BBC Radio 2, 3 and 4 airplay, features on BBC 6 Music and RTE 1, glowing ★★★★★ press coverage, an appearance on Cambridge Folk Festival’s prestigious main stage, and performances across the UK, Europe and beyond.\\n\\nA band that clearly loves playing together — and one not to be missed.\\n\\n***This event will last for approximately 75 minutes without an interval.***\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Kings Place.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:20\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s955aa09cfd4?dice_id=s955aa09cfd4\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/od298a2f4031?dice_id=od298a2f4031\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/sfecf34622f1?dice_id=sfecf34622f1\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/fc1b662501b9?dice_id=fc1b662501b9\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/be35c0dda5b0?dice_id=be35c0dda5b0\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r28d2695dec3?dice_id=r28d2695dec3\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-20T01:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-26T14:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-20T01:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-26T15:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-26T17:15:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2183,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2362\",\"name\":\"Kings Place\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"kings-place-29op\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"69202afaf701580001fbb2ad\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Folk Weekend: The Shackleton Trio\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"3o3xxp-folk-weekend-the-shackleton-trio-26th-apr-kings-place-hall-two-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1777213800,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":{\"description\":\"At EartH, we want our space to give back to the community. That’s why we teamed up with Progression Sessions to open Studio 36 inside our venue. Studio 36 provides music making facilities and expertise for free to young musicians in London who face a variety of barriers that might prevent them from making the most of their creativity and talent. \\n\\nEvery donation helps keep Studio 36 open and accessible, so that more young people can find their voice, develop their talents and feel supported as they take their next steps.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-28/af5fb538-b9c7-4f41-bf11-48d1d9d6d45a.jpeg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"variants\":[{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":100,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTExMzc4NiwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTIwODE2LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1OTozNC4yNjI2NTZaIiwicHJpY2UiOjEwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6Mjc1NSwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MzAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":300,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTExMzc4NiwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTIwODE2LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1OTozNC4yNjI2ODRaIiwicHJpY2UiOjMwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6Mjc1NiwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6NTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":500,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTExMzc4NiwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTIwODE2LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1OTozNC4yNjI2OTNaIiwicHJpY2UiOjUwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6Mjc1NywicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcml