_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1764147600,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":863,\"name\":\"EartH\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://earthackney.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"498772217287544\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-6QJEY8LKG2\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":\"781332317\",\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":\"nxkPCNyPg5caEN3eyPQC\",\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"This event will take place in EartH Theatre.\\n\\nSince 2020, the Rengin Women’s Choir, which has carried out significant work both in the field of music and in strengthening women’s solidarity, is now preparing for a major concert with Feryal Öney, themed “The Fraternity of Peoples and the Colours of Folk Songs.”\\n\\nFeryal Öney began her musical journey during her university years, and since then she has continued to perform with Kardeş Türküler, one of Turkey’s most important music ensembles. In this journey that brings together the melodies of different peoples, she has reached a wide audience with her powerful voice. In addition to her work with Kardeş Türküler, she has made remarkable contributions to her solo career with albums such as “Arı” (The Bee), “Yol” (The Road), “İstanbul”, and the highly acclaimed “Hardasan” (Where Are You), offering deeply expressive interpretations of folk music. Known also for her projects that highlight women’s voices and stories, Öney always creates unforgettable moments for her audience with her emotional and energetic performances.\\n\\nThe Rengin Women’s Choir previously brought 100 women to the stage at the “Sahne Kadınların” (Women Take the Stage) event held at Dominion Center in 2023, delivering an unforgettable musical celebration. Their powerful performance at the earthquake solidarity concert held at Alexandra Palace in 2022 also left a lasting impression.\\n\\nThis time, the choir is preparing a special surprise for the audience: together with a Folk Dance Ensemble, they will present dance performances from various nations, adding colour to the stage and reflecting the brotherhood of peoples on an even broader scale.\\n\\nThis special event will take place on Sunday, April 26, at 6:00 PM at Hackney Earth, where Feryal Öney’s magnificent voice and the Rengin Women’s Choir’s enthusiasm will come together to offer us yet another unforgettable evening.\\n\\nDon’t miss it!\\n\\nFor more information on access at EartH, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/44dzl75 or contact us at access@earthackney.co.uk\\n\\nEartH is a social enterprise committed to supporting new musicians, with music studios in the venue that are completely free for young artists to use. When you attend a show in EartH Theatre, head to the back of the space to rent a cushion for just £2. Not only will you get to sit more comfortably, but all proceeds go towards funding Studio 36. Find out more here: https://earthackney.co.uk/about/studio-36/\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by GIDKER\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:21\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c38053ad5569?dice_id=c38053ad5569\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x0585ca48236?dice_id=x0585ca48236\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A13e2724ae74?dice_id=A13e2724ae74\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/j12d50913624?dice_id=j12d50913