r with Dingwalls to present the very first edition of **LONDRA FESTIVAL**, bringing the best of the Italian Alternative Rock scene to London. The festival will feature some of the most exciting and influential artists in the genre.\\n\\nThe festival takes place on **April 25th & 26th, 2026 at Dingwalls**, Camden.\\n\\n**DAY 1 – 25th April**\\n\\nZen Circus\\n\\nDente\\n\\nLamante\\n\\nAftershow with limited availability for Super Fan ticket buyers only\\n\\n  \\n**DAY 2 – 26th April**\\n\\nMinistri\\n\\nMeganoidi\\n\\nManagement del dolore post-operatorio\\n\\nAftershow with limited availability for Super Fan ticket buyers only\\n\\n***  \\nSuper Fan ticket holders get exclusive access to the aftershow at Dingwalls 2 (former Canal Bar, entrance next to the main clockroom).***\\n\\nGet ready for two unforgettable nights of Italian alternative rock in the heart of London!\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Citizen Live.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:22\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/rd7da92c8122?dice_id=rd7da92c8122\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/dcfb4d77e3ae?dice_id=dcfb4d77e3ae\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/oa1a8fd3e711?dice_id=oa1a8fd3e711\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/M6e8a7e3f929?dice_id=M6e8a7e3f929\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Na45ad25f024?dice_id=Na45ad25f024\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/i632c684cd22?dice_id=i632c684cd22\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-15T13:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-26T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-15T13:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-26T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-27T02:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3038},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"11372\",\"name\":\"Citizen Live\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-07-04/3986ab94-e1cf-489e-95df-450093b12e1c.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"citizen-live-6al8\",\"profile_active\":true},\"id\":\"6968ac427edcb500017b80d6\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"LONDRA FESTIVAL - Day 2\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"py52ok-londra-festival-day-2-26th-apr-dingwalls-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1777222800,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-26T18:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-04-26T22:30:00+01:00\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Skarlett Riot\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"103598\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Ad Infinitum\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"94474\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":69033,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":69034,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":69035,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-13/ae148b5d-53ae-4f89-a8e7-5ce175ba5a74.jpg?rect=278%2C0%2C1378%2C1378\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-13/ae148b5d-53ae-4f89-a8e7-5ce175ba5a74.jpg?rect=0%2C89%2C2000%2C1200\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-13/ae148b5d-53ae-4f89-a8e7-5ce175ba5a74.jpg?rect=621%2C0%2C758%2C1378\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Ad Infinitum - Demons\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/demons/1495562065?i=1495562593&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Ad Infinitum\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/b9/be/22/b9be22cd-2043-c170-5a88-44e47c1bbeeb/mzaf_7703890850165575876.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Demons\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Ad Infinitum - Demons\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6hRGzMscjFo4IxbxlCIKBR\",\"artist\":\"Ad Infinitum\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/eedb95b8222a6477be93a7e3aefaf260869df082?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Demons\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1768320000,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Ad Infinitum stands as a formidable force in the modern metal scene, with a sound that melds haunting melodies, crushing riffs, and dynamic storytelling. Formed in 2018 by the charismatic and versatile frontwoman Melissa Bonny, the band has rapidly risen through the ranks, carving out a distinct niche with their intense and evocative music. Ad Infinitum’s 2020 debut, “Chapter I: Monarchy,” announced their arrival with a thunderous roar, setting the stage for what would be an unstoppable ascent. This record was shortly followed by “Chapter II – Legacy” in 2021 and “Chapter III – Downfall” in 2023.\\n\\nWith their 4th album “Abyss”, the band further refined their identity, delivering an even more aggressive and sonically complex record that pushes the boundaries of modern metal. The powerful lineup— with Melissa Bonny’s limitless and versatile vocals, Adrian Thessenvitz’s intricate and masterly guitar work, Korbinian Benedict’s driving and powerful bass, and Niklas Müller’s thunderous and incisive drumming—creates a soundscape that is both grand and intimate, capturing the full spectrum of human emotion and experience.\\n\\nAd Infinitum continues to blaze their path with unrelenting passion and innovation, drawing fans deeper into their mesmerising, immersive world with every release. As rising stars of the new wave of modern metal, they remain committed to exploring new territories and shattering expectations with each powerful performance.\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Underworld.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:23\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T8e36233cd60?dice_id=T8e36233cd60\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Od9cd3a499d1?dice_id=Od9cd3a499d1\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/C4ae51719433?dice_id=C4ae51719433\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m578dec2ec08?dice_id=m578dec2ec08\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r9bd9a0ad850?dice_id=r9bd9a0ad850\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N34aa2968c15?dice_id=N34aa2968c15\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-13T16:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-26T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-13T16:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-26T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-26T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3214,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"696655aef51f23000130f238\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"AD INFINITUM\",\"offers_extras\":true,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"xe2p8a-ad-infinitum-26th-apr-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1777222800,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[{\"ticket_type_id\":1166652,\"extra_ids\":[\"1172920\"]}],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"583\",\"name\":\"Troxy\",\"address\":\"490 Commercial Road, London E1 0HX\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5127267,\"lng\":-0.0440164000000323},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-02-09/061113a1-696d-4a63-976d-388707e1d2c4.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2750%2C2750\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"troxy-ww3x\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://troxy.co.uk/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-26T18:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-04-26T23:00:00+01:00\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"告五人\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"104539\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":20779,\"title\":\"How can I purchase an accessible ticket?\",\"body\":\"Please email accesstickets@troxy.co.uk with a copy of your proof of eligibility.\\n\\nFor more information about Accessible bookings and example proof of eligibility, visit https://troxy.co.uk/accessibility/.\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":20780,\"title\":\"Can I get a carer ticket if I have a standing or circle ticket?\",\"body\":\"We can offer free companion tickets upon receipt of proof of eligibility and your DICE booking confirmation at accesstickets@troxy.co.uk. Companion ticket availability is limited in the Circle, so please reach out to check availability before purchasing a Circle ticket.\",\"order\":1}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-08/d9391382-d35a-4f25-8871-7f6ec04e1494.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1250%2C1250\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-08/d9391382-d35a-4f25-8871-7f6ec04e1494.jpg?rect=0%2C250%2C1250%2C750\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-08/d9391382-d35a-4f25-8871-7f6ec04e1494.jpg?rect=281%2C0%2C688%2C1250\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":\"d31cbde6-a999-4e14-8ec1-e975c10adbf1\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1765447200,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":14,\"name\":\"Troxy\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://troxy.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"784424a7-8ebe-4f5d-a8ac-998a6c48dc15\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"d31cbde6-a999-4e14-8ec1-e975c10adbf1\",\"seat_selection\":\"disabled\"},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Following the huge success of their first World Tour - AROUND THE NEW WORLD – “AMUSEMENT OF THE UNIVERSE”, Mandarin band Accusefive is set to return to London on April 26, 2026 with \\\\[Run, Run, Run!\\\\] 2026 Live Tour, bringing fans an all-new live experience.\\n\\nThis tour holds special meaning for the trio as they return to the Live House stage — a setting reminiscent of where their musical journey first began. Stripping away grand production in favor of heartfelt connection, the band aims to deliver a raw, authentic, and emotionally charged performance that brings fans closer than ever before. This tour has been played and sold out in multiple cities across Asia including Yilan, Taipei, Taichung, Kaohsiung, Guangzhou, Shenyang, Beijing, Xi’an, Shanghai, Hong Kong, Chengdu, Wuhan, Osaka, Tokyo, Singapore and Kuala Lumpur which underscoring the band’s immense popularity and influence.\\n\\nThe tour was first launched in their alma mater in their hometown, Yilan, Taiwan, a city that holds a very special meaning for the trio. Band member Quan Qing shared her excitement: “Thank you all for giving me so much courage along the way, allowing me to return here with pride and confidence.”\\n\\nThe band revealed that some of the fans having missed the chance to experience their music in a more intimate setting. To give more fans the opportunity to connect up close, the band decided to return to Live House venues to fulfill fans request. “Performing in a Live House is just as exhilarating as playing a large arena,” member Richard Lin shared. “Returning to our musical roots allows every fan to join us from the very beginning of our journey.”\\n\\nAccusefive’s dedication to their fans extends far beyond the stage. Following the performances, an exclusive post-show autograph sessions left fans exhilarated, with many admitting they “couldn’t sleep that night from excitement!”\\n\\nThis tour accompanies their fourth studio album, “The Dreamers”, whose songs have resonated deeply with fans, becoming an inseparable part of their lives. Member Pan Pan An commented: “In your life stories, we are the supporting characters while you are the main protagonist. We hope our songs grow with you, bringing strength and inspiration along the way.”\\n\\nBooking fees include a £2.25 venue restoration levy per ticket.\\n\\n**Accessible Bookings:**\\n\\nTickets for Troxy’s step-free seated accessible area are available directly from this listing as Accessible Area tickets. If you’ve purchased Accessible Area tickets for this event and haven’t done so for a previous event at Troxy, please email accesstickets@troxy.co.uk with a copy of your proof of eligibility. We accept PIP letters, Access Cards, Blue Badge, Doctor's notes, etc. Please ensure that this is sent to us within 7 days of your purchase, as failure to do so could result in your ticket being cancelled and refunded. Please direct all other accessibility enquiries to accesstickets@troxy.co.uk.\\n\\nFor more information about Accessible bookings and example proof of eligibility, visit https://troxy.co.uk/accessibility/.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Groupal.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:24\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/X300a0c45997?dice_id=X300a0c45997\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ka9efea2cbdb?dice_id=Ka9efea2cbdb\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Kb0e0daba8d4?dice_id=Kb0e0daba8d4\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/C7189b4527e1?dice_id=C7189b4527e1\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Wf8901812a07?dice_id=Wf8901812a07\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/V06716c49ba8?dice_id=V06716c49ba8\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-11T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-26T21:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-18T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-26T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-26T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":5918},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1554\",\"name\":\"Troxy\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"troxy-5wrl\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"6937071215880400015af9dc\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"784424a7-8ebe-4f5d-a8ac-998a6c48dc15\",\"name\":\"Accusefive (告五人)\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"2w7k27-accusefive-26th-apr-troxy-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1777222800,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"ven