sion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"The Fiery Furnaces, the long-running collaboration between siblings Eleanor and Matthew Friedberger, reconvene for a number of performances as a pared-down duo. Renowned for their dense, allusive lyrics and formally inventive compositions, the band occupies a singular space in the landscape of experimental pop. No despisers of sentimentality, this reunion is however less a nostalgic reprise than a continuation of their interrogation of song form, song culture, storytelling, and memory.\\n\\nLast year the band reissued their seminal album 'Blueberry Boat’ as a limited edition deluxe gatefold 2LP with bonus track 'Far Away'. They plan to continue reimagining, reworking, and adding to their repertoire, both live and as part of a new series of recordings called “Σκίτσα” (Sketches).\\n\\n*For accessibility information please see the accessibility information button/link below.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 16+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Eat Your Own Ears\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:27\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/qbc59408447c?dice_id=qbc59408447c\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W8fc4a3957c4?dice_id=W8fc4a3957c4\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W95f783ea46b?dice_id=W95f783ea46b\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ld548b06ce1b?dice_id=Ld548b06ce1b\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ae2f44d10d7a?dice_id=Ae2f44d10d7a\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":