\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebc6c4efb86ea194d0345ac471\"},\"artist_id\":\"133385\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Prospect Hill\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"133384\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Lansdowne\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"99318\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":35509,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":35510,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":35511,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-05/78697d99-272c-4d09-b799-b7f43dfdaab2.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2750%2C2750\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-05/78697d99-272c-4d09-b799-b7f43dfdaab2.jpg?rect=0%2C550%2C2750%2C1650\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-05/78697d99-272c-4d09-b799-b7f43dfdaab2.jpg?rect=619%2C0%2C1513%2C2750\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Lansdowne - Make It a Lie\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3fse9bOfmU8yAUO8bpxb6q\",\"artist\":\"Lansdowne\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/448c51e8f9acc89f5433f2229e0165075bfc8878?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Make It a Lie\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Lansdowne - Make It a Lie\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/make-it-a-lie/1808692234?i=1808692239&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Lansdowne\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/58/1d/c3/581dc3e1-72ad-467a-64c4-a5b0ad969ee4/mzaf_12442458954916095865.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Make It a Lie\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1754380800,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"From war zones to festival main stages, Boston rock titans Lansdowne have built a career on grit, hooks, and heart.\\n\\nSince bursting onto the scene in 2006, Lansdowne has carved out a reputation as one of the hardest-working and most fiercely independent bands in modern rock. Their journey has taken them from college campuses and roadside dives to global tours and charting radio hits earning them over 140 million streams, 75,000+ global units sold, and a fiercely loyal fanbase that spans continents.\\n\\nRoots in Resolve, Raised by the Road\\n\\nComprised of Jon Ricci (vocals), Shaun Lichtenstein (lead guitar/vocals), Glenn Mungo (drums), Josh Waterman (guitar/vocals), and Mike LaRoche (bass), Lansdowne is a band forged in the fire of adversity. From the early days of DIY tours to a harrowing stint stranded in Texas during a flood, they’ve never taken the easy route and wouldn’t have it any other way.\\n\\nWhether performing for U.S. troops in the Middle East braving sub-zero temperatures in Kyrgyzstan or narrowly dodging mortar fire in Afghanistan or grinding it out in the States opening for acts like Halestorm, Pop Evil, Theory of a Deadman, and Creed, Lansdowne has remained steadfast in their mission: to create music that connects and deliver a visceral live experience that leaves fans breathless.\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Underworld.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:34\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Pd97679db2f0?dice_id=Pd97679db2f0\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Pb8c35cb73aa?dice_id=Pb8c35cb73aa\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/nf7750a94d2c?dice_id=nf7750a94d2c\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/C781bee7fae7?dice_id=C781bee7fae7\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H5368ec2656e?dice_id=H5368ec2656e\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u3e03d792947?dice_id=u3e03d792947\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-08-05T09:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-27T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-08-07T09:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-27T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-27T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2987,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"688b52f2eb24b600017bd0b1\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"LANSDOWNE\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"perm_name\":\"dknego-lansdowne-27th-apr-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1777312800,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"43\",\"name\":\"MOTH Club\",\"address\":\"Old Trades Hall