nres. He combines his experimental mindset with a single looping pedal to craft intricate improvisational pieces that incorporate a variety of instruments, influences, and soul. His music showcases a blend of tribal sounds, Spanish rumba guitar techniques, and the deep resonance of percussion instruments like the djembe and bass.\\n\\nNadav Tabak’s journey promises to be nothing short of extraordinary as he takes listeners on a voyage through his captivating musical universe. With his fusion of cultural influences and innovative production\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Hootananny Brixton.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:46\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Hb48d2b2a3cf?dice_id=Hb48d2b2a3cf\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p82b745a2d1c?dice_id=p82b745a2d1c\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D3524a70ed26?dice_id=D3524a70ed26\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/nd00344a20c6?dice_id=nd00344a20c6\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q78051e155e9?dice_id=Q78051e155e9\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q37e8a7dd391?dice_id=Q37e8a7dd391\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-27T16:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-28T23:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-28T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-28T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-28T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1600,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8240\",\"name\":\"Hootananny Brixton\",\"image\":{\"