urchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Eat Your Own Ears presents Memorials at The Lexington.\\n\\nMEMORIALS draw inspiration from folk, dub, post punk, experimental tape music, 60s soul, garage rock and 70s spiritual jazz, twisting these influences into their own unmistakable sound. The duo of Verity Susman and Matthew Simms (ex-Electrelane/WIRE) recently toured the USA opening for Stereolab and have been called “Stereolab’s evil twin.”\\n\\n“Kaleidoscopic art-pop and adventurous psych-rock with an immersive, experimental aura.” KEXP\\n\\n“From baroque ’60s acid pop to Can-esque pounding krautrock to heavy psych…also very The Doors at times” Brooklyn Vegan\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Eat Your Own Ears.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:66\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ea08af8e3881?dice_id=Ea08af8e3881\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P96e4cb2f70e?dice_id=P96e4cb2f70e\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n2479e5e378b?dice_id=n2479e5e378b\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o7f715c616d6?dice_id=o7f715c616d6\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w9563be94660?dice_id=w9563be94660\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c36a2fa9b448?dice_id=c36a2fa9b448\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-03T11:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-29T17:45:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-03T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-29T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-29T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1714,\"s