ically the songs have an emo, poetic flair, often tackling trauma and Mental Health challenges head-on.\\n\\nLove Ghost has collaborated with artists from around the world, including an entire album with industrial legend Tim Skold (KMFDM, Marilyn Manson). Other notable collaborations include Rico Nasty, Camidoh, Adan Cruz, The Skinner Brothers, Santa RM, Dan Garcia, Ritorukai, Mabiland, Wiplash, Blnko, Rayben and El Burger.\\n\\nhttps://hoo.be/loveghost_official\\n\\n\\\\+ supports\\n\\nThursday 30th April 2026\\n\\nNew Cross Inn, London\\n\\nDoors 6pm\\n\\nTickets £15 ADV STBF\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ under 16's to be accompanied by an adult\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"New Cross Live presents\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:71\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w3bfd78c671d?dice_id=w3bfd78c671d\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q9cbc3722641?dice_id=Q9cbc3722641\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z8d6a819911c?dice_id=z8d6a819911c\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A7bd31cb613f?dice_id=A7bd31cb613f\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Aa874ccb270e?dice_id=Aa874ccb270e\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/d431c300bd8d?dice_id=d431c300bd8d\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-19T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-30T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-19T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-30T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-30T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1650,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\"