o present valid identification indicating that they are at least 14 years of age will not be admitted to this event and will not be eligible for a refund.\",\"order\":1}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/61996125-9e6b-4737-b860-f21c1bd7a7d7.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C800%2C800\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/61996125-9e6b-4737-b860-f21c1bd7a7d7.jpg?rect=0%2C160%2C800%2C480\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/61996125-9e6b-4737-b860-f21c1bd7a7d7.jpg?rect=180%2C0%2C440%2C800\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Blaggard\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1almDIgCDSSEcImafVOkhd\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/8eff8054668de8966a8dfb32e46abc8046b13250?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Blaggard\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770804000,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1707,\"name\":\"Live Nation UK\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.livenation.co.uk/privacy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"“Close your eyes and pull like a dog,” was the answer once given by Irish Olympic rowers Gary and Paul O’Donovan in a 2016 interview, when asked to describe their game plan for an upcoming race. The phrase – previously non-existent – caught on and has since become cultural shorthand for the straightforward tenacity required to do pretty much anything.\\n\\nFor Dublin-based four-piece The Scratch, the phrase came to represent a collective headspace going into their forthcoming album – titled Pull Like A Dog, scheduled for release on 6th March 2026 via Sony Music Ireland. “It’s just another way of saying ‘send it’ and see what happens,” Daniel “Lango” Lang (cajón, percussion, lead vocals) explains. “It’s a motivating phrase we needed, at the time, to inspire a bit of gusto.”\\n\\nIn a league of their own when it comes to live performances, the high-voltage folk-metal band have been busy touring the past few months. From hitting the road with the Dropkick Murphys across the US, packing-out festival sets across Europe, supporting Dermot Kennedy in Australia and performing at the UK’s Download Festival, the band are showing no signs of slowing down.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event - 14s to 16s must be accompanied by an adult..\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Live Nation.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:74\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y3412b899456?dice_id=Y3412b899456\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A0a53465daea?dice_id=A0a53465daea\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J605e2919781?dice_id=J605e2919781\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T3f675b1a3c3?dice_id=T3f675b1a3c3\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Xd6cfd0a4c12?dice_id=Xd6cfd0a4c12\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/red963407ee7?dice_id=red963407ee7\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-11T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-30T10:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-11T10:00:00