e-born, London-based Theo Zhykharyev, it is distinguished by its giddy bass, sizzling synth lines and melancholic vocal hooks.\\n\\nPowerplant moves at its own accord, always morphing into something more powerful and mysterious. With each addition to their catalog, Theo Zhykharyev throws new sonic mutations in the mix. It’s never the same, but always 100% Powerplant.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/27d05a88-e94b-49ca-b929-504a0ed0bccf.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1748%2C1748\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/27d05a88-e94b-49ca-b929-504a0ed0bccf.jpg?rect=0%2C350%2C1748%2C1049\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/27d05a88-e94b-49ca-b929-504a0ed0bccf.jpg?rect=394%2C0%2C961%2C1748\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Powerplant - Bridge of Sacrifice\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1TcxVhdUtm5SU3gbEoWGr1\",\"artist\":\"Powerplant\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/b2f849acd4424d862c6cc7fe59b351e54307a115?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Bridge of Sacrifice\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Powerplant - Bridge of Sacrifice\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/bridge-of-sacrifice/1861447161?i=1861447164&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Powerplant\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/7b/15/7c/7b157cc5-5d24-88d6-bb3c-c9a3232ea8e0/mzaf_5224245221657322996.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Bridge of Sacrifice\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770807600,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"LNZRT\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://lanzaroteworks.com/Privacy-Policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\