0+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-30T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-30T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3078,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"9454\",\"name\":\"FORM\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"form-5rnk\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"68fcacea1f23e40001fc06a4\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Nubiyan Twist\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"perm_name\":\"yog7nv-nubiyan-twist-30th-apr-koko-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1777572000,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":false,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"114\",\"name\":\"Roundhouse\",\"address\":\"Roundhouse, Chalk Farm Rd, London NW1 8EH\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5430406,\"lng\":-0.15131180000003},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-24/2fce8c34-cb66-4510-a1d0-f2c07a1f9479.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2889%2C2889\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"roundhouse-4296\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/visit/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-30T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"The Twilight Sad\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-06-25/3f3dad9d-0560-4df1-a2fa-fa4e754f005f.jpg?rect=0%2C51%2C538%2C538\"},\"artist_id\":\"1473\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true},{\"name\":\"Darren Wasteland\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"132556\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"deary\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-03-08/b5a75b64-10f4-42a1-9201-9af828545cd2.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"58928\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":48986,\"title\":\"Where are my tickets?\",\"body\":\"**IMPORTANT: Read here about your Roundhouse tickets**\\n\\nPlease note you will need to access your tickets via the Roundhouse Online Wallet at - http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk\\n\\nYour tickets WILL NOT be available in the DICE app. Just follow the below steps below on the day of event to access your ticket to the show:\\n\\nHead to http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk\\n\\nSign in using your DICE account email address - if you already had a Roundhouse account under the same email address, enter the password associated with this email address. If you didn’t have one, Roundhouse will have created one for you and you’ll just need to reset the password before logging in.\\n\\nIf you need to reset your password, you’ll be taken to http://roundhouse.org.uk, but you need to log in again at http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk to access your ticket.\\n\\nThe QR code should appear a couple of hours before the stated time on your ticket\\n\\nIf you want to transfer your tickets to a friend please do so at least 4 hours before the event within the Roundhouse ticket wallet.\\n\\nIf you cannot access your tickets in the Roundhouse online wallet please visit the venue box office when you arrive and one of the team will be happy to assist you.\\n\\nFull information regarding the Roundhouse online wallet can be found at - https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/faqs/digital-tickets/\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":48987,\"title\":\"Security\",\"body\":\"On arrival you will be greeted by our ticket scanners and our security teams. Our security checks include bag searches and a search of individuals using wands. Please be prepared upon arrival to go through this process and help speed up the entry. Our security teams are there for your safety but we recognise that this process can be daunting for some. Please do raise any concerns with staff members when you arrive so that we can support you where needed.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":48988,\"title\":\"Prohibited Items\",\"body\":\"We reserve the right to prohibit specific items from the Roundhouse Premises. A full list of prohibited items can be found in our Admissions Terms & Conditions: https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/terms-policies/admissions-terms/\\n\\nUnfortunately flags and banners are not permitted into the venue as they can obstruct the view for other people in the audience. Please note this list is not exhaustive. The Venue Management has the right to prohibit any other items that are not included in this list but are deemed to cause a risk to the building or people.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":48989,\"title\":\"Accessibility Tickets\",\"body\":\"Accessibility tickets must be booked directly with the venue, not through DICE. Please get in touch with the venue via access@roundhouse.org.uk prior to purchasing.\",\"order\":3}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-28/9a07a8b4-c222-46f7-8f40-a8080613ac47.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-28/9a07a8b4-c222-46f7-8f40-a8080613ac47.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-28/9a07a8b4-c222-46f7-8f40-a8080613ac47.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"The Twilight Sad - There's a Girl in the Corner\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/6e6GkaF6uiSEFuTrlvDJUF\",\"artist\":\"The Twilight Sad\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/a8792b6fea33eeade371f36349ee9f40e292fcc4\",\"track_name\":\"There's a Girl in the Corner\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":\"668c8537-569b-459b-aa5d-df72d382717b\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1761645600,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1175,\"name\":\"Kilimanjaro Live Limited\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://myticket.co.uk/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"f78cd9fe-8f0f-473f-b6c4-537bb16350d1\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"668c8537-569b-459b-aa5d-df72d382717b\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Kilimanjaro presents\\n\\nThe Twilight Sad\\n\\n\\\\+ deary\\n\\n\\\\+ Darren Wasteland\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All Ages (U16s accompanied by an adult, U14s in seats)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Kilimanjaro.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:85\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Vd0149e6851c?dice_id=Vd0149e6851c\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x9552a07b978?dice_id=x9552a07b978\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Geb43b6f0ef6?dice_id=Geb43b6f0ef6\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Eb8b08928040?dice_id=Eb8b08928040\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T445903aa03c?dice_id=T445903aa03c\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ya56fd2efdd9?dice_id=Ya56fd2efdd9\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-28T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-29T09:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-10-31T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-30T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-30T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3507,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"91\",\"name\":\"Kilimanjaro\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"kilimanjaro-43px\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"68e64286910e560001cb08aa\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"f78cd9fe-8f0f-473f-b6c4-537bb16350d1\",\"name\":\"The Twilight Sad\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"perm_name\":\"dk8g8o-the-twilight-sad-30th-apr-roundhouse-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1777572000,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":false,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-30T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-04-30T23:00:00+01:00\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Voltstorm\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebbc5efc813ab6e5c038a312a3\"},\"artist_id\":\"59681\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Demon\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab67616d0000b27350165bd0505641e65186f182\"},\"artist_id\":\"67282\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true},{\"name\":\"Tygers of Pan Tang\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebaa17778a42e42c49cfa41ab2\"},\"artist_id\":\"12933\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":44212,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":44213,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":44214,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-11/758e1bf8-e7c7-4115-9360-e0210197c9a0.jpg?rect=359%2C0%2C2083%2C2083\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-11/758e1bf8-e7c7-4115-9360-e0210197c9a0.jpg?rect=0%2C202%2C2800%2C1680\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-11/758e1bf8-e7c7-4115-9360-e0210197c9a0.jpg?rect=827%2C0%2C1146%2C2083\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Only the Brave\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5F4PRUrsZQ8zTppxd6OA9a\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/17e83f263b2caec264905fe663d61520e6c8e2a8?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Only the Brave\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Tygers of Pan Tang - Blood Red Sky\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/blood-red-sky/1144484400?i=1144484810&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Tygers of Pan Tang\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/2f/5b/00/2f5b004d-5a72-1167-c69a-e2c6df5d71eb/mzaf_939941650335296755.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Blood Red Sky\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1757667600,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Robb Weir is never a man to take what he has for granted. Having led the Tygers since their first album through a plethora of line-up changes, he recognises that the current band are probably the strongest since they were at the forefront of the NWOBHM. The original band, who made 4 albums for MCA records, survived the unexpected departure of Jess Cox to run Neat records and later John Sykes, who was bound for Thin Lizzy and a multi-million seller with Whitesnake. What they didn’t survive was their greatest commercial success with the album ‘The Cage’. However, Weir, ever the optimist, formed a new version of the band to play the old material and write songs that would represent this ‘new’ Tygers. The backbone of the band – Craig Ellis on drums together with Jack Meille on vocals have now been together for considerably longer than the first Tygers and were joined by Francesco Marras on guitar and Huw Holding on bass for their 2023 album ‘Bloodlines’. 2024 saw the release of both a new live album ‘Live Blood’ and reimagining of the album that put the Tygers back on the rock and roll rails - ‘Animal Instinct’. A new album is expected in 2026.\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Underworld.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:86\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/B8103e6dc5de?dice_id=B8103e6dc5de\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ze4afa6d58fe?dice_id=Ze4afa6d58fe\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/re0987f81c80?dice_id=re0987f81c80\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w3143b79df73?dice_id=w3143b79df73\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o8d973553f3c?dice_id=o8d973553f3c\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Oe41b874d6b6?dice_id=Oe41b874d6b6\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-09-12T10:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-30T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-09-12T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-30T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-30T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3554,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"68c2d108d54cdb0001ec8545\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"TYGERS OF PAN TANG x DEMON\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"perm_name\":\"k6oq28-tygers-of-pan-tang-x-demon-30th-apr-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1777572000,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"940\",\"name\":\"Kings Place (Hall One)\",\"address\":\"Kings Place, 90 York Way, Kings Cross, London N1 9AG\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5349694,\"lng\":-0.121675500000038},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"kings-place-hall-one-yo6v\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.kingsplace.co.uk/your-visit/access-information/\"},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-04-30T19:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":4},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/873ace48-1207-4065-a089-b983d73895f7.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/873ace48-1207-4065-a089-b983d73895f7.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/873ace48-1207-4065-a089-b983d73895f7.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Moon River\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/635wx6uv5nTm4FFySw3cMW\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/8b4dd5147aef774c99509af0edb741c25c76f1e0?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Moon River\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":\"b6cacc81-15a1-4778-90c1-515c20e0c024\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1770771600,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1141,\"name\":\"Kings Place \",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.kingsplace.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"5c28fad5-743f-4b39-b994-332f62cbadd4\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"b6cacc81-15a1-4778-90c1-515c20e0c024\",\"seat_selection\":\"disabled\"},\"about\":{\"description\":\"***With a voice that bridges generations, Stella Cole has cultivated nearly two million social media followers through her fresh interpretations of timeless songs by iconic artists including Judy Garland, Frank Sinatra, and Nat ‘King’ Cole. Often described as a Laufey-meets-Bublé sensation, Cole brings classic repertoire to a new generation with warmth and ease.***  \\n\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\n\\nRaised in rural Illinois on Hollywood musicals such as *Singin’ in the Rain* and *The Wizard of Oz*, Cole told *ELLE* that she “never expected this life.” She has since earned praise for her soulful interpretations of the Great American Songbook from legends including James Taylor, David Foster, and Michael Bublé. She has performed on *The TODAY Show*, *Live with Kelly and Mark*, *Tamron Hall*, and on stages throughout the U.S., Europe, and Asia.\\n\\n‘It’s amazing to think that this music can be a balm for people’s stress and anxiety,’ says Cole. ‘Don’t forget, these songs helped people get through the Great Depression and World War II. That’s the most gratifying thing of all – experiencing how this music can help people.’\\n\\nAuthentic and faithful to the traditions in which these songs have been heard for generations, Cole brings a personal charisma that transcends time.\\n\\n***This event will last approximately 1 hour and 50 minutes, including an interval.***\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Kings Place.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:87\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/l7e8a7b3564f?dice_id=l7e8a7b3564f\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o6a37d987726?dice_id=o6a37d987726\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A90f8d8a5d85?dice_id=A90f8d8a5d85\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/sef26442505d?dice_id=sef26442505d\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/S3355ecc6f46?dice_id=S3355ecc6f46\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y6888b1e2dec?dice_id=y6888b1e2dec\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-11T01:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-04-30T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-11T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-04-30T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-04-30T21:50:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2947,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2362\",\"name\":\"Kings Place\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"kings-place-29op\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"698ccee4d4dcd600010c682e\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"5c28fad5-743f-4b39-b994-332f62cbadd4\",\"name\":\"Stella Cole\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"bb393m-stella-cole-30th-apr-kings-place-hall-one-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1777573800,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":