"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Diezelbud:\\n\\nFrom a shed in the village of Bletchingdon, George Wing and Cameron Davies have given life to Oxfordshire's answer to Frankenstein’s monster, London-based Diezelbud. The band are serving up a potent blend of indie rock and bedroom pop with a post punk attitude and a sound drenched in jangly guitars. The band's DIY debut 'Bletch' saw the boys stepping out of small town life into the big leagues. Emboldened by its reception they are poised for an exciting release and are set to continue their campaign toward horizons unknown. With a lineup now rounded out by Angus Mckay, Louis Davidson, and Matthew Grainger they have brought their riotous live shows to stages across the country and are met with an ever-growing and fiercely loyal following.\\n\\nOne show is all it takes to see the truth - It's Bletch or bust. See you in the pit.\\n\\n\\\\+ supports tba\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Short Waves.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"8cc5ceb0df17d6a6:88\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/jb30b9559c94?dice_id=jb30b9559c94\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/se89fab99c9c?dice_id=se89fab99c9c\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/beaac0c6700d?dice_id=beaac0c6700d\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/af6eb736b4d7?dice_id=af6eb736b4d7\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w0f44e05fd40?dice_id=w0f44e05fd40\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y4243d504