:\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-22/e54fef14-ff2b-41bc-accc-7b0b70ef66b9.jpg?rect=0%2C890%2C4492%2C4492\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-22/e54fef14-ff2b-41bc-accc-7b0b70ef66b9.jpg?rect=0%2C2040%2C4492%2C2695\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-22/e54fef14-ff2b-41bc-accc-7b0b70ef66b9.jpg?rect=383%2C0%2C3726%2C6774\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"*poetry for non-poetry fans*\\n\\nA memorable night with the UK's best poets, showing just how entertaining, moving and hilarious they can be using nothing but words.\\n\\n\\\\-------------------\\n\\n**lineup - tba**\\n\\n***\\\\+ open mic section***\\n\\n***\\\\--------------------***\\n\\nno tickets on the door\\n\\nseated\\n\\ninsta / tiktok: @spitnights\\n\\n- Show starts 7.45pm\\n- DJs from 7pm and 10:30-late\\n- Bar open all day - pizza from 7pm\\n- Step free access\\n- bring a book for the book swap <3\\n- 18+\\n\\n\\\\--------------------\\n\\n**LOW INCOME TICKETS**\\n\\n**we don't want anyone to be priced out of coming to our night so if money is too tight use code COMMUNITY to unlock £5 tickets (DICE adds a fee for waitlist tickets)**\\n\\n**thank you to everyone who buys a PAY IT FORWARD ticket to help us offer cheaper tickets to those who need <3**\\n\\n\\\\---------------------\\n\\nopen mic details:\\n\\n\\\\- sign up on the door 7-7:45pm\\n\\n\\\\- names will be picked out of a hat\\n\\n\\\\- 4 minutes maximum\\n\\n\\\\----------------------\\n\\n1st thursdays of the month = pure poetry night\\n\\n3rd saturdays of the month (usually) = poets vs singers\\n\\nlast thursday of the month = poetry x improv jazz show\\n\\n\\\\----------------------\\n\\nHere at spit nights, we are committed to creating a safe and celebratory environment for all of our supporters. By attending spit nights, you agree to adhere to our safety policy.\\n\\nYou can find more info regarding our safety policy here: https://linktr.ee/spitnig