himself at the forefront of one of hip-hop’s most visible eras. That moment introduced his sound to audiences worldwide, while his solo catalogue quickly revealed the depth and clarity that would define his career on his own terms.\\n\\nSUPPORT TBA\\n\\nTHIS IS AN 18+ EVENT\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"6967c25a7c7aa50001302991\",\"name\":\"G Unit: Lloyd Banks\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Lloyd Banks - Hands Up (feat. 50 Cent)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/music-video/hands-up-feat-50-cent/1445858209?uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Lloyd Banks\",\"preview_url\":\"https://video-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Video115/v4/27/76/a9/2776a937-4b99-a040-b86b-02d36cec91bb/mzvf_7190436200145890059.640x480.h264lc.U.p.m4v\",\"track_name\":\"Hands Up (feat. 50 Cent)\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Lloyd Banks\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb88b361f4861990f7a696c87d\"},\"artist_id\":\"76154\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-26T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-01T15:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-28T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-01T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-01T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1201,\"name\":\"DHP Family\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.dhpfamily.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_