ons in sound and technology, bringing her latest work, Ama, to life on stage.\\n\\nQueralt Lahoz, a singer-songwriter from Santa Coloma de Gramenet, moves effortlessly between flamenco, bolero, hip-hop, pop, and dancehall, performing her newest album, 9:30 PM, with the emotional depth and fearless artistry that has defined her career.\\n\\nTogether, Arnal and Lahoz offer a night where tradition meets experimentation, emotion meets innovation, and two singular storytellers showcase the very best of contemporary Catalan music.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"6916f7afef017f0001823407\",\"name\":\"Maria Arnal & Queralt Lahoz\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Maria Arnal - AMA\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/ama/1847588251?i=1847588252&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Maria Arnal\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/a6/e6/e5/a6e6e550-05c6-57e6-38a3-e3e180d4e819/mzaf_5921968198715451120.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"AMA\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Maria Arnal\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebbb915e1ff303f8cc8ff2552f\"},\"artist_id\":\"110752\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Recognized as one of Spain's most innovative voices in contemporary music, this Barcelona-based artist blends avant-garde pop, electronics, and polyphonic traditional music with artistic projects exploring sound, technology and art.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-22T12:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026