as earnt him multiple Grammy nominations and been featured on tracks by Christina Aguilera, Gorillaz and labelmate Kaytranada.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-08-08T00:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-01T00:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-08-08T00:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-01T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-01T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":37267,\"title\":\"Venue Accessibility Information\",\"body\":\"https://electricballroom.co.uk/disabled-access/\",\"order\":0}],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by AGMP.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1754607600,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"55\",\"name\":\"Electric Ballroom\",\"address\":\"184 Camden High St, London NW1 8QP\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5396558,\"lng\":-0.143191399999978},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/fab0b36d-a5a4-4e37-a541-2c5af15a3bc1.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C400%2C400\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"electric-ballroom-j78v\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://electricballroom.co.uk/disabled-access/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-01T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1442\",\"name\":\"AGMP\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"agmp-99g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"95f5e6a9ee55de96:15\",\"date_unix\":1777658400,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3420,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Gc0d83930d25?dice_id=Gc0d83930d25\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Wf01ad04cac9?dice_id=Wf01ad04cac9\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R06c6bb65cb7?dice_id=R06c6bb65cb7\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ma1d59ee8ef3?dice_id=Ma1d59ee8ef3\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h887e3bba535?dice_id=h887e3bba535\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/X660268e1f75?dice_id=X660268e1f75\"},\"perm_name\":\"avgyw7-au-pairs-1st-may-electric-ballroom-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-08/752749b7-df12-4a54-96ae-08fb90e46b75.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-08/752749b7-df12-4a54-96ae-08fb90e46b75.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-08/752749b7-df12-4a54-96ae-08fb90e46b75.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"AGMP Concerts proudly presents\\n\\nAU PAIRS\\n\\n'Playing With A Different Sex' 45th Anniversary\\n\\n\\\\+ very special guests\\n\\nFirst concert in over 40 years for legendary Post Punk group AU PAIRS.\\n\\nAu Pairs formed in late 1978 in Birmingham, UK in the post-punk era. They were a much-loved band who combined fun, dancey music with an innovative and, for that time, a daringly progressive message.\\n\\nIn their original form they were 2 women and 2 men, the objective being to show that women and men can work together as equals.\\n\\nLesley Woods led the band as frontperson, lead singer, songwriter and guitarist. Lesley was once described as “”one of the most striking women in British rock”.\\n\\nTheir first album 'Playing With A Different Sex' is a post-punk classic and focusses on gender and other politics. A critic from The Guardian praised it for its “viciously well-observed lyrics on contemporary life, love and the role of women “.\\n\\nThe band is re-forming beginning 2026 when they commence a UK tour with Lesley Woods and new members. The 2 women/2 men balance remains .\\n\\nAu Pairs blend political lyrics with a tough funk-dance-rock idiom which is as relevant today as it ever was.\\n\\nThis event is 14 and over. 14s to 16s must be accompanied by an adult.  Any ticket holder unable to present valid identification indicating that they are at least 14 years of age will not be admitted to this event and will not be eligible for a refund.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"id\":\"68960986a4b26300014656c7\",\"name\":\"Au Pairs\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Galimbas y rock'n'roll\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0YVZArd3Isijt20TjweBIo\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/2d068fd1c3cf2437e112fae01e449e43c1c49b11?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Galimbas y rock'n'roll\"}],\"unicorn\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Au Pairs\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb9572da330774833a50c4dbfe\"},\"artist_id\":\"125374\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"20