6:25\",\"date_unix\":1777723200,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1650,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/M0720a5ce36f?dice_id=M0720a5ce36f\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/od386b49424e?dice_id=od386b49424e\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m6a7b18a10b3?dice_id=m6a7b18a10b3\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v6c5d0c28844?dice_id=v6c5d0c28844\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/U1793a663d91?dice_id=U1793a663d91\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/S3f8cd57776e?dice_id=S3f8cd57776e\"},\"perm_name\":\"py6nrp-tommy-ashby-2nd-may-hot-box-chelmsford-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-30/abfd4de9-b4e3-490f-b6f6-0b46ef6abd65.jpg?rect=214%2C0%2C853%2C853\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-30/abfd4de9-b4e3-490f-b6f6-0b46ef6abd65.jpg?rect=0%2C43%2C1280%2C768\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-30/abfd4de9-b4e3-490f-b6f6-0b46ef6abd65.jpg?rect=406%2C0%2C469%2C853\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Prolific Scottish songsmith ***Tommy Ashby*** has spent his career refining a natural talent for capturing the innate beauty of everyday moments in a dulcet combination of ethereal sonics and hushed vocals. His fascination with the human relationship to sound saw him complete a PhD in Psychoacoustics, knowledge of which Tommy deftly utilises throughout his songcraft to illuminate the beautiful minutia of life, nature, and relationships.\\n\\nTommy’s works have amassed over **30 million streams** across Spotify and seen him tour with the likes of *Skinny Living, Banners, Tom Speight, Turin Brakes, Luke Sital-Singh, Jamie Lawson, and Nina Nesbitt* as well as receiving continued support across Spotify Editorial mood playlists, and a multitude of synchs at mainstream media including *Grey’s Anatomy, Atypical (Netflix), Love Island, The Innocents (Netflix), Found (NBC)* and across various placements on advertising and film.\\n\\n***Sponsored by Last Piastre Records.***\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"68db8a45edeab000015b949e\",\"name\":\"Tommy Ashby\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Blood Wolf Moon\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3wihzwWc7SD7plghq6xNxV\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/7057d55538a95c137e2a773484d9d9c84194a91b?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Blood Wolf Moon\"}],\"unicorn\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Tommy Ashby\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb12d7ed8e99d1f7280210bc99\"},\"artist_id\":\"6987\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-14T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-02T19:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-14T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-02T14:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-03T02:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":null,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by New Untouchables.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1771027200,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"298\",\"name\":\"Strongroom Bar\",\"address\":\"120-124 Curtain Rd, Shoreditch, London EC2A 3SQ, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5259644,\"lng\":-0.0801498},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-11-09/01c2cab5-15ea-48e0-a0b4-d9ed0465d9db.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C850%2C850\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"strongroom-bar-4bym\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-02T14:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"3126\",\"name\":\"Strongroom\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"strongroom-bpmk\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"95f5e6a9ee55de96:26\",\"date_unix\":1777726800,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":0,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/V9a4d165fb59?dice_id=V9a4d165fb59\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Pa01a52ded84?dice_id=Pa01a52ded84\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Hfc91ec9c122?dice_id=Hfc91ec9c122\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/we3347dd301d?dice_id=we3347dd301d\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/U50fa4ebc700?dice_id=U50fa4ebc700\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z6ad4327fd3f?dice_id=Z6ad4327fd3f\"},\"perm_name\":\"6d26w8-buckingham-palace-scooter-rally-all-dayer-2nd-may-strongroom-bar-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-14/d2484bd1-e0a6-4166-a1a9-bc76a8977cc4.jpg?rect=0%2C1%2C1204%2C1204\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-14/d2484bd1-e0a6-4166-a1a9-bc76a8977cc4.jpg?rect=0%2C242%2C1204%2C722\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-14/d2484bd1-e0a6-4166-a1a9-bc76a8977cc4.jpg?rect=271%2C0%2C663%2C1206\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"SATURDAY 2 MAY 2026 Scooters meet 1pm carnaby street (route on website)\\n\\n**Live Music** from THE BEATPACK, OSTERBERG WEEKEND & THE FORTY FOURS.\\n\\n**Dance the day away with DJs**: Rob Bailey, Oliver Nyikos, Jake Bonnici, Brian Lindsay & Chris Stancil. + BBQ + 3 BARS SERVING DELICIOUS COCKTAILS & BEERS ALL DAY\\n\\n**Free entry**\\n\\n**Free parking for scooters**\\n\\nScooter comp announced winners announced 4pm\\n\\nMARSHALS REQUIRED FOR THIS EVENT. PLEASE MESSAGE drrobert@btinternet.com\\n\\n\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\n\\n**ROUTE FOR SCOOTER RUN**\\n\\nMeet 1pm at Carnaby Street.\\n\\nLeave 1.10pm Head west to Regent Street.\\n\\nTurn left at traffic lights onto Regent Street towards Piccadilly Circus.\\n\\nAt Piccadilly Circus, take 1st exit onto Shaftesbury Avenue.\\n\\nFollow Shaftesbury Ave until the end and turn right onto A40 Theobalds Ave.\\n\\nContinue into Clerkenwell Road and into Old Street.\\n\\nContinue Straight over Old Street Roundabout (2nd exit)\\n\\nVier Right onto Great Eastern Street\\n\\nTurn left at Curtain Road.\\n\\nContinue for 400 yards to Strongroom.\\n\\n**FREE PARKING INSIDE VENUE FOR SCOOTERS ONLY.**\\n\\nScooter competition announced at approximately 3pm at venue entrance (Please stay with your scooter between 2-3pm if you want to enter)\\n\\n**Categories are:**\\n\\n- Best Lambretta\\n- Best Vespa\\n- Best Mod Scooter\\n\\n\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\n\\n**ULTRA LOW EMISSIONS ZONE**\\n\\nBikes over 40 years old do not have to pay. If your scooter is over 40 years old it qualifies for exemption automatically if you are registered with DVLA for the Historic Vehicle Taxation Class, which you should be if you already drive your scooter on public roads. Check your DVLA Logbook-V5 form or V11 Tax Reminder form for Taxation class info.\\n\\nALL newer scooters will be liable for the £12.50 charge unless you passed the emissions test and registered with TFL. More good news here: It Seems the standard PX 125/200/T5 will pass the emissions test:\\n\\nThis is an 18+ event. This venue has a strict No ID, No entry Policy. Physical government photo ID required, we do not accept photos or copies of ID’s.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"id\":\"6990c798de45d900011cc037\",\"name\":\"Buckingham Palace Scooter Rally + All Dayer\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":3},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-11T13:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-02T14:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-22T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-02T14:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-03T02:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Brixton Disco Festival.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1762866000,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"2722\",\"name\":\"Various Venues, Brixton\",\"address\":\"Brixton, London, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4612794,\"lng\":-0.11561480000000302},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\