ia.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-12/cff0c4fb-522c-496b-8c81-8db4b2ad24ae.jpg?rect=649%2C0%2C751%2C1365\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Tickets back on sale Thursday 22 January - sign up for a reminder\\n\\nBrixton Disco Festival 2026: The 8th Annual Multi-Venue Celebration of Disco Culture in the heart of Brixton\\n\\nTickets will cover entry to multiple Brixton venues.\\n\\nElectric Brixton - Brixton Jamm - Phonox - Brixton Village - Black Cultural Archives - Ritzy - Bricks\\n\\nValid Photo ID will be required for entry to the event. 18+ Event\\n\\nAfter 1am, the ticketholder may not move between licensed venues within the festival. Once you leave one of these venues after this time, you are leaving the festival, with no re-admission.\\n\\nTicket Pickup:\\n\\nWristbands for moving between venues to be collected at the main festival venues - the wristband gains you access into the event. It does not guarantee you entry into one of the licensed venues within the festival. If the venue is at capacity, then you will be able to access one of the other licensed venues.\\n\\nPhysical Photo ID will be required for entry\\n\\n\\\\* Line-up, venues and timings subject to change\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"6911a72ae1d5c500013283de\",\"name\":\"Brixton Disco Festival 2026\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Unlimited Touch - I Hear Music in the Streets - François Kevorkian Mix\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5HgE5eXfu0An2moseSM635\",\"artist\":\"Unlimited Touch - I Hear Music in the Streets - François Kevorkian Mix\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/f92bc4ace965a438ae82cd4b22b9e2431b44727c?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Unlimited Touch - I Hear Music in the Streets - François Kevorkian Mix\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Unlimited Touch - I Hear Music In the Streets (François Kevorkian Mix)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/i-hear-music-in-the-streets-fran%C3%A7ois-kevorkian-mix/281203542?i=281203625&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Unlimited Touch\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/9b/d5/e1/9bd5e108-d513-91d9-d16b-757251ba77d6/mzaf_14472412521834339716.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"I Hear Music In the Streets (François Kevorkian Mix)\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Natasha Diggs\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-02-17/58172a76-fa6d-42b6-926a-a4f7a54f9e33.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C512%2C512\"},\"artist_id\":\"10026\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Norman Jay\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"54289\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Norman Jay MBE\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-04-02/9a13afd6-85c3-42db-b8bd-f41044fcb98c.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"2602\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Dave Lee ZR\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab67616d0000b2733a62450a5cbbcbfdabc9c163\"},\"artist_id\":\"74959\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Joey Negro\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb7a09fdf535f9563747ccf9a1\"},\"artist_id\":\"2592\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":22,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":8,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-07-21T00:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-02T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-07-21T00:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-02T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-02T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_eve