-presents-latinas-of-london-2nd-may-the-jazz-cafe-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-16/ec19ac85-3760-4a3d-8de9-8ce7bc796287.jpg?rect=0%2C67%2C891%2C891\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-16/ec19ac85-3760-4a3d-8de9-8ce7bc796287.jpg?rect=0%2C245%2C891%2C535\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-16/ec19ac85-3760-4a3d-8de9-8ce7bc796287.jpg?rect=164%2C0%2C563%2C1024\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Camden native Desta French leads a sisterhood lineup for a night of the most exciting voices emerging from London’s Latin music scene.\\n\\nDrawing from jazz, hip-hop, and cumbia, Desta made history in 2020 as the first UK Latin artist supported on BBC Radio with an all-Spanish song.\\n\\nShe is joined by virtuoso Peruvian saxophonist Allexa Nava, whose work blends South American heritage with contemporary jazz, and Xativa, whose haunting fusion of folk and jazz reflects her Spanish and Ecuadorian roots.\\n\\nThree artists come together, showcasing the depth and vibrancy of London’s Latin music scene, right in the heart of Camden.\\n\\n\\\\*This event is part of the La Linea Festival 2026\\\\*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"69417eda72d76a00011d4883\",\"name\":\"Desta French presents: Latinas of London\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Ojos Negros\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0E34QOEIpfSEvwkWOUi16T\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/898da6d346d6daaf51324656223dd6e27f923faf?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Ojos Negros\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Desta French\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-02-19/695486ac-fda8-4927-ac67-4ff2f3f94f72.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"7271\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Allexa Nava\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-04-23/d3eaf9d1-711d-40d8-8ac0-68d7e92783d1.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"99965\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"XATIVA\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"51143\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-15T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-02T21:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-17T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-02T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-02T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":31977,\"title\":\"Accessible and carer ticketing information\",\"body\":\"The accessible area for this show is full, and all the free personal assistant tickets have been assigned. We will not be able to accommodate any more requests. We apologise for any inconvenience this may cause.\\n\\nhttps://support.dice.fm/article/179-accessibilty-tickets-for-islington-assembly-hall\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":31976,\"title\":\"Stage Times \",\"body\":\"Stage times are posted at 11am on the day of the show on our venue website.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":47386,\"title\":\"Support the Supports\",\"body\":\"Islington Assembly Hall has launched 'Support the Supports' a campaign to help introduce more music lovers to the up-and-coming acts that open the show! Show up to the venue prior to 8pm and you are in with a chance to win a mystery prize, from drinks vouchers to exclusive merchandise from artists that have previously played the venue. Use the #supportthesupports through socials when you discover a new favourite act at Islington Assembly Hall.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":57461,\"title\":\"Age Restricition\",\"body\":\"This is a 14+ event – 14 and 15 year olds must be accompained by an adult. You may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"order\":3}],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/legal-information/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"679202632593023\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-980124-39\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Live Nation.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1765792800,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"34\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"address\":\"Upper Street, London N1 2UD\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5395894,\"lng\":-0.102482699999996},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-02-10/05562e9c-c684-4beb-b818-4e908bbfb14d.jpg?rect=712%2C0%2C2832%2C2832\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-z8e2\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/about/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlight