:\"https://link.dice.fm/v653a5189fc8?dice_id=v653a5189fc8\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u2e9f426ab6a?dice_id=u2e9f426ab6a\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/I2b3f5113430?dice_id=I2b3f5113430\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W46828c5f348?dice_id=W46828c5f348\"},\"perm_name\":\"g568y5-able-noise-dna-and-jemima-2nd-may-cafe-oto-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-16/30106623-307f-45f9-8cae-9059e619b267.jpg?rect=0%2C270%2C2160%2C2160\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-16/30106623-307f-45f9-8cae-9059e619b267.jpg?rect=0%2C702%2C2160%2C1296\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-16/30106623-307f-45f9-8cae-9059e619b267.jpg?rect=338%2C0%2C1485%2C2700\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"*Dig That Treasure! and Baba Yaga's Hut present*\\n\\n**Dig That Treasure! Festival - Night Two**\\n\\n**Able Noise**\\n\\nAble Noise have become one of the most revered and ineffable acts in the European experimental music circuit. Originating in The Hague (Knegtel) and Athens (Andropoulos), the pair met at art school in the Netherlands and have since refined a sound that channels a process-based artistic practice through a lineage of post-rock and experimental pop music. The duo followed a 2020 GLARC tape with their first 'proper' full-length, released on World Of Echo to great acclaim. Conceptually driven but packing an emotional weight, the duo's live performances see them utilise cassette players, extended practice techniques and shared vocal duties to create a distinctive, spellbinding experience.\\n\\n**DNA? AND?**\\n\\nComprised of young people with Down Syndrome and professional musicians from Oslo’s improv scene, DNA? AND are an improvisational project unlike any other. Making a rare appearance outside their native Norway and a first performance in the UK, DNA? AND? are a raucous, revolutionary and life-affirming band who cannot be missed.\\n\\n**Jemima**\\n\\nThe enigmatic duo Jemima have been quietly making waves with their latest LP, Even The Dog Knows, released in 2025 on All Night Flight Records. The album is a collection of minimal home recordings stitched together out of brooding guitar lines, sparse melodica, field recordings and occasional snippets of voice.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"6914550e207ba300014f9ddb\",\"name\":\"Able Noise + DNA? AND? + Jemima\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Able Noise - To Appease\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3iqxhztsHUQec35wCsKL2X\",\"artist\":\"Able Noise\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/65f20ffe52a7044cea8dbd3e54c5def44f2c6897?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"To Appease\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Able Noise - To Appease\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/to-appease/1757668767?i=1757668977&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Able Noise\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/2b/34/50/2b3450d6-7e25-4614-4854-676073efb561/mzaf_3718071913783386431.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"To Appease\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Able Noise\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"31849\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-17T16:45:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-02T18:45:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-10-17T16:45:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-02T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-02