square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-23/d0e63e28-8ba5-47ca-987b-89598cd002c2.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1333%2C1333\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-23/d0e63e28-8ba5-47ca-987b-89598cd002c2.jpg?rect=0%2C600%2C1333%2C800\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-23/d0e63e28-8ba5-47ca-987b-89598cd002c2.jpg?rect=117%2C0%2C1100%2C2000\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"*\\\\*For accessibility information please see the accessibility information button/link below*\\n\\nNatalie Jane’s anticipated debut album, the world i didn't want (out via Capitol Music Group/10K Projects), takes a joyride through the confessional pop singer-songwriter’s career—with all of the heartache and self-reflection she experienced along the way. The album features the heart-pounding lead single, “how u been?”\\n\\n*the world i didn't want* arrives after 2024’s evocative *Sick To My Stomach* EP and a sold-out international tour. In 2022, Natalie inked her deal with 10K Projects/Capitol Records and released her debut EP, *Where Am I*,? the following year.\\n\\nNatalie’s otherworldly vocal talent has amassed over 2 billion global streams to date. In 2023, she reigned as one of the most viewed musical artists on TikTok in the U.S., landed on GRAMMY.com’s list of “25 Rising Artists To Watch In 2024”, and scored a nomination for the Social Star Award at the 2024 iHeart Radio Music Awards.\\n\\nAs she continues to ascend, Natalie Jane assures to lead with authenticity.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This event is 14+ (14-16s with an adult) - Physical photo ID required\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"68f21e14b0008d0001d7c5b3\",\"name\":\"Natalie Jane\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Natalie Jane\