a9a-bdcb-073875718c8c.jpg?rect=536%2C0%2C1309%2C2380\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"La Línea Festival presents: Las Poderosas - Colombian Queens. An inspiring evening of Colombian female voices, celebrating music, heritage, and activism.\\n\\nHeadlining this exciting double bill is Adriana Lucía, one of Colombia’s most beloved and distinctive voices, celebrated for blending Caribbean rhythms such as cumbia, porro, and vallenato with contemporary pop influences.\\n\\nCo-headlining is Nidia Góngora, the Pacific coast’s iconic voice and guardian of Afro-Colombian heritage. As lead singer of Canalón de Timbiquí, the Latin GRAMMY–nominated singer brings ancestral marimba traditions to global audiences.\\n\\nOpening the show is La Muchacha. Her guitar-led folk and protest-rooted songwriting addresses justice, gender, and community, resonating across Latin America.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"5+. Under 14s must be accompanied by someone aged 16 or over.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"6942d72ebf88ce00019d069d\",\"name\":\" Adriana Lucia, Nidia Gongora and La Muchacha\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Adriana Lucia - A Pedile A Mi Dios\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/a-pedile-a-mi-dios/1223133262?i=1223133437&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Adriana Lucia\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/20/95/3d/20953dbd-5ace-fbbb-9a07-6d3ae045e025/mzaf_14279662758432206999.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"A Pedile A Mi Dios\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Adriana Lucia - A Pedile A Mi Dios\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0IJ8hkhC6KXrg3anXSGzV7\",\"artist\":\"Adriana Lucia\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/21cfc8880b89678f4a91698247a84d0b2af2dc24?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"A Pedile A Mi Dios\"}]