040%2C3200%2C1920\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-14/d2e44cdc-d7f5-45a3-b44e-688306ee1bc4.jpg?rect=500%2C0%2C2200%2C4000\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Ben Watt and Tracey Thorn, best known together as Everything But The Girl, play two shows in May. They will perform as a part-acoustic, part-electronic duo, accompanied by Rex Horan on double bass and Family Stereo's Blake Watt on guitar, drawing on songs from their 40-year careers as both solo artists and a best-selling duo.\\n\\nThe evening will consist of two sets and an interval. Ben and Tracey will be on stage at 8pm. There is no support. Seats allocated on first come first served basis. Doors 7pm.\\n\\n\\\\-----\\n\\nUnion Chapel has limited space for accessibility; carer tickets are subject to availability. If you require a carer ticket or have any other additional access requirements, please contact events@unionchapel.org.uk and include a photo of your Nimbus card or equivalent.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ (under 16s to be accompanied by an adult) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"696238b82f27e300018b1c2f\",\"name\":\"Ben Watt and Tracey Thorn\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Everything But the Girl - Mirrorball (2015 Remaster)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/mirrorball-2015-remaster/1631049357?i=1631049365&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Everything But the Girl\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview122/v4/f0/78/04/f0780435-2f44-1346-119f-5784303ca150/mzaf_6482117625051158763.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Mirrorball (2015 Remaster)\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Ben Watt\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761