ents/2026-02-05/db8612d8-04dc-4c6e-a25a-e446043402e0.jpg?rect=0%2C205%2C1024%2C614\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-05/db8612d8-04dc-4c6e-a25a-e446043402e0.jpg?rect=231%2C0%2C563%2C1024\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Support act: **Two-Man Giant Squid**\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"18+ only (photo ID required)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"69850046538fde0001d9c4d2\",\"name\":\"Flying Moon In Space + Two-Man Giant Squid\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Flying Moon in Space - where are you\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3QqLrmsIolRbFruT34bp6y\",\"artist\":\"Flying Moon in Space\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/8913e2a59c339ff3494ad6153c33ed61f648a2a2?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"where are you\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Flying Moon in Space - where are you\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/where-are-you/1852018451?i=1852018743&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Flying Moon in Space\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/14/07/ea/1407eaa6-30dd-9bc9-4ba1-3dc6d8f9b975/mzaf_12648388648362216833.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"where are you\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Two-Man Giant Squid\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-11-09/0d003a98-27ef-4020-a5c0-8433879a8f63.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"53098\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Flying Moon in Space\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"38396\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"FLYING MOON IN SPACE are a six-piece Band from Leipzig, Germany, born out-of live improvisations that can last hours at a time. This Group released two full-lenght studio albums (s/t, 2020; ZWEI, 2022) through London Label Fuzz Club. A new record will be out in early 2026. Accompanied to this they will be touring again. Their trademark sound is a shape-shifting blend of driving krautrock aesthetics, vivid psychedelic pop and techno-indebted electronics. In energetic live-shows they create an atmosphere that is difficult to resist.\\n\\n\\\"A fearless commitment to experimentalism and an entrancing shape-shifting quality\\\" - Under the Radar (US)\\n\\n\\\"Spectacular...they apply the rhythmic thrust of NEU! and Can to bursts of psychedelia, techno and spacey rock\\\" - Prog Magazine (UK)\\n\\n\\\"An expansive debut album\\\" - Uncut Magazine (UK)\\n\\n\\\"Something very special\\\" - Stern (DE)\\n\\n\\\"Enrapturing and euphoric\\\" - Visions (DE)\\n\\n\\\"Hypnotic motorik rhythms\\\" - Impatto Sonoro (IT)\\n\\n\\\"Impossible to resist\\\" - Indie Rocks! (MX)\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-15T10:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-05T21:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-10-17T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-05T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-05T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":220,\"name\":\"Paper Dress Vintage\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1196387937118330\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":false,\"show_opt_in_form\":false,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Woodburner.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1760518800,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"373\",\"name\":\"Paper Dress Vintage\",\"address\":\"352a Mare Street, London, E8 1HR, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.54733,\"lng\":-0.05467},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-03-29/13fc3fd2-f3f2-4ebb-b479-d3d2d7cf5214.jpg?rect=683%2C0%2C2731%2C2731\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"paper-dress-vintage-ja37\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://paperdressvintage.co.uk/faqs\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-05T19:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"7495\",\"name\":\"Woodburner\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"woodburner-on25\",\"profile_active\":true},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"95f5e6a9ee55de96:66\",\"date_unix\":1778005800,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1550,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k0bc695ec6da?dice_id=k0bc695ec6da\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/vc742222b1c6?dice_id=vc742222b1c6\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k78453091be7?dice_id=k78453091be7\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m12c3b259eb2?dice_id=m12c3b259eb2\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q6b2a6883b54?dice_id=Q6b2a6883b54\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Xb6a63bab7b8?dice_id=Xb6a63bab7b8\"},\"perm_name\":\"l8gy8r-flo-naegeli-5th-may-paper-dress-vintage-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-13/d812bd78-f59f-473b-a2b4-02b24b0b0d84.jpg?rect=1312%2C0%2C3376%2C3376\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-13/d812bd78-f59f-473b-a2b4-02b24b0b0d84.jpg?rect=187%2C0%2C5627%2C3376\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-13/d812bd78-f59f-473b-a2b4-02b24b0b0d84.jpg?rect=2072%2C0%2C1857%2C3376\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Flo Naegeli is a singer, multi-instrumentalist, and songwriter from Dresden, Germany. With a distinctive blend of indie soul and pop, his music draws inspiration from artists like Jordan Rakei, Stevie Wonder, and Benny Sings. Flo’s musical versatility shines through, whether it’s delivering smooth vocals, laying down funky guitar riffs, or crafting infectious bass lines, synth pads, and drums.\\n\\nHis ability to seamlessly write, arrange, and perform gives his sound both authenticity and wide appeal. Currently signed to Amsterdam-based Label Vokall Records, Flo has quickly made waves in the music industry, amassing over 1 million unique listeners on Spotify and attracting more than 145,000 followers on Instagram. His talent and dedication have recently earned him a publishing deal with Warner Chappell, marking an exciting new chapter in his career.\\n\\nWith a fresh live show in the works and several highly anticipated tracks slated for release this year, Flo Naegeli is set to continue his rise as one of indie soul pop’s most exciting new voices.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"68ed6a6aa251070001add86a\",\"name\":\"Flo Naegeli\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\"