cd91dc88?dice_id=Va58cd91dc88\"},\"perm_name\":\"8er3gr-ze-ibarra-6th-may-the-jazz-cafe-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-14/af75f5fa-ce63-476b-aa40-0531b9948116.jpg?rect=0%2C1037%2C4277%2C4277\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-14/af75f5fa-ce63-476b-aa40-0531b9948116.jpg?rect=0%2C1893%2C4277%2C2566\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-14/af75f5fa-ce63-476b-aa40-0531b9948116.jpg?rect=392%2C0%2C3493%2C6351\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Zé Ibarra is redefining Brazilian music with a bold, cinematic sound.\\n\\nOn his second solo album, AFIM, he blends MPB, jazz, and pop into intense, visually striking soundscapes where every note unfolds like a moving painting.\\n\\nA multi-instrumentalist, composer, and producer, Zé first gained acclaim as the voice and pianist of Rio’s band Dônica, winning the Prêmio da Música Brasileira, and later co-founded the Latin Grammy-winning group Bala Desejo.\\n\\nHis music effortlessly bridges classic Brazilian influences with daring experimentation, creating live performances that are as emotional as they are unforgettable.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"69170b392ba63700015a15ab\",\"name\":\"Ze Ibarra\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Zé Ibarra - Como Eu Queria Voltar\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/como-eu-queria-voltar/1687998765?i=1687999142&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Zé Ibarra\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview126/v4/ef/b3/b2/efb3b2c6-f33b-ff95-43a9-057a3b82d9e3/mzaf_11980389159411391097.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Como Eu Queria Voltar\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Zé Ibarra - Como Eu Queria Voltar\",\"red