42d5b05-bf71-4d08-bc02-6f5e22341599.jpg?rect=938%2C0%2C3751%2C3751\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-04/742d5b05-bf71-4d08-bc02-6f5e22341599.jpg?rect=0%2C188%2C5626%2C3376\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-04/742d5b05-bf71-4d08-bc02-6f5e22341599.jpg?rect=1782%2C0%2C2063%2C3751\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Action! Presents:\\n\\nSmash Into Pieces\\n\\n\\\\+ Enemy Inside\\n\\n\\\\+ Dark Divine\\n\\nThis event is 14 and over. 14s to 16s must be accompanied by an adult.  Any ticket holder unable to present valid identification indicating that they are at least 14 years of age will not be admitted to this event and will not be eligible for a refund.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"id\":\"690b18d7ecb2d900013e7ff1\",\"name\":\"Smash Into Pieces\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[],\"unicorn\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Smash Into Pieces\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb4116966c1f780668c5f2c1aa\"},\"artist_id\":\"32183\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true},{\"name\":\"Enemy Inside\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebf566af5cbe4e00d3292cac6a\"},\"artist_id\":\"134169\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Dark Divine\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"75978\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-03-26T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-06T19:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-03-26T00:15:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-06T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-06T23:45:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Hot Box Live Community Interest\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1742947200,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3785\",\"name\":\"Hot Box\",\"address\":\"28 Viaduct Rd, Chelmsford CM1 1TS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.7359952,\"lng\":0.4672127},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-06-29/9ff0c867-708b-4d5c-834d-a927e4e4ae83.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"5eb9799ae1727402966007e1\",\"name\":\"Chelmsford\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.736717,\"lng\":0.466083,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-r7wq\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.hotboxlive.co.uk/accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-06T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"4307\",\"name\":\"Hot Box Live Community Interest \",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-live-community-interest-7v77\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"95f5e6a9ee55de96:77\",\"date_unix\":1778090400,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1650},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o3fa0ec616c7?dice_id=o3fa0ec616c7\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K99a51c4127e?dice_id=K99a51c4127e\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z05d8b9919a6?dice_id=Z05d8b9919a6\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/S36802fddc15?dice_id=S36802fddc15\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Rd7415e2300a?dice_id=Rd7415e2300a\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J213dc631fa6?dice_id=J213dc631fa6\"},\"perm_name\":\"g56yp6-radio-city-sessions-w-the-jackson-line-6th-may-hot-box-chelmsford-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-03-26/b10bda69-7bcf-42a1-9621-0b8f7ca5d782.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-03-26/b10bda69-7bcf-42a1-9621-0b8f7ca5d782.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-03-26/b10bda69-7bcf-42a1-9621-0b8f7ca5d782.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Showcasing the best in Country and Americana songwriting talent from across the UK and beyond, the Radio City Sessions are limited-audience events which take you behind the scenes of the songwriting process. Discover the stories behind the songs, get insights into the songwriting craft, and then hear the songs in the most ‘country’ way possible – a guitar and a vocal.\\n\\nThe songwriters' round is a staple of the Nashville music scene, and the Radio City Sessions capture the intimacy of those events, enabling you, the listener, to discover the stories behind the songs. Each artist performs their own music (whether this has been released under their own name or written for another performer) as well as a cover song that has a particular meaning for them.\\n\\nBetween each song, the artists will tell their stories, exploring their songwriting process and chatting with the other artists on the stage. There will be laughter, there will be fun and there may also be some tears!\\n\\nThe night is hosted by The Jackson Line. Over the last few years, the band have been playing and releasing songs from their sophomore EP, California, recorded in Winnipeg, Canada with Juno Award-winning producer Murray Pulver (The Bros. Landreth, Katy Hurt). The first single, Shade of the Pines, featured on Apple Music’s 'Today's Country' editorial playlist, while the second, Gonna Get To You, was showcased on Baylen Leonard's Front Porch on Absolute Country as well as on Countryline Radio.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"68f238e0196b1b0001bb2dff\",\"name\":\"Radio City Sessions w/ The Jackson Line\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[],\"unicorn\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-12T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-06T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-13T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-06T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-06T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":76550,\"title\":\"What are the age restrictions for this event?\",\"body\":\"This is a 16+ event. Each under 18 must be accompanied by a responsible adult (1:1 ratio). Customers may be requested to provide valid physical photo ID upon entry, this is to ensure customer safety and ensure our legal age requirements are met. For this reason, we request that all customers bring valid ID. Digital or photocopied ID will not be accepted. For further information see Age and ID in FAQ’s. Right of admission reserved.\",\"order\":0}],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"LNZRT\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://lanzaroteworks.com/Privacy-Policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id