yne to Enigma, After is the Y2K, trip- hop, pop band you always knew you needed because you once heard it in a dream.\\n\\nThis is a 16+ event. Each under 18 must be accompanied by a responsible adult (1:1 ratio). Every customer may be requested to provide a valid ID upon entry, this is to ensure customer safety and ensure our legal age requirements are met. For this reason, we request that all customers bring valid ID. For further information see Age and ID in FAQ’s. Right of admission reserved.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"id\":\"6989c388fabb5d00016dc05e\",\"name\":\"After\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"After - 300 dreams\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3gkVuPHTyp4rHH5YrczzOL\",\"artist\":\"After\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/0fdbaed66452e24ca19025e54a261c3e7957ef09?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"300 dreams\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"After - 300 dreams\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/300-dreams/1797401697?i=1797401698&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"After\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/e6/30/db/e630dbf4-4b8d-46c8-5d8a-0861f63125be/mzaf_16587164195456163366.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"300 dreams\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"After\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"80542\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-04T16:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-06T18:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-04T16:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-06T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-06T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":35299,\"title\":\"Venue Accessibility Information\",\"body\":\"The Lexington is an early Victorian building and as such is not easily accessible for anyone with limited mobility. While the main bar is on the ground floor and accessible without steps the music venue is up a flight of stairs. We’re happy to help with access where possible; for any further information please contact us: info@thelexington.co.uk.\",\"order\":0}],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":225,\"name\":\"Bad Vibrations\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"http://www.badvibrations.co.uk/privacy-policy-mojave\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"744309937658318\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Bad Vibrations\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770220800,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"23\",\"name\":\"The Lexington\",\"address\":\"96-98 Pentonville Rd, London N1 9JB\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5317299,\"lng\":-0.111416400000053},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-lexington-jomz\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.thelexington.co.uk/about.php\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-06T19:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\