e trio are undertaking their most extensive tour to date. Soaring vocals, ethereal soundscapes and extraordinary lyrics have made LYR shows an unmissable and unforgettable experience, from a group who are now an essential part of the contemporary music scene.\\n\\nPresented by Communion One.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"691cc83585484c0001502f3b\",\"name\":\"LYR\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"LYR\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebb58d6c5850cc4234ef053df2\"},\"artist_id\":\"18210\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Wed 06 May\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-26T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-07T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-20T08:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-07T18:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-07T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":910,\"name\":\"Global Soul\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://globalsoulradio.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Global Soul.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1764158400,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"14889\",\"name\":\"Soul Mama\",\"address\":\"Ground Floor, 40 Celebration Ave, East Village, London E20 1DB\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.54641,\"lng\":-0.00784},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"68348e77ff502a30257b8e25\",\"name\":\"Stratford\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.545532,\"lng\":-0.007741,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"soul-mama-xeeyl\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-07T18:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"934\",\"name\":\"Global Soul\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-02-20/2ae7b816-a68d-419a-94d1-4a861ca1cfdb.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"global-soul-8er7\",\"profile_active\":true},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"95f5e6a9ee55de96:81\",\"date_unix\":1778175000,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":0},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Lf3bfe8fef7e?dice_id=Lf3bfe8fef7e\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q1396e67cdc2?dice_id=q1396e67cdc2\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Yc93c7ce93a9?dice_id=Yc93c7ce93a9\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ze46dc7c9d8a?dice_id=Ze46dc7c9d8a\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R00c52ce2e7b?dice_id=R00c52ce2e7b\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N663f2dcebc4?dice_id=N663f2dcebc4\"},\"perm_name\":\"2w8g57--salena-melina-malone-sophiz-more-tba-7th-may-soul-mama-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-16/a764ceef-bd4a-41f2-a37f-41d9b4bb26f8.jpg?rect=0%2C544%2C4470%2C4470\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-16/a764ceef-bd4a-41f2-a37f-41d9b4bb26f8.jpg?rect=0%2C1438%2C4470%2C2682\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-16/a764ceef-bd4a-41f2-a37f-41d9b4bb26f8.jpg?rect=707%2C0%2C3057%2C5558\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"**SALENA**\\n\\nSelina-Maria Edbauer aka SALENA, is a singer-songwriter from Austria.\\n\\nShe gained recognition after representing Austria in the Eurovision Song Contest 2023.\\n\\nSALENA began her musical journey at a young age. She performed at The Voice of Germany\\\" in 2017. Known for her R&B/Soul style she wries & produces her own music developing her unique sound.\\n\\nThroughout her career, she has lived in Berlin, Cologne, Vienna, & now London pursuing her passion for music & growing as an artist.\\n\\n**Sophiz**\\n\\nA rising star in London’s music scene with her powerhouse voice! She has a distinctive blend of Canadian, Italian, and Mauritian heritage, her warm and sultry sound captivates hearts.\\n\\nShe weaves memorable hooks & melodies into her own unique sound. Honing her craft she has performed with renowned artists like Lionel Richie, Bonnie Tyler & Andrea Bocelli.\\n\\n**Melina Malone**\\n\\nDublin-born Irish-Greek artist Melina Malone is quickly becoming one of the most exciting voices in neo-soul. Melina has carved out a unique space for herself with her debut album Aphrodite.\\n\\nShe performed at Ireland Music Week & had support from Hotpress Magazine, BBC Radio 1, RTE 2FM, Global Soul, Notion, Noctis Mag, Earmilk, Today FM etc.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"69926010a426db0001dc75a4\",\"name\":\" SALENA, Melina Malone, Sophiz + more TBA\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"SALENA - Love Is More Than Sex\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/7o8gz5OXsu9559yvCmKTAv\",\"artist\":\"SALENA\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/7c230c7d6827be3430d03514c0f16f88a162dcd2?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Love Is More Than Sex\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"ZASKA & Melina Malone - No Right Time\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/no-right-time/1770664810?i=1770664811&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"ZASKA & Melina Malone\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/e7/7a/5c/e77a5c27-ef3a-d801-d130-282c716f6f91/mzaf_8926878159802520342.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"No Right Time\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Melina Malone\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"124291\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Salena\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb526c9a3f29edae4a1814cdd1\"},\"artist_id\":\"134115\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":2,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-11T15:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-07T20:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-13T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-07T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":76192,\"title\":\"How do I arrange a carer/PA ticket?\",\"body\":\"Free PA and Carer tickets can be added onto an existing ticket by reaching out to dice.fm/contact. If possible please request these as soon as possible after purchase of your original ticket to ensure availability. These spots are limited for sold out events.\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":76193,\"title\":\"Can I upgrade my CD to an LP or the other way around on the night?\",\"body\":\"Sometimes this is possible, sometimes not. It all depends on if we have extra stock on the night!\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":76194,\"title\":\"If there is a signing at the event, can I have a photo with the artist?\",\"body\":\"We want everyone to enjoy their moment at these special intimate events. Although this is solely at the discretion of the artist or their management, there may be some cases where they don’t want photos.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":76195,\"title\":\"Do you have accessible seating?\",\"body\":\"Accessible seating can be requested prior to the event through dice.fm/contact or by contacting us directly. Please note that we only have a very limited number of seats available for sold out events.\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":76196,\"title\":\"Is Rough Trade East London wheelchair accessible?\",\"body\":\"Rough Trade East London is wheelchair acccessible via ramp, and has an accessible toilet.\",\"order\":4},{\"id\":76197,\"title\":\"If there is a signing at the event, can I bring other stuff to get signed?\",\"body\":\"This is purely at the discretion of the artist and management.\",\"order\":5},{\"id\":76198,\"title\":\"Where do I pick up my album?\",\"body\":\"When you arrive, a member of staff will scan your ticket and give you your pre-order upon entry. In some cases the album will be shipped and there will be a print to be signed instead. You won’t be able to collect the album on the way out after the event.\",\"order\":6},{\"id\":76199,\"title\":\"How long is the show and is there a support act?\",\"body\":\"Unless stated, there is just one set with no support, these are usually shorter than your average headline set. They’re between 30-50 minutes, playing songs from the new release or a Q&A. There is an hour between the door time and the stage time.\",\"order\":7},{\"id\":76200,\"title\":\"How do I know when it starts?\",\"body\":\"The doors and set times are listed on your DICE ticket and on the DICE event. This differs from store to store.\",\"order\":8},{\"id\":76201,\"title\":\"I don’t have a CD/Record player, can I just buy a ticket for the gig?\",\"body\":\"Unfortunately no, if general entry/free entry tickets aren’t listed there is no way to buy a ticket without an album.\",\"order\":9}],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":88,\"name\":\"Rough Trade\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.roughtrade.com/gb/privacy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"140305603371460\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-1783149-3\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[{\"ticket_type_id\":1192058,\"extra_ids\":[\"1198827\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1192059,\"extra_ids\":[\"1198827\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1192062,\"extra_ids\":[\"1198827\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1192063,\"extra_ids\":[\"1198827\"]}],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Rough Trade.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770822000,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"202\",\"name\":\"Rough Trade East London\",\"address\":\"The Old Truman Brewery, 150 Brick Lane, London E1 6QL\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5217064,\"lng\":-0.0722892999999658},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-04-22/07d0d459-3704-4