HERE-at-Outernet-Accessibility-FAQs\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-05-07T23:00:00+01:00\"}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"8466\",\"name\":\"Outernet Venue Ltd\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"outernet-venue-ltd-96a7\",\"profile_active\":true},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"95f5e6a9ee55de96:92\",\"date_unix\":1778176800,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3927},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Fd96bc3e82b4?dice_id=Fd96bc3e82b4\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ud27814acb23?dice_id=Ud27814acb23\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/tab7b89f046f?dice_id=tab7b89f046f\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/beb08989a7dc?dice_id=beb08989a7dc\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u7d4d0cf7f45?dice_id=u7d4d0cf7f45\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v8e58d352cf5?dice_id=v8e58d352cf5\"},\"perm_name\":\"yovlg2-rationale-7th-may-here-at-outernet-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":\"rescheduled\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-11-06/1b95da88-29ef-45b0-a344-9f02c5f1a4af.jpg?rect=1023%2C302%2C777%2C778\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-11-06/1b95da88-29ef-45b0-a344-9f02c5f1a4af.jpg?rect=60%2C0%2C1800%2C1080\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-11-06/1b95da88-29ef-45b0-a344-9f02c5f1a4af.jpg?rect=663%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"*\\\\*For accessibility information please see the accessibility information button/link below*\\n\\nAGMP Presents:\\n\\nRATIONALE\\n\\nHailing from Zimbabwe, Rationale is a singer, songwriter, and producer, he's a musical storyteller who weaves his extraordinary voice with a profound love for words and melody. His sonic tapestry is a distinctive blend of soulful lyrics and infectious & eclectic productions, returns in 2025 to celebrate a decade of groundbreaking music since the release of Fast Lane.\\n\\nKnown for his work with global artists such as Katy Perry, Rag’n’Bone Man, Bastille, Tom Grennan, Big Wild as well as his recent collaboration with Quantic on the track Unconditional, which was playlisted on BBC Radio 6 Music, Rationale is set to re-emerge with a second album and a landmark performance at London’s cutting-edge venue, HERE at Outernet, on Thursday September 18th, 2025.\\n\\nHis live performances have been described as unforgettable, gracing stages at renowned venues and festivals like Coachella, Lollapalooza, Glastonbury, Latitude, Reading and Leeds to name but a few. Television broadcasts, including appearances on Jools Holland and the Late Night Show with Steven Colbert, have solidified Rationale's presence as an international heritage act.\\n\\nRationale’s new vision is an immersive experience and HERE at Outernet in central London offers world-class visuals with 16K floor-to-ceiling screens, creating a visual and audio performance like no other. This event will combine Rationale’s cinematic soundscapes with stunning visuals, transforming the venue into a fully immersive, multi-sensory experience.’\\n\\nRationale's ability to delve into the intricacies of human connection and the world around him has cultivated a cross-demographic appeal, attracting high-profile fans including Pharrell Williams, Elton John, Ellie Goulding, Justin Timberlake, and Sam Smith.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 16+ event - physical photo ID required\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"672a00ace43dac0001510000\",\"name\":\"Rationale\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"6's to 9's (feat. Rationale)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4DAaQ5InUO23d8yNRbB0Yj\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/a6beaef9400ba799e9836ecd93675e14ea7b6c17?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"6's to 9's (feat. Rationale)\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Rationale - Deliverance\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/gb/album/deliverance/1255843361?i=1255844048&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Rationale\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/apple-assets-us-std-000001/AudioPreview127/v4/12/90/63/1290633e-844b-c97c-195f-c52a1378b51a/mzaf_5795950006779574106.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Deliverance\"}],\"unicorn\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Rationale\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb1a7564da1379b6c9bc9b0244\"},\"artist_id\":\"1220\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-11T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-07T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-11T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-07T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-07T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":627,\"name\":\"Colours\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://colourshoxton.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ad