anny-brixton-yn9r\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"95f5e6a9ee55de96:95\",\"date_unix\":1778178600,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2500,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/kaa971ae216c?dice_id=kaa971ae216c\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/hba950330c7f?dice_id=hba950330c7f\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a6bcffefcf0e?dice_id=a6bcffefcf0e\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/g0042f0b5012?dice_id=g0042f0b5012\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Of21244939fc?dice_id=Of21244939fc\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Gba1765b4ef4?dice_id=Gba1765b4ef4\"},\"perm_name\":\"6dno8b-the-beat-ft-ranking-jnr-7th-may-hootananny-brixton-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-28/a63815d1-bac8-404b-a0bd-cb30ec492912.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-28/a63815d1-bac8-404b-a0bd-cb30ec492912.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-28/a63815d1-bac8-404b-a0bd-cb30ec492912.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"We're happy to announce iconic ska band \\\"The Beat\\\" are coming to Brixton.,🕴🏁🎺🎷\\n\\nThe band crossed over fluidly between soul, reggae, pop and punk, and from these disparate pieces they created an infectious dance rhythm. Along with their contemporaries The Specials, The Selecter, and Madness, The Beat became an overnight sensation and one of the most popular and influential bands of the British ska movement. By Christmas of 1979, The Beat were riding high in the UK charts with their first single, a smoking remake of the classic Smokey Robinson tune Tears of a Clown.\\n\\nFor one night only they head to Brixton with the one and only Ranking JNR\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"697a2aefd9938c000117b65a\",\"name\":\"The Beat Ft. Ranking Jnr\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Mirror in the Bathroom\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/70pR7ZZ3C5mkLWoWtDhl38\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/7d4aee76d71c89fc86a5f83a18b5e256c9e20e03?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Mirror in the Bathroom\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"The Beat - Mirror In the Bathroom\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/gb/album/mirror-in-the-bathroom/1262759655?i=1262759660&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"The Beat\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview118/v4/42/1c/17/421c17fe-6c8d-8808-c30b-5c5a71a431b0/mzaf_4806791816030973230.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Mirror In the Bathroom\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"The Beat\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/0c79b47afe6209537d454305e74810986ad040d8\"},\"artist_id\":\"2949\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Ranking Jnr\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"132376\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"The Beat feat. Ranking Jnr\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"99897\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-27T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-07T16:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-27T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_