re the venue is safe for all customers.\\n\\nFor further information please see https://www.koko.co.uk/faqs and if you have any questions regarding accessibility contact ACCESS@koko.uk.com\",\"order\":0}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Baba Yaga's Hut.\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"927\",\"name\":\"Baba Yaga's Hut\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-11-17/84092575-7b18-48f1-a81d-3e429d6f7b2b.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"baba-yagas-hut-l8ob\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1778178600,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"unicorn\":true,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"90\",\"name\":\"KOKO\",\"address\":\"1A Camden High St, London NW1 7JE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5347507,\"lng\":-0.138054300000022},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/5f06821a-da0b-4985-9a41-f48ae4872759.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C400%2C400\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"koko-z9b7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.koko.co.uk/access-and-facilities\"},\"highlights\":[],\"profile_active\":true,\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-07T19:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":222,\"name\":\"Baba Yaga's Hut\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.babayagashut.com/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1263983106946503\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":918,\"name\":\"KOKO\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.koko.co.uk/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"421051646826847\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":2075,\"name\":\"KOKO 2\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.koko.co.uk/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"2512980718968598\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"secondary_status\":null,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"impression_id\":\"2abc553d5c73db35:3\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Baba Yaga's Hut presents:\\n\\nRival Consoles at Koko\\n\\n\\\\+ Ben Lukas Boysen\\n\\nOne of the UK’s most influential creators of electronic music, Rival Consoles, returns with a brand new audio-visual live show, centred around his new album Landscape from Memory — marking a new chapter in an ongoing quest for refinement and evolution.\\n\\nLondon-based producer Ryan Lee West, better known under the name Rival Consoles, is notable for making synthesisers sound human and atmospheric. Over the course of a critically acclaimed eighteen-year career, his music has diversified from the challenging electronic output of his early EPs, to gradually becoming more conceptual and metamorphic with his albums.\\n\\nIn July 2025 Rival Consoles released his latest studio album Landscape from Memory on Erased Tapes, and is presenting it with a brand new unique performance that will take the form of an immersive audio-visual experience in which he will present material from across the last 15 years of his career and beyond. From deep ambient works to his unique version of techno, and traversing the vast spectrum in between, the show will be a long- form narrative of ideas — many heard live for the first time — with visuals co-created and performed live by Sky Ainsbury.\\n\\n“Impossible to ignore, and hard to forget” — Pitchfork\\n\\n“Ambient leaning, mind expanding electronics” — DJ Mag\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event (under 16s accompanied by an adult)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1764583200,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Rival Consoles\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-07-17/2aa7eeeb-e01e-4e5b-9739-e3a6b4b04c5a.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"1521\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Ben Lukas Boysen\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/8a2c309283b70bde42e4de02e2d7f7884d40a3e0\"},\"artist_id\":\"20255\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-14/ff5a545c-58a7-4b76-a20d-84c4bf60b61f.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C3898%2C3898\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-14/ff5a545c-58a7-4b76-a20d-84c4bf60b61f.jpg?rect=0%2C780%2C3898%2C2339\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-14/ff5a545c-58a7-4b76-a20d-84c4bf60b61f.jpg?rect=877%2C0%2C2144%2C3898\"},\"offers_extras\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"id\":\"69172f2cb82e4a0001038527\",\"name\":\"Rival Consoles + Ben Lukas Boysen\",\"new\":false,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025