 earning a dedicated fanbase and recognition for his innovative sound and impactful lyrics. This year, with the backing of PPL's Momentum Fund, Tsatsamis is due to release his next project.\\n\\nIf you have any queries or would like more information about access at Village Underground, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/3EhSLgF, or contact access@villageunderground.co.uk.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1771236000,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Tsatsamis\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-07-16/54449b0f-eace-4e41-a3f2-617d6d09f787.jpg?rect=0%2C562%2C4492%2C4492\"},\"artist_id\":\"68784\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-13/71f24e2d-e0a6-4cd1-adda-51a0e974be22.jpg?rect=0%2C72%2C5464%2C5464\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-13/71f24e2d-e0a6-4cd1-adda-51a0e974be22.jpg?rect=0%2C2457%2C5464%2C3278\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-13/71f24e2d-e0a6-4cd1-adda-51a0e974be22.jpg?rect=479%2C0%2C4506%2C8192\"},\"offers_extras\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"id\":\"698369a900c5ab0001c2ba37\",\"name\":\"Tsatsamis\",\"new\":false,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-16T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-08T21:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-20T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-08T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-08T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"perm_name\":\"yo6b3a-tsatsamis-8th-may-village-underground-london-tickets\",\"score\":0,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"