and as such is not easily accessible for anyone with limited mobility. While the main bar is on the ground floor and accessible without steps the music venue is up a flight of stairs. We’re happy to help with access where possible; for any further information please contact us: info@thelexington.co.uk.\",\"order\":0}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Crosstown Concerts.\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"29\",\"name\":\"Crosstown Concerts\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-07-01/f0198251-f9b4-4348-9ac3-5dbcf7739d2b.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"crosstown-concerts-zg5p\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1778349600,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_disabled\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"unicorn\":true,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"23\",\"name\":\"The Lexington\",\"address\":\"96-98 Pentonville Rd, London N1 9JB\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5317299,\"lng\":-0.111416400000053},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-lexington-jomz\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.thelexington.co.uk/about.php\"},\"highlights\":[],\"profile_active\":true,\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1184,\"name\":\"Crosstown Concerts\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.crosstownconcerts.com/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"secondary_status\":null,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"impression_id\":\"2abc553d5c73db35:32\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Crosstown Concerts Presents...\\n\\nPUNCHBAG\\n\\nVeering between chaos and clarity where sweetness clashes with distortion, south-London sibling-duo PUNCHBAG deliver blistering, unfiltered pop-punk that hits fast, loud and straight to the gut.\\n\\nCusping the end of 2025 with their debut EP, ‘I’m Not Your Punchbag’, a sub-15-minute rush which quickly drew tastemaker attention from NME (Radar), Dork (HYPE cover, ★★★★), DIY (★★★★), CLASH (Next Wave), Wonderland, and praise from PAPER, Stereogum, Brooklyn Vegan, Popjustice and more.\\n\\nNamed a Spotify RADAR: First Listen artist, the band have sold-out multiple London headline shows and hit major festival stages including Reeperbahn, Iceland Airwaves, The Great Escape and Live At Leeds, alongside a live performance on Made In Chelsea.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770372000,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"PUNCHBAG\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-17/7fc7808c-61c5-433c-b7da-8776b1d9da69.jpg?rect=0%2C625%2C2500%2C2500\"},\"artist_id\":\"103745\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Colliding the raw unfiltered energy of punk, with the overflowing ecstasy of pop, emerges PUNCHBAG. A new electrifying brother-sister duo, from South London. With fierce tempos and ferocious energy, their music is an explosively cathartic release of raw intensity and unapologetic fun.\\n\\nThis is the sound of today’s tough realities, transmuting personal and collective life material into an earthquake of alternative-pop. PUNCHBAG propels listeners into a collision of chaos and catharsis, with music that wrestles with change, realisation and recovery.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-05/5031fecb-b3ed-451e-8a96-681224be7057.jpg?rect=638%2C0%2C3825%2C3825\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-05/5031fecb-b3ed-451e-8a96-681224be7057.jpg?rect=0%2C383%2C5100%2C3060\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-05/5031fecb-b3ed-451e-8a96-681224be7057.jpg?rect=1498%2C0%2C2104%2C3825\"},\"offers_extras\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"id\":\"6984d39f0c234900017b3902\",\"name\":\"PUNCHBAG\",\"new\":false,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-06T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-09T16:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-09T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-09T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"perm_name\":\"wwevgx-punchbag-9th-may-the-lexington-london-tickets\",\"score\":0,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3066,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"max_tickets\":8,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A3c345c6e00a?dice_id=A3c345c6e00a\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u854fdc2bf4a?dice_id=u854fdc2bf4a\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/uff828596bf4?dice_id=uff828596bf4\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Xfd0c8efbf5c?dice_id=Xfd0c8efbf5c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/qa9ac62ac0fb?dice_id=qa9ac62ac0fb\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b22f86e7b00a?dice_id=b22f86e7b00a\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Ego Ella May - What You Waiting For\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/what-you-waiting-for/1854103610?i=1854103923&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Ego Ella May\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/91/d3/72/91d37207-d31d-2c05-fa9a-da6c2cd605bb/mzaf_2837518837100470978.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"What You Waiting For\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":31977,\"title\":\"Accessible and carer ticketing information\",\"body\":\"The accessible area for this show is full, and all the free personal assistant tickets have been assigned. We will not be able to accommodate any more requests. We apologise for any inconvenience this may cause.\\n\\nhttps://support.dice.fm/article/179-accessibilty-tickets-for-islington-assembly-hall\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":31976,\"title\":\"Stage Times \",\"body\":\"Stage times are posted at 11am on the day of the show on our venue website.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":47386,\"title\":\"Support the Supports\",\"body\":\"Islington Assembly Hall has launched 'Support the Supports' a campaign to help introduce more music lovers to the up-and-coming acts that open the show! Show up to the venue prior to 8pm and you are in with a chance to win a mystery prize, from drinks vouchers to exclusive merchandise from artists that have previously played the venue. Use the #supportthesupports through socials when you discover a new favourite act at Islington Assembly Hall.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":57461,\"title\":\"Age Restricition\",\"body\":\"This is a 14+ event – 14 and 15 year olds must be accompained by an adult. You may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"order\":3}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Woodburner.\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1607\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-78g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1778349600,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"unicorn\":true,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"34\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"address\":\"Upper Street, London N1 2UD\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5395894,\"lng\":-0.102482699999996},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-02-10/05562e9c-c684-4beb-b818-4e908bbfb14d.jpg?rect=712%2C0%2C2832%2C2832\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-z8e2\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/about/accessibility/\"},\"highlights\":[],\"profile_active\":true,\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/legal-information/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"679202632593023\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-980124-39\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"secondary_status\":null,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"impression_id\":\"2abc553d5c73db35:33\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Drawing from an expansive palette of R&B, neo soul, contemporary jazz, and poetic songwriting, British-Nigerian award-winning singer-songwriter and musician Ego Ella May is creating music that resonates deeply across generations and cultures. Her work is united by her profound reverence for jazz; for Ego, it’s the “root of it all,” and a fearless commitment to emotional truth. Her genre-defying sound has cemented her as one of the most compelling voices in contemporary music.\\n\\nHer critically acclaimed debut album, Honey For Wounds, earned her widespread recognition, including Best Jazz Act at the 2020 MOBO Awards and Best Vocalist at the 2021 Jazz FM Awards.\\n\\nIn 2026, Ego ushers in a new chapter with the release of her highly anticipated sophomore album, Good Intentions, arriving 20th March 2026. It’s her most daring and ambitious work to date, blending warm jazz textures, alt-soul explorations, intricate harmonies, and lyrical storytelling. Lead singles “What We Do” and “We’re Not Free” offer a glimpse into the album’s thematic richness, examining community, liberation, vulnerability, and the complicated beauty of everyday human experience.\\n\\n*Islington Assembly Hall has launched 'Support the Supports' a campaign to help introduce more music lovers to the up-and-coming acts that open the show! Show up to the venue prior to 8pm and you are in with a chance to win a mystery prize, from drinks vouchers to exclusive merchandise from artists that have previously played the venue. Use the #supportthesupports through socials when you discover a new favourite act at Islington Assembly Hall.*\\n\\n*By purchasing a ticket to this event you are agreeing to adhere to Islington Assembly Hall's terms and conditions: https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/customer-terms-conditions-2022/*\\n\\n*All tickets to shows at Islington Assembly Hall are subject to a Venue Levy of £1.50 + VAT. As a Grade II listed building, this levy will be reinvested into Islington Assembly Hall and its services, meaning the customer experience can continue to be enhanced.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1768989600,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Ego Ella May\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/2149c4a6-5a31-4f2c-ab0c-2431ac5f5875.jpg?rect=0%2C53%2C535%2C535\"},\"artist_id\":\"6951\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-20/16be7dfb-8100-4634-ac16-9aa2d9c9c0ba.jpg?rect=0%2C305%2C2412%2C2412\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-20/16be7dfb-8100-4634-ac16-9aa2d9c9c0ba.jpg?rect=0%2C787%2C2412%2C1447\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-20/16be7dfb-8100-4634-ac16-9aa2d9c9c0ba.jpg?rect=375%2C0%2C1662%2C3021\"},\"offers_extras\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"id\":\"696fc582b76d3f0001e76744\",\"name\":\"Ego Ella May \",\"new\":false,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-21T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-09T21:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-23T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-09T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"perm_name\":\"rynne5-ego-ella-may-9th-may-islington-assembly-hall-london-tickets\",\"score\":0,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1700,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E38d10122457?dice_id=E38d10122457\",\"post_competitio