":\"PISS\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-07-14/b53103bc-762e-4b1b-b025-50cd696a0af9.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"122364\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"PISS is a noisy, genre-bending 4-piece punk band from Vancouver B.C. The band combines music, poetry, sound collage, performance art, and various mediums of visual art to address complex themes that blur the line between personal and political.\\n\\nPowered by a combination of thoughtful musicianship, energetic live performances, and a crystal-clear vision of a safer underground community, PISS writes punk music that aims to transcend the limitations of a well-established genre by pulling inspiration from a wide range of unexpected influences: literary giants, philosophers, filmmakers, painters, psychoanalysts, activists, children, members of a German anarcho-feminist militant group, and audience members from their shows, to name a few. These voices represent varying ideological beliefs about gender-based violence and enable PISS to create art that depicts challenging and controversial issues such as sexual violence and enculturated gender norms without reduction, romanticisation, polemics, or dogmatism.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-01/b5c25088-a2da-4d2e-a1fa-f65b8d7642a1.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C816%2C816\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-01/b5c25088-a2da-4d2e-a1fa-f65b8d7642a1.jpg?rect=0%2C163%2C816%2C490\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-01/b5c25088-a2da-4d2e-a1fa-f65b8d7642a1.jpg?rect=184%2C0%2C449%2C816\"},\"offers_extras\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"id\":\"6977b81d0ca8a20001040f92\",\"name\":\"PISS\",\"new\":false,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-04T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-11T18:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-06T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-11T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-11T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"perm_name\":\"g5dqbb-piss-11th-may-the-lexington-london-tickets\",\"score\":0,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3809},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Id34ebbf6815?dice_id=Id34ebbf6815\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v4e191285847?dice_id=v4e191285847\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/fcee1b14e35e?dice_id=fcee1b14e35e\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ac7dfbf37cae?dice_id=ac7dfbf37cae\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Wb2de6a0291f?dice_id=Wb2de6a0291f\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/sd99a06bdc42?dice_id=sd99a06bdc42\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Ismael Serrano - Absoluto\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/absoluto/896847241?i=896847335&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Ismael Serrano\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/d0/53/48/d05348de-7ea7-0159-f83b-9a7d2ee9a15a/mzaf_17697760588637983381.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Absoluto\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Ismael Serrano - Absoluto\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2rjrNvxkCcx7bpwMmhBcfU\",\"artist\":\"Ismael Serrano\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/29b77f793f4cbe56bb367aa3a348780d6a6e44a4?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Absoluto\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":54644,\"title\":\"What are the age restrictions for this event?\",\"body\":\"This is a 16+ event. All attendees 16-17s must be accompanied by a responsible adult who is 18 or older (1:1 ratio). To verify age, ID may be requested. We advise all customers to bring valid ID. For further information, see Age and ID in FAQs. Right of admission reserved.\",\"order\":0}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Go to beat. \",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"11564\",\"name\":\"EartH\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"earth-yxox\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1778524200,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"unicorn\":true,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1955\",\"name\":\"EartH\",\"address\":\"11 Stoke Newington Rd, London N16 8BH, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5509892,\"lng\":-0.07532500000002074},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-02-02/92037b31-0756-4c73-9f1b-11e5c4753296.jpg?rect=683%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"earth-76a7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://bit.ly/44dzl75\"},\"highlights\":[],\"profile_active\":true,\"space_name\":\"EartH Theatre\",\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-11T19:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":863,\"name\":\"EartH\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://earthackney.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"498772217287544\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-6QJEY8LKG2\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":\"781332317\",\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":\"nxkPCNyPg5caEN3eyPQC\",\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"secondary_status\":null,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"impression_id\":\"2abc553d5c73db35:60\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"This event will take place in EartH Theatre.\\n\\nIsmael Serrano finally arrives in London, Dublin, Berlin, and Brussels with a very intimate and special show: just guitar and voice. A journey through his greatest hits and a preview of his new songs. Pieces that invite us to live in the present with intensity and to seek the poetry found in everyday life. A close encounter with his music, his story, and his essence.\\n\\nIsmael Serrano (1974), a singer-songwriter raised in Vallecas (Madrid), released his first album Atrapados en azul in 1997. Since then, he has released 11 studio albums and 4 live albums, earning several gold and platinum records, as well as two major award nominations: a Goya Award nomination for Best Original Song for KM. 0 and a Latin Grammy nomination in 2001 for Best Sound Engineering.\\n\\nHis performances go beyond the conventional concert format: they are stage productions with a strong theatrical character. On stage, Serrano offers a kind of narrative thread that ties the songs together, giving a poetic depth to the musical experience\\n\\nFor more information on access at EartH, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/44dzl75 or contact us at access@earthackney.co.uk\\n\\nEartH is a social enterprise committed to supporting new musicians, with music studios in the venue that are completely free for young artists to use. When you attend a show in EartH Theatre, head to the back of the space to rent a cushion for just £2. Not only will you get to sit more comfortably, but all proceeds go towards funding Studio 36. Find out more here: https://earthackney.co.uk/about/studio-36/\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1760950800,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":{\"description\":\"At EartH, we want our space to give back to the community. That’s why we teamed up with Progression Sessions to open Studio 36 inside our venue. Studio 36 provides music making facilities and expertise for free to young musicians in London who face a variety of barriers that might prevent them from making the most of their creativity and talent. Every donation helps keep Studio 36 open and accessible, so that more young people can find their voice, develop their talents and feel supported as they take their next steps.\\n\\nA percentage of your donation goes towards a payment processing fee (DICE keeps none of this fee). For a £10 donation, the charity gets £9.75.\\n\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-28/af5fb538-b9c7-4f41-bf11-48d1d9d6d45a.jpeg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"variants\":[{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":100,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTEwMzAyNCwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTE2NTk2LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1NjoxNS40NDkwMzRaIiwicHJpY2UiOjEwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MjY1OCwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MzAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":300,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTEwMzAyNCwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTE2NTk2LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1NjoxNS40NDkwNTFaIiwicHJpY2UiOjMwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MjY1OSwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6NTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":500,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTEwMzAyN