 survival strategies shaped by desire, distraction, and cultural pressure.\\n\\nThe album moves fluidly across genres, from synth pop to techno, grunge to metal cues, with epic balladic moments seeded throughout. Co-Produced by Golestaneh and Jorge Elbrecht, Delusion features collaborations with visual artists Camille Henrot, Estelle Hoy and Sandra Mujinga and is set for release April 24th, 2026 on Golestaneh’s own new label fear of luxury, distributed by Cascine/Secretly.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770220800,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Tempers\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb81e1efb5a6d3f7caa04d3cf8\"},\"artist_id\":\"9568\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/8ab04ad6-2656-429d-ab9d-255e922c2805.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C4096%2C4096\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/8ab04ad6-2656-429d-ab9d-255e922c2805.jpg?rect=0%2C819%2C4096%2C2458\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/8ab04ad6-2656-429d-ab9d-255e922c2805.jpg?rect=922%2C0%2C2253%2C4096\"},\"offers_extras\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"id\":\"69836dc800c5ab0001894071\",\"name\":\"Tempers\",\"new\":false,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-04T16:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-12T19:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-04T16:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-12T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-12T23:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"perm_name\":\"wwe8er-tempers-12th-may-ica-institute-of-contemporary-arts-london-tickets\",\"score\":0,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\