 The O2: \",\"body\":\"Tickets will be in The O2 venue app as they’re handling ticket scanning for this event. We will email you when your tickets are available in the app.\\n\\nHow to use your tickets:\\n\\n1\\\\. Get The O2 venue app - https://www.theo2.co.uk/visit-us/the-o2-app\\n\\n2\\\\. Sign up using the email you used to purchase your tickets on DICE\\n\\n3\\\\. At the door, show your tickets on the venue app (not DICE)\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":56090,\"title\":\"Can I change my seat?\",\"body\":\"Seats can’t be changed after booking, so please review your selection carefully before checkout.\",\"order\":3}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Live Nation.\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"24\",\"name\":\"Live Nation\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"live-nation-z6d3\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1778693400,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_disabled\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"unicorn\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"584\",\"name\":\"The O2, London\",\"address\":\"O2 Arena\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5025248,\"lng\":0.00366410000003725},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-o2-london-q2xy\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"highlights\":[],\"profile_active\":true,\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-13T18:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1707,\"name\":\"Live Nation UK\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.livenation.co.uk/privacy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixe