 the globe is what keeps us going year on year. It goes without saying that we’re absolutely buzzed to bring Way Dynamic to London in May and Wales this August for GM26!\\n\\nThis show marks Way Dynamic’s first ever UK show, so catch them early, they're set for beautiful things. Oh and if you’ve not heard summer release ‘Massive Shoe’, get it on immediately… its been on repeat at GMHQ.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770199200,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Way Dynamic\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb83d0f86e3fa5efa6ce78ef87\"},\"artist_id\":\"133406\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-03/ce26e40b-f9c5-41b0-811e-032eafeead57.jpg?rect=0%2C54%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-03/ce26e40b-f9c5-41b0-811e-032eafeead57.jpg?rect=0%2C351%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-03/ce26e40b-f9c5-41b0-811e-032eafeead57.jpg?rect=169%2C0%2C743%2C1350\"},\"offers_extras\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"id\":\"69809b6bcd549a0001223dce\",\"name\":\"Way Dynamic\",\"new\":false,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-04T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-13T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-04T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-13T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-13T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"perm_name\":\"6d23p8-way-dynamic-13th-may-club-cheek-london-tickets\",\"score\":0,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_do