entity with sounds from the vibraphone, dark guitar layers and intricate ethereal harmonies. Winner of Welsh Album of the Year 2021, Mared has performed at leading festivals included Focus Wales, BreakOut West in Canada and Celtic Connections. Her upcoming EP 'Everything I Left Behind' comes out March 27th and will also see Mared's first vinyl. The vinyl will be on sale on the tour and combines the new EP with a 7 piece EP recorded at Lightship 95 in Greenwich, funded by BBC Horizons Launchpad.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1769385600,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Mared\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"84018\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/d11d15d9-914a-49c1-91ff-52100e4c359a.jpg?rect=0%2C608%2C3648%2C3648\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/d11d15d9-914a-49c1-91ff-52100e4c359a.jpg?rect=0%2C1338%2C3648%2C2189\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/d11d15d9-914a-49c1-91ff-52100e4c359a.jpg?rect=487%2C0%2C2675%2C4864\"},\"offers_extras\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"id\":\"6977957ecc43c900013f0fb3\",\"name\":\"Mared EP Launch Party\",\"new\":false,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-26T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-13T18:45:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-26T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-13T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-13T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"perm_name\":\"xe2oae-mared-ep-launch-party-13th-may-next-door-records-two-london-tickets\",\"score\":0,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}