\":{\"description\":\"Baba Yaga's Hut Presents:\\n\\nSmote\\n\\n£19 (inc. fees) - 100 Club - 13th May 2026\\n\\nSMOTE, once a solo endeavor by Daniel Foggin, now expanded to a fuller ensemble blends traditional instrumentation — creaking strings, funeral drums, somber winds — with thunderous synth work and desolate guitar to craft drone and dirge.\\n\\nThe new album “A Grand Stream” (Rocket Recordings 2024) is a full-scale psychic voyage into the ether and a drone-and-repetition-fuelled series of incantations that takes simple, primal ingredients and utilises them for the purposes of aural sorcery, summoning spectres and revelations aplenty in its wake.\\n\\nSmote’s austerity is one that refreshingly escapes the usual trappings of avant-garde music, simply by the force of its elemental vitality and its grounding of negative aural space. Its overpowering wall of sound still holds enough natural grace that it escapes the oppressive abusiveness of, say, Swans, and yet it is relentless in its forward thrust.\\n\\n“A Grand Stream” takes the band – one who’ve always eschewed the cliches and stumbling blocks of all contemporary psych rock in favour of their own unique and wyrd vision – into a realm in which they transcend through willpower and skill alike into something preternaturally thrilling and intimidating, mapping out their own crepuscular new territory in the paranormal.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1757327400,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Smote\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"49668\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-07/99ec6cdf-63a3-4399-b5e5-c77d34028f76.jpg?rect=205%2C0%2C833%2C833\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-07/99ec6cdf-63a3-4399-b5e5-c77d34028f76.jpg?rect=0%2C44%2C1242%2C745\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-07/99ec6cdf-63a3-4399-b5e5-c77d34028f76.jpg?rect=392%2C0%2C458%2C833\"},\"offers_extras\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"id\":\"68bdd089b5772c00010d0383\",\"name\":\"Smote\",\"new\":false,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-09-08T11:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-13T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-09-10T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-13T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-13T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"perm_name\":\"k6o328-smote-13th-may-the-100-club-london-tickets\",\"score\":0,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"event_tag\":null},{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"seats_io_event_id\":\"fa426543-5224-429c-95a0-230777b050e2\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":2750},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m6838eff695f?dice_id=m6838eff695f\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A09d2a5ed442?dice_id=A09d2a5ed442\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ja659c7c0368?dice_id=ja659c7c0368\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p194e9d6371c?dice_id=p194e9d6371c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Me16aa0a60d4?dice_id=Me16aa0a60d4\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/nb305295f72b?dice_id=nb305295f72b\"},\"previews\":[],\"faqs\":[],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Serious.\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1432\",\"name\":\"Serious\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"serious-nyo9\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1778698800,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"unicorn\":true,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"201\",\"name\":\"Barbican Hall\",\"address\":\"Barbican Centre, Silk Street, London EC2Y 8DS\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.519853,\"lng\":-0.0916614000000209},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"barbican-hall-ja9d\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.barbican.org.uk/your-visit/accessibility/access-scheme\"},\"highlights\":[],\"profile_active\":true,\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-13T19:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1446,\"name\":\"Serious\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://serious.org.uk/serious-ticketing-t-cs\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"secondary_status\":null,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"impression_id\":\"2abc553d5c73db35:88\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Cuban pianist and composer Roberto Fonseca follows this philosophy: “express more with fewer notes”. It’s a solid foundation for his music, which pulls from reggaeton, bossa nova and Afrobeat. Dubbed \\\"the most exciting pianist in Cuba\\\" Fonsesca’s percussive yet fluid performances are not to be missed.\\n\\nWhether you are familiar or not with the moves and steps of the Mambo, Rumba or Bolero, the urge to sway to the melodies played by an artist considered to have breathed a new life into Cuban music, will be irresistible.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"5+. Under 14s must be accompanied by an adult.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"fa426543-5224-429c-95a0-230777b050e2\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"19f74e3d-efaf-4a71-9476-13370248a171\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"announcement_date_unix\":1764064800,\"seats_io_public_key\":\"19f74e3d-efaf-4a71-9476-13370248a171\",\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Roberto Fonseca\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb68dae947e8834cec2a384b38\"},\"artist_id\":\"26776\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-25/767a93ae-84e1-4856-b19c-c61bd3f22e49.jpg?rect=1444%2C0%2C5773%2C5773\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-25/767a93ae-84e1-4856-b19c-c61bd3f22e49.jpg?rect=0%2C289%2C8660%2C5196\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-25/767a93ae-84e1-4856-b19c-c61bd3f22e49.jpg?rect=2743%2C0%2C3175%2C5773\"},\"offers_extras\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"id\":\"6929975735bac9000110b512\",\"name\":\"Roberto Fonseca: La Gran Diversion\",\"new\":false,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-25T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-13T12:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-28T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-13T20:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-13T23:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"perm_name\":\"mx8kvw-roberto-fonseca-la-gran-diversion-13th-may-barbican-hall-london-tickets\",\"score\":0,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Wed 13 May\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2987,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"max_tickets\":6,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Xcab83d7469c?dice_id=Xcab83d7469c\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/X2ad48a43368?dice_id=X2ad48a43368\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Uae6bca2d07a?dice_id=Uae6bca2d07a\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/I3dc25fdd885?dice_id=I3dc25fdd885\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N8a53334ac78?dice_id=N8a53334ac78\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Xc5008f5ed42?dice_id=Xc5008f5ed42\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"John 5 - Black Widow of la Porte\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/black-widow-of-la-porte/260531058?i=260533467&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"John 5\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/f7/75/eb/f775eb02-167e-a61c-c4ad-6d6cdc3b3539/mzaf_9511867419111007641.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Black Widow of la Porte\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"John 5 - Black Widow of La Porte\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5qzba849erpnQeyp8zg135\",\"artist\":\"John 5\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/49c53b19dfa63e20c0880afc507cbe733547d324?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Black Widow of La Porte\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":75682,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":75683,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":75684,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Underworld.\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1778781600,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"unicorn\":true,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"highlights\":[],\"profile_active\":true,\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-14T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-05-14T23:00:00+01:00\"}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"secondary_status\":null,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[{\"ticket_type_id\":1190138,\"extra_ids\":[\"1196870\"]}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"impression_id\":\"2abc553d5c73db35:89\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Guitarist JOHN 5 will bring his extraordinary talents to the UK and Europe in May 2026.\\n\\nApart from a few shows in 2016 this is John’s first ever solo tour in these territories.\\n\\nFor over 30 years, JOHN 5 has been one of the most in-demand guitar players on the planet.\\n\\nJohn has shared stages and recording studios with Rob Zombie, Marilyn Manson, David Lee Roth, Lynyrd Skynyrd, Meat Loaf, Dolly Parton and more and is now a member of Motley Crue.\\n\\nSince 2011 John has released a dozen solo albums highlighting his unique style of playing that has been entertaining and impressing audiences around world.\\n\\nThe tour will feature twelve UK appearances along with shows in Germany, the Netherlands, Belgium, Poland and the Czech Republic.\\n\\nJohn comments “I don’t think I’ve ever been more excited for a tour than this one coming up. I haven’t been there in so long and I can’t wait to say hello and have a great time with everyone. Super SUPER excited.”\\n\\n\\\\-\\n\\nJOHN 5 VIP MEET & GREET tickets include:\\n\\n\\\\- Pre-show Meet-and-Greet with JOHN 5  \\n\\\\- JOHN 5 signing session  \\n\\\\- Personal photo opportunity  \\n\\\\- JOHN 5 guitar pick set  \\n\\\\- Exclusive VIP laminate  \\n\\\\- Limited edition JOHN 5 tour poster\\n\\n14+. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID\",\"highlights\":[]},\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770804000,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"donation\":null,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"John 5\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebdb6620693d4000420d2cf6eb\"},\"artist_id\":\"118942\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/5cf188e4-5872-4b1a-95e2-9df9eaad0380.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C4000%2C4000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/5cf188e4-5872-4b1a-95e2-9df9eaad0380.jpg?rect=