n, London - Friday at Desertfest welcomes a diverse selection of the finest in stoner rock and underground music, including legendary reunions from the likes of California cult legends HERMANO (playing their first UK show in over two decades), London doom icons CAPRICORNS (playing their first live show in 18 years), and Florida sludge pioneers CAVITY.\\n\\nElsewhere, Godfather of Desert Rock, Mario Lalli returns to London with RUBBER SNAKE CHARMERS Rubber and Danish heavy psych instrumental wizards CAUSA SUI play the UK for the first time in their career.\\n\\nFriday’s full line up:\\n\\nHERMANO, CAUSA SUI, GNOME, CAPRICORNS, RUBBER SNAKE CHARMERS\\n\\nHÄLLAS, SOLACE, CWFEN, WITCHSORROW, LORQUINS ADMIRAL, BISMUT\\n\\nCAVITY, MOLOCH, DAUFODT, PRAETORIAN, KUSHTUHULU, IRON SLUG\\n\\nMEATDRIPPER, HASHTRONAUT, SUPERNAUGHTY, IRON RAT, SUPERSEED\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event (Photo ID Required).\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":false,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":12},\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Desertscene\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.desertscene.co.uk/#home\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"886112888082702\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-250881701-1\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Green Lung - Let the Devil In\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4dePQcQTcRj4K4cHjwcC1v\",\"artist\":\"Green Lung\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/93ff5d520fb3527878799db0cb3e04d88cb9f7fa?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a023