tps://link.dice.fm/V6f81f461bea?dice_id=V6f81f461bea\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Gefa5e3f1528?dice_id=Gefa5e3f1528\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/if43bfd95189?dice_id=if43bfd95189\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K17097ed6da5?dice_id=K17097ed6da5\"},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"max_tickets\":8,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Clapham Grand.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"3022d5cbdb7b3c7a:9\",\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-26T11:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-15T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-26T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-15T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-15T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"announcement_date_unix\":1769425200,\"offers_extras\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3500,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"id\":\"6973ad4420b937000135803e\",\"name\":\"Indiepalooza Festival - Kopycat Killers v Scam Fender v Subarctic Monkeys v Oasis96 v Kasabiaint v Kaiser Cheats\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"seating\":null,\"perm_name\":\"oegd6y-indiepalooza-festival-kopycat-killers-v-scam-fender-v-subarctic-monkeys-v-oasis96-v-kasabiaint-v-kaiser-cheats-15th-may-the-clapham-grand-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-23/c10d30b7-da2d-47fa-8937-dd3e61ae3e42.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-23/c10d30b7-da2d-47fa-8937-dd3e61ae3e42.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-23/c10d30b7-da2d-47fa-8937-dd3e61ae3e42.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"score\":0,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**FRIDAY 15TH MAY / DOORS & BARS OPEN 6PM / SHOW STARTS APPROX. 1 HOUR AFTER DOORS**\\n\\n**This is an 18+ event**\\n\\n6 Tribute Bands, 1 Night, YOU chose the anthems!\\n\\nIndiepalooza is an amazing touring indie-rock tribute festival featuring leading tributes to (ALL on ONE night!) :-\\n\\nThe Killers, Arctic Monkeys, Oasis, Sam Fender, Kasabian + Kaiser Chiefs....\\n\\nThis indoor show has sold out 1000 cap+ venues all over the country and is in it’s 4th year.\\n\\n“This. Is. Great. He is selling out all over the UK!” - Chris Moyles, Radio X\\n\\n“This is Great. He does sound great to be fair!” - Greg James, Radio 1\\n\\n\\\"The BEST tribute band I've ever seen, and I've shot HUNDREDS\\\" - Duncan Cowley\\n\\nTHE KOPYCAT KILLERS, SUBARCTIC MONKEYS, OASIS 96, KASABIAN'T, SCAM FENDER and KAISER CHEATS are amongst the best tributes in the world, playing huge festivals both in the UK and abroad to thousands, and now ALL COMING TOGETHER on this special touring festival show.\\n\\nHOURS OF WALL TO WALL BANGERS ALL NIGHT!!! - Expect Mr Brightside, Don’t Look Back In Anger, I Predict A Riot, Fire, Seventeen Going Under, I Bet That You Look Good On The Dancefloor, Hypersonic Missiles, Somebody Told Me, Wonderwall, Ruby, Mardy Bum, Human, When You Were Young, Club Foot, Will We Talk?, Do I Wanna Know, Supersonic, All These Things That I’ve Done, She’s Electric, Why’d You Only Call Me When You’re High, Cigarettes and Alcohol, Read My Mind, Florescent Adolescent, Glamorous Indie Rock N Roll, R U Mine?, Smile Like You Mean It, Spit Of You, 505, Getting Started, Snap Out Of It, People Watching, Oh My God! and many more!\\n\\n**If you have any questions please scroll down to the FAQ section below.**\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_