Orchestra\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-07-17/d85c81fc-e788-467a-9473-27102af7d73b.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"2233\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"seating\":null,\"perm_name\":\"l8b7mb-submotion-orchestra-15th-may-earth-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-03/cc1e0303-e02e-48a6-89d3-393ccbb69bfb.jpg?rect=0%2C28%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-03/cc1e0303-e02e-48a6-89d3-393ccbb69bfb.jpg?rect=0%2C351%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-03/cc1e0303-e02e-48a6-89d3-393ccbb69bfb.jpg?rect=169%2C0%2C743%2C1350\"},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"score\":0,\"about\":{\"description\":\"This event will take place in EartH Theatre.\\n\\nSince their inception in 2009, the genre-defying Submotion Orchestra have moved seamlessly between deep electronica, jazz, soul and ambient downtempo, mesmerising audiences from Iceland to India across their 6 albums, numerous EPs and countless tours. Their unique music is at once delicate and heavy, spacious and dense, highly atmospheric but firmly rooted. Earth-shaking bass and drums combine with lush keyboard and trumpet textures to create the perfect backdrop for the fragile beauty of Ruby Wood’s vocals.\\n\\nFrom their earliest post-dubstep album Finest Hour which gave birth to their signature song All Yours, to the multi-textured live electronica of their latest album Passed Me By, Submotion Orchestra continue to plough a path through electronic, jazz, ambient and soul in the singular way that only they can do, still challenging and moving audiences after 16 years of music making.\\n\\nFor more information on access at EartH, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/44dzl75 or contact us at access@earthackney.co.uk\\n\\nEartH is a social enterprise committed to supporting new musicians, with music studios in the venue that are completely free for young artists to use. When you attend a show in EartH Theatre, head to the back of the space to rent a cushion for just £2. Not only will you get to sit more comfortably, but all proceeds go towards funding Studio 36. Find out more here: https://earthackney.co.uk/about/studio-36/\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":null,\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1595,\"name\":\"JOY.\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.joyconcerts.com/privacy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":1737,\"name\":\"Sebright Arms\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://static1.squarespace.com/static/630f3de7c213c45e2e1a26eb/t/6788e53103ae512a44d3fc44/1737024817425/Privacy+Policy+-+Sebright+Arms.pdf\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Glazyhaze - BREATH\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/breath/1791865211?i=1791865218&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Glazyhaze\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Audio