ad guitar), Francesco (drums, programming), and Vsevolod (bass, vocals).\\n\\nSince the release of the debut album “Just Fade Away” (2023), the band has been engaged in various promotional tours, performing in major cities across Europe and the UK.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":222,\"name\":\"Baba Yaga's Hut\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.babayagashut.com/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1263983106946503\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Konta Chorus\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1oGGueDl4dMaPdk2PsN3hb\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/4c8f8dceb5d179a3c978d2b30eb02cb22658fe5b?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Konta Chorus\"}],\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"properties\":[],\"date_unix\":1778869800,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"4528\",\"name\":\"St Matthias Church\",\"address\":\"Wordsworth Rd, Stoke Newington, London N16 8DD, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.55245480000001,\"lng\":-0.08014030000000001},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"st-matthias-church-kbl9\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://stmchurch.co.uk/\"},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-15T19:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"927\",\"name\":\"Baba Yaga's Hut\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-11-17/84092575-7b18-48f1-a81d-3e429d6f7b2b.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"baba-yagas-hut-l8ob\",\"profile_active\":true},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b0a7a3bbf590?dice_id=b0a7a3bbf590\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b223a6fe13b9?dice_id=b223a6fe13b9\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m23fc44f0fe9?dice_id=m23fc44f0fe9\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D6846ab2f8e7?dice_id=D6846ab2f8e7\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Zec9fc0727e8?dice_id=Zec9fc0727e8\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x48c8c5c2c1a?dice_id=x48c8c5c2c1a\"},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Baba Yaga's Hut.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"3022d5cbdb7b3c7a:26\",\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-19T09:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-15T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-19T09:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-15T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-15T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"announcement_date_unix\":1768813200,\"offers_extras\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2150,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"id\":\"69679b302a02560001a23a11\",\"name\":\"The Utopia Strong + Bruise Blood\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"The Utopia Strong\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb96ba9429e9f570d44c244e96\"},\"artist_id\":\"14980\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"new\":false,\"seating\":null,\"perm_name\":\"7dp75v-the-utopia-strong-bruise-blood-15th-may-st-matthias-church-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-14/c035ac4d-244d-47c8-9c97-ce2eef6ab69c.jpg?rect=768%2C0%2C3072%2C3072\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-14/c035ac4d-244d-47c8-9c97-ce2eef6ab69c.jpg?rect=0%2C154%2C4608%2C2765\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-14/c035ac4d-244d-47c8-9c97-ce2eef6ab69c.jpg?rect=1459%2C0%2C1690%2C3072\"},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"score\":0,\"about\":{\"description\":\"The life of a psychonaut can take one to many plateaus of reality. Opinions vary as regards\\n\\nwhich of these are either desirable or optimal. All things considered though, it’s fair to say that\\n\\nonce the average cerebral wanderer finds themselves a stoned skeleton on a motorbike,\\n\\nit’s a sign that they’re going places.\\n\\nSuch were the movements of The Utopia Strong, in making their third and arguably trippiest\\n\\nfull length album for Rocket Recordings. As the band explain: “When recording we tend to have\\n\\nbooks, bits of art and interesting things lying around the place. (Kavus) had recently bought the\\n\\nPaul Kirchner compendium, Awaiting The Collapse. Paul’s character Dope Rider (the skeleton\\n\\nin question) drives around the desert, getting into all manner of high jinx and spouting cosmic\\n\\nphilosophy, highlighting the absurdities of life, death and the American mythos. “When we had\\n\\ncreated that particular track, one of our most beautiful and outré, it seemed to name itself.\\n\\nCertainly, we were looking at the comic strips while listening to it and something about it’s\\n\\nwide-screen vibes and the beautiful desert seemed to marry together.”\\n\\nSerendipity has always played a strong role in The Utopia Strong, with the improvisatory\\n\\napproach of Steve Davis, Kavus Torabi and Mike York - as well as the innate chemistry between\\n\\nthe trio - allowing them to take extensions through dimensions that frequently end up as much\\n\\nof a surprise to the band as the listener.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1980,\"name\":\"The 100 Club\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://the100club.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[],\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"properties\":[],\"date_unix\":1778869800,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"66\",\"name\":\"The 100 Club\",\"address\":\"100 Oxford St, Fitzrovia, London W1D 1LL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5161551,\"lng\":-0.1353063999999904},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/35e8f238-d827-4132-8534-bc474249d988.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C500%2C500\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\"