vironment for dancing, and the infectious, carefree spirit of a house party.\\n\\nGet ready to dance to classic hits and throwbacks of Hip-Hop, R&B, Jersey Club, House music, and more!\\n\\n**Dress Code**: Shades of Blue ➡️ Attendees Must Wear Blues 💙👖🩵\\n\\nFilming Notice:\\n\\nYour entry and presence on the event premises constitutes your consent to be photographed, filmed, and/or otherwise recorded and to the release, publication, exhibition, or reproduction of any and all recorded media of your appearance for any purpose whatsoever in perpetuity in connection with Club 1BD and its initiatives, including, by way of example only, use on websites, in social media, and advertising.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Fri 15 May\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Will Wilde - Lazy\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/lazy/1380720553?i=1380720575&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Will Wilde\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/5e/45/8a/5e458a71-71b1-18c8-2f86-89ec0dac52c8/mzaf_16900060012526092302.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Lazy\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Will Wilde - Lazy\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5jkkJxt2sF54aLBGYBCAt3\",\"artist\":\"Will Wilde\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/af2077bf29e3adbaca71cef8e0d86ad80040cc98?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Lazy\"}],\"is_