"},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"score\":0,\"about\":{\"description\":\"For over 15 years, Mànran has been at the heart of the Scottish traditional music scene, earning a reputation as one of the genre’s most exciting and influential bands. Renowned for their bold fusion of traditional and contemporary sounds, the seven-piece effortlessly blend English and Gaelic songs with driving, intricate instrumentals.\\n\\nTheir signature mix of bagpipes, fiddle, accordion, whistle, and flute - layered with guitars, drums, and bass - creates a dynamic, uplifting sound that is both deeply rooted in tradition and refreshingly modern. Their music has taken them to stages in more than 30 countries, building a loyal international following and a reputation for electrifying live performances.\\n\\nTheir most recent album 'To the Wind' was released in August 2025, which received airplay on BBC Radio 2 and has been nominated for Album of the Year at the MG ALBA Scots Trad Music Awards.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Beks - A Love Like This\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1UxFKQhrTBHkvIfwj1w7mK\",\"artist\":\"Beks\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/b4548c94b33d23d6c5595ee3d012f6e5d6a07319?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"A Love Like This\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Beks - A Love Like This\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/a-love-like-this/1840048246?i=1840048247&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Beks\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/0e/