/dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-07/f2774133-1b0d-42c5-91f1-93de704ae939.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"score\":0,\"about\":{\"description\":\"XTC's legendary drummer, Terry Chambers, is back on the road with his band EXTC (named and approved by XTC frontman, Andy Partridge).\\n\\nEmerging out of the post-punk and new-wave explosion of the late 70s, XTC experienced global success touring with the likes of The Police and Talking Heads. Sadly, their legions of loyal fans would be left in limbo when in 1982 XTC stopped touring, becoming a studio-based entity.\\n\\nEXTC were formed in 2019 by XTC's drummer Terry Chambers, performing classic XTC material such as Making Plans For Nigel, Senses Working Overtime, Mayor of Simpleton, Generals and Majors, Sgt. Rock (Is Going To Help Me), Love on a Farmboy's Wages and many more.\\n\\nAn AGMP Concerts presentation.\\n\\n- This is a standing event\\n- This event is 18+ only\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Will Wilde - Lazy\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/lazy/1380720553?i=1380720575&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Will Wilde\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/5e/45/8a/5e458a71-71b1-18c8-2f86-89ec0dac52c8/mzaf_16900060012526092302.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Lazy\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Will Wilde - Lazy\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5jkkJxt2sF54aLBGYBCAt3\",\"artist\":\"Will Wilde\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/af2077bf29e3adbaca71cef8e0d86ad8004