C1690%2C3072\"},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"score\":0,\"about\":{\"description\":\"The Utopia Strong bring their immersive, mind-expanding live show to The Castle, Luton. Featuring world snooker champion Steve Davis alongside Kavus Torabi and Mike York, the trio blend modular electronics, analogue synths and improvisation into a widescreen psychedelic experience that feels as transportive as it is intense. Rooted in deep chemistry and serendipity, their music drifts between cosmic abstraction and emotional weight, pulling listeners into strange and beautiful new terrains.\\n\\nThis is head music in the purest sense: hypnotic, exploratory and quietly euphoric. Expect a live journey that bends perception, rewards curiosity and leaves you feeling like you’ve travelled far -without ever leaving the room.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Sun 17 May\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"previews\":[],\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"properties\":[],\"date_unix\":1779123600,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1641\",\"name\":\"New Cross Inn\",\"address\":\"New Cross Inn, 323 New Cross Rd, London SE14 6AS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4757899,\"lng\":-0.037162699999953475},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/ba29f2fe-617e-4542-80b7-6e2529031d70.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C225%2C225\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001