\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1200},\"id\":\"6977a8400d0e1f0001d095a2\",\"name\":\"labyrinthine oceans\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Labyrinthine Oceans\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"97887\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true},{\"name\":\"Cracked Lime\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"128442\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"seating\":null,\"perm_name\":\"bb3xro-labyrinthine-oceans-20th-may-signature-brew-haggerston-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/ce9a9761-7c7b-4b80-8256-92069fb57447.jpg?rect=0%2C473%2C1365%2C1365\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/ce9a9761-7c7b-4b80-8256-92069fb57447.jpg?rect=0%2C615%2C1365%2C819\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-19/ce9a9761-7c7b-4b80-8256-92069fb57447.jpg?rect=120%2C0%2C1126%2C2048\"},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"score\":0,\"about\":{\"description\":\"***labyrinthine oceans -*** are a female-fronted grungegaze band based in london (UK). mixing dream rock, grunge, psychedelia and shoegaze, they create something that is not necessarily identifiable but very much exciting. weaving ghostly dreamscapes of guitar based noise, crafting wholly unconventional, dense layers of dreamy discomfort. pairing this with captivating visuals, they create a strong visual presence both live and across their various social platforms (@labyrinthineoceans)\\n\\n**Cracked Lime** - was created early 2025. London-based, the duo spent the last year touring the north-eastern venues of the city, refining their live performance, which blends post-punk sharp guitars, with electronic beats and a lingering trip-hop feel. Expect some hypnotic existentialist spoken words, melodic interventions, noisy texture and a sharp dance-y weird rhythm section.\\n\\n***Artists:*** We are always interested in