,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1779454800,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1686\",\"name\":\"Peckham Rye Park\",\"address\":\"Straker's Rd, London SE15 3UA, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.45863019999999,\"lng\":-0.061613800000031915},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"peckham-rye-park-2oam\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-22T14:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"3775695cf81d3a40:22\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"9247\",\"name\":\"GALA\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-29/8f39b77a-8449-46a7-b833-4e33cd548388.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"gala-ove5\",\"profile_active\":true},\"id\":\"6971ee400a0fab00011d7899\",\"name\":\"GALA '26\",\"perm_name\":\"l8b65p-gala-26-22nd-may-peckham-rye-park-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/2c8fa722-ecf6-445a-b217-176fb9acdfaf.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1130%2C1130\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/2c8fa722-ecf6-445a-b217-176fb9acdfaf.jpg?rect=0%2C226%2C1130%2C678\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/2c8fa722-ecf6-445a-b217-176fb9acdfaf.jpg?rect=254%2C0%2C622%2C1130\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Giggs\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-06-04/a1eaf81f-ce41-4c86-9470-8bf42429285b.jpg?rect=0%2C54%2C532%2C532\"},\"artist_id\":\"2159\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Novelist \",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-08-23/871d669b-c9e1-426b-a04b-73fc6a8a03ff.jpg?rect=1%2C0%2C639%2C639\"},\"artist_id\":\"38235\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Chaos In The CBD\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-08-13/7c59469f-c675-48ca-b7a0-a8397c1ccc8c.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C320%2C320\"},\"artist_id\":\"3667\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"CASISDEAD\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-04-17/888b7149-945b-475d-b2ae-a4dade05651c.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"1723\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Benji B.\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"130917\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":46,\"total_free_texts\":5},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1769074200,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":71335,\"title\":\"Accessibity info\",\"body\":\"We’re on a mission to make GALA as inclusive as it can be. This includes making the information around accessibility as useful as possible. Here you’ll find everything you need to know about accessibility at GALA. If you have any questions, please get in touch using the contact methods below. Hope to see you in the park!  \\n\\n**Venue Description**\\n\\nGALA will take place on Peckham Rye Park on 23–25 May 2025\\n\\nThere is step-free access into the site.\\n\\nThe site is undulated and is approximately 1.2 km2 / 0.5 square miles.\\n\\nThe site is grass and could be difficult to get around in wet conditions.\\n\\n**Access Facilities**\\n\\nCompanion/PA tickets available at no additional fee are available on request, please contact up on our access email address. We will not ask for evidence of accessibility requirements. You just need to provide proof of purchase.\\n\\nWhere possible stages will have viewing areas or a platform, to get a wrist band for a viewing area, please go to the welfare tent, if you would prefer welfare to come to you, please contact a security guard who can radio welfare to bring you a band.\\n\\n**Please refer to our website for full access info.**\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":71336,\"title\":\"What time do I need to arrive?\",\"body\":\"Please adhere to the entry time stated on your ticket. The different entry times helps our team manage people flow and queues on the day.\\n\\nPlease ensure the name on your ticket matches your ID.\\n\\nPlease note we cannot guarantee entry if you arrive later than your ticket time or after the last entry. We cannot make case by case exceptions.\\n\\nLast entry for general tickets is 6pm on the Friday and 5pm on Saturday & Sunday.\\n\\nIf have an early entry ticket and arrive late, you may be charged an additional fee on entry.\\n\\nIf you have an after work ticket for Friday you need to arrive between 5.30pm and 7.30pm.\\n\\nWe cannot swap tickets to different days or ticket types.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":71337,\"title\":\"How do I get there?\",\"body\":\"The festival entrance is opposite Colyton Road on the South side of the Park (What Three Words: option.lost.plants) and the nearest train stations are Peckham Rye (1 mile / 20 minute walk) and Honor Oak Park (1.1 miles / 22 minute walk).\\n\\nIf you plan to travel by Lime Bike or Forest Bike, there is a designated parking zone within Peckham Rye Park & Common – opposite the Clockhouse Pub, just off Peckham Rye. Here you can finish your ride without incurring a fine. You will not be able to end your ride in any other location within the park/common or on roads surrounding it – this geofence will be visible on your e-bike app when you get closer to the event. The parking zone will be marked with signage and barriers.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":71338,\"title\":\"Are the age restircitons?\",\"body\":\"GALA is an 18+ only licensed event – no children are permitted on site. We will be operating a Challenge 25 policy at the gates so please ensure you bring ID.\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":71339,\"title\":\"Prohibited Items\",\"body\":\"Please don’t bring large bags (bags bigger than an A4 piece of paper will not be permitted), we want to get you in quickly and safely without prolonged search times.\\n\\nControlled & psychoactive substances, other than prescription drugs (matching ID is required to bring inside).\\n\\nAnimals (with the exception of assistance dogs – see our Accessibility page for more information).\\n\\nFolding chairs / selfie sticks/ golf umbrellas\\n\\nGlass/ aerosols/ gas canisters/ BBQs/ weapons/ sharp objects\\n\\nPyrotechnics/ flares/ fireworks/ lasers/ laser pens\\n\\nBikes/ skateboards/ scooters\\n\\nMegaphones/ large amplification equipment/ klaxons/ air horns\\n\\nFood and Drink (there are water points inside if you bring an empty bottle)\\n\\nDrones and Unmanned Aerial Vehicles\\n\\nProfessional camera/ filming equipment (hand held personal cameras are permitted)\\n\\nMake-up and Sunscreen are permitted, you may be asked to test on yourself.\",\"order\":4},{\"id\":71340,\"title\":\"Can I re-enter?\",\"body\":\"Once your ticket has been scanned, you cannot leave and re-enter. Please remember all you will need throughout your day with us.\",\"order\":5},{\"id\":71341,\"title\":\"Drop off and pick up?\",\"body\":\"We have a designated drop-off and pick-up location, please use this postcode to get there: SE15 3HZ and follow signs for GALA. Please use the same designated pick up when you are leaving to minimise disturbance.\\n\\nDue to multiple roadworks in place in Peckham (at the same time), we advise that your journey time may take longer than usual. Please avoid using taxis to journey to the festival as they’ll be contributing to the congestion in Peckham. At the moment our Taxi PU/DO will stay on Barry Road – if there are any changes to this then we will notify closer to the event.\",\"order\":6},{\"id\":71342,\"title\":\"Wellbeing at GALA\",\"body\":\"GALA and Don’t Be A Creep have a zero-tolerance policy towards harassment, assault, and abuse of any kind. To uphold this we have developed a wellbeing strategy to both safeguard our audience and deal with individuals who go against our policy.\\n\\nWe have a welfare area and safe space on site which is run by trained professionals. They work together with a specialist security response team who are radioed if an incident is reported.\",\"order\":7},{\"id\":71343,\"title\":\"Southwark Day Centre for Ayslym seekers\",\"body\":\"For a fourth year in a row we will be fundraising for Southwark Day Centre for Asylum Seekers (SDCAS), a local charity who have supported over 25,000 clients in their 25 years of operation. They are a small organisation who are wholly dependent on volunteers, donations and fundraising. When you see someone in a hi-vis jacket representing the charity at GALA, please give what you can.\",\"order\":8}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":6119},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Giggs - Talkin The Hardest\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/3S0tlB4fE7ChxI2pWz8Xip\",\"artist\":\"Giggs\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/636f8aa5d6824f6d260d19750763f0b3e36f1bf1\",\"track_name\":\"Talkin The Hardest\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-05T11:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-22T19:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-05T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-22T14:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-22T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Boa Nova Festival\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/wdd6540f4201?dice_id=wdd6540f4201\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/G48d5d737368?dice_id=G48d5d737368\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Wae0df8f5888?dice_id=Wae0df8f5888\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/d85d33ecb442?dice_id=d85d33ecb442\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/M4371b95ae13?dice_id=M4371b95ae13\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w3552a62c505?dice_id=w3552a62c505\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Três vozes essenciais do Brasil chegam a Londres para a primeira edição do Boa Nova Festival.  \\nElas se juntam a um lineup 100% brasileiro, com muitos outros nomes que serão anunciados em breve. Londres encontra o Brasil.\\n\\nThree essential voices from Brazil touch down in London for the first edition of Boa Nova Festival.  \\nThese artists will sit alongside an exciting all-Brazilian lineup, with more names to be revealed in the coming weeks.  \\nLondon meets Brazil.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1779454800,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"17685\",\"name\":\"Leyton Jubilee Park\",\"address\":\"Seymour Road, Waltham Forest, London, E10 7BL, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.563121092258626,\"lng\":-0.023876219582249475},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"65e5f91831f8011ecb903745\",\"name\":\"Leytonstone\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.565785,\"lng\":0.007698,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"leyton-jubilee-park-ry79r\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\"