61a1a6-b910-4b15-a45b-67782d6300ee\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"987893cf-bc40-4a74-8eee-5de2ce676631\",\"seat_selection\":\"disabled\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Planningtorock - Gay Dreams Do Come True\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0Ye3vovRUVyJofT0Vf4NXY\",\"artist\":\"Planningtorock\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/e2ff4e3f28d63ca6183fe45739ce1c713e4aee54?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Gay Dreams Do Come True\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-06T09:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-24T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-06T09:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-24T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-24T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Dictionary Pudding.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/g426c22d7812?dice_id=g426c22d7812\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Qe0d5f466368?dice_id=Qe0d5f466368\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F121bf0ba8be?dice_id=F121bf0ba8be\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/B0c09e81b4db?dice_id=B0c09e81b4db\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/qa1e02d9bca6?dice_id=qa1e02d9bca6\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T538c9e9c9f2?dice_id=T538c9e9c9f2\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"“\\\\[Sweet Leaf of The North\\\\] my favourite song of the last decade” Iggy Pop\\n\\nMik Artistik's Ego Trip are genuinely delightful, funny, frightening, and indefinable. Northern rock and roll stand-up comes close.\\n\\nMik fixes the audience with his compelling stare, hypnotising and charming them with stories, songs, and poems. Every show is unique as Mik finds a new train of thought to ride. He connects, chats, breaks the wall between audience and band, creates chaos, plays air-crook lock (!?), and is complimented by exquisite layers of rock, soul, funk, and punk created by Jonny Flockton on electric guitar, drum machine, and one of a number of well-heeled bass players.\\n\\nThe band are regular Glastonbury favourites since their first appearance in 2007.\\n\\nMany fans don't consider Glastonbury has started until they've attended either Mik’s gig on the Wednesday afternoon at the Croissant Neuf Bandstand, or the chaos that reigns at Thursday evening’s Rocket Lounge gig. Both are now Glastonbury traditions for many fans.\\n\\nIn early 2020 no-less than rock icon and 6Music presenter Iggy Pop endorsed Mik’s anthem of hope ‘Sweet Leaf of the North’ as his favourite song of the last DECADE! ... In his words \\\"… because it's human, it's real and it has soul“\\n\\n\\\"Best live band I have seen all summer” Gideon Coe\\n\\n\\\"My favourite band on the planet\\\" Martin Parr (RIP)\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1779647400,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"23\",\"name\":\"The Lexington\",\"address\":\"96-98 Pentonville Rd, London N1 9JB\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5317299,\"lng\":-0.111416400000053},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-lexington-jomz\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.thelexington.co.uk/about.php\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-05-24T19:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"3775695cf81d3a40:78\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"178\",\"name\":\"Dictionary Pudding\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"dictionary-pudding-j5vy\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"698364b921dfbc00012e0802\",\"name\":\"Mik Artistik's Ego Trip\",\"perm_name\":\"l89qbw-mik-artistiks-ego-trip-24th-may-the-lexington-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/b8b09c68-5de5-49ed-a7ec-90d87ebaeab4.jpg?rect=0%2C17%2C828%2C828\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/b8b09c68-5de5-49ed-a7ec-90d87ebaeab4.jpg?rect=0%2C270%2C828%2C497\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/b8b09c68-5de5-49ed-a7ec-90d87ebaeab4.jpg?rect=129%2C0%2C570%2C1036\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Mik Artistik's Ego Trip\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"28561\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770368400,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":74370,\"title\":\"Venue Accessibility Information\",\"body\":\"The Lexington is an early Victorian building and as such is not easily accessible for anyone with limited mobility. While the main bar is on the ground floor and accessible without steps the music venue is up a flight of stairs. We’re happy to help with access where possible; for any further information please contact us: info@thelexington.co.uk.\",\"order\":0}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1980,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Mik Artistik's Ego Trip - Back to Bed\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/back-to-bed/1295258536?i=1295259341&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Mik Artistik's Ego Trip\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview128/v4/c5/fa/d3/c5fad31e-0052-b871-4040-dfada3d5d962/mzaf_4532659695784354679.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Back to Bed\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Mik Artistik's Ego Trip - Back to Bed\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6cXMeVJ1nIOXDdaUdLezDp\",\"artist\":\"Mik Artistik's Ego Trip\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/8b58b49bba618b25f41b1626cc11a324340a924f?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Back to Bed\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-02T01:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-24T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-02T01:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-24T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-24T21:25:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Kings Place.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"4f708c7e-5527-47d5-86e7-231b0142901b\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x73535583777?dice_id=x73535583777\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/bb70820fc632?dice_id=bb70820fc632\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/md3e28a7aed2?dice_id=md3e28a7aed2\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/bdf24a343b2c?dice_id=bdf24a343b2c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ebf47d3251e1?dice_id=Ebf47d3251e1\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v476b06b6580?dice_id=v476b06b6580\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"***In a set created exclusively for this Hall One concert, the Joe Webb Trio unveils new work from ’Neath Beat, released on Edition Records. Webb’s blend of fearless technique, swagger and melodic clarity – championed by Wynton Marsalis, Jamie Cullum and Jools Holland – meets the dynamic support of Will Sach and Sam Jesson in music that fuses Tatum-like agility with British, hook-focused immediacy.***  \\n\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\n\\n**Joe Webb** is regarded as one of the most formidable new jazz pianists to emerge in recent years – a musician with fearless technique, unmistakable swagger and a melodic instinct that lands with clarity and purpose. His ascent has been driven by genuine acclaim, commanding live performances and support from figures such as Wynton Marsalis, Gilles Peterson, Jools Holland and Jamie Cullum, further amplified by his 2025 Mercury Prize shortlist for *Hamstrings & Hurricanes*.\\n\\nJoined by bassist **Will Sach** and drummer **Sam Jesson**, Webb continues his “mixtape” concept on *’Neath Beat*, merging the spark of his live sets with carefully crafted compositions. The sound draws on the velocity and harmonic imagination of Art Tatum, channelled by the directness and confidence of Oasis. The result is bold, hook-focused and rhythmically charged – virtuosity delivered with style, lift and undeniable presence.\\n\\n***This event will last approximately 85 minutes, with no interval.***\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":\"b6cacc81-15a1-4778-90c1-515c20e0c024\",\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1141,\"name\":\"Kings Place \",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.kingsplace.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_