ful messiness of life. Whether she's unpacking heartbreak, navigating self-discovery, or calling out the absurdities of modern romance, Moore's signature honesty and humour remain as sharp as ever.\\n\\nIf you have any queries or would like more information about access at Village Underground, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/3EhSLgF, or contact access@villageunderground.co.uk.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-20T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-27T21:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-23T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-27T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-27T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Lily Moore - I Will Never Be\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/album/i-will-never-be/1408954956?i=1408954960&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Lily Moore\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/apple-assets-us-std-000001/AudioPreview125/v4/bb/8f/03/bb8f033f-efbf-c597-0447-0d93ec80aceb/mzaf_3997918803120042271.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"I Will Never Be\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Lily Moore - Float\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5GsqueLF0J7tOZgD9uvF0O\",\"artist\":\"Lily Moore\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/0d3edd603a03207390fed793b85108d7a3a9d2b0?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Float\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Wed 27 May\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"nam