th has grown into one of the UK’s most distinctive voices, performing everywhere from intimate clubs to major stages. Whether fronting her full five-piece band or appearing in a stripped-back duo, she delivers performances filled with authenticity, passion, and power.\\n\\nBeth Rowley has worked or shared the stage with David Gray, Jools Holland, Crowded House, Rumer, Burt Bacharach, Angelo Badalamenti and many more.\\n\\nDon’t miss this chance to experience Beth Rowley live on her ‘Pale Jewel Volume II’ UK 2026 tour.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-03T00:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-29T01:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-10-03T00:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-29T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-29T23:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":3},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Blues Kitchen Brixton.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":20,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"670\",\"name\":\"The Blues Kitchen Brixton\",\"address\":\"40 Acre Ln, London SW2 5SP\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4606163,\"lng\":-0.119256500000006},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-01-10/acde8e01-529b-4b1e-a86a-5496e18af1df.jpg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"coun