"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-05/88921a9f-ec3c-4973-a003-9ee7ac972265.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C593%2C1078\"},\"id\":\"6985d11a726fc70001b42d9b\",\"name\":\"Team RnB Bottomless Day Party with Lisa Maffia & Crew\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":\"rescheduled\",\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**TEAM RNB BOTTOMLESS DAY PARTY**  \\n**SATURDAY 30th May 2026**\\n\\n\\\\*DOORS: 12PM  \\nEVENT END: 5PM  \\n\\\\*\\n\\n**Valid physical Photo ID is required!**\\n\\nLisa & Dan events are super excited to announce the Team RnB bottomless & day party\\n\\nThis event is held on Saturday 30th May 2026 at Clapham Grand 12pm - 5pm\\n\\nDoors open at 12pm - Bottomless starts at 12:30 and ends at 1:30\\n\\nExpect to hear:\\n\\nUSHER • ASHANTI • MARIO • BEYONCÉ • GINUWINE • BRANDY • SISQO • JA RULE • CIARA • CASSIE • NELLY BOYZ II MEN • MARIAH CAREY • AALIYAH • DESTINY'S CHILD • NEXT • MONICA • RIHANNA • TLC • AKON • ALICIA KEYS • NE-YO • KEVIN LYTTLE • DONELL JONES • CRAIG DAVID • SEAN PAUL • KELIS • MARY J BLIGE • JAGGED EDGE • JOEDICE • H TOWN • KEITH SWEAT • BRANDY • SWV • EN VOGUE\\n\\nIf you have any dietary requirements, please email Dan from the Garage Brunch UK team on dan@lyricaluk.com. You must do this by the Wednesday before the event, at the latest (Wed 27th May)!!\\n\\nPlease note: Bottomless booze finishes at 1:30pm.\\n\\n▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀\\n\\n**FOOD & DRINK**\\n\\nBottomless rum punch cocktails\\n\\nBottomless 12:30 - 1:30pm\\n\\nFood by Thunderbird chicken\\n\\nV (Quorn)\\n\\nVegan option available. Please contact us 3 days prior the event\\n\\n**▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀**\\n\\n**Attractions:**\\n\\n★ UNLIMITED FOOD & DRINK (60 min)\\n\\n★ FREE GIVEAWAYS\\n\\n★ FULLY LICENSE BARS\\n\\n★ GAMES\\n\\n★ CHILL OUT AREA\\n\\n**\\\\+ LOADS MORE !!!!**\\n\\n*For any ticketing queries please contact DICE's Help Centre first, or contact info@claphamgrand.com*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"T