y artists such as Jalen Ngonda and Thee Sacred Souls, DON WEST brings a fresh yet timeless sound to modern soul.\\n\\nWith key tracks like ‘Small Change’, ‘Friends’, ‘Send It Back’, ‘Julia’, and the release of his debut album Give Me All Your Love, DON WEST is an artist fully hitting his stride - confidently defining his own chapter in soul music.\\n\\nHaving returned from his sold-out European debut tour, with a global tour in the works for 2026, we’re taking DON WEST to KOKO.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-17T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-30T13:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-19T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-30T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-30T21:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-18T12:00:00+00:00\"},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Hell Can Wait\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"46532\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by New Cross Live.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1641\",\"name\":\"New Cross Inn\",\"address\":\"New Cross Inn, 323 New Cross Rd, London SE14 6AS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4757899,\"lng\":-0.037162699999953475},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/ba29f2fe-617e-4542-80b7-6e2529031d70.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C225%2C225\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"