\"description\":\"The Hempolics are a close-knit, family-like group of best friends who have come together to form a unique reggae, dub, soul, and hip hop fusion.\\n\\nKnown for a genre-jumping yet cohesive sound, The Hempolics celebrate love, connection, and social commentary. Infectious rhythms, rich harmonies, and emotive lyrics create a fresh, rootsy sound with catchy melodies and socially conscious lyrics, fronted by producer Grippa Laybourne and vocalists Nubiya and Dandelion.\\n\\n*“Great summer vibes. Puts a smile on my face. And amazing live too!” - **Eliza Doolittle***\\n\\n*“Best new reggae band on the planet” - **Chris Hawkins, BBC6***\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-12T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-30T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-12T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-05-30T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-05-30T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"The Hempolics & Macka B - One Law Fi Dem\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/one-law-fi-dem/1634105845?i=1634105854&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"The Hempolics & Macka B\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview112/v4/22/e8/ee/22e8eef0-3c7f-d056-1774-2fe9f1a9147f/mzaf_148535394487986456.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"One Law Fi Dem\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Fatherson\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-27/a89b92e8-9eb7-40e6-985d-286e06371d9a.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"3991\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donatio