 and carer ticketing information\",\"body\":\"The accessible area for this show is full, and all the free personal assistant tickets have been assigned. We will not be able to accommodate any more requests. We apologise for any inconvenience this may cause.\\n\\nhttps://support.dice.fm/article/179-accessibilty-tickets-for-islington-assembly-hall\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":31976,\"title\":\"Stage Times \",\"body\":\"Stage times are posted at 11am on the day of the show on our venue website.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":57461,\"title\":\"Age Restricition\",\"body\":\"This is a 14+ event – 14 and 15 year olds must be accompained by an adult. You may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"order\":3}],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"34\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"address\":\"Upper Street, London N1 2UD\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5395894,\"lng\":-0.102482699999996},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-02-10/05562e9c-c684-4beb-b818-4e908bbfb14d.jpg?rect=712%2C0%2C2832%2C2832\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-z8e2\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/about/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-01T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1607\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-78g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1770717600,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/kfafc46700b8?dice_id=kfafc46700b8\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/g20fb9fb757b?dice_id=g20fb9fb757b\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R843bf9bc5c0?dice_id=R843bf9bc5c0\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ic867d93d8c1?dice_id=ic867d93d8c1\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Gbe24e889c77?dice_id=Gbe24e889c77\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p8f738e812ee?dice_id=p8f738e812ee\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"py9y8p-annahstasia-1st-jun-islington-assembly-hall-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/legal-information/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"679202632593023\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-980124-39\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1780336800,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"impression_id\":\"55e67ca3ba9827ff:56\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3124},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/a9c2cf55-89b3-4f36-9442-e203de4188b9.jpg?rect=0%2C415%2C2165%2C2165\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/a9c2cf55-89b3-4f36-9442-e203de4188b9.jpg?rect=0%2C678%2C2165%2C1299\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/a9c2cf55-89b3-4f36-9442-e203de4188b9.jpg?rect=353%2C0%2C1460%2C2654\"},\"id\":\"6984c2930c2349000104b89a\",\"name\":\"Annahstasia\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Annahstasia has cultivated her soulful, poetic folk songcraft between blazes of intimacy and independence across different lives, locations, and iterations, loves lost and gained, expectations evaded and recreated. Love is the elemental constant, alongside her distinctly resonant voice, shading the singer-songwriter's music since her earliest self-taught recordings, back when a 17-year-old Annahstasia Enuke was discovered and propelled into the pressures of an industry that nearly stifled her greatest strengths.\\n\\n*By purchasing a ticket to this event you are agreeing to adhere to Islington Assembly Hall's terms and conditions: https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/customer-terms-conditions-2022/*\\n\\n*All tickets to shows at Islington Assembly Hall are subject to a Venue Levy of £1.50 + VAT. As a Grade II listed building, this levy will be reinvested into Islington Assembly Hall and its services, meaning the customer experience can continue to be enhanced.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-10T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-01T21:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-13T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-01T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-01T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Power\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3nE7KhZq3bz31I7g7hvt1v\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/366006e31482e080d6c4e28c26add22c12962871?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Power\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Annahstasia - Power\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/power/1634078590?i=1634078591&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Annahstasia\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview112/v4/9c/f1/9e/9cf19eda-8913-f78b-5903-4abc53528cbe/mzaf_14029488497801491180.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Power\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Ghost-Note\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-06/1b249c01-db6a-467e-b709-ec4cb8c16a0a.jpg?rect=101%2C0%2C586%2C586\"},\"artist_id\":\"20847\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Jazz Cafe.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":72421,\"title\":\"The Jazz Cafe FAQ's\",\"body\":\"Please follow this link for all Jazz Cafe FAQ's: https://thejazzcafe.com/faqs/?\",\"order\":0}],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"415\",\"name\":\"The Jazz Cafe\",\"address\":\"5 Parkway, London NW1 7PG\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5387845,\"lng\":-0.143146300000012},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-jazz-cafe-4m7k\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://thejazzcafelondon.com/faqs/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-01T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"43\",\"name\":\"The Jazz Cafe\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\