t-jun-the-waiting-room-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":338,\"name\":\"FORM Presents\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://formpresents.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"502219323814680\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1780338600,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"55e67ca3ba9827ff:58\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1450,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-15/165c4e6a-f7aa-4015-a8ed-49a2a26a98ad.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C3600%2C3600\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-15/165c4e6a-f7aa-4015-a8ed-49a2a26a98ad.jpg?rect=0%2C720%2C3600%2C2160\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-15/165c4e6a-f7aa-4015-a8ed-49a2a26a98ad.jpg?rect=810%2C0%2C1980%2C3600\"},\"id\":\"69691928284b8900017e874b\",\"name\":\"Case Oats\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"FORM Presents\\n\\nCASE OATS\\n\\n\\\\+ Special Guests\\n\\nBaseball caps and horsetails, porch swings and “all else that fails”—these are the lyrical stomping grounds of Case Oats, the group led by Casey Walker and Spencer Tweedy. Transplanted from Missouri to Chicago, Walker has a knack for getting to the “gooey heart” of relationships and experience, of bringing a city-dwelling life back down to earth. With an unadorned delivery and an unflinching eye, Walker relates songs about moving on, about growing up in the Midwest, and about loyalty to desperately flawed people and gratitude for pain, for the way things end up.\\n\\nCase Oats’ yet-to-be-announced debut album is a well-defined, inviting labor of love. Light on pastiche and heavy on intention, their arrangements, backed by a group of longtime collaborators, put Case Oats on a continuum of porch-sitting, familiar songwriters.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-26T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-01T16:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-26T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-01T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-01T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Case Oats - Bitter Root Lake\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1N4WfOBly0tOaAVQ0HeNDC\",\"artist\":\"Case Oats\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/7a66be18dc72c71733c427d1c2eb2f1613161ee8?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Bitter Root Lake\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Case Oats - Bitter Root Lake\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/bitter-root-lake/1841836197?i=1841836208&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Case Oats\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/50/d9/fc/50d9fcc6-58dd-ab02-6611-4848d9be6e71/mzaf_8211761888525752278.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Bitter Root Lake\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Mon 01 Jun\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"The Curtom Orchestra\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"16012\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"The Curtom Orchestra brings together members of funk and jazz acts Incognito, The Brand New Heavies and Jamiroquai. Named after Curtis Mayfield’s Curtom Records, the band grooves their way through four decades of Mayfield’s sociopolitically charged classics, including 1965’s ‘People Get Ready’ and 1970’s ‘(Don’t Worry) If There’s a Hell Below, We’re All Going to Go’.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by AGMP.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":45731,\"title\":\"The Jazz Cafe FAQ's\",\"body\":\"Please follow this link for all Jazz Cafe FAQ's: https://thejazzcafe.com/faqs/?\",\"order\":0}],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"415\",\"name\":\"The Jazz Cafe\",\"address\":\"5 Parkway, London NW1 7PG\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5387845,\"lng\":-0.143146300000012},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-jazz-cafe-4m7k\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://thejazzcafelondon.com/faqs/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-02T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1442\",\"name\":\"AGMP\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"agmp-99g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1758150000,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/yce4edd5f5e6?dice_id=yce4edd5f5e6\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/X0c74478c692?dice_id=X0c74478c692\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P0cfa67f24e8?dice_id=P0cfa67f24e8\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a48ba3e5aa00?dice_id=a48ba3e5aa00\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/rafcfe8cc360?dice_id=rafcfe8cc360\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n9bd90e743ae?dice_id=n9bd90e743ae\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"3oy3v8-the-curtom-orchestra-presents-curtis-mayfield-2nd-jun-the-jazz-cafe-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":false,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1780423200,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"55e67ca3ba9827ff:59\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2900,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-18/25afad30-7a97-4f39-aa33-02201319afd7.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C768%2C768\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-18/25afad30-7a97-4f39-aa33-02201319afd7.jpg?rect=0%2C154%2C768%2C461\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-18/25afad30-7a97-4f39-aa33-02201319afd7.jpg?rect=173%2C0%2C422%2C768\"},\"id\":\"68cbe686b6e6ce00018c714c\",\"name\":\"The Curtom Orchestra presents Curtis Mayfield\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"\\\"Curtis Mayfield is a one-of-a-kind musical genius\\\"\\n\\nLionel Richie\\n\\nThe Curtom Orchestra are an all-star band featuring members of Jamiroquai, The Brand New Heavies, Incognito and more who will be celebrating the life and music of Curtis Mayfield and The Impressions.\\n\\nIt is now over 25 years since the passing of Singer-Songwriter & Producer Curtis Mayfield. After meeting Jerry Butler he formed The Impressions in 1956 and went on to record many classic songs including ‘We’re a Winner’, ‘I’m So Proud’, ‘It’s All Right’, ‘For Your Precious Love’ and the politically-charged ‘People Get Ready’.\\n\\nAfter leaving The Impressions in 1970, Curtis Mayfield released a slew of socially conscious albums such as 'Curtis' (1970), 'Super Fly' (1972), 'Back To The World' (1973) and more.\\n\\nThe Curtom Orchestra will be performing all of the classics and fan favourites from throughout the career of Curtis Mayfield tonight.\\n\\nAn AGMP Concerts presentation.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-09-18T00:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-02T07:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-09-18T00:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-02T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-02T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Kassi Valazza\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-04-10/43451d6e-ef17-4d18-986f-242020b54d1d.jpg?rect=0%2C54%2C532%2C532\"},\"artist_id\":\"62976\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Broadside Hacks.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"43\",\"name\":\"MOTH Club\",\"address\":\"Old Trades Hall, Valette Street, London E9 6NU\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5450825,\"lng\":-0.0546326999999565},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net