ddca8d39\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Qa9fd990d2d2?dice_id=Qa9fd990d2d2\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/g5bfc3550bbb?dice_id=g5bfc3550bbb\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ieed7ad0f15c?dice_id=ieed7ad0f15c\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"v3g7qg-vix-and-the-bleeding-hearts-4th-jun-hot-box-chelmsford-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1780596000,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"55e67ca3ba9827ff:73\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1320,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-29/24e7c60f-919c-43f8-9ce5-fb1e2edf7e25.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1400%2C1400\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-29/24e7c60f-919c-43f8-9ce5-fb1e2edf7e25.jpg?rect=0%2C280%2C1400%2C840\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-29/24e7c60f-919c-43f8-9ce5-fb1e2edf7e25.jpg?rect=315%2C0%2C770%2C1400\"},\"id\":\"692defeae9c24900013a961e\",\"name\":\"Vix and the Bleeding Hearts\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Vix and the Bleeding Hearts are an energetic UK indie-psychedelic-pop group. Compelling lyrics and classic songwriting combined with the edge if indie music.\\n\\nThis band is from Colchester and is led by Victoria 'Vix' Weaver. They formed as local regulars in Colchester's jam circuit and have been described as \\\"Colchester's supergroup\\\" by Paul Dupree of City Sounds radio.\\n\\nComprised of members Ian Sycamore (Hobo Chang) on lead guitar, Ian Fulcher on keys, Cameron Mackie on bass, and Tyler Baker (Gasoline Green, UK's Young Drummer of the Year Winner 2023) on drums.\\n\\nFrom their recent gig at the O2 Academy, Islington their performance was described as\\n\\n\\\"...a very tight performance at the o2 Islington Academy! Great storytellers and we loved their insane guitar solos!” (INPOP).\\n\\nThey are great, have a fantastic album coming out early next year and have already released three singles. They are a must-see live. We think the whole band is so talented.\\n\\nFind their music on all streaming platforms as Vix and the Bleeding Hearts.\\n\\nTheir first three singles are Teenage Love Affair, Heart Bleeds Lonely, and Are You Looking For Love?\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-01T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-04T19:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-01T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-04T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-04T23:45:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Vix and the Bleeding Hearts - Teenage Love Affair\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/26C67TQLMxMtKVwRUBAPV0\",\"artist\":\"Vix and the Bleeding Hearts\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/08ae928dc7d823359adf8ae71896ca57d1e40f7f?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Teenage Love Affair\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Vix and the Bleeding Hearts - Teenage Love Affair\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/teenage-love-affair/1777799996?i=1777800002&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Vix and the Bleeding Hearts\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/e0/e5/dc/e0e5dc87-003c-f91c-863a-aaebaf996f92/mzaf_3090721386642035485.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Teenage Love Affair\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Duo Ruut\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebb022d2c8dd26f161e80a024b\"},\"artist_id\":\"130840\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Dreamers’ Circus\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb2365821dda0d57f3b2ef50f9\"},\"artist_id\":\"130728\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"World-class new Nordic music\\n\\nIs there a more daringly inventive acoustic band in the Nordic sphere than Dreamers’ Circus? Since first crossing paths at a late-night jam session in Copenhagen, they have grown into one of the most adventurous and internationally acclaimed bands in Nordic folk and traditional music. This genre-defying trio blends breathtaking virtuosity with an adventurous spirit, crafting a sound that is both deeply rooted and strikingly contemporary.\\n\\nDrawing from backgrounds in traditional music, classical performance, and jazz improvisation, the band weaves together influences with effortless finesse. The result is a musical universe where Nordic folk traditions meet the lyricism of classical music and the pulse of pop and jazz – all delivered with dazzling energy and melodic richness.\\n\\nThe trio features Nikolaj Busk (piano, accordion), Rune Tonsgaard Sørensen (violin), and Ale Carr (cittern). Busk is a prolific composer and arranger whose work spans folk, pop, jazz, and classical ensembles, with 15 Danish Music Awards to his name. Sørensen, a founding member of the Grammy-nominated Danish String Quartet, grew up steeped in traditional Faroese and Danish music. Carr, born into a renowned Swedish folk music family, is one of Scandinavia’s leading innovators on string instruments.\\n\\nOver seven albums, Dreamers’ Circus have established themselves as one of Denmark’s leading ensembles, honoured by the Danish Arts Foundation as a “Special Ensemble.” Their extensive touring includes regular appearances across Europe, North America, and Japan, earning them a growing international reputation as musical ambassadors for the new Nordic sound.\\n\\nThey’ve collaborated widely and contributed original music to film, television, theatre, and contemporary dance — including the acclaimed The Lost Musicians with Aaben Dans. Their most recent album, Handed On, is a celebration and reflection of their musical heritage.\\n\\nThe name Dreamers’ Circus hints at a world of imagination, daring, and craft — qualities that shine through in live performances marked by precision, passion and playful joy.\\n\\n“They’re world class. Now the world needs to hear them.” — Chris Nickson, Sing Out\\n\\n“Dreamers’ Circus does for Nordic folk music what Astor Piazzolla did for Argentinian tango.” — Kim Skotte, Politiken\\n\\n“Charisma, talent and a powerful performance onstage” — Songlines\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by DMP.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"65\",\"name\":\"Union Chapel\",\"address\":\"Compton Terrace, London N1 2UN, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5447669,\"lng\":-0.102892500000053},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"union-chapel-jx9a\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.unionchapel.org.uk/accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-04T18:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1768\",\"name\":\"DMP\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"dmp-d5kq\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1764115200,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Zca017350e58?dice_id=Zca017350e58\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z59e69a1c326?dice_id=Z59e69a1c326\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/qade602cbeb0?dice_id=qade602cbeb0\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Yb54fbc5bc40?dice_id=Yb54fbc5bc40\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J15161e92dad?dice_id=J15161e92dad\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p4db59944139?dice_id=p4db59944139\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"ryapyq-dreamers-circus-plus-duo-ruut-4th-jun-union-chapel-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":2237,\"name\":\"DMP\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.dmpuk.com/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1780596000,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"55e67ca3ba9827ff:74\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2750,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-26/c2fd5bed-4c23-4b0d-a4e2-f815a5557107.jpg?rect=106%2C0%2C768%2C768\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-26/c2fd5bed-4c23-4b0d-a4e2-f815a5557107.jpg?rect=0%2C90%2C980%2C588\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-26/c2fd5bed-4c23-4b0d-a4e2-f815a5557107.jpg?rect=279%2C0%2C422%2C768\"},\"id\":\"6927166376ef050001aa9b59\",\"name\":\"Dreamers Circus plus Duo Ruut\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Support from Duo Ruut\\n\\nDuo Ruut's sound is based on the common ground that two young Estonian musicians and songwriters, Ann-Lisett Rebane and Katariina Kivi have explored since coming together in 2017.\\n\\nTheir sound ties together a single Estonian zither and two distinct voices. Inspired by the traditions of their Estonian heritage, they draw influence from both the beliefs of different cultures and their own contemporary and emotive songwriting.\\n\\nAs they are composing on one instrument Duo Ruut’s music is minimalist at its core but packed with new and imaginative ideas.\\n\\nIn December 2019 Duo Ruut released their debut album \\\"Tuule sõnad” which was awarded as the Debut Album of the Year by Estonian Ethno Music Awards 2020. The same album was nominated in different categories by Estonian Music Awards. In 2021 Duo Ruut released an EP called “Kulla kerguseks” which received strong organic support internationally. The EP was nominated for the “Ethno/Folk Album of the Year” by Estonian Music Awards 2022. Their latest album “Ilmateade” was released in 2025.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event (under 18s must be accompanied by an adult)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-26T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-04T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-26T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-04T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-04T22:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"August\",\"redirect