omage to one of the ’80s most recognisable bands. Focused on channelling the rough-edged spirit of The Smiths, the quartet have toured the length of the UK, and even played at Glastonbury performing the band’s signature hits.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Pad Presents.\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":76551,\"title\":\"Venue Accessibility Information\",\"body\":\"monopolyaccessibility@ticketquarter.co.uk\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":76552,\"title\":\"Age Restricition\",\"body\":\"This event is 14 and over. 14s to 16s must be accompanied by an adult.\\n\\nAny ticket holder unable to present valid identification indicating that they are at least 14 years of age will not be admitted to this event and will not be eligible for a refund.\",\"order\":1}],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[\"selling_fast\"],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"55\",\"name\":\"Electric Ballroom\",\"address\":\"184 Camden High St, London NW1 8QP\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5396558,\"lng\":-0.143191399999978},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/fab0b36d-a5a4-4e37-a541-2c5af15a3bc1.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C400%2C400\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"electric-ballroom-j78v\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://electricballroom.co.uk/disabled-access/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-06T18:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"14332\",\"name\":\"The Pad Presents\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-pad-presents-nvlp3\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1770915600,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/j94b968ea016?dice_id=j94b968ea016\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m8818d0f246f?dice_id=m8818d0f246f\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/rab4d67182d3?dice_id=rab4d67182d3\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Wfdf77a4e9ac?dice_id=Wfdf77a4e9ac\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Mf815a783cdd?dice_id=Mf815a783cdd\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/i7f066cc199d?dice_id=i7f066cc199d\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"g5myrb-the-smyths-6th-jun-electric-ballroom-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1780765200,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"55e67ca3ba9827ff:85\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2390,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-12/3e2631de-bcc0-4ff7-8eca-c5489e155f51.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-12/3e2631de-bcc0-4ff7-8eca-c5489e155f51.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-12/3e2631de-bcc0-4ff7-8eca-c5489e155f51.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"id\":\"698e05b419fa05000143bf41\",\"name\":\"The Smyths\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"The Smyths are back on tour in calling into the Electric Ballroom, Camden on Sat 6th June following their sell out show at the venue in 2025.\\n\\nFor the 2026 tour the band will be celebrating the 40th Anniversary of ‘The Queen Is Dead’. The album features some of the most loved songs including The Queen Is Dead, Frankly, Mr. Shankly, I Know It's Over, Never Had No One Ever, Cemetery Gates, Bigmouth Strikes Again, The Boy With The Thorn In His Side, Vicar In A Tutu, There Is A Light That Never Goes Out, Some Girls Are Bigger Than Others.\\n\\nAlongside revisiting the album the band will close the show with a ‘Best of’ featuring tracks all across the classic Smith’s back catalogue.\\n\\nSound Of New Order) playing a career defining set the band play the songs from the early years after the demise of Joy Division. Expect to hear a career defining set often not performed by New Order themselves with 'Ceremony', ‘Procession’ & ‘Everything’s Gone Green’ 'Temptation' ‘Blue Monday’, ‘Bizarre Love Triangle’ ‘True Faith’ ‘Regret’ ‘Krafty’ ‘Your Silent Face’ ‘The Perfect Kiss’ to tracks from 2015's Music Complete.\\n\\nOpening up proceedings with be the one and only BILLY BLAGG (Billy Bragg tribute) Paying homage to Britain's finest political troubadour, Billy Blagg performs a solo set of the sociopolitical anthems that have made The Bard of Barking an unsung national treasure. Interspersed with stories behind the songs, expect a career-spanning set with a focus on Bragg’s early solo-guitar classics.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-12T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-06T14:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-12T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-06T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-06T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Pussy Riot\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb03a92efa00bbc6b7d3dfeaba\"},\"artist_id\":\"5455\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Riot Days\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-02/cfbd7b54-79bd-471a-bdcc-a7c3b7d9c0ca.jpg?rect=0%2C201%2C1000%2C1000\"},\"artist_id\":\"133437\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"SNAYX\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb1bd9d9dbe96c6109472a9a0f\"},\"artist_id\":\"133660\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"The Oozes\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-01-30/c2bfaba3-dee4-497f-9588-2a470c6ab626.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C768%2C768\"},\"artist_id\":\"17093\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Hongza\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-09/22748b82-6e70-4cf4-be1e-560db7d229f5.jpg?rect=0%2C704%2C2832%2C2832\"},\"artist_id\":\"25823\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":7,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":{\"description\":\"At EartH, we want our space to give back to the community. That’s why we teamed up with Progression Sessions to open Studio 36 inside our venue. Studio 36 provides music making facilities and expertise for free to young musicians in London who face a variety of barriers that might prevent them from making the most of their creativity and talent. \\n\\nEvery donation helps keep Studio 36 open and accessible, so that more young people can find their voice, develop their talents and feel supported as they take their next steps.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-28/af5fb538-b9c7-4f41-bf11-48d1d9d6d45a.jpeg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"variants\":[{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":100,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE5Mzg5MCwidHlwZSI6