-venue music festival taking place in London from 4-6 June 2026, featuring Maruja, SPRINTS, Pussy Riot:Riot Days and many more.\\n\\nFor more information on access at EartH, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/44dzl75 or contact us at access@earthackney.co.uk\\n\\nEartH is a social enterprise committed to supporting new musicians, with music studios in the venue that are completely free for young artists in Hackney to use. Find out more here (https://earthackney.co.uk/about/studio-36/).\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-09T16:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-06T21:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-11T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-06T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-06T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Purge The Poison (feat. Pussy Riot)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/51G4UdHXjcNrdLueS1ohzU\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/5062aa3386c67f5c7453886ade0f1761800687aa?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Purge The Poison (feat. Pussy Riot)\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Pussy Riot - Make America Great Again\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/album/make-america-great-again/id1165185875?i=1165186514&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Pussy Riot\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/apple-assets-us-std-000001/AudioPreview71/v4/2c/6e/8c/2c6e8c5d-5aa2-fb34-31e7-1e1dee9420b2/mzaf_1902784736698636601.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Make America Great Again\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"The Artificial Monkeys\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\