"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-06T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"13616\",\"name\":\"The Black Heart\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-black-heart-yq6r\",\"profile_active\":false},\"announcement_date_unix\":1769472000,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Bf8b6a7773a0?dice_id=Bf8b6a7773a0\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/rb4b84ba8136?dice_id=rb4b84ba8136\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/jbde0b715083?dice_id=jbde0b715083\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Fe8290bca2d1?dice_id=Fe8290bca2d1\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p9cb8051cff3?dice_id=p9cb8051cff3\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P7eb43e085ea?dice_id=P7eb43e085ea\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"3ogrol-the-spirit-is-alive-5-jackos-memorial-show-6th-jun-the-black-heart-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1780768800,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"55e67ca3ba9827ff:90\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1385,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-28/bae41663-c737-4dc0-9c5f-f997cb90d882.jpg?rect=0%2C1482%2C5811%2C5811\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-28/bae41663-c737-4dc0-9c5f-f997cb90d882.jpg?rect=0%2C2640%2C5811%2C3487\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-28/bae41663-c737-4dc0-9c5f-f997cb90d882.jpg?rect=495%2C0%2C4822%2C8767\"},\"id\":\"697a0c18b93d8200018dc6e1\",\"name\":\"The Spirit is Alive #5: Jacko’s Memorial Show\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"BLATOIDEA | BAD NASTY | DEFCON ZERO | DOWN CHARMED\\n\\nSat 06.06.2026 — The Black Heart, London\\n\\nIn memory of our beloved Jacko.\\n\\nThis is not just another gig. this is a night with a mission.\\n\\nOn June 6th, 2026, we’re gathering at The Black Heart to celebrate the life and spirit of our late bass player Jacko, whose strength, humour, and heart inspired all of us.\\n\\nJacko battled myositis, a rare and debilitating condition, with courage that deserves to be remembered and fought against.\\n\\nWe’re raising funds for Myositis UK, an organization doing vital work to support people living with this disease and drive research toward better treatments.\\n\\nEvery ticket, every pint, every moment you share with us that night helps push that mission forward.\\n\\nThis is our way of keeping Jacko’s memory alive, turning grief into purpose, passion, and community.\\n\\nLine-up:\\n\\nBLATOIDEA\\n\\nBad Nasty\\n\\nDefcon Zero\\n\\nDown Charmed\\n\\nThese bands are here because they’re family, they believe in what we’re doing, and they want to make this night powerful and unforgettable.\\n\\nThis event is for everyone who has ever lost someone, who has ever stood by a friend in a struggle, who believes music can do more than entertain. It can heal, remember, and change lives.\\n\\nCome down. Bring friends.\\n\\nMake a difference.\\n\\nAll proceeds go to Myositis UK\\n\\nhttps://www.myositis.org.uk/\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-27T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-06T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-27T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-06T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-06T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Executed\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3LAlbLmLw3km9N15bj9JWI\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/7a356605b686d89266910af4afd3625913813d9f?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Executed\"}],\"score\":0,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"event_tag\":null},{\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Patricia Wolf\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-21/8c8f016a-3837-42c7-9745-04836eca7329.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"59620\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Patricia Wolf is a musician, sound designer, and film composer residing in Portland, Oregon. Wolf uses electronics, voice, and field recordings to produce non-linear compositions that draw listeners to a hypnotic inner world. Her use of melody and repetition manipulate the listeners' perception of time, conjuring vivid textures, and atmospheres.  \\n  \\nhttps://patriciawolf.bandcamp.com/music  \\nhttps://www.instagram.com/patriciawolf_music/\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"donation\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by REAL\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"faqs\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"properties\":[],\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1565\",\"name\":\"The Old Church Stoke Newington\",\"address\":\"Stoke Newington Church St, Stoke Newington, London N16 9ES, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5613778,\"lng\":-0.0847131000000445},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-old-church-stoke-newington-x9am\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theoldchurch.org.uk/access\"},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-06T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"12522\",\"name\":\"REAL\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-04-07/94ee93c8-9fa3-48b9-ae67-0215c3e3b070.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"real-vxyd\",\"profile_active\":true},\"announcement_date_unix\":1768993200,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N3fb00bcf8e5?dice_id=N3fb00bcf8e5\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u54681218aeb?dice_id=u54681218aeb\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e523fec70261?dice_id=e523fec70261\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Da15210e51a0?dice_id=Da15210e51a0\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P83b8251f58e?dice_id=P83b8251f58e\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z77cfd596d00?dice_id=Z77cfd596d00\"},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"perm_name\":\"oeg35g-patricia-wolf-6th-jun-the-old-church-stoke-newington-london-tickets\",\"unicorn\":true,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"marketeers\":[],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"date_unix\":1780768800,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"impression_id\":\"55e67ca3ba9827ff:91\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1800,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-05/3abfa350-1e6a-4b58-b012-496b49dacb89.jpg?rect=0%2C1324%2C5304%2C5304\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-05/3abfa350-1e6a-4b58-b012-496b49dacb89.jpg?rect=0%2C2385%2C5304%2C3182\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-05/3abfa350-1e6a-4b58-b012-496b49dacb89.jpg?rect=465%2C0%2C4374%2C7952\"},\"id\":\"695b8f424a6bc60001b93fc7\",\"name\":\"Patricia Wolf\",\"seating\":null,\"secondary_status\":null,\"new\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"***Patricia Wolf*** is a musician, sound designer, and field recordist residing in Portland, Oregon. Wolf’s work sonically unites natural and modern worlds, integrating ecological sources into her minimalist electronic compositions. Using melody and repetition she lures listeners to her hypnotic inner space, conjuring vivid textures and atmospheres imbued with emotion. Wolf's debut album, I’ll Look For You In Others was released in February 2022 on Past Inside The Present and was quickly followed up by her 2nd LP See-Through which was released on the Catalan label, Balmat. In June of 2024 she released \\\"The Secret Lives of Birds\\\" on the UK based label Nite Hive. In 2024 Wolf also created the soundtrack and did the sound design and sound mixing for Edward Pack Davee's new feature length film, Hrafnamynd. The soundtrack by the same name was released on Balmat July 11, 2025.\\n\\n***Artists:*** We are always interested in hearing from talented artists. If you’d like to play at our future events, please get in touch at info@realsounds.uk.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"Under 18s to be accompanied by an adult\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-21T11:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-06T23:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-28T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-06T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-06T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Patricia Wolf - Distant Memory\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/distant-memory/1601305633?i=1601305634&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Patricia Wolf\",