accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-r7wq\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.hotboxlive.co.uk/accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-07T15:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Award-winning singer-songwriter, and daughter of cult blues figure, Victor Brox, Kyla Brox’s raw talent has seen her described as “the finest female blues singer of her generation”.\\n\\nWinner of the UK Blues Challenge 2018 and the European Blues Challenge 2019, voted Best Female Vocalist in the 2019 European Blues Awards and semi-finalist in the International Blues Challenge 2019 and 2020, Kyla Brox is at the very top of the UK Blues scene.\\n\\nKyla plays Hot Box in duo form with her husband, virtuoso acoustic guitarist, Danny Blomeley, whose playing, by turns delicate and unrestrained, has earned him a following in his own right.\\n\\n“Manchester’s answer to Aretha Franklin,” Tony Wilson, Factory Records\\n\\n“An authentic soul diva… sensitive, sexy, and with infinite reserves of sassiness,” City Life\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-01T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-07T14:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-01T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-07T14:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-07T20:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"692e02ed2533e1000136cced\",\"name\":\"Kyla Brox and Danny Blomeley\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net