l,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Rough Trade.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"faqs\":[{\"id\":69380,\"title\":\"What are the age restrictions?\",\"body\":\"This is a 16+ event. All attendees 16-17s must be accompanied by a responsible adult who is 18 or older (1:1 ratio). To verify age, ID may be requested. We advise all customers to bring valid ID. For further information, see Age and ID in FAQs. Right of admission reserved.\",\"order\":0}],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"236\",\"name\":\"Rough Trade\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-04-22/9fc79b92-f049-4139-9903-f93a90a88363.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"rough-trade-jqgp\",\"profile_active\":true},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"q27rn9-blue-intimate-performance-7th-jun-earth-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1780855200,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"8fa9a59af65bb1b7:2\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1955\",\"name\":\"EartH\",\"address\":\"11 Stoke Newington Rd, London N16 8BH, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5509892,\"lng\":-0.07532500000002074},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-02-02/92037b31-0756-4c73-9f1b-11e5c4753296.jpg?rect=683%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"earth-76a7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://bit.ly/44dzl75\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":\"EartH Hall\",\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Blue\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-14/d5067ed8-cdde-498b-b453-89da7da88de6.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"130437\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Rough Trade is very excited to present an outstore intimate performance from Blue at EartH Hall, London. This unique event celebrates the release of their new album 'Reflections' released via Cooking Vinyl.\\n\\nThis is a 16+ event. Each under 18 must be accompanied by a responsible adult who is over 21 (1:1 ratio). In order to verify your age, ID may be requested. For this reason, we advise that all customers bring valid ID. For further information see Age and ID in FAQ’s. Right of admission reserved.\\n\\nGeneral Admission tickets do NOT come with an album.\\n\\nPlease note this is an album release show so performances are usually around 45min.\\n\\nAll CD/LP purchases will be shipped at release from 15th January via Second Class Mail. Please note we can only ship to the UK so sales for this event are strictly restricted to this territory.\\n\\nTicket transfer will be off for this event to avoid any shipping issues. Please purchase separate tickets if you're not planning to attend together.\\n\\nMore product information can be found HERE >> https://www.roughtrade.com/product/blue/reflections-12\\n\\nThis is a 16+ event. Each under 18 must be accompanied by a responsible adult who is over 21 (1:1 ratio). In order to verify your age, ID may be requested. For this reason, we advise that all customers bring valid ID. For further information see Age and ID in FAQ’s. Right of admission reserved.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-14T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-14T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-07T21:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"69668b64ed07460001112d7c\",\"name\":\"Blue: Intimate Performance \",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-13/5478de9a-9aee-4b43-88b0-c2e4a9ff31c8.jpg?rect=0%2C1224%2C4912%2C4912\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-13/5478de9a-9aee-4b43-88b0-c2e4a9ff31c8.jpg?rect=0%2C2207%2C4912%2C2947\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-13/5478de9a-9aee-4b43-88b0-c2e4a9ff31c8.jpg?rect=432%2C0%2C4048%2C7360\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":88,\"name\":\"Rough Trade\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.roughtrade.com/gb/privacy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"140305603371460\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-1783149-3\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":863,\"name\":\"EartH\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://earthackney.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"498772217287544\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-6QJEY8LKG2\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":\"781332317\",\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":\"nxkPCNyPg5caEN3eyPQC\",\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":true,\"tty_to_extras\":[{\"ticket_type_id\":1166792,\"extra_ids\":[\"1173065\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1166793,\"extra_ids\":[\"1173065\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1166794,\"extra_ids\":[\"1173065\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1166795,\"extra_ids\":[\"1173065\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1166796,\"extra_ids\":[\"1173065\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1166797,\"extra_ids\":[\"1173065\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1166798,\"extra_ids\":[\"1173065\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1166799,\"extra_ids\":[\"1173065\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1166800,\"extra_ids\":[\"1173065\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1167563,\"extra_ids\":[\"1173065\"]}],\"announcement_date_unix\":1768392000,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/i06e71636b26?dice_id=i06e71636b26\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h1171dd1d801?dice_id=h1171dd1d801\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/zfd6f44ec283?dice_id=zfd6f44ec283\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/uf59b8c4beed?dice_id=uf59b8c4beed\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Wba19d7256ff?dice_id=Wba19d7256ff\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/I12b2b8ec75b?dice_id=I12b2b8ec75b\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Blue - One Last Time\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5Z5MPEjK8JZ7FwYYFBkkaV\",\"artist\":\"Blue\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/ffa69c2df4d6543514e325bdb83b81d456c5892e?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"One Last Time\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Blue - One Last Time\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/one-last-time/1832580489?i=1832580490&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Blue\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/86/48/92/864892fc-8daa-107b-cd02-d3d7ba36e1cd/mzaf_16742388510037267234.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"One Last Time\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2750,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Broadside Hacks.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"faqs\":[{\"id\":77226,\"title\":\"Theatreship Accessibility Policy\",\"body\":\"Theatreship is committed to broadening access to the arts - we know that ticket price is a huge barrier for some. If the regular ticket price is beyond what you feel able to afford for whatever reason, please don't hesitate to email us at tickets@theatreship.co.uk and we will send a ticket at whatever price works for you, no questions asked.\\n\\nDue to the historic nature of the ship, we’re sorry to say there is not currently step-free access into the theatre space. We have dedicated staff on hand to help with stairs, and an onsite wheelchair once you’re inside the venue. If you have any access needs, please do e-mail us at access@theatreship.co.uk, we're always happy to hear from you, and we'll do whatever we can to help!\",\"order\":0}],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1021\",\"name\":\"Broadside Hacks\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"broadside-hacks-eomw\",\"profile_active\":false},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"bb85ek-pierre-bensusan-7th-jun-theatreship-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1780855200,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"8fa9a59af65bb1b7:3\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"14088\",\"name\":\"Theatreship\",\"address\":\"South Quay Plaza 2, London, England E14 9SH, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.500574,\"lng\":-0.01734},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-16/325a798f-118c-4bd1-ad3e-4bfdd4f477dc.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"theatreship-yo272\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Pierre Bensusan\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"91170\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"French acoustic guitar virtuoso, vocalist, and composer Pierre Bensusan, surnamed “Mister DADGAD”, has taken his unique sound to all corners of the globe.\\n\\nWinner of the Independent Music Award for his triple live album \\\"Encore\\\", voted Best World Music Guitarist by Guitar Player Magazine readers’ Poll, winner of the Rose d’Or at the Montreux Festival for his debut album, Pierre is recognized as one of the greatest guitar players of the 21st century.\\n\\nWhen Michael Hedges titles one of his compositions “Bensusan”, you know that the inspiration behind it must be special, and Pierre Bensusan certainly is. Guitarists from Leo Kottke to Larry Corryel, to Tuck Andress, Tommy Emmanuel, Mark Knopfler, Andrew York, Andy Timmons, Pat Metheny, and Steve Lukather… have sung his praises, and Steve Vai released three Bensusan albums on his label Favored Nations. And it's not just guitarists who are so inspired by Pierre's music, as a recent studio collaboration with him on Donny Osmond’s latest album “Start Again” goes to show.\\n\\nIf World Music means the fusion of traditional, contemporary, jazz, classical, and pop music, then Bensusan is one of the most eloquent World Music musicians of our time. A pianist in his beginnings, then self-taught on the guitar, the originality of his style makes him one of today’s greatest guitarists and composers for the instrument. Also called “The Prince of DADGAD”, his story is far from trivial, and it is on stage that this artist has earned his stripes: among others, the Rose d'Or of the Montreux Festival, and being elected Best Guitarist of World Music by the readers of Guitar Player Magazine! His triple album \\\"Encore\\\" won the Grand Prix at the Independent Music Awards in the Best Live Album category... Since his first performances in 1974 in France, the guitarist has sold half a million albums and given thousands of concerts around the globe, both solo and through numerous collaborations.\\n\\nPierre Bensusan is an adventurer of unusual lands. His music is an intimate and orchestral hymn, a solo crossing on a multi-shell Lowden guitar subjected to the natural elements with sound molecules and finger pulp on an ebony fingerboard for open tuning - a unique and transparent technique, under the fingers of an adventurous pilgrim.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-17T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-07T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-17T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-07T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"69946e016e731e00014a2241\",\"name\":\"Pierre Bensusan\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-17/6e99a558-6eda-4934-8047-1381b5d79cdf.jpg?rect=0%2C250%2C1000%2C1000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-17/6e99a558-6eda-4934-8047-1381b5d79cdf.jpg?rect=0%2C450%2C1000%2C600\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-17/6e99a558-6eda-4934-8047-1381b5d79cdf.jpg?rect=88%2C0%2C825%2C1500\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":2229,\"name\":\"Broadside Hacks\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1476463663168370\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":false,\"show_opt_in_form\":false,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1771286400,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ae4863537c43?dice_id=Ae4863537c43\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/yea5cd77b27e?dice_id=yea5cd77b27e\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z879d77ffa83?dice_id=z879d77ffa83\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/S71b5863617b?dice_id=S71b5863617b\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/V9c9cae682ab?dice_id=V9c9cae682ab\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/fd192e97defb?dice_id=fd192e97defb\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Pierre Bensusan - Heman Dubh\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1VoZC8jeyiXQn4KnEUhX68\",\"artist\":\"Pierre Bensusan\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/d01a76862f58a2c5c440d2ef68f599202fd5cca2?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Heman Dubh\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Pierre Bensusan - Heman Dubh\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/heman-dubh/202493496?i=202493968&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Pierre Bensusan\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview71/v4/04/ec/fd/04ecfd44-c896-9dc8-3937-e105196a0628/mzaf_169129860445388592.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Heman Dubh\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":false,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3605},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by AGMP.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"faqs\":[{\"id\":15914,\"title\":\"Which venue is this in?\",\"body\":\"Venue 1 - entrance through double glass doors.\",\"order\":0}],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"6234\",\"name\":\"229\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"229-82l5\",\"profile_active\":false},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"53qwyl-leo-kottke-sold-out-7th-jun-229-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"date_unix\":1780855200,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"8fa9a59af65bb1b7:4\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"399\",\"name\":\"229\",\"address\":\"229 Great Portland St, London W1W 5PN, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.523568,\"lng\":-0.144821},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-04-28/84389ecd-ecb4-45bc-a846-5cf9964535ff.jpg?rect=180%2C0%2C838%2C838\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"229-zl9b\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://229.london/access/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-06-07T23:00:00+01:00\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Leo Kottke\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-01-19/3cbae2a4-901d-43e4-b30f-6711d6e2251d.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"113421\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Acoustic guitarist Leo Kottke was born in Athens, Georgia, but left town after a year and a half. Raised in 12 different states, he absorbed a variety of musical influences as a child, flirting with both violin and trombone, before abandoning Stravinsky for the guitar at age 11.\\n\\nAfter adding a love for the country-blues of Mississippi John Hurt to the music of John Phillip Sousa and Preston Epps, he issued his 1968 recording debut LP Twelve String Blues, for the Oblivion label.\\n\\nLeo Kottke released his major-label debut, 'Mudlark', in 1971. Kottke flourished during his tenure on Capitol Records, as records like 'Greenhouse' (1972) and 'My Feet Are Smiling' (1973) found him branching out with guest musicians and honing his guitar technique.\\n\\nHis recent collaboration with Phish bassist Mike Gordon, 'Clone', caught audiences’ attention in 2002. Kottke and Gordon followed with a recording in the Bahamas called 'Sixty Six Steps', produced by Leo’s old friend and Prince producer David Z.\\n\\nAn AGMP Concerts presentation.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-04-01T00:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-07T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-04-01T00:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-07T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"67ebeaec2cffe20001d7f494\",\"name\":\"Leo Kottke - SOLD OUT\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-07/d9348406-f8fc-4046-804a-cb91b0ca7608.jpg?rect=274%2C0%2C768%2C768\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-07/d9348406-f8fc-4046-804a-cb91b0ca7608.jpg?rect=18%2C0%2C1280%2C768\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-07/d9348406-f8fc-4046-804a-cb91b0ca7608.jpg?rect=447%2C0%2C422%2C768\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":294,\"name\":\"229 The Venue\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://229.london/dataprotection/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1743462000,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/d86eaf27eeb9?dice_id=d86eaf27eeb9\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/fb4bbd704d99?dice_id=fb4bbd704d99\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ccddbc6ae05b?dice_id=Ccddbc6ae05b\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Rfbda8e14727?dice_id=Rfbda8e14727\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Kb58c0ef22ef?dice_id=Kb58c0ef22ef\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/vc8b4c8d3c8c?dice_id=vc8b4c8d3c8c\"},\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":4570},\"seats_io_public_key\":\"e0dc9d72-aa88-4eb1-a260-aba6188eb895\",\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Serious.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"faqs\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1432\",\"name\":\"Serious\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"serious-nyo9\",\"profile_active\":true},\"seats_io_event_id\":\"f346bf71-fb55-465e-8eca-9f703686be55\",\"perm_name\":\"bbx62v-mario-biondi-7th-jun-theatre-royal-drury-lane-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1780857000,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"8fa9a59af65bb1b7:5\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"16659\",\"name\":\"Theatre Royal Drury Lane\",\"address\":\"Catherine Street, Westminster, London, WC2B 5JF, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.51253,\"lng\":-0.120191},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"theatre-royal-drury-lane-ww2kv\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Mario Biondi\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebcdadf8a70e2ecdc63b485557\"},\"artist_id\":\"7390\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"The hit “This Is What You Are” on the radio for the first time in 2006 defined the voice of Mario Biondi, a native of Catania, whose extraordinary warm, velvety voice has invited comparisons with Teddy Pendergrass, Isaac Hayes, and Barry White, three of the greatest black voices of all time.\\n\\nThe real breakthrough came when the song entered the top ten most-played tracks on Norman Jay’s cult program on BBC Radio. The song paved the way for Handful of Soul, a well-balanced cocktail of rhythm & blues, soul, swing, and jazz, alternating original pieces with covers from the less overexposed corners of the American soul repertoire.\\n\\nIt has been 20 years since Mario Biondi's warm, deep voice won over audiences abroad and in Italy with the single “This Is What You Are,” which went on to become one of his most iconic songs and a contemporary classic of international soul-jazz and led to collaborations with Burt Bacharach, Chaka Khan, and Earth, Wind & Fire. Since then, he’s earned platinum albums, recorded for Disney films, and performed on iconic stages.\\n\\nBlending jazz, soul, and pop into a refined signature, Biondi now looks ahead to 2026, when he will tour Europe celebrating the 20th anniversary of “This Is What You Are”.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"4+. Under 15s must be accompanied by an adult. \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"f346bf71-fb55-465e-8eca-9f703686be55\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"e0dc9d72-aa88-4eb1-a260-aba6188eb895\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-26T15:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-05T12:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-28T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-07T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-07T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"69271bda10b09b00010f286d\",\"name\":\"Mario Biondi\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-26/69e5f42a-dd2d-4fd6-919c-25d4b69ad848.jpg?rect=600%2C0%2C2400%2C2400\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-26/69e5f42a-dd2d-4fd6-919c-25d4b69ad848.jpg?rect=0%2C120%2C3600%2C2160\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-26/69e5f42a-dd2d-4fd6-919c-25d4b69ad848.jpg?rect=1140%2C0%2C1320%2C2400\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1446,\"name\":\"Serious\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://serious.org.uk/serious-ticketing-t-cs\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1764171000,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/lb830ccaa648?dice_id=lb830ccaa648\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q3f584c17a88?dice_id=Q3f584c17a88\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/uceae10d5a52?dice_id=uceae10d5a52\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/waf32a160c2d?dice_id=waf32a160c2d\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e710e6d4b9dd?dice_id=e710e6d4b9dd\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q3b148c384fb?dice_id=q3b148c384fb\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Mario Biondi - This Is What You Are\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/album/this-is-what-you-are/199255789?i=199257236&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Mario Biondi\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/apple-assets-us-std-000001/AudioPreview71/v4/84/17/c8/8417c8e5-c184-ff1a-aa03-7cf341a41aa4/mzaf_8022422597990580911.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"This Is What You Are\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Sun 07 Jun\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"unicorn\":true,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":4120,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Underworld.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"faqs\":[{\"id\":58040,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":58041,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":58042,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"g5k5x2-voivod-x-midnight-8th-jun-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1780938000,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"8fa9a59af65bb1b7:6\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-08T18:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Cryptosis\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb95efd7017908c36781ca014f\"},\"artist_id\":\"58643\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Midnight\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebe8f087e1553e9712e1d73f37\"},\"artist_id\":\"9707\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true},{\"name\":\"Voivod\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-17/5c0f254c-c4f9-464b-8076-72d154d1fad0.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"8013\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"**VOIVOD**\\n\\n**MIDNIGHT CELEBRATING 15 YEARS OF SATANIC ROYALTY**\\n\\n**with special guests CRYPTOSIS**\\n\\nVOIVOD are a Canadian Heavy Metal band from Jonquière (now part of Saguenay) Quebec. The original line-up consisted of vocalist Denis \\\"Snake\\\" Bélanger, guitarist Denis \\\"Piggy\\\" D'Amour, drummer Michel \\\"Away\\\" Langevin and bassist Jean-Yves \\\"Blacky\\\" Thériault. The band have had numerous member changes throughout their 43-year career, with Langevin as the only consistent member. Their current line-up includes Langevin, Bélanger, Daniel \\\"Chewy\\\" Mongrain (guitar) and Dominic \\\"Rocky\\\" Laroche (bass).\\n\\nVOIVOD's musical style has changed several times since its inception. Starting out as a Speed Metal band; they have added a mix of Progressive and Thrash Metal to create their own unique Metal style, and have been credited as progenitors of the \\\"Technical Thrash Metal\\\" sound along with CORONER, WATCHTOWER, DARK ANGEL, MEKONG DELTA, ANACRUSIS and BLIND ILLUSION, among others.\\n\\nTo date, VOIVOD have released sixteen studio albums, as well as one EP, one live album, two compilations, seven demos and one DVD featuring a live concert. They have been grouped with SACRIFICE, RAZOR and ANNIHILATOR as the \\\"Big Four\\\" of Canadian Thrash Metal. The band found mainstream success in the late 1980s with their fifth studio album Nothingface (1989), which is VOIVOD's only album to enter the Billboard 200 charts, peaking at number 114. The band won the \\\"Visionary\\\" award at the 2017 Progressive Music Awards. In 2019, Voivod's fourteenth studio album, The Wake, won the Juno Award for Metal/Hard Music Album of the Year. VOIVOD's most recent studio album Morgöth Tales, a collection of re-recorded songs, was released in July 2023.\\n\\nMIDNIGHT are an American band that play a mixture of Black Metal, Speed Metal and Punk; a style referred to as Black n' Roll. It was formed as a solo project by Jamie Walters in 2003 in Cleveland, Ohio. Walters, under the pseudonym Athenar, is the only constant member of the band. While he performs vocals and all instruments in studio recordings, he is accompanied by different musicians during live performances. During their live performances, musicians cover their faces with scarves.\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-18T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-08T16:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-18T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-08T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-08T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"691c4647f5f064000177d024\",\"name\":\"VOIVOD x MIDNIGHT\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-17/69de5007-c505-4006-9563-0885eea1b890.jpg?rect=500%2C0%2C2000%2C2000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-17/69de5007-c505-4006-9563-0885eea1b890.jpg?rect=0%2C100%2C3000%2C1800\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-17/69de5007-c505-4006-9563-0885eea1b890.jpg?rect=950%2C0%2C1100%2C2000\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pi