",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"moth-club-43ox\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://mothclub.co.uk/Access\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-18T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Austin TV\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"88109\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Austin TV is one of the most important rock bands in Latin America. Despite being a instrumental band they have a lot to say. Using masks according to the album concept, they give life to their motto ¨Tu Cara No Importa, Importas Tú¨ (Your face does not matter, you matter!).\\n\\nAfter a 10 year hiatus they decided to return in 2022 with new music and a strong comeback to the stage. Their message has marked more than one generation, they have performed more than 1,200 shows, released 5 albums and with 21 years of experience, they have managed to carry the flag of independence to new horizons. Their iconic concept album \\\"Fontana Bella\\\" was produced by Emmanuelle del Real (Café Tacvba´s Keyboardist and composer), released in 2007 at their Vive Latino Festival show. After a 10-year hiatus, they announced their first comeback show, Selling Out in just 3 minutes at Foro Indie Rocks.\\n\\nCurrently they have already finished their new album, being one of the most anticipated albums of 2023 according to Rolling Stone Mexico magazine. 40,000 people witnessed Austin Tv's return to the stage as one of the main acts at Vive Latino 2023, the most important festival in Latin America.\\n\\nAustin TV surprised everyone with a live session for the cult radio station KEXP, in which they obtained more than 500,000 views in just one month.\\n\\nAustin TV will release their new full length album called \\\"Rizoma\\\" at the end of September 2023. It features 9 instrumental pieces recorded entirely live at Estudios Noviembre in Mexico City.\\n\\nThey recently sold out Pepsi Center WTC with a 6,000 people capacity, consolidating themselves as the most important instrumental rock band in the country.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-10T15:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-18T18:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-10T15:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-18T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-18T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"6989c2dc3449e30001ab0e8d\",\"name\":\"Austin TV\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/a3faf81e-ecc4-4e98-bef2-f106ee2a056e.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1500%2C1500\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/a3faf81e-ecc4-4e98-bef2-f106ee2a056e.jpg?rect=0%2C300%2C1500%2C900\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-09/a3faf81e-ecc4-4e98-bef2-f106ee2a056e.jpg?rect=338%2C0%2C825%2C1500\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"LNZRT\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://lanzaroteworks.com/Privacy-Policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":954,\"name\":\"MOTH\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"2922216871345119\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversio