28b-b24f-6f5d-c1bf-4be33011a599/mzaf_12599421218702361152.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Ella No Me Conoce\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3747,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Old Empire.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"faqs\":[{\"id\":69413,\"title\":\"What's the bag policy?\",\"body\":\"Security – Bag Policy\\n\\nLarge bags – including rucksacks are not allowed.\\n\\nThere are no facilities to leave large bags or luggage.\\n\\nIf you really have to bring a bag – and it’s preferable you don’t – please make sure it’s small.\\n\\nOnly one small bag per person is permitted and it must not be bigger than A4 size.\\n\\nHeight: 28.7cm\\n\\nWidth: 21cm\\n\\nDepth 15cm\",\"order\":0}],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"80\",\"name\":\"Old Empire\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"old-empire-4n2q\",\"profile_active\":false},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"6dn588-death-to-all-18th-jun-o2-academy-islington-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1781805600,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"8fa9a59af65bb1b7:53\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"251\",\"name\":\"O2 Academy Islington\",\"address\":\"Angel Central, N1 Centre, 16 Parkfield St, Islington N1 0PS\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5348047,\"lng\":-0.105732699999976},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"o2-academy-islington-zler\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://academymusicgroup.com/o2academyislington/access\"},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-18T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Death\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"1383\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Death to All\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"46746\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Old Empire proudly present\\n\\nDeath To All\\n\\n’Symbolic Healing European Tour’\\n\\nFounded in 1984 by Chuck Schuldiner in Altamonte Springs, Florida, Death was among the more widely known early pioneers of death metal, along with California’s Possessed. Quickly becoming an integral part in defining the famous Florida death metal sound, their 1987 debut album, ‘Scream Bloody Gore’, is widely regarded as one of the first death metal records. To this day Death is considered to be among the most influential bands in heavy metal music, and remains a pioneering force in death metal.\\n\\nDeath To All operates as a tribute to the original band Death, which dissolved in 2001 following the passing of the group’s founder and frontman, Chuck Schuldiner. The backbone of Death To All comprises original Death members: the legendary drummer Gene Hoglan (Dark Angel, Dethklok), bass beast Steve DiGiorgio (Testament, Sadus), guitarist Bobby Koelble (Death), joined by singer/guitarist Max Phelps (Exist, Cynic).\\n\\nThis London appearance celebrates the 35th anniversary of ‘Spiritual Healing’ (1990) and 30th anniversary of ‘Symbolic’ (1995), two seminal Death albums.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ under 16s accompanied by an adult \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-19T15: