this link for all Jazz Cafe FAQ's: https://thejazzcafe.com/faqs/?\",\"order\":0}],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"5970\",\"name\":\"Como No!\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-09/a9850c4f-895d-494f-beec-abcf15aec03e.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"como-no-v7rd\",\"profile_active\":true},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"v3bk3l-nortec-bostic-fussible-full-band-21st-jun-the-jazz-cafe-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1782064800,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"8fa9a59af65bb1b7:76\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"415\",\"name\":\"The Jazz Cafe\",\"address\":\"5 Parkway, London NW1 7PG\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5387845,\"lng\":-0.143146300000012},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-jazz-cafe-4m7k\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://thejazzcafelondon.com/faqs/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-21T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Nortec Collective\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"129247\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Emerging from Tijuana’s electronic scene, Bostich + Fussible pioneered Nortec — a fusion of techno with Norteño, a traditional style of Mexican music from the north.\\n\\nAs founding members of the Nortec Collective, they captured the spirit of the borderlands, blending traditional instruments with heavy electronic beats into a sound that’s both rooted and futuristic.\\n\\nTheir innovative approach has taken them from Coachella to Bonnaroo, earning them a global following and reshaping modern electronic music.\\n\\nCelebrating their 25th anniversary, they will perform live with the full band, delivering a high-energy show where tradition and technology collide — a vibrant celebration of rhythm, culture, and sound.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-27T13:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-21T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-10-27T13:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-21T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-21T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"68f8ee54509c6500014f8d9b\",\"name\":\"NORTEC: BOSTIC + FUSSIBLE (FULL BAND) \",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-23/b0e5615c-258a-40f5-9833-7e8627b55d96.jpg?rect=213%2C0%2C854%2C854\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-23/b0e5615c-258a-40f5-9833-7e8627b55d96.jpg?rect=0%2C43%2C1280%2C768\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-23/b0e5615c-258a-40f5-9833-7e8627b55d96.jpg?rect=405%2C0%2C470%2C854\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1496,\"name\":\"Como No\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.comono.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1012760396803642\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,