ps and a chain of electronic effects to open out and explore a series of rich, drone-based sound fields. Pulsing, visceral and full of color, her work is deeply immersive, marked by a wonderful sense of restraint and an almost hallucinatory clarity. Meditative yet with a sculptural sharpness and rigor that sets it apart from the swathe of New Age / DIY droners, she has forged a very elegant and precise vision.\\n\\n***Artists:*** We are always interested in hearing from talented artists. If you’d like to play at our future events, please get in touch at info@realsounds.uk.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-20T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-24T23:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-22T09:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-24T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-24T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"69467fb91d724900014a6701\",\"name\":\"Clarice Jensen\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-20/22ceb87c-cf09-4498-aae1-50b65d55dc21.jpg?rect=702%2C0%2C2000%2C2000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-20/22ceb87c-cf09-4498-aae1-50b65d55dc21.jpg?rect=0%2C100%2C3000%2C1800\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-20/22ceb87c-cf09-4498-aae1-50b65d55dc21.jpg?rect=950%2C0%2C1100%2C2000\"},\"marketeers\":[],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1766224800,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ibbc81dd6e69?dice_id=ibbc81dd6e69\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/xed8f6f48799?dice_id=xed8f6f48799\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_ref