:\"2026-06-25T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"6916103beb47cf000179ff77\",\"name\":\"Celeste\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-12/9a9de0b1-d94c-4b70-86b4-8b1962701631.jpg?rect=0%2C1311%2C5027%2C5027\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-12/9a9de0b1-d94c-4b70-86b4-8b1962701631.jpg?rect=0%2C2317%2C5027%2C3016\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-12/9a9de0b1-d94c-4b70-86b4-8b1962701631.jpg?rect=410%2C0%2C4207%2C7649\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1987,\"name\":\"SJM Concerts\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://privacy.sjmconcerts.com/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1763114400,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n8ca2fdef9e3?dice_id=n8ca2fdef9e3\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Xba0b982f67a?dice_id=Xba0b982f67a\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E5e15e66d078?dice_id=E5e15e66d078\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Xaaf7244bcc3?dice_id=Xaaf7244bcc3\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Se4ac66b2aea?dice_id=Se4ac66b2aea\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Rc793c4a5582?dice_id=Rc793c4a5582\"},\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Strange\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/7sq2z9oX2S0CvgTqCZ0ko4\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/a9f8d4785b1d4626fadf7238e93eb4f5d0e3acfc?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Strange\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Celeste - Strange\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/strange/1544501544?i=1544502362&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Celeste\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview122/v4/f3/db/50/f3db50af-2a97-bf45-d052-e44c45df18ed/mzaf_18410906128556864785.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Strange\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1813,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Broadside Hacks, Skinty Records.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"faqs\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"245\",\"name\":\"LNZRT\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-03-12/1814e171-32d9-4237-848d-85f91f0af396.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"lnzrt-jeed\",\"profile_active\":true},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"k69q6o-dug-file-moth-25th-jun-moth-club-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"date_unix\":1782412200,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"8fa9a59af65bb1b7:89\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"43\",\"name\":\"MOTH Club\",\"address\":\"Old Trades Hall, Valette Street, London E9 6NU\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5450825,\"lng\":-0.0546326999999565},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-04-14/0164c968-c9f6-4e55-8329-e0a12ce43b69.jpg?rect=341%2C0%2C1367%2C1367\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"moth-club-43ox\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://mothclub.co.uk/Access\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-25T19:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"DUG\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-07-31/19318201-2805-471d-a68f-8f8191ba5c13.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"125143\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"There’s a natural magnetism to DUG’s folk brew. The duo, made up of Conor (Lorkin) O’Reilly and Jonny Pickett, are gearing up for the release of their debut album, having formed in 2023–but you’d be forgiven for believing that they’ve been writing together for a lifetime.\\n\\nTheir music stems from roots in musical traditions spanning both sides of the pond. In one breath, echoing the great American folk troubadours, and in another, comfortably channelling the elder statesmen of Irish folk.\\n\\nThis is no accident. DUG have a shared musical heritage, with members having been born in America and Scotland before arriving in Ireland. O’Reilly himself spent almost a decade making and releasing music in upstate New York, having picked up sticks from his native Edinburgh, (Irish mother and Scottish father) before moving to Ireland in 2022 to start a new musical chapter.\\n\\nAnd you can hear that lived musical experience in singles like ‘Big Sundown’ and ‘Jubilee’ (shortlisted for two Grammy nominations). Resonator guitar and banjo, the building blocks of DUG’s arrangements, lick and spin, with intricate finger-picking patterns whirling to a compelling whole. Their music breathes, vamping in sync.\\n\\nThey’re damn funny too. DUG’s lyrics catch you off guard, eliciting an honest-to-goodness chuckle in a moment of levity. At their very best, as on their forthcoming album, there’s a bona fide warmth littered throughout their unique take on folk storytelling. Tracks like ‘Wheel of Fortune’ have an easy rapport. It’s catching up with an old friend, all mischief and smiles.\\n\\nThere are allusions to darker moments there too; yearning and melancholy, to lessons learnt the hard way. Taking the heavy with the light, and being able to translate it into a foot-tapping, infectious contemporary folk sound is what DUG do best. They don’t need to posture; their music is naturally playful and honest, inviting you along on their musical journey.\\n\\nDUG’s love for the musicians that inspired them never steps too far into reverence. They’re an unapologetically modern band. You’ll hear plenty of Irish influence in their music, but you’ll not find any tweed coats or paddy caps here. Instead, the band opts to be themselves-completely natural and organic. It’s part of what gives the group’s work such a strong charisma, and helps establish DUG as having one of the most unique takes on contemporary folk music.\\n\\nIn 2024, the duo signed to Claddagh Records, a label in which they find themselves in fine musical company. A subsidiary of Universal Records, Claddagh Records has spent the last few years becoming a hotbed for some of the most forward-thinking musicians in contemporary Irish folk, home to artists like Niamh Bury, Lemoncello, and ØXN, to name a few.\\n\\nIt should come as no surprise that a group that delights in a touch of devilment and so ardently remains true to themselves has built a thriving community of fans, both at their live shows and through their often hilarious social media.\\n\\nOn that note, beyond the release of their debut album, DUG will spend much of 2025 on the road with plans for an extensive international tour. Already announced are Summer dates in the US: Colorado (main stage at Telluride Blugrass Festival), Washington, Portland and Idaho, as well as a debut tour in Australia in October. Irish fans can expect a surely raucous performance at almost every major Irish festival this summer. There’s plenty more dates still to be announced, so it’s well worth keeping your eyes peeled.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-12T11:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-25T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-13T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-25T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-25T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"698da444220c1a00015bd0ed\",\"name\":\"DUG (Féile MOTH)\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-12/26e2068d-b875-4a0e-b29f-b788df9af0f3.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C768%2C768\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-12/26e2068d-b875-4a0e-b29f-b788df9af0f3.jpg?rect=0%2C154%2C768%2C461\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-12/26e2068d-b875-4a0e-b29f-b788df9af0f3.jpg?rect=173%2C0%2C422%2C768\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"LNZRT\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://lanzaroteworks.com/Privacy-Policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":954,\"name\":\"MOTH\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"2922216871345119\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":false,\"show_opt_in_form\":false,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1770894000,\"donation\":null,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H71fe7beb8b9?dice_id=H71fe7beb8b9\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k4e15b813fb0?dice_id=k4e15b813fb0\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q06920c78ccc?dice_id=q06920c78ccc\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F2e645b5d26b?dice_id=F2e645b5d26b\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/d07963d65421?dice_id=d07963d65421\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/t8704104178a?dice_id=t8704104178a\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"DUG - Cumberland Gap\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/cumberland-gap/1825361962?i=1825362480&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"DUG\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/c2/44/62/c2446255-d345-62b4-8722-522d229c5e7a/mzaf_991750814151500898.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Cumberland Gap\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Thu 25 Jun\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"unicorn\":true,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":5894,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Labyrinth.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"faqs\":[{\"id\":17883,\"title\":\"Where can I find out more information about travelling to Alexandra Palace?\",\"body\":\"Head here to find out more and stay up to date: https://www.alexandrapalace.com/visitor-information/get-here/\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":23131,\"title\":\"Is there a cloakroom?\",\"body\":\"£5 for bags (under A4 size only), £3 for coats and £2 for all other items (card only). Large bags are not allowed inside the venue at all (including the cloakroom).\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":17884,\"title\":\"What do I do on the day of the event?\",\"body\":\"On the day of the event (usually 2h before it starts) you’ll be able to activate your ticket in the app and generate your unique QR code.\\n\\nJust follow these steps.\\n\\n1\\\\. Open the DICE app. Tap the ticket icon at the bottom of the screen.\\n\\n2\\\\. Choose the event.\\n\\n3\\\\. Tap Activate QR code.\\n\\nIf you bought tickets for a group and you’re arriving together, you can show everyone’s tickets on your device to the door staff.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":17885,\"title\":\"What if I can’t make the event anymore? \",\"body\":\"**Offer your ticket to another fan**\\n\\nWe believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the wait list: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the wait list function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the wait list after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the wait list works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":23132,\"title\":\"Is there an after show party?\",\"body\":\"Happening in the Phoenix Bar until 1am. Please note this is not an official party related to the artist or promoter.\",\"order\":4},{\"id\":17886,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":5},{\"id\":23130,\"title\":\"Can I bring a bag?\",\"body\":\"You're welcome to bring a bag for your essentials into the festival. However, there won’t be a cloakroom available, and large bags will not be allowed in so please leave them at home.\\n\\nExemptions apply for medical purposes, but we ask that you contact us in advance if this applies to you via access@alexandrapalace.com.\",\"order\":6},{\"id\":23133,\"title\":\"Can I pay in cash?\",\"body\":\"Ally Pally is now fully cashless so bring your card/phone with you to pay across the site.\",\"order\":7}],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1871\",\"name\":\"Alexandra Palace\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"alexandra-palace-oybm\",\"profile_active\":false},\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"2wkyd7-empire-of-the-sun-26th-jun-alexandra-palace-london-tickets\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"date_unix\":1782495000,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"max_tickets\":6,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"impression_id\":\"8fa9a59af65bb1b7:90\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"179\",\"name\":\"Alexandra Palace\",\"address\":\"Alexandra Palace, Alexandra Palace Way, London N22 7AY\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5941783,\"lng\":-0.130773299999987},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-03-12/284d14ab-cfd4-49de-aeca-561e3b4888b2.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C512%2C512\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"alexandra-palace-j7v7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/visitor-information/ticketing/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":\"Alexandra Palace Great Hall\",\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-06-26T18:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Empire of the Sun\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-16/bc70c483-bd51-4b09-b789-fea5b56afd71.jpg?rect=262%2C0%2C4125%2C4125\"},\"artist_id\":\"12765\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Second date added due to phenomenal sign up demand.\\n\\nThe visionary Empire of the Sun are set to make a magical Alexandra Palace debut on June 27th with their Ask That God tour.\\n\\nExpect a journey through Empire Of The Sun’s multi-platinum catalogue, which has amassed over 7.6 billion streams worldwide, interwoven with new material from their latest album. With 34.5 million monthly Spotify listeners, fans can look forward to era-defining anthems including Walking on a Dream, We Are The People, Alive and High & Low, alongside expansive new works that reflect the band’s ever-evolving creative spirit, all brought to life through their trademark cinematic visuals and immersive stage production.\\n\\nThe indie-electronic pioneers will illuminate the Grade II-listed hilltop palace, a site synonymous with iconic performances. For this special London date, the band will unveil an immersive stage production crafted specifically for the venue, transforming the space into an otherworldly realm of light, sound and spectacle.\\n\\nFresh off the immediate sell-out of their show at Labyrinth on the Thames, which marked the band’s return to the UK for the first time in six years, signing up is essential.\\n\\nPre-sale tickets go live January 29th at 9am, exclusively to those who sign up.\\n\\n*If you'd like to learn more about the venue's story and mission, along with how you can play your part to support them - please head here: https://bit.ly/support-ally-pally*\\n\\n*Venue terms and conditions can be viewed here: https://www.alexandrapalace.com/terms-and-conditions/#*\\n\\n*Price includes a £2.50 venue restoration levy.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-28T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-26T21:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-30T09:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-26T18:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-26T22:45:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"properties\":[],\"id\":\"6978bb589704570001e8372d\",\"name\":\"Empire of the Sun\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-28/9d8bfc96-1556-4c8f-ba1f-154da60092e7.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-28/9d8bfc96-1556-4c8f-ba1f-154da60092e7.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-28/9d8bfc96-1556-4c8f-ba1f-154da60092e7.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":471,\"name\":\"Labyrinth Events\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.labyrinthevents.com/terms\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1410823875730293\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":\"CQU8ARJC77UCRPC5TAV0\",\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":959,\"name\":\"Alexandra Palace\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":\"AW-784377975\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"new\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"announcement_date_unix\":1769601600,\"donation\":{\"description\":\"Love Ally Pally? Add a donation to care for the Palace and Park. Your gift helps to protect and restore this special place — for everyone, forever.\\n\\nA percentage of your donation goes towards a payment processing fee (neither DICE or the charity keep any of this fee). For a £10 donation, the charity gets £9.75\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-28/af5fb538-b9c7-4f41-bf11-48d1d9d6d45a.jpeg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"variants\":[{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":100,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE4Mzc1MiwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTUwMjg2LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1ODoxNC4yODk1MTVaIiwicHJpY2UiOjEwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MzU0NSwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MzAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":300,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE4Mzc1MiwidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTUwMjg2LCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1ODoxNC4yODk1Mz