7-ba8d-dc5f1cebbfce.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-23/d2df1a49-8b13-4127-ba8d-dc5f1cebbfce.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"The visionary Empire of the Sun are set to make a magical Alexandra Palace debut on June 27th with their Ask That God tour.\\n\\nExpect a journey through Empire Of The Sun’s multi-platinum catalogue, which has amassed over 7.6 billion streams worldwide, interwoven with new material from their latest album. With 34.5 million monthly Spotify listeners, fans can look forward to era-defining anthems including Walking on a Dream, We Are The People, Alive and High & Low, alongside expansive new works that reflect the band’s ever-evolving creative spirit, all brought to life through their trademark cinematic visuals and immersive stage production.\\n\\nThe indie-electronic pioneers will illuminate the Grade II-listed hilltop palace, a site synonymous with iconic performances. For this special London date, the band will unveil an immersive stage production crafted specifically for the venue, transforming the space into an otherworldly realm of light, sound and spectacle.\\n\\nFresh off the immediate sell-out of their show at Labyrinth on the Thames, which marked the band’s return to the UK for the first time in six years, signing up is essential.\\n\\nPre-sale tickets go live January 29th at 9am, exclusively to those who sign up.\\n\\n*If you'd like to learn more about the venue's story and mission, along with how you can play your part to support them - please head here: https://bit.ly/support-ally-pally*\\n\\n*Venue terms and conditions can be viewed here: https://www.alexandrapalace.com/terms-and-conditions/#*\\n\\n*Price includes a £2.50 venue restoration levy.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"69775bb591a2d50001de7c9d\",\"name\":\"Empire of the Sun\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Empire of the Sun - Walking On a Dream\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/album/walking-on-a-dream/712862605?i=712862708&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Empire of the Sun\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/apple-assets-us-std-000001/AudioPreview128/v4/91/85/96/918596a1-2869-1705-806e-8c256db576af/mzaf_5291754557625606715.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Walking On a Dream\"},{\"type\":\"trailer\",\"title\":null,\"redirect_url\":null,\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/LoVAWsBdSexrSkQe6E4dJEEl6BKaayk4H02Rn2302uZC4.m3u8\",\"track_name\":\"\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Empire of the Sun\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-16/bc70c483-bd51-4b09-b789-fea5b56afd71.jpg?rect=262%2C0%2C4125%2C4125\"},\"artist_id\":\"12765\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-17T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-06-27T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-17T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-06-27T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-06-27T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":64501,\"title\":\"The Jazz Cafe FAQ's\",\"body\":\"Please follow this link for all Jazz Cafe FAQ's: https://thejazzcafe.com/faqs/?\",\"order\":0}],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1496,\"name\":\"Como No\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.comono.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1012760396803642\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pix