85\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R54798484503?dice_id=R54798484503\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/X2e1c45c7517?dice_id=X2e1c45c7517\"},\"perm_name\":\"xe7pdk-james-oliver-band-ft-norman-watt-roy-1st-jul-hot-box-chelmsford-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-20/1cf64a2a-6e8f-4285-a12d-11df5ff43bd4.jpg?rect=207%2C0%2C786%2C786\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-20/1cf64a2a-6e8f-4285-a12d-11df5ff43bd4.jpg?rect=0%2C33%2C1200%2C720\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-20/1cf64a2a-6e8f-4285-a12d-11df5ff43bd4.jpg?rect=384%2C0%2C432%2C786\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"James Oliver is one of the UK’s busiest acts playing over 300 gigs a year all over the UK, Europe, and the USA! For this show he will be joined by Norman Watt Roy on bass of the Blockheads and Wilko Johnson.\\n\\nHe has performed over 3000 gigs and shared the stage with many acts including Albert Lee, Bill Kirchen, Deke Leonard, Greg Koch, Walter Trout, Steve Gibbons, Billy Bremner, Geraint Watkins, and many others.\\n\\nIn 2020 James won the UK Blues Awards Emerging Artist of the Year and has since been nominated 3 additional times.\\n\\nJames Oliver released 2 studio albums 3 live albums and his album Twang was #1 on Amazon Blues Charts for 3 weeks. James is currently working on a new record with legendary producer, Jo\\n\\n“One of the UK’s most revered and incredible next generation guitar masters”\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"692e11284510540001722a57\",\"name\":\"James Oliver Band ft. Norman Watt Roy\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"The James Oliver Band - American Cars\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0Fnnd0LMVchlCZyHti28a