2a947dffd\"},\"perm_name\":\"bb8bgm-hackensaw-boys-2nd-jul-hot-box-chelmsford-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-03/facce85c-9060-4957-bd3e-37efd2d9a443.jpg?rect=0%2C1951%2C4051%2C4051\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-03/facce85c-9060-4957-bd3e-37efd2d9a443.jpg?rect=0%2C1823%2C4051%2C2431\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-03/facce85c-9060-4957-bd3e-37efd2d9a443.jpg?rect=355%2C0%2C3342%2C6076\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Roots music shapeshifters Hackensaw Boys have been making audiences holler and dance since way back in 1999. Formed in Charlottesville and now based in Lynchburg, Virginia, this hard traveling group has built an international following for their high-energy performances and down-to-earth presentation. Despite their roots in traditional music, their homegrown aesthetic (bolstered by the “charismo,” their calling card percussion instrument handmade from cans and other metal objects) belies their contemporary approach to songcraft and showmanship. Hackensaw Boys’ music today has just as much in common with the straight-ahead sound of the Del McCoury Band as it does with the indie rock of Pavement and the modern folk of the Avett Brothers and Mountain Goats. Their most recent LPs merge an old timey sonic palette with a folk-punk sensibility, with poignant lyricism, focused arrangements, and a deep groove all held together by bluegrass chops. Coming out swinging after the pandemic release of A Fireproof House Of Sunshine and 2022’s Hackensaw Boys, they’ve brought this sound on tour dates all across the US, Canada, and Europe, including appearances at ROMP Music Festival, Paaspop (Netherlands), and Tønder Festival (Denmark).\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"698251f09178fb00017d9bb2\",\"name\":\"Hackensaw Boys\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Hackensaw Boys - Bordertown\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/bordertown/77924873?i=77924836&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Hackensaw Boys\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview116/v4/ef/c3/df/efc3df3e-12b2-b964-a5fe-3f99e7352aa5/mzaf_3134520301857479748.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Bordertown\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Hackensaw Boys - Bordertown\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2uRqe0zLR9LSEstJPXf0dv\",\"artist\":\"Hackensaw Boys\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/b8ffbdbd3cf6f1b656bd09727cc55f3b135d4552?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Bordertown\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-13T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-07-02T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-13T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-07-02T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-07-02T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Castle Live.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1768327200,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"15346\",\"name\":\"The Castle\",\"address\":\"1 Castle Street, Luton, LU1 3AA, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.87773,\"lng\":-0.41441},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"61e9810a0ee924eb5436541c\",\"name\":\"Luton\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.879768,\"lng\":-0.415161,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-castle-v3vq7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-07-02T19:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"128716\",\"name\":\"The Castle\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-castle-yk97v\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"49b4780d575288c7:14\",\"date_unix\":1783017000,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1892,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/fa1373a24866?dice_id=fa1373a24866\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r80bbef9b1b0?dice_id=r80bbef9b1b0\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ma2dc36dc866?dice_id=Ma2dc36dc866\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ocbd7af136a3?dice_id=ocbd7af136a3\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n0975706a9d4?dice_id=n0975706a9d4\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/t8fe3f589aed?dice_id=t8fe3f589aed\"},\"perm_name\":\"oeglpa-the-9075-2nd-jul-the-castle-luton-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-12/d92da44a-cd9a-4504-8264-ca62e23e0fb7.jpg?rect=912%2C0%2C3648%2C3648\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-12/d92da44a-cd9a-4504-8264-ca62e23e0fb7.jpg?rect=0%2C183%2C5472%2C3283\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-12/d92da44a-cd9a-4504-8264-ca62e23e0fb7.jpg?rect=1733%2C0%2C2006%2C3648\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Get ready for a night of pure 1975-era magic ✨\\n\\nThe 9075 are bringing the sound, the swagger, and the emotional punch of The 1975 to The Castle, Luton — and this isn’t just a tribute… it’s an experience.\\n\\nAs the world’s first tribute band to The 1975, The 9075 recreate the atmosphere, energy, and iconic moments that fans know and love. From euphoric singalongs to shimmering guitars and moody, cinematic vibes, this show is built for the die-hard fans and the casual listeners who just want an unforgettable night out.\\n\\nExpect huge anthems, deep cuts that hit hard, a crowd singing every word, and the kind of night that feels like a real 1975 show.\\n\\nIf you’ve ever screamed the lyrics, danced with strangers, or felt that rush when the lights go down — this one’s for you.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 16+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"6965249b8dca4900015fae9a\",\"name\":\"The 9075\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"The 1975 - If You’re Too Shy (Let Me Know) [Edit]\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/if-youre-too-shy-let-me-know-edit/1508995271?i=1508995274&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"The 1975\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/d2/b2/26/d2b226be-12b1-48b0-4f69-73d38467f8bd/mzaf_10622352300469540961.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"If You’re Too Shy (Let Me Know) [Edit]\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"The 1975 - About You\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3hEfpBHxgieRLz4t3kLNEg\",\"artist\":\"The 1975\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/39c5cb6625074a7cac706f73cf958d571802bd43?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"About You\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Thu 02 Jul\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-01T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-07-03T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-01T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-07-03T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-07-03T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"New Cross Live presents\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1764583200,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1641\",\"name\":\"New Cross Inn\",\"address\":\"New Cross Inn, 323 New Cross Rd, London SE14 6AS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4757899,\"lng\":-0.037162699999953475},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/ba29f2fe-617e-4542-80b7-6e2529031d70.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C225%2C225\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"new-cross-inn-x9yl\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.newcrossinn.com/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-07-03T18:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1888\",\"name\":\"New Cross Live\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"new-cross-live-y8la\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"49b4780d575288c7:15\",\"date_unix\":1783098000,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2200,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Aee16ab9a6ec?dice_id=Aee16ab9a6ec\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ceaee1d07a05?dice_id=ceaee1d07a05\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/jb895c28567d?dice_id=jb895c28567d\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/gfe01bb2ebe7?dice_id=gfe01bb2ebe7\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/M26aab1ab7a6?dice_id=M26aab1ab7a6\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/bb34d8adf6e5?dice_id=bb34d8adf6e5\"},\"perm_name\":\"xe7lre-soft-machine-3rd-jul-new-cross-inn-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":\"rescheduled\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-28/4ca359c1-dcfc-47fb-b275-d8ced97ddcb3.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-28/4ca359c1-dcfc-47fb-b275-d8ced97ddcb3.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-28/4ca359c1-dcfc-47fb-b275-d8ced97ddcb3.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Soft Machine\\n\\nTheir work, from their earliest performances as a psychedelic band who were contemporaries of, and shared stages with, Syd Barrett's Pink Floyd and the Jimi Hendrix Experience, all the way to being one of Europe's best known 'fusion' groups, has influenced several generations of bands, and continues to be name-checked by today's hip experimentalists.\\n\\nWhilst the line-up of Soft Machine may have changed many times since the heady days of the late 1960’s, the band’s spirit of musical adventure, and the ease with which it freely avoids being pigeon holed and can move from powerful progressive jazz fusion to atmospheric psychedelia to free improvised jazz-rock to ambient loop music continues to make it both unique and totally contemporary.\\n\\nhttps://www.softmachine.org\\n\\n\\\\+ support\\n\\nDB Infusion\\n\\nDanny Berdichevsky's Infusion is a dynamic, high energy instrumental band which blends jazz rock fusion with elements from Latin, Flamenco, Classical, Middle Eastern and African music to produce a rich, melodic and highly original sound. \\n\\nhttps://www.db-infusion.co.uk/\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ under 16's to be accompanied by an adult\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"69297eaa35bac9000109b9a9\",\"name\":\"Soft Machine\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Hazard Profile Pt.1\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5O4zm28e5KYkojyhoWY6w9\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/8ad587e2e293367622cd930c09334a2f356f3216?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Hazard Profile Pt.1\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Soft Machine - Why Are We Sleeping?\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/album/why-are-we-sleeping/307719104?i=307719120&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Soft Machine\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/apple-assets-us-std-000001/Music/v4/74/fd/c4/74fdc498-75a9-a095-b038-f775e4c3c3a2/mzaf_1711400785668513113.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Why Are We Sleeping?\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Soft Machine\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/6d1a3e811561a488c1c7d0b320403268ec027b70\"},\"artist_id\":\"11074\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-17T11:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-07-03T21:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-21T09:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-07-03T18:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-07-03T22:45:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":57132,\"title\":\"Where can I find out more information about travelling to Alexandra Palace?\",\"body\":\"Head here to find out more and stay up to date: https://www.alexandrapalace.com/visitor-information/get-here/\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":57133,\"title\":\"What do I do on the day of the event?\",\"body\":\"On the day of the event (usually 2h before it starts) you’ll be able to activate your ticket in the app and generate your unique QR code.\\n\\nJust follow these steps.\\n\\n1\\\\. Open the DICE app. Tap the ticket icon at the bottom of the screen.\\n\\n2\\\\. Choose the event.\\n\\n3\\\\. Tap Activate QR code.\\n\\nOnce you activate your ticket, you will no longer be able to send it to a friend.\\n\\nIf you bought tickets for a group and you’re arriving together, you can show everyone’s tickets on your device to the door staff.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":57134,\"title\":\"What if I can’t make the event anymore? \",\"body\":\"**Offer your ticket to another fan**\\n\\nWe believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the wait list: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the wait list function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the wait list after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the wait list works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\\n\\n**Transfer your ticket to a friend**\\n\\nIf a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":57135,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":57136,\"title\":\"Is there a cloakroom?\",\"body\":\"£5 for bags (under A4 size only), £3 for coats and £2 for all other items (card only). Large bags are not allowed inside the venue at all (including the cloakroom).\",\"order\":4},{\"id\":57137,\"title\":\"Can I bring a bag?\",\"body\":\"BAG POLICY FOR LIVE MUSIC EVENTS AT ALEXANDRA PALACE\\n\\nWe encourage you to attend live music events without bags. Should you need to bring one for your essentials, it needs to be as small as possible.\\n\\nFor security reasons and in line with industry best practice, visitors are only permitted to bring one small bag into the venue, which must be no bigger than:\\n\\nHeight 30cm (11.8 inches)\\n\\nWidth 20cm (7.9 inches)\\n\\nDepth 10cm (3.9 inches)\\n\\nAny bags that do not meet these requirements will be directed to our bag drop (Great Hall concerts only).\\n\\nExemptions apply for medical purposes, but we ask that you contact us in advance if this applies to you via access@alexandrapalace.com.\",\"order\":5},{\"id\":57138,\"title\":\"Is there an after show party?\",\"body\":\"Happening in the Phoenix Bar until 1am.\",\"order\":6},{\"id\":57139,\"title\":\"Can I pay in cash?\",\"body\":\"Ally Pally is now fully cashless so bring your card/phone with you to pay across the site.\",\"order\":7}],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":959,\"name\":\"Alexandra Palace\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":\"AW-784377975\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Metropolis Music and AEG.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1763377200,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"179\",\"name\":\"Alexandra Palace\",\"address\":\"Alexandra Palace, Alexandra Palace Way, London N22 7AY\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5941783,\"lng\":-0.130773299999987},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-03-12/284d14ab-cfd4-49de-aeca-561e3b4888b2.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C512%2C512\"},