ink for all Jazz Cafe FAQ's: https://thejazzcafe.com/faqs/?\",\"order\":0}],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":380,\"name\":\"Columbo Music\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://thecolumbogroup.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"298700384025189\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Jazz Cafe.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770804000,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"415\",\"name\":\"The Jazz Cafe\",\"address\":\"5 Parkway, London NW1 7PG\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5387845,\"lng\":-0.143146300000012},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-jazz-cafe-4m7k\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://thejazzcafelondon.com/faqs/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-07-05T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"43\",\"name\":\"The Jazz Cafe\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-jazz-cafe-43ox\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"49b4780d575288c7:21\",\"date_unix\":1783274400,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3175,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D3528d7caf34?dice_id=D3528d7caf34\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/O571a705f8bf?dice_id=O571a705f8bf\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/cccdb4fe60c0?dice_id=cccdb4fe60c0\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T4d071fea079?dice_id=T4d071fea079\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P65023fd6dd9?dice_id=P65023fd6dd9\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v28fa8c131be?dice_id=v28fa8c131be\"},\"perm_name\":\"nv9mdq-yellowman-the-upper-cut-band-5th-jul-the-jazz-cafe-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/f143fe18-e780-4285-9bb9-8ffcd8da1afa.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1030%2C1030\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/f143fe18-e780-4285-9bb9-8ffcd8da1afa.jpg?rect=0%2C206%2C1030%2C618\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-10/f143fe18-e780-4285-9bb9-8ffcd8da1afa.jpg?rect=232%2C0%2C567%2C1030\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"**A founding figure of dancehall culture, Yellowman is one of Jamaica’s most influential and recognisable voices.**\\n\\nRising from the Kingston sound-system scene in the early 1980s, he emerged at a pivotal moment for reggae, embodying a rebellious new voice while helping define dancehall as a global force.\\n\\nHis seminal albums Mr. Yellowman and Yellow Like Cheese, released on CBS Records, remain two of the most iconic productions in Jamaican music history.\\n\\nJoined by the Upper Cut Band, Yellowman brings his legendary catalogue to our stage for a rare live performance celebrating the roots and power of dancehall.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"698b6474849e780001ccc606\",\"name\":\"Yellowman & The Upper Cut Band\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Sun 05 Jul\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-27T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-07-06T09:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-29T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-07-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-07-07T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":71655,\"title\":\"Age Restriction\",\"body\":\"13 and under allowed in level 2 with an adult (18 and over)\\n\\n14 and 15 allowed in level 1 with an adult (18 and over)\\n\\n16 allowed in level 1 by themselves but CANNOT be a responsible adult for someone younger than them\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":71656,\"title\":\"Where are my tickets?\",\"body\":\"**IMPORTANT: Read here about your Roundhouse tickets**\\n\\nPlease note you will need to access your tickets via the Roundhouse Online Wallet at - http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk\\n\\nYour tickets WILL NOT be available in the DICE app. Just follow the below steps below on the day of event to access your ticket to the show:\\n\\nHead to http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk\\n\\nSign in using your DICE account email address - if you already had a Roundhouse account under the same email address, enter the password associated with this email address. If you didn’t have one, Roundhouse will have created one for you and you’ll just need to reset the password before logging in.\\n\\nIf you need to reset your password, you’ll be taken to http://roundhouse.org.uk, but you need to log in again at http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk to access your ticket.\\n\\nThe QR code should appear a couple of hours before the stated time on your ticket\\n\\nIf you want to transfer your tickets to a friend please do so at least 4 hours before the event within the Roundhouse ticket wallet.\\n\\nIf you cannot access your tickets in the Roundhouse online wallet please visit the venue box office when you arrive and one of the team will be happy to assist you.\\n\\nFull information regarding the Roundhouse online wallet can be found at - https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/faqs/digital-tickets/\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":71657,\"title\":\"Security\",\"body\":\"On arrival you will be greeted by our ticket scanners and our security teams. Our security checks include bag searches and a search of individuals using wands. Please be prepared upon arrival to go through this process and help speed up the entry. Our security teams are there for your safety but we recognise that this process can be daunting for some. Please do raise any concerns with staff members when you arrive so that we can support you where needed.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":71658,\"title\":\"Prohibited Items\",\"body\":\"We reserve the right to prohibit specific items from the Roundhouse Premises. A full list of prohibited items can be found in our Admissions Terms & Conditions: https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/terms-policies/admissions-terms/\\n\\nUnfortunately flags and banners are not permitted into the venue as they can obstruct the view for other people in the audience. Please note this list is not exhaustive. The Venue Management has the right to prohibit any other items that are not included in this list but are deemed to cause a risk to the building or people.\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":71659,\"title\":\"Accessibility Tickets\",\"body\":\"Accessibility tickets must be booked directly with the venue, not through DICE. Please get in touch with the venue via access@roundhouse.org.uk prior to purchasing.\",\"order\":4}],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1496,\"name\":\"Como No\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.comono.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1012760396803642\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":\"80a917ca-10a7-4c59-bb64-9f091d8d0152\",\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Como No!.\",\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"80a917ca-10a7-4c59-bb64-9f091d8d0152\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"668c8537-569b-459b-aa5d-df72d382717b\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"announcement_date_unix\":1769508000,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"114\",\"name\":\"Roundhouse\",\"address\":\"Roundhouse, Chalk Farm Rd, London NW1 8EH\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5430406,\"lng\":-0.15131180000003},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-24/2fce8c34-cb66-4510-a1d0-f2c07a1f9479.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2889%2C2889\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"roundhouse-4296\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/visit/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-07-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":\"668c8537-569b-459b-aa5d-df72d382717b\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"5970\",\"name\":\"Como No!\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-09/a9850c4f-895d-494f-beec-abcf15aec03e.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"como-no-v7rd\",\"profile_active\":true},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"49b4780d575288c7:22\",\"date_unix\":1783447200,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":7674},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K1bdd19dc44a?dice_id=K1bdd19dc44a\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J74151c57eef?dice_id=J74151c57eef\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/afebac40952e?dice_id=afebac40952e\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r734562e1b61?dice_id=r734562e1b61\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F454012682cd?dice_id=F454012682cd\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c17dc92f4b31?dice_id=c17dc92f4b31\"},\"perm_name\":\"dk32ro-gilberto-gil-7th-jul-roundhouse-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/2fbeac41-5b35-4974-9634-f272b6402e07.jpg?rect=832%2C0%2C3328%2C3328\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/2fbeac41-5b35-4974-9634-f272b6402e07.jpg?rect=0%2C167%2C4992%2C2995\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/2fbeac41-5b35-4974-9634-f272b6402e07.jpg?rect=1581%2C0%2C1830%2C3328\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"A living legend of Brazilian music, Gilberto Gil returns to the stage with a concert that is both a celebration of legacy and a deeply personal musical encounter.\\n\\nOne of the architects of Tropicalismo and a defining voice of Brazilian culture for over six decades, Gilberto Gil has shaped generations through songs that blend Bahia’s traditions with global sounds — samba, reggae, pop, rock, and Afro-Brazilian rhythms — creating a musical language that is unmistakably his own.\\n\\nFor this special performance, Gilberto Gil will revisit his long and rich musical career, performing some of his most beloved songs, including “Aquele Abraço”, “Toda Menina Baiana”, “Expresso 2222”, “Andar com Fé”, “Drão”, “Palco”, and “Não Chore Mais”.\\n\\nHe is joined on stage by members of his own family, transforming the concert into an intimate dialogue between generations. Sharing the stage with him are his children and grandchildren: Bem Gil (vocals, guitar, bass), José Gil (vocals, drums), João Gil (vocals, guitar, bass), and Flor Gil (vocals, keyboards). Together, they bring new life and warmth to a repertoire that has become part of Brazil’s cultural history.\\n\\nWith over 60 albums released, multiple Grammy and Latin Grammy Awards, and a career that spans music, culture and public life, Gilberto Gil remains a singular figure in world music — as relevant, generous, and inspiring as ever.\\n\\nThis is an all-ages event (Under 16s accompanied by an adult, Under 14s accompanied and in seats).\",\"highlights\":[]},\"id\":\"6977a4f20ca8a200010df5cd\",\"name\":\"Gilberto Gil\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Andar com fé\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2BvDFQOl4JieEGK2cgKOey\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/b90ffe158a1588fb6daaa5b81e7c9e0c76b0197b?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Andar com fé\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Gilberto Gil\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-23/9cf0d44d-745f-46cd-8629-132fe566d59a.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"131239\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Tue 07 Jul\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-11T15:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-07-08T22:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-12T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-07-08T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-07-08T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":20779,\"title\":\"How can I purchase an accessible ticket?\",\"body\":\"Please email accesstickets@troxy.co.uk with a copy of your proof of eligibility.\\n\\nFor more information about Accessible bookings and example proof of eligibility, visit https://troxy.co.uk/accessibility/.\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":20780,\"title\":\"Can I get a carer ticket if I have a standing or circle ticket?\",\"body\":\"We can offer free companion tickets upon receipt of proof of eligibility and your DICE booking confirmation at accesstickets@troxy.co.uk. Companion ticket availability is limited in the Circle, so please reach out to check availability before purchasing a Circle ticket.\",\"order\":1}],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":14,\"name\":\"Troxy\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://troxy.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":\"bedc69aa-368a-463d-b01e-45a3c229f37d\",\"presented_by\":\"Presented by FORM.\",\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"bedc69aa-368a-463d-b01e-45a3c229f37d\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"d31cbde6-a999-4e14-8ec1-e975c10adbf1\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"announcement_date_unix\":1770822000,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"583\",\"name\":\"Troxy\",\"address\":\"490 Commercial Road, London E1 0HX\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5127267,\"lng\":-0.0440164000000323},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-02-09/061113a1-696d-4a63-976d-388707e1d2c4.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2750%2C2750\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"troxy-ww3x\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://troxy.co.uk/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-07-08T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-07-08T23:00:00+01:00\"}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":\"d31cbde6-a999-4e14-8ec1-e975c10adbf1\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1554\",\"name\":\"Troxy\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"troxy-5wrl\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"49b4780d575288c7:23\",\"date_unix\":1783533600,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3657},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/C0b2a2c1303d?dice_id=C0b2a2c1303d\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/zc32f75d0ab7?dice_id=zc32f75d0ab7\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/df0100026f47?dice_id=df0100026f47\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ucd3d4e23a70?dice_id=Ucd3d4e23a70\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/dd6f3a1d4138?dice_id=dd6f3a1d4138\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u7f0b12e6f86?dice_id=u7f0b12e6f86\"},\"perm_name\":\"v39vdv-kevin-morby-8th-jul-troxy-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/32e8e59c-86a3-4c28-a4ca-68fde677f042.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C768%2C768\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/32e8e59c-86a3-4c28-a4ca-68fde677f042.jpg?rect=0%2C154%2C768%2C461\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/32e8e59c-86a3-4c28-a4ca-68fde677f042.jpg?rect=173%2C0%2C422%2C768\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"If I needed to guess what his music would contour toward, or away from, that would be harder. He thinks in the unit of the album, album-sized steps into the future, each one a concept that ripples through, song by song, to the end.\\n\\n“Field Guide for the Butterflies says everything this record’s about,” he tells me. “It’s all in there. I was on this drive through Arkansas by myself. I noticed that butterflies kept hitting my truck, as they were trying to cross the highway. I went to Dickson Street Books in Fayetteville, and looked at this book, Field Guide to the North American Butterfly. It was this moment where I was like, what does it mean that there are butterflies crossing the highway, what do they mean as a symbol? The people who died going to my show, it means that. It means me and Katie meeting on the road and touring together and falling in love. It’s like, we’re floating around. Flying over the highway like we are not butterflies. Like we are not fragile.”\\n\\nBut they are. We are. - Rachel Kushner\\n\\nBooking fees include a £2.25 venue restoration levy per ticket.\\n\\n**Accessible Bookings:**\\n\\nTickets for Troxy’s step-free seated accessible area are available directly from this listing as Accessible Area tickets. If you’ve purchased Accessible Area tickets for this event and haven’t done so for a previous event at Troxy, please email accesstickets@troxy.co.uk with a copy of your proof of eligibility. We accept PIP letters, Access Cards, Blue Badge, Doctor's notes, etc. Please ensure that this is sent to us within 7 days of your purchase, as failure to do so could result in your ticket being cancelled and refunded. Please direct all other accessibility enquiries to accesstickets@troxy.co.uk.\\n\\nFor more information about Accessible bookings and example proof of eligibility, visit https://troxy.co.uk/accessibility/.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"6989b784abd5300001870a2d\",\"name\":\"Kevin Morby\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Kevin Morby\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-06/88024ebd-5383-4cc2-8332-3ab08e029077.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"330\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Paired with indie folk instrumentals that embody America’s Deep South, Kevin Morby’s sublime lyrical tales have won comparisons to Bob Dylan. Morby, who fronted The Babies in the mid ’10s, uses his surroundings as a muse, from New York on his 2013 debut, Harlem River, to Memphis on This Is a Photograph (2022). These cinematic stories flourish as Morby performs them alongside his live band.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true},{\"name\":\"Liam Kazar\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"31585\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":