ssion, along with how you can play your part to support them - please head here: https://bit.ly/support-ally-pally\\n\\nVenue terms and conditions can be viewed here: https://www.alexandrapalace.com/terms-and-conditions/#\\n\\nPrice includes a £2.50 venue restoration levy.\\n\\nWet Leg has partnered with PLUS1 to support War Child. £1.20 (minus applicable taxes) from every ticket sold will go to PLUS1 who help War Child to protect, educate, and stand up for the rights of children affected by war.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"68fa59a8778dc300016644a3\",\"name\":\"Wet Leg\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Wet Leg - Chaise Longue\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/7iqAuZe5yS0suLQcFfVK39\",\"artist\":\"Wet Leg\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/0a1534b179b809dfa3c5f6c380d0e7eb14d22f58?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Chaise Longue\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"English Teacher\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-07-17/e2de85f3-6c9b-4ef5-a1de-c4f2218e151f.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C341%2C341\"},\"artist_id\":\"23028\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Wet Leg \",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-06-26/19fe5809-c584-4a6b-a5ab-30e26a43fcc8.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"34737\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-03T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-07-10T19:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-05T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-07-10T19:00:00+01:00\",\"ev