’ sparking a reminiscent sound to bands of the golden of the 70’s such as led Zeppelin, Black Sabbath, and Free.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"69824f84e9015a0001b41d16\",\"name\":\"SANTÙ\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"SANTÙ - Scream\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/66KxL9q3bJy2QtpSdV5M3W\",\"artist\":\"SANTÙ\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/f6b61b89041259b6a0483383c528ac5e75a14ddf?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Scream\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"SANTÙ - Scream\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/scream/1644951382?i=1644951384&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"SANTÙ\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview122/v4/17/db/fc/17dbfce9-a785-d01d-d297-0796a7119420/mzaf_16064116379049439369.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Scream\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"SANTÙ\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"116055\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-27T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-07-17T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-30T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-07-17T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-07-17T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1038,\"name\":\"Pink Mist\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://pinkmist.limitedrun.com/pages/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"596808222645807\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel