_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ld94f060dce0?dice_id=ld94f060dce0\"},\"perm_name\":\"ryndvw-another-vu-a-tribute-to-the-velvet-underground-18th-jul-bush-hall-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/04b978c1-fd10-4fb8-b2b5-dc6c3da62701.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C7000%2C7000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/04b978c1-fd10-4fb8-b2b5-dc6c3da62701.jpg?rect=0%2C1400%2C7000%2C4200\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/04b978c1-fd10-4fb8-b2b5-dc6c3da62701.jpg?rect=1575%2C0%2C3850%2C7000\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"'Entropy Prescribed Intravenously' - A 60th Anniversary Tribute To The Velvet Underground & Nico\\n\\n\\\"A decade before punk - before the world was ready - there was The Velvet Underground.\\n\\nThey didn’t play it safe. They shattered conventions, creating raw, confrontational art that redefined rock & roll and laid the foundations for generations to come.\\n\\nAnother VU’s 'Entropy Prescribed Intravenously' recreates the legendary 'Exploding Plastic Inevitable' - the groundbreaking events the Velvets created with Andy Warhol.\\n\\nCelebrating 60 years since the first true multimedia concerts, this production plunges audiences back into the kaleidoscopic environment of orbiting colour reflections, liquid light projections, flashing xenon strobes, and evocative film imagery colliding with the Velvets’ hypnotic, timeless music.\\n\\nThis special event also features guest star Caroline Dawson performing the songs Nico sang with the band, on their debut album.\\n\\nExperience the euphoria - and dance as if you’ve slipped straight back into 1966.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"69737416a4ecfb0001ff50d2\",\"name\":\"ANOTHER VU - A TRIBUTE TO THE VELVET UNDERGROUND\",\"shopping_cart_