/6a60a0a1-dc81-4ce9-bd1b-265316643e3f.jpg?rect=0%2C151%2C4496%2C2698\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-18/6a60a0a1-dc81-4ce9-bd1b-265316643e3f.jpg?rect=1423%2C0%2C1650%2C3000\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"La Forastería is a vibrant music tribeled by Tuto Petruzzi, a multi-instrumentalist producer and composer, and the powerful singer and songwriter Toni Volpen.\\n\\nTheir live set blends Afro and Latin American roots with modern and electronic genres, creating a unique sound using a variety of instruments like guitar, charango, synths, percussion, and live vocals with 5 musicianson stage. This fusion creates a distinctivesound that resonates within the indie, psychedelic, world music, and folktronic scenes.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"6943fdff215e90000133ae41\",\"name\":\"La Forasteria\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Espíritu De Seda\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0v4js74LfOaGOfKK66xSNY\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/3652a2e3c37f81129ee7697dec39bb774e7e4dc2?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Espíritu De Seda\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"La Forastería - Cosmic Home\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/cosmic-home/1717587474?i=1717587487&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"La Forastería\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview126/v4/35/84/4d/35844d6c-ceee-1366-4052-7c9e092fa906/mzaf_8876550178330989065.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Cosmic Home\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"La Forasteria\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebf4c9a2f4377