8869\"]},{\"ticket_type_id\":1189873,\"extra_ids\":[\"1178870\",\"1178869\"]}],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_disabled\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Labyrinth\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770112800,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1152\",\"name\":\"Old Royal Naval College\",\"address\":\"Old Royal Naval College, King William Walk, London, Greenwich SE10 9NN, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4827375,\"lng\":-0.008513499999935448},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"old-royal-naval-college-kxpp\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-07-31T16:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"122060\",\"name\":\"Labyrinth Festivals\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-02/4c68f801-1782-477b-976d-6b2c8c0da0d9.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"labyrinth-festivals-qylqp\",\"profile_active\":true},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"49b4780d575288c7:79\",\"date_unix\":1785510000,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":7268},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ob8bde6a4e8e?dice_id=Ob8bde6a4e8e\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Pcc78550d040?dice_id=Pcc78550d040\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/g272297ccae1?dice_id=g272297ccae1\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J1e78f124fae?dice_id=J1e78f124fae\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q3ca3a0f42a9?dice_id=q3ca3a0f42a9\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/f4e4cd5c5580?dice_id=f4e4cd5c5580\"},\"perm_name\":\"g5ddab-the-kooks-20-years-of-inside-ininside-out-london-31st-jul-old-royal-naval-college-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-20/d5ca5ef8-424d-4842-afbd-88cb5217e6e7.jpg?rect=0%2C72%2C2008%2C2008\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-20/d5ca5ef8-424d-4842-afbd-88cb5217e6e7.jpg?rect=0%2C648%2C2008%2C1205\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-20/d5ca5ef8-424d-4842-afbd-88cb5217e6e7.jpg?rect=317%2C0%2C1375%2C2500\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"20 years of The Kooks' Inside In / Inside Out and to celebrate, London had to be extra special. On July 31st the era-defining Indie band will perform at London's iconic Old Royal Naval College, UNESCO World Heritage Site - a unique chance to experience their anthemic live show in the grounds of one of the capital’s most spectacular settings.\\n\\nImagine singing the timeless \\\"Naive\\\", \\\"Seaside\\\", \\\"Ohh La\\\" & \\\"She Moves In Her Own Way\\\" framed by the River Thames and London’s skyline. This will be pure magic.\\n\\nLuke Pritchard from The Kooks - \\\"The Old Royal Naval College gig is going to be something else. I spent half my childhood running around Greenwich - my mum’s shop was literally a stone’s throw away. Those buildings, that riverside, it’s all tied up with my earliest memories of music and discovering who I wanted to be. To bring The Kooks back there now, to play in front of those iconic buildings where I used to daydream about being in a band feels surreal. See you there, can’t wait\\\"\\n\\nJoining The Kooks are Britain's legendary Circa Waves, known for their nervy, melodic indie rock. We can't wait to hear \\\"T-Shirt Weather\\\" on the Thames!\\n\\nThis date comes off the back of a sold out O2 Arena show for The Kooks and tickets will be in huge demand, for this 20 year celebration.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.  Photo ID required.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"6980bd5870b67200012ec204\",\"name\":\"The Kooks 20 Years of Inside In/Inside Out London\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"The Kooks - Naive\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/naive/714597926?i=714597985&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"The Kooks\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview122/v4/c0/73/29/c073299c-e0ab-ad3d-2368-5a5e9013ac8f/mzaf_10487254890433455261.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Naive\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"The Kooks\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-02/1ee31962-99a6-435a-a200-225a7d261aa8.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C800%2C800\"},\"artist_id\":\"18468\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true},{\"name\":\"Circa Waves\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-09/206763a1-eef6-4a74-8d8c-6499c7c4cba0.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"},\"artist_id\":\"484\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-17T11:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-07-31T14:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-17T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-07-31T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-07-31T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":77189,\"title\":\"Venue Accessibility Information\",\"body\":\"monopolyaccessibility@ticketquarter.co.uk\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":77190,\"title\":\"Age Restricition\",\"body\":\"This event is 14 and over. 14s to 16s must be accompanied by an adult.\\n\\nAny ticket holder unable to present valid identification indicating that they are at least 14 years of age will not be admitted to this event and will not be eligible for a refund.\",\"order\":1}],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Pad Presents.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1771326000,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"55\",\"name\":\"Electric Ballroom\",\"address\":\"184 Camden High St, London NW1 8QP\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5396558,\"lng\":-0.143191399999978},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/fab0b36d-a5a4-4e37-a541-2c5af15a3bc1.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C400%2C400\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"electric-ballroom-j78v\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://electricballroom.co.uk/disabled-access/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-07-31T18:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"14332\",\"name\":\"The Pad Presents\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-pad-presents-nvlp3\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"49b4780d575288c7:80\",\"date_unix\":1785517200,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2163,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u5dab7fb8263?dice_id=u5dab7fb8263\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p5c31be82b55?dice_id=p5c31be82b55\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ab55a7820486?dice_id=Ab55a7820486\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/mfe8dbcd1bf0?dice_id=mfe8dbcd1bf0\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w3d0fef04f9d?dice_id=w3d0fef04f9d\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b2c3e3600cb2?dice_id=b2c3e3600cb2\"},\"perm_name\":\"3owebx-nirvana-uk-31st-jul-electric-ballroom-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-17/52caf1d7-23bf-41b4-a6a8-bc8dd8507972.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C3000%2C3000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-17/52caf1d7-23bf-41b4-a6a8-bc8dd8507972.jpg?rect=0%2C600%2C3000%2C1800\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-17/52caf1d7-23bf-41b4-a6a8-bc8dd8507972.jpg?rect=675%2C0%2C1650%2C3000\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Nirvana UK are returning to Electric Ballroom with the ultimate double bill, featuring a tribute to Pearl Jam ‘Brain Of J’, creating the ultimate 90s grunge package for one night only.\\n\\nNIRVANA UK:\\n\\nTearing up venues up and down the UK and around Europe, the band are formed of 3 die hard Nirvana fans who love nothing more than recreating Nirvana's live music and look for other fans! The band strive to be as close to the real deal as possible. Including thesame instruments, effect boxes and pre amp that Kurt Cobain used to ensure they re-create the distinctive Nirvana sound.\\n\\nNirvana UK's set includes the whole spectrum of Nirvana’s live and studio catalogue, from rarities on From the Muddy Banks of theWishkah, to the massive sounding commercial success of Nevermind, through debut Bleach, Insecticide, In Utero and everything in between – Not to mention the standard Nirvana style anarchy and abuse of gear at the conclusion of each show.\\n\\nBRAIN OF J:\\n\\nSpecial guest support comes from Brain of J the Pearl Jam tribute band based in London. The band are dedicated to bringing the energy and passion of Pearl Jam's music to our fans. The live show is an experience not to be missed – The band play all the hits and deep cuts that fans love. Come see us and hear the difference for yourself\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event. Under 16s must be accompanied by an adult. \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"69944acd4f7e0e0001a86f5d\",\"name\":\"Nirvana UK\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Nirvana - Smells Like Teen Spirit\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/album/smells-like-teen-spirit/483164389?i=483164390&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Nirvana\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/apple-assets-us-std-000001/Music4/v4/76/4d/e8/764de8ce-85ff-5e0b-0a18-76c61b19bdc1/mzaf_5282410278512830293.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Smells Like Teen Spirit\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Nirvana UK\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"13221\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Brain of J – The Pearl Jam Tribute Band\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"134176\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-16T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-05-29T18:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-16T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-07-31T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-08-01T02:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":null,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by SJQ.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1771200000,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"181\",\"name\":\"SJQ\",\"address\":\"10A Bradbury Street, London N16 8JN\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.548677,\"lng\":-0.0767180999999937},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-01-14/8d708e25-8424-478d-bba7-b394578460a7.jpg?rect=899%2C0%2C3744%2C3744\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"sjq-4pqp\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://servantjazzquarters.com/#contact\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-07-31T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"124635\",\"name\":\"SJQ\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"sjq-wb3bv\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"49b4780d575288c7:81\",\"date_unix\":1785520800,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":0,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r33ccce2dcca?dice_id=r33ccce2dcca\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/se10531dea8b?dice_id=se10531dea8b\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Laffb39c96c5?dice_id=Laffb39c96c5\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ua6b8166014c?dice_id=Ua6b8166014c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ib27b924f87c?dice_id=Ib27b924f87c\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v3929e9404d4?dice_id=v3929e9404d4\"},\"perm_name\":\"3owe5v-trio-explorations-31st-jul-sjq-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-16/f0519294-ac2e-4997-9682-7ef7cf5b570f.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2400%2C2400\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-16/f0519294-ac2e-4997-9682-7ef7cf5b570f.jpg?rect=0%2C880%2C2400%2C1440\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-16/f0519294-ac2e-4997-9682-7ef7cf5b570f.jpg?rect=320%2C0%2C1760%2C3200\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"TRIO EXPLORATIONS\\n\\nThree leading voices from London’s forward-looking jazz community—Sheldon Agwu (Electric Guitar), Max Luthert (Upright Bass & Modular Synth), and Yusuf Ahmed (Drums & Percussion)—come together to form a trio that thrives on curiosity, groove, and sonic adventure.\\n\\nTheir music moves fluidly between lush harmony, textural experimentation, and rhythmic intensity, creating a sound that feels both expansive and immediate.\\n\\nGuitarist Sheldon Agwu blends Jazz Guitar with ambient layers and electronic colours, shaping a distinctive musical identity reflected in his projects Kintsugi, Vtet Live at Mu, and Seeds of Sanctum.\\n\\nBassist and modular architect Max Luthert, known for collaborations with Nubya Garcia, Zara McFarlane, and Moses Boyd, brings a deeply grounded yet exploratory presence that anchors—and often propels—the trio’s improvisational pathways.\\n\\nDrummer & Percussionist Yusuf Ahmed (Qwalia, Unknown to Known) channels Jazz, Afro-funk, and global rhythmic traditions into a dynamic voice that balances drive, nuance, and invention.\\n\\nTogether, the trio offers a night of immersive interplay, atmospheric soundscapes, and bold improvisation—music that lives at the crossroads of Jazz, Electronics, and boundary-pushing rhythm.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"699353e0073ed70001db6ee1\",\"name\":\"Trio Explorations\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-28T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-07-31T21:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-30T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-07-31T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-07-31T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":31977,\"title\":\"Accessible and carer ticketing information\",\"body\":\"The accessible area for this show is full, and all the free personal assistant tickets have been assigned. We will not be able to accommodate any more requests. We apologise for any inconvenience this may cause.\\n\\nhttps://support.dice.fm/article/179-accessibilty-tickets-for-islington-assembly-hall\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":31976,\"title\":\"Stage Times \",\"body\":\"Stage times are posted at 11am on the day of the show on our venue website.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":47386,\"title\":\"Support the Supports\",\"body\":\"Islington Assembly Hall has launched 'Support the Supports' a campaign to help introduce more music lovers to the up-and-coming acts that open the show! Show up to the venue prior to 8pm and you are in with a chance to win a mystery prize, from drinks vouchers to exclusive merchandise from artists that have previously played the venue. Use the #supportthesupports through socials when you discover a new favourite act at Islington Assembly Hall.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":57461,\"title\":\"Age Restricition\",\"body\":\"This is a 14+ event – 14 and 15 year olds must be accompained by an adult. You may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"order\":3}],\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/legal-information/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"679202632593023\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-980124-39\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Kilimanjaro.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1769594400,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"34\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"address\":\"Upper Street, London N1 2UD\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5395894,\"lng\":-0.102482699999996},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-02-10/05562e9c-c684-4beb-b818-4e908bbfb14d.jpg?rect=712%2C0%2C2832%2C2832\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-z8e2\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/about/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-07-31T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1607\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-78g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"49b4780d575288c7:82\",\"date_unix\":1785520800,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3066},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Qcf078fabb81?dice_id=Qcf078fabb81\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D1e3f797e04f?dice_id=D1e3f797e04f\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m9665603950f?dice_id=m9665603950f\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/cd46db3e2dd5?dice_id=cd46db3e2dd5\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v2ce5e472ead?dice_id=v2ce5e472ead\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ebaf079ca7e1?dice_id=ebaf079ca7e1\"},\"perm_name\":\"8e8625-through-storms-and-stars-an-evening-with-voyager-31st-jul-islington-assembly-hall-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/40f84056-f0b3-4ce0-a75b-be3f467123d8.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/40f84056-f0b3-4ce0-a75b-be3f467123d8.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/40f84056-f0b3-4ce0-a75b-be3f467123d8.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"*Join us for an evening with Western Australia’s progressive metal pioneers, marking Voyager’s long-awaited return to the stage with a special night of music, comedy, and connection with their fans.*\\n\\n*In summer 2026, Voyager will present two carefully curated ‘evening with’ performances following an extraordinary and challenging period for the band, including frontman Danny Estrin’s two-year battle with terminal cancer. Against the odds, Voyager returns to the stage to share a unique live experience that goes beyond a traditional concert - blending performance and storytelling.*\\n\\n*This will be a deeply meaningful celebration of resilience, creativity, and community, honouring one of Australia’s most internationally respected heavy music exports following their landmark Eurovision appearance.*\\n\\n*Islington Assembly Hall has launched 'Support the Supports' a campaign to help introduce more music lovers to the up-and-coming acts that open the show! Show up to the venue prior to 8pm and you are in with a chance to win a mystery prize, from drinks vouchers to exclusive merchandise from artists that have previously played the venue. Use the #supportthesupports through socials when you discover a new favourite act at Islington Assembly Hall.*\\n\\n*By purchasing a ticket to this event you are agreeing to adhere to Islington Assembly Hall's terms and conditions: https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/customer-terms-conditions-2022/*\\n\\n*All tickets to shows at Islington Assembly Hall are subject to a Venue Levy of £1.50 + VAT. As a Grade II listed building, this levy will be reinvested into Islington Assembly Hall and its services, meaning the customer experience can continue to be enhanced.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"69723fed07d2ba0001dd11b7\",\"name\":\"Through Storms and Stars – An Evening with Voyager \",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"trailer\",\"title\":null,\"redirect_url\":null,\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/ZchRs9Z9VpT02Ks5MpyyqV0202diAAS9By9Hde01jMMqwdI.m3u8\",\"track_name\":\"\"}],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Voyager\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/006bc277-9e6b-444f-b2d9-23ca74f76bd8.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"70946\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":8,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-08-20T15:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-07-31T23:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-08-20T15:30:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-07-31T20:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-08-01T00:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"offers_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"marketeers\":[],\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":null,\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Electric Star Pubs.\",\"seating\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1755700200,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"13434\",\"name\":\"The Star of Kings\",\"address\":\"126 York Way, Islington, London, N1 0AX, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.53636,\"lng\":-0.12205},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-star-of-kings-8dy5\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://starofkings.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/SOK-Venue-Brochure-2024-compressed.pdf\"},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-07-31T20:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"donation\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"136032\",\"name\":\"Electric Star Pubs\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"electric-star-pubs-nb53l\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"impression_id\":\"49b4780d575288c7:83\",\"date_unix\":1785524400,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":0,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Efe8d735eb2c?dice_id=Efe8d735eb2c\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/O85da2cadb32?dice_id=O85da2cadb32\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H0ca6863b64b?dice_id=H0ca6863b64b\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ad68c2ac7e35?dice_id=Ad68c2ac7e35\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D92496ac09d8?dice_id=D92496ac09d8\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h0f17a5d1ce5?dice_id=h0f17a5d1ce5\"},\"perm_name\":\"v3kneg-rockaoke-31st-jul-the-star-of-kings-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-20/b2efd44e-7529-4002-a060-a3613c1ab72a.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2250%2C2250\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-20/b2efd44e-7529-4002-a060-a3613c1ab72a.jpg?rect=0%2C450%2C2250%2C1350\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-20/b2efd44e-7529-4002-a060-a3613c1ab72a.jpg?rect=506%2C0%2C1238%2C2250\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Join us for singalong fun twice a month, every second and last Friday!\\n\\nBringing you the ultimate live band Karaoke experience that will set the tone for an unforgettable year. Be part of the action as you step into the spotlight and belt out your favourite tunes in front of a lively crowd. Channel your inner Debbie Harry, Ed Sheeran, or Justin Bieber and make this year's Rockaoke a night to remember!\\n\\nA unique Karaoke singing experience.\\n\\nA perfect experience for anyone!\\n\\n“Most fun ever? We reckon so!” – Time Out London\\n\\n“Karaoke’s much cooler older brother, ROCKAOKE” – Sunday Times\\n\\n“The best rockaoke band on the planet\\\" – Virgin Radio\\n\\n“So wrong, it’s right!” – Ibiza Rocks\\n\\n\\\"The band make you feel like a proper ROCKSTAR, they don’t make you sound like one, but they make you feel like one - \\\"Chris Moyles, Radio DJ\\n\\n“Paulo Nutini, The Fratellis and McFly were among the acts who performed exclusive live sessions for the intimate audience in the Virgin Radio VIP Sessions, setting the stage for ROCKAOKE” – OK Magazine\\n\\n“Thank you SO much. We all had a great great time and I think the warmth, enthusiasm and kindness of the band added so much.” – Kate Harwood (BBC Head of Drama & Serials)\\n\\n“I recently attended a Rockaoke night in Cardiff and was absolutely blown away by your performance and the whole atmosphere of the event. I have never witnessed anything quite like it and the talent the band demonstrated with their wide repertoire was incredible.” – Beth (Cancer Research Wales)\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"68a6cdf3cd48650001c907a2\",\"name\":\"Rockaoke\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[],\"unicorn\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Rockaoke\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"126109\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"max_tickets\":6,\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-10T09:15:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-08-01T01:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-10T09:15:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-07-31T23:00: