k.dice.fm/Lb43b34539a4?dice_id=Lb43b34539a4\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P063c8017b4e?dice_id=P063c8017b4e\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r7237d60fa0a?dice_id=r7237d60fa0a\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F14139065b18?dice_id=F14139065b18\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/G1038c30c770?dice_id=G1038c30c770\"},\"perm_name\":\"av382x-richie-spice-matinee-show-2nd-aug-the-jazz-cafe-london-tickets\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-30/818f40d7-9088-4f86-bc76-bb31c801727b.jpg?rect=0%2C18%2C952%2C952\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-30/818f40d7-9088-4f86-bc76-bb31c801727b.jpg?rect=0%2C209%2C952%2C571\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-30/818f40d7-9088-4f86-bc76-bb31c801727b.jpg?rect=205%2C0%2C543%2C988\"},\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"**One of reggae’s true torchbearers, Jamaican vocalist Richie Spice brings his uplifting blend of roots reggae, dancehall, and lovers rock to our stage for two unforgettable live shows.**\\n\\nFrom hits like ‘Grooving My Girl’ to ‘Earth A Run Red’ and ‘Youth Dem Cold,’ he has spent decades creating music that inspires, uplifts, and unites.\\n\\nBorn Richell Bonner in Kingston into a musical family, Spice has always used his music as a force for good, blending faith, culture, and social consciousness in every track.\\n\\nOn stage, his soulful vocals and infectious riddims turn every performance into a joyous celebration of life and music.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"id\":\"697c8aa5aeddcb0001925a5f\",\"name\":\"Richie Spice (Matinee Show)\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"new\":false,\"previews\":[],\"unicorn\":true,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"su