6a3:17\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/pde415f0d872?dice_id=pde415f0d872\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q608b4e5a883?dice_id=q608b4e5a883\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K9aebc7b8880?dice_id=K9aebc7b8880\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ocb325d9e96d?dice_id=Ocb325d9e96d\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u6cd05ad8894?dice_id=u6cd05ad8894\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q8661ee7abc5?dice_id=Q8661ee7abc5\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-02T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-08-25T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-02T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-08-25T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-08-25T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1100,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1888\",\"name\":\"New Cross Live\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"new-cross-live-y8la\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"6980b28c52420e00019e551f\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Downcast\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"6d23q8-downcast-25th-aug-new-cross-inn-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1787677200,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-08-25T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-08-25T23:00:00+01:00\"}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Kings of Thrash\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"100471\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":76271,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":76272,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":76273,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/d7904726-48df-41f3-8b47-630e9c781ca4.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2048%2C2048\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/d7904726-48df-41f3-8b47-630e9c781ca4.jpg?rect=0%2C410%2C2048%2C1229\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-11/d7904726-48df-41f3-8b47-630e9c781ca4.jpg?rect=461%2C0%2C1126%2C2048\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Kings Of Thrash - Lockdown\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4w6RriW7okftQMrlN0rVIE\",\"artist\":\"Kings Of Thrash\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/11f928a18ace2abacc865680c2c3cff6f76c9e59?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Lockdown\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Kings Of Thrash, David Ellefson & Jeff Young - The Skull Beneath the Skin (Live)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/the-skull-beneath-the-skin-live/1667670518?i=1667670834&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Kings Of Thrash, David Ellefson & Jeff Young\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview113/v4/63/f6/c1/63f6c1ef-35c9-1faa-5efc-c9242ff63410/mzaf_4422474512450971049.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"The Skull Beneath the Skin (Live)\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770886800,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"KINGS OF THRASH RETURN TO THE UK & IRELAND – AUGUST / SEPTEMBER 2026\\n\\nDavid Ellefson's Kings of Thrash are set to return to the UK and Ireland this August–September 2026, bringing their explosive, high-energy live show back to some of the region’s most iconic venues and festivals.\\n\\nFollowing a massive run of international dates, the band—featuring Jeff Young, Fred Aching, and Chaz Leon—will once again unleash their signature blend of classic thrash, precision musicianship, and raw intensity for audiences who have long been a cornerstone of the genre.\\n\\nThe UK leg includes headline shows and festival appearances, highlighted by a performance at Stone Dead Festival, where Kings of Thrash will headline the Earache Records stage, alongside long-awaited returns to London, Newport, Nuneaton, and Blackpool. The tour then concludes with two special shows in Ireland and Northern Ireland, wrapping up the band’s summer run on deeply meaningful ground.\\n\\nJeff Young shares:\\n\\n“We have such fond memories of touring abroad in the UK & Europe. The cultures are so rich, and it’s refreshing to see how much people truly live for music. The attendance and enthusiasm take the concert experience to another level. Kings of Thrash can’t wait to kick out the jams for you all, real soon!”\\n\\nDavid Ellefson adds:\\n\\n“It’s great to be back to where heavy metal started, in the UK with Kings of Thrash in August. Some killer new events like headlining the Earache Records stage at the Stone Dead Festival, and revisiting our longtime friends and fans in London and Blackpool. We’ll see you there!”\\n\\nOn the Ireland dates, Ellefson continues:\\n\\n“It’s been an incredible world tour this year with Kings of Thrash, and we’re wrapping up our summer in Ireland and Northern Ireland. So much of my thrash metal history has happened in these regions, and it’s great to be back to finish strong with friends who were so great to us when we were there last year.”\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Underworld.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"e551cd9f216396a3:18\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T1caa69adc6a?dice_id=T1caa69adc6a\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/md3fd0170fbf?dice_id=md3fd0170fbf\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/La386f5d7e27?dice_id=La386f5d7e27\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/pf9acc7722eb?dice_id=pf9acc7722eb\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A0cafcdb6988?dice_id=A0cafcdb6988\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H281e6153669?dice_id=H281e6153669\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-12T09:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_