Wipe Those Tears Dry\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/gb/album/wipe-those-tears-dry/1478041479?i=1478041487&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Laurence Jones\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview123/v4/82/04/5b/82045b26-1c21-7148-ace3-20c3d1d8db12/mzaf_4295995649669372316.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Wipe Those Tears Dry\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1764547200,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"The award-winning and critically acclaimed blues artist, Laurence Jones from Liverpool, has opened for the likes of Ringo Starr, Sir Van Morrison, Jeff Beck, Johnny Winter, Walter Trout and recently Status Quo.\\n\\nAfter joining Buddy Guy on stage to jam and experience the blues first-hand, Buddy remarked, \\\"He’s like a young Eric Clapton\\\", and that pretty much says it all.\\n\\nRaised on classical guitar and with a Grade 8 Distinction at the age of 18, he now combines his musical heritage with the energy of the blues-rock that made him famous. Laurence Jones has built up a loyal fan base throughout, signing his first record deal at just 17, gaining him many awards and accolades with his critically acclaimed blues album ‘Thunder In The Sky’ in 2012. Laurence’s debut solo album ‘On My Own’ feels intimate and personal, yet simultaneously bursting with the power and tradition of the blues. Laurence Jones proves once again why he's considered one of the absolute top performers in the genre.\\n\\nJones career includes multiple British Blues Awards, over 50,000 albums sold, and a #1 album on the Official UK Jazz & Blues chart. Now the focus is less on charts and accolades and more on telling his story through stripped-down, heartfelt blues.\\n\\n“The British blues rock guitarist skilfully combines energy & feeling” - Rolling Stone Magazine\\n\\nMusic Radar voted Laurence one of the world's TOP 10 blues-rock guitarists\\n\\n‘Exciting, full of energy, a must see act’ - BBC RADIO 2\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Black Frog\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"e551cd9f216396a3:48\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q0309c88654a?dice_id=Q0309c88654a\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e04d3450a94f?dice_id=e04d3450a94f\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h9f62f3fc9cd?dice_id=h9f62f3fc9cd\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/l2c9327f78a2?dice_id=l2c9327f78a2\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k1b2dbec60e0?dice_id=k1b2dbec60e0\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/t39eecd9e493?dice_id=t39eecd9e493\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-01T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-09-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-01T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-09-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-09-09T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1650,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"4307\",\"name\":\"Hot Box Live Community Interest \",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-live-community-interest-7v77\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"692e2ba452d6ab00018b9a1a\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Laurence Jones\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"k6ne5p-laurence-jones-9th-sep-hot-box-chelmsford-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1788976800,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Wed 09 Sep\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-09-10T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Dry Socket\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab67616d0000b273d2dd2e66b2fdbe668ed65b5d\"},\"artist_id\":\"31234\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"SPACED\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb7aaabac38ed2b4dd9cf095cb\"},\"artist_id\":\"72530\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"SPY\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-03-26/d13d0721-4256-4f6a-9ca2-d976396e9c1e.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"71245\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":76576,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":76577,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":76578,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-12/510cc971-b439-4e4e-862a-c5deacafb6e7.jpg?rect=529%2C0%2C2116%2C2116\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-12/510cc971-b439-4e4e-862a-c5deacafb6e7.jpg?rect=0%2C106%2C3174%2C1904\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-12/510cc971-b439-4e4e-862a-c5deacafb6e7.jpg?rect=1005%2C0%2C1164%2C2116\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Koniec\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0AkpbeijRYbavdv8mczxl4\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/b794e2e1dae8efab2ac63ae11cbd966f288e45c0?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Koniec\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770984000,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"SPY is a five-piece Hardcore Punk band from the San Francisco Bay Area, known for intense, fast-paced tracks that blend Rock and Roll riffs with heavy, distorted Hardcore. Formed by vocalist Peter Pawlak, the band has released music through Closed Casket Activities and Bandcamp, featuring members like Thomas Sherry, Drew Satterlund, Cody Kryst, and Josh Mendoza.\\n\\nSPACED is a Buffalo, NY-based Hardcore punk band known for blending traditional Hardcore with Psych and Shoegaze elements, often described as \\\"far-out Hardcore\\\". Signed to Pure Noise Records and Revelation Records, they are fronted by vocalist Lexi Reyngoudt, with members including guitarists Donny Arthur and Joe Morganti, bassist John Vaughan, and drummer Dan McCormick.\\n\\nDRY SOCKET is a politically charged Hardcore band from Portland, Oregon. With high-intensity performances and emotional songwriting, they blend classic hardcore aggression with deeply personal narratives.\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Boneyard Promotions, Burn It Down and The Underworld\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"e551cd9f216396a3:49\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ffa96df40afd?dice_id=ffa96df40afd\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/X144cdd5e77d?dice_id=X144cdd5e77d\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D23a0d78e31f?dice_id=D23a0d78e31f\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y224b5f3a038?dice_id=Y224b5f3a038\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/vbb3d320941c?dice_id=vbb3d320941c\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/pb52e963aeaa?dice_id=pb52e963aeaa\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-13T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-09-10T18:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-16T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-09-10T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-09-10T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2704,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"698e0991888e250001d3d210\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"SPY\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"mx3qpk-spy-10th-sep-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1789063200,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":{\"description\":\"At EartH, we want our space to give back to the community. That’s why we teamed up with Progression Sessions to open Studio 36 inside our venue. Studio 36 provides music making facilities and expertise for free to young musicians in London who face a variety of barriers that might prevent them from making the most of their creativity and talent. \\n\\nEvery donation helps keep Studio 36 open and accessible, so that more young people can find their voice, develop their talents and feel supported as they take their next steps.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-28/af5fb538-b9c7-4f41-bf11-48d1d9d6d45a.jpeg?rect=342%2C0%2C1365%2C1365\"},\"variants\":[{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MTAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":100,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE5MTQ2NywidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTUzNzYwLCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1NjowNC4zNTU2MTdaIiwicHJpY2UiOjEwMCwidmFyaWFudF9pZCI6MzY2OSwicHJvbW90aW9uX2lkIjpudWxsLCJwcm9kdWN0X2dyb3VwX3R5cGUiOiJkb25hdGlvbnMifQ==\"},{\"price\":{\"id\":\"eyJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJwcmljZSI6MzAwLCJwcm9tb3Rpb25faWQiOm51bGx9\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":300,\"sales_tax\":0},\"reserve_token\":\"eyJpZCI6MTE5MTQ2NywidHlwZSI6InByb2R1Y3QiLCJ0aWVyX2luZGV4IjowLCJldmVudF9pZCI6NTUzNzYwLCJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0wMi0xN1QxNjo1NjowNC4zNTU2NTVaIiwicHJpY2UiOjMwMCwidmF