ty\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-09-19T13:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-30/3418243a-ca7c-4caf-b109-601293cca0c3.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-30/3418243a-ca7c-4caf-b109-601293cca0c3.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-30/3418243a-ca7c-4caf-b109-601293cca0c3.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Odette Michell - Great Old Northern Line\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/great-old-northern-line/1462490099?i=1462490104&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Odette Michell\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview113/v4/1b/e5/b6/1be5b68a-cab6-a29b-8925-db4a312418b0/mzaf_5316943309908080256.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Great Old Northern Line\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Odette Michell - Great Old Northern Line\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5M8ltmcNw2ZNSEQfJWCrKM\",\"artist\":\"Odette Michell\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/a812ee2bc03543dd82a565567dd940a1e4b27560?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Great Old Northern Line\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1764633600,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"There isn't enough room to write about all the achievements that Odette & Craig have sccomplished over their music career here. I urge you to read more about them on their websites, https://craigjoinermusic.com/ & https://www.odettemichell.com/ which will hopefully make you understand what outstanding folk talents they are.\\n\\n***Odette Michelle :-*** \\\"One of the brightest new names to have emerged full-grown on the country’s folk scene in recent years\\\" FOLK RADIO. Odette Michell is an award-winning British singer-songwriter and multi-instrumentalist with a rich foothold in the folk tradition.\\n\\nIn April 2019, Odette released her debut album ‘The Wildest Rose’. The album gained widespread positive acclaim followed by a string of live interviews, and featured notable musical contributions from Phil Beer, and Toby Shaer.\\n\\n***Craig Joiner :-*** Whether lamenting a love lost, celebrating the calming beauty of nature or relating the epic tale of a struggle at sea, Craig’s songs are informed by experience, observation, vivid imagination and a desire to take his music “deeper into folk”.\\n\\nAlthough Craig has forged a career and won repute in the rock arena, folk music has always been his true muse and calling. “As a 15-year-old, I played my first gig, guitar in hands, at the Cellar Folk Club in Hemel Hempstead,” he recalls. “Life and opportunities then led me elsewhere, but here I am again, having travelled full circle. It feels like home and it’s so wonderful to be here.”\\n\\n***Sponsored by Last Piastre Records.***\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Black Frog\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"e551cd9f216396a3:68\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y75becb542cf?dice_id=y75becb542cf\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/c4e8e4128371?dice_id=c4e8e4128371\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://l