 of proof of eligibility and your DICE booking confirmation at accesstickets@troxy.co.uk. Companion ticket availability is limited in the Circle, so please reach out to check availability before purchasing a Circle ticket.\",\"order\":1}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-23/d1879727-4dd0-4714-9610-5aed685e849b.jpg?rect=0%2C278%2C2752%2C2752\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-23/d1879727-4dd0-4714-9610-5aed685e849b.jpg?rect=0%2C1239%2C2752%2C1651\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-23/d1879727-4dd0-4714-9610-5aed685e849b.jpg?rect=241%2C0%2C2270%2C4128\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":\"d31cbde6-a999-4e14-8ec1-e975c10adbf1\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1769418000,\"max_tickets\":8,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":14,\"name\":\"Troxy\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://troxy.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"8449c85a-ea0b-4ad7-8055-a74673e41839\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"d31cbde6-a999-4e14-8ec1-e975c10adbf1\",\"seat_selection\":\"disabled\"},\"about\":{\"description\":\"The international Japanese pop sensation LiSA is launching her first-ever Europe & UK tour later this year.\\n\\nIn celebration of the 15th anniversary of her solo debut this year, LiSA will reach fans in Milan, Düsseldorf, Paris, and London with her iconic voice. This will be the very first time for LiSA to bring her tour to Europe and the UK, and it marks her first headline shows in the four cities.\\n\\nKnown for performing numerous theme songs for globally popular anime series, including “oath sign” for Fate/Zero, “Gurenge” for Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba, “crossing field” for Sword Art Online, and “ReawakeR (feat. Felix of Stray Kids)” for Solo Leveling, LiSA is a beloved icon for J-Pop and anime fans across the globe.\\n\\nThrough her energetic live performances, LiSA engages audiences with her intensity and positive messages. Her presence extends beyond the anime music scene, as she has also made a strong impact as a live artist at major rock festivals, continuing to set new records while further solidifying her reputation.\\n\\nHaving successfully held headline shows across the United States, Mexico, East Asia, and Southeast Asia, and following the success of her first North American tour in the summer of 2025, LiSA’s Europe & UK tour this year will be a milestone of her career.\\n\\n【Comment from LiSA】\\n\\nI am going to Europe and UK for my first tour in September!\\n\\nFinally, I can come to sing for you!\\n\\nThank you everyone for being patient and waiting for this moment. I am so excited to see you all! Let’s have some fun!\\n\\nAnother great day!\\n\\nLiSA\\n\\nTickets include a £2.25 venue restoration levy.\\n\\nSeating is reserved for this event and you will be automatically assigned the best available seats within your chosen area. Seat details are available immediately after purchase. Please follow the link in your confirmation email if you wish to change your seats. For any queries please contact help@dice.fm. Please note we cannot guarantee that seated tickets offered via the Waiting List will be located together.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false