0customers%20to%20the%20venue.&text=There%20is%20level%20access%20from,or%20a%20lift%20on%20site.\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-09-25T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Floral Image\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb1b49f3b1b327c0e5a2ff758c\"},\"artist_id\":\"78299\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Helion\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"127980\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-13/0b88afae-223a-4575-8762-8582360da218.jpg?rect=0%2C145%2C1773%2C1773\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-13/0b88afae-223a-4575-8762-8582360da218.jpg?rect=0%2C798%2C1773%2C1064\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-13/0b88afae-223a-4575-8762-8582360da218.jpg?rect=155%2C0%2C1463%2C2660\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Helicon - Backbreaker\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/7clVaikJVEEG3ryVk4o1P3\",\"artist\":\"Helicon\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/a27595de6070d3b9f05849bf78163a42e5fe92d1?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Backbreaker\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1768402800,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"***Helicon -*** Helicon was formed by brothers John-Paul and Gary Hughes in East Kilbride, Glasgow, Scotland. Known for the intensity of their live shows, their sound blends psychedelia, electronica, guitars and sitars with a spirit of counter-cultural experimentation. Since signing to Fuzz Club in 2017, their music has featured on BBC Radio 6 Music, and they’ve previously collaborated with Tony Doogan (Mogwai / Delgados / Belle & Sebastian / David Byrne), Will Carruthers (Spacemen 3 / The Brian Jonestown Massacre/ Spiritualized / Dead Skeletons), and Mark Gardener (Ride).\\n\\n***Floral Image -*** There is a mischief and daydream to the character of Floral Image, on full dynamic display across the record - a reflection of both the playful fraternity of band members Fergus Nolan (vocals, guitars), Jack Warner (vocals, keys), Matt Kennedy (bass guitar), Mitch Forsyth (drums, visuals), & Phil Whitton (guitars, visuals), and the ever-weaving textures they make together.\\n\\n***Artists:*** We are always interested in hearing from talented artists. If you’d like to play at our future events, please get in touch at info@realsounds.uk.\\n\\n***Refunds:*** Tickets are for the full event and not for individual artists. If an artist cancels your tickets are still valid for the event. We cannot offer refunds.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by REAL\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"e551cd9f216396a3:78\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F86e5c07850a?dice_id=F86e5c07850a\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/V7d235d04bb6?dice_id=V7d235d04bb6\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N77bfc0b6179?dice_id=N77bfc0b6179\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R31504fc4aeb?dice_id=R31504fc4aeb\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/v8b3d5963036?dice_id=v8b3d5963036\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F1f694e1326d?dice_id=F1f694e1326d\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-14T15:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-09-25T23:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-14T15:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-09-25T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-09-25T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1000},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"12522\",\"name\":\"REAL\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-04-07/94ee93c8-9fa3-48b9-ae67-0215c3e3b070.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"real-vxyd\",\"profile_active\":true},\"id\":\"6967693bc5db310001c20b58\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Helicon\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"py525y-helicon-25th-sep-the-100-club-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1790359200,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"34\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"address\":\"Upper Street, London N1 2UD\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5395894,\"lng\":-0.102482699999996},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-02-10/05562e9c-c684-4beb-b818-4e908bbfb14d.jpg?rect=712%2C0%2C2832%2C2832\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-z8e2\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/about/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-09-25T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Magnum\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebdde4ddf54456f242d98b3cd0\"},\"artist_id\":\"6635\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":31977,\"title\":\"Accessible and carer ticketing information\",\"body\":\"The accessible area for this show is full, and all the free personal assistant tickets have been assigned. We will not be able to accommodate any more requests. We apologise for any inconvenience this may cause.\\n\\nhttps://support.dice.fm/article/179-accessibilty-tickets-for-islington-assembly-hall\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":31976,\"title\":\"Stage Times \",\"body\":\"Stage times are posted at 11am on the day of the show on our venue website.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":47386,\"title\":\"Support the Supports\",\"body\":\"Islington Assembly Hall has launched 'Support the Supports' a campaign to help introduce more music lovers to the up-and-coming acts that open the show! Show up to the venue prior to 8pm and you are in with a chance to win a mystery prize, from drinks vouchers to exclusive merchandise from artists that have previously played the venue. Use the #supportthesupports through socials when you discover a new favourite act at Islington Assembly Hall.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":57461,\"title\":\"Age Restricition\",\"body\":\"This is a 14+ event – 14 and 15 year olds must be accompained by an adult. You may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"order\":3}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-17/60b2b49e-c164-4d93-9b92-ed5d143e9d70.jpg?rect=1249%2C0%2C4997%2C4997\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-17/60b2b49e-c164-4d93-9b92-ed5d143e9d70.jpg?rect=0%2C250%2C7495%2C4497\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-17/60b2b49e-c164-4d93-9b92-ed5d143e9d70.jpg?rect=2374%2C0%2C2748%2C4997\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"On a Storyteller's Night\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0JUNSsLMKlBTRMZ4nM4kZP\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/5a49dd8ee5de820a510139ed13b3990aa9b93d76?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"On a Storyteller's Night\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Magnum - Kingdom of Madness\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/gb/album/kingdom-of-madness/397338085?i=397338096&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Magnum\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Music/v4/30/31/d1/3031d18a-b90a-001a-319c-49da42318f2c/mzaf_1242480574157004607.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Kingdom of Madness\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1771322400,\"max_tickets\":8,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/legal-information/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"679202632593023\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-980124-39\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"announced\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"*British rock legends Magnum are entering an exciting new era as they continue to honour the extraordinary legacy of their late founder, guitarist, and songwriter Tony Clarkin, who sadly passed away last year.*\\n\\n*Magnum are now preparing to share this next chapter with their loyal fans around the world — continuing the band’s legacy of timeless rock and heartfelt storytelling.*\\n\\n*Islington Assembly Hall has launched 'Support the Supports' a campaign to help introduce more music lovers to the up-and-coming acts that open the show! Show up to the venue prior to 8pm and you are in with a chance to win a mystery prize, from drinks vouchers to exclusive merchandise from artists that have previously played the venue. Use the #supportthesupports through socials when you discover a new favourite act at Islington Assembly Hall.*\\n\\n*By purchasing a ticket to this event you are agreeing to adhere to Islington Assembly Hall's terms and conditions: https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/customer-terms-conditions-2022/*\\n\\n*All tickets to shows at Islington Assembly Hall are subject to a Venue Levy of £1.50 + VAT. As a Grade II listed building, this levy will be reinvested into Islington Assembly Hall and its services, meaning the customer experience can continue to be enhanced.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Senbla.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"e551cd9f216396a3:79\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ed244f1d4021?dice_id=ed244f1d4021\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/M8ce8cc412c5?dice_id=M8ce8cc412c5\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r53163b59aeb?dice_id=r53163b59aeb\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/te79892dc38e?dice_id=te79892dc38e\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/yf40189ee59c?dice_id=yf40189ee59c\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Zd25b2b7f2cb?dice_id=Zd25b2b7f2cb\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-17T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-09-25T21:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-20T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-09-25T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-09-25T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3815},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1607\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-78g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"6932a037832107000173703d\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Magnum\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"3onyp8-magnum-25th-sep-islington-assembly-hall-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1790359200,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"23\",\"name\":\"The Lexington\",\"address\":\"96-98 Pentonville Rd, London N1 9JB\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5317299,\"lng\":-0.111416400000053},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-lexington-jomz\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.thelexington.co.uk/about.php\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-09-25T19:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Voxtrot\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb69e2e793c0a23edabc652181\"},\"artist_id\":\"90020\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":73664,\"title\":\"Venue Accessibility Information\",\"body\":\"The Lexington is an early Victorian building and as such is not easily accessible for anyone with limited mobility. While the main bar is on the ground floor and accessible without steps the music venue is up a flight of stairs. We’re happy to help with access where possible; for any further information please contact us: info@thelexington.co.uk.\",\"order\":0}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-03/918e71cc-0283-4d59-9bb5-8c62edb207ab.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C4000%2C4000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-03/918e71cc-0283-4d59-9bb5-8c62edb207ab.jpg?rect=0%2C800%2C4000%2C2400\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-03/918e71cc-0283-4d59-9bb5-8c62edb207ab.jpg?rect=900%2C0%2C2200%2C4000\"},\"previews\":[],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770127200,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1175,\"name\":\"Kilimanjaro Live Limited\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://myticket.co.uk/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Kili Presents by Arrangement with Pitch & Smith:\\n\\nVoxtrot\\n\\nNearly two decades after their 2007 debut and a 2010–2022 hiatus, Austin, TX’s Voxtrot return with Dreamers in Exile, a new LP that turns an underdog story into a true second act.\\n\\nThe band who quietly became cult heroes in the streaming era deliver a record that carries the electric rush longtime fans remember while speaking directly to the new generation of youth who discovered them through playlists and word of mouth.\\n\\nMusically, Dreamers in Exile folds Voxtrot’s classic DNA—C86 sparkle, Sarah Records romanticism, the pulse of The Velvet Underground, the elegance of Felt—into a sharper, more confident sound.\\n\\nGuitars chime and sprint, rhythms push forward, and Ramesh Srivastava’s literate, heart-forward lyrics trace the distance between youth and maturity, exile and home, regret and renewal. Mixed by Dean Reid (Lana Del Rey, James Blake), it reads as both reintroduction and redemption.\\n\\nFor a band born of the 2000s blog wave alongside Vampire Weekend, The National, and Grizzly Bear, Dreamers in Exile is less nostalgia than proof of life. It’s the sound of a beloved group returning on their own terms and finding their songs resonating more widely than ever.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Kilimanjaro and Pitch & Smith.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"e551cd9f216396a3:80\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/xc17ae02c01b?dice_id=xc17ae02c01b\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W5a50b08ca45?dice_id=W5a50b08ca45\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P590fcbaab08?dice_id=P590fcbaab08\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ec5a5fc77102?dice_id=ec5a5fc77102\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W71d555c1283?dice_id=W71d555c1283\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s007468f5104?dice_id=s007468f5104\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-03T14:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-09-25T14:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-06T10:0