e-j7v7\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/visitor-information/ticketing/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":\"Alexandra Palace Great Hall\",\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-09-26T18:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Public Service Broadcasting\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb9440e2cf9666848156cda1f9\"},\"artist_id\":\"226\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[{\"id\":70424,\"title\":\"Is there a cloakroom?\",\"body\":\"£5 for bags (under A4 size only), £3 for coats and £2 for all other items (card only). Large bags are not allowed inside the venue at all (including the cloakroom).\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":70425,\"title\":\"Where can I find out more information about travelling to Alexandra Palace?\",\"body\":\"Head here to find out more and stay up to date: https://www.alexandrapalace.com/visitor-information/get-here/\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":70426,\"title\":\"What do I do on the day of the event?\",\"body\":\"On the day of the event (usually 2h before it starts) you’ll be able to activate your ticket in the app and generate your unique QR code.\\n\\nJust follow these steps.\\n\\n1\\\\. Open the DICE app. Tap the ticket icon at the bottom of the screen.\\n\\n2\\\\. Choose the event.\\n\\n3\\\\. Tap Activate QR code.\\n\\nIf you bought tickets for a group and you’re arriving together, you can show everyone’s tickets on your device to the door staff.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":70427,\"title\":\"What if I can’t make the event anymore? \",\"body\":\"**Offer your ticket to another fan**\\n\\nWe believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the wait list: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the wait list function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the wait list after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the wait list works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":70428,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":4},{\"id\":70429,\"title\":\"Can I bring a bag?\",\"body\":\"BAG POLICY FOR LIVE MUSIC EVENTS AT ALEXANDRA PALACE\\n\\nWe encourage you to attend live music events without bags. Should you need to bring one for your essentials, it needs to be as small as possible.\\n\\nFor security reasons and in line with industry best practice, visitors are only permitted to bring one small bag into the venue, which must be no bigger than:\\n\\nHeight 30cm (11.8 inches)\\n\\nWidth 20cm (7.9 inches)\\n\\nDepth 10cm (3.9 inches)\\n\\nAny bags that do not meet these requirements will be directed to our bag drop (Great Hall concerts only).\\n\\nExemptions apply for medical purposes, but we ask that you contact us in advance if this applies to you via access@alexandrapalace.com.\",\"order\":5},{\"id\":70430,\"title\":\"Is there an after show party?\",\"body\":\"Happening in the Phoenix Bar until 1am. Please note this is not an official party related to the artist or promoter.\",\"order\":6},{\"id\":70431,\"title\":\"Can I pay in cash?\",\"body\":\"Ally Pally is now fully cashless so bring your card/phone with you to pay across the site.\",\"order\":7}],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/9a9a4910-df1c-4e76-a154-f63e7f630ecc.jpg?rect=0%2C1306%2C2763%2C2763\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/9a9a4910-df1c-4e76-a154-f63e7f630ecc.jpg?rect=0%2C1247%2C2763%2C1658\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/9a9a4910-df1c-4e76-a154-f63e7f630ecc.jpg?rect=240%2C0%2C2283%2C4151\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Go!\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5xYZXIgVAND5sWjN8G0hID\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/e486847ed1fb5c7d7bcff27efdab04d65a6a3ac1?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Go!\"},{\"type\":\"trailer\",\"title\":null,\"redirect_url\":null,\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/AgLJQmIaqYVFvA6uHObEJFdpqZAe3quxRdWJJkJNlp4.m3u8\",\"track_name\":\"\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1768989600,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":35,\"name\":\"the Event Organiser, AEG Presents\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.aegpresents.co.uk/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":959,\"name\":\"Alexandra Palace\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":\"AW-784377975\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":2383,\"name\":\"East City Management\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"632380832661166\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":false,\"show_opt_in_form\":false,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"If you'd like to learn more about the venue's story and mission, along with how you can play your part to support them - please head here: https://bit.ly/support-ally-pally\\n\\nVenue terms and conditions can be viewed here: https://www.alexandrapalace.com/terms-and-conditions/#\\n\\n£1 from every ticket will be donated to the Music Venue Trust to support small venues. Charity registration details below:\\n\\n- Music Venue Trust is a UK charity registered with the Charity Commission of England and Wales, registration no: 1159846\\n- Music Venue Trust (Scotland) is a charity registered with the Office of the Scottish Charity Regulator: Charity Number SC052001\\n\\nPrice includes a £2.50 venue restoration levy.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by AEG.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"e551cd9f216396a3:81\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/C4b14d805a53?dice_id=C4b14d805a53\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/O23fbaab9a85?dice_id=O23fbaab9a85\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p852f1c4e5ca?dice_id=p852f1c4e5ca\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ydff91b8c88d?dice_id=Ydff91b8c88d\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q3d88582d72c?dice_id=q3d88582d72c\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/y8d704a97953?dice_id=y8d704a97953\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-21T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-09-26T21:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-29T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-09-26T18:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-09-26T22:45:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":6653},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1871\",\"name\":\"Alexandra Palace\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"alexandra-palace-oybm\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"696fa3a54abf7c000166afdc\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"Public Service Broadcasting\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"dk3ap6-public-service-broadcasting-26th-sep-alexandra-palace-london-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1790443800,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":true,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3785\",\"name\":\"Hot Box\",\"address\":\"28 Viaduct Rd, Chelmsford CM1 1TS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.7359952,\"lng\":0.4672127},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-06-29/9ff0c867-708b-4d5c-834d-a927e4e4ae83.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"5eb9799ae1727402966007e1\",\"name\":\"Chelmsford\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.736717,\"lng\":0.466083,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-r7wq\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.hotboxlive.co.uk/accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-09-26T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"John Otway and The Big Band\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"87084\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-23/e57b7efa-bffa-4687-b86f-7ec3466c0579.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-23/e57b7efa-bffa-4687-b86f-7ec3466c0579.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-23/e57b7efa-bffa-4687-b86f-7ec3466c0579.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Seagulls on Speed\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6hxOrwbQu3aJVSgEy8iZwc\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/de22d16ca0bfdde6c0944adf8084426f7b859cb2?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Seagulls on Speed\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"John Otway - Ok Father Christmas\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/album/ok-father-christmas-radio-edit/951660084?i=951660086&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"John Otway\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/apple-assets-us-std-000001/Music3/v4/b1/ce/f6/b1cef6a8-795c-7059-f488-cfa7079c91a1/mzaf_6617529653050975579.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Ok Father Christmas\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1696464000,\"max_tickets\":6,\"marketeers\":[],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"John Otway is an English singer-songwriter who has built a sizeable cult audience through extensive touring, a surreal sense of humour and a self-deprecating underdog persona.\\n\\nFrom the age of 9, Otway knew he wanted to be a pop star. But even at that young age, having listened to his sister's Beatles and Stones records, he knew he would never be able to do what they do. However, when his sister got the latest Bob Dylan album, he knew there was a place for him and he set about learning how to play guitar.\\n\\nOtway had to wait until 1977 and the rise of punk before his dream of fame and fortune would finally become a reality. Having caught the eye of the producers of the BBC's Old Grey Whistle Test, Otway's performance on that show would grab the attention of the watching audience. Otway, ever the showman, decided to jump on to the amplifier of his colleague during a performance of Bob Lind's Cheryl's Going Home. (Un)fortunately for Otway, he misjudged his leap and sent Wild Willy Barrett’s amplifier tumbling as he crashed down straddling the box under the amp.\\n\\nThe full force of the impact was absorbed by the most tender body parts, but in doing this one simple act of recklessness and his wanton disregard for his own safety, Otway was the talk of everyone who watched that evening's programme.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Black Frog\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"e551cd9f216396a3:82\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r62eb36cf108?dice_id=r62eb36cf108\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/A2a7ed118688?dice_id=A2a7ed118688\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E8bd5f136bc2?dice_id=E8bd5f136bc2\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ka961677cc78?dice_id=Ka961677cc78\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ae782ceccc75?dice_id=Ae782ceccc75\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Lf1da5f7730b?dice_id=Lf1da5f7730b\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2023-10-05T01:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-09-26T19:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2023-10-05T06:15:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-09-26T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-09-27T00:30:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"secondary_status\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2200,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"properties\":[],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"4307\",\"name\":\"Hot Box Live Community Interest \",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-live-community-interest-7v77\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"692f21b9fa4024000144cc04\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"name\":\"John Otway and The Big Band\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"new\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"perm_name\":\"6dw5w2-john-otway-and-the-big-band-26th-sep-hot-box-chelmsford-tickets\",\"date_unix\":1790445600,\"score\":0,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"event_tag\":null},{\"unicorn\":false,\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"5073\",\"name\":\"Kings Place (Hall Two)\",\"address\":\"Kings Place, 90 York Way, London N1 9GU, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.53485440000001,\"lng\":-0.1219841},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"kings-place-hall-two-a95d\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.kingsplace.co.uk/your-visit/access-information/\"},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-09-26T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"faqs\":[],\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-01/22b5c488-41f2-49c0-a20a-6156951c5227.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-01/22b5c488-41f2-49c0-a20a-6156951c5227.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-10-01/22b5c488-41f2-49c0-a20a-6156951c5227.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"good day good day bad day bad day I\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/7oUTZltcwf4MhZbMFJWeSD\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/4cd547236efdd04aa1c98d0d92a2f182da44a14a?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"good day good day bad day bad day I\"}],\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1759275000,\"max_tickets\":4,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1141,\"name\":\"Kings Place \",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.kingsplace.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"seating\":null,\"about\":{\"description\":\"***In this special concert, GBSR Duo give the World Premiere of a newly commissioned work by Sarah Davachi, presented in partnership with d&b audiotechnik’s en-space technology.***  \\n\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\n\\nArtists-in-Residence GBSR Duo join forces for the very first time with acclaimed Canadian composer Sarah Davachi, one of the most distinctive voices in contemporary music today. Known internationally for her immersive and contemplative sound worlds, Davachi’s work explores the subtle intricacies of timbre and the perception of time, drawing listeners into states of heightened attention and deep listening.\\n\\nd&b audiotechnik‘s pioneering system allows acoustic environments to be shaped and transformed in real time, opening up a completely new dimension of listening in Hall Two.\\n\\n***This event will last 1 hour, with no interval.***\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Kings Place.\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"e551cd9f216396a3:83\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P9e9c1aaf8f8?dice_id=P9e9c1aaf8f8\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/za82bb7afff9?dice_id=za82bb7afff9\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/k0c756964dd6?dice_id=k0c756964dd6\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w0b99b7914dc?dice_id=w0b99b7914dc\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R6c538c7f4aa?dice_id=R6c538c7f4aa\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p033afa012d7?dice_id=p033afa012d7\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-10-01T00:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-09-26T12:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-10-01T00:30:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-09-26T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\