/A08952c1e59f?dice_id=A08952c1e59f\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1201,\"name\":\"DHP Family\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.dhpfamily.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"d6e15a092fa69dd9:14\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by DHP FAMILY.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1769508000,\"id\":\"697339828627e10001c3b654\",\"name\":\"Fischer-Z\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"DHP Presents :\\n\\nFISCHER-Z\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event (under 18’s accompanied). \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"67\",\"name\":\"DHP FAMILY\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"dhp-family-43kx\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1791136800,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":7538},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"7d7d8cb3-9d80-4206-9d70-dbbe81e4e06b\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"668c8537-569b-459b-aa5d-df72d382717b\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-05T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-10-02T09:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-08T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-10-04T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-10-04T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"q26lpx-djavan-4th-oct-roundhouse-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"7d7d8cb3-9d80-4206-9d70-dbbe81e4e06b\",\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":\"668c8537-569b-459b-aa5d-df72d382717b\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":64513,\"title\":\"Where are my tickets?\",\"body\":\"**IMPORTANT: Read here about your Roundhouse tickets**\\n\\nPlease note you will need to access your tickets via the Roundhouse Online Wallet at - http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk\\n\\nYour tickets WILL NOT be available in the DICE app. Just follow the below steps below on the day of event to access your ticket to the show:\\n\\nHead to http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk\\n\\nSign in using your DICE account email address - if you already had a Roundhouse account under the same email address, enter the password associated with this email address. If you didn’t have one, Roundhouse will have created one for you and you’ll just need to reset the password before logging in.\\n\\nIf you need to reset your password, you’ll be taken to http://roundhouse.org.uk, but you need to log in again at http://wallet.roundhouse.org.uk to access your ticket.\\n\\nThe QR code should appear a couple of hours before the stated time on your ticket\\n\\nIf you want to transfer your tickets to a friend please do so at least 4 hours before the event within the Roundhouse ticket wallet.\\n\\nIf you cannot access your tickets in the Roundhouse online wallet please visit the venue box office when you arrive and one of the team will be happy to assist you.\\n\\nFull information regarding the Roundhouse online wallet can be found at - https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/faqs/digital-tickets/\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":64514,\"title\":\"Security\",\"body\":\"On arrival you will be greeted by our ticket scanners and our security teams. Our security checks include bag searches and a search of individuals using wands. Please be prepared upon arrival to go through this process and help speed up the entry. Our security teams are there for your safety but we recognise that this process can be daunting for some. Please do raise any concerns with staff members when you arrive so that we can support you where needed.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":64515,\"title\":\"Prohibited Items\",\"body\":\"We reserve the right to prohibit specific items from the Roundhouse Premises. A full list of prohibited items can be found in our Admissions Terms & Conditions: https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/terms-policies/admissions-terms/\\n\\nUnfortunately flags and banners are not permitted into the venue as they can obstruct the view for other people in the audience. Please note this list is not exhaustive. The Venue Management has the right to prohibit any other items that are not included in this list but are deemed to cause a risk to the building or people.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":64516,\"title\":\"Accessibility Tickets\",\"body\":\"Accessibility tickets must be booked directly with the venue, not through DICE. Please get in touch with the venue via access@roundhouse.org.uk prior to purchasing.\",\"order\":3}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Djavan\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-15/df6f650b-5ad9-4f2f-bbf2-f1889ef22e3b.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"131482\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"114\",\"name\":\"Roundhouse\",\"address\":\"Roundhouse, Chalk Farm Rd, London NW1 8EH\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5430406,\"lng\":-0.15131180000003},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-10-24/2fce8c34-cb66-4510-a1d0-f2c07a1f9479.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2889%2C2889\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"roundhouse-4296\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.roundhouse.org.uk/visit/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-10-04T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-19/9e404b38-4d01-4284-9b51-553390315a68.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1767%2C1767\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-19/9e404b38-4d01-4284-9b51-553390315a68.jpg?rect=0%2C354%2C1767%2C1060\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-19/9e404b38-4d01-4284-9b51-553390315a68.jpg?rect=398%2C0%2C972%2C1767\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/G4057fdf0121?dice_id=G4057fdf0121\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H16662386277?dice_id=H16662386277\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/rad5cc2c6fea?dice_id=rad5cc2c6fea\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/G3c472bbbc18?dice_id=G3c472bbbc18\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a268a2a679d6?dice_id=a268a2a679d6\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/rdb4ddf53dd4?dice_id=rdb4ddf53dd4\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":380,\"name\":\"Columbo Music\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://thecolumbogroup.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"298700384025189\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":2089,\"name\":\" The Columbo Group\",\"privacy_policy_link\":null,\"fb_pixel_id\":\"556297964005636\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":false,\"show_opt_in_form\":false,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"d6e15a092fa69dd9:15\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Columbo Music.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1767607200,\"id\":\"694979011d72490001ec1cac\",\"name\":\"Djavan\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Djavan brings to London the greatest hits from every phase of his discography.\\n\\nIn 1976, the Alagoan singer began his artistic journey with the release of A Voz, o Violão, a Música de Djavan, without imagining he would become one of the most iconic figures in Brazilian popular music.\\n\\nHe now celebrates five decades of his career with a show built entirely around his most beloved hits. The setlist will feature a range of songs spanning Djavan’s entire discography, including timeless classics such as ‘Sina’, ‘Oceano’, ‘Um Amor Puro’, and more, performed live at Roundhouse.\\n\\nDjavan (vocals, acoustic guitar and electric guitar) Felipe Alves (drums) Marcelo Mariano (bass) Torcuato Mariano (electric and acoustic guitar) Paulo Calasans (piano and keyboard) Renato Fonseca (keyboard) Jessé Sadoc (trumpet and flugelhorn) Marcelo Martins (tenor sax and flute) Rafael Rocha (trombone)\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ (U18s accompanied) / U14s seated and accompanied on Mezzanine only.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"14\",\"name\":\"Columbo Music\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"columbo-music-427z\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1791136800,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2040,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":false,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-09-02T10:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-10-04T22:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-09-04T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-10-04T19:30:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-10-04T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"2wxlxp-cory-hanson-wand-4th-oct-moth-club-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Cory Hanson - Housefly\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2fHZoO9Tf2aycKJWmbB9JQ\",\"artist\":\"Cory Hanson\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/ca6f4b14f05e66be0de1d20e5eb51dd353ee8ced?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Housefly\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Cory Hanson - Housefly\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/housefly/1658891672?i=1658891675&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Cory Hanson\",\"preview_url\":\"\",\"track_name\":\"Housefly\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Cory Hanson\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-01/5a0fcb46-17d1-41e0-b06b-a81cbb2edef5.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"34866\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Like a sweet spring breeze after a long, cruel winter, Cory Hanson’s blowing through town again. And like the wind, I Love People comes from parts unknown. Need a ride? Long as you’re ready to find yourself wherever it dies down, jump on! Despite all the complications of life here in Central Casting 2025, Cory and the boys are happier than ever to be playing music at its most beautiful for ALL the people: eminent hipsters bellied up to the bar alongside the ropers, riders and all the other jokers for whom freedom’s just another word for nothing left to lose or do. Followers of Cory’s twin arcs as solo singer and Wand member will be intrigued to learn that the lineup here is the same band that recorded last year’s Vertigo. Yep, Wand — their Masters of Unbounded Space robes traded in for Wrecking Crew trucker’s caps, as they reel out licks both tasty and smooth, like chopsmeisters of yore. That’s Robbie Cody co-producing behind the desk, Evan Backer playing bass and arranging strings and horns, Evan Burrows on drums and percussion and Cory on piano, guitars and voices and songs.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"43\",\"name\":\"MOTH Club\",\"address\":\"Old Trades Hall, Valette Street, London E9 6NU\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5450825,\"lng\":-0.0546326999999565},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-04-14/0164c968-c9f6-4e55-8329-e0a12ce43b69.jpg?rect=341%2C0%2C1367%2C1367\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"moth-club-43ox\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://mothclub.co.uk/Access\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-10-04T19:30:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-08-29