ton-assembly-hall\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":31976,\"title\":\"Stage Times \",\"body\":\"Stage times are posted at 11am on the day of the show on our venue website.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":57461,\"title\":\"Age Restricition\",\"body\":\"This is a 14+ event – 14 and 15 year olds must be accompained by an adult. You may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"order\":3}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Yaşar\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/21f07473-2de5-443f-be53-a0f4b61cb02d.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"94465\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":8,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"34\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"address\":\"Upper Street, London N1 2UD\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5395894,\"lng\":-0.102482699999996},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-02-10/05562e9c-c684-4beb-b818-4e908bbfb14d.jpg?rect=712%2C0%2C2832%2C2832\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-z8e2\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/about/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-10-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/d8d47d65-7546-4bf9-8882-868608a23f90.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/d8d47d65-7546-4bf9-8882-868608a23f90.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-04/d8d47d65-7546-4bf9-8882-868608a23f90.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/S7cd23f30348?dice_id=S7cd23f30348\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s6dc59aacc0c?dice_id=s6dc59aacc0c\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o457ea69b17e?dice_id=o457ea69b17e\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/f600076f7661?dice_id=f600076f7661\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a850a058b05b?dice_id=a850a058b05b\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Lf6f6957c3cd?dice_id=Lf6f6957c3cd\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/legal-information/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"679202632593023\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-980124-39\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"d6e15a092fa69dd9:18\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Gise Events.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1770224400,\"id\":\"698341f198cfdc00017e16ab\",\"name\":\"Yasar\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"When we say ‘Oh, where are the songs of the ’90s?’, Yaşar is one of the first names that comes to mind. With his concert, he takes his audience on a journey into the past. Yaşar, who brought songs such as Kumralım, Birtanem, and Divane to Turkish pop music, mesmerizes listeners with his live performance. As part of his European tour, Yaşar will be performing at Islington Assembly Hall in London on October 7 2026. This special night celebrates the timeless hits of the ’90s and showcases why Yaşar remains a beloved figure in Turkish pop music, captivating audiences across generations.\\n\\n*By purchasing a ticket to this event you are agreeing to adhere to Islington Assembly Hall's terms and conditions: https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/customer-terms-conditions-2022/*\\n\\n*All tickets to shows at Islington Assembly Hall are subject to a Venue Levy of £1.50 + VAT. As a Grade II listed building, this levy will be reinvested into Islington Assembly Hall and its services, meaning the customer experience can continue to be enhanced.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1607\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"islington-assembly-hall-78g9\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1791396000,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":4597},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"796f42d6-ca66-42a5-8ad5-a5dda3c35b28\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"8653326f-30b8-4a87-9930-ed977273c7b5\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-12T13:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-10-07T15:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-21T13:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-10-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-10-07T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"bb3wgv-lafur-arnalds-7th-oct-eventim-apollo-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"796f42d6-ca66-42a5-8ad5-a5dda3c35b28\",\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"20:17\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/7vbCfkJf89i4s745KbELgr\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/014c0a36ace531f648b99ae56127c4af509a5cf6?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"20:17\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":12},\"seats_io_public_key\":\"8653326f-30b8-4a87-9930-ed977273c7b5\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":68350,\"title\":\"Bag Policy\",\"body\":\"Only small bags will be allowed into the venue. We class a small bag as A4 size or smaller or a standard handbag.\\n\\nLarge bags such as backpacks, suitcases, travel cases, laptop bags and large tote bags are NOT permitted inside the venue.\\n\\nNo bags are permitted in the Rear Circle Standing section for events. There is a cloakroom on site where small bags can be stored however, please note there is limited capacity for the cloakroom.\\n\\nFull information on security measures and bag policy can be found here: https://www.eventimapollo.com/venue-info/security/\",\"order\":0}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Ólafur Arnalds\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-02-11/b679ede5-009e-46be-b908-96dcbf504d70.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"},\"artist_id\":\"8197\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Ólafur Arnalds is a producer, composer and multi-instrumentalist from Iceland. A Grammy and Emmy nominee, his tranquil soundscapes – notably on 2020’s some kind of peace – utilise piano and orchestral strings, while his live shows combine immersive visuals, string quartets and self-playing piano software Stratus.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":4,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"365\",\"name\":\"Eventim Apollo\",\"address\":\"45 Queen Caroline St, London W6 9QH\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.49084,\"lng\":-0.224503599999935},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"eventim-apollo-jx2m\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.eventimapollo.com/venue-info/access-requirements/\"},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-10-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-09/2948184d-aebb-4bbc-ac37-f08fb532237b.jpg?rect=0%2C240%2C960%2C960\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-09/2948184d-aebb-4bbc-ac37-f08fb532237b.jpg?rect=0%2C432%2C960%2C576\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-09/2948184d-aebb-4bbc-ac37-f08fb532237b.jpg?rect=84%2C0%2C792%2C1440\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W9808975b55d?dice_id=W9808975b55d\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Zcb0ec1a8964?dice_id=Zcb0ec1a8964\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/qbdf390ca9e7?dice_id=qbdf390ca9e7\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z71d7d07c8ac?dice_id=Z71d7d07c8ac\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/i3087e6fb784?dice_id=i3087e6fb784\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Edc2559f1855?dice_id=Edc2559f1855\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":260,\"name\":\"Bird On The Wire\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.birdonthewire.net/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"168353773761986\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"d6e15a092fa69dd9:19\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Bird On The Wire.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1768222800,\"id\":\"6967ee872a0256000142fd81\",\"name\":\"Ólafur Arnalds\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Falling Apart Together  \\n***19 attempts at dismantling the distance  \\nA live experience by Ólafur Arnalds*\\n\\nAward-winning artist, composer and producer Ólafur Arnalds returns with his most daring and adventurous project to date.\\n\\nFalling Apart Together is an attempt at dismantling the distance between us. A concert hybrid that reveals the layers we construct in order to feel safe, the moments in which those layers tremble and the shared humanity that emerges when we allow ourselves to be exposed.\\n\\nTogether with his team of devoted craftsmen and musicians, Ólafur presents a spellbinding blend of past and new material in a show that challenges the boundaries of what a concert can be.\\n\\nAfter his globally acclaimed tours following re:member and some kind of peace — which sold out such iconic halls as Royal Albert Hall, Elbphilharmonie, Sydney Opera House, and Walt Disney Concert Hall – performing to hundreds of thousands of fans worldwide — Ólafur returns with his most intimate and boundary-pushing work to date.\\n\\nFalling Apart Together explores what becomes possible when we let ourselves unravel just enough to collectively open up.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"3+ only (under 15s must be accompanied by an adult).\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"112\",\"name\":\"Bird On The Wire\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"bird-on-the-wire-jqo9\",\"profile_active\":true},\"date_unix\":1791396000,\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Wed 07 Oct\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3554,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-21T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-10-08T17:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-23T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-10-08T19:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-10-08T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"wwreen-the-haunted-8th-oct-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"99\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5otXJIeiF43SPz7R7ov8GX\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/4a7e158aee02b84e051d39f507f6fbc37c906637?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"99\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"The Haunted - 99\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/99/1045610564?i=1045610574&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"The Haunted\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/d7/c1/b3/d7c1b31d-581b-ebed-d8a5-c9c637e1347b/mzaf_15277975655597984386.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"99\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":71087,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":71088,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":71089,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Red Method\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"41989\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"The Haunted\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb0880fd4a149bd96ad6e16ef5\"},\"artist_id\":\"132656\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-10-08T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-10-08T23:00:00+01:00\"}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/17b40880-cb6e-4e57-958a-01f690a7f82f.jpg?rect=773%2C0%2C3300%2C3300\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/17b40880-cb6e-4e57-958a-01f690a7f82f.jpg?rect=0%2C157%2C4979%2C2987\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/17b40880-cb6e-4e57-958a-01f690a7f82f.jpg?rect=1582%2C0%2C1815%2C3300\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u99e8763f140?dice_id=u99e8763f140\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/qed06ef1ad4a?dice_id=qed06ef1ad4a\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q1b875aeed9e?dice_id=Q1b875aeed9e\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/t12a27c2cccb?dice_id=t12a27c2cccb\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Aed260ff6e93?dice_id=Aed260ff6e93\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W55034102d05?dice_id=W55034102d05\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"d6e15a092fa69dd9:20\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Underworld.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1769014800,\"id\":\"6971e8234a279a00016dbcc0\",\"name\":\"THE HAUNTED\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"THE HAUNTED are a Swedish Heavy Metal band from Gothenburg, formed in 1996. The original members were Anders and Jonas Björler, Peter Dolving, Adrian Erlandsson and Patrik Jensen. Both the Björler brothers and Erlandsson were members of the seminal Melodic Death Metal band AT THE GATES, a pioneering force in the Swedish Death Metal scene.\\n\\nThe band currently consists of Marco Aro (vocals), Patrik Jensen (rhythm guitar), Ola Englund (lead guitar), Jonas Bjorler (bass), and Adrian Erlandsson (drums).\\n\\nDuring August 2024, THE HAUNTED were in the studio working on their tenth studio album, with drummer Adrian Erlandsson confirming that he was \\\"working on drums\\\" for it.\\n\\nThe band released their tenth studio album, Songs of Last Resort, on 30th May 2025.\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1791482400,\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Thu 08 Oct\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1650,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-09T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-10-09T17:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-09T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-10-09T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-10-09T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"q29oby-7-seconds-of-love-9th-oct-new-cross-inn-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"7 Seconds of Love - Danger of Death\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/danger-of-death/357109644?i=357110393&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"7 Seconds of Love\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Music/bf/50/4e/mzm.hcdgxkwp.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Danger of Death\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"7 Seconds of Love - Danger of Death\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2mrbRGW49PgSwLbN3DQmGD\",\"artist\":\"7 Seconds of Love\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/461654b0b615a6572ee77099445fb970c9a4489e?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Danger of Death\"}],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"7 Seconds of Love\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"94585\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"offers_extras\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1641\",\"name\":\"New Cross Inn\",\"address\":\"New Cross Inn, 323 New Cross Rd, London SE14 6AS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4757899,\"lng\":-0.037162699999953475},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/ba29f2fe-617e-4542-80b7-6e2529031d70.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C225%2C225\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"new-cross-inn-x9yl\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.newcrossinn.com/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-10-09T18:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-06/f993afa2-655c-4557-a943-67516327983c.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1000%2C1000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-06/f993afa2-655c-4557-a943-67516327983c.jpg?rect=0%2C200%2C1000%2C600\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-06/f993afa2-655c-4557-a943-67516327983c.jpg?rect=225%2C0%2C550%2C1000\"},\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/wa2fed709f7c?dice_id=wa2fed709f7c\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/we9606e730a0?dice_id=we9606e730a0\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/mce593845445?dice_id=mce593845445\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/u93cce3cbac2?dice_id=u93cce3cbac2\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Pba3bc34f35e?dice_id=Pba3bc34f35e\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/db0d5d4fef87?dice_id=db0d5d4fef87\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"impression_id\":\"d6e15a092fa69dd9:21\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Safe As Milk and Be Sharp Promotions present\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1770595200,\"id\":\"6986218b86d4e50001b360be\",\"name\":\"7 Seconds Of Love\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"7 Seconds Of Love\\n\\nIt's no surprise that Britain's ska-tinged comedy rock act 7 Seconds of Love is the creation of Joel Veitch, the Internet animator behind cult website www.rathergood.com and Quizno's ads featuring the infamous Spongmonkeys. After recruiting his brother Alex Veitch to play keyboards, Joel met the five other musicians who would round out the act -- Pat Schulenburg (guitar), Ed Snow (drums), Ed Harding (trumpet), Ian Paterson (saxophone), and Stephen Pattison (bass). The band started playing shows in London, later expanding to regional and national gigs, as well as maintaining an enthusiastic digital following thanks to Joel's animated music videos and the release of singles. In January 2007, fans in Argentina alerted 7 Seconds of Love that a Coca-Cola commercial being shown in the country bore a striking similarity to the group's song and video for \\\"Ninja.\\\" A legal agreement was reached with the company in which Coca-Cola paid the band an undisclosed sum; 7 Seconds of Love used some of the money to record and distribute an EP, and then donated the rest to two children's charities. \\n\\nFollowing their packed out reunion show at the New Cross Inn in October 2024 (their first London show in almost a decade), 7SOL are back and better than ever!\\n\\nhttps://open.spotify.com/artist/2qNMrWESolNFF3oc6YYKPc\\n\\n\\\\+ supports\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ under 16's to be accompanied by an adult\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1888\",\"name\":\"New Cross Live\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"new-cross-live-y8la\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1791565200,\"event_tag\":null},{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2859,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"fd2d3e53-acae-4794-ac5f-d65d97f97249\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"c36ada6d-6a62-4ea4-b2e3-d77a8688f68b\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-20T18:15:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-10-09T13:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-20T18:15:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-10-09T18:00:00+01:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-10-09T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"perm_name\":\"53898w-eric-christian-9th-oct-cadogan-hall-london-tickets\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"fd2d3e53-acae-4794-ac5f-d65d97f97249\",\"previews\":[],\"donation\":null,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"seats_io_public_key\":\"c36ada6d-6a62-4ea4-b2e3-d77a8688f68b\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Eric Christian\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-20/8aa7e2e4-c99e-46f0-8f46-15ae6ecc1e7d.