t_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"d6e15a092fa69dd9:68\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Crosstown Concerts.\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1770804000,\"id\":\"698c50a6203b5000012467aa\",\"name\":\"Swervedriver\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Thirty-five years on, Swervedriver are ready to celebrate their iconic debut with ‘Raise At 35’ – a special performance at the Village Underground in London on October 24th, where the band will play the album in its entirety, among other songs from their vast back catalogue.\\n\\nIf you have any queries or would like more information about access at Village Underground, please see our FAQs here: https://bit.ly/3EhSLgF, or contact access@villageunderground.co.uk.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"16+ event. (16-17 with a responsible adult 18+,1:1) \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"11556\",\"name\":\"Village Underground\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"village-underground-n5v8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"date_unix\":1792866600,\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Sat 24 Oct\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1320,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":true,\"streaming_options\":null,\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-02T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-10-25T15:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-02T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-10-25T15:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-10-25T20:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\"