{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E55e25139a89?dice_id=E55e25139a89\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n409c221de2e?dice_id=n409c221de2e\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ld3acda808fb?dice_id=ld3acda808fb\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/X501397025ac?dice_id=X501397025ac\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Fe3cbd8c55d5?dice_id=Fe3cbd8c55d5\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/va5fd467bb54?dice_id=va5fd467bb54\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":818,\"name\":\"HERE at Outernet\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://hereldn.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1415783946118882\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-QH4NRPEYW3\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":819,\"name\":\"The Lower Third\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://thelowerthird.co.uk/privacy-notice/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"783951717556608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"G-ZVCKXCPJY8\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"impression_id\":\"d6e15a092fa69dd9:78\",\"properties\":[],\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Kilimanjaro\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1769594400,\"id\":\"6979f0ce1787b70001366e74\",\"name\":\"Jamie Grey\",\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"new\":false,\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Jamie Grey excels at intimate songs infused with heartfelt emotion, his voice exuding power and soul as he delivers lyrics that confront life’s tougher moments head-on. His authenticity and natural charm continue to attract a rapidly growing audience, with streams now surpassing 75 million and live performances alongside Rag’n’Bone Man, Scouting For Girls and Jools Holland.\\n\\nA renowned collaborator, Jamie co-wrote James Arthur’s hit Falling Like The Stars and several tracks from Arthur’s UK #1 album Bitter Sweet Love. Alongside his own releases, these moments have cemented his reputation as both a compelling solo artist and a trusted songwriter.\\n\\nSince the end of 2025, Jamie has entered a bold new creative chapter. A burst of inspiration has seen him refine a supercharged pop sound that blends emotional depth with arena-ready hooks. Recent releases showcase an artist stepping confidently into his world-conquering potential, with more new music already lined up for release throughout this year.\\n\\nHailing from Redcar on Teesside, Jamie was first drawn to music through the big voices and unwavering conviction of Motown, later shaped by UK influences such as Arctic Monkeys anMursolo Nutini. Although performance always called to him, he initially shied away from the stage — until one decisive moment saw him quit his job to fully commit to his ambitions.\\n\\nWith a sold-out UK headline tour in 2023 and 2025, this underlines his determination to become a global artist, with momentum continuing to build ever since. In 2026, Jamie Grey takes that next step with a UK and European tour, bringing his powerful live show to audiences across the continent. With new music on the way and his profile rising fast, it’s only a matter of time before Jamie Grey earns his place in pop’s premier league.\\n\\n*For accessibility information please see the accessibility information button/link below.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ (U16's must be accompanied by an adult)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"score\":0,\"billin