9T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-11-06T14:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-12T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-11-08T17:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-11-08T22:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Action!\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_disabled\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"40ab2fb2-a73d-4ff4-8c80-31a8ed113ee0\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/B109a4eff94a?dice_id=B109a4eff94a\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ie27492a4f8e?dice_id=ie27492a4f8e\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Icba77574ecc?dice_id=Icba77574ecc\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Uc01abecb72e?dice_id=Uc01abecb72e\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K5ef80b114e0?dice_id=K5ef80b114e0\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/pf27a7de51fb?dice_id=pf27a7de51fb\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Standing: Over 16s only. Seated: Under 15s must be accompanied by an adult over 18.\\n\\nThere is a £3.25 Venue Facility Fee included in the ticket price.\\n\\nAccessible Seating Accessible bookings can be purchased online when selecting the event via www.theo2.co.uk and visiting the https://www.theo2.co.uk/visit-us/accessibility (copy to browser), DICE do not process any Accessible tickets for any event at The O2.\\n\\nAction! presents\\n\\nPapa Roach - Rise of the Roach\\n\\n\\\\+ Special Guests\\n\\n\\\\-\\n\\n£1 from each ticket sale will be donated to CALM, charity number 1110621\\n\\nPapa Roach, the two-time GRAMMY-nominated, Platinum-selling pioneers of Alternative Hard Rock, are celebrating the 25th Anniversary of their groundbreaking album INFEST in 2025. Known for their candid approach to mental health, the band has long used their platform to raise awareness and support suicide prevention—beginning with their iconic hit “Last Resort” and continuing through their recent collaboration with Carrie Underwood on “Leave A Light On (Talk Away The Dark),” which raised over $500,000 for the American Foundation for Suicide Prevention (AFSP). The ever-evolving band has released eleven studio albums to date, including their most recent release, Ego Trip, via their own label, New Noize Records. Papa Roach’s catalogue has amassed over 1 billion global streams, with Ego Trip delivering four #1 singles and contributing to an impressive career total of 28 Top 10 hits and 14 #1s across Rock, Alternative, and Hot AC charts. Following sold-out arena tours across the UK, Europe, and North America, Papa Roach will take their electrifying live show to Asia and Australia this spring. Their new single “WAKE UP CALLING” is available everywhere January 28th.\\n\\n16+ only in the standing area, under 15s must be accompanied by an adult aged 18+\",\"highlights\":[]},\"seats_io_public_key\":\"91b87c00-af06-457c-b5e8-4d8f0af2ae7f\",\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1175,\"name\":\"Kilimanjaro Live Limited\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://myticket.co.uk/privacy-policy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false},{\"id\":2127,\"name\":\"The O2, London\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theo2.co.uk/legal/privacy\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":1794159000,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"584\",\"name\":\"The O2, London\",\"address\":\"O2 Arena\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5025248,\"lng\":0.00366410000003725},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-o2-london-q2xy\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-11-08T17:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"764f3889713ed38b:1\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"91\",\"name\":\"Kilimanjaro\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"kilimanjaro-43px\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"6989b2f7202b71000109867d\",\"name\":\"Papa Roach - Rise of the Roach\",\"perm_name\":\"wwe28n-papa-roach-rise-of-the-roach-8th-nov-the-o2-london-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-06/815de4fd-7d48-42a7-82ba-41ff587f9b59.jpg?rect=834%2C0%2C4167%2C4167\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-06/815de4fd-7d48-42a7-82ba-41ff587f9b59.jpg?rect=0%2C334%2C5834%2C3500\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-06/815de4fd-7d48-42a7-82ba-41ff587f9b59.jpg?rect=1771%2C0%2C2292%2C4167\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Papa Roach\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-02-06/ae9c4aa8-3881-4df0-bf74-e981653927a9.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"64347\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770631200,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":74959,\"title\":\"FAQs for The O2\",\"body\":\"Further information about visiting The O2 can be found at https://help.theo2.co.uk/hc/en-gb\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":74960,\"title\":\"How to book accessible tickets for The O2\",\"body\":\"Accessible Seating Accessible bookings can be purchased online when selecting the event via www.theo2.co.uk and visiting the https://www.theo2.co.uk/visit-us/accessibility (copy to browser), DICE do not process any Accessible tickets for any event at The O2.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":74961,\"title\":\"How tickets work for The O2\",\"body\":\"Tickets will be in The O2 venue app as they’re handling ticket scanning for this event. We will email you when your tickets are available in the app.\\n\\nHow to use your tickets:\\n\\n1\\\\. Get The O2 venue app - https://www.theo2.co.uk/visit-us/the-o2-app\\n\\n2\\\\. Sign up using the email you used to purchase your tickets on DICE\\n\\n3\\\\. At the door, show your tickets on the venue app (not DICE)\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":74962,\"title\":\"Can I change my seat?\",\"body\":\"Seats can’t be changed after booking, so please review your selection carefully before checkout.\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":76215,\"title\":\"Ticket Terms and Conditions\",\"body\":\"The following information is to be provided to all ticket purchasers at the point of sale and should appear on all event and sales pages on your websites:\\n\\n1\\\\. Your ticket purchase constitutes a personal, revocable license and, at all times, remains the property of the promoters. This ticket must be surrendered to the promoters upon request.\\n\\n2\\\\. Your ticket/s are sold by the promoters directly to you the consumer. Any tickets purchased by business or traders in breach of the terms and conditions of ticket sale will be cancelled. By accepting these terms and conditions you confirm that you are a consumer.\\n\\n3\\\\. Your ticket/s will IMMEDIATELY BECOME INVALID if resold OR OFFERED FOR SALE unless the sale is through the Artist’s official re-sale channels as advertised, or ticket agent fan to fan exchange (where applicable). Tickets sold via third parties and other unauthorised outlets, including online auction sites, are not valid for admission. The resale of a ticket renders it invalid and may lead to refusal of entry.\\n\\n4\\\\. Ticket sales are limited to a maximum of 8 per person.\\n\\n5\\\\. Only tickets purchased through approved ticket agents are valid for admission. The venue reserves the right to refuse admission.\",\"order\":4}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":0},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"40ab2fb2-a73d-4ff4-8c80-31a8ed113ee0\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"91b87c00-af06-457c-b5e8-4d8f0af2ae7f\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-17T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-11-06T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-17T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-11-08T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-11-08T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by New Cross Live.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[\"selling_fast\"],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/aa5ba4e2427c?dice_id=aa5ba4e2427c\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F7b030a748fd?dice_id=F7b030a748fd\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ye154ae18448?dice_id=Ye154ae18448\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z8b49fbba04a?dice_id=Z8b49fbba04a\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a7bd6319410d?dice_id=a7bd6319410d\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r518f89c61bf?dice_id=r518f89c61bf\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Los Fastidios\\n\\nFrom Verona, Italy, they have been touring the world since 1991, playing over a hundred shows a year. Their sound is from Streetpunk to 2Tone ska, with a mix of rock'n'roll, brit-pop, and early reggae. They're all about having fun, with lyrics that make you think and get you dancing from start to finish. Enrico, the\\n\\noriginal lead singer, has been joined by Elisa Dixan's sweet voice since 2018, which has given the band a fresh, even more exciting vibe.\\n\\nwww.instagram.com/losfastidios\\\\_official\\n\\n\\\\+ supports TBA\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ under 16's to be accompanied by an adult\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1794160800,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1641\",\"name\":\"New Cross Inn\",\"address\":\"New Cross Inn, 323 New Cross Rd, London SE14 6AS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4757899,\"lng\":-0.037162699999953475},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/ba29f2fe-617e-4542-80b7-6e2529031d70.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C225%2C225\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"new-cross-inn-x9yl\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.newcrossinn.com/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-11-08T18:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sal