ttps://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/d70a674b-de47-4914-959e-bd0025102a5e.jpg?rect=0%2C39%2C1200%2C720\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-26/d70a674b-de47-4914-959e-bd0025102a5e.jpg?rect=381%2C0%2C439%2C798\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Rwake\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"113845\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Intercourse\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebd9f78690039caf82153efc08\"},\"artist_id\":\"84294\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Eyehategod\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebd24736ad136d98a63d5db87f\"},\"artist_id\":\"8087\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Eyehategod emerged in the early ’90s with an uncompromising blend of doomy, bluesy punk and misanthropic metal that quickly pushed them to the fore of the fertile New Orleans metal scene. Since debuting with In the Name of Suffering, the band have amassed a loyal following with potently disorienting releases. Each new album saw the band adding or refining an element, ensuring the doomcore veterans continued to evolve.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1770372000,\"faqs\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3647,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"New Orleans Is the New Vietnam\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/2O1cAE5g9CNU5j9JWQs1fD\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/0ca3958797dc49772365456074e5b7a092b7f6c7?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"New Orleans Is the New Vietnam\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Mon 09 Nov\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-28T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-11-11T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-28T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-11-11T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-11-11T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Black Frog\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p18bef682a13?dice_id=p18bef682a13\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/nd64aca74b54?dice_id=nd64aca74b54\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/W24ecec63770?dice_id=W24ecec63770\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ub4900106bfb?dice_id=ub4900106bfb\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Q783c381e4f8?dice_id=Q783c381e4f8\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/E45554983293?dice_id=E45554983293\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Track Dogs are an international band formed in 2006 in Madrid with a name deriving from the dark subterranean world of the New York subway system. They are an eclectic line up of acoustic guitar, electric bass, trumpet, cajon and stunning four-part vocal harmonies.**\\n\\n*“A rare combination of four great players who also have superb voices creating stunning individual vocal performances and the almost inevitable perfect harmonies. The playing is outstanding, the harmonies superb and it is joyful throughout, just give it a listen”. Music Riot UK*\\n\\n**Their sound is best described as “sunshine-y songs thriving on dark themes behind irresistible rhythms”. Those familiar with the band will know that Track Dogs have always dabbled in different styles from Americana and bluegrass to folk and even blues. With over 11 albums, and performances from Glastonbury to the Royal Albert Hall, Track Dogs continue make a name for themselves.**\\n\\n*“Genre busting acoustic music built around folk, Americana and blue grass”. RnR Magazine*\\n\\n**Sometimes deadly serious, sometimes showing a finely tuned sense of humour – they will always get you tapping your feet and before you know it you will be up and dancing!**\\n\\n*“If you were looking to mark your card for the ‘end of the world’ party, head to wherever Track Dogs are playing for they surely will be playing! Squeeze in at the bar, drink up and thirst no more”. Americana-UK*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"18+\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1794423600,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3785\",\"name\":\"Hot Box\",\"address\":\"28 Viaduct Rd, Chelmsford CM1 1TS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.7359952,\"lng\":0.4672127},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-06-29/9ff0c867-708b-4d5c-834d-a927e4e4ae83.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"5eb9799ae1727402966007e1\",\"name\":\"Chelmsford\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.736717,\"lng\":0.466083,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-r7wq\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.hotboxlive.co.uk/accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-11-11T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"764f3889713ed38b:5\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"4307\",\"name\":\"Hot Box Live Community Interest \",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-live-community-interest-7v77\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"692f502e3f4fd20001e10d29\",\"name\":\"Track Dogs\",\"perm_name\":\"6dw5k8-track-dogs-11th-nov-hot-box-chelmsford-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-28/88acd55b-d42a-4eed-87cc-b26770ad68f5.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-28/88acd55b-d42a-4eed-87cc-b26770ad68f5.jpg?rect=0%2C240%2C1200%2C720\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-28/88acd55b-d42a-4eed-87cc-b26770ad68f5.jpg?rect=270%2C0%2C660%2C1200\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Track Dogs\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"70447\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1766880000,\"faqs\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2200,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Track Dogs - Amor De Mi Vida\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/amor-de-mi-vida/1791658730?i=1791658738&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Track Dogs\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/11/35/51/1135514f-7a79-6966-18fd-b32fe4e41bf5/mzaf_2980964804735338452.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Amor De Mi Vida\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Track Dogs - Amor De Mi Vida\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0eAaA7Fo15tsU7jCtj1DM8\",\"artist\":\"Track Dogs\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/7ec75a4bccb6164a15fd82291710a6eff5aa6e98?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Amor De Mi Vida\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Wed 11 Nov\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-19T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-11-12T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-19T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-11-12T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-11-12T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by New Cross Live.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ge40f7619fd3?dice_id=Ge40f7619fd3\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Sc2b21dd2103?dice_id=Sc2b21dd2103\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h93838284433?dice_id=h93838284433\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b9570e498eea?dice_id=b9570e498eea\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/fb38b35ac307?dice_id=fb38b35ac307\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P25361061b4c?dice_id=P25361061b4c\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"O.R.k.\\n\\nFormed as a meeting of minds between award-winning composer/vocalist LEF, King Crimson drummer Pat Mastelotto, Marta Sui Tubi’s Carmelo Pipitone on guitar and bassist Colin Edwin, formerly of Porcupine Tree, O.R.k. set out their stall with their forceful and enticing debut album Inflamed Rides in 2015.\\n\\nO.R.k. have cemented their reputation with further full-length album releases, 2017’s Soul of an Octopus, 2019’s Ramagehead, 2022’s Screamnasium and their fifth album, Firehose of Falsehoods was released in April 2025.\\n\\nO.R.k have long attracted the interest and support of fellow creative artists and musicians. Previous guests and collaborators have included multiplatinum vocal phenomenon Elisa, virtuoso cellist Jo Quail and System of a Down’s Serj Tankian. The creative duo of Grammy winning art director Adam Jones (of Tool) and Marvel/DC Comics illustrator Denis Rodier have also been involved in artwork and their albums remarkable visual imagery, while mixing and mastering duties have been undertaken by both Machine (Lamb of God, Clutch) and three-time Grammy winner Marc Urselli.\\n\\nO.R.k. have also built up a considerable live following with dates and festivals across Europe and South America over the years.\\n\\n\\\"Between Lef’s voice and the sheer power of their live shows, they’re alt-metal titans in the making\\\" - Prog Magazine\\n\\nhttps://www.orkband.com/\\n\\n\\\\+ supports\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ under 16's to be accompanied by an adult\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1794506400,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1641\",\"name\":\"New Cross Inn\",\"address\":\"New Cross Inn, 323 New Cross Rd, London SE14 6AS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4757899,\"lng\":-0.037162699999953475},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/ba29f2fe-617e-4542-80b7-6e2529031d70.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C225%2C225\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"new-cross-inn-x9yl\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.newcrossinn.com/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-11-12T18:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"764f3889713ed38b:6\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1888\",\"name\":\"New Cross Live\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"new-cross-live-y8la\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"6968f755eb5a600001639647\",\"name\":\"O.R.k.\",\"perm_name\":\"v3qodg-ork-12th-nov-new-cross-inn-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-15/0b4f5182-43fa-4725-9c4c-5384e2e3cc74.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-15/0b4f5182-43fa-4725-9c4c-5384e2e3cc74.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-15/0b4f5182-43fa-4725-9c4c-5384e2e3cc74.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"O.R.k\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb506f42e2076ca9cf5c4af407\"},\"artist_id\":\"6110\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1768780800,\"faqs\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2200,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Kneel to Nothing\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5W5DAkxT6EWMvshtictWA0\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/7b813df2cd122f676a30ed327038f9640922f003?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Kneel to Nothing\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-15T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-11-12T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-15T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-11-12T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-11-12T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Red Crust Promotions.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/S541f82a7004?dice_id=S541f82a7004\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/B8f77515cfa8?dice_id=B8f77515cfa8\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Yc3a51329f77?dice_id=Yc3a51329f77\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x9b8712c0326?dice_id=x9b8712c0326\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Y0f9d876afba?dice_id=Y0f9d876afba\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T0860e74c3f2?dice_id=T0860e74c3f2\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Multi award-winning singer, songwriter and multi-instrumentalist Rosalie Cunningham (ex Purson/Ipso Facto) released her Mercury Music Prize nominated, self titled début album in 2019 through Esoteric Antenna, earning a Top 10 placing in the UK’s official independent chart and attracting fantastic reviews and stellar ratings from Classic Rock, Uncut, Mojo and Kerrang.\\n\\nRosalie built on her burgeoning reputation as an original and thought-provoking songwriter and musician with the release of her second solo album ‘Two Piece Puzzle’ (also through Esoteric Antenna) to universal acclaim in 2022. The Times – 4/5 ‘fantastic’; Powerplay – 10/10 ‘a heady mix … all infused with Rosalie’s unique ability to entertain and enthral the listener’; Shindig – 5/5 ‘sexy, loud and bursting with ideas’; Uncut – 8/10 ‘dazzling’.\\n\\nWhen her hectic touring schedule has allowed, Rosalie has been working on her third solo studio album, ‘To Shoot Another Day’.\\n\\nThe first tracks released from ‘To Shoot Another Day’ were ‘Return of The Ellington’ and ‘Home’ – available as a limited edition 7” vinyl single exclusively through Rosalie’s website and digitally through Esoteric Antenna via all the usual streaming platforms.\\n\\nThis is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year olds MUST be accompanied by an adult (18+) / All ticketholders under the age of 25 will be required to carry PHOTO ID.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":1794510000,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-11-12T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-11-12T23:00:00+00:00\"}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"764f3889713ed38b:7\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"69666b2bbbdd570001478853\",\"name\":\"ROSALIE CUNNINGHAM\",\"perm_name\":\"q27r29-rosalie-cunningham-12th-nov-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/c478ac24-ab01-4bc2-9b29-9304e2e25d20.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C2200%2C2200\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/c478ac24-ab01-4bc2-9b29-9304e2e25d20.jpg?rect=0%2C440%2C2200%2C1320\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-21/c478ac24-ab01-4bc2-9b29-9304e2e25d20.jpg?rect=495%2C0%2C1210%2C2200\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Rosalie Cunningham\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"43991\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1768471200,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":69079,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":69080,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":69081,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2987,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Rosalie Cunningham - Butterflies\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/butterflies/1464598387?i=1464598645&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Rosalie Cunningham\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/bb/3d/36/bb3d369d-8ae2-2fe1-fcad-4db7405fd3ec/mzaf_14260944269683559074.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Butterflies\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Rosalie Cunningham - Butterflies\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/3JhcdAugm7WubG5oWbKOSu\",\"artist\":\"Rosalie Cunningham\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/e7c3cd34c4a9a064d1684817cd15392958bb7698?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Butterflies\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Thu 12 Nov\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-17T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-11-14T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-17T17:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-11-14T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-11-14T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Underworld.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J24ed1677e07?dice_id=J24ed1677e07\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s7267da23e0f?dice_id=s7267da23e0f\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p92ade2d84ba?dice_id=p92ade2d84ba\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ud54a4546b44?dice_id=Ud54a4546b44\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Qa30e176789b?dice_id=Qa30e176789b\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/wbf30fcf2f60?dice_id=wbf30fcf2f60\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"“THE DIRT TOUR 2026”\\n\\nThe world’s most authentic Mötley Crüe tribute show goes international – and they're the Crüe you deserve. Brace yourself: the decadence of the Sunset Strip is headed your way with a soundtrack to boot thanks to four hell raisers named Nikki, Vince, Mick & Tommy.\\n\\nAfter 10 years together on the road and during Mötley Crüde’s anniversary tour “Decade of Decadence” in 2025, the band’s popularity soared to new heights, drawing over 3.5 million visitors across social media and amassing a devoted international following. Now, in 2026, Mötley Crüde is set to embark on their most ambitious journey yet — \\\"The Dirt Tour\\\" — a high-octane celebration of Mötley Crüe’s legendary 80s era which takes their show across the entire UK, into parts of Europe, for the first time ever into the USA and even down under to Australia.\\n\\nThe Dirt Tour promises to be a spectacle of lüde, crüde & rüde anarchy, and what fans are calling a stadium show in the clubs and the most faithful Mötley Crüe experience on Earth.\\n\\n“They’re not a tribute – they are Mötley Crüe in their prime.” – Kerrang.\\n\\nVoted “The World’s Most Authentic Mötley Crüe Tribute” by the official Mötley Crüe Global Fanclub, these lifelong Crüeheads have been tearing through the tribute scene with an explosive and unrivaled live show, explicit attention to detail, note-for-note accuracy, vintage-era gear/costumes and a sound that captures the raw energy of the Crüe’s wildest years (Shout at the Devil, Theatre of Pain, Girls, Girls, Girls, and Dr. Feelgood). Mötley Crüde has raised the bar worldwide not only for tribute shows but original acts too.\\n\\nIn 2023, the band became the first tribute act in history to sell out the iconic London venue The Underworld in Camden on presales alone, equalling that of the real Mötley Crüe who sold out the same venue just six months prior in a secret show under the name Dögs Öf War.\\n\\nFans should prepare for a 2-hour, no-holds-barred assault of Crüe hits, fan favourites and those long-desired deep cuts, delivered with the same fire that lit up the Whisky A Go Go in ’81.\\n\\nMötley Crüde isn’t just a tribute — they’re a resurrection of rock’s most notorious decade. Whether you're a longtime Crüehead or discovering the madness for the first time, this is the closest you’ll get to the real thing, delivered by the realest Mötley Crüe experience on the planet.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 14+ event. 14 and 15 year old’s MUST be accompanied by an adult\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1396572940874608\",\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":1794679200,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"53\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"address\":\"174 Camden High St, London NW1 0NE\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5391426,\"lng\":-0.142163900000014},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-25/f029c393-780a-492d-8c51-acec64197fc4.jpg?rect=391%2C0%2C1569%2C1569\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zg7p\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.theunderworldcamden.co.uk/about/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-11-14T18:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-11-14T22:00:00+00:00\"}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"764f3889713ed38b:8\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"52\",\"name\":\"The Underworld\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-underworld-zkx8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"691b4be20239be000127c2be\",\"name\":\"MÖTLEY CRÜDE\",\"perm_name\":\"mx82vv-mtley-crde-14th-nov-the-underworld-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-18/4a1ee0d4-0e3d-41db-ab64-cd5dc9243054.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C3000%2C3000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-18/4a1ee0d4-0e3d-41db-ab64-cd5dc9243054.jpg?rect=0%2C600%2C3000%2C1800\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-18/4a1ee0d4-0e3d-41db-ab64-cd5dc9243054.jpg?rect=675%2C0%2C1650%2C3000\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Sven Smith\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-17/749262b2-c7d4-4ac4-8a98-d4aafd33d2f5.jpg?rect=0%2C53%2C534%2C534\"},\"artist_id\":\"130344\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Mötley Crüde\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"24554\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":2,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1763398800,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":19233,\"title\":\"Offer your ticket to another fan\",\"body\":\"We believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the Waiting List: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the Waiting List function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the Waiting List after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the Waiting List works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":19234,\"title\":\"Transfer your ticket to a friend \",\"body\":\"If a friend is keen to attend an event you can’t make, you can transfer your ticket to them quickly and securely within the app. Just make sure you have their number saved in your phone, and that they have a DICE account registered with that number.\\n\\nAfter you transfer the ticket, it will be stored within the DICE app on your friend’s phone – there’s no fiddling with name changes, emailing PDFs, or sending across screenshots. It’s just another way we make sure tickets don’t fall into the wrong hands.\\n\\nThe whole process takes seconds, here’s a step-by-step breakdown https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669378449\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":19235,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":2}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2591,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Mötley Crüe - Cancelled\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/cancelled/1761271497?i=1761271509&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Mötley Crüe\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/ba/52/c5/ba52c51b-af22-9f1b-6a05-beb229602483/mzaf_16431188050141567039.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Cancelled\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Mötley Crüe - Cancelled\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6zMBklADPUiVev8tFrMHIy\",\"artist\":\"Mötley Crüe\",\"preview_url\":\"\",\"track_name\":\"Cancelled\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-02-05T09:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-11-14T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-02-05T09:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-11-14T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-11-14T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Reckless Rat Promotions.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Sf4f2cfb629d?dice_id=Sf4f2cfb629d\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Hf63959a1244?dice_id=Hf63959a1244\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a9d531739fb2?dice_id=a9d531739fb2\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/p6cd4522a7a3?dice_id=p6cd4522a7a3\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w439ba4b1e27?dice_id=w439ba4b1e27\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/X22ce784840f?dice_id=X22ce784840f\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Short version: Chiara Kilchling is a musician from Germany with Hungarian roots. Although she began her singing career in the children’s choir of the opera in her hometown Freiburg, she fell in love with rock music and bands like Led Zeppelin, Whitesnake, Fleetwood Mac and Metallica at a young age. At eighteen, she began uploading videos of herself, covering popular songs by singing and playing various instruments on YouTube and making connections in the cover scene. She regularly collaborates with various YouTube stars, and today her channel has over 70,000 subscribers and her videos receive numerous views.\\n\\nIn 2021 she founded her rock band ‘Caravel,’ with which she now writes and releases her own music, inspired by her idols.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+. U18's accompanied by an adult. Physical photo ID required for entry.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":294,\"name\":\"229 The Venue\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://229.london/dataprotection/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":1794682800,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"399\",\"name\":\"229\",\"address\":\"229 Great Portland St, London W1W 5PN, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.523568,\"lng\":-0.144821},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-04-28/84389ecd-ecb4-45bc-a846-5cf9964535ff.jpg?rect=180%2C0%2C838%2C838\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"229-zl9b\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://229.london/access/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-11-14T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\