econdary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1871\",\"name\":\"Alexandra Palace\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"alexandra-palace-oybm\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"697393a7b1b16800013bd337\",\"name\":\"Enter Shikari\",\"perm_name\":\"l8b9xx-enter-shikari-20th-nov-alexandra-palace-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-30/186d53ba-c375-4835-b7f7-7edb541f07e5.jpg?rect=0%2C315%2C1920%2C1920\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-30/186d53ba-c375-4835-b7f7-7edb541f07e5.jpg?rect=0%2C864%2C1920%2C1152\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-30/186d53ba-c375-4835-b7f7-7edb541f07e5.jpg?rect=168%2C0%2C1584%2C2880\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"The Callous Daoboys\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-03-31/e03183b8-e55e-4c2f-8265-25c90173e65a.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"48572\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Holding Absence\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-05-24/d219dc4f-a060-4858-8524-2cf5325f17d5.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"4348\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Enter Shikari\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-07-26/215fa2ac-c71c-4eae-b88b-17c22f2a2a5c.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C640%2C640\"},\"artist_id\":\"20388\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Although primarily considered a rock band, since their 2003 debut, Enter Shikari have proven their reputation as musical chameleons. Initially sharing their music to MySpace, the four-piece have explored noisy post-hardcore (2007’s Take to the Skies), dubstep and drum and bass (A Flash Flood of Colour, 2012) and electro-pop and grime (2017’s The Spark), with a host of frenetic live performances in-between, including sold-out shows at Alexandra Palace and headline slots at Reading and Leeds.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1769508000,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":71093,\"title\":\"Is there a cloakroom?\",\"body\":\"£5 for bags (under A4 size only), £3 for coats and £2 for all other items (card only). Large bags are not allowed inside the venue at all (including the cloakroom).\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":71094,\"title\":\"Where can I find out more information about travelling to Alexandra Palace?\",\"body\":\"Head here to find out more and stay up to date: https://www.alexandrapalace.com/visitor-information/get-here/\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":71095,\"title\":\"What do I do on the day of the event?\",\"body\":\"On the day of the event (usually 2h before it starts) you’ll be able to activate your ticket in the app and generate your unique QR code.\\n\\nJust follow these steps.\\n\\n1\\\\. Open the DICE app. Tap the ticket icon at the bottom of the screen.\\n\\n2\\\\. Choose the event.\\n\\n3\\\\. Tap Activate QR code.\\n\\nIf you bought tickets for a group and you’re arriving together, you can show everyone’s tickets on your device to the door staff.\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":71096,\"title\":\"What if I can’t make the event anymore? \",\"body\":\"**Offer your ticket to another fan**\\n\\nWe believe tickets belong in the hands of fans, and that they should only ever be sold for a fair price. That’s why we have the wait list: if you can’t make it to a sold-out event, you can add your ticket to the queue to be purchased by another fan. If the ticket is sold, you’ll get your money back – no drama, no rip-offs.\\n\\nThere are a few conditions, though. Not every show will have the wait list function switched on, and tickets can only be added to the wait list after a show sells out. On top of that – and this is important – you’ll only get your money back if another fan buys your ticket.\\n\\nLearn more about how the wait list works https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409669479953\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":71097,\"title\":\"Can I purchase tickets from a third-party ticket website?\",\"body\":\"DICE does not participate in re-selling with any third-party sites as our tickets are only accessible via our app using the unique QR code that can only be activated on the day of the event.\\n\\nYou will be rejected at the door, if you show a ticket from third-party ticket resale site.\\n\\nOur wait list feature puts fans first and ensures they aren’t being charged more than the actual ticket price. The wait list is the only way to ensure you are purchasing a genuine ticket that will give you entry into your favourite events!\",\"order\":4},{\"id\":71098,\"title\":\"Can I bring a bag?\",\"body\":\"BAG POLICY FOR LIVE MUSIC EVENTS AT ALEXANDRA PALACE\\n\\nWe encourage you to attend live music events without bags. Should you need to bring one for your essentials, it needs to be as small as possible.\\n\\nFor security reasons and in line with industry best practice, visitors are only permitted to bring one small bag into the venue, which must be no bigger than:\\n\\nHeight 30cm (11.8 inches)\\n\\nWidth 20cm (7.9 inches)\\n\\nDepth 10cm (3.9 inches)\\n\\nAny bags that do not meet these requirements will be directed to our bag drop (Great Hall concerts only).\\n\\nExemptions apply for medical purposes, but we ask that you contact us in advance if this applies to you via access@alexandrapalace.com.\",\"order\":5},{\"id\":71099,\"title\":\"Is there an after show party?\",\"body\":\"Happening in the Phoenix Bar until 1am. Please note this is not an official party related to the artist or promoter.\",\"order\":6},{\"id\":71100,\"title\":\"Can I pay in cash?\",\"body\":\"Ally Pally is now fully cashless so bring your card/phone with you to pay across the site.\",\"order\":7}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":6673},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Sorry You're Not a Winner\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/6PwxotrB99xgatKVzibmkz\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/8567ca5b7fb5bebfd00d811ae2a26f2a79518a5a?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Sorry You're Not a Winner\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Enter Shikari - satellites* *\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/gb/album/satellites/1496648817?i=1496649756&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Enter Shikari\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview113/v4/17/94/f4/1794f4f1-cbd4-39da-6824-e02afcf67e05/mzaf_2631961547327494681.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"satellites* *\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-10T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-11-20T18:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-10T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-11-20T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-11-20T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Signature Brew.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/aa176fe55874?dice_id=aa176fe55874\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Yb39bc0f49d5?dice_id=Yb39bc0f49d5\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/te509e0ebf04?dice_id=te509e0ebf04\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b1c948ff62b8?dice_id=b1c948ff62b8\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r9dd90819219?dice_id=r9dd90819219\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Hc35c6008145?dice_id=Hc35c6008145\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"80s On Brass - Old Dirty Brasstards | Signature Brew Blackhorse Road\\n\\nGet ready for a massive night of nostalgia as the 10-piece drum and brass powerhouse Old Dirty Brasstards take over Signature Brew Blackhorse Road. Expect high-octane, horn-heavy covers of the ultimate 80s anthems... from the New Wave hits of Duran Duran and The Human League to the power pop of Whitney Houston and the stadium classics of Queen and Bon Jovi! Experience your favorite decade reimagined with wall-to-wall brass, huge singalongs and the freshest beer in London.\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/olddirtybrasstards\\n\\nSignature Brew Blackhorse Road\\n\\nFriday 20th November 2026 | 7pm doors\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1795201200,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"4259\",\"name\":\"Signature Brew Blackhorse Road\",\"address\":\"Unit 15, Uplands Business Park, Blackhorse Ln, Walthamstow, London E17 5QJ, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5915931,\"lng\":-0.0428547},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-19/22392fd6-55c8-436f-b7c7-be53bd36eea2.jpg?rect=420%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"signature-brew-blackhorse-road-wxbg\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.signaturebrew.co.uk/pages/signature-brews-frequently-asked-questions-faqs\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-11-20T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"764f3889713ed38b:25\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"3591\",\"name\":\"Signature Brew Haggerston\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-19/cf9f0866-c543-4008-8b08-026157cfb350.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"signature-brew-haggerston-3m2g\",\"profile_active\":true},\"id\":\"6961481fffbf2e00015942b7\",\"name\":\"80s On Brass - Old Dirty Brasstards | London\",\"perm_name\":\"l8b2pl-80s-on-brass-old-dirty-brasstards-london-20th-nov-signature-brew-blackhorse-road-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-09/072dbd90-eee6-4264-98f0-789472e437fa.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-09/072dbd90-eee6-4264-98f0-789472e437fa.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-09/072dbd90-eee6-4264-98f0-789472e437fa.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Old Dirty Brasstards\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/de34f9f89566f51dc4e1ef76c4601bea5dcfce69\"},\"artist_id\":\"8315\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"South-east London’s Old Dirty Brasstards are a 10-piece drum and bass band known for their jazzy reimaginations of popular songs. Since emerging in 2012, they’ve covered artists from Beyoncé to Blink-182, opened for Basement Jaxx and performed at the Roundhouse and Ronnie Scott’s.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1768039200,\"faqs\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2020,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Old Dirty Brasstards - I Wanna Dance With Somebody (Who Loves Me)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4tMFDTqKiWvddftQi0LI56\",\"artist\":\"Old Dirty Brasstards\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/88ec010ad89620b7248a2a70e276c310a0f58854?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"I Wanna Dance With Somebody (Who Loves Me)\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Old Dirty Brasstards - I Wanna Dance With Somebody (Who Loves Me)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/i-wanna-dance-with-somebody-who-loves-me/1203025840?i=1203025930&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Old Dirty Brasstards\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/74/3c/10/743c10a3-e06a-b06b-2671-60f072e4bf34/mzaf_14993334277187640591.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"I Wanna Dance With Somebody (Who Loves Me)\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-08T15:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-11-20T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-12T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-11-20T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-11-20T23:45:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Hot Box Live Community Interest Company.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T972356423a9?dice_id=T972356423a9\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H77c1fac17b3?dice_id=H77c1fac17b3\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ef9eeb72fed9?dice_id=ef9eeb72fed9\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o774bdff00f2?dice_id=o774bdff00f2\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/hfabad51262a?dice_id=hfabad51262a\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n209929f1ccc?dice_id=n209929f1ccc\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"The Ska Legends ***The Kubricks*** are back in Chelmsford after their BACK TO BACK sold out shows in November!\\n\\nBased in London, ***The Kubricks*** are a seven-piece band that seamlessly blends ska, reggae, and irresistibly catchy melodic pop.\\n\\nProduced by Toby Davies of Gentleman’s Dub Club, the band’s debut album, ‘The Heist’, dropped in 2017. The UK’s longest-running skazine, Do The Dog, dubbed it, “A very strong contender for album of the year,” while Bucketlist in Canada described it as, “A gem of an album that makes ska and reggae seem like a perfect fit with 21st-century musical trends.” Tom Robinson (6Music) immediately shared the track ‘Down With the Dogs’ with his listeners, and BBC Introducing in Essex invited the band for a live session.\\n\\nAfter completing two autumn UK tours and securing a publishing deal with Wipe Out Music, The Kubricks unveiled their latest album, ‘Between Antipodes’, in December 2022. Representing their most ska-pop record to date, the album was produced by Tom Donovan, a producer and musician from the hip-hop act Monster Florence.\\n\\nThey’ve played to tens of thousands at notable events such as the Isle of Wight Festival, Kendal Calling, Green Man, Shambala, Boomtown Fair, Bearded Theory’s Spring Gathering, Godiva, Weinturm Open Air (Germany), Lott Festival (Germany), Zik ‘n’ Roll (France), Dance Ska La (France), and The London International Ska Festival, among many others.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1795201200,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3785\",\"name\":\"Hot Box\",\"address\":\"28 Viaduct Rd, Chelmsford CM1 1TS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.7359952,\"lng\":0.4672127},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-06-29/9ff0c867-708b-4d5c-834d-a927e4e4ae83.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"5eb9799ae1727402966007e1\",\"name\":\"Chelmsford\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.736717,\"lng\":0.466083,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-r7wq\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.hotboxlive.co.uk/accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-11-20T19:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"764f3889713ed38b:26\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"4307\",\"name\":\"Hot Box Live Community Interest \",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-live-community-interest-7v77\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"69558346224fbb000164f179\",\"name\":\"The Kubricks \",\"perm_name\":\"dk35ve-the-kubricks-20th-nov-hot-box-chelmsford-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-08-22/6470666e-8e83-4a29-954f-1923cca3342b.jpg?rect=599%2C0%2C3413%2C3413\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-08-22/6470666e-8e83-4a29-954f-1923cca3342b.jpg?rect=0%2C323%2C4611%2C2767\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-08-22/6470666e-8e83-4a29-954f-1923cca3342b.jpg?rect=1367%2C0%2C1877%2C3413\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"The Kubricks\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5eb685aa73b1603d3a36084007e\"},\"artist_id\":\"25137\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1765206000,\"faqs\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1650,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"The Kubricks - My Mate Lives At the Side of the Road\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/gb/album/my-mate-lives-at-the-side-of-the-road/670713299?i=670713307&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"The Kubricks\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Music4/v4/15/18/f4/1518f455-6e65-f0b6-562c-b22ba850a310/mzaf_5560481721447214568.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"My Mate Lives At the Side of the Road\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-10T10:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-11-20T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-12T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-11-20T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-11-20T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Academy Events. \",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/pd98f6afcb22?dice_id=pd98f6afcb22\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/C2986adb5ada?dice_id=C2986adb5ada\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b0038316893f?dice_id=b0038316893f\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/b1714d50a516?dice_id=b1714d50a516\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J29a5ba2196a?dice_id=J29a5ba2196a\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o3ae9deb8413?dice_id=o3ae9deb8413\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"*GLORYHAMMER will hit the road in October and November 2026 for their 5th Album Release Tour, bringing a new record and an updated live show to fans across the globe! This run marks the start of the band’s next phase, with a fresh production and a setlist built to hit as hard as an astral hammer!*\\n\\n*The tour will feature new material from the upcoming album alongside the live staples fans expect, delivered with the energy the band brings every night.*\\n\\n*Supporting on the tour:*\\n\\n*Majestica — melodic, high-impact power metal with serious musicianship.*\\n\\n*Arion — modern Finnish metal with big hooks and a sharp, polished sound.*\\n\\n*Islington Assembly Hall has launched 'Support the Supports' a campaign to help introduce more music lovers to the up-and-coming acts that open the show! Show up to the venue prior to 8pm and you are in with a chance to win a mystery prize, from drinks vouchers to exclusive merchandise from artists that have previously played the venue. Use the #supportthesupports through socials when you discover a new favourite act at Islington Assembly Hall.*\\n\\n*By purchasing a ticket to this event you are agreeing to adhere to Islington Assembly Hall's terms and conditions: https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/customer-terms-conditions-2022/*\\n\\n*All tickets to shows at Islington Assembly Hall are subject to a Venue Levy of £1.50 + VAT. As a Grade II listed building, this levy will be reinvested into Islington Assembly Hall and its services, meaning the customer experience can continue to be enhanced.*\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is a 16+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/legal-information/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"679202632593023\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-980124-39\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkou