a 14+ event – 14 and 15 year olds must be accompained by an adult. You may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"order\":3}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":3296},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Hootsforce\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5gJ1DNzFHwNFlEw1UltyFk\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/4c798e0c1156639855f817939fb33818f8d83ef7?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Hootsforce\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-05T12:45:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-11-19T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-05T12:45:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-11-20T19:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-11-20T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Serious.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"02e3bfe7-92c5-4e48-a761-1e7de4838b0d\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/pa34faec20db?dice_id=pa34faec20db\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o16cf313b1f7?dice_id=o16cf313b1f7\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/bf511355b9ab?dice_id=bf511355b9ab\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Lebfe209062c?dice_id=Lebfe209062c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Yb4a07515615?dice_id=Yb4a07515615\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/m463a24ca43f?dice_id=m463a24ca43f\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"\\\"Ben Folds is an Emmy-nominated singer-songwriter who has created an enormous body of genre-bending music that includes pop albums with Ben Folds Five, multiple solo albums, a holiday album, and numerous collaborative records.\\n\\nHe currently tours as a pop artist, while also performing for over two decades with some of the world’s greatest symphony orchestras.\\n\\nFolds, who served for eight years as the first ever Artistic Advisor to the National Symphony Orchestra (NSO) at the Kennedy Center in Washington, DC, stepped down from his post when Donald Trump announced his takeover of the Center. Just days before the US presidential election, Folds recorded two sold out performances with the NSO which he released as a live album this summer which debuted at the top of the Billboard classical and classical crossover charts.\\n\\nBen Folds’ Paper Airplane Request Tour is a unique concert format where fans write their favorite Folds song requests on paper, fold them into airplanes, and launch them toward the stage. The show consists of Folds performing a standard setlist for the first half, followed by an intermission. At the start of the second half, fans are given a cue to launch their airplanes onto the stage. Folds will then perform requests written on airplanes which he randomly selects between each song. \\n\\nFans are encouraged to bring their pre-made paper airplanes to the show, but paper and pens are also available at the merchandise table to fans who wish to assemble theirs on site.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":\"987893cf-bc40-4a74-8eee-5de2ce676631\",\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1446,\"name\":\"Serious\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://serious.org.uk/serious-ticketing-t-cs\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":1795203000,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1847\",\"name\":\"Royal Festival Hall - Southbank Centre\",\"address\":\"Southbank Centre, Belvedere Rd, Lambeth, London SE1 8XX, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.506921,\"lng\":-0.1161019999999553},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"royal-festival-hall---southbank-centre-oy3m\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.southbankcentre.co.uk/visit-us/access/\"},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-11-20T19:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"764f3889713ed38b:28\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1432\",\"name\":\"Serious\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"serious-nyo9\",\"profile_active\":true},\"id\":\"6932d28a9f9ef000012b567d\",\"name\":\"Ben Folds Solo: Paper Airplane Request Tour\",\"perm_name\":\"bbx6lk-ben-folds-solo-paper-airplane-request-tour-20th-nov-royal-festival-hall-southbank-centre-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-25/d37ddf7e-fae7-496f-97c9-59b04fb273cc.jpg?rect=92%2C0%2C4070%2C4070\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-25/d37ddf7e-fae7-496f-97c9-59b04fb273cc.jpg?rect=0%2C759%2C4253%2C2552\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-25/d37ddf7e-fae7-496f-97c9-59b04fb273cc.jpg?rect=1007%2C0%2C2239%2C4070\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Ben Folds\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab6761610000e5ebb79aa7b4b5d29ec744cfcec0\"},\"artist_id\":\"20277\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":true}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1764938700,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":61974,\"title\":\"Accessibility Information\",\"body\":\"To purchase accessible tickets, contact Southbank Centre on 020 3879 9555\",\"order\":0}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":5790},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"seating\":{\"region\":\"eu\",\"seats_io_event_id\":\"02e3bfe7-92c5-4e48-a761-1e7de4838b0d\",\"seats_io_public_key\":\"987893cf-bc40-4a74-8eee-5de2ce676631\",\"seat_selection\":\"enabled\"},\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"The Luckiest\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/5nt7eRlOOJhrsBSrHWiY4I\",\"artist\":\"\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/850777034e3253a6c5395f5c1be654503edd6b64?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"The Luckiest\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Fri 20 Nov\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-28T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-11-21T16:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-30T10:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-11-21T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-11-21T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Pad Presents.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o342fee78e96?dice_id=o342fee78e96\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H1ab2302d919?dice_id=H1ab2302d919\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/qd138df03cd0?dice_id=qd138df03cd0\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n5da23c4d9a9?dice_id=n5da23c4d9a9\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z32349c3473c?dice_id=Z32349c3473c\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/B6f7556383d0?dice_id=B6f7556383d0\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"NOASIS (The Definitive Oasis Tribute)\\n\\n\\\\+ The Total Stone Roses\\n\\n\\\\+ Guests\\n\\n\\\\+ The Winchester Collective DJs\\n\\n6pm – 10:30pm Saturday 21st November, Electric Ballroom, Camden, London\\n\\nWe are very pleased to be bringing Noasis back to Camden Electric Ballroom for their annual gig on Saturday 21st November 2026 following numerous sell-out shows at the venue.\\n\\nNoasis is the definitive tribute band to Manchester's five-piece super group Oasis. Since their formation in 2006 and with over 1000 performances to date Noasis has justly earned its reputation as the best tribute on the circuit packing out venues up and down the UK.\\n\\nWith an obsessive attention to detail the band recreates the real Oasis experience with amazing energy, playing all the classic songs as if they were their own. This is more than a tribute band; this is Oasis from a parallel universe. With a Oasis' huge back catalogue to choose from, the band create huge crowd-pleasing sets with tracks like: Definitely Maybe, (What’s the Story) Morning Glory, Be Here Now, Standing on the Shoulder of Giants, Heathen Chemistry, Don’t Believe the Truth, & Dig Out Your Soul delivering a supersonic show of the very best Oasis anthems.\\n\\nWith the real OASIS back in the game the reformation has sparked even more interest in the band and tickets are selling even faster for the definitive tribute NOASIS all over the UK.\\n\\nThis event is 14 and over. 14s to 16s must be accompanied by an adult.  Any ticket holder unable to present valid identification indicating that they are at least 14 years of age will not be admitted to this event and will not be eligible for a refund.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1795284000,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"55\",\"name\":\"Electric Ballroom\",\"address\":\"184 Camden High St, London NW1 8QP\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5396558,\"lng\":-0.143191399999978},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/fab0b36d-a5a4-4e37-a541-2c5af15a3bc1.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C400%2C400\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"electric-ballroom-j78v\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://electricballroom.co.uk/disabled-access/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-11-21T18:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"764f3889713ed38b:29\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"14332\",\"name\":\"The Pad Presents\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-pad-presents-nvlp3\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"6929a3b5d4e98a00014699f1\",\"name\":\"Noasis + The Total Stone Roses\",\"perm_name\":\"2w7gbo-noasis-the-total-stone-roses-21st-nov-electric-ballroom-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-28/be82f3f9-e58a-402f-98f5-b5db8b64649c.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-28/be82f3f9-e58a-402f-98f5-b5db8b64649c.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-11-28/be82f3f9-e58a-402f-98f5-b5db8b64649c.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Noasis\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"41236\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1764288000,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":60291,\"title\":\"Venue Accessibility Information\",\"body\":\"https://electricballroom.co.uk/disabled-access/\",\"order\":0}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2390,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Oasis - Cigarettes & Alcohol (Live from Manchester, 11 July '25)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4CBcpZIlrWtLAZfXlZbtK3\",\"artist\":\"Oasis\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/9811a5acb67de3fa989dec81db62dab0d6e0350d?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Cigarettes & Alcohol (Live from Manchester, 11 July '25)\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Oasis - Cigarettes & Alcohol (Remastered)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/cigarettes-alcohol-remastered/1525936190?i=1525936204&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Oasis\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/d1/18/38/d1183860-e569-ed7e-dca7-726bb6011b36/mzaf_1925333758002580817.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Cigarettes & Alcohol (Remastered)\"}],\"score\":0,\"acq