c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"I'm on Fire\"},{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Guana Batz - I'm On Fire\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/gb/album/im-on-fire-single-loan-shark-album/263271636?i=263272063&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Guana Batz\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Music5/v4/f4/64/53/f46453f4-4caf-77fd-4368-33485059a2ce/mzaf_3271465418238071576.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"I'm On Fire\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Sat 28 Nov\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-02T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-11-29T15:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-02T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-11-29T15:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-11-29T20:45:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Hot Box Live Community Interest\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q3c78c2b6777?dice_id=q3c78c2b6777\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/J78ec398c552?dice_id=J78ec398c552\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/g9f537bce32f?dice_id=g9f537bce32f\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D401c9796444?dice_id=D401c9796444\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/w084c929cfc9?dice_id=w084c929cfc9\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/t4cff7ec6828?dice_id=t4cff7ec6828\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Dubbed “England’s equivalent to Joe Bonnamassa” by Blues Matters, Jim Kirkpatrick has built up over a quarter-century’s experience in Blues and Rock and earned a tonne of respect from his fans, peers and critics alike. Not only is he a gifted songwriter (who’s written numerous nationally UK playlisted songs) but he’s also a deft-fingered, multi-skilled, guitarist who’s famed for possessing both Bonnamassa-type energy and slide guitar and fingerstyle— worthy of the great Duane Allman — as well.\\n\\nJim is probably best-known as the lead guitarist of the legendary British melodic rock band FM, with whom he’s served since 2008.\\n\\nStriking out as a solo artist, Jim earned well-deserved acclaim, as a songwriter, guitarist, vocalist with his critically acclaimed, 2020, 12-track solo album ‘Ballad of a Prodigal Son’. Life Music Media called it “The most important British Blues-Rock album of recent years,” and proclaimed, “Jim should be regarded as being right at the pinnacle of the world’s best Blues guitarist/vocalists.”\\n\\nJims current album ‘Dead Man Walking” has been called 'Quite simply a masterpiece’ by Metal Planet Music who gave it 10/10. Blues Matters Magazine said ‘This is the album of the year, no question about it’ and continued to say ‘If there is a better blues/rock guitarist within this sceptres isle of ours, I’ll eat my hat’! Blues In Britain exclaimed that the album is ‘Quite brilliant’!\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1795964400,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3785\",\"name\":\"Hot Box\",\"address\":\"28 Viaduct Rd, Chelmsford CM1 1TS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.7359952,\"lng\":0.4672127},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-06-29/9ff0c867-708b-4d5c-834d-a927e4e4ae83.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"},\"city