how-to-lay-an-egg-with-a-horse-inside-4th-dec-union-chapel-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-03/4f1ed0a7-9133-4feb-9595-d53c8476b4ee.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C800%2C800\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-03/4f1ed0a7-9133-4feb-9595-d53c8476b4ee.jpg?rect=0%2C160%2C800%2C480\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-03/4f1ed0a7-9133-4feb-9595-d53c8476b4ee.jpg?rect=180%2C0%2C440%2C800\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Brian Bilston\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-i-scdn-co.imgix.net/image/ab67616d0000b2734b0a06c54b51c1f60336b880\"},\"artist_id\":\"130978\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1764928800,\"faqs\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":3004,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Fri 04 Dec\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-25T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-12-05T01:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-25T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-12-05T13:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-12-05T17:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Hot Box Live Community Interest\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/rec6028f173e?dice_id=rec6028f173e\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n553e2549676?dice_id=n553e2549676\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/x965d76900fa?dice_id=x965d76900fa\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/O49809fe2b75?dice_id=O49809fe2b75\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/h92a9d4c2f55?dice_id=h92a9d4c2f55\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/I0a229a28ced?dice_id=I0a229a28ced\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Any guitarist looking for a quality blues rocker to emulate couldn’t do better than latch onto Rory Gallagher. But Davy Knowles went one better; he hired Gallagher’s band to support him.\\n\\nThey share equal billing on MKO, released on Oct. 17. Bassist Gerry McAvoy (M) and drummer Brendan O’Neill (O) have toured extensively with Knowles (K) as Band of Friends (they once played all Gallagher material) but this is the first time they have collaborated on a studio album of original songs. The eight tunes are penned and sung by Knowles and while they share some of Gallagher’s driving approach and the power trio lineup he favored both in his own work and that of his previous band Taste, this is no copycat outfit.\\n\\nKnowles, like his biggest influence, knows that successful blues rockers need firm melodies with memorable lyrics, as well as succinct, gripping guitar solos. He displays the sum of those talents on material such as “High Horse,” a kiss-off to an old flame with “It’s the same ol’ record playin’,…You ain’t got nothin’ good to say”. He unleashes his slide on a flaming solo as bass and drums deliver swampy backing. It’s such a cool vibe, you’ll wish it would extend past its three-and-a-half minute length.\\n\\nIt’s an impressive start for what seems like a project that has legs. In MKO with McAvoy and O’Neill, Knowles has found a rhythm section that meets his high standards; a duo road-tested, approved and certified by one of the blues-rock greats.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1796475600,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"3785\",\"name\":\"Hot Box\",\"address\":\"28 Viaduct Rd, Chelmsford CM1 1TS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.7359952,\"lng\":0.4672127},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-06-29/9ff0c867-708b-4d5c-834d-a927e4e4ae83.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"5eb9799ae1727402966007e1\",\"name\":\"Chelmsford\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.736717,\"lng\":0.466083,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-r7wq\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.hotboxlive.co.uk/accessibility\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-12-05T13:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"764f3889713ed38b:51\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"4307\",\"name\":\"Hot Box Live Community Interest \",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"hot-box-live-community-interest-7v77\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"697662a0ac68d600014472b7\",\"name\":\"KMO (Band Of Friends)\",\"perm_name\":\"nvk623-kmo-band-of-friends-5th-dec-hot-box-chelmsford-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-25/275713ca-030f-4c00-b5d2-94556dcbde29.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-25/275713ca-030f-4c00-b5d2-94556dcbde29.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-25/275713ca-030f-4c00-b5d2-94556dcbde29.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Davy Knowles\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"106353\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Gerry McAvoy\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"132890\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false},{\"name\":\"Brendan O’Neill\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"132891\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":3,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1769299200,\"faqs\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2200,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[{\"type\":\"apple_music\",\"title\":\"Davy Knowles - Someone Else's Dream (feat. Gerry McAvoy & Brendan O'Neill)\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/someone-elses-dream-feat-gerry-mcavoy-brendan-oneill/1845914485?i=1845914491&uo=4&at=1001ld8Z&ct=app_event\",\"artist\":\"Davy Knowles\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/99/a3/76/99a376a2-bdd4-0692-0fcd-3ca1c2b93f54/mzaf_1191659420503652590.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Someone Else's Dream (feat. Gerry McAvoy & Brendan O'Neill)\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"title\":\"Davy Knowles - Someone Else's Dream\",\"redirect_url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/30kxFXoCCK5Foi4vLBqgKw\",\"artist\":\"Davy Knowles\",\"preview_url\":\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/53a3ac681a448d414d4675153dfaabb6c66a4826?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\",\"track_name\":\"Someone Else's Dream\"}],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-05T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-12-04T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-05T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-12-05T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-12-05T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Safe As Milk Promotions and New Cross Live presents\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Zc7fa062c59c?dice_id=Zc7fa062c59c\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Icf3c22663e9?dice_id=Icf3c22663e9\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Oe7b4499fb66?dice_id=Oe7b4499fb66\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R9db58485a6e?dice_id=R9db58485a6e\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/D0efac56edbf?dice_id=D0efac56edbf\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P3dae69525ab?dice_id=P3dae69525ab\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Bruce Juice\\n\\nA live injection of Bruce Juice during the long years between Bruce Springsteen’s tours, this new band provides a vibrant tonic pumped into every aching hungry heart.\\n\\nYou can expect an ‘E-Street’ experience that captures the unique seven-piece band line-up through arrangements from legendary concerts such as the Main Point to the Bottom Line, Passaic, Winterland and Tempe.\\n\\nThe band reproduces the original arrangements from the 1970s Wild, Innocent and a slow, bluesy ‘E Street Shuffle’ as well as the iconic anthems from the ‘Born to Run’ tour.\\n\\nMore gems from the 1980s capture the crisp, rasping sound of the ‘Professor’s’ piano, Federici’s organ and Clarence’s sax from ‘The River’ tour, as well as a few stadium foot-stompers from the ‘Born in the USA’ tour.\\n\\nThis is the only Springsteen tribute band that combines both popular favourites with the essence of Springsteen’s arrangements in legendary live gigs and an unforgettable show.\\n\\nThe term ‘tribute band’ doesn’t really fit – it is just that there isn’t another word. We are not trying to pay tribute to Bruce as if he has won an award or passed away. Instead, we absolutely LOVE his music and everything about the energy and passion with which he and the E Street Band deliver unforgettable shows.\\n\\nSo, we aim to deliver a high-energy show inspired by Springsteen, to send you home with a strong injection of Bruce Juice until the real thing alights on these shores again.\\n\\nhttps://brucejuice.rocks/\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"14+ under 16's to be accompanied by an adult\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[],\"date_unix\":1796493600,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1641\",\"name\":\"New Cross Inn\",\"address\":\"New Cross Inn, 323 New Cross Rd, London SE14 6AS, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4757899,\"lng\":-0.037162699999953475},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-12-13/ba29f2fe-617e-4542-80b7-6e2529031d70.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C225%2C225\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"new-cross-inn-x9yl\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://www.newcrossinn.com/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-12-05T18:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"gig\",\"value\":\"music:gig\",\"title\":\"Gigs\"}],\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"max_tickets\":6,\"donation\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"impression_id\":\"764f3889713ed38b:52\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"secondary_status\":null,\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1888\",\"name\":\"New Cross Live\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"new-cross-live-y8la\",\"profile_active\":false},\"id\":\"695b9e114a6bc600017acffb\",\"name\":\"Bruce Juice\",\"perm_name\":\"v3q8rg-bruce-juice-5th-dec-new-cross-inn-london-tickets\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-05/2b766105-1aa5-4947-96d1-29d7ae5feb37.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-05/2b766105-1aa5-4947-96d1-29d7ae5feb37.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-05/2b766105-1aa5-4947-96d1-29d7ae5feb37.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"unicorn\":true,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Bruce Juice\",\"image\":null,\"artist_id\":\"117910\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"new\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1767571200,\"faqs\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2200,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null},{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-01-26T00:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-12-05T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-01-26T00:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-12-05T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-12-05T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Human Punk.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/P3c0ad4736ac?dice_id=P3c0ad4736ac\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/a42e3d42c4b9?dice_id=a42e3d42c4b9\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ad72f22f39ed?dice_id=Ad72f22f39ed\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/if7d0a705efe?dice_id=if7d0a705efe\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e51fe6cc2ffe?dice_id=e51fe6cc2ffe\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H600777a0f83?dice_id=H600777a0f83\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Human Punk proudly presents:\\n\\nSHAM 69\\n\\nOriginal line up; Jimmy Pursey, Dave Parsons and Dave Treganna with Spike Smith\\n\\nSPECIAL 50th ANNIVERSARY CONCERT\\n\\nAt their LONDON home, The 229, right in the HEART of London.\\n\\nExpect to hear all the classics from their 50 years. Hersham Boys, Borstal Break Out, Angels With Dirty Faces, If The Kids Are United, Hurry Up Harry etc..\\n\\nSpecial guests:\\n\\nKNOCK OFF - exclusive LONDON show from this extraordinary band. The write so prolifically. This is a full hour set like their headline shows. A stunning live band.\\n\\nANABOLLIC STEROIDS - themselves only a year behind Sham! The original band started in 1977. Huge HUMAN PUNK faves. Always great live. Make sure you are in early and don't miss a note!\\n\\nWith HUMAN PUNK ON 45 DJs Dr Vinyl and JK Herbert, Esq dropping killer 45s before and inbetween live sets. The night starts literally as doors open!\\n\\nDO NOT MISS THIS ONE!!!\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":294,\"name\":\"229 The Venue\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://229.london/dataprotection/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":1796497200,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"399\",\"name\":\"229\",\"add