ster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"order\":3}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":2950},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"seating\":null,\"previews\":[],\"score\":0,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"event_tag\":null}],\"title\":\"Thu 28 Jan\",\"image\":null,\"key\":null,\"action\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"suggestion_type\":null,\"suggestion_name\":null,\"section_type\":\"events_vertical\",\"load_more\":null,\"section_hash\":null},{\"events\":[{\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-08-11T10:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2027-03-13T21:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-08-15T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2027-03-13T19:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2027-03-13T23:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by DHP Family.\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"properties\":[],\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/if3bab53921a?dice_id=if3bab53921a\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/q98d6bac0cfe?dice_id=q98d6bac0cfe\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e6351bc217ab?dice_id=e6351bc217ab\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/We3cf7a08d2e?dice_id=We3cf7a08d2e\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/jdfc5698c3ee?dice_id=jdfc5698c3ee\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/e3d5f7157dd7?dice_id=e3d5f7157dd7\"},\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Danny & The Champions of the World's seventh studio album 'You Are Not A Stranger Here', released on Loose Music in October 2024, has been \\\"wildly and justifiably acclaimed\\\" (RnR). Their live shows are leaving reviewers reaching for superlatives, from the summer's festival stages to sold out headline shows:\\n\\n\\\"When such as Bruce Springsteen and the Gaslight Anthem achieve international stardom it remains one of life’s abiding mysteries as to why Danny and the Champions of the World are not mentioned in the same breath...This was yet another brilliant performance\\\" God is in the TV\\n\\n\\\"after much well-justified applause...the band, impossible as it seems, manage to turn it up even higher, ending proceedings with a bang while they are cheered to the rafters” RnR*  \\n  \\nBy purchasing a ticket to this event you are agreeing to adhere to Islington Assembly Hall's terms and conditions: https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/customer-terms-conditions-2022/*\\n\\n*All tickets to shows at Islington Assembly Hall are subject to a Venue Levy of £1.50 + VAT. As a Grade II listed building, this levy will be reinvested into Islington Assembly Hall and its services, meaning the customer experience can continue to be enhanced.*\\n\\nThis is a 16+ event – you may be asked to prove your age and if you are not able to show valid ID, you may be refused entry. Valid ID includes passports, driving licences, over 16+ zip oyster photocard and citizen cards. Photocopies will not be accepted.\",\"highlights\":[]},\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://islingtonassemblyhall.co.uk/legal-information/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"679202632593023\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-980124-39\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"date_unix\":1804964400,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"34\",\"name\":\"Islington Assembly Hall\",\"address\":\"Upper Street, Lon